revision.text:
{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_103_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=来たね。さっき送ったチャット、見てくれた？|text_cn=你来了。刚刚给你发的信息，有看到吗？|trans_en=Oh, you're here. Did you get my text?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_103_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=にゃん、にゃにゃ、にゃあ…あ、ボス。うん、今のはネコじゃなくて、あたし|text_cn=喵，喵喵，喵——<br/>啊……魔王？嗯……<br/>刚才发出声音的不是猫，是我。|trans_en=Meow, meow, meow—<br/>Ah, Boss.<br/>Yes, that wasn't a cat, it was me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_103_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよう、お腹すいた|text_cn=早上好，饿了。|trans_en=Morning. I'm hungry...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_103_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんにちは、お腹ペコペコ|text_cn=中午好，我肚子饿了。|trans_en=Hello. I'm starving...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_103_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんばんは、お腹が空っぽ|text_cn=晚上好，好饿啊。|trans_en=Evening. My stomach is empty...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_103_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうして既読スルーするの？|text_cn=为什么……已读不回？|trans_en=Why did you leave me on read?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_103_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ケータイの中に住めたらいいのに|text_cn=要是能住在手机里就好了。|trans_en=Wish I could live in my phone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_103_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この子の体、フワフワでモフモフ。ボスも触ってみる？|text_cn=这孩子毛发软软的，摸起来很舒服。<br/>来，你也试试。|trans_en=The kitty's so soft and fluffy.<br/>Boss, do you wanna pet her?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_103_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスもこの子と話したい？ならネコの言葉を教えてあげる。にゃ、にゃ～|text_cn=魔王，你也想跟它说话吗？那我教你，喵……喵~|trans_en=Boss, you want to talk to the kitty, too? I can teach you Catspeak. Meow, meow...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_103_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=疲れたの？ならここに座って。肩、貸してあげる|text_cn=如果累了，就坐下来休息一会儿。<br/>来，肩膀借你。|trans_en=Tired? You can sit here.<br/>Lean on my shoulder, if you like.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_103_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=誤解されるのは慣れてる。その誤解を、銃で解決するのもね|text_cn=我已经习惯被人误会，也习惯用枪来解决误会。|trans_en=I'm used to being misunderstood, and to clear things up with my guns.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_103_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ネコが好き。フワフワの毛に顔を埋めると、太陽の匂いがするから|text_cn=我喜欢猫，把脸埋进她们柔软蓬松的毛毛里，就能闻到太阳的味道。|trans_en=I love cats. When I bury my face in their soft fur, it smells like sunshine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_103_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ。今夜の見張りはあたしだった<br/>暇になったら、ボスにメッセージを送っていい？|text_cn=今天轮到我守夜。无聊的时候，可以给你发消息吗？|trans_en=Ah. I'm on watch tonight. Can I text you if I get bored?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_103_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、あげる。あたしが集めたネコの毛玉|text_cn=这个送给你，是我珍藏的猫饼。|trans_en=Here, take this. It's a hairball I collected from the kitten.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_103_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスとのチャットは全部残してある<br/>この記録は…星ノ塔でも奪えない|text_cn=和魔王聊天的记录都在手机里，这些记忆……星塔拿不走。|trans_en=I have all our chats saved. Not even the Monoliths can take these memories away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_103_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人と話すのが苦手。でもあなたは例外。もっとたくさんお話ししよう、ボス|text_cn=我……我不习惯和人讲话，但你是例外。<br/>和我多说说话吧，魔王。|trans_en=I'm bad at talking to people, but with you... It's different.<br/>Talk to me more, okay, Boss?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_103_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたし、文字を打つのは速い方<br/>ボスも同じくらい爆速でメッセージを返してくれるから、嬉しい|text_cn=自从你来了，终于有人能跟上我打字的速度了……<br/>……开心。|trans_en=I'm pretty fast at typing, but you can reply just as fast.<br/>It makes me happy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_103_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=少し肩貸して。んにゃ…こうすれば、何時間ケータイを見てても疲れない|text_cn=肩膀，借我靠一下。<br/>……这样玩手机就不累了。|trans_en=Lend me your shoulder for a bit. Hm...<br/>This way, I won't get tired playing on my phone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_103_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ネコって、頭から尻尾の先まで撫でてあげると、嬉しそうに目を細める<br/>どれくらい気持ちいいんだろう。…ちょっと試してみる？|text_cn=像这样，从脖子一直抚摸到尾骨，猫咪就会开心地眯起眼睛。<br/>唔，真的有那么舒服吗？我有点好奇。<br/>魔王，我们要不要来试试？|trans_en=When you pet a cat from head to tail, they'd feel so good that they squint their eyes in happiness.<br/>I wonder how amazing that really feels...<br/>Boss, shall we try it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_103_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ネコは自由な生き物縛られるのは嫌い。<br/>でも…好きな人に出会ったら、変わるかも|text_cn=猫是讨厌束缚的生物，除非她遇到了喜欢的人……|trans_en=Cats are totally free spirits. They hate being tied down... But if they meet someone they like, things might change.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_103_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日、セイナが寝言でボスの名前を呟いてた。あたし？あたしは寝言なんか言わない|text_cn=魔王，昨晚尘沙说梦话的时候，喊你的名字了哦。<br/>我？我从来不说梦话。|trans_en=Yesterday, Noya muttered your name in her sleep.<br/>Me? I never talk in my sleep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_103_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメは普段『無駄遣いはダメ』って言ってばっかり<br/>でも装備品の補充と修理には、迷わずお金を出してくれる。そういうところ、すごく助かる|text_cn=鸢尾虽然平时限制我们的花销，但每次需要买子弹，修武器的时候，她都能干脆地掏出钱来，很可靠。|trans_en=Iris always goes on about "No wasting money." But she never skimps on gear maintenance and upgrades. It's reassuring to have her on our team.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_103_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=このまえ船着き場に行ったとき、知らない人に「釣った魚と一緒に写真撮って」って頼まれて<br/>撮ってあげたら、お礼に魚を全部くれた。すごくいい人だった|text_cn=之前路过码头时，有个人缠着我，要我帮忙拍她和鱼的合影，最后还把那些鱼全送给我了……真是个好人。|trans_en=I was down at the docks the other day, and there was this stranger who asked me to take a photo of her with the fish she'd caught.<br/>So I did, and she gave me all her fish as a thank you. Such a nice person.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_103_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミスティって人、私と同じくらい写真を撮るのが上手<br/>どの写真も迫力があるし、イキイキしてて。すごく参考になる|text_cn=那个叫雾语的人，她的摄影技术不在我之下。<br/>她的照片很有张力，充满动感，值得学习。|trans_en=Mistique takes great photos, as good as I do.<br/>Her shots are powerful and full of life and vigor—they're really inspiring.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_103_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=クレーンゲームは直感を鍛えるのにちょうどいい<br/>あたしが知る限り、ナズナが特に上手いかも|text_cn=抓娃娃可以锻炼直觉，是很好的训练机器。<br/>嗯，小禾的水平也很高，是我见过的最厉害的。|trans_en=Claw machines are good for honing your instincts. <br/>As far as I know, Nazuna's especially good at them.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_103_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=それ、尻尾じゃなくて伸縮自在の便利アイテムだから…ちょっと、引っ張らないで|text_cn=这不是尾巴，这是可以自由伸缩的带子，很好用……<br/>等、等一下，不要拽。|trans_en=That's not a tail. It's a retractable band, useful for many things. <br/>W-wait, don't pull on it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_103_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう出発？|text_cn=要出发了吗？|trans_en=Heading out already?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_103_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=寝てない。あなたを見てるだけ|text_cn=我没有睡着，只是在看着你。|trans_en=I'm not sleeping, just watching you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_103_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふんふんふ～ん♪|text_cn=哼哼哼哼~♫<br/>哼哼哼哼~♫<br/>哼哼哼~♫ ——<br/>啊……|trans_en=Hmm, hm, hm~ ♪<br/>Hmm, hm, hm~ ♪<br/>Hmm, hm, hm~ ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_103_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふにゃぁ～…|text_cn=呼啊……|trans_en=Yawn ... purr...}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_103_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしはコハク。アヤメが自己紹介を作ってくれたから、詳しいことは後でメールする|text_cn=我，琥珀。<br/>……鸢尾替我写了一份自我介绍，我稍后发邮件给你。|trans_en=I'm Amber.<br/>Iris wrote me a proper intro. I'll text it to you later.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_103_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=自己紹介はいらないと思う。もう知り合いだから|text_cn=我们已经这么熟了，所以……不用再自我介绍了吧？|trans_en=I don't think self-intro is necessary. We already know each other.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_103_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こういう銃の扱い方もあるんだ|text_cn=枪的手感……更好了。|trans_en=My guns are easier to sling now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_103_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん…身体が軽くなった|text_cn=身体更轻盈了，感觉很好。|trans_en=Mm... My body feels lighter.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_103_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ…あたしの過去？何か思い出せそうな…|text_cn=我好像回忆起了什么……那是我的过去吗？|trans_en=I'm remembering something... Is it from my past?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_103_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この曲…すごくいい|text_cn=这是什么歌？好好听。|trans_en=This song ... is so beautiful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_103_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス。あたし、成長してる？|text_cn=魔王，我有成长吗？|trans_en=Boss. Have I gotten better?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_103_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい子いい子、抱っこしてあげる…え？ネコの話だけど？|text_cn=来抱抱……<br/>啊，我说的是这只猫。|trans_en=There, there. Lemme give you a hug...<br/>Hm? I was talking about the cat, though?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_103_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、一緒に写真撮ろう？|text_cn=魔王，要不要一起拍张照？|trans_en=Boss, will you take a picture with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_103_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=記念にもう一枚写真を撮ろ。今度は目を閉じないでね|text_cn=上次你闭眼了，再来一张。|trans_en=Let's take one more selfie together. Don't blink this time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_103_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=2人で撮った写真、好き。待ち受けにしたから、いつでも見られる|text_cn=我把合影设成了手机桌面。因为喜欢。|trans_en=Our selfie was pretty good. I set it as my wallpaper so that I can see it anytime.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_103_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、待ち受け画面にするから、また一緒に写真撮ろう。100枚だけでいい|text_cn=魔王，我想换手机桌面了。请再和我合影吧……<br/>……一百张就够了。|trans_en=Boss, I'm thinking of a new wallpaper.<br/>Please take more pictures with me... 100 should do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_103_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、好き。ありがとう|text_cn=这个，喜欢。|trans_en=I like this. Thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_103_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、すごく好き。ありがとう|text_cn=这个，特别喜欢。|trans_en=I love this very much. Thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_103_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ…ボスだと思って大事にする。本当にありがとう|text_cn=这个，我会像珍惜魔王一样地珍惜它。|trans_en=I... I'll treasure this as if it were you. Thanks so much.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_103_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=わかった|text_cn=明白。|trans_en=Got it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_103_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=違う|text_cn=不对。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_103_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいの？|text_cn=可以吗？|trans_en=You sure?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_103_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…|text_cn=唔……|trans_en=Hmm...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_103_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…|text_cn=怎么会……|trans_en=No...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_103_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ…！|text_cn=啊……！|trans_en=Ah...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_103_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメ|text_cn=绝对……不行。|trans_en=No way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_103_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ|text_cn=呵。|trans_en=Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_103_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=呼……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_103_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ケータイは常にチェックして|text_cn=记得看手机。|trans_en=Always check your phone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_103_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=撃つよ|text_cn=我要开枪了。|trans_en=I'll shoot.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_103_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=動かないで|text_cn=不许动。|trans_en=Don't move.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_103_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務を遂行する|text_cn=我会完成任务。|trans_en=I'll complete the mission.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_103_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_103_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしに任せて|text_cn=交给我。|trans_en=Leave it to me.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_103_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=充填完了、発射|text_cn=充能完毕，发射。|trans_en=Filling complete. Firing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_103_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしが…排除する|text_cn=蓄力射击，击破。|trans_en=I'll... eliminate them.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_103_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘不能、撤退の指示を|text_cn=无法继续战斗，请求撤退。|trans_en=I'm down. Requesting retreat.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_103_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=少し…休む|text_cn=我可能要……休息一会。|trans_en=Just need a little rest...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_103_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、使いやすい|text_cn=这个很好用。|trans_en=This is easy to use.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_103_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたし…強くなった？|text_cn=现在的我……足够强了吗？|trans_en=Have I ... become stronger?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_103_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=力が湧いてくる|text_cn=我变强了。|trans_en=I feel powerful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_103_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これであなたの力になれる|text_cn=我能帮到你。|trans_en=Now I can be of use to you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_103_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=『ネコの歌』でも、歌おうか？|text_cn=要听“喵喵之歌”吗？|trans_en=Wanna hear the Meow Meow Song?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_103_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=2、4、6…うん、弾薬の予備はこれで十分|text_cn=两个，四个，六个……嗯，柔光弹匣还够用。|trans_en=2, 4, 6... Still plenty of backup mags.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_103_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=厄介な敵は、あたしが倒す|text_cn=棘手的敌人，我来解决。|trans_en=Leave the tough ones to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_103_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=最新のムーナ製品、買ってきた。今回は役に立つかも|text_cn=我淘到了最新款的柔光制品，说不定这次能派上用场。|trans_en=This is the latest model from NGO. Should come in handy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_103_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=怪しい場所は、あたしが見張っとく|text_cn=我会盯紧所有可疑的地方。|trans_en=I'll keep watch on suspicious areas.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_103_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=キャットフード、置いてないかな|text_cn=这边有猫粮吗？|trans_en=I wonder if there is any cat food.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_103_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=強い敵がいる。でも負けない|text_cn=敌人更强了。但没关系，能赢。|trans_en=The enemies are stronger. But I can take 'em.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_103_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先に道を…え、ついてきたい？わかった|text_cn=我先去探路……要一起行动？好。|trans_en=I'll scout ahead—Hm? You wanna tag along? Sure.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_103_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=面白いものがいっぱい。全部買っていい？|text_cn=好多有趣的东西……都能买吗？|trans_en=There's so much cool stuff. Can I buy them all?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_103_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス。ここで記念写真撮りたい|text_cn=等一下，我要拍张照片，留个纪念。|trans_en=Boss, I wanna take a photo here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_103_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人と話すのは、難しい|text_cn=和人交流……好难。|trans_en=Talking to people is tough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_103_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい感じ|text_cn=一切顺利。|trans_en=All's good so far.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_103_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん…これでよし|text_cn=嗯……这样就好。|trans_en=Okay. Good enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_103_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=先に進も|text_cn=……继续前进吧。|trans_en=Let's move on.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_103_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務完了|text_cn=任务完成。|trans_en=Mission complete.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_103_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしの勝ち|text_cn=是我赢了。|trans_en=I won.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_103_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務…失敗|text_cn=任务……失败。|trans_en=Mission failed...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_103_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=やらかした。次はもっとうまくやる|text_cn=魔王，我失手了，下次不会了。|trans_en=I messed up. I'll do better next time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_103_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=出撃準備|text_cn=出发。|trans_en=I'm ready.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_103_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=銃の調子も万全|text_cn=整备完毕，枪械状态良好。|trans_en=Guns are in perfect condition.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_103_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務開始|text_cn=任务开始。|trans_en=Mission start.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_103_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、行くよ|text_cn=魔王，要上了。|trans_en=Boss, let's go.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_103_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_103_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プレゼント、用意した。チョコで作った、ネコ耳カチューシャ。非常食にもなる|text_cn=我为你准备了一份礼物……<br/>嗯，是巧克力猫耳发箍，可以当应急食品。|trans_en=I prepared a present.<br/>It's a cat-ear headband made of chocolate. It can be an emergency ration, too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_103_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、今夜は雪が降るらしいから、一緒に雪だるま作ろう？<br/>クリスマスに作った雪だるまなら、きっとお願い叶えてくれる|text_cn=魔王，今晚会下雪，我们一起去堆雪人吧。在雪愿节里堆出的雪人，一定能实现我们的愿望。|trans_en=Boss, looks like it will snow tonight. Shall we make a snowman together? A snowman made at Snowish Festival will surely make your wishes come true.<br/>They say if you build a snowman on Christmas, it'll grant you one wish.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_103_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今年最初のメッセージは、ボスからだった。嬉しい|text_cn=新年收到的第一条信息，是魔王你的……开心。|trans_en=The first message of the year was from you, Boss. I'm glad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_103_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はあたしの誕生日。でも、普段となにも変わらないはずなのに<br/>ネコと一緒にお昼寝するみたいに、胸のあたりがあったかくなる<br/>それとも…これってボスと一緒だから？|text_cn=魔王，今天是我的生日。其实，我觉得生日就像猫咪打盹一样，安静而温暖。<br/>和你在一起，我感到很安心。|trans_en=Today's my birthday. It shouldn't be any different from usual...<br/>Yet my chest feels warm, like when I nap with a cat.<br/>Maybe... It's because I'm with you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_103_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_103_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえボス、知ってる？ネコって目で感情を表すんだよ<br/>例えばこうすると…お誕生日おめでとうって意味|text_cn=魔王，你知道吗，猫会用眼神表达情感。<br/>比如这样……是在对你说：生日快乐。|trans_en=Did you know, Boss? Cats can say things just with their eyes. <br/>Like this... It means "Happy Birthday."}}
{{AudioRow|title=Chinese New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc103_ChineseNewYear26_day04_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc103_ChineseNewYear26_day04_cn.ogg|text_jp=にゃ～にゃ～んクロが『去年はお疲れさま』だって<br/>春節はゆっくり休んで、みんなで良い一年にしようね|text_cn=喵~喵~唔，魔王，小黑说，过去一段时间你辛苦了。<br/>新年到了，要好好放松，和大家一起过个好年。|trans_en=Meow, meow.Inky said "thank you for last year."<br/>Let's rest well during the Springseek Festival and make it a good year together.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc103_FirstAnniversary_day02_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc103_FirstAnniversary_day02_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスが大変なことになっちゃったけど、あたしはなにも心配してないよ<br/>だってボスは、いつだってどんなピンチも乗り越えてきたでしょ？だからきっと今回も大丈夫<br/>むしろあの絶望的な状況からどうやって逆転するのか、たのしみに待ってるからね|text_cn=魔王碰到了大麻烦，可我……一点也不担心。<br/>一直以来，不管碰到什么样的大危机，魔王都能解决。这次也一定没事的。<br/>我更期待，看到魔王扭转这绝望的局面。我会等你的好消息。|trans_en=Even though you're in a tight spot, Boss, I'm not worried.<br/>Because no matter the crisis, you've always been able to handle it, right? I have no doubt it'll be fine this time too.<br/>In fact, I can hardly wait to see you turn this hopeless situation around.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Half Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc103_HalfAnniversary_day02_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc103_HalfAnniversary_day02_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは白亜商会に潜入する前、水道橋の上で、ボスが居眠りしてたときの写真<br/>こっちはフィーリエに着く直前、オアシス号の中でボスが居眠りしてたときの写真<br/>それはアグリ・ユニオンで、アヤメとマイナが徹夜してる裏でボスが居眠りしてたときの写真<br/>え？隠し撮り？違うよ。撮っちゃダメなら返事してって、ちゃんと確認はとってるから|text_cn=这是潜入白垩商会前，在水道桥上……魔王打瞌睡的照片。 <br/>这是抵达菲莱前，在小绿里……魔王打瞌睡的的照片。 <br/>这是在联合种业，鸢尾和尘沙通宵工作时……魔王打瞌睡的照片。<br/>哎？偷拍？我没有，我拍的时候都有问过魔王，如果不能拍的话要告诉我哦。|trans_en=This is a picture of when you were dozing off on the Waterway before we infiltrated Creta Trading.<br/>This one was taken when you were sleeping in Lucky Oasis right before we arrived at Philae.<br/>And this one is you snoozing in the background while Iris and Mina were pulling all-nighters.<br/>Hm? Sneak shots? Of course not. I asked if it was okay to take them, and I didn't hear a "no."}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_107_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん、パトロールに行くであります！|text_cn=要一起去巡逻吗？|trans_en=I'm heading out for patrol, Boss!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_107_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ相棒！今日も一緒に正義を守るであります！|text_cn=打起精神来，你可是我认同的搭档，今天也要为了维护正义一起奋斗！|trans_en=All right, comrade! Let's enforce justice together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_107_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはようございます！ちょうどいま、朝の訓練を終えたところなんですが…<br/>よければ一緒に朝食はいかがですか？|text_cn=早上好！我刚结束早上的训练！要不要一起去吃个早饭？|trans_en=Good morning! I just finished my morning training.<br/>Would you care to have breakfast together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_107_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一日で一番、昼が辛いのであります<br/>太陽の下に立っていると、暑すぎて息苦しくなりますから<br/>まるで加熱されている缶詰みたい…<br/>えっ、鎧を脱げばいい？それは無理です！鎧は騎士のシンボルでありますから！|text_cn=中午是一天中最难熬的时候，穿着盔甲站在太阳下，又热又闷，感觉就像是被丢进罐头里加热了一样……<br/>你说脱掉？那怎么行，盔甲可是骑士的象征！|trans_en=Noon is the worst part of the day. The midday sun blazes with suffocating heat, making me feel like I'm packed in a hot can...<br/>Huh? I should take off my armor? Perish the notion—a knight is no knight without her armor!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_107_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=本日のパトロールおーしまい。早く帰って『ヘルムライダー』を見よーっと！|text_cn=巡逻结束，我要赶紧回家看今晚的《蒙面骑士》了！|trans_en=Today's patrol is done! Time to go home and watch Helm Rider!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_107_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヒッポグリフ号、整備完了。いつでも出発可能であります！|text_cn=骏鹰号，整备完毕，随时准备出发！|trans_en=The Lapis Eagle is all set. Ready to depart anytime!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_107_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=向かい風の中を進むのは、ワクワクしますね。あなたはどうです？|text_cn=我好喜欢迎着风前行的感觉，你呢？|trans_en=Going against the wind is exhilarating, isn't it? Don't you agree?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_107_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=休日にあなたと一緒にここに来て、ヘルムライダーの変身ポーズを練習すると、<br/>元気いっぱいになります！|text_cn=轮休的时候，和你一起来这边骑车兜风，练习一下蒙面骑士的变身姿势，就感觉自己又充满活力了！|trans_en=On my day off, we can come here together and practice the Helm Rider transformation pose. Won't that be energizing?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_107_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=麦のいい香り…また、あなたと一緒にここへ来られるでしょうか？<br/>え…絶対？なら、約束です|text_cn=迎面吹来的风有麦子的香味……我们还会再来这个地方吗？<br/>会？那就约好了哦。|trans_en=Ah, the fragrance of ripe wheat... Can we come here together again?<br/>Wait, really? Then it's a promise!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_107_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナイトォ…キーック！！見たでありますか、この素晴らしい技を！<br/>え、キックなのになぜ盾を使うのか？<br/>ふふん♪これこそが従騎士ティリアの編み出した必殺技の真髄であります！<br/>あなたになら、特別に教えてあげてもいいですよ|text_cn=骑士——飞踢！怎么样，这招很强吧，想不想学？<br/>为什么明明说飞踢结果却是用盾砸……？<br/>哼哼，这就是骑士侍从缇莉娅专属必杀技的奥妙所在，一般人我可不会告诉他。|trans_en=Kniiiiiight ... kick! Did you see that amazing move?!<br/>Hm? Why call it a kick when I'm using a shield? <br/>Heh heh ♪ This is the signature move I, Squire Tilia, have created! I'd be happy to teach you, as a favor to a friend!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_107_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=その時、我々は目を疑った<br/>長い戦いの中でアップグレードされ続けたヒッポグリフ号が、突然目からビームを放ち――<br/>というところで、夢から覚めたんですよね…|text_cn=这时不可思议的事情发生了，经过漫长的战斗，升级后的骏鹰号突然能从眼睛里放出激光了……<br/>啊，原来只是我的梦。|trans_en=We couldn't believe our eyes. <br/>The Lapis Eagle, which had been upgraded through a series of hard-fought battles, suddenly shot beams from its eyes—<br/>and that's when I woke up from the dream.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_107_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヒッポグリフ号の動力システムをまたアップグレードしたいですね<br/>今度こそスピードを元の3倍にするであります！|text_cn=真想再改造一次骏鹰号的动力系统，这次要将速度提升到原来的三倍！|trans_en=I'd like to upgrade the Lapis Eagle's power grid again. This time, I'll make it three times as fast!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_107_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつも兜を被っている理由？<br/>それはもちろん、ヘルムライダーの変身アイテムだからです！<br/>すなわち兜は、正義の象徴なのであります！|text_cn=我为什么总喜欢一直戴着头盔？<br/>因为每一代的蒙面骑士都会依靠头盔变身，换句话说这就是正义的象征！|trans_en=Why do I always wear a helmet?<br/>It helps me transform into Helm Rider, of course! The helmet is a symbol of justice!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_107_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヒーローへの道のりは長く険しいですが…<br/>いつか私の活躍を元に、ステラドラマを作ってもらえるよう頑張るであります！|text_cn=和故事中真正的英雄相比，我还有很长的路要走。<br/>未来会有人把我的事拍成星塔影剧吗？|trans_en=The path to becoming a hero is long and arduous.<br/>I hope someday a Stella Drama will be made about my many achievements!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_107_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=『弱きを守る。敵を恐れない。己の全てを捧げる。正義の心を忘れず悪に立ち向かう』<br/>あれ、聞こえてました？実はいまの、騎士の教訓なんです<br/>といっても帝国護衛隊の規則ではなく、騎士小説に書かれていた言葉でして…<br/>それを自分の目標として頑張っているのであります|text_cn=“尊重弱者并给予保护，不畏敌人，无私奉献，永远以正义与善良对抗不公与邪恶……”<br/>嗯？你听到了？我正在诵读骑士诫言。<br/>不是啦，这不是帝国卫队的纪律，而是我在骑士小说中看到的，我把这几句话当作对自己的要求。|trans_en="Protect the weak. Fear no enemy. Dedicate yourself. Always face evil with a heart of justice."<br/>—Oh, you heard me? That was a knight's oath.<br/>But no, not the official one from the Imperial Guard. It's from a novel I read.<br/>I'm reciting it to inspire me to work harder toward my goals.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_107_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=最高の仲間である証として、この兜を進呈するであります！<br/>これは私が小さい頃から大事にしている限定版の兜で、被ればきっと――<br/>え、暑そうだからいらない？大丈夫ですよ、すぐに慣れるでありますから！<br/>とりあえず被って――ちょ、逃げないでくださーい！|text_cn=这是我从小就一直珍藏的限定版头盔。我想把它送给你，它能证明我们两人是维护正义的最佳搭档……<br/>你说太闷了不想戴？没关系，习惯就好！你先戴上去试试嘛！<br/>——喂，不准逃！|trans_en=As a token of appreciation to the best comrade ever, I present you this helmet! <br/>It's a limited-edition model I've cherished since I was little. If you wear it, I'm sure... <br/>Eh? You don't want it because it looks stuffy? Don't worry, you'll get used to it soon enough. <br/>Here, let me help—hey, don't run from me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_107_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さすが私の仲間です、バッチリ兜をかぶりましたね<br/>私にはまだ及びませんけど、中々似合っているであります！<br/>ちなみにそのボタンを押すと、かっこいい変身の効果音が流れますよ！<br/>ただ音量はちょっと…ま、まあ一度押してみるのであります！|text_cn=结果还是戴上了嘛，不愧是我的拍档。嗯，看上去还不错，只比我差了一点点。<br/>顺便一提，只要按动旁边的按钮，就会发出变身音效，很帅气吧？<br/>唯一的小问题是音量有点……总之你按一下就知道了！|trans_en=I knew you'd put on the helmet, comrade! You've got some ways to go, but it suits you pretty well!<br/>By the way, if you press this button, it makes a cool transformation sound!<br/>Though, the volume might be a bit—well, just try it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_107_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=古い騎士小説でも、ヘルムライダーのようなステラドラマでも<br/>ヒーローに仲間の存在は欠かせないのであります<br/>ですから、その…うぅ～、心の準備が…や、やっぱり何でもありませぇええええん！|text_cn=不管是古代的骑士小说中，还是蒙面骑士这样的电视节目里，主人公想要成为英雄，都离不开好伙伴的支持。<br/>所以，那个……唔唔，我、我还没有做好心理准备，你就当作什么都没听见吧！|trans_en=Even in old knight novels, or in Stella Dramas like Helm Rider, a hero can't exist without comrades.<br/>So, um... Ugh, I'm not ready. Never mind, forget I said anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_107_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このヘアゴムですか？新人だった頃、とある友人に無理矢理押しつけられたんですよ<br/>私に絶対似合うからって――<br/>え？あなたもそう思う？そ、そうですか…|text_cn=头上的发圈？我训练营里的朋友强行塞给我的，她说我戴上很可爱……<br/>你也这么觉得？这、这样啊……|trans_en=This hair tie? When I was a rookie, a friend forced it on me, saying it totally suited me and—<br/>Huh? You think it does, too? Well, in THAT case...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_107_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=偉大なる騎士ティリアの伝説が、いま始まるであります！<br/>さあ魔王さん、共に征きましょう！|text_cn=伟大骑士缇莉娅的传说，现在才正式开始。<br/>哼哼，我的拍档，和我一起来谱写吧！|trans_en=The legend of the great knight Tilia begins now!<br/>Come, Tyrant, let's march together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_107_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=車の運転が好きなセイナさんとは話があいそうです<br/>といっても…まずは安全運転を心がけてもらわないと！|text_cn=尘沙是优秀的车手，我和她有共同语言……要是她能注重安全驾驶就更好了！|trans_en=Noya likes driving, so I'm sure we'll get along very well.<br/>But first things first—she has to drive safely!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_107_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミネルバさんが率いるウィンドアッシュは、優秀な方ばかりですね<br/>いつか帝国護衛隊にスカウトしたいであります<br/>もちろん、スケボーの安全運転を心がけることが条件ですが|text_cn=密涅瓦和她的伙伴都很优秀……我迟早要拉她们加入卫队，不过前提是安全驾驶！|trans_en=Minova's Ashwind Clan is packed with talent.<br/> I'd like to recruit them into the Imperial Guard someday.<br/>Of course, safe skateboarding is a must!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_107_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=劇団白猫…護衛隊の同僚から聞いた話だと、自己中心的な人が多いとか…<br/>それでも私は、会ってみたいのであります！|text_cn=白猫剧团？虽然听骑士团的同僚说，她们都是些自作主张的家伙，不过……要是有机会交流一下就好了。|trans_en=The White Cat Troupe? I heard from other guards that they're full of egotists...<br/>But I still want to meet them!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_107_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタルという子どもに会ったんですが…<br/>あんな小さい子を戦わせるなんてなにを考えているでありますか？危ないであります！|text_cn=我见过火垂……为什么要让那么年幼的孩子战斗呢？多危险啊！|trans_en=I met a girl named Firefly. But I have to ask...<br/>What are they thinking, making such a little girl fight? It's dangerous!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_107_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…オフィールさんはあなたのお知り合いですよね？<br/>可能なら、次のヘルムライダーの公演日がいつなのか、代わりに聞いてもらえないでしょうか？<br/>それと…確実にチケットをとる方法も！|text_cn=你应该认识奥菲尔吧？可不可以帮我问问她，下次的蒙面骑士公演是什么时候？怎么才能抢到票呢？|trans_en=Erm, you know Ophir, right?<br/>C-Could you ask when the next <i>Helm Rider</i> show will be?<br/>Oh ... and more importantly, the best way to get tickets!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_107_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょ、待って！髪がぐしゃぐしゃになっちゃいますからぁ…！|text_cn=别、别弄乱我的头发啦。|trans_en=W-Wait! My hair's getting all messy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_107_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=緊急事態でありますか？すぐに出動します！|text_cn=发生了什么紧急的事吗？我这就出发！|trans_en=An emergency? I'll head out right away!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_107_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ以上無視するなら、一人で出発しますよ<br/>ほら、ヒッポグリフ号も待ちくたびれてるであります！|text_cn=再不理我的话，我就要一个人出发啰。骏鹰号也在等你！|trans_en=If you keep ignoring me, I'll leave alone. Look, even Lapis Eagle's raring to go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_107_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=見張りで忍耐勝負？負けないであります！|text_cn=你也在练习站岗吗？我可不会输哦！|trans_en=Patrol duty is a battle of patience? Then I won't lose!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_107_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=民の眠りを守るのも、帝国騎士の役目であります！|text_cn=守护民众的睡眠，也是帝国骑士的职责之一！|trans_en=Protecting the people's sleep is also an Imperial Knight's duty!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_107_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私は正義の従騎士ティリアであります！<br/>これから共に、正しき心を広めてゆきましょう！|text_cn=报告！我是代表正义的骑士侍从缇莉娅。来成为我的伙伴一起伸张正义吧！|trans_en=I am Tilia, the Squire of Justice!<br/>From now on, I shall bring righteousness to the people!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_107_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また会いましたね、正義を願う同志よ！|text_cn=又见面啦，正义的伙伴！|trans_en=We meet again, fellow seeker of justice!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_107_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また強くなったであります！|text_cn=我的力量又变强了！|trans_en=I feel stronger!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_107_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=槍が鋭さを増しました！|text_cn=我的枪尖，更锋利了！|trans_en=My lance is even sharper now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_107_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=記憶の片隅にあるあの光景…実際にあったことだったんですね|text_cn=原来我经常做的那个梦，真的发生过……！|trans_en=That scent, tucked away in my memories... <br/>So it was real, then?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_107_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うんうん、パトロールにぴったりの曲であります|text_cn=嗯~是个适合巡逻时听的旋律！|trans_en=Mmmhmm. A perfect ditty for a patrol.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_107_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ？なんだかヒッポグリフ号の音がいつもと違って…<br/>うひゃあああ～～！？|text_cn=咦……骏鹰号的声音怎么有点不对劲……哇哇哇——！|trans_en=Huh, the Lapis Eagle sounds different, somehow. <br/>What in the world?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_107_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヒーローへと続く道の第一歩、見届けてくれてありがとうございます|text_cn=谢谢你，来见证我踏上英雄之路。|trans_en=I thank you, for bearing witness to my first steps in becoming a hero!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_107_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=騎士になるのは、小さい頃からの夢であります|text_cn=从很小的时候开始，我成为骑士的梦想就没有动摇过。|trans_en=Becoming a knight has been my dream since I was little.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_107_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=正義は確かに存在するのであります<br/>見張りに立つたび、パトロールに出るたび、誰かを助けるたび、いつもそばに感じてますから|text_cn=正义从来不是虚无飘渺的，每次站岗，每次巡逻，每次帮助他人的时候，都能让我感受到它的存在。|trans_en=I assure you, justice exists. Every time I stand watch, go on patrol, or help someone, I feel its presence, right by my side.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_107_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=仲間とともに冒険し、正義のために戦うのは<br/>ヒーロードラマみたいで気持ちがいいのであります|text_cn=和伙伴一起冒险，一起维护正义的感觉真好，就像英雄剧里的主人公们一样。|trans_en=Adventuring with comrades and fighting for justice makes me feel like a superhero—and that feels good!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_107_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとうって、ずっと伝えたくて――<br/>え、何のお礼かって？それは…いつも側で助けてくれたこと…とか？<br/>そ、それだけであります！他に意味なんてありませんから！|text_cn=一直以来，我都想对你说声谢谢。<br/>欸，谢什么？就是那个……谢谢你愿意一直陪在我身边帮助我……<br/>就、就这样，没别的意思！|trans_en=I've always wanted to say thank you—<br/>Huh, what for? Why, for always being by my side ... to help!<br/>Th-That's all! No other meaning, really!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_107_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プレゼント？ありがとうございます、大事にしますね！|text_cn=这是礼物？谢谢你，我会好好保管的！|trans_en=A gift? Thank you! I'll keep it forever!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_107_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁ！私の好み、覚えててくれたんですね！嬉しいです！|text_cn=这个我喜欢！你还记得我的喜好，好高兴！|trans_en=Wow! You remembered what I like? That makes me so happy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_107_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、もしかして噂の…す、すごいです！どこで見つけて…<br/>本当にありがとうございます！|text_cn=这……这难道是传说中的……好厉害，你从哪里找到的？太感谢啦！|trans_en=Is this what everyone is mad about?! Amazing! How'd you find it? Thank you so much!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_107_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうであります|text_cn=很好。|trans_en=That's right.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_107_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメであります！|text_cn=不行！|trans_en=No, no, no!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_107_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっ？|text_cn=是吗？|trans_en=Eh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_107_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ…？|text_cn=咦……？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_107_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うう…|text_cn=呜……|trans_en=Ugh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_107_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=これであります！|text_cn=就是这个！|trans_en=This is it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_107_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=このっ…！|text_cn=可恶！|trans_en=How dare you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_107_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=よかったであります！|text_cn=太好了！|trans_en=Super duper!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_107_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_107_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ただいま参上！|text_cn=我来了！|trans_en=Here to stay!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_107_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナイトアターック！|text_cn=骑士冲锋！|trans_en=Knight Attack!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_107_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=信じてるのであります|text_cn=我相信你。|trans_en=I have faith in us!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_107_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヒッポグリフ号から、また煙が…|text_cn=骏鹰号又开始冒烟了……|trans_en=There's smoke coming from the Lapis Eagle again...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_107_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_107_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=準備完了、出撃であります！|text_cn=准备出发啦！|trans_en=Ready to march!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_107_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=正義の裁きを！|text_cn=正义执行！|trans_en=Know judgement's wrath!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_107_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=自由と栄光を！|text_cn=自由和荣耀！|trans_en=For freedom and glory!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_107_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=盾が、重い…|text_cn=拿不住盾了……|trans_en=This shield's heavy...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_107_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これじゃ、騎士になんて…|text_cn=绝不能……辱没骑士之名……|trans_en=A knight must strive to be better.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_107_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=従騎士ティリア、変・身！|text_cn=骑士侍从缇莉娅，变身准备就绪！|trans_en=Squire Tilia, transform!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_107_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが正義の力であります！|text_cn=这就是正义的力量。|trans_en=This is the power of justice!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_107_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=正義は勝つ、であります！|text_cn=正义必将获胜！|trans_en=Justice shall prevail!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_107_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=民を守るのが帝国騎士の使命であります！|text_cn=保护人民是帝国骑士的使命！|trans_en=An Imperial Knight is sworn to protect the people!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_107_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私がみなさんの盾になるであります！|text_cn=我会成为大家的盾。|trans_en=I'm going to be a shield for everyone!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_107_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=皆さんはパトロールが面倒だと仰っていますが、本官は結構楽しくやっているであります|text_cn=大家都觉得巡逻是件苦差事，我倒是乐在其中。|trans_en=Everyone says patrol duty is terrible, but I actually quite like it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_107_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=帝国の騎士たる者、困っている人は誰であろうと全力で助けねば！|text_cn=身为帝国骑士，我要做的不仅仅是保护城里的市民。<br/>只要是有需要的人，我都会尽我所能去帮助他们。|trans_en=As a knight of the Empire, I am bound to render aid with all my strength!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_107_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日の『ヘルムライダー』、見ましたか！？<br/>間違いなく今年一番、最っ高の回でした！見終わっても興奮で朝まで眠れなくて<br/>だから…ふぁあ～、今はとっても眠いですぅ…|text_cn=你看了昨晚的《蒙面骑士》吗？<br/>感觉是今年最有意思的一集，看完后我一直兴奋到凌晨，根本睡不着觉……<br/>哈啊，我现在好困哦。|trans_en=Did you watch yesterday's Helm Rider?<br/>It was the best episode of the year! I was so excited I couldn't sleep afterwards! Yaaawn...<br/>But I'm sleepy now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_107_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=冒険も楽しいであります！<br/>私も帝国護衛隊に入っていなかったら、いまごろ巡遊者になっていたかもしれません<br/>も、もちろん、いろんな場所で正義を成すためであります！|text_cn=旅人的冒险还挺有意思的……<br/>如果我没有加入帝国卫队，说不定也会成为专职旅人，这样就可以到各地伸张正义了~|trans_en=Adventuring is fun too. <br/>If I hadn't joined the Imperial Guard, I might've become a full-time trekker by now...<br/>Of course, the point would be to bring justice to every far-flung corner of the world!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_107_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=友とは手を取り合い、悪は討つべきであります|text_cn=遇到朋友要帮忙，遇到坏人就打倒。|trans_en=Together with my comrades, I must vanquish evil wherever I find it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_107_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=敵が勢いづいてきました。<br/>でも負けないのであります！|text_cn=敌人的气势变得更强了呢，不过，我们也不会输！|trans_en=The tide is in the enemy's favor, but I won't falter!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_107_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新たな冒険、心の準備はよいでありますか？|text_cn=准备好迎接新的挑战了吗？|trans_en=Well? Ready for a new adventure?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_107_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは…都市のお店と全然違うのでありますね！|text_cn=这里和城里的商店长得不一样欸！|trans_en=This place... It's not at all like those city shops!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_107_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=従騎士ティリア、休憩の申請をいたします！はぁ～…気持ちいい～♪|text_cn=骑士侍从缇莉娅，申请休整！啊~好舒服~|trans_en=Squire Tilia, requesting a break! Ah, that feels better... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_107_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんなヒミツも、この鋭い騎士の目は誤魔化せませ――<br/>ううっ、瞬きせずにいると目が乾くであります…|text_cn=没有秘密，能躲开我这双锐利的骑士之眼……<br/>啊，眼睛瞪得好酸。|trans_en=No secret escapes the sharp eyes of this knight—<br/>Ugh, my eyes are dry from not blinking.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_107_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=日々の訓練と比べれば、この程度なんともありません|text_cn=这点运动量，和我平时的训练强度比起来，不算什么。|trans_en=Compared to my daily training, this is nothing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_107_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=報告、敵はすべて排除したであります！|text_cn=报告，敌人已经全部清理完毕！|trans_en=Reporting! All enemies eliminated!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_107_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=敵が何か落としたであります。確認してみましょう|text_cn=敌人身上说不定会掉落好东西，记得捡哦。|trans_en=The enemy dropped something. I'll check it out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_107_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=楽勝であります！|text_cn=小菜一碟。|trans_en=Piece of cake!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_107_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=心に灯る正義の炎が勝利へと導いてくれました！|text_cn=我心中那熊熊燃烧的正义之火，引导着我走向胜利！|trans_en=The flame of justice led me to victory!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_107_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここで終わるわけには…もう一度挑戦するであります！|text_cn=一时失败不意味着结束……等会再来！|trans_en=I can't quit now—I'll be back, better than ever!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_107_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=少し休んだら、すぐ立ち上がるので…！|text_cn=休息一下，我马上就会回来！|trans_en=Let me catch my breath, and I'll be right back up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_107_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=正義のために！|text_cn=为了正义！|trans_en=For justice!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_107_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=騎士の名にかけて！|text_cn=以骑士精神起誓！|trans_en=For the honor of a knight!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_107_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=準備完了であります！|text_cn=准备出发。|trans_en=Ready to go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_107_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=従騎士ティリア、出撃であります！|text_cn=帝国骑士侍从缇莉娅，申请出战！|trans_en=Squire Tilia, marching out!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_107_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_107_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=バレンタインというのは、自分の気持ちを大切な人に打ち明ける日と聞きました<br/>ここは騎士を目指す者としてその伝統を守らねばなりません！<br/>ですので…この手作りチョコをどうぞ！<br/>それで、あの…もうすぐシフトの交代時間なので、よければ一緒に遊びに行きませんか…！？|text_cn=据说情人节要把心意传达给最重要的人……唔，身为一名合格的骑士侍从，当然也要遵守这个习俗！<br/>所、所以……这个巧克力是我亲手做的送给你！还有马上就到我换班的时间了要不要去哪逛逛！|trans_en=So apparently, Valentine's Day is about sharing your true feelings with people you care about.<br/>Well, as a knight, I'm honor-bound to uphold all traditions!<br/>And if that includes making chocolates for you, then so be it. Hope you enjoy them...<br/>Oh, and my shift ends soon, so I'm available if you, er, want to go out to the tavern or something.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_107_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=クリスマスの日、街が賑やかになるのはいいことでありますが…<br/>人が増えるからこそ、従騎士たる者、パトロールをおろそかにするわけにはいきません！<br/>正義を志す相棒として、魔王さんもそう思いますよね？<br/>ですからこのティリアが目を光らせている限り、悪事はゼッタイに見逃さないであります！|text_cn=每年的今天，大家看起来都比平时要开心。身为一名合格的骑士侍从，今天的巡逻任务就更不能松懈！<br/>你说对吧？今晚的和平就交给帝国卫队吧，一定不会让任何坏人有机可乘！|trans_en=Gosh, the town becomes so bright and lively on Snowish Festival!<br/>... But when the crowds get bigger, that's when us aspiring knights have to work extra hard to keep the peace.<br/>Of course, as my partner in the pursuit of justice, I don't have to tell you that now, do I?<br/>Fear not—I'll have my eyes peeled, and no act of wickedness shall escape my eagle eye!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_107_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は『ヘルムライダー』の、新春スペシャル番組の日です！<br/>これを見逃すと、一生後悔しますよ！<br/>なのでお菓子とジュースを用意して、一緒に観ましょう！<br/>ちゃんと放送開始の時間までに、来てくださいね？|text_cn=今天有《蒙面骑士》新年特别篇！错过了就亏大了！你要来跟我一起看吗？零食和饮料我都准备好了，就等你啦！|trans_en=You know what's on tonight, don't you? It's the <i>Helm Rider</i> New Year Special!<br/>If we miss it, we'll regret it for the entire rest of the year.<br/>I'll put together some snacks and drinks, so we can watch it together...<br/>Just make sure you're here in plenty of time—I don't want to miss the start!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_107_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は私の誕生日であります！願い事はもちろん…「正式な騎士になれますように」<br/>であります！結局去年、この願い事は叶いませんでしたが…<br/>今年はあなたという最高の相棒がいるので、きっと大丈夫です！<br/>私が騎士になれたら、豪華な食事をご馳走しますから…期待して待っていてくださいね！|text_cn=今天可是我的生日哦！今年的生日愿望嘛——当然还是想要顺利转正，成为正骑士！<br/>虽然去年的愿望也是这个……不过这一次，有你这个最棒的搭档在身边，我一定能成功的！<br/>等我成为正骑士，就请你吃超级丰盛的大餐！你就好好期待吧！|trans_en=Today is my birthday! And you know what my wish is, right? It's to become a full-fledged official knight!<br/>That's what I wished last year too, though it didn't work out.<br/>But this year, I have the best partner ever, so I know I'm going to do it!<br/>Once I get my knighthood, I'm going to treat you to the most sumptuous feast ever, so I hope you're ready to eat big!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_107_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_107_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとうございます！ケーキを用意したので、一緒に食べましょう！<br/>今日の主役はあなたですからね！どんなムチャブリにも、応えてみせるであります！<br/>遠慮はいりませんよ。私たちはこれから、ノヴァで一番の相棒になっていくんですからね！|text_cn=生日快乐！我特地给你准备了蛋糕，快来一起吃吧！今天你是主角，有什么要求我都会尽全力实现！<br/>别跟我客气啦~以后我们还要一起并肩作战，做最厉害的正义搭档呢！|trans_en=Happy birthday! I made a cake—let's eat it together!<br/>You're the star of the day, so I'm totally prepared to do whatever madcap thing you want to do.<br/>No need to be shy either. After all, we're on the way to being the best team in all of Nova!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_108_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=改めて挨拶をと言われても、困る…そういうのは苦手なんだ|text_cn=要说什么特别的话来打招呼吗？我不擅长这个。|trans_en=Another welcome speech? Urgh... I'm not good at formalities.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_108_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうした？次の任務の相談なら――ん？世間話に来ただけ？|text_cn=来找我商量下次行动的细节吗？嗯？只是想随便聊聊天？|trans_en=You need something? Advice about the next mission? Anything but small talk, please!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_108_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよう。さあ、仕事を始めようか。寝ぼけている暇はないぞ|text_cn=早。工作时间到了。要不，再给你五分钟醒醒脑子？|trans_en=Rise and shine, sleepyhead. We have work to do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_108_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=仕事が一段落したら、食事にでも行かないか？今日は私がおごってやる|text_cn=把事都做完就可以休息吃饭了，我请客。|trans_en=Want to grab dinner after we're done today? My treat.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_108_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=風呂から上がったら、何か飲むか…君も一緒にどうだ？|text_cn=我要去泡个澡，然后再小酌几杯。你要一起吗？|trans_en=I'd love a drink after my bath. Care to join me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_108_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=…ひとつ忠告しておこう。怪我をしたくなければ、私の背後に立たないことだ|text_cn=呼……一个忠告：不希望被误伤的话，就别从背后靠近我。|trans_en=Don't stand behind me if you don't want to get hurt.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_108_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=警戒を怠った者は、戦場で命を落とす<br/>だが安心してくれ。君に降りかかる火の粉は私が払う|text_cn=缺乏警惕的话，便无法从战场上活着回来……<br/>但我决不会让硝烟与战火落到你身上。|trans_en=On the battlefield, one careless slip can be fatal.<br/>But don't worry. I'll be your shield and make sure no harm comes to you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_108_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また二人で記録を更新したな<br/>ん？なんだ、もう次のゲームを探しているのか？ふふ、望むところだ|text_cn=又和你一起破了项游戏记录。<br/>嗯？已经开始寻找下一个目标了？呵呵……|trans_en=We set another new record.<br/>... Hm? You're already looking for the next game? Sounds good to me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_108_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう一戦？いいだろう。時間の許す限り相手しよう|text_cn=再来一把？<br/>当然可以，留给我们的时间还多得是。|trans_en=Another fight?<br/>Fine by me. I'll keep going as long as time allows.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_108_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=カフェ・猫の箱を知っているか？落ち着いた雰囲気のいい店なんだ<br/>興味があるなら、私の奢りで今度一緒にどうかな？|text_cn=猫箱咖啡馆……听说过吗？<br/>是一个能让人放松下来的好地方……有空可以去那坐坐，我请客。|trans_en=Do you know the Cat Box Café? It's a cozy place with a nice, laid-back vibe.<br/>If you're interested, I can take you there some time—my treat.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_108_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=傭兵という仕事がら、ときには危険な任務に臨むことがある<br/>そういう時、劇団白猫では出発前に願いを込めてネコを触るんだ<br/>無事に任務を遂行し、生きて戻れるように…とな|text_cn=我们这些做佣兵的，时常会接到一些危险的任务。<br/>临出发前，大家都要摸一摸猫。据说这么做，能保你任务顺利、性命无虞。|trans_en=Mercenaries have got to take on dangerous jobs sometimes.<br/>In the White Cat Troupe, we always pet the cats for luck before setting out.<br/>It's our way of praying for a successful mission and a safe return.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_108_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=混沌とした世の中で、幸せになれる人は少ない。だからこそ秩序が必要なんだ|text_cn=能在混乱中得到幸福的人终究是少数。只有建立了秩序，才能让大多数人都幸福。|trans_en=Few people are happy in chaotic world. That's why we need order.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_108_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=力を証明した者にのみ、白猫は見合った成果を捧げる。誰でも雇い主になれるわけじゃない|text_cn=不是所有人都有资格做我的雇主。展现你的能力吧，白猫会给予你同等价值的回报。|trans_en=Strength talks, and the White Cats listen! Prove yourself worthy, and we'll help. We don't work for just anybody.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_108_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=力があるのに、責任から逃れる…そういう弱い奴は大嫌いだ<br/>だが街には、その手の人間が多くいるんだろう？|text_cn=我讨厌软弱的人。软弱并非弱小，而是有能力，却逃避责任。大多数城里人，不都这样吗？|trans_en=I hate weak-willed people who claim power but shirk responsibility. But this town is full of them...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_108_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=劇団白猫のメンバーは、生涯同じ銃を使い続ける。もっとも…例外はあるが|text_cn=每位白猫成员的枪支，都是终生不换的。不过，也有例外。|trans_en=Most of us in the White Cat Troupe use the same gun for their whole career. There are exceptions, though.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_108_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…仕事がない日は暇だな。ビリヤード、レースゲーム、ボードゲーム――<br/>どれでも君の好きなものでいい、相手になってくれないか？|text_cn=没有工作的日子闲得发慌。桌球、赛车、电竞……这类竞技运动，你有喜欢的吗？我可以带你去。|trans_en=Ah, I get bored when there's no work in. Play with me, would you? Billiards, a race sim, a board game—anything but this tedium!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_108_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=別に私は、劇団白猫のリーダーになりたい訳じゃない<br/>帰る場所がない『白猫』たちに、新たな居場所を作りたいだけだ|text_cn=我从没打算成为白猫剧团的新首领。<br/>我只是想给那些无家可归的“白猫”们，建立起一个可以用来遮风避雨的地方罢了。|trans_en=It's not that I crave to be the leader of the White Cat Troupe.<br/>I just want to build a place for white cats to call home.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_108_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=爪と牙を求める場所に、『白猫』は現れる。君の求めに応じ、どこへでも駆けつけよう|text_cn=哪里需要尖牙与利爪，“白猫”便出现在哪里。<br/>如果是你的召唤，那么不管身处何方，我都会赶到你身边。|trans_en=When claws and teeth are required, White Cat answers the call.<br/>You need me, I'll come running.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_108_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この５分間に、君の命を奪うチャンスは10回あったぞ<br/>もっと身の安全に気を配った方が…<br/>いや、やはり君はそのままでいい。私が守れば済む話だ|text_cn=在刚才的五分钟里，我有十次机会取走你的性命，你还真是缺乏危机意识啊……<br/>不，你继续保持这样就好。察觉危险的事就由我来做，我会保护你。|trans_en=I could've taken your life ten times in the last five minutes. You should be more alert to dangers.<br/>... Actually, never mind. Stay as you are. I'll protect you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_108_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=招き猫…一つ招いて道中安全、二つ招いて商売繁盛…ごほん。ただの言葉遊びだ、気にするな|text_cn=猫爪子摇一摇，出入平安啊；猫爪子摇二摇，财源广进啊……<br/>——咳，只是句带有神秘力量的顺口溜罢了。|trans_en=Carry one beckoning cat and you'll travel safe. Have two and business will prosper...<br/>Well, that's what they say, at least.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_108_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャトンは場所やタイミングを考えず挑んでくるが…正直、悪い気はしない<br/>むしろ、倒される日が待ち遠しくもあるな|text_cn=我不讨厌猫眼不分时间地点场合的挑战。<br/>事实上，我十分期待她击败我的那一天到来……|trans_en=Chaton will challenge me regardless of place or time. But frankly, that's fine with me.<br/>In fact, the day can't come soon enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_108_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵意志の人間は苦手だ<br/>彼らはあらゆる面において…私たちとは全く別の世界に生きているような気がしてな|text_cn=我和恩赐意志的人处不来。我们好像活在两个世界一样。|trans_en=I'm not fond of those in the Grace Imperium. <br/>In every way imaginable, they live in a completely different world than ours.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_108_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私やシャトンの武器は、ベニトにメンテナンスしてもらっているのだが…<br/>本当に、彼女の技術には驚かされる。ついでに、コーヒーの淹れ方も完璧だったな|text_cn=蓝锥的手艺很好，我和猫眼的装备都是由她来改装维护的。<br/>当然，她泡咖啡的手艺也很好。|trans_en=Benito maintains my weapons, and Chaton's too. Her skills are incredible—<br/>and she makes a mean mug of coffee, as well.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_108_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズという少女の生き方は実に興味深い。彼女こそ、まさに『森の娘』だ|text_cn=那个叫杏子的小姑娘……她的生存方式很有意思，简直就是“森林的女儿”。|trans_en=What an extraordinary life that girl Ann leads. She is truly a daughter of the forest.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_108_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=復讐か…確かに大義名分もあるようだ。人手が必要なら言ってくれ。協力しよう|text_cn=复仇？也算大义之举。倘若你们缺少人手，我愿助一臂之力。|trans_en=Revenge ... can always be justified. If you ever need help, I'll be there.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_108_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=言いたいことがあるなら、はっきり言ったらどうだ？|text_cn=有事就说。|trans_en=If you have something to say, just spit it out, why don't you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_108_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうした、状況が変わったのか？|text_cn=需求有变动吗？|trans_en=What's the matter? Has something happened?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_108_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=子供たちの笑い声が聞こえるな…ふっ、いいことだ|text_cn=那是……孩子们的笑声？<br/>……真好。|trans_en=I can hear the children laughing...<br/>What a sweet sound it is, too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_108_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=暇だな…やはり私は、戦う方が性に合っている|text_cn=外出战斗比就这样待着更适合我。|trans_en=Save me from this boredom! I belong on the battlefield, not moping around here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_108_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お疲れさま。お茶を用意しておいたから――<br/>ん？なんだ寝てしまったのか？<br/>ふふ。おつかれさま。今はゆっくり休んでくれ|text_cn=辛苦了，我拿了些茶来……喂！怎么睡着了？<br/>算了，养精蓄锐也很重要。|trans_en=Stellar effort today. Now, I made you a cup of—<br/>Oh? You're asleep already?<br/>Hehe. Well, you've earned it. You go ahead and get your beauty sleep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_108_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=劇団白猫、第三小隊隊長のカシミラだ。では、この契約書にサインを願おう|text_cn=白猫剧团第三小队队长，卡西米拉。这是我们的合作协议，请在上面签名吧。|trans_en=I'm Kasimira, commander of 3rd Squad, White Cat Troupe. Sign here on the dotted line, please.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_108_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=君との契約を延長できること、心から嬉しく思う|text_cn=你是个不错的雇主。能继续与你合作……我很高兴。|trans_en=I'm delighted that you'll be staying on with us.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_108_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=難しい仕事でも、遠慮なく任せてくれ|text_cn=请给我更困难的工作。|trans_en=I can take on any challenge, so don't be shy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_108_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よし、メンテ完了。早速試し撃ちしてみようか|text_cn=枪支保养完毕。我想试试手了。|trans_en=Okay, maintenance complete. Let's give it a quick test fire.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_108_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=旅に出た理由は…決して忘れない|text_cn=唯独“我为何启程”这件事，决不能忘记。|trans_en=Never forget the reason why you set out on your journey.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_108_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これも誰かが幸福を求めている音か…|text_cn=这也是某个呼唤幸福的声音吧。|trans_en=Could this, too, be the sound of someone seeking happiness?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_108_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが契約内容の補足事項だ。目を通しておいてくれ|text_cn=这是补充协议，请。|trans_en=Here's the update to the contract. Make sure you read it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_108_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=契約書に、条件をひとつ追加しようと思ったこともあったんだが…<br/>結局どう書けばいいのかわからなくてな<br/>でも…いまならわかる。友情とは、契約で手に入るものではないらしい|text_cn=我终于意识到，原来你才是我最灵验的幸运护符。|trans_en=I did think about adding another condition to the contract.<br/>I spent ages tried to figure out how to word it.<br/>But now I know friendship isn't something that's built on paperwork.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_108_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=雇い主は君だ。不満があれば遠慮せず言ってくれ|text_cn=你是雇主。如果我有做得不够的地方，你得提出来。|trans_en=You're the client. If you have any complaints, don't hesitate to tell me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_108_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=傭兵だって、仕事は選ぶ。君の依頼を断らないのは…その判断に、価値があるからだ|text_cn=就算是雇佣兵，我们也不是什么活都接的。<br/>但白猫愿意与你长期合作，你有这个价值。|trans_en=I'm a mercenary, yes, but picky about the work I accept.<br/>Sure, I take on all your jobs ... but that's because you're worth it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_108_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=君にネコのストラップをやろう。これは幸福と安全のお守りでな<br/>持っていると、どんな困難でも乗り越えられるんだ<br/>…少なくとも、私たちはそう信じている|text_cn=收下它。这个小猫吊坠给你了。<br/>我们大家都很信这个，猫会保佑你幸福平安，度过一切难关。|trans_en=Even mercenaries have the right to refuse jobs.<br/>But I never turn you down, because I know that every job from you is worth the risk.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_108_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=君との関係は、「雇い主」より「家族」と言った方が正しいかもしれないな…<br/>時間があれば、白猫を第二の家だと思って、いつでも訪ねてくれ|text_cn=比起“雇主”，我想，现在称呼你为“家人”要更合适。<br/>有空的话多来坐坐吧，白猫就是你第二个家。|trans_en=You're more like family than a client. <br/>Consider the White Cats your second home, and visit anytime.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_108_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは…依頼の頭金ということか？|text_cn=是委托的订金吗？|trans_en=Is this the down payment for a commission?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_108_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょうど必要だったんだ、感謝する|text_cn=这正是我需要的，非常感谢。|trans_en=Just what I needed. Thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_108_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=驚いたぞ。まさか私の好みを把握していたとは…幸運のお守りだと思って、大切にする|text_cn=令人惊讶，你从哪调查到我的喜好……<br/>我会珍惜的，它一定会给我带来幸运。|trans_en=I'll be damned. I didn't think you knew what I liked.<br/>I'll treasure it like a holy talisman.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_108_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くない|text_cn=不错。|trans_en=Not bad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_108_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=違う|text_cn=不对。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_108_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=何？|text_cn=什么。|trans_en=What?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_108_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=は？|text_cn=啊？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_108_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=あり得ない…|text_cn=这不可能……|trans_en=Unbelievable.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_108_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=真面目にやれ！|text_cn=正常一点！|trans_en=Be serious!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_108_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=正直に言え！|text_cn=告诉我！|trans_en=Speak the truth!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_108_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ|text_cn=呵呵。|trans_en=Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_108_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉。|trans_en=Hfff...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_108_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ついてこい|text_cn=跟着我。|trans_en=Follow me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_108_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=下がれ|text_cn=你退后。|trans_en=Back down.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_108_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=雇い主が最優先だ|text_cn=雇主至上。|trans_en=The client comes first.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_108_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=力があるほど、責任も大きくなる|text_cn=强大伴随着责任。|trans_en=As your power grows, so does your responsibility.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_108_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_108_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=挑発しているのか？|text_cn=你在挑衅我？|trans_en=Is this a challenge?}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_108_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この銃弾で――葬り去る！|text_cn=弹壳将成为你们的墓碑！|trans_en=I'll bury you ... with this bullet!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_108_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=眠れ――安らかにな！|text_cn=葬身于此吧！|trans_en=Rest in peace!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_108_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=すまない…|text_cn=真吵闹啊……|trans_en=Sorry...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_108_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=後は…頼んだ…|text_cn=接下来就托付给你了。|trans_en=The rest, I leave to you...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_108_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=感謝する|text_cn=多谢。|trans_en=My thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_108_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=遠慮なくいただこう|text_cn=我就不客气了。|trans_en=I happily accept.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_108_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の弾薬は、それぞれ異なる性質を持つんだ|text_cn=不同的弹药也有不同的特性。|trans_en=My ammo has all kinds of interesting effects.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_108_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=背中は私が守る、安心してくれ|text_cn=背后就交给我吧。|trans_en=Don't you worry about anything. I've got your six.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_108_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=仲間を守る力…存分に利用させてもらう|text_cn=我会用好这力量。|trans_en=I'll do everything in my power ... to protect my comrades.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_108_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦場では何が起こるかわからない。甘い考えは捨てることだ|text_cn=人得现实一点，尤其是在战场上。|trans_en=The battlefield is full of threats. It's no place for naivety.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_108_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=弾薬の予備なら心配いらない|text_cn=弹药储备很充足。|trans_en=Don't worry. I've plenty of ammo.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_108_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=『ネコ』の加護がある限り、私たちに敗北はない|text_cn=猫会保佑我们胜利的。|trans_en=We cannot lose, as long as we have the Cat's blessing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_108_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=むりに成果を出そうとしなくていい<br/>こういうのは過程を楽しむことも大切なんだ|text_cn=一味追求结果容易适得其反。享受过程吧。|trans_en=Don't just focus on the finish line—you need to enjoy the journey, too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_108_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=指揮官である以上、私たちが気を抜くわけにはいかない|text_cn=你我都是领导者。可不能太松懈了。|trans_en=As commanders, we simply cannot afford to let our guard down.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_108_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今回はこれまで以上に危険な任務になる。だからこそ、信頼できる人に背中を預けたい|text_cn=这次的行动更危险，所以，我的背后必须托付给可靠的人。|trans_en=This mission will be more dangerous than ever. I need someone I can trust on my six.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_108_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんな場所でも、やるべきことをやるだけさ|text_cn=不管在什么地方，我都会做好我该做的。|trans_en=We do what we must, no matter the situation.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_108_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=必要物資の確保を忘れるな|text_cn=物资储备亦是关键。|trans_en=Don't forget to load up on supplies.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_108_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘では、己の体こそが最大の資本だ。休めるうちに休んでおこう|text_cn=身体是战斗的本钱，魔王，我们休息一下吧。|trans_en=Your body is your greatest asset in battle. Rest it while you can.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_108_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誰が敵で誰が味方か…よく見極めろ|text_cn=擦亮眼睛，看清谁是你的敌人，谁是你的盟友。|trans_en=Know your allies ... and know your enemies better.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_108_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=油断するな、まだ敵が隠れているかもしれない|text_cn=保持警惕，也许还有敌人在潜伏。|trans_en=Be on guard. The enemy may still be lurking.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_108_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=掃討完了|text_cn=很好，干干净净。|trans_en=All clear here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_108_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=後始末を忘れるな|text_cn=别忘了打扫战场。|trans_en=Don't forget to tidy up.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_108_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=素晴らしい指揮だった|text_cn=出色的指挥。|trans_en=You were a great commander.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_108_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=やはり、私の目に狂いはなかったな|text_cn=我果然没有看错你。|trans_en=My eye for talent never lets me down.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_108_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=同じ失敗は繰り返さない|text_cn=绝不会有下一次了。|trans_en=I won't make the same mistake again.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_108_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=くっ…失態だった…|text_cn=如此……失态。|trans_en=Dammit. This is humiliating...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_108_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは私に任せておけ|text_cn=放心交给我。|trans_en=Let me handle this.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_108_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=その期待に応えてみせよう|text_cn=不错的提案。|trans_en=I won't disappoint you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_108_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=その依頼、私が引き受ける|text_cn=我已接受您的业务委托。|trans_en=I'll take care of that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_108_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=今回の依頼もよろしく頼む|text_cn=合作愉快，雇主。|trans_en=Consider this commission done.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_108_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_108_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=バレンタインをすっかり忘れていてな。いま渡せるものといえばこの弾薬くらいなのだが…<br/>受け取ってもらえるとうれしい。ちなみにそれは、ただの弾薬ではないんだぞ？<br/>なんと幸運の弾薬なんだ。前に星ノ塔で遭難しかけたときも、その一発の弾とともに生還できてな<br/>だから君が助けを求めるとき、きっとその弾薬が答えへと導いてくれるはずだ|text_cn=这枚空弹壳，作为情人节的礼物送给你吧。它或许算不上什么珍贵的东西。<br/>只是希望你在需要依靠的时候，能想起我。呵呵，放心，无论何时，我都会赶来你身边。|trans_en=I totally forgot about Valentine's Day. I don't have anything to give you except this ammo here...<br/>It'd mean a lot to me if you accept it. And by the way, it's not just any old stuff... It's lucky ammo.<br/>And yes, I'm serious. Back in the monolith, when I was in a tight spot, a single bullet got me home safe and sound.<br/>So if you're ever in a desperate situation, this gift will do a way better job of saving your skin than a box of chocolates.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_108_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このマントを使うといい。雪が強いし、温かくして、風邪を引かないようにな<br/>なに、私のことは心配いらない。前に経験した嵐のほうが、もっとひどかったくらいだ<br/>え？一緒に羽織ればいい？<br/>それは…ふふ、ならばそうさせてもらおうか|text_cn=披风给你，外头雪大，记得保暖。你不用为我操心，更恶劣的天气我都经历过……诶？一起披着就好了？<br/>那个……呵呵。那么就这么做吧。|trans_en=Here, wrap this cloak around you. Snow's coming down hard, and we don't want you catching a fever.<br/>Me? I'm fine. I've weathered way worse than this.<br/>Well, okay. We COULD both fit underneath, now you mention it.<br/>Let me just snuggle in there...}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_108_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう。ラッキー・ホースシューの言い伝えは知っているか？<br/>このラッキーアイテムを持っていれば、今年一年、運気はきっと良くなるだろう<br/>君の幸せを祈っているよ|text_cn=新年快乐。你知道幸运马蹄铁的传说吗？<br/>只要拿着这个幸运道具的话，今年一整年，你的运势一定会很好的。<br/>希望你能幸福。|trans_en=Happy New Year. You know the tradition about horseshoes, right?<br/>Well, if you hang onto this lucky charm, you'll be bound to stay lucky for the whole year.<br/>So there you go. Have a great year!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_108_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=去年の誕生日から、もう1年が経ったのか<br/>うん？私の願い事？それはいつだって決まっているよ<br/>「白猫のみんな、そして…君が毎日を無事に過ごせますように」だ|text_cn=呵呵，不知不觉又过了一年。我没什么特别的生日愿望，只希望白猫的大家……还有你，都能平安、顺利，这就足够了。|trans_en=Crazy to think it's been a whole year already since my last b-day.<br/>Hm? What's my birthday wish? Oh, that's always the same.<br/>May everyone in the White Cat Troupe—oh, and you too—make it through another year safe and sound.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_108_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_108_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日おめでとう。このベルトを君に贈ろう<br/>ちなみにこれは白猫の仲間の証であり、もっとも信頼する依頼人としての証でもあるんだ<br/>これが私たちをつないでくれる限り、誰にも君を傷つけさせはしない|text_cn=生日快乐，<username>。这条绑带给你。有了它，你就是组织认可的伙伴，也是白猫最信赖的人。<br/>只要我们之间的纽带还在，白猫就不会让任何人伤害到你。|trans_en=Happy birthday. Here, I want you to have this belt.<br/>It proves that you're a friend of the White Cats, and one of our most trusted clients.<br/>It's like a pact, between you and me. So long as you have it, we won't let anyone harm you.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_110_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたって賢いんでしょう？なら何か面白い話を聞かせてちょうだい|text_cn=听说你头脑不错，来说点不无聊的事让我听听？|trans_en=You're smart. So tell me something interesting.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_110_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう来たのね。どうぞ、適当にかけて|text_cn=啊，你来啦。坐。|trans_en=You're here already? Sit wherever you like.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_110_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら、おはよう。あなたもコーヒーを飲むでしょう？|text_cn=早啊。喏，给你，咖啡。|trans_en=Oh, good morning. You take coffee?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_110_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そのランチ、いい匂いね。ひと口いただいてもいいかしら？|text_cn=你这工作餐闻着好香啊……给我尝一口。|trans_en=Your lunch smells good. May I have one bite of it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_110_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう時間？すぐに片づけるから少し待っていてくれる？|text_cn=来接我下班？稍等，我先处理完手头的文件。|trans_en=Is it this late already? I will clean up quickly, so can you please wait a little?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_110_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=剣の腕だけでなく、対人関係における交渉術も磨いておくといいわ。|text_cn=手段与计策，就像剑一样，要时刻打磨锋利。|trans_en=In addition to sword skills, it's good to hone negotiation skills in interpersonal relationships.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_110_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=剣術を学びたいのなら、技術だけにこだわらず、まずは気品を身につけなさい<br/>うふふ。そうすれば私のように、優雅な身のこなしを会得できるはずよ♪|text_cn=剑术，不仅是一门技艺，更是一种优雅的修养。你也想拥有这份优雅吗？|trans_en=If you want to learn swordplay, don't insist only on technique, but first acquire dignity.<br/>Hehehe. If you do that, you should be able to master graceful movements like me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_110_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=酸っぱさに耐える顔なんて、なかなか見られるものではないし…<br/>うふふ。あなたには悪いけれど、なんだか楽しくなってきたわ♪|text_cn=嗯……你这幅酸得脸都皱起来的表情，倒是分外少见，也分外有趣呢。|trans_en=A face enduring sourness is not something one sees often...<br/>Hehehe. I feel sorry for you, but somehow I'm starting to enjoy this ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_110_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私がレストランを起ち上げたら…一緒に支えてくれるとうれしいわ|text_cn=如果是我开的餐厅……你要不要考虑一下……技术入股？|trans_en=If I start a restaurant... I'd be happy if you support me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_110_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=気をつけなさい、私はやられたらやり返す女よ。うふふ……|text_cn=小心点。我可是个睚眦必报的女人呢。|trans_en=Be careful. I'm the type of woman who always pays back what's done to her. Ehehe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_110_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふっ、賢い人との議論は本当に面白いわ。好きよ、こういうの|text_cn=嗯哼，令人愉悦，我就喜欢和聪明人聊天。|trans_en=Ehehe, debating intelligent people is truly entertaining. I love it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_110_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=背負うものが多くなるほど、それだけ責任も大きくなるのよ|text_cn=拥有的越多，理应背负的责任就越大。|trans_en=The more work you take on, the greater your responsibility.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_110_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=まったく…この私を、地位とお金しか見ていない無能な連中と一緒にしないでもらえる？|text_cn=别把我和那些尸位素餐的人相提并论……|trans_en=Honestly... Can you not lump me in with those incompetents who only care about rank and money?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_110_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたのその知恵を振り絞って、私のために貢献してくれることを期待しているわ|text_cn=希望你的能力，能匹配得上你的卓远见识。|trans_en=With that intelligence of yours, I expect you to make contributions for me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_110_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたの見識と、私の采配を組み合わせたら…うふふ、敵はいないわ♪|text_cn=你的惊世智慧，加上我的资源和手腕……<br/>我们联手的话，呵呵……|trans_en=If we combine your knowledge and my leadership...<br/>Hehe, we will have no rival ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_110_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=じっとして。そのまま動いちゃダメよ？<br/>ふふ…思った通り、最高の撫で心地ね♪|text_cn=诶，别动，来让我摸摸头——<br/>嗯。手感果然如同想象中的一样好。|trans_en=Hold still. Do not move, okay?<br/>Hehe... As I thought, the best feeling to the touch ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_110_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=退勤後のお楽しみは大切よ。というわけだから、あなたの時間を貰うわね？|text_cn=下班后的享乐是十分重要的……我能独享你的时间吗？|trans_en=Work hard, play hard. Speaking of which, do you have a moment?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_110_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん、そのままで…よろしい…うふふ♪<br/>私に膝枕してもらえること、光栄に思いなさい|text_cn=嗯，很好……就这个姿势……<br/>感到荣幸吧，能被我当作膝枕，可不是谁都能有的殊荣。|trans_en=Yes, just like that... Good... Hehe ♪<br/>Consider it an honor to put your head in my lap.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_110_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=報告ありがとう。よく出来ていたわよ。<br/>ご褒美に私の香水の香りを教えてあげる|text_cn=你的汇报非常好。奖励你一个了解我香水味道的机会吧。|trans_en=Thank you for the report. As a reward, I'll let you have a sniff of my perfume.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_110_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=相変わらずつまらない接待ばかりね……<br/>決めたわ、全てキャンセルよ。賢い人と過ごす方が有意義だもの|text_cn=怎么还是有那么多应酬……<br/>不去了，还是和聪明人在一起的时间更有价值。|trans_en=Social gatherings are too dull for words, I've decided.<br/>Cancel them all. I'd rather spend time with someone intelligent.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_110_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=言葉にせずとも気持ちが通じる…そんな友人もいれば、当然その逆の存在もいるでしょう<br/>たとえ私とニュクスがどのような関係であれ…彼女とは、今後も手を取り合っていくつもりよ|text_cn=这世上有相知有素的朋友，同样也有各执所见的朋友。<br/>但不管立场如何，我和星雁依旧会携手并进。|trans_en=Feelings communicated without a word... Some friends are like that, and there must be others who are the opposite.<br/>No matter the kind of relationship I have with Nyx... I intend to continue to work with her in the future.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_110_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いくら話しやすいからって、サファイアに意地悪しちゃダメよ<br/>そんなことをすれば……私が容赦しないわ|text_cn=别看蓝宝石好说话，就想着去欺负她哦。<br/>我会原模原样地……用你的身体来偿还的。|trans_en=Just because Sapphire is easy to talk to doesn't mean you should tease her.<br/>In fact, I'm warning you not to.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_110_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=退屈なら、ルビィのところに行ってごらんなさい<br/>彼女なら私よりも面白い話を――って私の話がつまらないと言いたいのかしら？|text_cn=要是缺乐子的话，就去找红宝石吧。<br/>活跃气氛这种事，她比我要在行的多……<br/>等等……我也没有那么无趣吧？|trans_en=If you're bored, why not visit Ruby?<br/>I'm sure she has more interesting stories than—<br/>Wait, are you saying I'm boring?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_110_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵意志で管理職をしているアルベド…だったかしら？<br/>数万規模の従業員がいる中で、そのリソース管理を任されているくらいだもの<br/>カンパニーから見ても、それだけ優秀な人材なんでしょうね。一度直接話してみたいものだわ|text_cn=在恩赐意志里担任管理职的那位……是叫奥尔贝德吧？在数万名员工中，能被选中并委以重任。<br/>从公司的角度看，她一定是名非常优秀的人才。真想有机会能与她当面聊聊。|trans_en=The one doing admin at Grace Imperium... Albedo, was it? Among tens of thousands of employees, she's the one entrusted with resource management.<br/>From the company's perspective, she must be a talented asset. I'd love to talk to her in person sometime.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_110_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダリシアと契約を結ぶときは、裏の裏までよく確認なさい<br/>でないと、あとで痛い目を見ることになるわよ？|text_cn=达尔茜娅……哼，和她打交道，必须打起十二万分的精神。<br/>不然……连自己最后会落得何种下场都不得而知。|trans_en=When signing a contract with Darcia, check even the finest print.<br/>If you don't, you will regret it later.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_110_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=することがないのなら、私の仕事を手伝ってみる？|text_cn=要是闲的话，就来帮我分担点工作。|trans_en=If you have nothing to do, do you want to try helping with my work?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_110_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふ……ちょっと待っててちょうだい。終わったら構ってあげるから|text_cn=诶？嗯……那你等我一下……我过会就来陪你。|trans_en=Ehehe... Just wait a little longer and I'll be all yours.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_110_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あぁ……寝ちゃったのね。うふふ♪|text_cn=睡……着……了……吗……呵呵。|trans_en=Ah... You fell asleep, didn't you? Ehehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_110_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら？今度はどこへ遊びに行ってしまったのかしら？|text_cn=哦？又在和谁卿卿我我呢？|trans_en=Oh? Where have you run off to this time?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_110_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=急に静かになって…なにかサプライズでも企んでいるの？|text_cn=突然变得这么安静……是在企图给我什么惊喜吗？|trans_en=You suddenly became quiet... Are you planning some kind of surprise?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_110_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フィレンよ。盟友としての実力を見せてあげる<br/>だからあなたも私を失望させないでちょうだいね|text_cn=翡冷翠，你的盟友。我会向你展现我的价值，也请你不要令我失望。|trans_en=I'm Firenze. Let me show you what I can do, and please don't disappoint me either.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_110_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お互い気心が知れているのだし、挨拶は不要<br/>なぜ私を探していたのか答えてくれるなら、付き合ってあげてもいいわ|text_cn=聪明人之间，就不必重复客套话了——说出你特地找我的理由吧，我都会奉陪。|trans_en=We know each other well enough. No need for formalities. Tell me why you want me, and maybe I'll go along.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_110_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私への投資？うふふ……その誠意、確かに受け取ったわ|text_cn=对我的投资啊……哼哼，你的诚意，我收到了。|trans_en=Investing in me? Ehehe... I'll accept your good will.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_110_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=鋭い嗅覚を持っていなければ、望む未来は掴めない。あなたならこの意味がわかるでしょう？|text_cn=没错，我能懂你的意思。我们要时刻保持敏锐，这样才能得到我们想要的未来。|trans_en=If you don't have a keen intuition, you can't grasp the future you desire. I think you understand what this means, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_110_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=踊りだしたくなるような…穏やかで心地よい音色ね。あなたもそう思わない？|text_cn=真是平稳又让人舒适的音色，令人想要随之起舞。你觉得如何？|trans_en=It makes one want to dance... This gentle, pleasant sound. Do you not think the same?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_110_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=音楽としては及第点ね|text_cn=嗯，还算悦耳。|trans_en=As music, it's passable.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_110_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=より強固な関係にしていくため、一度契約を見直しましょうか？|text_cn=是时候签个新契约了，让我们的合作……更进一步吧……！|trans_en=To build a stronger relationship, shall we review the contract once?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_110_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=共に歩んでいくと決めた以上、私から逃げられるとは思わないことね♪|text_cn=既然选择了与我一起……就意味着，你已经逃不出我的掌心了喔……|trans_en=Now that we've decided to go forward together, don't think you can run away from me ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_110_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私たちの関係が、双方にとって大きな利益をもたらすことを願っているわ|text_cn=希望我们的合作，能给双方都带来可观的利益。|trans_en=I am hoping that our relationship will bring great benefits to both sides.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_110_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=話が早くて助かるわ。それじゃ、引き続きよろしくね|text_cn=与你共事确实省心，就让我们继续合作共赢吧。|trans_en=I appreciate your being quick to the point. I look forward to working with you further.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_110_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたからの相談なら、24時間いつでも大歓迎よ|text_cn=别忘了，我才是你的全天候战略合作伙伴……唯一的那个。|trans_en=If you need advice, you are welcome 24 hours a day.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_110_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この契約書にサインすれば、私たちはすべてを共有することになるの<br/>資産、ブランド、人材、知恵、見識、策略、嗜好、権力、そして…秘密もね|text_cn=只要你签下这个条款，我们就能共有资产、债务、品牌、员工……<br/>智慧、学识、胆魄、喜好、力量，以及秘密……|trans_en=If we sign this contract, we will share everything.<br/>Assets, brand, personnel, knowledge, insights, strategies, preferences, power, and ... even secrets.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_110_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=単刀直入に訊くけれど、お返しは何がいいかしら？|text_cn=不如直说好了，想要我给你什么回报？|trans_en=Let's talk straight. What would you like in return?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_110_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふ、高得点よ。さすがは私が見込んだ人ね|text_cn=嗯，这才是我认可的，高分表现。|trans_en=Ehehe, high marks. As expected from someone I've put my faith in.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_110_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなにドキドキさせられるなんて…うふふ♪<br/>危うくラインを踏み越えてしまうところだったわ|text_cn=让我这么心动的话……我会不小心越线的。|trans_en=I can't believe my heart is racing like this... Hehehe ♪ I almost got too close to crossing the line.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_110_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいわ|text_cn=很好。|trans_en=Fine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_110_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメね|text_cn=不。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_110_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=何をしているの？|text_cn=这是在做什么？|trans_en=What are you doing?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_110_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=……は？|text_cn=哈？|trans_en=...Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_110_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=くっ……|text_cn=呜……|trans_en=Ugh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_110_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=まぁ……！|text_cn=怎会——|trans_en=What! Oh my...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_110_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちっ……！|text_cn=可恶！|trans_en=Tch...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_110_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=褒めてあげる|text_cn=值得嘉奖。|trans_en=Well done.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_110_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ……|text_cn=哎……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_110_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=アセスメントが必要ね……|text_cn=需要衡量其价值。|trans_en=An assessment is in order.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_110_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私を失望させないでちょうだい|text_cn=别让我失望哦？|trans_en=Do not disappoint me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_110_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=まあ及第点ね|text_cn=嗯，勉强及格吧。|trans_en=Great results.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_110_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=常識の範囲内でよろしく|text_cn=麻烦正常一点。|trans_en=Keep it reasonable.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_110_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_110_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=任せるわ|text_cn=交给你了。|trans_en=It's up to you.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_110_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=礼儀がなってないわね――そこに直りなさい！|text_cn=该为你的冒犯……付出代价了！|trans_en=You lack manners. Attention!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_110_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の前に――ひれ伏しなさい！|text_cn=在我面前——跪下！|trans_en=Kneel before me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_110_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私が……ミスを？|text_cn=我竟然……失误了？|trans_en=I ... made a mistake?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_110_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=必ず、倍返しに……|text_cn=我会……加倍奉还。|trans_en=I'll make you pay—twice over...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_110_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の魅力がより一層引き立ったわ|text_cn=不错，足以衬托我。|trans_en=My charm shines even brighter.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_110_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら、効率的ね|text_cn=高效的手段。|trans_en=Oh, now that's efficient.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_110_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=その案、採用しましょう|text_cn=很好，就用这版。|trans_en=I'll approve that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_110_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=背中は任せてちょうだい|text_cn=你的背后，交给我了。|trans_en=I'll watch your back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_110_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=リスクヘッジなら任せてちょうだい|text_cn=我会备好风险应急预案。|trans_en=Risk management is my middle name.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_110_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わざわざ時間を作って来てあげたのだから、感謝なさい|text_cn=我可是特意抽空陪你来的，感恩戴德吧。|trans_en=You should be grateful. I made the time to be here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_110_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この私が認めたのだから、それなりの成果を期待しているわ|text_cn=既然得到了我的赏识，你就该回报等价的成果。|trans_en=I've acknowledged you, so I expect results.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_110_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=先月の財務報告？そんなことよりも、いまは目の前の仕事に集中なさい|text_cn=上月的公司财报……算了，先关注眼下的工作吧。|trans_en=Last month's financial report? Forget about that. Focus on the task at hand right now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_110_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=刮目なさい。巡遊者たる私の毅然とした姿に|text_cn=我作为旅人的英姿，你就拭目以待吧。|trans_en=Feast your eyes on the dignified form of a true Trekker.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_110_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=オフィスにいてばかりでは勘が鈍ってしまうし…<br/>うふふ。たまには思い切り体を動かさないとね|text_cn=是该抽空多出门走走了，也不能成天坐办公室里。|trans_en=Being in the office all the time dulls the senses...<br/>Hehe. Sometimes you have to really move your body.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_110_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たとえリスク負ったとしても、それ以上のリターンが見込めるのなら、挑戦する価値がある<br/>その判断を瞬時におこなう能力こそ、管理者に必要な素養なの。よーく覚えておきなさい|text_cn=适当地承担风险，是优秀管理者必备的素养。|trans_en=Even if there is risk, as long as you expect a greater return, it's worth trying.<br/>The ability to instantly make that decision is exactly the quality a supervisor needs. Hehehe, remember that well.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_110_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このブルー・オーシャンの開拓は、必ず成功するでしょう|text_cn=很好，希望我们能顺利开拓这片蓝海。|trans_en=This blue ocean venture is bound to succeed.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_110_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=物品購入は、あなたの方が慣れているでしょう？|text_cn=招标采购……你比我更擅长吧？|trans_en=You're more familiar with buying things, aren't you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_110_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=少し休むわ。あなたもいまのうちに、休んでおきなさい|text_cn=坐吧，与我共度片刻闲暇。|trans_en=I will rest a little. You should also rest now while you can.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_110_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふん……私の時間を無駄にしないでほしいものね|text_cn=哼，不会耽误我的时间吧？|trans_en=Hmph. I do hope this isn't a waste of my time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_110_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一段落したことだし、報告書の作成をよろしく|text_cn=阶段任务完成，待会记得提交报告。|trans_en=Now that's settled, draft the report, will you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_110_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=終わったのね。報告は後でいいわ|text_cn=扫除结束，你来写个纪要吧。|trans_en=We're done? The report can wait.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_110_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまには現場に出てみるのもいいわね|text_cn=偶尔亲力亲为，也不失为一种乐趣。|trans_en=Getting out into the field can be useful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_110_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=当然の結果とはいえ、たまには褒めてくれていいのよ？|text_cn=虽说是理所当然的事，不过夸我一句也无妨哦？|trans_en=An obvious outcome, but you could still say something nice once in a while.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_110_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私に相応しい、見事な指揮だったわ♪|text_cn=真是与我相称的精彩指挥。|trans_en=That was excellent command, worthy of me ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_110_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今回は私の責任ね…|text_cn=开个复盘会议吧……这次是我的问题。|trans_en=This time, it's my responsibility...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_110_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=撤退も戦略のうちよ|text_cn=撤退也是一种计策。|trans_en=A retreat is a strategic choice like any other.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_110_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ようやく私の出番？まあいいわ|text_cn=想起我了？哼，眼光还不错嘛。|trans_en=My turn at last? Well, it's about time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_110_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふ……待ちくたびれたわ|text_cn=我早就跃跃欲试了。|trans_en=Ehehe... I was getting impatient.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_110_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の手腕、とくとご覧なさい|text_cn=让你见识见识我的手段吧。|trans_en=Watch how I handle this.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_110_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょうど気分転換したかったの|text_cn=刚好，我想转换下心情了。|trans_en=I was just looking for a change of mood.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_110_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_110_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これはなにって？もちろんチョコレートに決まっているでしょう？<br/>時間の都合上手作りではないけれど…<br/>フィーリエで一番の有名店のものだから、間違いはないはずよ|text_cn=巧克力，收下吧。<br/>可惜时间有限，来不及亲手为你制作，这盒是我在菲莱最有名的商店挑选的，想必味道不错。|trans_en=What's this, you ask? Of course, it has to be chocolate, right?<br/>It's not homemade due to time constraints, but... It's from the most famous shop in Philae, so it must be good.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_110_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私と一緒に、ゴールドエリアで開催されるクリスマスパーティーに参加したい？<br/>それは…あなたがエスコートしてくれるということかしら？<br/>うふふ、いいわよ。ドレスに着替えて、あなたの迎えを待っているわ|text_cn=你愿意陪我参加今晚在金城区举办的宴会吗？<br/>你的意思是，你十分乐意担任我的护花使者？<br/>很好，我会提前准备好礼服，期待你的到来。|trans_en=You want to go to the Snowish Festival party in the Gold District with me?<br/>Does that mean ... you will escort me?<br/>Hehehe, alright. I'll change into my dress and wait for your pickup.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_110_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう。新たな年の訪れを、新たな気持ちで迎える――<br/>私たちの関係が、末永く続いていくことを願っているわ<br/>これからも、私を失望させることのないよう、しっかり励んでちょうだい|text_cn=新年新气象，希望我们的合作能长长久久。<br/>别让我失望哦，聪明人总该拿出让人惊喜的表现。|trans_en=Happy New Year. Welcome a new year with a new attitude—I am hoping that our relationship will continue for a long time.<br/>Please keep working hard, so as not to disappoint me from here on out.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_110_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうね…今日だけは無礼講ということで、存分に私を祝わせてあげるわ♪<br/>ただし…チャンスは限られていると思って、私のことをよーく考えて答えを出してちょうだいね|text_cn=今天就破例一次，让你尽情为我庆祝吧。<br/>不过机会有限，你可要仔细思考有关我的一切，然后给出令我满意的方案哦。|trans_en=Right... Just for today, let's forget about formalities, and I'll let you celebrate me to the fullest ♪<br/>However, keep in mind the opportunity is limited, so think very carefully about me before giving your answer.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_110_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_110_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたのために特別なプレゼントを用意したわ。受け取ってちょうだい<br/>え？高価なものは受け取れない？うふふ、気にしなくていいのよ？<br/>私たちの関係には、お金では買えない価値があるのだから|text_cn=收下吧，这是我特意为你定制的礼物。<br/>嗯？你说太昂贵了，不好意思收？别在意这种小事，我们之间的关系不能用金钱来衡量。|trans_en=I've prepared a special gift for you. Please accept it.<br/>Huh? You can't accept expensive things? Hehehe, no need to worry. Our relationship has value that cannot be bought with money.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's Day 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc110_Valentine26_day04_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc110_Valentine26_day04_cn.ogg|text_jp=私が、特別な相手にチョコを贈るときの言葉を聞いてみたい？<br/>そんな機会は一度もなかったし、そもそも考えたことすらなかったのだけど…そうね<br/>私の…心を込めた贈りもの…受け取ってもらえるとうれしいわよーく味わって食べてね♡<br/>うふふ♪自分から聞きたいと言っておいて、なにを赤くなっているのかしら？|text_cn=想知道我给特别的人送巧克力时会说什么？<br/>呵呵，还没有过那样的机会，我也从没考虑过这件事……正好。<br/>这是饱含了我所有情意，精挑细选的巧克力。你可务必要好好品尝，仔细感受那层层诱人的温度和余韵。<br/>来，啊——呵呵~你不是说想听吗？怎么反倒脸红了？|trans_en=You want to hear my words when I give chocolate to someone special?<br/>I haven't had the chance even once, and I had not even thought about it... Let's see.<br/>My ... heartfelt gift... I will be happy if you accept it. Savor it well as you eat it.<br/>Hehehe ♪ You said you wanted to hear it yourself, so why are you turning red?}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_111_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあボス、今日も元気に頑張りましょう！|text_cn=<username>，工作还有很多……<br/>我们精神满……满……地干起来吧。|trans_en=Well, Boss! Let's get to it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_111_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…また一日が始まる…そ、それでは今日も、頑張って仕事をしていきましょう…！|text_cn=新的一天！新的美妙工作！|trans_en=Sigh... Another day... W-Well, let's put in some hard work today too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_111_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはようございます。早起きは三文の徳、ですね|text_cn=俗话说，早起的鸟儿有虫吃。|trans_en=Good morning. "Early to bed and early to rise," as they say.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_111_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨタカブレッドで豪華なランチを作ってみたんですが…一緒にいかがですか？|text_cn=<username>，一起吃饭吗？我准备了两份豪华茶色夜莺哦！|trans_en=I made a fancy meal with Tawny Nightingales! Care to join me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_111_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この帳簿に目を通したら…きっと今夜は、不安で眠れなくなりますよ<br/>だって私がそうですから…|text_cn=您睡得着吗？看这账本，我睡不着。|trans_en=Looking through these ledgers... You'll probably be too anxious to sleep tonight.<br/>I mean, at least I am...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_111_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまは帳簿の整理中ですからねあなたを見ていたというのは…ただの気のせいでは？|text_cn=才，才没有看你……<br/>我……我在算上月收支啦。|trans_en=I'm sorting through the ledger right now. So, if you thought I was looking at you... Maybe it's just your imagination?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_111_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=やった、全問正解です！やはり問題を解いているときが、一番リラックスできますねぇ♪|text_cn=嘿嘿，这套题全对了，做题真开心。|trans_en=Yes! I solved all the problems! It's always such a relief when you finally figure a problem out. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_111_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ううっ…これ以上は食べちゃダメなのに…でも、脳が糖分を欲して…|text_cn=呜，不能再吃了。这样下去我会堕落的。<br/>可是……大脑在渴求糖分。|trans_en=Ugh. I shouldn't eat any more. But my brain is craving sugar...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_111_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=お世話になったぶん、きちんとお返しがしたいので…<br/>私にできることがあれば、遠慮せずなんでも言ってくださいね|text_cn=欠了你那么多东西，我已经还不起了。<br/>以后，多使唤使唤我吧。|trans_en=I really want to thank you for all your help, so...<br/>If there's anything at all I can do, please don't hesitate to ask.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_111_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふんふんふ～ん♪今日はいい天気ですねぇ<br/>そうだ、こんな日は日頃がんばっている自分へのご褒美として、問題集でも解こうかな！|text_cn=哼~哼~哼♪<br/>今天天气真好。做套卷子奖励一下自己吧。|trans_en=Hmm-hmm-hmm♪ Isn't this weather just fabulous?<br/>Oh, I know! To treat myself for working so hard every day, I think I'll go solve a quiz book!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_111_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=試験では、たった1点の差が結果を左右しますが…<br/>ひとつのミスが命取りになるのは冒険でも同じです|text_cn=提高一分、超过万人。不论考试还是冒险，都是这样。|trans_en=A single point can mean the difference between passing or failing a test.<br/>As it is in adventure, where a single mistake can mean the difference between life and death.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_111_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この魔法書が便利そう？そうですね、戦闘では鈍器にもなりますし<br/>まあ…修理費はかさみますけど|text_cn=我的魔法书很好用？嗯，我也这么觉得。<br/>抡起来很顺手，就是修理费太贵了。|trans_en=My MagBook looks useful? I think so too.<br/>It could even double as a blunt weapon. Well... Repair costs do add up, though.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_111_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ、今回のセールは…っと♪<br/>えっ！？き、昨日まで！？もうなにもかも終わりですぅ…|text_cn=这次打折的时间是……昨天？！<br/>完了……全完了……我的人生也完蛋了……|trans_en=Hehe, now for this sale—<br/>What?! It ended YESTERDAY!? It's all completely over...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_111_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=失敗を恐れることはありませんよ<br/>何度も失敗してきた私が言うんですから…あ、あはは…間違いありません|text_cn=失败并不可怕，你多失败几次就知道了……<br/>一点都不可怕。|trans_en=There's no need to fear failure.<br/>I say this as someone who's failed countless times... Ah, ahaha... I'm absolutely certain...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_111_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=依頼からの帰宅中、オアシス号の明かりが見えると不思議と疲れが消えていく気がするんです<br/>なのに…ベッドに入って次の日のことを考え始めると…<br/>アハハ、ドッと疲れが押し寄せてくるのはどうしてでしょうね…|text_cn=回家路上，远远看见房车的灯火，疲劳就不翼而飞了。<br/>躺在床上，仔细想想明天的工作，疲劳就失而复得了。|trans_en=On the way home from a commission, the lights of Lucky Oasis always lift my spirits.<br/>But then... Once I'm in bed and start thinking about the next day...<br/>Ahaha... I suddenly get overwhelmed again, and I don't know why.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_111_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うう…もう私、星ノ塔の門番になります…そうすれば、こんなに仕事をしなくていいんですよね？<br/>え…門番は朝から晩まで働き詰めなんですか？そ、そんな…|text_cn=魔王，你把我绑了，丢到星塔里，让我变成不用工作的守卫吧……<br/>什么！守卫一天要工作二十四小时吗？|trans_en=Ugh... I'll just become a gatekeeper at the Monolith. Then I wouldn't have to work so much, right?<br/>Wait, gatekeepers have to work 24/7? O-Oh no...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_111_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=毎日毎日、まるで私の試験結果のようにうまくいかないことばかりで…<br/>それとも…私では到底およばない試験の会場にいるようなものなんでしょうか…？|text_cn=要是生活也像考试那么简单就好了。<br/>不对，生活就是一场考试，只是我走错了考场。|trans_en=Every single day, it's just one thing after another going wrong... exactly like my exam results.<br/>Could it be ... that my life is actually like one big test that I just can't pass...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_111_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お金は貯められるときに貯めておかないと！<br/>ちょ、誰が守銭奴ですか…！おかしな言いかたはやめてください！<br/>私はただ、無一文になって旅を続けられなくなったら困ると思っているだけです…|text_cn=我不是守财奴。<br/>我只是害怕有一天朵拉不够用，我们就没办法一起旅行了……<br/>能存钱的时候，就要多存一些。|trans_en=You have to save money whenever possible!<br/>Hey! Who are you calling a cheapskate? That's not very nice!<br/>It's just that I don't want our travelling days to come to an end because we're broke...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_111_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつか巡遊者を引退したら、一緒に住む家を買いませんか？<br/>いまから少しずつでも貯金をすれば、きっと叶えられるはずです！|text_cn=如果有天我们想安定下来了，就一起在喜欢的地方买个房吧。<br/>从现在开始攒钱的话，一定没问题的。|trans_en=If we ever quit being Trekkers, would you like to buy a house to live in together?<br/>If we start saving up right now, we might just be able to do it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_111_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメという女の子の物語は、以上となります<br/>次は…あなたの物語を教えてもらえませんか？|text_cn=名为鸢尾的书，你已经读过了……现在换我了。|trans_en=And that's the end of the story of the girl named Iris.<br/>So, your turn. Tell me yours, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_111_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=セイナとコハクは、信頼できる仲間…いえ、家族と言っても過言ではありません|text_cn=尘沙和琥珀，是我最好的伙伴……或者说，家人。|trans_en=Noya and Amber are my most trusted companions... I've come to see them as family.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_111_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ストレスが溜まった時ですか？カフェ・猫の箱に行って、ネコと遊んでいますよ|text_cn=焦虑的时候，我喜欢去猫箱咖啡馆坐坐。只要摸摸小猫，心情就能平静下来。|trans_en=When I'm stressed, I go to the Cat Box Café and play with the cats.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_111_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=学校の先生…憧れますよね。収入が安定していますし、夏と冬には休暇が取れそうですから|text_cn=做老师真好啊，有稳定的工资，还有寒暑假。|trans_en=Gosh, I envy teachers.<br/>A regular paycheck and summers and winters off. What's not to love?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_111_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=醤油を少々、塩を適量加えたらしばらく強火にかける…<br/>このレシピ本、少々とか適量とか大雑把すぎませんか？<br/>やはり料理のことなら、ジンリンさんに直接聞いたほうがいいのでは…？|text_cn=酱油少许，盐适量，大火片刻……<br/>少许是多少……适量是……片刻是几分钟……完全看不懂！<br/>唉，还是找璟麟问问吧。|trans_en=Add a little soy sauce and a pinch of salt, then cook over high heat for a while...<br/>Okay, "a little" here, "a pinch" there... This recipe is way too vague.<br/>When it comes to cooking, maybe it's best to ask Jinglin directly?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_111_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=ポーシアさんはいつもやつれているように見えますけど…<br/>この調子で働き続けたら、いつか私もあのようになってしまうのでは…？|text_cn=波西亚看起来好憔悴啊……我以后该不会也变成她那样吧？|trans_en=Portia always looks so drained...<br/>I won't end up like that if I keep working like this, will I?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_111_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんですか？もう打ち合わせの時間ですか？|text_cn=啊？到开会的时间了？|trans_en=What? Is it time for the meeting already?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_111_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなに暇なら、私と一緒に問題集でもやりますか？|text_cn=您要是很闲的话，不如来和我做题。|trans_en=If you're bored, we can do some practice questions together.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_111_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふんふんふ～ん♪|text_cn=♫~|trans_en=Hmm-hmm-hmm! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_111_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたが側にいるだけで、作業効率が上がるような気がして…<br/>もしよければ、もう少しここに…いてくれませんか？|text_cn=有您在身边，我的工作效率提高了很多，您能多陪我待一会吗？|trans_en=With you by my side, I feel so much more efficient. If you don't mind... Could you stay a bit longer?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_111_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして、寝ているんですか？ふふ、仕方がないですね。えっと、ブランケットはどこに…|text_cn=睡着了吗？真是拿你没办法……我去给你拿张毯子吧。|trans_en=Asleep on your desk? I guess you're working just as hard, Boss... Now where's that blanket...}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_111_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初めまして、アヤメといいます<br/>ええと…至らない点もあると思いますが、よろしくお願いします|text_cn=我叫鸢尾，那个……有什么做的不好的地方，请多多指教。|trans_en=Nice to meet you, I'm Iris.<br/>Uh... If there's anything I can improve on, please don't hesitate to tell me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_111_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ただいま戻りました<br/>バイトでもらったお給料は、ギルドの予備金として、私の代わりに管理しておいてください|text_cn=我回来了，<username>。这是打工的收入，请帮我存起来，作为旅团的风险准备金吧。|trans_en=I'm back.<br/>Here's my part-time earnings. Please save it as the guild's emergency fund.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_111_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=勉強の成果がでたような気がします！|text_cn=做完这几套题，大脑变得更清醒了。|trans_en=I feel like my studying is paying off!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_111_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一冊の問題集を繰り返し何度も解いたおかげで、自信がつきました！|text_cn=这些题我总共刷了十八遍，收获良多。|trans_en=I've gone through this quiz book so many times that now I feel pretty confident!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_111_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これを選ぶとは…さすがボス、目のつけどころが違いますね|text_cn=没想到，你的品味和我一样……别致。|trans_en=I'm impressed, Boss. You have exceptional taste.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_111_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一般的には、このような曲が好まれるんでしょうね|text_cn=嗯，大家一定都喜欢这个。|trans_en=This is probably the type of music people generally like.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_111_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このバッグの重さは、すなわちこれまで詰め込んできた知識の重さなんです|text_cn=我的手提包可是很沉的，别小看知识的重量！|trans_en=The weight of this bag is the weight of all the knowledge I've accumulated!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_111_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなにおいしいクッキーの味を覚えさせられてしまったら…<br/>責任をとって、また食べさせてくださいね？約束ですよ？|text_cn=谢谢你给我买的曲奇，很好吃……真是的，要是之后再也吃不到这么好吃的曲奇，我一定会难过的。你要负起责任来啊，约好了。|trans_en=It's you who makes me remember how delicious these cookies taste...<br/>You'll have to take responsibility and feed me more, okay? Promise?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_111_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんだか手間取らせてしまってばかりな気が…<br/>私、本当にみんなの足を引っ張っていませんか？|text_cn=为什么要这么照顾我……是觉得……我拖后腿了吗？|trans_en=I feel like I'm always needing help...<br/>Are you sure I'm not holding everyone back?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_111_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまはお世話になってばかりですが…<br/>いつか私も、あなたを支えられるような一人前の巡遊者になってみせますからね|text_cn=<username>，我们一直在依赖你。但我希望，总有一天，我也能变成一个可靠的人，一个你可以依赖的人……|trans_en=Right now I'm always relying on you...<br/>But someday, I'll support you in return as a fully-fledged Trekker.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_111_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…みんなが寝たら、少しお話しませんか？<br/>空白旅団のことや…私たちの将来のこと…とか|text_cn=等她们都睡了，我想和你聊聊未来。我们的未来，旅团的未来。|trans_en=Um... Once everyone's asleep, would you like to talk a little?<br/>About the New Star Guild ... and our future...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_111_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=r{{=}}a(1-sinθ)…この関数は…は、は、はー…<br/>い、いえ、やっぱりなんでもないです！|text_cn=<username>，r{{=}}a(1-sinθ)，这个函数，我我……我……没事了，嗯，什么事都没有。|trans_en=r{{=}}a(1-sinθ). Boss, about this formula, is it... Uh... Um...<br/>N-Never mind, please forget I said anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_111_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=突然どうしたんですか？いきなりで驚きましたが…ありがとうございます|text_cn=怎么突然……既然是你送的，那就谢谢啦。|trans_en=Hm? What's this about? I'm a little surprised, but... Thank you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_111_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こ、こんなに素晴らしいものを私に…！？ど、どうやってこの恩に報いれば…？|text_cn=诶！这么好的东西……我、我该怎么报答你的大恩大德啊！|trans_en=Wh-What an amazing gift! How can I possibly repay you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_111_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わあ…これ、私のために用意してくれたんですか…！？<br/>素敵です…！鍵のかかる場所に置いて、大切に保管しますね！|text_cn=竟然为了我这么费心……我……我好高兴……谢谢你！我会放进保险柜里好好保存的！|trans_en=Wow... You got this for me?<br/>It's so wonderful! I'll keep it safe with lock and treasure it forever!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_111_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい|text_cn=嗯！|trans_en=Yes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_111_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=違います|text_cn=不对吧……|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_111_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=おかしいですね…|text_cn=好奇怪。|trans_en=That's strange...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_111_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Eh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_111_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=私のせいです…|text_cn=是我的错……|trans_en=It's my fault...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_111_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=まさか――|text_cn=竟然——|trans_en=No way...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_111_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=あんまりです|text_cn=太过分了。|trans_en=How could you...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_111_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=よかったです|text_cn=真好。|trans_en=That's nice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_111_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ|text_cn=唉。|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_111_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう終わりですぅ～！！|text_cn=来不及了来不及了……|trans_en=It's all done for—!!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_111_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう少し頑張りましょうか|text_cn=再努力一下。|trans_en=Shall we try a little more?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_111_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=失敗しました…|text_cn=失败了。|trans_en=I failed...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_111_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=諦めたくないんです|text_cn=我不会放弃的。|trans_en=I don't want to give up.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_111_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_111_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私に任せてください|text_cn=交给我吧。|trans_en=You can count on me.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_111_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=気温、気圧、共に調整完了。コールドウェーブ展開！|text_cn=气压、温度调控完毕。在寒潮中冻成坚冰吧。|trans_en=Temperature check, pressure check. Let the cold wave descend!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_111_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが勉強の成果です！コールドウェーブ！|text_cn=抱歉，这是必要的措施……极地涡旋！|trans_en=The fruit of all my study! Cold wave!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_111_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あうぅ…知恵熱が…|text_cn=计算，到极限了……|trans_en=Ahh... My brain burns...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_111_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=体力の…限界ですぅ…|text_cn=可以……不用再努力了……|trans_en=I'm ... at my limit...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_111_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍族には『学問に終わりはない』という言葉が伝わっているそうですよ|text_cn=龙裔有句话——学海无涯。|trans_en=The Loongs said it best—"There is no end to learning."}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_111_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=なるほど、完ぺきに理解しました|text_cn=原来如此，我完全理解了。|trans_en=Got it. I fully understand!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_111_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=これでまた、勝率があがりましたね|text_cn=胜算又多了一分。|trans_en=This way, our win rate has gone up again.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_111_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=バタークッキーがあれば、申し分ないんですが…|text_cn=如果有一块黄油曲奇就更好了。|trans_en=This would be perfect with a butter cookie.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_111_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=足手まといにならないよう、精いっぱいがんばります！|text_cn=我、我会跟上大家的。|trans_en=I'll give it my absolute best not to slow anyone down!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_111_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=残りの借金は…はぁ、相変わらずお金が足りません…|text_cn=还有好多的债要还，钱永远不够用。|trans_en=With all these debts... Sigh... Short on money as usual...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_111_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしよう、食費と装備の整備費用が資金を圧迫して…<br/>ハッ――！いけないいけない。いまはそんなことを考えている場合ではありません…|text_cn=这个月的伙食费是……维修开支是……唔，现在不是算这些的时候……|trans_en=What am I gonna do... The cost of food and equipment maintenance are really cutting into our budget...<br/>Ah—! No, no. Now is not the time to be worrying about that...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_111_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…疲れました…冷たいものでも飲みながらゆっくりしたい気分です|text_cn=好想坐下来，喝杯冷饮休息一下啊……|trans_en=Phew... I'm tired... I wish I could just sit and relax with something cold and fizzy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_111_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=今回の依頼、たくさん報酬がもらえるといいですね！|text_cn=这次工作，能入账多少呢？|trans_en=I hope the pay for our next commission is good!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_111_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=塔の内部には壮観な景色が広がっていて…<br/>これを見られるのは、巡遊者の特権ですね|text_cn=星塔的内部好壮观，这是只有旅人才能看到的景象吧。|trans_en=The inside of a Monolith is as remarkable as ever.<br/>A unique perk for Trekkers, I suppose.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_111_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私たちだけで対処できない場合…素直に撤退すべきでしょうか？|text_cn=万一应付不了，我们就跑？|trans_en=If this is too much for us alone, maybe we should just retreat?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_111_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは慎重に行かないと…|text_cn=小心驶得万年船……|trans_en=You can never be too careful...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_111_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=予算はきちんと守ってくださいね|text_cn=不要超出预算哦。|trans_en=Please stay within budget.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_111_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=休憩するなら、私の枕をどうぞ|text_cn=我把枕头带来了！请用！|trans_en=If you're going to rest, you can use my pillow.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_111_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=利益とリスクは、比例するのが一般的です|text_cn=风险总和收益并存。|trans_en=Risk to reward should usually be about equal.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_111_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=忘れ物がないか、確認しましょう|text_cn=要不……我们再检查检查？|trans_en=Let's make sure we haven't left anything behind.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_111_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=見落としはありませんか？|text_cn=再确认一遍，没有东西落下吧？|trans_en=Nothing's been overlooked, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_111_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=心相石の魔力、使い切らずにすみましたね|text_cn=心相石状况稳定，继续前进吧。|trans_en=We did it without using up the Soul Stone's power.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_111_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私たち、勝てたんですね…！|text_cn=心想事成了吗？|trans_en=We actually won, didn't we?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_111_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この結果も予想していたんですか？|text_cn=这次胜利，也在你的计划之中吗？|trans_en=Was our victory a part of your plan, too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_111_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっぱり私は…巡遊者に向いていないんでしょうか…|text_cn=我是不是……不适合做旅人啊。|trans_en=Am I just ... not Trekker material?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_111_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=大丈夫です、失敗には慣れていますから…|text_cn=……没关系，我已经习惯了。|trans_en=It's fine. I'm used to failing...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_111_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さ、最善を尽くします|text_cn=我会努力的。|trans_en=I'll give it my all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_111_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=転ばないように、足元に気をつけて…と|text_cn=不要摔倒，不要摔倒。|trans_en=Watch your step. Don't trip...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_111_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=サポートは任せてください|text_cn=后勤工作就交给我吧。|trans_en=I'll help out however I can.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_111_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=準備はしっかりと…|text_cn=我会认真准备的。|trans_en=I'll be fully prepared.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_111_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_111_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっと、手作りチョコに挑戦してみたんです<br/>見た目も味も、お店のものにはおよばないかもしれませんが…食べてもらえると嬉しいです！|text_cn=魔王，这是我亲手做的巧克力。虽然它们没有商店里卖的那么高档……但还是希望你能喜欢……！|trans_en=Urm... So I tried making chocolates. <br/>They might not look as good as the ones from a shop, or even taste as good... but I hope you eat them all anyway!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_111_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マフラーを編んでみました。ちょっと歪んでいますが…<br/>ちゃんと試したので、普段使いには支障ありません<br/>あ、も、もし気に入らなかったらテーブルクロスにしてもいいですからね…！|text_cn=这个……保暖围巾！虽然织错了二十七处，但经过实测，保暖效果完全没问题！要、要是不喜欢的话，拿去当桌布也可以……|trans_en=I knitted a scarf. It's a little wonky, I admit...<br/>But I tried it on and it does sort of keep your neck warm.<br/>Er... If you really don't like it, you can always use it as a tea cozy or something...}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_111_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとうございます<br/>今年も一年、みんな仲良く、楽しく幸せに過ごせますように|text_cn=新的一年，我的愿望是我们的旅团越来越好，大家都能幸福快乐。|trans_en=Happy New Year.<br/>I'm looking forward to spend a delightful year together with everyone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_111_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい？誕生日プレゼント？<br/>…えええ～～っ！？ここにあるクッキー、本当に好きなだけ食べてもいいんですかぁ！？<br/>あぁ♪私のために、ここまでしてもらえるなんて…！<br/>では…誕生日なんて年に一度のことですし、今日だけは、甘えちゃいますね♪|text_cn=给我的生日礼物是不限量曲奇畅吃？！真的可以吗……不会太浪费吗……<br/>呜……这种奢侈感.……一年也只有这么一次了……|trans_en=Huh? A birthday present?<br/>... Whaaaaat!? The cookies here—can I really eat as many as I want!?<br/>Ahh♪ That you'd go to such lengths just for me...!<br/>Well then... Since birthdays only come once a year, I'll indulge myself just for today♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_111_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_111_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、お誕生日おめでとうございます！<br/>いつもそばで支えてくれている感謝の気持ちも込めて、今日は盛大にお祝いしますね！<br/>ドリンクに氷はいりますか？|text_cn=生日快乐，<username>！谢谢你一直以来的陪伴和支持，今天让我来为你庆祝吧！汽水要加冰吗？|trans_en=Boss, happy birthday!<br/>With gratitude for always supporting me, I'm throwing you a big celebration today!<br/>Would you like ice in your drink?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Chinese New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc111_ChineseNewYear26_day05_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc111_ChineseNewYear26_day05_cn.ogg|text_jp=去年使った費用を計算したら、今年の活動予算にはだいぶ余裕がありそうなんです<br/>なので春節はゆっくり休んで、新しい一年もみんなで一緒にがんばりましょうね！|text_cn=不用担心，今年的预算还有结余。去年的账目我都算清楚了！<br/><nobr>趁着新春，大家好好休息一下……</nobr>年后可要继续努力哦~|trans_en=After calculating last year's expenses, it looks like we have a lot of room in this year's activity budget.<br/>Let's rest well during the Springseek Festival and make the new year good together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc111_FirstAnniversary_day01_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc111_FirstAnniversary_day01_cn.ogg|text_jp=楽しい時間はあっという間に過ぎていくと言いますが…<br/>ボスと出会ってから、気づけばもう一年が経っていたんですね<br/>あの日の出来事は、まるで昨日のことのように鮮明に思い出せるのに、なんだか不思議な感じです<br/>これからも私たちと一緒に、たくさんの思い出を作っていきましょうね！|text_cn=快乐的时光总是过得飞快……<br/>回过神来，和魔王已经一起度过一年了。<br/>那一天的事，就好像昨天才发生一样鲜明地在脑海里，真是不可思议呢。<br/>今后也请继续和我们一起创造更多的回忆吧。|trans_en=They say time flies when you're having fun...<br/>I can't believe it has been one year since I first met you, Boss.<br/>What happened that day... Even though I remember it like it was yesterday, it still feels kind of surreal.<br/>Let's continue to create wonderful memories together in the future!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Half Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc111_HalfAnniversary_day01_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc111_HalfAnniversary_day01_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスと出会ってからの半年間、いろいろなことがありましたね<br/>でもまさか、神器を取りに行ったはずが、祈願箱から人が出てくるなんて想像もしていなくて…<br/>え？ちょ…！？ですからアレは、人なのか神器なのかをたしかめるため、体を確認しただけで…！|text_cn=一晃眼都认识半年了，感谢魔王这半年来对我们的照顾。<br/>真没想到，原本只是想去找神器，打开许愿箱里面竟然躺着一个人……<br/>诶？不不不是啊！所以说当时……<br/>把你身体从里到外检查一遍，真的只是为了确认箱子里的到底是人还是神器！|trans_en=Various things have happened over the past six months since I met you, Boss.<br/>I never imagined that we'd go looking for Artifacts, only to dig a person out of the Wishing Box...<br/>Huh? Wait...! I mean, I only checked your body to see whether you were an Artifact or a real person!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_112_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=天気もいいし、ドライブでもどう？さあさあ、レッツゴー！|text_cn=想不想出去兜风？不如我们现在就出发！|trans_en=The weather's great! How about a drive? Come on, let's go cruisin'!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_112_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミドリちゃんの心臓――もといエンジンの力強～い鼓動に耳を傾けてみて？|text_cn=小绿有着健康强劲的心脏呢，听，是不是感受到了强大的生命力。|trans_en=Hey, get an earful of Loxy's engine—that's a seriously powerful pulse!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_112_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おっはよー！今日も一日、パチパチメテオを飲んで頑張ろー<br/>ほら、魔王さんもぐいっと！|text_cn=早上好！美好的一天从能量沛沛开始！<br/><username>，你也要来一罐吗？|trans_en=G'morning! Let's tackle today with a Pep Pep Juice! <br/>C'mon—bottoms up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_112_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ランチタイムだー！もうお腹ペッコペコだよ～<br/>街にいれば美味しいものが食べれるけど、荒野だとろくなものがないんだよね|text_cn=中午啦，好饿好饿！在城里还能吃点好的，不像在野外，只能随便对付一口。|trans_en=Lunchtime, and I'm starving! Options are great in town ... and really crappy out in the wilds.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_112_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんばんは。用がないなら、今日は早めに休んだ方がいいよ<br/>元気をたくわえて、明日の冒険に備えないとね！|text_cn=晚上好。如果没什么事情的话，可以早点休息，明天还要继续冒险呢！|trans_en=Evening. If there's nothing urgent, I suggest you get some rest now.<br/>Gotta be ready for tomorrow's big adventures!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_112_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=パチパチメテオ、最ッ高～♪魔王さんも一本どう？|text_cn=能量沛沛真的很好喝哦，你也要来一罐吗？|trans_en=Pep Pep Juice is the best! ♪ Want one?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_112_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=くぅ～っ！パチパチメテオが染みる～♪|text_cn=哈，爽！人活着就是为了能量沛沛！|trans_en=Chugging Pep Pep Juice is what life's all about. Let's go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_112_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=タイヤよーし、動力システムよーし、燃料補充よーし、ブラウディよーし！<br/>オッケー、それじゃあしゅっぱ～つ！|text_cn=轮胎正常，传动正常，充能正常，布兰迪正常……嗯，我们出发吧！|trans_en=Tires, power system, fuel, check! Brandie, check! All set—let's head out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_112_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=車の修理を誰に教わったかって？独学だよ。旅にトラブルはつきものだからねー<br/>そうだなぁ、巡遊者専用の魔法…みたいな？|text_cn=修车的手艺？我自己钻研出来的。<br/>作为旅人，出门在外就只能自己动手，这是只属于旅人的魔法哦~|trans_en=Who taught me how to fix cars? Myself! Things happen on the road, ya know?<br/>I guess you could call it Trekker magic ... or something!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_112_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この子はクマのブラウディ！大事な人からもらったぬいぐるみで…<br/>ええっと…それが誰なのかは思い出せないけど…とにかく、大事な人にもらったの！|text_cn=这只玩偶熊叫布兰迪，是……非常重要的人送给我的！<br/>虽然想不起来到底是谁……总之肯定是非常重要的人！|trans_en=This little one is Brandie the bear! <br/>Someone gave me this plushie, but strangely, I can't remember who. All I know is that it was someone special!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_112_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=不思議だよねー？そりゃあ生きていくにはお金が必要だし<br/>お金を稼ぐには仕事をしなきゃだけどさ<br/>どうしてみんな命を削ってまで仕事してるんだろう？|text_cn=想不通啊，如果工作是为了活命，那为什么还要为工作卖命？|trans_en=I don't get it. Okay, so you need money to live...<br/>... and ya gotta work to make money.<br/>But why's everyone always working themselves to death?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_112_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は魔王さんが買い出しに行く日？<br/>なら私、荷物持ちするよ！で、そのついでに一緒に街を見て回るの！どう！？|text_cn=今天是不是轮到<username>去采购？让我陪你一起吧，我力气很大的！<br/>路上还可以顺路逛逛，看看风景。|trans_en=Is today your shopping day?<br/>I can carry your bags as long as we can look around the town a little! Whaddaya think?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_112_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=荒野での食事は、贅沢言ってられないからね<br/>私の場合、パサパサのヨタカブレッドでもペロッと食べちゃうよ！|text_cn=在荒野，当然是有什么吃什么。<br/>哪怕是已经风干的茶色夜莺，我也能一口吃掉！|trans_en=You can't be picky about food in the wilds.<br/>I've even gobbled down dry, crumbly Tawny Nightingale!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_112_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつか絶対に星狩りをするんだ！みんなはただの伝説って言うけど<br/>そうじゃないって、私のカンが言ってるから！それに星狩りって響きがカッコいいし♪|text_cn=你问我为什么想摘星？<br/>嗯……虽然别人都觉得只是个传说，但直觉告诉我那些都是真的！<br/>再说，“摘星”这个词，听起来很帅吧。|trans_en=I'll definitely go star plucking one day!<br/>Everyone says it's just a myth, but my gut says it's real. <br/>Plus, doesn't "star plucking" just sound so cool?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_112_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の体って、他の人と比べてもケガの治りが早いんだよねー<br/>まえに大ケガしたところも…ココとココ…あとこっちも。ね、ぜんぜんわかんないでしょ？<br/>って、なんで目そらしてるの？|text_cn=我恢复能力超强的！有次受了好重的伤，但现在已经完全没事啦~<br/>在这，在这，还有这，连疤痕都没有哦。欸？你不看看吗？|trans_en=I heal really fast compared to most people.<br/>I've had a couple of major injuries before, like here, here ... and here! You can't even tell, right?<br/>Wait, why are you looking away?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_112_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今回の依頼は大成功だったね♪<br/>報酬もたっぷりもらえたし、なにをプレゼントしたら、みんなよろこんでくれるかなぁ？<br/>ちなみに魔王さんは…え？私の手作りのものがほしい？<br/>そういうことなら…わかった、楽しみにしててね♪|text_cn=这次委托非常顺利，赚了一大笔呢！我有好多想要送给大家的礼物！<br/>琥珀的，鸢尾的，薇洛的，大家的都想好了……魔王大人呢，你喜欢什么呀？<br/>只要是我亲手做的都可以？嗯嗯，我记下了！|trans_en=We really nailed that commission, huh? ♪<br/>I wonder what I should get for everyone with the pay...<br/>Oh, and what about you... Huh? You want something handmade?<br/>Well, I think I can accommodate that! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_112_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにを作ってるのかって？ふっふっふ、木彫りのブラウディだよ。うまいもんでしょ？<br/>でも完成はまだまだ先かなぁ…魔王さんへのプレゼントは、丁寧にしあげたいから|text_cn=你看，这是我拿树根雕的布兰迪，很像吧~不过，这个还不能送给你……<br/>可以再等等吗？给你的礼物，我想做得更好一些。|trans_en=What am I making? Hehehe... It's a Braude carved out of driftwood! Pretty good, right?<br/>But I'm not quite done yet... It's going to be for you, so I wanna make it extra nice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_112_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんを助手席に乗せてると、何時間運転しててもちっとも退屈しないんだー♪|text_cn=开车的时候，只要身边坐着<username>，不管开多久我都不会犯困！|trans_en=Having you ride shotgun makes even long drives fun! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_112_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミドリちゃんも私たちの大切な仲間なんだから<br/>この先10年、20年…ううん、ずーっと一緒に旅をするためにもちゃんとメンテしないとね♪|text_cn=小绿也是我们的伙伴，要好好保养才行。<br/>这样，我们就可以一起旅行十、二十……五十年！|trans_en=Loxy is an important part of the team.<br/>To keep traveling together for 10 years, 20 ... and forever, I've gotta keep her well-maintained!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_112_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=荒野で過ごしてるとさ、毎日の食事が少しでもおいしくなるようにって考えるから<br/>自然と料理の腕もあがってくんだよねー。ちなみに魔王さんは、私の料理…どれが好き？<br/>言ってくれたら、いつでも作ってあげるよ？|text_cn=我的厨艺都是在荒野上磨练出来的。<br/>很多时候没法选定食材，只能找到什么就用什么，但还是要尽量做得好吃点！<br/>喜欢吃我做的饭？嘿嘿，那我可以一直做给你吃哦，做多少顿都行！|trans_en=Living in the Wilds, you start thinking about how to add a little more fun to everyday cooking.<br/>So naturally, your cooking skills improve. By the way, which of my dishes do you like best?<br/>If you tell me, I'll make it for you anytime!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_112_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメの好きなところ？そうだなぁ…面倒見がよくて、お姉ちゃんみたいなとこかなー<br/>コハクの好きなところは…髪がさらさらで、撫で心地がいいところだねー|text_cn=你问鸢尾的优点？很爱操心，像妈妈一样！<br/>至于琥珀么，头发摸起来很舒服！|trans_en=My favorite thing about Iris? She's so caring, kind of like a big sister!<br/>My favorite thing about Amber? She's got silky smooth hair that's super fun to touch!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_112_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミネルバのスケボーと比べたら、そりゃあミドリちゃんは小回りがきかないけど…<br/>でもみんなを乗せていろんな場所に連れてってくれるから<br/>私はミドリちゃんが負けてるとは思ってないよ♪|text_cn=密涅瓦的滑板确实很好啦，相比之下小绿在城里就没那么方便。<br/>可是她载着我们去过超多地方！也很棒对不对！|trans_en=Loxy isn't as agile as Minova's skateboarding...<br/>But she's always taking everyone around to all sorts of places.<br/>So I feel like Loxy is just as amazing! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_112_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ブロッチを敵に回すくらいなら、星骸100体と戦う方がよっぽどマシだね<br/>だってあの子のところに買い出しに行く度、お金がガラクタに変わって…<br/>あれって絶対ヤバい魔法だよ！|text_cn=呜呜……我宁愿面对一百只星骸也不想和布洛可打交道……<br/>她掌握着可怕的魔法，只要每次去她那进货，钱就会变成一堆没用的东西！|trans_en=I'd rather fight 100 Stellaroids than get on the bad side of Bloc. <br/>Every time I shop there, my money turns into junk!<br/>Totally sketchy magic!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_112_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ティリアが乗ってるあれ…ヒッポグリフ号！カッコいいよね～！<br/>私も乗ってみたいなぁ|text_cn=缇莉娅的那辆……对，骏鹰号，它好帅噢！我也想要体验一把！|trans_en=Tilia's on the Lapis Eagle! So cool!<br/>I wanna ride it too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_112_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャロのぬいぐるみってかわいいんだけど…<br/>あの生気を感じさせない目が不気味なんだよね…<br/>え、ホタルの部屋にはいっぱいあるの？近づかないようにしよっと…|text_cn=夏洛克玩偶是很可爱，但老给我种不太舒服的感觉……<br/>诶？火垂有一屋子？……听上去有些恐怖。|trans_en=Sherlock's plushies are cute but also kinda creepy. What's that?<br/>Firefly's room is full of them? Eek...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_112_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=悩んでる時は、よく星ノ塔を眺めてるんだ<br/>そうしたら嫌なことは全部、吹き飛んじゃうんだよね|text_cn=烦恼的时候，我会看着星塔发呆，这样那些麻烦的想法就能短暂消失掉！|trans_en=When I'm feeling down, I look up at the Monolith. It clears my mind completely.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_112_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまごペットはね、１タップでレベルが１上がるんだよ<br/>で、レベル999999999になったら、指定の塔で豪華賞品がもらえるんだって！<br/>指定の塔がどこなのかは分からないけど…絶対見つけてやるんだから！|text_cn=每点一次，这只宠物蛋就能升一级，等升到999999999级的时候，就能去指定的星塔兑换大奖！<br/>指定的星塔在哪？我会找到的！|trans_en=Tamago Pets level up with just one tap! When they hit level 999999999, you get amazing prizes at a special Monolith. <br/>No clue where it is, but I'll find it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_112_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんがぼーっとしてるなら、私も一緒にぼーっとしよっ|text_cn=<username>在发呆吗？好巧，我也在发呆，那就一起发呆吧。|trans_en=You spacing out? Then I'll zone out with you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_112_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ、タップしないの？なにをって…もちろんたまごペットだけど？|text_cn=不点一下吗？我是说宠物蛋啦。|trans_en=Wait, you're not tapping? Uh, you know... For your Tamago Pet, of course.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_112_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ、寝ちゃったかな？毎日仕事お疲れ様。私がずっと側にいるから、安心して眠ってね|text_cn=睡着了吗？每天都在工作真是辛苦啦，睡吧睡吧，我一直在的哦。|trans_en=Hehe, did you fall asleep? Well, you've been at it pretty hard. I'll stay by your side, so rest easy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_112_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ見ぬ星ノ塔を目指して出発しんこーう！ほらほら、魔王さんも早く来て！|text_cn=我们走吧，魔王大人，有很多很多星塔在等着我们！|trans_en=Let's aim for a Monolith we've never seen before! Come on, Boss, time to move out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_112_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者の間ではね、一度目の出会いは縁、二度目の出会いは運命って言われてるんだ<br/>え？こんな話は私らしくない？|text_cn=对旅人来说，相逢即是有缘，再遇便是命运……<br/>……诶？不像我说的话吗？|trans_en=Among the Trekkers, they say the first meeting is fate, and the second is destiny.<br/>Huh? That's not like something I'd say?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_112_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔を登るだけじゃなくて、こういう修行も大事だよね！|text_cn=除了攀登星塔外，这种修炼也是必要的！|trans_en=It's not just about climbing Monoliths—this kind of training is important, too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_112_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=パチパチメテオを飲んだ時みたいに、パワー全開だよ！|text_cn=现在我精力充沛！就像喝了能量沛沛！|trans_en=Make like guzzling Pep Pep Juice, and go full power ahead!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_112_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=へえ、こんなこともあったんだ…って、あれれ？私ってこんな無茶してたの？|text_cn=好怀念的感觉……原来还发生过这样的事啊……欸？我有这么乱来吗？|trans_en=Wow, so that's what happened...? Whoa, was I really that reckless?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_112_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この曲はドライブ用にしよーっと！|text_cn=这个音乐很适合开车时听呢！|trans_en=This one's going in the car playlist!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_112_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これからも、みんなで一緒に旅しようね！|text_cn=接下来的旅程，大家还要继续在一起！|trans_en=Let's keep traveling together forever!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_112_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミドリちゃんの修理が終わったら一緒に星ノ塔を眺めにいかない？|text_cn=等小绿修好之后，我可以带<username>去个很适合观赏星塔的地方哦。<br/>就我们两个人。|trans_en=Once Loxy's fixed, let's go see a Monolith together, shall we?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_112_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんと出会った日から、毎日が楽しいんだ<br/>もちろんその前も楽しかったけど、ちょっと種類が違うというか…|text_cn=自从遇到你的那一刻开始，我每天都很开心。之前也很开心，但开心和开心是不一样的。|trans_en=Ever since I met you, every day's been a total adventure. <br/>I mean, things were fun before, too—but now they're on a whole new level of fun...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_112_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星狩りをしたら、願いが一つ叶えられるんだよ<br/>私の願いは…うーん、ロスレコになっちゃったかな<br/>ならこうしよう！魔王さんが私の願いを決めて、私が魔王さんの願いを決めるの！|text_cn=摘星后可以实现一个愿望。我的愿望吗？<br/>我只想摘星，愿望什么的可能丢到哪个秘纹圆盘里了吧。<br/>这样好了，你送我一个愿望，我也送你一个！|trans_en=Star plucking grants one wish. <br/>My wish is ... hmm, I guess it turned into a Disc? <br/>Hey, let's do this—you pick my wish, and I'll pick yours!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_112_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私のロスレコが見つからなかったら？<br/>平気だよ。だってこの先、ロスレコが100枚あっても収まりきらないくらい<br/>たくさんの思い出を作っちゃえばいいんだからね♪|text_cn=就算找不到我的秘纹圆盘也没关系。等到很多年以后，我们的回忆一定会多到用几百张圆盘都装不下！|trans_en=What if we can't find my Runic Disc?<br/>No problem! Because even if I have a hundred Discs, my memories won't fit in!<br/>That's how many memories I'll make!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_112_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつか…もし離れ離れになる日が来たとしても…<br/>私はずっとずーっと、魔王さんのこと忘れないからね！|text_cn=我好不容易才把你从星塔里带出来，如果哪天你要回去的话，我、我一定会想你的……<br/>一直一直想着，不会忘记的那种。|trans_en=If the day comes that we ever have to part...<br/>I'll keep thinking of you. Always and forever. I'll never forget you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_112_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんがくれるなら、どんなものでも嬉しいよ！|text_cn=不管送的是什么，我都很开心！|trans_en=I'm happy with anything you give me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_112_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そう、これ！これが好きなんだよ！<br/>わざわざ用意してくれて、ありがとう！すっごく嬉しい！|text_cn=我喜欢这个！是特意送给我的？太好了，谢谢！谢谢！|trans_en=Yes! I love this! Thanks for going out of your way—it makes me so happy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_112_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わーお、さっすが魔王さん！私をよろこばせる天才だね！|text_cn=哇——魔王，你就是世界上对我最最最好的人！|trans_en=Wow, I'm impressed! You really know how to make me happy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_112_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=よし！|text_cn=好！|trans_en=Got it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_112_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=だめ！|text_cn=不可以！|trans_en=Nope!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_112_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっ？|text_cn=诶？这样吗？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_112_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=変だなぁ…|text_cn=好奇怪啊。|trans_en=That's strange...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_112_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…|text_cn=呜……|trans_en=Ugh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_112_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=我慢できないっ！|text_cn=忍不了了！|trans_en=I can't take it anymore!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_112_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=…っ！|text_cn=……|trans_en=What!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_112_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっへへ～|text_cn=好耶！|trans_en=Ehehe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_112_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁああ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Ughhh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_112_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=悩むのは後、後！とりあえず何か別のことしよう！|text_cn=别苦恼啦，先做点什么吧。|trans_en=No time to think—let's do something else!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_112_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=出発しんこーう！|text_cn=出发！|trans_en=Off we go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_112_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私もやりたーい！|text_cn=快让我试试！|trans_en=Count me in!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_112_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=待っててね星ノ塔、今行くから！|text_cn=星塔在哪，我来了！|trans_en=Wait for me, Monolith—I'm coming!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_112_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_112_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=やりぃ、大成功♪|text_cn=这不是挺顺利的嘛！|trans_en=Yay, a huge success! ♪}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_112_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=覚悟して！これは――痛いよ！|text_cn=看好了，这招——可是很痛的！|trans_en=Get ready to say ouch!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_112_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=星狩りを邪魔するなら――手加減しないよ！|text_cn=阻碍摘星的敌人，我绝不心软！|trans_en=If you're trying to stop me from star plucking, you are in BIG trouble!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_112_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うきゅう…もう無理ぃ…|text_cn=怎么，使不上力……|trans_en=Yeee... I can't...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_112_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=星狩りできてないのにぃ…|text_cn=我还没……摘星……|trans_en=I didn't get to pluck a star...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_112_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=オッケー。この技――完全に理解したよ！|text_cn=这个招式……我完全理解了！|trans_en=Okay, got it! I've mastered this move!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_112_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力、使いこなしてみせる！|text_cn=我会好好使用这份力量的！|trans_en=I'll put this power to good use!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_112_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=う～ん♪いい気分！|text_cn=呼~神清气爽！|trans_en=Ooh... ♪ That feels good!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_112_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私に任せとけば、オールオッケー！|text_cn=有我在，别担心！|trans_en=Leave it to me—everything will be A-OK!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_112_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなで星狩りに、しゅっぱーつ！|text_cn=让我们一起摘星吧~|trans_en=Let's all go star plucking together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_112_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=糖質ゼロ！食物繊維たっぷり！<br/>パチパチメテオのピーチソーダを飲めば、星ノ塔でも最上階までひとっ飛び！|text_cn=只要来罐无糖纤维多能量沛沛桃味苏打，一口气爬十层都不费劲！|trans_en=Sugar free! Packed with fiber! One sip of peach Pep Pep Juice and you'll rocket to the top of the Monolith!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_112_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこに星骸が隠れてても、巡遊者の勘でぜーんぶ見つけちゃうよー！|text_cn=我能感觉到星骸的气息。他们在暗中蠢蠢欲动，但骗不到经验丰富的旅人。|trans_en=Stellaroids can hide, but us Trekkers will always flush them out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_112_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=昔は星ノ塔に星骸がいなかったから、みんな自由に出入りして願い事ができたんだって<br/>いいなぁ～…|text_cn=听说在很久以前，星塔里是没有星骸的。<br/>大家都能随意出入，许下愿望……真好啊。|trans_en=Back in the day, Monoliths didn't have any Stellaroids in them, so people could come and make wishes whenever. <br/>Musta been nice...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_112_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=星骸ってなんで神器を守ってるんだろう？<br/>どうせ使わないんだし、守る意味なんてなくない？|text_cn=星骸为什么要阻止我们拿神器呢？他们又用不上，放在那也是浪费。|trans_en=I don't get why Stellaroids guard Artifacts.<br/>They can't even use them, right? How does it make any sense?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_112_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=食材が手に入ったら、みんなどんな料理が食べたい？私がなんでも作ってあげるよ♪|text_cn=等下能不能找到什么食材呢？如果有的话，我就来做顿大餐吧~大家有什么想吃的呀？|trans_en=Once we get the ingredients, what do you all wanna eat? I'll make anything for you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_112_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=危険な場所ほど、冒険のし甲斐があるよね～♪|text_cn=越危险的地方就越有冒险的价值！|trans_en=The more dangerous the place, the more exciting the adventure, right? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_112_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ノヴァにある全部の塔に登れば、いつかは星狩りができるよね！|text_cn=只要爬遍诺瓦所有星塔，就一定能成功摘星。|trans_en=If I climb all the Monoliths in Nova, I'll be able to pluck a star for sure!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_112_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私はソーダにしよっかなー。魔王さんは？|text_cn=我想买瓶汽水，你呢？|trans_en=Think I'll have soda. What about you, Boss?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_112_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=無理は禁物！ほらほら、今のうちに休んで休んで！|text_cn=是时候休息一下啦！可不要硬撑喔。|trans_en=Don't push yourself too hard! C'mon, take a break while you can!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_112_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ、誰かいるよ？なにかな、なにかなぁ♪|text_cn=感觉来了！会发生什么有意思的事情呢~？|trans_en=Oh, is anyone there? Ooh, what could it be? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_112_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=楽勝、楽勝♪|text_cn=小菜一碟~|trans_en=As easy as chugging Pep Pep Juice! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_112_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いっちょあがり♪|text_cn=搞定！|trans_en=And ... done! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_112_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=さーて、お次の目的地は～っと？|text_cn=要往哪走来着？|trans_en=Now then, where to next?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_112_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=準備運動には丁度いいかな――って、一度言ってみたかったんだよね！|text_cn=啊，我才刚热完身，怎么就结束了……嘿嘿，这样说是不是有点帅？|trans_en=This'll do for a warm-up! ... Haha, I always wanted to say that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_112_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=また一歩、星狩りに近づいたね！|text_cn=摘星就是要这样坚实地走出每一步！|trans_en=One step closer to star plucking!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_112_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=次こそミスしないように…もう一回！|text_cn=一定是哪里没做好，再来一次吧！|trans_en=Let's try again—but no mistakes this time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_112_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=星狩りを叶えるためには、失敗だって大事な道だよ！|text_cn=偶尔的失败，也是摘星的必经之路呢。|trans_en=Failure is a stepping stone to making star plucking a reality!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_112_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=任された！|text_cn=包在我身上！|trans_en=Got it covered!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_112_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=りょーかいっ！|text_cn=嗯！|trans_en=Roger dodger!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_112_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私がまるっと解決してあげる！|text_cn=交给我吧，无论什么都可以解决！|trans_en=I'll take care of everything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_112_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=出発だー！みんな、気合い入れて！|text_cn=打起精神，做好准备哦！|trans_en=Let's go, everyone! Light a rocket under it!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_112_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_112_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん魔王さん、チョコ食べない？私の自信作！<br/>なんとゼリーにしたパチパチメテオを、中に入れてみたんだー♪<br/>ほらほら、早く食べてみて！…どう？おいしいでしょ！？|text_cn=魔王大人，这是我准备的巧克力。嗯，当然是我亲手做的，我还特地往里面加了些冻冻胶。<br/>这可是我的独家配方，保证健康又美味！你快尝尝。嘿嘿，看你的表情，味道不错吧？|trans_en=Hey, Boss, you want try some chocolates? <br/>Made 'em myself, and they are TOTALLY fab! I even used jellied Pep Pep Juice as a filling! ♪ <br/>Go on, don't by shy! Gobble them down! ... Well? Delicious, amiright?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_112_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい、どうぞ。ホットココアだよ雪の日にはやっぱりコレだよねぇはぁ～…あったまる～♪<br/>…てなわけで、体もあったまったことだし、一緒にミドリちゃんデコりに行こう！<br/>クリスマスだし、かわいくデコるならやっぱり赤かな～？|text_cn=给，热可可。像这样，在下雪天来杯热饮……整个人都暖呼呼的~<br/>对了对了，我打算把小绿打扮得更有节日氛围，你也一起来吧~走啦走啦~|trans_en=Here you go—a piping hot cup of cocoa! Nothing beats THAT on a snowy day. Mm-mmm. Warms you from the insides! ♪ <br/>Okay, now we've warded off the frostbite, let's dress up Loxy! It's Snowish Festival and all, so red‘s definitely the way to go, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_112_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん、あけましておめでとう！<br/>今年も空白旅団のみんなで楽しく過ごして、たくさん塔にも登って…<br/>あとあと、星狩りもゼッタイ達成しようね！|text_cn=新年快乐呀！今年，我的愿望是——爬塔！摘星！和旅团的大家，永远在一起！|trans_en=Happy New Year, Boss! <br/>It's going to be a great twelve months for the New Star Guild, I just know it! <br/>We're going to have fun together, climb lots of Monoliths, and most important of all—got star plucking!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_112_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう目、開けていい？…ってこれ、新しい世代の『たまごペット』じゃない！？<br/>まさか誕生日プレゼントを用意してくれてるなんて思ってなかったから、すっごく嬉しいよ！<br/>よーし、ふたりで一緒に育てようね！|text_cn=我可以把眼睛睁开了吗？……哇！！这、这是，最新版的宠物宝贝蛋？！<br/>魔王大人，谢谢你的生日礼物！我们一起来养它吧~|trans_en=Can I open my eyes now?<br/>... Wait, don't tell me—is this ... is this the next-generation Tamago Pet?<br/>I wasn't expecting anything for my birthday, but to get one of these?! Just ... wow. Brilliant, in fact. Let's raise it together, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_112_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_112_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん、誕生日おめでとう！…って、どうしたの？探しもの？<br/>あ、わかった！誕生日プレゼントが気になるんでしょ？ダ～メ、まだ内緒だよ～♪<br/>とりあえず、今日の夜ごはんは期待しててね！|text_cn=今天轮到我对你说生日快乐啦！嗯？你在看什么？哦~~想知道我准备了什么生日礼物？嘿嘿，保密。<br/>不如先期待一下今晚的生日大餐吧！|trans_en=Happy birthday, Boss. ... Hm? What's up? Looking for something? <br/>Ah, I get it! You're curious about your birthday present, aren't you? ♪<br/>Well, you're just going to have to wait until dinner tonight. Okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Chinese New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc112_ChineseNewYear26_day06_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc112_ChineseNewYear26_day06_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミドリちゃんを春節っぽくデコってみない？<br/>赤い提灯を吊るしたり、赤い剪紙を貼ったり、赤いタイヤにしたり…<br/>あれ？そしたらミドリちゃんがアカちゃんになっちゃう！？|text_cn=我们要不要把小绿布置得更有春节氛围一点？<br/>比如挂上红灯笼，贴上红窗花，换上红轮胎……<br/>呃？那小绿……岂不是就变成小红了？！|trans_en=Why don't we decorate Loxy in a Springseek Festival style?<br/>Hang red lanterns, put up red paper cuttings, make the tires red...<br/>Wait, does that turn Loxy into Ruby?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc112_FirstAnniversary_day03_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc112_FirstAnniversary_day03_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんと出会ってからもう１年かぁ、思い返すとあっという間だったな～<br/>砂漠ではじめてキミを見たときはみんな本当に驚いたんだから。<br/>あの日のことは、まだ鮮明に…鮮明に覚えて…あれ？魔王さん？もしかして…太った？<br/>え？私の料理がおいしくて、つい食べ過ぎちゃう？ふーん、じゃあ今日の夕飯も期待しててね♪|text_cn=不知不觉，跟魔王相遇已经一年了呢～还记得在沙漠刚见到你的时候，大家都吓了一跳！<br/>那天的事，到现在还鲜明地……鲜明地记在脑海……<br/>魔王？你是不是胖了啊？<br/>嗯？因为我做的饭太好吃了，一不小心就吃多了？哼哼～那今天的晚饭你也好好期待一下吧～|trans_en=I can't believe it's been a year since we first met, Boss. Looking back, it went by so fast...<br/>We were really shocked when we first saw you in the desert.<br/>I still remember that day so... So vividly... Huh? Boss? Did you by any chance ... gain a few extra pounds?<br/>Huh? You just can't resist the food I make? Hm-hm, well, you can look forward to dinner tonight too♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Half Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc112_HalfAnniversary_day03_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc112_HalfAnniversary_day03_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんが空白旅団の仲間になってから、もうすぐ半年でしょ？<br/>だからさ、記念日には盛大にお祝いしようと思ってるんだけど…どうかな！？<br/>私も腕によりをかけてご馳走を作っちゃうから、食べたいものなんでも言ってみてよ！<br/>え？私が作るものなら、なんでもうれしい？えへへ～、魔王さんってば、口がうまいんだから♪|text_cn=魔王，算算日子，你加入空白旅团都快半年了吧？<br/>我在想……纪念日那天，要不要搞个超大的庆祝会？你觉得怎么样？<br/>到时候就看我大显身手，给大家做顿丰盛的大餐！有什么想吃的尽管跟我说！<br/>诶？只要是我做的，不管什么都好吃？嘿嘿……真是的！魔王你这嘴巴也太甜啦～！|trans_en=It will soon be half a year since you became friends with the New Star Guild, right?<br/>So, I'm thinking about a huge celebration on the anniversary... What do you say?<br/>I'll also do my best to make a feast, so tell me anything you want to eat! <br/>Eh? You'll be happy as long as it's something I make? Hehe, you're a smooth talker, Boss♪}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_113_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おや、ボス？え…これですか？詐欺被害ゼロ運動を広めるチラシですよ<br/>今日の仕事は、その告知ですからね|text_cn=唔，魔王你来了。给，最新的反诈宣传册。今天的工作是开展防诈骗宣传活动。|trans_en=Oh hey, Boss. ... What, this? It's a flyer for the Zero Fraud Initiative. I'm doing PR work for it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_113_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、逃げないでください！<br/>今日は消防設備点検のため、一緒に商店街を回る予定でしょう！|text_cn=魔王，别跑。今天还要和我一起继续检查各商铺的消防设备。|trans_en=Boss, don't run away! We're supposed to inspect fire safety equipment in the shopping district, remember?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_113_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはようございます<br/>あ、えっと…他にも挨拶の仕方を考えたんですが、何も思い浮かびませんでした|text_cn=早上好……<br/>打招呼的话，我也只能想出这么一句。|trans_en=Good morning.<br/>I, er, wanted to try some kind of fancy greeting, but nothing came to mind.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_113_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日の昼食は龍璟樓のお弁当です安くて美味しいので、いつも助かってます<br/>ボスも一度、食べてみては？|text_cn=我手上的这个吗？是怀璟食府的盒饭，价廉物美。<br/>魔王下次也可以试试。|trans_en=I've got a packed lunch from Huaijing Restaurant. My go-to bento shop. <br/>Cheap and delicious—I recommend it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_113_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ？もうこんな時間に…ボスも早めに休んでください。明日も早いんですからね|text_cn=诶？这么晚了……<br/>记得早点休息，明天还要早起！|trans_en=Whoa, look at the time! <br/>Boss, you should go to bed. We have an early start tomorrow.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_113_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=すみません、話題を考えるのは得意ではなくて。ええと…食事はもう、すませましたか？|text_cn=……抱歉，我好像不太会找聊天话题。<br/>那个……今天吃了吗？|trans_en=Sorry, I'm not great at small talk. <br/>Uh ... have you already eaten?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_113_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この剣の名前？…シーミャオ妙妙剣です<br/>コホン…何回か口にすれば慣れますよ|text_cn=这把剑的名字？<br/>……叫做师渺妙妙剑。<br/>咳，多念十遍就习惯了。|trans_en=The name of this sword?<br/>It's the Miaovelous Sword. <br/>... Yeah, I know, it's kind of a mouthful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_113_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごほっ、ごほごほっ…だ、大丈夫、少しむせただけです…<br/>これでも私、辛いものには強いので…|text_cn=咳、咳咳咳……只是被呛到了，其实我很能吃辣的，真的。|trans_en=Cough, cough... I-I'm fine, just something in my throat. I-I actually like spicy food, honest...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_113_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=辛いのが苦手なら、別の鍋に変えましょうか？<br/>わ、私は…いまのままでも全然平気ですけど|text_cn=魔王，如果觉得辣的话我们可以换成清汤锅底。<br/>当然，纯粹只是因为你在，我才这么建议。|trans_en=If spicy's not your thing, we could get something a little milder. <br/>Not that I need too—I'm totally okay with fiery hot!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_113_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=目を大切にしてください。巡遊者にとって視力は大事ですから…<br/>私のメガネ？私の場合は遺伝です|text_cn=魔王也请时刻注意用眼卫生，视力对旅人十分重要……<br/>请不要盯着我的眼镜看，这个属于家族遗传。|trans_en=Look after your eyes. Good vision is important for Trekkers. <br/>... My glasses? You can blame my parents.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_113_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この剣に興味が？ならご覧になりますか？<br/>実はこれ、剣の形をした多機能収納ボックスなんですよ|text_cn=你似乎对这把剑很有兴趣……给你看看也无妨。<br/>虽然外形是一把剑，但其实是多功能剑式收纳盒。|trans_en=Interested in this sword? Then take a closer look. <br/>It's actually a multi-functional storage box.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_113_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私が書いた『科学麻雀解説第2版』は読んでいただけましたか？<br/>フフ…わかりやすかったでしょう？ということで、今度実践といきましょう！|text_cn=你看过我整理的《科学麻雀牌精讲2.0》？<br/>如何，还挺通俗易懂的吧。下次有机会实践几盘，我来做你的对手。|trans_en=Have you read my Scientific Mahjong Guide 2nd Edition? <br/>Hehe. Pretty easy to follow, right? Try applying it next time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_113_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは私の一族にのみ、代々伝わる特別な法術で…え？ええ。おっしゃる通りです<br/>水利や灌漑の技術を研究しているため、その過程で水に関する法術が生み出されたんです|text_cn=这套法术，也是家传的。……竟然猜到了？<br/>没错，我们家世代专精于灌溉和水利技术，自然也就钻研出了与水相关的法术。|trans_en=This is a Xuan art passed down in my clan... Hm? Yes, that's right. <br/>While researching water management and irrigation techniques, we naturally developed water-based Xuan arts.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_113_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=法術を教えてほしい…ですか？ではこちらをどうぞ、参考書籍のリストです<br/>どれも初心者向けなので、理解しやすいかと<br/>ちなみに『ノヴァ帝国研究誌』が入っているのは、その一節に法術の起源の記述が――<br/>え？やっぱりやめておく？そうですか…それは残念です|text_cn=对法术好奇的话……正好，我这边有几本参考书，是与此相关的基础知识，有助于理解龙裔的法术原理。<br/>对了，《诺瓦帝国研究全志》我也拿来了，这里面也有几个章节和法术溯源有关。<br/>……啊，不想了解了吗？<br/>太可惜了。|trans_en=You want me to teach you Xuan arts?<br/>Here's a list of reference books. They're easy for beginners to understand. <br/>By the way, the Nova Empire Research Journal is included because one section discusses the origins of Xuan arts—<br/>oh, you'd rather not, you say? Pity.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_113_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=幼い頃は、寝る前に母が龍族に伝わる童謡をよく歌って聞かせてくれたものです<br/>ふふ、懐かしいですね。メロディーは、たしか…|text_cn=龙裔的童谣……小时候，母亲常常会唱歌哄我入睡，现在想想也很是怀念。<br/>旋律我记得是……|trans_en=When I was young, my mother used to sing traditional Loongkind lullabies before bed. <br/>I still remember some of them. The melody goes like this, I think...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_113_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は早いのですね。書類の整理がまだ少し残っているので<br/>そちらで本でも読んで待っていてください<br/>ああ、いい本を選びましたね。『東大陸植物図鑑』は、私の姉が書いたものですよ|text_cn=今天来得好早。我还有几份文件需要处理，你可以挑本书打发时间……<br/>选了一本好书呢，这是我姐姐写的《诺瓦东大陆植物图鉴》。|trans_en=You're early. I still have some paperwork to plow through, so why don't you read a book while you wait? <br/>Ah, yes, that's a great one. The "Compendium of Flora of the Eastern Continent, "written by my sister, no less.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_113_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうぞ、サインペンです。それから付箋と巻き尺、カッターのり…じ、準備がいいだなんて…<br/>こほん。シーミャオ妙妙剣には様々なものが入りますから<br/>あらゆる事態を想定して備えておくのは当然です|text_cn=给，签字笔。这里还有便条贴、卷尺、裁刀、胶水……<br/>都是事先塞在师渺妙妙剑里的东西，方便应付各类突发情况。<br/>细、细心什么的……咳，只是物尽其用罢了。|trans_en=Here's a marker. Also, sticky notes, a tape measure, a box cutter, glue... <br/>Well, yes, I suppose it is a lot of stuff. <br/>But the Miaovelous Sword can hold all sorts of things, so of COURSE I'm going to be prepared!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_113_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=最近の私は、少し変なんです。些細なチャットの会話でも、なんだか楽しく思えてきて…<br/>一体、どうしてしまったんでしょう？|text_cn=真是奇怪，最近我总会时不时拿起手机翻看我们的聊天记录，<br/>即便只是一些琐事，我也觉得它们很有趣……|trans_en=Lately, I've been feeling a bit ... different. <br/>I'm actually starting to enjoy pointless small talk. What's happening to me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_113_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたと二人きりになった途端、急に周囲の気温が上がっていくようで…<br/>こんな現象、本の知識では説明できません…|text_cn=和你两人独处的时候总感觉周围的温度在升高……<br/>这个现象好像很难用书本上的理论知识来解释……|trans_en=It's strange, but when I'm alone with you, it feels like the temperature suddenly rises... <br/>None of my meteorological references can explain it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_113_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=適度なスキンシップは、互いの距離を縮める効果があると聞きました<br/>ですので…ボス、検証に付き合っていただけませんか？<br/>まずはこうして…指を絡め、手を握る…どうでしょう、効果はありますか？|text_cn=听说适当的身体接触可以拉近彼此之间的距离……<br/>魔王，可以和我试验一下吗？<br/>比如这样……十指相扣……<br/>应该，足够了吧……|trans_en=I've heard that physical contact can help bring people closer. <br/>So, would you help me test this? <br/>Lacing fingers, holding hands... <br/>How is it? How do you feel?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_113_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメさんを知りませんか？彼女に頼まれて『公務員試験過去問題集』を持ってきたのですが<br/>そうですか…では代わりに、これを彼女へ渡していただけますか？<br/>それから重要なポイントは、付箋の箇所を見るようにと伝えてください|text_cn=鸢尾好像不在……我带来了她上次提到的《五年公考三年模拟》。<br/>上面还有我画的重点，麻烦魔王转交给她。|trans_en=Do you know Iris? She asked me to bring her the Civil Service Exam Workbook. <br/>... Oh, good. In that case, could you give this to her for me? And tell her to pay extra attention to the pages with sticky notes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_113_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この剣は、以前とある友人からもらったものです<br/>シーミャオ妙妙剣という名も、彼女がつけてくれました。友人の名前、ですか？<br/>いつかあなたが彼女と出会った時、本人から直接聞いてください|text_cn=师渺妙妙剑是由一位朋友所赠。当然……这个名字也是她取的。<br/>至于她本人叫什么……若是你俩日后有缘相见，可以亲自去问她。|trans_en=This sword was given to me by a friend. She's the one who named it Shimiao's Miaovelous Sword. <br/>My friend's name? Well, you can ask her yourself, when you meet her.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_113_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ジンリンは、私の4番目の伯父の2番目の叔母の叔父のお隣の娘さんです…<br/>え、ふ、複雑すぎますか？|text_cn=唔，璟麟是我四叔公二女婿的小姨的表舅的邻居家的女儿……<br/>诶？很、很复杂的关系吗？|trans_en=Jinglin is the daughter of the uncle of my fourth great-uncle's second aunt's uncle's neighbor. <br/>Did you get all that?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_113_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=あそこにいるのが星輝附属大学のカナーチェ先生…優しそうなかたですね<br/>私もあのくらい愛想よくできればよいのですが…<br/>って、いまのは独り言ですから忘れてください！|text_cn=那一位是来自星辉附属大学的卡娜丝老师吗……看上去是一位非常优秀的教师。不知道我有没有机会去旁听一节她的课……|trans_en=That over there is Professor Canace from Grace Light Academy. <br/>She seems nice. I wish I could be that good socially.<br/>Um, I didn't mean to say that out loud. Pretend you didn't hear it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_113_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=フィレンさんは昔、私をアグリ・ユニオンに勧誘してくれました<br/>けれど職場が家から遠かったため断ってしまったのです<br/>別に後悔はしていませんよ。仕事より家族の方が大切ですから|text_cn=翡冷翠小姐曾经希望我可以入职联合种业，不过我并不希望工作地点离家太远，便拒绝了她的邀请。<br/>会觉得可惜吗？不，家人对我来说更重要。|trans_en=Firenze once invited me to the join United Harvest. But I had to decline because the commute would've been a bear... <br/>Hm? Oh no, I don't particularly regret it. Family is more important than work, after all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_113_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もし暇を持て余しているなら、内職を斡旋しましょうか？<br/>空白旅団のみなさんは、なにかとご入用でしょうし|text_cn=魔王，你看起来好像很闲。<br/>正好，我们白泽公署的人手不够，有些工作不如就外包给你好了。|trans_en=If you have extra free time, maybe I can find you a side job?<br/>I'm sure the New Star Guild is looking for some help.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_113_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ余裕があるようですね…ではこちらの書類もお願いします|text_cn=看来工作还是不够饱和……那么这些文书也拜托你帮忙处理了。|trans_en=At a loose end, are you? In that case, could you take care of these reports?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_113_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス？あの～ボス？一体どこに行ったのでしょう…<br/>まさか、悪い人にほいほいついていってしまい、高額な壺を買わされているのでは…|text_cn=魔王？魔王？到底去哪儿了……<br/>啊，难道是被无良商家缠住了，要求买超贵的翡翠？|trans_en=Um, Boss? Hellooo? <br/>Where ARE you? I sure hope some bad person isn't trying to dupe you into buying an expensive vase...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_113_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこを探しても、ボスが見当たりません…<br/>まさか迷子？放送で呼びかけたほうが良いのでしょうか？<br/>いえ、それだと恥ずかしがって余計に出てきづらくなるかも…|text_cn=不管怎么找都找不到魔王……要不要贴一些寻人启事？还是算了，就在这等等看吧。|trans_en=I can't find Boss anywhere. Could she be lost? Should I try calling for her on the air?  <br/>No, wait. That might make her too embarrassed to come out...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_113_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスと連絡がとれません。空白旅団の皆さんに知らせないと…|text_cn=必须通知一下空白旅团的人……魔王失联了。|trans_en=I can't get reach the Boss. I need to tell the New Star Guild...}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_113_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめまして、白沢管理局のシーミャオです<br/>以後あなたのギルドとの協力に関する連絡事項は、すべて私が担当します<br/>どうぞよろしくお願いしますね|text_cn=我是白泽公署的师渺，今后由我来接手与贵旅团的相关合作事宜，还望合作愉快。|trans_en=Nice to meet you. I'm Shimiao from the Baize Bureau. <br/>From now on, I'll handle all all communications regarding our cooperation with your guild. I look forward to working with you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_113_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お久しぶりです、ボス。早速なのですが、急ぎの案件を受けていただけませんか？<br/>詳細は移動しながら説明します|text_cn=又见面了魔王。有个紧急委托需要你的帮助，具体内容我会在路上告知。|trans_en=Boss! Been a bit, huh? I've got an urgent task for you—I'll fill you in on the way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_113_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この感じ…久々です。ありがとうございます、ボス|text_cn=久违的感受。感谢你，魔王。|trans_en=It's been a while since I felt like this. Thanks, Boss.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_113_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=収納の極意を習得しました。これでより多くの物をシーミャオ妙妙剣に入れられますね|text_cn=掌握了新的收纳方法，师渺妙妙剑里面能塞更多东西了。|trans_en=I've mastered the art of storage.<br/>Now I can fit even more vital supplies into my Miaovelous Sword.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_113_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この曲…幼い頃に母が歌ってくれた童謡を思い出します。懐かしい…|text_cn=它让我想起小时候母亲唱给我听的童谣……真好。|trans_en=Oh, my. This takes me back. It reminds me of the lullabies mother used to sing for me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_113_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この旋律を聴くと、心が穏やかになりますね|text_cn=是受到了这首旋律的影响吗？心情稍微放松了一点。|trans_en=This melody is so soothing...}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_113_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=水は自在に形を変えます。つまりその可能性は無限大！|text_cn=水，以不变呈万态。|trans_en=Water can take any shape it wants. Which means its potential is limitless!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_113_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また火鍋ですか！？い、いえ、不満はありませんが…<br/>『龍族は火鍋』が好きと先入観を抱くのはよくないと思います|text_cn=又、又是火锅吗？！没有不满，我只是想纠正一下大家对龙裔喜欢吃火锅的刻板印象。|trans_en=Hot stew again?! I-I'm not complaining, but I think it's a bit unfair to assume that Loongs love stew ALL the time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_113_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たしかに龍族といえば、みな料理上手なイメージがありますね<br/>けれど私は…で、ですが練習すればなんとかなるはず<br/>ですので、その…少し付き合っていただけませんか？|text_cn=龙裔确实会给大家人均大厨的印象，可惜我的水平……<br/>但我相信勤能补拙，你能陪我一起练习吗？|trans_en=It's true that Loongkind have a reputation for being great cooks. But as for me... <br/>I-I suppose with enough practice, I could improve. In fact ... could you help with that?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_113_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私には、無理をしないようにとよく口にされますが…<br/>あなたの方こそ、かなり無理をしているのでは？|text_cn=你总要我别勉强……可是，明明你才是更努力的那个人。|trans_en=You often tell me not to overdo it, but aren't you pushing yourself too hard?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_113_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたがいないと…少し落ち着きません。どうしてって…そ、それは…|text_cn=每当你不在的时候，我好像就会变得有点……不够镇定了。为什么？魔王，你可真是……明知故问。|trans_en=I feel a bit uneasy without you around. Why, you ask? W-Well, it's just...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_113_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=伝えたいことがあったので、手紙を書いてみたのです<br/>これを読んだら…あなたの返事を聞かせていただけますか？|text_cn=我有些话想对你说……不过，我还是觉得用笔写下来比较好……你看过之后，我有机会听到你的读后感吗？|trans_en=I had something I wanted to say, so I wrote you a letter. Talk to me after you read it, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_113_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとうございます。ですが贈り物なら、表彰状だけで十分ですよ|text_cn=谢谢。不过赠礼的话，送锦旗就可以了。|trans_en=Thank you. But if you want to give me a gift, a certificate of commendation is more than enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_113_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=白沢管理局の職員として、おいそれと金品を受け取るわけにはいきませんが…<br/>これは友人からのプレゼントということで、ありがたくいただいておきますね|text_cn=白泽公署的工作人员讲究清正廉洁，一般情况下我不能随意收礼……<br/>但你是以朋友的身份送这个的，所以……我收下了，谢谢。|trans_en=As an employee of the Baize Bureau, I can't accept money or items... <br/>But since this is from a friend, I'll gladly accept.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_113_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたの気持ち…たしかに受け取りました<br/>なので、こちらもシーミャオ個人として、心からの感謝を…|text_cn=你的这份心意，我会铭记在心。郑重地向你表达谢意……<br/>以、以我个人的名义……|trans_en=I appreciate your gesture, I really do. <br/>So I happily accept, friend to friend...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_113_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうです|text_cn=没错。|trans_en=That's right.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_113_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいえ|text_cn=不。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_113_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=つまり？|text_cn=你的意思是？|trans_en=In other words?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_113_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=困ります|text_cn=这样会造成困扰。|trans_en=That's not good.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_113_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…|text_cn=怎么会……|trans_en=Oh no...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_113_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=ああっ！|text_cn=啊！|trans_en=Ahh!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_113_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=…ふん|text_cn=……哼。|trans_en=Hmph.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_113_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ|text_cn=哈哈……|trans_en=Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_113_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=哎。|trans_en=(sigh)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_113_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=仕事の進捗が思わしくないようで…|text_cn=工作进度似乎慢了……|trans_en=The work isn't progressing as we hoped...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_113_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=このスケジュール、見直した方がいいのでは？|text_cn=这份计划还是重新确认下吧。|trans_en=Maybe we should revise the schedule?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_113_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ勤務時間中です|text_cn=还没有到下班的时间。|trans_en=I'm still on the clock.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_113_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=消防設備の点検をします|text_cn=我来进行消防安全检查。|trans_en=I'll be inspecting the fire safety equipment.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_113_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_113_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは基準に沿っていませんね|text_cn=唔，这似乎不太合规。|trans_en=This doesn't meet regulations.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_113_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一水四見、万物流転|text_cn=天生一，一生水，水生万物。|trans_en=In every raindrop, an ever-changing world.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_113_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=四方八方、温潤而沢|text_cn=时雨降矣，润泽四方。|trans_en=In every direction, a gentle nourishing rain.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_113_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=油断、しすぎましたね…|text_cn=糟糕，战场轻敌乃大忌。|trans_en=I was careless, and paid the price...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_113_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごめんなさい…後は、どうか…|text_cn=抱歉……接下来就交给你了。|trans_en=I'm sorry, but the rest is up to you...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_113_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=正しい道を選択すれば、自ずと成功率は上がります|text_cn=选择正确的道路，事半功倍。|trans_en=Choose the correct path, and success will be ours.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_113_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力、早速試してみましょう|text_cn=我会尽快领悟。|trans_en=Hm. Let's try this power right away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_113_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=水は万物を利するのみ…|text_cn=水善利万物而不争。|trans_en=Water is a boon to all things...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_113_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=困っている人を助けるのが、白沢管理局員の使命です|text_cn=帮助有需要的人，是我的职责。|trans_en=Helping those in need is the mission of the Baize Bureau.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_113_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=安全性に問題がないか、確認します|text_cn=安全隐患由我来排查。|trans_en=Let me check for safety risks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_113_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=現場作業は久々ですね。普段は事務仕事ばかりですから|text_cn=公署的文书工作比较多，我也很久没有出外勤了。|trans_en=It's been a while since I've done fieldwork. I'm usually just pushing paper.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_113_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=専業巡遊者と比べれば、私の日常など取るに足らないものです<br/>とはいえ、まだ転職するつもりはありませんけどね。ふふっ|text_cn=和专职旅人的生活比起来，我的日常要无趣得多。不过目前，我还不打算跳槽。|trans_en=Compared to full-time Trekkers, I can't say my days are packed with excitement. <br/>That said, I'm not planning a career change anytime soon. Hehe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_113_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=『龍族』を騙って詐欺行為をはたらく輩を見かけたら、すぐ私にご連絡ください|text_cn=如果遇到什么打着“龙裔”名号招摇撞骗的人，记得通知我。|trans_en=If you see anyone trying to pass themselves off as a Loong, let me know right away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_113_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=そのお弁当、美味しそうですね。えっ、セイナさんが？それは…驚きました|text_cn=你手里的盒饭看起来真好吃……这居然是尘沙做的？人不可貌相啊。|trans_en=Gosh, that picnic looks delicious. ... What's that? Noya made it? Well, well...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_113_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=『とうとう星ノ塔までやって来ました』…ふふ<br/>あれ？今の冗談、面白くありませんでしたか？|text_cn=真是大水淹了白泽庙，旅人进了星塔门。呵呵，讲个笑话缓和一下氛围而已……不好笑吗？|trans_en="Finally made it to the Monolith!" Hehe. Hm? You didn't like the joke?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_113_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この塔は、安全性に不備があるようです。メモしておかないと…|text_cn=这地方看上去有不少安全隐患……我要做好记录。|trans_en=This place seems to have serious safety issues. I'd better take some notes...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_113_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめて来る場所ですが、建築基準法は遵守されているのでしょうか…|text_cn=没有来过的地方，应该不是违章建筑吧……|trans_en=This is my first time here. The building code had better be up to scratch...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_113_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ではまず、必要物品をリストアップしていきましょう|text_cn=魔王，我们先罗列一下必需品清单吧。|trans_en=I'll draw up a list of what we need, in triplicate.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_113_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…少し休憩していきましょうって、どうしました？皆さん一斉に、私を見て…|text_cn=呼……休息一下也不错。嗯？为什么大家都这么盯着我？|trans_en=Yeesh... Let's take five, okay? ... Hm? Why's everyone staring at me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_113_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これで多少、効率が上がればいいのですが|text_cn=如果这能提高一点效率的话，那也不错。|trans_en=I'm hoping this will improve efficiency.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_113_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ油断しないでください|text_cn=切勿掉以轻心。|trans_en=Don't lower your guard just yet.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_113_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=フッ…素晴らしい成果です|text_cn=嗯，成效显著。|trans_en=Hmph. Impressive results.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_113_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=想定通りの結果です|text_cn=符合预期。|trans_en=I like it when things go according to plan.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_113_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=滞りなく勝利しました|text_cn=这是一场水到渠成的胜利。|trans_en=Victory achieved without a hitch.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_113_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=勝利は皆で祝うべきもの…？ではこの後、火鍋でも食べに行きましょうか？|text_cn=胜利是需要庆祝的？那么……等会我们去吃火锅吧？|trans_en=Victory should be celebrated together... Shall we go share a hot stew?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_113_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=失敗は成功のもと。落ち込む必要はありません|text_cn=失败也无须沮丧。|trans_en=Failure is the stepping stone to success. There's no need to feel down.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_113_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=次の反省会で、今の戦闘を議題に上げるべきですね|text_cn=明天我来组织一场复盘会。|trans_en=We need to discuss today's battle at the next debrief.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_113_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=調査業務の準備はできています|text_cn=我已做好万全准备。|trans_en=I'm ready to investigate.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_113_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=実戦経験も大切です|text_cn=积累实战经验也很重要。|trans_en=Experience is also important.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_113_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=依頼を達成できるよう、力をお貸しします|text_cn=合作愉快，一切都是为了顺利完成委托。|trans_en=I'll do my best to ensure the mission's success.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_113_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=その信頼に応えてみせます|text_cn=感谢魔王的信任。|trans_en=I'll prove worthy of your trust.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_113_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_113_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…もしよければ、ご一緒に火鍋はいかがですか？<br/>あ、いえ…別に火鍋が食べたいわけではなく…<br/>普通にチョコを渡すのはなんだか恥ずかしいので辛いもので気を紛らわそうかと…|text_cn=今天……能不能和我一起去吃火锅？啊，也、也不是一定要去……<br/>我试着给你做了巧克力，总觉得就这么直接给你有些不好意思……所以就觉得，要是能吃点辣的……|trans_en=Um... Would you like to have some hot pot with me? <br/>Oh, um ... it's not that I especially want hot pot... <br/>It's more that I'm kinda embarrassed to give you chocolate, <br/>so I thought inviting you for something spicy might be easier...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_113_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は雪になるらしいので、温かくして出かけてくださいえ？積もったら雪合戦がしたい？<br/>温かくするよう言っているのに、どうして外で遊ぶことを考えているのですか…<br/>まったく、しかたありません。本当は後で渡そうと思っていたのですが…<br/>このマフラーをどうぞ。その…クリスマスプレゼントです|text_cn=今天会有大雪，魔王要是打算出门的话，一定要注意保暖。<br/>欸、欸？你想出门打雪仗？等等，我刚刚才说了要你注意保暖吧，你怎么就……唉。<br/>好吧，这个本来是准备之后再给你的。喏，围巾……雪愿节快乐。|trans_en=It's supposed to snow today, so be sure to wear warm clothes! Hm? You want to have a snowball fight later?<br/>I thought I just told you to keep warm. Why do you want to play outside in the cold? <br/>Oh, I swear. I was planning to give this to you later, but... Here's a scarf I got for you. It's a Snowish present!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_113_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、ボス…あけましておめでとうございます…<br/>はい？クマがすごい？<br/>ああそれは…最近仕事が忙しく残業して片付けているうちに年があけていたので…<br/>とはいえせっかくの年明けですからね。これから一緒に花火を見に行きませんか？|text_cn=魔王，新年好。我的黑眼圈很重？嗯，最近公署的任务繁重，回过神来已经是新的一年了。<br/>那个……为了弥补之前一直没有见面的遗憾，等会……要不要一起去看烟花？|trans_en=Hi, Boss. Happy New Year! <br/>Hm? The dark circles under my eyes are plain to see? <br/>Well, that's... Work's been so busy.  I was cleaning up after hours, and before I knew it, it was the new year already. <br/>But, well, here we are. Why don't we go watch some fireworks together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_113_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの、ボス？この包みは？はい？誕生日…プレゼントぉ！？<br/>いったいどこで私の誕生日を…？いえいえいえ！うれしいです！ありがとうございます！！<br/>ボスからお祝いしていただけるとは思っていなかったので、少々照れくさく…<br/>このペンは、シーミャオ妙妙剣に大切にしまっておきますね♪|text_cn=诶？这个是送给我的？生日礼物？<br/>你、你是从哪里调查到我生日的……？不、不是，我很开心！谢谢你！<br/>只是完全没想到会从你这里收到生日礼物，总觉得有点不好意思……<br/>这支笔，我会收进师渺妙妙剑里，妥善保管的。|trans_en=Um, Boss? What's this package? What? A birthday present?! How did you know it was...? <br/>No, no, no! I'm really happy! Thank you so much!<br/>This is just so unexpected, so I feel a little shy... I'll treasure this pen just like my Shimiao's Miaovelous Sword! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_113_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_113_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとうございますえ？私からの誕生日プレゼントを楽しみにしていたのですか？<br/>そ、そんなに期待されてしまうと緊張するのですが…<br/>では、こちらをどうぞ。銅銭を結んだ紐です…<br/>ボスがこの先もずっと、無事に旅を続けられるよう気持ちを込めて作りました|text_cn=生日快乐，魔王。很期待我的礼物？也、也不是什么贵重的东西……<br/>给你，只、只是一枚系了平安铜钱的绳结……希望你能一直平平安安。|trans_en=Happy birthday! <br/>Hm? You were looking forward to my present? <br/>Oh, now I'm getting nervous! Okay, here it is. It's a traditional knot with bronze coins on it. <br/>I made this with loving wishes for you to continue your journeys safely for a long time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Chinese New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc113_ChineseNewYear26_day03_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc113_ChineseNewYear26_day03_cn.ogg|text_jp=気の緩み安い時期ですが、祝日を楽しむためにも、火の元には十分注意してください<br/>お困りのことがありましたら、いつでもシーミャオまでご連絡を<br/>春節期間中も、白沢管理局が迅速に対応します|text_cn=新春佳节之际，在享受节日的同时也要注意防火防盗。<br/>如遇任何困难或紧急情况，请随时联系我。<br/>白泽公署将第一时间为您提供专业的帮助与支持。|trans_en=This is a time when it's easy to get loose, but please be careful about fire when enjoying the festival.<br/>If there are any problems, contact me anytime.<br/>Even during the Springseek Festival period, the Baize Bureau will respond promptly.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_114_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わっ！ビックリした？ちぇ～……リアクション薄すぎ|text_cn=嘣！被我吓到了吧~<br/>没有吗？切~|trans_en=Wah! Did I scare you? Tsk... You could at least act surprised.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_114_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=喜べ！暇を持て余したシャトン様が、魔王の対戦相手になってやろう～♪|text_cn=我今天也很闲，就大发慈悲地陪你来一局吧~|trans_en=Rejoice! The Great Chaton, who has plenty of time on her hands, shall honor you as her opponent! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_114_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おっはよー、魔王！ねえねえ、今日はどこで遊ぶ！？|text_cn=早上好，魔王大人！今天我们要去哪玩？|trans_en=Good morning, Tyrant! Hey, hey, where should we go to play today?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_114_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ、あたし寝てた？ってもうお昼ぅ！？|text_cn=等等，已经中午了吗！可恶……又到了光明之力最盛的时刻了……|trans_en=... Huh? Was I sleeping? Wait, it's already noon?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_114_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふっ……夜の闇こそ、このシャトン様にふさわしいのだ！|text_cn=夜晚，是属于猫眼的时间——！|trans_en=Heh... The darkness of the night is truly befitting of the great Chaton!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_114_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふっふ～！シャトン様は、今日も漆黒の力とともにあり！|text_cn=今天的猫眼大人也在被黑暗之力眷顾~|trans_en=Heh heh! The great Chaton is at one with the dark power today too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_114_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=音楽こそ、暗黒の力を司る重要な要素！<br/>旋律が響き渡った瞬間、シャトン様の力は何倍にも跳ね上がるのだあっ！|text_cn=音乐，乃是驾驭黑暗的媒介！当旋律响起，我的力量将会获得数倍的增幅——！|trans_en=Music is the vital component that commands the dark power!<br/>As soon as a melody rings out, the great Chaton's power surges many times over!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_114_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王と一緒にゲームするなんて、夢にも思わなかったよ～！|text_cn=在这里和你一起打游戏……就像做梦一样！|trans_en=I never thought I'd get to game with you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_114_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王っ、あたしに力を貸して！キミの漆黒パワーがあれば、シャトン様は無敵なんだから！|text_cn=魔王，为我注入力量吧。只要拥有了你的黑暗之力，猫眼大人必将无所不能！|trans_en=Tyrant, lend me your strength! With your dark power, the great Chaton is invincible!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_114_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はもう疲れたぁ…！漆黒の力もからっぽだし…<br/>ねえ魔王、エネルギー補給するから、あま～いキャンディちょうだい？|text_cn=今天练枪练得手好酸啊，感觉黑暗之力都要用光了……<br/>魔王~快给我补充点能量……我要甜甜的糖果~|trans_en=I'm tired already today...! My dark power is totally empty...<br/>Hey, Tyrant, I wanna restore my energy, so give me some sweeet candy?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_114_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=なるほどぉ……真の魔王になるには、専用曲が必要なんだぁ？|text_cn=《如何成为一名合格的魔王》……首先登场的时候要有自己的专属音乐！|trans_en=I see... To become a true Tyrant, you need your own theme song!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_114_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=毎日ゲームばっかりしてて暇そう？<br/>いやいやいや、シャトン様は優秀だから、仕事があっという間に片付いちゃうだけなの！|text_cn=人家哪有天天游手好闲？只不过是我太能干了，早早就把活干完了。|trans_en=You think I'm just slacking off and playing games every day?<br/>Wrong, wrong, wrong! The great Chaton's just so efficient that she gets her work done in no time at all!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_114_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=野菜は陽の光を浴びて育つから、『光』の食べ物<br/>つまり『漆黒の力』を求めるシャトン様にはふさわしくないの<br/>というわけだから、真っ黒な炭で焼いた串焼き食べたい！|text_cn=蔬菜……这种充满“光明之力”的绿色食物，和猫眼大人高贵的黑暗气质一点都不搭！<br/>快把它撤走，换成那个……看起来蕴藏着很多黑暗之力的烤串！|trans_en=Vegetables grow in sunlight, so they are foods of light.<br/>Which means they don't suit the great Chaton, who seeks dark power.<br/>That's why I want to eat skewers grilled over pure black charcoal!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_114_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=スナイパーだって、前線で活躍できるんだから！<br/>凸砂、突撃スナイパー……いい響きでしょ♪|text_cn=狙击手也可以冲在前面！你看，冲锋狙，这名字听上去还挺酷的吧！|trans_en=Snipers can shine on the front lines, too!<br/>An assault sniper... Doesn't that sound awesome? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_114_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=この旋律の祝福とともに命ず——漆黒の力を秘めしライフルよ…その真の力を解き放て！<br/>って、ちょっ！？あたしのヘッドホン取らないで！|text_cn=隐藏着黑暗之力的狙击枪啊，在我面前释放你真正的力量吧，在这音乐的轰鸣中，我命令你——<br/>欸！你干嘛摘我耳机！|trans_en=By this melody's blessing, I command you! O rifle, imbued with dark power... Unleash your true power!<br/>Wait, hey!? Don't take my headphones!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_114_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=古のネコ神を祀るにゃんこにゃんにゃん団のキャンディーハンターであり、<br/>高貴なる電音の守護者を兼ね、邪悪なる魔眼の保持者かつ最凶の突撃スナイパー……<br/>そして偉大なるリズムクイーンの称号を持つこのあたしこそ！<br/>もっとも魔王に等しい存在のはず！|text_cn=本王乃上古猫神喵咪喵喵教团糖果收集大使，高贵的电音守护者，强大的魔眼持有者，卓越的冲锋狙驾驭者……<br/>以及最伟大的节奏之王！！当然有和魔王大人平起平坐的资格啦！|trans_en=Candy hunter of the ancient bastet-worshipping Nyan Brigade...<br/>... protector of noble electrowaves, wielder of the ominous Evil Eye, fiercesome sniper rusher...<br/>... and Rhythm Queen par excellence—that's me!<br/>Clearly the closest rival to the Tyrant!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_114_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=して欲しいことがあれば、何でも言って！<br/>ゲームも冒険も、このシャトン様がパーフェクトでクリアしてあげる♪|text_cn=不论是游戏还是探险，你都放心交给猫眼吧！|trans_en=Whatever you need, just say the word!<br/>Games, adventures—the great Chaton will ace them all for you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_114_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=机の上のやつ？あれはシャトン様が厳選した、音ゲーの譜面の解説書だよ♪<br/>暇なときにでも試してみてよ。結果報告、楽しみにしてるから！|text_cn=桌上那些，是猫眼大人的精选谱面合集。我不在的时候，你要是觉得太无聊，就去挑战一下地狱难度的曲子吧。我很期待你的表现哦~|trans_en=The thing on the desk? That's a rhythm game chart guide I carefully selected ♪<br/>Try it when you're free sometime. I look forward to your report of the results!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_114_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王は古い伝説にも詳しいんでしょ？聞かせて聞かせて！<br/>シャトン様覚醒のためのヒントを出すと思って！|text_cn=身为魔王，你肯定知道不少古老的传说吧？来来快跟我说说。<br/>这可是让猫眼大人补充黑暗力量的仪式，说嘛说嘛~|trans_en=You know a lot about old legends, right? Tell me, tell me!<br/>Think of it as giving hints for the great Chaton's awakening!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_114_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王と一緒なら、どんな記録だって超えられるんだからっ！<br/>というわけで、あたしと契約してふたりで頂点を目指そうよ！|text_cn=只要有魔王大人陪着，再高的记录我都能破！如果你有同感的话，就和我签订契约，一起前往记录的巅峰吧！|trans_en=If I'm with you, I can surpass any record!<br/>So make a pact with me and let's aim for the top together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_114_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=カシミラには誰も手を出すなぁ！<br/>アイツを倒すのは、このシャトン様って決まってるんだからっ！|text_cn=卡西米拉只能被猫眼亲手打败。在此之前，谁都别想打她的主意！|trans_en=Nobody touch Kasimira!<br/>I'm the only one allowed to beat her!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_114_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうすればコハクと仲良くなれるのかなぁ？「コハク！この前の決闘の続きしよっ！」<br/>「コハク！エビ味の虫フライ、作り方教えて！」<br/>「コハク！しばらくの間、ネコを貸してくれない？」<br/>……え、全部ダメ？|text_cn=你觉得该怎么找琥珀搭话比较好呢？“琥珀！我们上次的决斗还没分出胜负呢！”<br/>“琥珀！教教我虾味炸昆虫的做法吧！”<br/>“琥珀！猫猫借我玩两天吧！”<br/>……欸！都不行吗！|trans_en=How do I break the ice with Amber? "Amber! Let's continue that duel!"<br/>"Teach me how to make shrimp-flavored fried bugs!"<br/>"Can I borrow your cat for a while?"<br/>...What? No to all those?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_114_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハのお菓子があるだけで、お茶会が豪華になるよね♪<br/>おいしすぎて、いくらでも食べ…んぐうっ！？<br/>喉に詰まって…息が…水…水…ごくごく…ぷはぁ！ふぅ、生き返ったぁ…|text_cn=花原的点心，撑起了整个茶话会的含金量！真想一直吃下去啊<br/>唔！噎到了……水！水！咳咳……活过来了……|trans_en=Just having Nanoha's sweets makes the tea party luxurious ♪<br/>They're so delicious, I can eat them forev... Gah?!<br/>It's stuck in my throat... I can't breathe... Wa... Water... Gulp, gulp... Ahh! Whew, I'm back to life...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_114_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミネルバのことはよく知ってるよ<br/>ウィンドアッシュは、あたしにとって第二の家みたいなものだし<br/>それにおもしろい人が多くてさ。みんなスケートボードも上手くて――|text_cn=我和密涅瓦可熟了，灰风简直就是我第二个家！毕竟灰风的人又有趣，滑板技术又高超……|trans_en=I know a lot about Minova.<br/>The Ashwind Clan is like my second home.<br/>Plus, there are so many fun people! Everyone rocks at skateboarding too...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_114_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵意志の人とは関わっちゃダメダメ<br/>外面はいいけど、裏で何やってるか全然わかんないんだから！|text_cn=离恩赐意志的人远点。那些人看着仪表堂堂，谁知道在打些什么鬼主意。|trans_en=Don't mess with the people from the Grace Imperium.<br/>They put up a friendly front, but who knows what they're really up to?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_114_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なになに？リズムを取る練習？<br/>ふっふー、そんなスピードじゃシャトン様には勝てないよ！<br/>ほらほら、もっと速く！はい！はい、はい、はい、はい、はい！|text_cn=唔！你终于觉醒了魔王速度了吗？那就来一教高下吧！嘿！嘿！嘿！嘿！嘿！|trans_en=What is it, what is it? Rhythm practice?<br/>Hehe, you won't beat the great Chaton with that kind of speed!<br/>Look, get faster! Hey! Hey, ho, hey, ho, hey!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_114_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=このシャトン様が、負けた…だと…！？<br/>いやいやいや、いまのはただの練習だし？次が本番だから…もう一回っ！|text_cn=不可能！我堂堂猫眼大人怎么会输给魔王……刚刚的不算！再来！|trans_en=The great Chaton has lost, you say...!?<br/>No, no, no. That was just practice right now! The next one is the real thing... One more time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_114_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もおおおおおおっ！無視するなあああああっ！！|text_cn=啊啊啊啊啊！不准无视我！|trans_en=Aaaaargh! Don't ignore meeeeeee!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_114_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえ魔王…って、寝ちゃったの？まったく、警戒心の欠片もない顔しちゃって<br/>しょうがない、シャトン様が守ってあげるからゆっくり休みなよ|text_cn=魔王……睡着了啊。哼哼……身为魔王却这么没戒心，没办法，只好由猫眼大人来护着你啦！|trans_en=Hey, Tyrant... Oh, you fell asleep? Seriously, you seem not the least bit on guard...<br/>Well, I guess there's no helping it. The great Chaton will protect you, so rest easy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_114_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王、魔王！？まずい、息してる！？まーおーうーさーまー！<br/>まだ死んじゃダメ！キミがいなくなったら、あたしはどうすれば――<br/>な～んて……ねえ、そろそろ起きてよ？|text_cn=魔王大人，魔王大人？糟糕，不会没有呼吸了吧。魔——王——大——人！你可不能死啊！你死了猫眼怎么办啊——！|trans_en=Tyrant? Oh no, are you breathing!? <br/>T-y-r-a-n-t! You can't die yet! What would I do if you—<br/>Just kidding... Hey, wake up already!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_114_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふーん、キミが伝説の魔王？本当に漆黒の力を持ってるなら、眷属になってあげてもいいよ<br/>まあ隙を見せたら、シャトン様覚醒のための経験値にしちゃうから。油断は禁物ね♪|text_cn=汝即是传说中的魔王？既然汝身怀黑暗之力，那吾便回应汝之召唤。<br/>咳……做好觉悟吧！我会助你走上黑暗的巅峰，再狠狠击溃你！喵哈哈哈哈！|trans_en=Hmm, you're the legendary Tyrant? If you really possess dark power, I can become your follower.<br/>But if you show weakness, I'll turn you into EXP for the great Chaton's awakening. Don't let your guard down ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_114_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王との絆が深まった気がする！え？別にお礼とか必要ないし<br/>だってこれは、キミの持つ漆黒の力と、あたしの持つ漆黒の力が共鳴した結果だからね！|text_cn=呼……看来我们之间的羁绊又加深了。不用急着道谢，这不过是汝之黑暗力量的必然回响！喵哈哈哈哈！|trans_en=I feel like my bond with you has deepened! Huh? Your thanks isn't necessary.<br/>After all, this is the result of your dark power and my dark power resonating!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_114_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また一歩、勝利に近づいた！|text_cn=这样，离胜利就更近一步了！|trans_en=One step closer to victory!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_114_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふっふ～ん♪シャトン様は無敵なんだから！|text_cn=哼哼，猫眼大人是无敌的！|trans_en=Nyahaha! ♪ The great Chaton is unbeatable!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_114_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『過去』のことよりも、大切なのは『今』と『未来」』でしょ！<br/>だから魔王、一緒に楽しい思い出作ろうね！|text_cn=比起“过去”，现在和未来对我来说更加重要。我不会忘记和你们的回忆，并且，之后还要一起创造更多的回忆！|trans_en=The past isn't as important as the 'now' and 'future'!<br/>So Tyrant, let's make some fun memories together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_114_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=う～ん、いい曲！無限リピートしたいくらい！|text_cn=好好听的歌。我想循环播放了！|trans_en=Ooh, such a good song! I could listen to it on repeat!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_114_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=封印されし力、ここに解放っ！！にゃ～っはっはっはぁ！！|text_cn=黑暗之力，封印解除——！喵哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！|trans_en=Sealed power, be unleashed here! Nya~haha!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_114_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=オールパーフェクト！これが魔王の祝福を受けし、シャトン様の実力だよ！<br/>すごいでしょ？ほら魔王、褒めて褒めて♪|text_cn=完美！厉害吧~这就是黑暗之王的实力！魔王，快夸我快夸我~|trans_en=All perfect! This is the great Chaton's true power after receiving Tyrant's blessing!<br/>Amazing, right? Come on Tyrant, praise me, praise me ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_114_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王は魔王なのに、自分の過去も思い出せないの？<br/>ふっふ～♪ならシャトン様が、その枷をぶっ壊してあげるよ！<br/>それで、全盛期の力を取り戻したところで、あたしが魔王を負かして経験値を得るの！どう！？|text_cn=身为“魔王”，怎么能连自己的过去都想不起来？哼哼，就由猫眼大人来帮你打破这层禁锢吧！<br/>我要把你培养成一个足够强大的魔王，最后再让你输得心服口服！|trans_en=You are Tyrant, but you can't remember your own past?<br/>Hehe ♪ In that case, the great Chaton will break those shackles for you!<br/>And then, once you've regained your full power, I'll defeat you and earn EXP! How about that?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_114_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王が登場するときにピッタリな曲見つけたよ！<br/>想像してみて？稲妻が走る雲の中から現れて、目が妖しく真っ赤に光って…<br/>ザ・世界の支配者！って感じがして、めちゃめちゃカッコよくない！？|text_cn=我找到一首特别适合魔王出场的音乐！来，想象一下……<br/>你从闪烁着雷点的云雾中走出，眼睛冒着红光……在那旋律中，你就是这世界的主宰！是不是超酷的？|trans_en=I found the perfect music for you when making your entrance!<br/>Can you imagine? Emerging from clouds with lightning coursing through them, eyes glowing an ominous red...<br/>"The Ruler of the World!" is what it feels like, isn't that super cool?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_114_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この威圧感…！それだよ、それ！ついに全盛期の魔王が降臨――<br/>え？降臨しない？そもそもなにも思い出してない？<br/>そういうことなら…最終手段に出るしかないね。覚悟はいい？|text_cn=这种压迫感……没错，就是这样！你的记忆正如洪水一样涌出，连空气都在因为你的苏醒而扭曲——<br/>啊！这就是……欸？你什么都没想起来？哈、哈哈……看来猫眼大人不得不拿出最终手段了，你可要做好觉悟哦！|trans_en=This sense of intimidation...! That's it! The Tyrant finally descends in full glory—<br/>Huh? You won't descend? You haven't remembered anything?<br/>In that case... We have to use our last resort. Are you ready?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_114_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミが本当の力を取り戻すまで、あたしは絶対諦めないよ！<br/>この世から漆黒の力が消えない限り、魔王が返り咲く方法なんていくらでもあるし！<br/>魔王とシャトン様の決戦は…いにしえより定められた運命なんだからっ！|text_cn=在你成为“真正的魔王”前我是不会放弃的！<br/>只要你心中的黑暗之力还未散去，我就有一百种方法让你觉醒。那场终焉的决战，注定是你与我的宿命！|trans_en=Until you get your true power back, I will never give up!<br/>As long as the dark power does not leave this world, there are many ways for you to make a comeback!<br/>The final battle between you and the great Chaton has been destined from time immemorial!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_114_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん、いい感じ！９９点！|text_cn=这个不错嘛！给你打九十九分！|trans_en=Mhm-mm, looking good! 99 points!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_114_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=百点満点！シャトン様の超高評価をあげよう♪|text_cn=满分！给你个大大的好评！|trans_en=Perfect score! A super high rating from the great Chaton ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_114_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャトン様の好感度が限界突破！さっすが魔王、世界で一番あたしのこと理解してるね！|text_cn=计分器爆炸啦！你就是这个世界上最了解猫眼的人！|trans_en=The great Chaton's affection has broken through the limit! As expected of the Tyrant! You understand me better than anyone else in the world!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_114_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うんうん|text_cn=嗯嗯。|trans_en=Um-hm.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_114_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=いやっ！|text_cn=不要！|trans_en=No!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_114_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=ええ？|text_cn=诶~~|trans_en=Ehhh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_114_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=んん～？|text_cn=啊？|trans_en=Umm...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_114_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅぅ……|text_cn=嗯唔唔唔……|trans_en=Ungh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_114_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナイス！|text_cn=我要这个！|trans_en=Nice!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_114_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=覚えてろ～！|text_cn=给我等着！|trans_en=You'll pay for this!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_114_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=やった！|text_cn=好耶！|trans_en=Yes!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_114_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ……|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Hah...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_114_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅぅ……|text_cn=嗯唔唔唔……|trans_en=Unnngh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_114_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=楽勝～|text_cn=轻轻松松~|trans_en=Easy peasy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_114_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ゲームしよ～！|text_cn=陪我玩！|trans_en=Let's play!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_114_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=やるじゃ～ん！|text_cn=漂亮！|trans_en=Not too shabby!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_114_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_114_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=絶対勝つ！|text_cn=我要赢！|trans_en=I'll win for sure!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_114_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=イビルアイ――リミット解除。逃げ場はないよ！|text_cn=魔神之眼——解禁！你们无处可逃！|trans_en=Eye of the Demon—limit unleashed. There's no escape for you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_114_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=デストロイレーザー降臨。焼き払え――！|text_cn=降临吧，灭世之光，焚烧他们！|trans_en=Laser Destroyer, fire! Obliterate everything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_114_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ……負けてない……|text_cn=我还，没有输……|trans_en=I ... haven't lost...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_114_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=闇は……消えない……|text_cn=黑暗……不会消散……|trans_en=The darkness ... will never fade...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_114_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=デンデデー♪デデーン！|text_cn=噔噔噔噔~噔噔！|trans_en=Dun-dun-dun! ♪ Tadah!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_114_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=くっ…静まれ、体を駆け巡る漆黒の力！|text_cn=黑暗之力……正在体内奔涌！|trans_en=Ugh... Be still, the dark power coursing through my body!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_114_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=掴んだ！勝利につながるリズムの波動！|text_cn=胜利的节拍尽在掌握！|trans_en=I got it! The rhythm that leads to victory!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_114_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャトン様がサポートするから、トドメは任せるぜっ♪|text_cn=猫眼大人赐予你们黑暗的加护！|trans_en=The great Chaton has your back—deal the finishing blow! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_114_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまにはサポーターで貢献度も稼いどかないとね～|text_cn=多拿点助攻也行吧。|trans_en=Got to play support sometimes to rack up those endorsements!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_114_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ひーまー！ひーまー！ひ～～ま～～！！！なんか面白いことしようよ！|text_cn=好——无——聊——啊——！我们来找点乐子吧！|trans_en=I'm bored! I'm bored! I'm booored!!! Let's do something fun!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_114_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王と一緒なら～♪いつでもウィン、ウィン、ウィ～ン♪だよね！|text_cn=跟着魔王大人，就能赢！赢！赢！|trans_en=When I'm with you, it's always win, win, win! ♪ Am I right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_114_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=音楽聴きながらだと、いい感じに集中力上がるんだよね♪|text_cn=来首音乐边打边听吧！这样才有感觉！|trans_en=While I'm listening to music, I can focus better ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_114_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=塔に入った瞬間からウズウズして…もう限界！撃っていい！？|text_cn=我的手指好痒！等不及了！我现在就要扣动扳机！|trans_en=I've been itching to do this ever since we set foot in the Monolith... I'm at my limit! Can I attack?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_114_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=スナイパーに突撃が不可能かどうかは、シャトン様の立ち回りを見てから言ってくれる？|text_cn=谁说狙击手不能打前锋的，我今天就来给你好好演示一下~|trans_en=Think it's impossible for a sniper to charge? Say that again after you’ve seen the great Chaton's moves!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_114_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=難易度アップ？あたしは逃げも隠れもしないよ！|text_cn=难度提升？正合我意！|trans_en=The difficulty's going up? I won't run or hide!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_114_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい舞台があたしを待ってる！早く行こう！|text_cn=新的使命在召唤我们！我们走吧！|trans_en=A new stage awaits me! Let's hurry up and go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_114_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王！あのドリンク買って！シャトン様をパワーアップさせるためだと思って…ねっ？|text_cn=魔王！我要那个特饮！为了让猫眼大人爆发出毁天灭地的力量……快买给我嘛~|trans_en=Tyrant! Buy me that drink! Think of it as giving the great Chaton a power-up... Please?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_114_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここが闇に祝福されし場所…？ふっふ～、たしかに安心して休めそうだね♪|text_cn=这就是被黑暗眷顾之地吗？看来可以安心休息了。|trans_en=Is this the place blessed by the darkness...? Hehe, it certainly looks like a place to rest comfortably ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_114_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふ～ん？これも運命ってやつ？|text_cn=哼哼……是命运的指引吗？|trans_en=Hmm? Is this what you call fate? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_114_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=オールパーフェクト！|text_cn=完美！|trans_en=All perfect!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_114_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=弱すぎ～♪もう終わり？|text_cn=切，对面也太菜了。|trans_en=Too weak ♪ That all you got?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_114_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ～ん、シャトン様の実力にビビっちゃった～？|text_cn=哼哼，被猫眼大人的实力吓到了吧~|trans_en=Hehe, scared of the great Chaton's true power?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_114_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いえ～い！ハ～イタッチ～♪|text_cn=耶——！来击个掌吧！|trans_en=Yay! High five! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_114_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=え～、もう終わり～？もっと遊びたかったな～|text_cn=诶——就这？我还没玩够呢！|trans_en=What, we're done already? I wanted to hang out more...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_114_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=くっ…力を使いすぎたツケが…|text_cn=可恶，这就是代价吗？透支力量所换来的结局……|trans_en=Ugh... The cost of using too much power...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_114_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャトン様は負けたわけじゃないんだからね！|text_cn=别以为这样就结束了，我一定会回来的！|trans_en=The great Chaton has not lost!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_114_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうそう、あたしにぜ～んぶ任せといて♪|text_cn=早让我来不就好了？|trans_en=Yep yep, should have left everything to me ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_114_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャトン様、登場！はい拍手～♪|text_cn=猫眼登场！掌声在哪？|trans_en=The great Chaton is here! Now, let's hear some applause! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_114_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしがいれば、クリア確定♪|text_cn=叫上我准没错！|trans_en=With me here, victory's guaranteed! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_114_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=漆黒の闇は、常にシャトン様と共にあるのだ！|text_cn=黑暗与吾同在！|trans_en=The darkness of the abyss is always with me!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_114_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_114_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これはシャトン様の漆黒の力を込めた、闇の結晶だよ！ほらほら、食べてみて！<br/>え？闇の結晶っていうほど黒くない？いや、それは…苦すぎて、ミルクを足したから…|text_cn=此乃猫眼大人耗费全部心血，所凝结的黑暗之力的结晶！哼哼，快尝尝吧，魔王大人！欸？这个结晶为什么不够黑……？<br/>那是因为我觉得猫眼大人的黑暗太过苦涩，就、就多加了点牛奶……|trans_en=This is a dark crystal infused with my dark power! Here, here, try it!<br/>Huh? It's not black enough to be called a dark crystal? Well, that's because... It was too bitter, so I added milk...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_114_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日の深夜、魔王の中の漆黒の力が、頂点に達する気がする！<br/>ということは、眷属であるあたしの力も高まって、いよいよ覚醒できるかも…！？<br/>よーし、魔王！今夜は雪原で待ち合わせね！本気の勝負しよう！|text_cn=我能感觉到……魔王大人体内的黑暗之力将会在今日午夜达到巅峰！<br/>而我体内的黑暗之力也正在狂涌！准备好接受我的挑战了吗？我们在雪地里一决胜负！|trans_en=I have the feeling that late tonight, your dark power will reach its peak!<br/>Which means, as your follower, my power will increase and I may be able to awaken soon...!!<br/>All right, Tyrant! Let's meet on the snowfield tonight! And have a serious duel!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_114_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王、あけおめー！今年の計画は決まってる？あたしの計画はね…<br/>キミの力を完全復活させて、その漆黒の力で世界征服することだよ！にゃ～っはっはぁ！|text_cn=新年快乐~魔王大人，今年你有什么新的计划吗？哼哼……<br/>我的计划就是——督促你觉醒最深邃的黑暗之力，然后征服世界！喵哈哈哈！|trans_en=Tyrant, Happy New Year! Have you decided on your plan for this year? My plan is...<br/>To completely restore your power and use that dark power to rule the world! Nyahaha!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_114_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はシャトン様がこの世界に降り立った日だよ♪<br/>その生誕祭に、供物じゃなくてゲストとして参加できるとか、魔王は超ラッキーなんだから|text_cn=今日，即为猫眼大人降临此界的神圣之日，能作为祭品……啊不，作为贵宾出席这场庆典，将是你莫大的荣幸！|trans_en=Today is the day the great Chaton came down to this world ♪<br/>To be able to attend the festivities as a guest instead of an offering, you're super lucky.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_114_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_114_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王の生誕祭、それはつまり――世界に新たな秩序が生まれた日ってこと！<br/>それを祝ってシャトン様が特別なプレゼント用意したんだから、ちゃんと受け取ってよね♪|text_cn=魔王的诞辰正是打开新秩序大门的时刻！为此猫眼大人也为你精心准备了一份贺礼……好好收下吧，可别太感谢我哦~|trans_en=Your birthday celebration represents—the day a new order was born into the world!<br/>To celebrate that, I have prepared a special present. Make sure to accept it ♪}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_115_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マオーどしたの？ゆらゆらして、ゼリゼリのマネ？<br/>え？眠いだけ？|text_cn=你怎么软趴趴的，像冻冻？欸？困了？|trans_en=What's wrong, Tyrant? Wobbling around, imitating a Glopo?<br/>Hm? Just sleepy?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_115_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=マオーもシャロと一緒に遊ぶ？|text_cn=魔王，要不要和我一起去找夏洛克玩？|trans_en=Tyrant, you wanna play with Sherlock as well?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_115_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=起きてー、起きてー|text_cn=起床……起床啦！|trans_en=Get up, get up—}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_115_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お腹ペコい…でもニンジンはいらない|text_cn=饿了……但是，不要胡萝卜。|trans_en=Hungry... But I don't want carrots.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_115_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふあぁ……ねむ……|text_cn=呼哈……想睡觉……|trans_en=Fwaaah... Sleepy...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_115_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アバランチに触ってみたい？いいよ。はい――<br/>え？重くて持ち上がらない？ぜんぜん重くないのに…変なの|text_cn=你要玩玩这个吗？拿不起来？明明很轻啊……|trans_en=Wanna try touching Avalanche? Okay. Here—<br/>Hm? Too heavy to lift up? But it's not heavy at all... Strange.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_115_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=だいじょーぶ。ホタルがマオー守る|text_cn=没关系，我可以保护你。|trans_en=It's okay. I will protect Tyrant.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_115_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=モチモチでマルマル♪シャロかわいい、好き♪|text_cn=夏洛克可爱，因为夏洛克软乎乎，夏洛克一团团，嗯，喜欢。|trans_en=Softy and roundy... ♪ Sherlock is cute, I like ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_115_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁぁ…眠い…ホタル寝るから、なにかお話して？|text_cn=火垂累了，火垂要睡了。火垂要魔王讲故事。|trans_en=Fwah... I'm sleepy... I'm going to sleep. Can you tell me a story?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_115_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔、危ない場所？そんなことないよ<br/>オモチャはたくさんあるし、友だちもいるホタル、ここ好き♪|text_cn=星塔很危险？意思是星塔不好吗？但里面有玩具，还有朋友。<br/>火垂，喜欢！|trans_en=Are Monoliths dangerous places? No, not at all.<br/>There are lots of toys and friends. I like it here ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_115_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ニンジン、まっず…でもしっかり食べないと、背伸びない…<br/>センセーに言われたから、がまんして食べ…ぺっ|text_cn=胡萝卜……难吃……但是老师说，不吃的话就会长不高……<br/>所以，要忍耐……|trans_en=Carrots taste awful... But I have to eat them, or I won't grow taller.<br/>Professor said so, so I'll endure and ea... Bweh.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_115_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=あほげ違う。これ、ホタルの髪の毛<br/>でも…ときどきホタルの言うこと聞かないで、勝手にピコピコ動く…<br/>まったく、困ったやつ|text_cn=呆……毛……？<br/>你是说这个？只是普通的毛毛……但偶尔会不听话乱动，坏！|trans_en=It's not a stray hair. This is my hair.<br/>But... Sometimes it doesn't listen to me, and wags around on its own...<br/>Sigh, what a bother.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_115_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=お休みの過ごしかた？森に行って…塔に行って…あとシャロと遊ぶ|text_cn=放假安排？嗯……去森林，去塔里，玩夏洛克！|trans_en=How do I spend time off? Go to the forest... Go to Monoliths... And play with Sherlock.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_115_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=モフモフのシャロ、ホタルにくれるの？うれしい、ありがと<br/>お返しは…次会うときでいい？|text_cn=毛茸茸的……夏洛克！<br/>……欸？这个是送给我的？谢谢你……回礼，我下次会带给你的。|trans_en=Fluffy Sherlock! You're giving this to me? I'm so happy, thank you.<br/>Return gift... I'll give you next time we meet, is that okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_115_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=人にイジワルするのは悪い子。センセー言ってた<br/>だからホタル、悪い子にお尻ぺんぺんしてあげた|text_cn=欺负别人的是坏家伙，老师说了，坏家伙是要被打屁股的，所以……我只是打了他们的屁股！|trans_en=Doing mean things to people is what bad children do. Professor said so.<br/>So I gave bad children spanking.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_115_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=センセーにもらったマフラー、汚れてたから何回も洗った。いまはお日さまのいい匂い|text_cn=围巾……老师送的。<br/>之前不小心弄得脏脏，在水里洗了很久……现在是香香的！|trans_en=Professor gave me this scarf. It got dirty so I washed it many times. Now it smells like sunshine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_115_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日見た木のモンスターの体に、お花生えてた<br/>すごくきれいだったから…はい、マオーにあげる|text_cn=昨天，遇到了树树怪，它身上的花花好看，所以我掰下来了，送给你！|trans_en=Yesterday I saw a tree monster. It had flowers growing on its body.<br/>They were very pretty... Here, Tyrant, I got one for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_115_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタルの知らない人たちが、ホタルの知らないことばっかりお話ししてる<br/>友だちほしいけど、学校つまんない|text_cn=不想回学院的……原因？人都在说话，叽里咕噜，很吵，听不懂……|trans_en=People I don't know are talking about nothing but things I don't know.<br/>I want friends, but school is boring.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_115_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日、星ノ塔でゼリゼリたちのお風呂を見つけて…あ、ウソ<br/>昨日は学校行ってたから、ホタルなにも知らない。ゼリゼリ、お風呂、なんのこと？|text_cn=昨天在星塔，有个房间，里面有很多冻冻在洗澡……<br/>不、不对，昨天……有好好待在学院里，嗯嗯，我没有偷跑出去……|trans_en=Yesterday, I found a room in the Monolith where lots of Glopos were taking a bath... Ah, I lied.<br/>Yesterday I was at school, so I know nothing. Glopos? Bath? What do you mean?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_115_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナデナデよくない、背が伸びなくなるってセンセー言ってた<br/>でもマオーはいちばん大事な友だち。だからホタルをナデナデする許可あげる、おっけー|text_cn=不可以摸头……头被摸了，就会长不高。但，魔王是最好的朋友！<br/>所以……可以摸摸头！|trans_en=Petting me is not good. Professor said it will stop me from growing taller.<br/>But you're my most important friend. So I give you permission to pet me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_115_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=コハクねーねにお菓子もらった<br/>なんで『ねーね』？コハクねーねに言われただけだから、ホタルは知らない|text_cn=这个，是琥珀姐姐给我拿的零食……<br/>嗯？为什么叫她姐姐？火垂不知道，琥珀姐姐是这样说的。|trans_en=I got sweets from big sis Amber.<br/>Why "big sis"? That's just what big sis Amber told me. I don't know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_115_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=セイナ、おっきい犬みたい…かわいい。よしよしする？|text_cn=尘沙……好像狗狗……喜欢……|trans_en=Noya is like a big doggy...So cute. Should I pet her?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_115_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメは厳しいセンセーみたい。こわい…|text_cn=鸢尾……像学院里……让我背书的老师……好可怕。|trans_en=Iris is like a strict teacher. Scary...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_115_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=センセーはいい大人。ホタルのこと遊びに連れてってくれるし、おいしいものもくれる<br/>それに悪い子を追い払って、守ってくれるから|text_cn=老师是好人，她会带我去玩，给我买好吃的，还会把坏人赶走……！|trans_en=Professor is a good adult. Takes me out to play and gives me yummy food.<br/>She also drives away bad guys and protects me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_115_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=白い服で、鎌を持った変な人が、悪い子を追い払ってくれて、ケガも治してくれた<br/>代わりに…研究？付き合ってほしいって<br/>でも研究って、なんだろ？ホタルと一緒に遊びたいってこと？|text_cn=见到怪人，白色的，拿着镰刀，还把坏蛋打跑了，但她帮我包扎了，还说……<br/>费用？下次借她研究？是要我陪她玩吗……|trans_en=A person in white clothes with a scythe chased off bad guys and healed my wounds.<br/>But then... Research? She said she wanted me to help.<br/>But what is research? Does it mean she wants to play with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_115_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なーに？|text_cn=……怎么了？|trans_en=What?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_115_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=頭、ボサボサになっちゃう|text_cn=讨厌，毛毛乱了……|trans_en=My hair will get messy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_115_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=静か……あ。あそこにシャロがいる…と思ったらただの鳥だった|text_cn=好安静……嗯？那边好像有夏洛克。<br/>啊，是小鸟。|trans_en=Quiet... Ah. Sherlock is over there... Or so I thought, but it's just a bird.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_115_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャロも退屈？ねー？ホタルもチョー退屈|text_cn=夏洛克也很无聊吧，嗯，我也是。|trans_en=Sherlock, are you bored? I'm super bored too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_115_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなバタバタしてて、ホタルと遊んでくれない。つまんない…<br/>でもこっそり抜け出して遊びに行くなら、いまがチャンス|text_cn=呜，大家都很忙，不跟火垂玩……趁现在......偷偷溜出去玩吧！|trans_en=Everyone's so busy, no one will play with me. I'm bored...<br/>But if I am to sneak out and play, now is my chance.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_115_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=む…ホタルを学校に連れ戻しに来た？え、違う？なら一緒にあそぼっ！|text_cn=你也是来抓我回学校的吗？……原来不是啊，那来陪火垂玩吧！|trans_en=Hm... Are you here to take me back to school? Oh, you're not? Then let's play together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_115_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もうちょっとだけ…あそぼ？そしたらちゃんと帰る|text_cn=能……再玩一会吗？我会跟你回去的。|trans_en=Play ... just a little longer? Then I'll go home, really.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_115_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=勉強終わった。でもぜんぜん、わかんなかった|text_cn=……学完了，嗯，都不懂！|trans_en=I finished studying. But I didn't get it at all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_115_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタル、パワーアップ|text_cn=我很强的。|trans_en=Firefly, powered up.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_115_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、いつの話？|text_cn=欸……这是什么时候的事情？|trans_en=When did this happen?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_115_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ…いい音、好き|text_cn=这个……好听！喜欢！|trans_en=This ... is a nice sound. I like it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_115_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタル、ただの子供じゃない。だからマオーのことだって、ちゃんと守れる|text_cn=魔王，我不是小孩子，我可以保护你。|trans_en=I'm not just an ordinary kid. So I can protect Tyrant well.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_115_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタルと一緒に、思い出作ろ？|text_cn=可以请你……跟我一起创造回忆吗？|trans_en=Make memories together with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_115_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マオーはなにが欲しい？ホタルが祈願箱から取ってきてあげる|text_cn=魔王有什么喜欢的东西吗？你喜欢的，火垂从星塔的箱子里，拿给你。|trans_en=What do you want? I'll go get it from a Wishing Box for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_115_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一緒に遊んでくれるから、マオーは一番の友だち。ホタル、マオーと遊ぶの好き|text_cn=魔王，愿意陪我玩。魔王，是最最好的朋友。火垂，喜欢和魔王一起玩。|trans_en=Tyrant plays with me, so Tyrant is my best friend. I like playing with Tyrant.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_115_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マオーは星、好き？ホタル、いい場所知ってる<br/>夜になると、小さな星が、たくさんフワフワしてるの。今度一緒に見にいこ？|text_cn=魔王喜欢星星吗？嗯……我知道有个地方，晚上去的话，有会飞的星星，下次，带你去看好吗？|trans_en=Tyrant, do you like stars? I know a good place.<br/>When night comes, little stars floaty-floaty everywhere. Let's go see them together next time?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_115_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ゆっくりできる場所がお家？なら星ノ塔も、森の中も、シャロのぬいぐるみの山も…<br/>あとマオーの隣も。全部ホタルのお家|text_cn=听别人说，家是令人安心的地方。那……星塔里，森林里，夏洛克玩偶堆里，嗯……还有魔王身边，都是我的家。|trans_en=A place you can relax is home? Then the Monolith, the forest, the mountain of Sherlock plushies...<br/>And next to Tyrant. They're all my home.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_115_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マオーからの、プレゼント。ドキドキ、たのしみ|text_cn=魔王的礼物，好期待。|trans_en=A present from Tyrant. My heart's racing. Can't wait.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_115_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マオーはホタルの友だち。このプレゼント、マオーだと思って大切にする|text_cn=魔王，好朋友！礼物，喜欢！|trans_en=Tyrant is my friend. I'll treasure this gift, thinking of it as Tyrant.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_115_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マオーはいつも、ホタルに優しくしてくれる<br/>だからホタルも、マオーに優しくする|text_cn=魔王，对火垂好。火垂，也会对魔王好。|trans_en=Tyrant is always kind to me.<br/>So I will be kind to Tyrant too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_115_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん|text_cn=嗯，嗯！|trans_en=Mhm.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_115_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=や|text_cn=不要。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_115_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Eh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_115_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん？|text_cn=这是……什么？|trans_en=Hm?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_115_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ……|text_cn=呜……|trans_en=Uugh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_115_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=おぉ…|text_cn=呜哇……！|trans_en=Ohh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_115_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=む…|text_cn=你……！|trans_en=Grr...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_115_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=わーい|text_cn=我很开心。|trans_en=Yay!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_115_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ……|text_cn=嗯……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_115_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=一緒にあそぼ？|text_cn=要不要去玩？|trans_en=Play with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_115_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=遊んでたら、壊れちゃった…しゅんしゅん…|text_cn=不小心弄坏了……|trans_en=I was playing with it, and it broke... Sad...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_115_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=森に行きたい？ならホタルが案内する|text_cn=想去森林的话，我可以带路。|trans_en=Wanna go to the forest? Then, I'll guide you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_115_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタル、食べ物スキキライしない|text_cn=我没有挑食……|trans_en=I'm not picky about food.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_115_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_115_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=モフッ！モフッ！|text_cn=是毛茸茸……！|trans_en=Fluff! Fluff!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_115_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アバランチ、ボコボコモード――攻撃開始<br/>必勝――ぼんぼんブレード|text_cn=雪崩生气了！开启哔唷哔唷形态！必胜——崩崩剑！|trans_en=Avalanche, beatdown mode—initiate attack.<br/>Unbeatable—Bon Bon Blade.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_115_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ピカピカ～、ホタルが盛り上げてあげる<br/>一緒に遊ぼ？それじゃ、まずはホタルの番ね。やぁ～|text_cn=开派对！火垂，让这里热闹~火垂——来切蛋糕！|trans_en=Twinkle, tinkle, I will liven things up.<br/>Wanna play together? Then, first it's my turn. Yaah~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_115_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=目がクルクル……|text_cn=火垂怎么在转圈……？|trans_en=My head is spinning...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_115_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ……つまんない……|text_cn=这不好玩……|trans_en=This is boring...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_115_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい、おもちゃ？|text_cn=新的玩具？|trans_en=A new ... toy?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_115_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ…好き！|text_cn=这个……喜欢！|trans_en=This... I like!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_115_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタルはいい子。ご褒美、もらう|text_cn=火垂，是好孩子。好孩子，会有奖励~|trans_en=I'm a good girl. I get ... rewards.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_115_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=手、ニギニギ。これでホタルと友だち～♪|text_cn=手拉手，好朋友~|trans_en=Hands, holdy holdy. Now you're my friend ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_115_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタルがお空に連れてってあげる|text_cn=火垂带你飞高高！|trans_en=I'll take you to the sky!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_115_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャロシャロ～ぺんぎん～♪|text_cn=夏洛克♫♪~是企鹅♫♪~|trans_en=Sherlock, Sherlock~ Penguin ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_115_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタルと塔に来たこと、センセーにはナイショ|text_cn=我偷偷来这里的事，不要告诉老师……|trans_en=Don't tell professor that you came to the Monolith with me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_115_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=学校より、星ノ塔がたのしい|text_cn=不想去学校……|trans_en=Monoliths are more fun than school.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_115_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=大丈夫、ぜったい迷惑かけない。ホタルとマオーの約束|text_cn=火垂和魔王拉勾勾，保证，不闯祸。|trans_en=It's okay, I won't be any trouble. It's our promise.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_115_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=たのしい場所、たくさん知ってる<br/>ホタルについてきて|text_cn=带你去噼啪噼啪卟噜卟噜的好玩地方~|trans_en=I know lots of fun places.<br/>Follow me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_115_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここの、おもちゃ…ちょっと危ない？|text_cn=这里的玩具，会有一点凶。|trans_en=Toys here ... are a little dangerous?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_115_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい遊園地…！わくわく！|text_cn=新的游乐园！开心~|trans_en=A new amusement park...! Exciting!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_115_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミドリの店員がいるお店|text_cn=这里是绿色店员在的商店。|trans_en=A shop with an employee in green.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_115_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなでお休み|text_cn=这边是休息的地方。|trans_en=Everyone, take a break.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_115_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誰かいる。怖い人じゃない？|text_cn=……可怕的人？不是可怕的人？|trans_en=Someone's here. Is it a scary person?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_115_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たのしかった。けど足りない|text_cn=好玩，开心，没玩够。|trans_en=That was fun. But not enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_115_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ…もう終わり？|text_cn=这就……结束了？|trans_en=Eh... Over already?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_115_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=もっとオモチャで遊びたい|text_cn=该去找新玩具了……|trans_en=I want to play with toys more.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_115_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ぴーす？こう？|text_cn=……耶，是这样比吗？|trans_en=Peace? Like this?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_115_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご褒美に、新しいオモチャちょーだい|text_cn=奖励……有新玩具吗！|trans_en=As a reward, please give me a new toy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_115_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=痛い…|text_cn=好痛……|trans_en=It hurts...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_115_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタルは強い子…|text_cn=……火垂，很坚强，不会哭。|trans_en=I'm a strong girl...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_115_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタル、行きます|text_cn=火垂，准备出击。|trans_en=Here I go.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_115_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=遊ぶの、わくわく|text_cn=出去玩，好期待。|trans_en=Playing—I'm excited.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_115_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=お出かけ、うきうき|text_cn=要出门吗？开心。|trans_en=Going out—so much fun.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_115_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=センセー、褒めてくれるかな？|text_cn=火垂，表现好，老师，会表扬。|trans_en=Will professor praise me?}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_115_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_115_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は大切な友だちに、チョコレートをあげる特別な日<br/>だからこれ…はい、ホタルからマオーにプレゼント<br/>センセーに教えてもらったリボンの結びかた、うまくできなかったけど…がんばって包んだ|text_cn=今天……很特别？大家都送，巧克力。火垂也有。给你，很甜！<br/>绑带是……跟老师学的，火垂绑不好，好可惜。|trans_en=Today is a special day when you give chocolate to special friends.<br/>So... Here, a present, from Firefly to Tyrant.<br/>I couldn't tie the ribbon the way professor taught me very well, but... I did my best to wrap it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_115_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あっちもこっちも、雪で真っ白♪<br/>ホタル、1年いい子にしてたし、クリスマスツリーの精霊、ちゃんと願い事叶えてくれる？|text_cn=下雪了，到处都白白的。火垂，今年努力当好孩子了。雪愿树精灵，会给我礼物吗？|trans_en=It's completely white with snow everywhere ♪<br/>I've been a good girl all year, so will the Snowish Festival Tree Spirit really grant my wish?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_115_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=カレンダー、ぴかぴか。新しい1年の始まり。今年もいっぱい、ホタルと遊んでくれる？|text_cn=日历翻过去了。说是……新年。旧的纸，不要了。换成新的。魔王……今天也要，一起玩。|trans_en=The calendar is brand new. The start of a new year. Will you play with me a lot this year too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_115_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=センセーが言ってた。今日はホタルの誕生日だって<br/>ホタル、これでまたひとつ大人に近づいた？大人になったから、背もいまより伸びる？<br/>もくひょーは、マオーよりおっきくなること！|text_cn=生日……是不是就长大了？那火垂，可以长高了。要变得比魔王还高！|trans_en=Professor was telling me. She said today is my birthday.<br/>Did I get one more step closer to adulthood? When I become an adult, will I get taller than I am now?<br/>My goal is to become bigger than Tyrant!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_115_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_115_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はマオーの誕生日。だからホタル、プレゼント用意しようと思った<br/>でも…お金持ってないから、代わりに森で、これ拾ってきた<br/>なにかわからないけど…キラキラ光ってて、きれいうれしい？|text_cn=魔王的生日。火垂……没有钱。但是，有这个！<br/>森林里捡的。亮亮的，会发光……很好看。送给魔王。|trans_en=Today is your birthday. So I thought I would prepare a gift.<br/>But... I don't have money, so instead, I found this in the forest.<br/>I don't know what it is, but... It's sparkly and pretty. Are you happy?}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_116_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふんふふんふふ～ん♪ふんふふんふ――おわぁっ！？<br/>…って、魔王さんかぁ。急に声かけられてびっくりしちゃったよ～|text_cn=哼哼~♪<br/>——呜哇！啊……吓我一跳，原来是你来了啊~|trans_en=La la lalala la la♪ La lala lala—<br/>Wagh! Oh, it's you, Boss. Oh, my gosh! You really startled me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_116_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、魔王さ～ん！焼きたてのおイモはいかが？来ると思って、とっておいたよ|text_cn=快来快来~刚烤好的红薯，特地给你留的！|trans_en=Hi, Boss! Want a baked sweet potato? I saved one for you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_116_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おっはよ～！朝どれの野菜で作ったサンドイッチでも食べない？|text_cn=早安~我刚从地里摘了菜，要一起吃蔬菜三明治吗？|trans_en=Good morning! Want a nice fresh veggie sandwich?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_116_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=温室の中ってすっごく暑いけど…草むしりするならいまの時間になっちゃうんだよね～|text_cn=中午的太阳好晒呀……不过，这个时候最适合除草了。|trans_en=It's so hot inside the greenhouse... But now would be the time to pull weeds.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_116_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=むにゃむにゃ…はっ…！？<br/>ダメダメ、まだ起きてなきゃ…！じゃないと、食べものを盗まれちゃうかもだから…！|text_cn=不能睡……一睡……粮食就要被偷走了……|trans_en=Zzz... <br/>Huh?! No! I can't fall asleep! Someone will run off with all my food!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_116_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日は星がきれいだったね～<br/>空って畑に、星って種が蒔かれてたみたいにいっぱい光ってて…<br/>…もしかして、しばらくしたら、キラキラ光る野菜が育ったりするのかな？|text_cn=昨晚的星星特别漂亮~我觉得星星就像是夜晚的种子……说不定能种出会发光的蔬菜呢！|trans_en=The stars were so beautiful last night. <br/>The night sky is like a field full of sparkling seeds. <br/>I wonder if bright, shining plants will grow one day!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_116_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=食糧庫って、幸せだよね<br/>いっぱい貯まった食べものを眺めて、どうやって食べるか考えてると…<br/>本当に、しあわせぇ…えへへ|text_cn=我觉得最幸福的事，就是窝在地窖里，一边看着满满当当的食物，一边想着要怎么把它们都吃完……嘿嘿……|trans_en=I just love storehouses. <br/>It's so much fun to look at all the food and think of all the yummy ways to eat it!<br/>It's the best! Hee hee!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_116_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この肥料…ちょっとだけ効きめが強いかも…？<br/>って、うわぁ！？ちょっとってレベルじゃなく、効いちゃってるかも～！？|text_cn=这个营养剂的效果太难控制了，看来之后还要继续调整配方才行……啊，现在不是说这种话的时候！|trans_en=This fertilizer might be a little strong... <br/>Wait, whoa! It's not just a little strong, it looks like it's super strong!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_116_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ～、これは…野菜の品種改良をしてたら…なんかすごいことになっちゃった<br/>あ、あはは…|text_cn=我试着改良了一下这种植物的特性，但还是搞砸了……|trans_en=Oh, my... I was trying to breed some vegetables and... Well, these sure are some results.<br/>Ah ha ha...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_116_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔に隠したものは、他の人にあんまり見つけられないって聞いたけど…<br/>食べものも隠せるのかな…？たぶん星骸はごはんを食べないだろうし…|text_cn=我听说有人会把宝物藏到星塔里……那我要是把粮食也放进去，是不是就不会被偷啦？<br/>星骸应该……不需要吃饭吧？|trans_en=I heard that things hidden in a Monolith are hard for other people to find... <br/>Does that include food? Stellaroids probably don't eat people food anyway...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_116_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=食べものを盗みにきたウッドモットさんたちなら、もう追い払ったよ。だから安心して！|text_cn=我刚刚赶跑了想偷粮食的树树鼠，现在可以放心啦~|trans_en=I already chased those Shrubshrews who came to steal our food away. No need to worry!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_116_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん？このシャベルが気になるの？この子、すごいんだよ～<br/>穴を掘ったり、実を切ったり、戦うのにも使えるし、それに、お料理だってできちゃうの！|text_cn=这把铲子很好用的，可以用来挖坑，修剪枝芽，赶走小偷，还能用来当雨伞，当煎锅……<br/>总之，没有它做不到的事。|trans_en=Hm? Oh, this shovel? It's amazing!<br/>Not only is it good for digging, but it's great for cutting fruit, fighting, and even cooking!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_116_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=人と話さなくていいし、なんならゆっくり野菜を育てる時間もあるし…<br/>アグリ・ユニオンのお仕事ってすっごく楽しいんだ～|text_cn=在联合种业的工作？我觉得很好啊……平时也不用和人打交道，还有时间种地。这样安安静静的，感觉很舒服。|trans_en=I don't have to talk to anyone, and I have time to relax and grow veggies... <br/>I just love working for United Harvest!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_116_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=みて、魔王さん。このカボチャ、私が改良した、新種なんだよ～<br/>甘くてやわらかくて、ほんのりフルーティーで…お菓子感覚で食べられるすごいカボチャなの<br/>まあ…あんまり大きく育たないところが玉に瑕なんだけど…|text_cn=最近我试着培育了一种新型南瓜，吃起来甜甜糯糯的，还有点淡淡的果香，像在吃蛋糕一样，可惜个头太小了，怎么都长不大……|trans_en=Look, Boss! This is a squash variety I bred. <br/>It's sweet and soft, almost like fruit. You can almost eat it like candy, even. <br/>The only real downside is that they don't grow very big.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_116_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=大ニュース大ニュース！魔王さん、この新聞みて！<br/>…え？もうみんな知ってる？そもそも去年の話？<br/>はぇ～？本当だぁ。いつの間にそんな時間が経ってたんだろう？|text_cn=大事不好了，魔王，快看！这份报纸的头条上写了……<br/>诶？你早就知道了？<br/>原来这是去年的报纸……外面的世界变化好快啊……|trans_en=Hey, there's some big news! Look at this newspaper! <br/>Everyone already knows? What? This happened last year? <br/>Oh! It did! How did the time go by so fast?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_116_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昔ね、災害で食べ物が手に入らなくなっちゃって、苦しい思いをしたことがあるの<br/>それ以来、ごはんを食べるしあわせに目覚めちゃったっていうか…なんか、そんな感じ|text_cn=我小时候遇到过天灾，有好长一段时间都吃不饱饭……<br/>所以现在啊，我总觉得，只要能吃上好吃的饭，就是最幸福的事了~|trans_en=A long time ago, there was a disaster and I had a really hard time finding any food. <br/>That's what really made me appreciate just being able to have a meal ... or something!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_116_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アグリ・ユニオンの仕事は気に入ってるけど…ちょっと怖い噂も聞くから、心配になるんだよね<br/>使われなくなったはずの農業試験場で、よくわからない改良植物を作ってるみたいだし…<br/>収穫量を増やすことにも、作ったものの味にも興味なさそうだし…私、どうしたらいいんだろう？|text_cn=其实有时候，我觉得现在的联合种业很可怕。不再关心怎么提高农作物的产量，也不在意开发的食品好不好吃……<br/>甚至连以前的试验田，都拿来培育一些我搞不懂作用的变异植物。要是他们以后再也不种普通的农作物了，那可怎么办啊？！|trans_en=I really like working at United Harvest, but ... sometimes I worry because I hear some scary rumors.<br/>I heard they're breeding some weird plants at a supposedly abandoned agricultural lab.<br/>And they don't seem to be doing it to improve the yield or flavor, so... I'm not sure what to do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_116_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん、魔王さん！よかったら、今日は私のうちでお夕飯、食べていかない？<br/>味見してほしいものがあるから、遠慮しないできてほしいな|text_cn=魔王魔王，今天要过来吃晚饭吗？我有好多东西都想让你尝尝。|trans_en=Boss! Boss! Would you like to come to my place for dinner tonight? <br/>There's something I'd really like for you to try, so I sure hope you'll take me up on it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_116_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そういえばこの前、森で魔王さんに似てるお花を見つけたんだ<br/>それで、一輪だけ植え替えて、食糧庫に飾ってあるんだよ<br/>おかげで最近は食糧庫にいると、魔王さんも近くにいるみたいで、とってもしあわせなんだ～♪|text_cn=之前在野外发现了一种小花，不知道叫什么名字，但是给我的感觉就像你一样。<br/>我摘了一朵，进行移栽后放在了床头，这样的话，以后一睁眼就能看到你啦。|trans_en=Oh! You know, I found a flower that looks just like you in the forest the other day.<br/>So, I put one in a pot and put it in the storehouse.<br/>Now every time I go in, I'm so happy because it's like you're there with me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_116_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また食糧庫を拡張してみたんだ。魔王さんが泊まれる、広いスペースも作っておいたから<br/>たまにでいいから遊びにきてね！たーっぷりおもてなしするから！|text_cn=我把地窖又扩大了一圈，特意给你留了个舒服又宽敞的房间。<br/>你要是什么时候觉得累了，就来我这里吧，我们可以一直窝在一起，想待多久就待多久！|trans_en=I expanded the storehouse again! Now it's nice and big so you can stay here anytime! <br/>I hope you come by, even just sometimes! I'll take eeextra good care of you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_116_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここだけの話…龍璟樓で使ってる食材って、だいたい全部、私が作ったものなんだよ<br/>だから龍璟樓がおいしいって褒められてると、私も一緒に褒められてるみたいで…<br/>なんか、心が満たされるんだ…お料理の話だから、お腹は空いてきちゃうけど…|text_cn=怀璟食府平时用的食材有好多都是我提供的。<br/>看到自己的劳动成果被做成可口的菜肴，就会觉得特别满足……|trans_en=So, don't tell anyone, but ... Jing's Bistro actually gets most of its ingredients from me.<br/>Anytime someone compliments the restaurant's food, I feel like they're complimenting me too!<br/>It makes my heart feel full ... but talking about food always makes my tummy feel empty!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_116_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=フィレンさんって知ってる？会うとなんだか、胸がきゅっとするというか、オーラがあるよね<br/>レモンが好きってきいたけど…品種改良の参考に、ちょっと意見きいてみたいな～|text_cn=翡冷翠小姐气场真强啊……每次见到她，我都会不自觉地屏住呼吸……<br/>但听说她很喜欢吃柠檬？好想了解一下她喜欢哪个品种的柠檬啊……|trans_en=Do you know Firenze? She has this aura that makes me nervous around her.<br/>I heard she likes lemons... I'd like to ask for her opinion on some that I'm breeding right now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_116_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ニュクスさん、たまに私の温室に忍びこんで寝てるんだよね…<br/>でも、こっそり野菜を育ててるのを見ても報告とかしてないし…たぶん、いい人なんだよね…？|text_cn=星雁小姐有时候会溜进温室睡觉，所以知道我偷偷在温室种菜，不过她说会帮我保密，真是个好人啊……|trans_en=Nyx sometimes sneaks into my greenhouse and sleeps in it. <br/>But she never tells on me for secretly growing vegetables, so ... I guess she's an okay person?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_116_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセさんってすごいよね！すっごくお米に詳しいんだよ！<br/>いつか私の作ったお米、食べてくれないかなぁ|text_cn=千都世小姐，对米的研究很深入呢！要是有机会请她来试吃一下我种的米就好了。|trans_en=Chitose is so amazing! <br/>She knows so much about rice! I hope she'll try mine some time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_116_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=フリージアさん、だっけ？ほら、あのヨロズ配達の。<br/>ずいぶん前だけど、遠くまで花の種を届けてくれたから、いつかお礼がしたいなって<br/>おいしいお野菜とか、プレゼントしたらよろこぶかな？ニンジンとか、どうだろう？|text_cn=万送屋的那个信使，是叫苍兰吗？她之前跑了好远的路帮我送花种，我一直都很想感谢她。<br/>要不……我包一些好吃的胡萝卜送给她？|trans_en=Freesia, was it? You know, the one from Post Haste. <br/>It was a long time ago, but she once delivered some flower seeds from far away for me. <br/>I wonder if she'd like some nice veggies? Maybe some nice carrots...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_116_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うわぁ、なになに？お腹でもすいたの？<br/>なら、おいしいトウモロコシがあるから、食べていってよ！|text_cn=饿了吗？我这里有很好吃的玉米哦~|trans_en=Gah! What is it? <br/>Are you hungry? I've got some really good corn! You've gotta have some!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_116_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=むにゃむにゃ…ハッ…！？もしかして泥棒！？ど、どこにいるの！？|text_cn=欸？！有小偷？在哪！|trans_en=Zzz... Wha?! Is there a burglar here? Sh-Show yourself!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_116_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=暇してるとなんか…ちょっとお腹、すいてきちゃうね|text_cn=有点饿了……|trans_en=When I'm bored, I always get kinda hungry.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_116_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふんふんふふ～ん♪静かなのは好きだから、こういう時間も悪くないなって|text_cn=这样安安静静的，也挺好~|trans_en=La lalala la! ♪ I love the quiet, so I'm pretty much okay with this!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_116_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=次の星ノ塔の探索には、どんな野菜を持って行こう…<br/>ジャガイモ、サツマイモ、カボチャ、ニンジン、キャベツ…<br/>う～ん…これだけあれば足りるかな～？|text_cn=下次去星塔带些什么好呢……土豆，红薯，南瓜，玉米，胡萝卜，卷心菜……<br/>嗯，只屯这么一点好像不够啊……|trans_en=Which veggies should I bring on our next Monolith adventure? <br/>Potatoes, sweet potatoes, squash, carrots, cabbage... <br/>Hmm... Will that be enough?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_116_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめまして。アグリ・ユニオンのレイセンだよ<br/>え？私の温室に入ってみたい？あ、いやぁ…それはちょっと…|text_cn=我是联合种业的温室管理员岭川，初次见面，请、请多指教……|trans_en=Nice to meet you. I'm Ridge with United Harvest. <br/>Hm? Wanna come inside my greenhouse? Uh, well, uh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_116_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、魔王さん！これ、私が温室で育てたお野菜だよ！仲良くなった証に、貰ってくれる？|text_cn=这次……我给你带了一点礼物！<br/>是我种的蔬菜，刚从地里摘的，很新鲜很好吃哦。|trans_en=Hey, Boss! I grew these veggies in my greenhouse! Will you take them as a sign of our friendship?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_116_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=野菜も力も、手をかけたぶんだけ大きく成長するんだよ！|text_cn=精心照料，就能茁壮成长。|trans_en=Both veggies and power grow when you care for them!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_116_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これだけ強くなれば、食べものをとられる心配はだいぶ減ったよね！|text_cn=现在的话，应该能好好守住粮食了吧？|trans_en=Now I can worry a lot less about my food getting stolen!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_116_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう怖がったりしないってば！ホントだよぉ～…！|text_cn=我、我现在已经不怕了……真的！|trans_en=I won't be afraid anymore! I'm not lying!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_116_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お野菜も、音楽を聴いて育つと、おっきくなるんだよ～！|text_cn=给植物放放音乐，能让它们长得更好喔~|trans_en=Plants grow bigger when you play music for them!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_116_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつか、私だけの畑がほしいってずっと思ってるんだ<br/>そこで好きなお野菜や植物を、いっぱい育てたいな～|text_cn=总有一天，我会拥有属于自己的超大田地，想种什么种什么。|trans_en=I've always wanted my own piece of land. <br/>I'd grow so many crops and plants on it as I like!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_116_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=う、うわぁ！？なんかツタがすごいことに…！<br/>ま、魔王さん…！助けてぇ～…！このままだと、逃げられなくなっちゃいそうだよぉ～…！|text_cn=呜呜……怎么会变成这样……<br/>魔王，快帮帮我……我一个人没办法……！|trans_en=Wh-Wha?! Wow, this ivy's out of control! <br/>Boss! Help me! I'm afraid I won't be able to run away!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_116_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=う～ん…最近、品種改良がうまくいかないなぁ～<br/>魔王さんって頭いいし、なにかいい解決策とか知ってたりしない？|text_cn=最近在改良作物上遇到了一点困难……魔王，你懂的这么多，能不能给我出出主意呢？|trans_en=Hmm... My breeding's not going so well lately. <br/>Hey, Boss! You're smart. Do you have any good ideas?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_116_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今度、うちに来てごはん食べない？<br/>魔王さんのこと話したら、おかあさんがお礼したいって言ってて…<br/>ついでにごはんも作ってくれると思うから…おかあさんの料理、おいしいし…どう、かな？|text_cn=明天要不要去我家做客？妈妈总听我说起你的事，想要感谢你对我的照顾……<br/>让我一定要带你回家吃饭。她会做很多好吃的喔~我、我也会一起帮忙！所以……要来吗？|trans_en=Wanna come to my place for dinner?<br/>I told my mom about you, and she wants to thank you. <br/>She'll probably make something really nice for dinner, too. Well? What do you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_116_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このあいだ改良を手伝ってもらった野菜、魔王さんのおかげでうまくいったよ！<br/>それで…新種だし、名前を付けようと思うんだけど…<br/>魔王さんと私で作ったふたりの子みたいなものだし…一緒に名前、考えてみない…？|text_cn=之前培育的新品种，性状已经表现得很稳定了。嘻嘻，每当看到自己培育的作物茁壮成长，就像看到自己的孩子那样喜悦……<br/>你帮我给它起个名字好不好？|trans_en=Your help with that veggie I was breeding really paid off!<br/>So... I've been thinking about the name for this new variety and...<br/>If you think about it, it's kind of like a baby we made together, so ... can you help me name it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_116_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ずっとひとりで黙々とお野菜を作ってるのがしあわせだと思ってたんだけど…<br/>魔王さんと一緒に農作業したり、お出かけするのも悪くないって、最近は思うんだ<br/>だから、今度さ。私の知らないおもしろいところに、連れてってほしいんだけど…いいかな？|text_cn=之前，我一直觉得在家呆着最舒服了，有堆得满满的食物，也不用跟人有交流……<br/>但是，认识了魔王之后，感觉偶尔出去看看也挺好的。<br/>要是能经历一些只有我们才会觉得有趣的事情，我一定会特别特别开心。<br/>那个……下次可以带我一起吗？|trans_en=I always thought I'd be happy just quietly growing vegetables all by myself...<br/>But farming and going places with you is actually not bad.<br/>So... I'd love to go somewhere interesting I've never been before... Can you take me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_116_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私にくれるの？ありがとう！なんだろ、花の種とかかな？|text_cn=送给我的？谢谢~会是花种吗？|trans_en=Is this for me? Thank you! Ooh, could it be flower seeds?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_116_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わあ、ありがとう！食糧庫で厳重に保管するね！|text_cn=这个……我要放进地窖里好好保存起来！|trans_en=Wow, thanks! I'll lock it up nice and safe in the storehouse!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_116_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この嬉しい気持ち…うまく言葉にできないから…<br/>お返しに、集めたおいしいもの、いっぱいわけてあげるね！|text_cn=我其实不太会表达感谢……但可以分给你很多好吃的~|trans_en=This happiness ... it's hard to put into words.<br/>In return, I'll share all the yummy things I've collected with you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_116_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん！|text_cn=好~|trans_en=Yup!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_116_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメ！|text_cn=不可以！|trans_en=No!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_116_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんでぇ～？|text_cn=怎么会这样……|trans_en=Whyyy?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_116_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あれ…？|text_cn=咦？|trans_en=Uh, what?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_116_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなぁ～…！|text_cn=不要……|trans_en=Noooo...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_116_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=おお～っ！|text_cn=啊——！|trans_en=Ohhh!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_116_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=もうっ！|text_cn=这是我的！|trans_en=Grr!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_116_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=わあ～！|text_cn=太好了~|trans_en=Wooow!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_116_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_116_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、すっごくおいしいんだよ！|text_cn=这个很好吃的！|trans_en=This is really delicious!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_116_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の食べもの、とらないでぇ～！|text_cn=不要偷我的食物！|trans_en=Don't take my food from me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_116_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=おっきくなぁ～れ♪|text_cn=快快长大~|trans_en=Grow up big and strong! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_116_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=びっくりしたぁ～…|text_cn=吓、吓死我了……|trans_en=That surprised me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_116_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_116_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=た、助けてぇ～…！|text_cn=请帮帮我！|trans_en=H-Heeelp!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_116_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=収穫楽しみだね！<br/>…って、ちょっとぉ～！？|text_cn=嘿咻——啊！还给我！|trans_en=This'll be a good harvest!<br/>Wait, what?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_116_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=大きくなぁれ！…って、種返してぇ～！|text_cn=快快长大吧……呀——|trans_en=Grow, grow! Wait, gimme back my seeds!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_116_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…ごはんどこぉ～…？|text_cn=呜……呜呜……|trans_en=Ugh... Where's some food?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_116_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=おなか…ぺこぺこぉ…|text_cn=好饿啊……|trans_en=I'm ... starving...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_116_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これでもっと収穫が増えそうだね！|text_cn=这样的话，收获就会更多吧？|trans_en=This'll make for a bigger harvest!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_116_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これで、食べ物を奪われる心配はなくなりそうだね！|text_cn=有了这个，我们的储备粮就更安全了！|trans_en=Now I don't have to worry about food getting stolen!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_116_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の力の芽、だいぶ伸びたと思わない？|text_cn=力量的种子，发芽了吗？|trans_en=My power's sprouted a lot, don'tcha think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_116_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごはんのことなら私に任せて！|text_cn=我来负责大家的伙食。|trans_en=Leave the food to me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_116_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなでいっぱい収穫できそうだね|text_cn=我不会让大家的辛苦白费的。|trans_en=We'll all be able to harvest a lot!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_116_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おなかすいてたりしない？たべものい～っぱい持ってきたから、私のわけてあげるよ|text_cn=我带了很多干粮噢，饿了就来找我拿吧。|trans_en=You hungry or anything? I brought looootsa food, so I can give you some.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_116_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなに広い場所があるのになにも育ててないなんて…もったいないと思わない？ね？|text_cn=这个地方好大啊，但是什么东西都没种……好浪费。|trans_en=I can't believe there's so much land here and no one's growing anything on it! Crazy, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_116_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=敵に見つかりませんように…|text_cn=看不见我……看不见我……|trans_en=I hope enemies don't find us...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_116_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔の中に肉まん屋さんがあるってホント？ちょっと…行ってみたいかも…？|text_cn=听说星塔里有卖肉包子的店……真的有吗？想去看看……|trans_en=Is it true there's a pork bun shop inside Monoliths? I... kinda wanna try it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_116_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔の中ってさ、種を蒔いといたら、次きた時に芽が生えてたり…しないかな？|text_cn=如果在这里埋一些种子的话，下次进来时它们会发芽吗？|trans_en=If you plant a seed inside a Monolith, will it sprout the next time you go in?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_116_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなに攻略がしんどいなら…もっと食べもの、持ってくればよかったなぁ…|text_cn=要是知道会这么危险，就应该多带点食物的……|trans_en=If I knew this would be so hard... I woulda brought lots more food...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_116_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめて来る場所だけど…大丈夫かなぁ？|text_cn=好陌生的地方……好像有点可怕……|trans_en=I've never been here before... I hope it's okay.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_116_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あとあと使えるかもだし、買えるだけ買っとこ～っと|text_cn=多买一点吧，万一之后用得上呢？|trans_en=These are always useful, so let's get as much as we can.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_116_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…あ、お菓子でも食べる？いっぱい持ってきたんだ～♪|text_cn=要吃点零食吗，我带了很多喔~|trans_en=Phew... Hey, want some snacks? I brought a whole bunch! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_116_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私って、人見知りだからさ…交渉とかは、任せちゃいたいな～なんちゃって…|text_cn=那个……交涉之类的事，可以麻烦你去吗？|trans_en=I'm a pretty shy person... Could I, like, leave the negotiating to you or something? Hee hee.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_116_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これでもう安全だよ|text_cn=这下安全了。|trans_en=Now we're safe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_116_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=食べもの…こぼしたりしてないよね！？|text_cn=饭……没撒吧？！|trans_en=We didn't drop any food, did we?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_116_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=静かだと落ち着くなぁ…|text_cn=还是安静的地方好啊……|trans_en=Ah, the quiet is nice...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_116_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=収穫完了～！|text_cn=大丰收~！|trans_en=Harvest complete!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_116_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=努力は実を結ぶんだね！|text_cn=努力终会开花结果！|trans_en=Hard work pays off!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_116_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごはん食べて元気だそっか…|text_cn=要不……先去吃饭吧？|trans_en=A little food will make us feel better...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_116_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんな、ごめんね…|text_cn=对、对不起……|trans_en=I'm sorry, everyone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_116_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=知らない人ばっかりだと緊張する…|text_cn=有点不自在……|trans_en=I get nervous around lotsa people I don't know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_116_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=人がいっぱいで人酔いしちゃいそう…|text_cn=人好多，好紧张。|trans_en=There's so many people I might get dizzy...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_116_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=知らない人が多くても…がんばって種まきしなきゃ…！|text_cn=再努力一下……|trans_en=Even if there are lotsa people I don't know... I need to plant seeds!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_116_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、うん…収穫の準備はできてるよ|text_cn=嗯……我准备好了。|trans_en=Uh, yeah... Harvest preparations are complete.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_116_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_116_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい、チョコレート！今日って、そういう日なんでしょ？<br/>私がカカオから育てた手作りで、きっとすーっごく甘いから！ゆっくり味わって食べてね|text_cn=听说这个日子里大家会给重要的人送巧克力，所以我为了这一天，早早就种好了可可。<br/>这是我做的巧克力，请收下吧，很甜的喔~|trans_en=Here's some chocolate! That's what we do on this day, right? <br/>I grew the cacao myself, and I bet it's super sweet! Savor each and every one, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_116_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんかアグリ・ユニオンのクリスマスパーティーに招待されちゃった<br/>プレゼント交換もあるみたいだけど…私が育てたジャガイモとか、喜んでもらえるかな？<br/>ひとりじゃ不安だし…魔王さんも一緒にきてくれたら心強いんだけど…どうかな？|text_cn=有熟人邀请我去参加联合种业的节日聚会，好像还会交换礼物。我该带什么比较好……带点我种的土豆可以吗？<br/>那个，我一个人去的话……感觉会有些不自在……那个，你能陪我一起去吗？|trans_en=I got invited to the United Harvest's Snowish party and stuff! <br/>I guess there'll be a gift exchange. I wonder if people will like my potatoes... <br/>I'm kind of nervous about going alone... It sure would help if you came with me, Boss...}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_116_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新年だね、魔王さん！<br/>今年も食べきれないくらい、たくさんのおいしいものを作れるように、がんばるね！<br/>魔王さんも、作ったものが盗られないように守るの、手伝ってくれたらうれしいな！|text_cn=新年啊……我的愿望是希望今后有一直吃不完的美味食物，有舒适宽敞的房间。<br/>最重要的是，再也不担心食物被偷走，这样就能给魔王更多好吃的东西了。要是都能实现就好了……|trans_en=It's the new year, Boss! <br/>I'll make you all the yummy food you can eat this year, too! <br/>And I hope you'll help protect all the yummy food I make from getting stolen!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_116_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん、今日はうちにごはん食べにこない？<br/>実は…私の誕生日で、おかあさんがごちそうを作ってくれたんだけど…<br/>せっかくだし、一緒に食べたいなぁ～、って思って。よければどう、かな…？|text_cn=今天来我家吃饭吧？妈妈做了一顿大餐来庆祝我生日。<br/>我、我希望你也能来一起热闹一下……你会来吗？|trans_en=Wanna come to my place for dinner tonight, Boss? <br/>Today's actually my birthday, and my mom's going to be cooking something nice. So, I was hoping you might join me... <br/>Well? What do you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_116_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_116_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとう、魔王さん！特製のお誕生日ケーキを作ったから、食べてほしいな！<br/>とれたてのニンジンとグリーンピースを使った、ヘルシーなお野菜ケーキだよ！<br/>さ、めしあがれ！|text_cn=生日快乐，魔王~我给你做了生日蛋糕，里面加了新鲜的胡萝卜和青豆，健康又有营养！我们一起吃吧~|trans_en=Happy birthday, Boss! <br/>I hope you like the extra special cake I made for you! It's a healthy cake full of freshly-picked carrots and green peas!<br/>Eat up!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_117_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっほー、ボス！前に話してたリバーシって遊び、あたしにも教えてよ！|text_cn=魔王~你上次提过的那个……黑白棋？教教我嘛！|trans_en=Hey, Boss! Teach me that Reversi game you mentioned before!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_117_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あっ、ボス！ねえねえ今日は麻雀とリバーシ、どっちで遊ぶのがいいかな？<br/>自分じゃ選べなくて…|text_cn=今天玩麻雀牌还是下棋？唔……唔……好难选择！！|trans_en=Ah, Boss! Should we play Mahjong or Reversi today? I can't decide...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_117_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おっはよー！朝ご飯はもう食べた？<br/>もしまだなら食べてってよ。ボスの分は取っといたからさ|text_cn=魔王早上好！吃了吗？这里还有些早点，特意留给你的~|trans_en=Hey-ho, good morning-o! Did you eat yet?<br/>I hope not, 'cause I saved some delish breakfast for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_117_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日のランチもお客さんでいっぱいだからね。あたしも気合い入れてかないと！|text_cn=今天的午市生意特别好，我也要加油咯！|trans_en=The shop's packed with the lunch rush again today, so I need to buckle down!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_117_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=…ふぅ、今日の営業は終了！あっ、ボス。よければうちのまかない、食べてかない？|text_cn=……呼，营业结束啦。魔王，要不要来试试我们的员工餐？|trans_en=Phew, time to close up shop! Boss, wanna stay for some of our unbeatable chow?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_117_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=見て見てボス！あたし、また背が伸びたんだ～！|text_cn=魔王，你看，我是不是又长高啦？|trans_en=Hey, Boss, check it out! I grew taller!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_117_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…ママからの課題、多すぎるよ～…|text_cn=糟糕……妈妈布置的作业好……多……啊……|trans_en=Ugh. Mom gave me WAY too much homework...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_117_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス早く！裏スジを追ってもあたしは止まらないよ？|text_cn=魔王，快来，三缺一啦。|trans_en=Come on, Boss! I'm not quitting, not matter how many side quests you drag me on!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_117_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=『何があろうと一局目で和了るべからず』だよ！|text_cn=俗话说，宁挨千刀剐，不胡第一把。|trans_en=You know what they say? "You can't win on the first turn, but you sure can lose!"}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_117_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ見てらっしゃい！龍璟樓の新メニュー、桃饆饠が、なんとたったの500ドーラ！<br/>この機会に、ぜひボスも味見してってね～！|text_cn=瞧一瞧看一看啦！怀璟食府新推出的桃桃毕罗，尝鲜价只要五百朵拉！魔王想尝尝吗？错过这次可就没下次啦~|trans_en=Step right up! Try our new Huaijing Restaurant's Peach Rolls, only 500 Dorra! <br/>You too, Boss—give 'em a try!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_117_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日彩ちゃんに聞かれた文法の問題、あたしも全然わかんないや…<br/>はぁ、やっぱり算数以外の科目はダメダメだな～…|text_cn=阿彩昨天问我的那道文法题，我也做不来……<br/>哎，我除了算术以外，水平和她半斤八两……|trans_en=That grammar problem Cai asked me yesterday? I had no clue either. <br/>Sigh... I'm only good at math...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_117_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=小さい頃から、雷の日はママがずっと側にいてくれたんだ<br/>だからあたし、雷は全然怖くないよ。ボスはどう？|text_cn=魔王会害怕打雷吗？……我吗？小时候妈妈总会在雨天陪着我，所以我不怕~|trans_en=When I was little, Mom stayed with me to comfort me on stormy days. So I'm not scared of lightning at all! <br/>How about you, Boss?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_117_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふむふむ、今月の売上と支出は…ってうわああ！？<br/>この帳簿はうちのトップシークレットだから、見ちゃダメ！|text_cn=本月门店的收入和支出……<br/>呜哇，这可是我们店的最高机密，不能给你看的！|trans_en=Hmm, let's check this month's sales and expenses... <br/>Hey-hey-hey, no peeking! Our books are top secret!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_117_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=そろそろ来月の新メニューを考えないと<br/>うーん…最近街で『コラボ』が流行ってるみたいだし、それを取り入れられないかな？|text_cn=要开始考虑下个月的新菜品了。唔……<br/>魔王，现在城里是不是流行什么“联名款”？这也是一种促销新手段吗？|trans_en=Time to plan next month's menu. <br/>... Hmm, collabs are trending lately. Maybe we could do one?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_117_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍璟樓のアンケートに協力してくれない？<br/>さすが、ありがとう！…って、全部「いい感じ」？もう、もっと具体的に書いてよ～|text_cn=怀璟食府的评价问卷，辛苦魔王填一下啦~<br/>……诶？只有“好评”两个字？再多写点嘛~|trans_en=Could you fill out our Huaijing Restaurant survey? Thanks so much! <br/>Wait, you just wrote "good" for everything? C'mon, I need specifics!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_117_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日も来ると思って、ボスの席を空けといたよ。さて、ご注文は？|text_cn=看，早就帮你留好位子啦。今天想吃点啥？|trans_en=I knew you'd show up, so I saved you a seat! What'll you have today?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_117_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今度時間がある時、うちに遊びに来てよ！ママがボスに会いたいんだってさ！|text_cn=魔王要是有空，要不要来我家玩？妈妈也很想认识一下你呢！|trans_en=Come visit us when you've got time! Mom says she wants to meet you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_117_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、助けて！サイちゃんと一緒にお出かけする約束してるんだけど…<br/>前の試験で間違えたところを見直してたら、どうしてもわからない箇所があって…<br/>悪いんだけど、帰ったら解き方教えてくれない？ほんと！？ありがとう！<br/>なら今度うちの店に来たとき、ジンリン特製『超無敵デラックスチャーハン』をサービスするよ！|text_cn=魔王——江湖救急！！我和阿彩等下要出门，但是考试的错题还没整理完……<br/>你能不能先帮我写一下呀？我保证回家好好复习！<br/>同意啦？嘿嘿，下次来我们店，送你一份璟麟特制超级无敌豪华蛋炒饭！|trans_en=Help! <br/>I'm supposed to go out with Cai soon, and I was fixing my wrong answers from the last test, and there's this one I can't figure out... <br/>Can you teach me when I get back? <br/>Really?! Thanks so much! I'll treat you to my Invincible Deluxe Fried Rice next time you come by the restaurant!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_117_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ええっ、全自動麻雀卓なんてどこで手に入れたの！？<br/>すっご～い…！ねえねえ、試しに一局打ってみようよ！|text_cn=全、全自动麻雀牌桌……好厉害，魔王从哪里淘来的好东西？<br/>来来来，先来上一局！|trans_en=Whaaat? Where'd you get an automated mahjong table?! That's amazing!<br/>Hey, let's play a round!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_117_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=じゃじゃーん！ボスのために特別メニューを用意したよ<br/>それと全品半額になるプレミアム会員カードも渡しとくから、どうぞご贔屓に～♪|text_cn=看，这是给魔王您准备的私厨菜单！收好您的尊贵会员卡，以后来我店里，打五折！|trans_en=Ta-daa! I've prepared a special dish just for you! <br/>Plus, here's a premium membership card that gives you half off everything! Be sure to come back, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_117_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ゼリゼリを味見してみたいってウェイジが言ってたんだけど…<br/>あれって食べられるんだっけ！？止めた方がいいよねぇ！？|text_cn=未济说……想抓一只冻冻尝尝口感。魔王，那个东西……真的能吃？！<br/>是不是阻止她一下比较好？|trans_en=Weiji said she wanted to try tasting Glopo, but is it even edible?! <br/>We should stop her, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_117_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメさんは勉強が得意なんだっけ？<br/>ならさ、今度勉強を見て欲しいんだけど…ボスから頼んでくれない？<br/>文法の試験で悪い点取ったら、麻雀牌を没収するってママが…うぅ…|text_cn=鸢尾好像很会念书诶。那个，魔王，能不能拜托她帮我补补课？<br/>妈妈说，这次她出的文法题我要是再做不好，就没收我的麻雀牌，呜……|trans_en=Iris's good at studying, right? So, um ... can you ask her to help me out? <br/>Mom said if I flunk the grammar test, she's taking away my mahjong set. Can you believe it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_117_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=シーミャオさんがこの前出した『科学麻雀解説第2版』だけど、今回のはかなり読みやすいね<br/>これならみんなにも最後まで読んでもらえそう|text_cn=师渺写了一份《科学麻雀牌精讲2.0》。这版精简了不少，终于不用担心大家看不下去了~|trans_en=The Scientific Mahjong Guide 2nd Edition that Shimiao released the other day is sooo much easier to read. <br/>I bet some people will actually make it through to the end now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_117_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=アグリ・ユニオンのファーストフードって、なんか変わった味がするんだよね…<br/>あっ、別にライバルだからって、こんなことを言ってる訳じゃないよ！？|text_cn=联合种业的快餐，总有股奇怪的味道……<br/>啊，我不是因为和他们有竞争关系才这么说……|trans_en=United Harvest's fast food tastes kinda ... weird, huh? <br/>And I'm not saying that because they're rivals or anything.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_117_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=谷風家政と一緒に夜市を開催できたら面白そうだよね<br/>きっとすっごくお客さんが集まって…うしししし|text_cn=如果可以联系谷风家政一起办场夜市，会不会很有趣呢？嘿嘿。|trans_en=Wouldn't it be fun to host a night market with Goodwind Homecare? I bet we'd draw a huge crowd... Heehee.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_117_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう、ボスってば子供じゃないんだから！<br/>それなら…あたしも反撃しちゃうもんね！ツンツンツンツン…！|text_cn=魔王好幼稚！那、那我也要反击了！戳你、戳你、戳你！|trans_en=Oh, come on, Boss, grow up. ... Fine! I'll do it right back at you ... poke poke poke!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_117_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=暇ならうちの出前を手伝ってよ？さあ動いた動いた！|text_cn=魔王看上去很无聊的样子。不如帮我送几单外卖吧，忙起来忙起来~|trans_en=If you're bored, you can help out with the deliveries. C'mon, chop-chop!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_117_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さっきからずっと黙ってるけど…<br/>なにか悩みがあるならあたしに相談してみてよ。誰にも言わないからさ|text_cn=别不说话嘛，是有什么事情不好意思开口吗？<br/>和我说说，我一定不告诉别人！|trans_en=You've been quiet. If there's something on your mind, tell me, okay? <br/>I promise I won't say a word to anyone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_117_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=おーい、ボスー！おかしいな、どこに行ったんだろう…？|text_cn=喂——喂，魔王——<br/>奇怪，去哪儿了呀。|trans_en=Boss! <br/>... Hmm, that's weird. Where'd you go?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_117_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス？うーん、寝ちゃってる<br/>まあギルドの管理も大変そうだし、たまにはちゃんと休んでもらわないとね|text_cn=魔王？魔王？唔……睡着了吗？<br/>管理旅团很累吧……要好好休息才行。|trans_en=Huh? Oh, you're asleep... <br/>Well, running the guild must be pretty exhausting, so it's good to see you resting for once.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_117_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いらっしゃーい！龍璟樓の店長、ジンリンだよ。お腹が空いた時はうちのお店に来てね！|text_cn=魔王好！我是怀璟食府的璟麟，今后请多多照顾我们家的生意呀！|trans_en=Welcome! I'm Jinglin, the manager of Huaijing Restaurant! If you're ever hungry, drop on by!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_117_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=決めた、ボスのために特別メニューを作ろっと！<br/>いいのいいの、ボスはうちの常連さんだから！|text_cn=我让后厨给魔王开个小灶吧。嘿嘿，不麻烦不麻烦，你可是我们家的熟客呀！|trans_en=I've decided—I'll make a special dish just for you! ... No, it's cool. After all, you're one of our regulars!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_117_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力で、龍璟樓とママはあたしが守る！|text_cn=我可以更好地守护怀璟食府，守护妈妈了！|trans_en=With this, I can protect Huaijing Restaurant and Mom!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_117_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=雷の力を感じる…！|text_cn=和自然的联系更紧密了~|trans_en=I can feel the thunder building...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_117_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしの秘密、ボスにだけこっそり教えてあげる♪|text_cn=这是有关于我的小秘密，只有你知道哦！|trans_en=I'll tell you a secret, just between us, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_117_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、なかなか面白い曲だね|text_cn=这儿的音乐真有趣啊~|trans_en=This is a fun tune!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_117_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ジンリン、見・参ッ！<br/>と、撮れた？もう…足が、ぷるぷるするぅ…|text_cn=璟麟，威风凛凛！——拍好了吗？脚、脚有点酸了……|trans_en=Jinglin, making a cool debut! <br/>Did you get the shot? Ugh, my legs are quivering.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_117_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=科学麻雀こそ勝利への道！ボスもそう思うでしょ？ふふん、さっすがあたしの麻雀仲間！|text_cn=科学麻雀牌才是唯一出路！魔王，你也认同这一点吧？嗯嗯，不愧是我的牌搭子！|trans_en=Scientific Mahjong is the path to victory! You agree, right? Hehe, I knew you were my mahjong buddy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_117_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『人生には色んな味がある』ってママがよく言ってるけど…<br/>あたしが甘くするコツを教えてあげるよ。というわけで…はい、麦芽水飴！<br/>これを食べると、あま～い毎日が過ごせるはずだよ！|text_cn=妈妈总说，酸甜苦辣，人生百味。不过我有让生活变甜的小妙招哦！<br/>给，麦芽糖。多吃甜的，生活也能变甜啦~|trans_en=Mom always says life has many kinds of flavors, but I've learned how to make it sweet. <br/>Here's some candy. Eat this and every day will be delightful!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_117_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい、お弁当作ってきたよ。今日は蒸し豚に、野菜炒め、それから…<br/>あ、野菜もちゃんと食べなきゃダメだからね？|text_cn=那个瓶子我还留着呢。魔王，我们再多写几个吧？|trans_en=I made you lunch today! It's steamed pork, sauteed vegetables, and...<br/>Hey! Be sure to eat the veggies too, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_117_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、この玉佩の片方を受け取ってくれる？<br/>え、これの意味？もちろん、世界一の仲良しって意味だよ！|text_cn=魔王，收下这半枚玉佩！……嘿嘿，它就是你和我，天下第一好的证明~|trans_en=Will you accept this jade pendant? <br/>... What does it mean? Why, it means we're the best of friends in the whole world, obviously!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_117_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、うちと業務提携してみない？<br/>そしたらお金も、美味しい食事も麻雀も、勉強も…ぜーんぶ一緒にできるんだよ！<br/>いっぱいいーっぱい、２人で楽しいことしようよ！|text_cn=魔王魔王，有没有兴趣加入我们怀璟食府呀？<br/>我们今后一起赚钱，一起吃好吃的，一起打麻雀牌，一起写作业，一起……做各种各样好玩的事！|trans_en=How about a business partnership? <br/>We could do everything together—make money, eat fine food, play mahjong, study ... everything! <br/>How awesome would that be?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_117_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう<br/>でもプレゼントなんて用意しなくても、お店に来てくれるだけで十分嬉しいのに|text_cn=来就来了，还拎什么礼物嘛~|trans_en=Thank you! But I don't need gifts—just you coming to the restaurant is present enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_117_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わあ！いつもありがとう！<br/>それじゃああたしも、ボスにも良いことがあるようにお願いしとくね！|text_cn=哇！承蒙厚爱！恭喜发财，大吉大利！|trans_en=Wow! Thanks so much! I'll make a wish for good luck!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_117_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっ！？こんなに貴重なもの、本当にくれるの？<br/>なら…お言葉に甘えさせてもらうね、ふふっ|text_cn=天呐！这、这怎么好意思收下——那我就不客气啦！|trans_en=Whoa! Isn't this super valuable? ... But if you insist, I gladly accept. Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_117_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うんうん！|text_cn=嗯嗯！|trans_en=Mmmhmm!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_117_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=それはダメ|text_cn=唔，不行呢。|trans_en=Nuh-uh.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_117_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え…？|text_cn=诶？这样的话……|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_117_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=でも…|text_cn=可是……？|trans_en=But...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_117_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…|text_cn=呜……|trans_en=Ugh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_117_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当！？|text_cn=哇，真的吗？！|trans_en=Really?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_117_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=酷い！|text_cn=太过分了！|trans_en=That's so mean!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_117_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=えへへ|text_cn=嘿嘿，好开心呀！|trans_en=Hehe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_117_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=哎呀呀……|trans_en=(sigh)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_117_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=あははっ、どんどん食べて！じゃんじゃん飲め飲めぇ♪|text_cn=大家，吃得开心~喝得开心~|trans_en=Ahaha, eat up! Drink as much as you like! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_117_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=悲しい時は、甘いものを食べるといいんだよ|text_cn=难过的时候吃些甜的，心情也会变好哦！|trans_en=Banish the blues by eating something sweet!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_117_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしって、結構運がいい方なんだよねぇ～|text_cn=我的运气一向很好！|trans_en=I'm actually pretty lucky, y'know?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_117_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、今度うちの店で出す新メニューなんだけど…どう！？|text_cn=怀璟食府的新品，还合口味吗？|trans_en=This is a new dish we're serving at the restaurant—what do you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_117_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_117_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=お客様ご来店でーす！|text_cn=有客上门啦！|trans_en=We've got customers!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_117_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=麒麟、招来！|text_cn=麒麟，招来！|trans_en=Come forth, Qilin!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_117_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=雷霆の力よ、集え！|text_cn=雷霆之力，起！|trans_en=Thunder, gather to me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_117_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…ちょっと休憩…|text_cn=我先……休息一下。|trans_en=Urgh—just need to ... catch my breath...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_117_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=課題…終わってないのに…|text_cn=忘记……写作业了……|trans_en=But I didn't finish my homework...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_117_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力…くぅ～っ、美味しすぎるでしょ！|text_cn=嘿嘿，这力量真美味！|trans_en=Mm-mmm! This power is tasty!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_117_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=差し入れ？大歓迎だよ！|text_cn=哇喔！给我的吗？|trans_en=Snack time? Oh, yes please!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_117_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=元気満タン！！|text_cn=充电完成~|trans_en=I'm full of energy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_117_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=安心して、あたしが面倒見てあげる！|text_cn=我会照顾好大家！|trans_en=Don't worry, I gotcha covered!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_117_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ビリビリ来てるよ～！|text_cn=快看！我头发竖起来啦！|trans_en=It feels kinda tingly!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_117_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁぁ…ねむ…えへへ…昨日は夢の中でもみんなと冒険してたから|text_cn=唔……昨天梦里都在和大家一起冒险……呼，现在好困……|trans_en=(yawn) Wooeesh, I'm beat... I was dreaming the whole night about adventuring with you guys.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_117_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=全自動麻雀卓の神器を探しに…しゅっぱーつ！|text_cn=出发！寻找全自动麻雀牌桌！|trans_en=Let's goo-hoo! I want to find the artifact—a fully automatic mahjong table!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_117_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここなら探索ついでに、ママが教えてくれた拳法も練習できる！一石二鳥だね！|text_cn=在这里还能顺便复习一下妈妈教我的掌法，一举两得~|trans_en=I can explore AND practice the martial arts Mom taught me! Two birds with one stone!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_117_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=店番は他の人に頼んで来たから、心配ご無用！|text_cn=我已经找人帮忙看店啦，不用担心~|trans_en=I left the restaurant in good hands, so no worries!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_117_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=この課題のプリント、星骸に盗まれたってことにすれば…<br/>な、なーんてね！冗談だよ！|text_cn=我把作业也带来了，要是被星骸抢走的话……|trans_en=My assignment? I'll say it got stolen by a Stellaroid. ... Just kidding, hehe!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_117_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=店長たるもの、このくらいどうってことないし！う、嘘じゃないよ！|text_cn=我、我才没有紧张哦！咳咳，店长我什么大风大浪没有经历过。|trans_en=This is no big deal for a store manager! S-Seriously!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_117_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔に龍璟樓の出張店を出せば、巡遊者のお客さんで大繁盛しそうだよね♪|text_cn=如果在星塔里开饭店的话，会很受旅人们的欢迎吧。|trans_en=If we opened a Jing's Bistro at the Monolith, I bet we'd make lots money from Trekker customers!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_117_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=使いやすい調理器具とか、売ってないかな？|text_cn=这儿有什么好用的厨具吗？|trans_en=I wonder if they sell handy kitchen utensils here?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_117_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんな～、駄菓子があるよ！一緒に食べよう！|text_cn=嘿嘿，我带了零食！大家来分一分~|trans_en=Hey, I brought some candy! Want some?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_117_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=良いことが起きるような…起きないような…ううん、起きるに決まってる！|text_cn=会有好事发生吗？会吗？不会吗？会的吧！|trans_en=I've got a feeling something good may ... or may NOT happen. Except it definitely will!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_117_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんな、お疲れ様！|text_cn=大家都辛苦啦~|trans_en=Good work, everyone!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_117_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあさあ！片付けして次いこ！|text_cn=收拾收拾继续前进吧！|trans_en=Alright, let's clean up and move on!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_117_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれっ？尻尾が絡まっちゃってる|text_cn=哎呀，尾巴不小心打结了——|trans_en=Huh? My tail's all tangled up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_117_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=勝てたのは、みんなのお陰だね！|text_cn=大家都好厉害呀！|trans_en=We won because of all our hard work!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_117_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今夜はうちのお店でパーッとやろう！|text_cn=今晚的夜宵，我请客~|trans_en=Let's celebrate at the shop tonight!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_117_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしじゃ、まだダメなの…？|text_cn=咳……好不甘心……|trans_en=Am I not good enough?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_117_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もっともっと、頑張らないと…！|text_cn=还要更加……努力才行……|trans_en=I need to work even harder!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_117_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=店長にお任せあれ♪|text_cn=交给我好啦！|trans_en=Leave it to the manager!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_117_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふう…よーし、行っくよー！|text_cn=呼……深呼吸。我要上了！|trans_en=Whew... Alright, let's gooo!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_117_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=準備万端、気合い十分！|text_cn=嗯！准备好啦。|trans_en=All set and fired up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_117_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=出発前の腹ごしらえは忘れずにね！|text_cn=出发之前，也要记得吃饭哦！|trans_en=Don't forget to eat before heading out!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_117_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_117_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はカップルのお客さんで、朝から大賑わいだよ<br/>あ、でも安心して。ボスの席はちゃーんと空けてあるから<br/>というわけで、どうぞこちらへ！バレンタインの特別メニューをたっぷり味わってね！|text_cn=今天店里来了好多成双成对的客人呢∼店里都快坐不下了！哎别担心，早就给魔王大人留好座啦！<br/>里面请，今天就来试试我们的节日特别套餐吧！|trans_en=We've had so many couples come through all day today! <br/>But don't worry! Of course, I saved a seat for you, Boss.<br/>Right this way! I hope you enjoy the special Valentine's Day menu!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_117_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁ…雪だぁー！こんなに積もってるとこ見るの、生まれてはじめてかも！<br/>そうだ、ボス！いまから一緒に雪合戦しようよ！<br/>コート持ってくるから、ちょっと待っててね<br/>風邪引かないようにしないと、ママに苦ーい薬飲まされちゃう|text_cn=哇……哇！！外面下雪啦！！我还从没见过这么大的雪！魔王，快快，我们去打雪仗~对、对了……<br/>还有外套，外套要穿好。万一感冒了，妈妈会给我们熬难喝的药……|trans_en=Look! Snow! I don't think I've ever seen so much everywhere!<br/>Hey Boss, let's have a snowball fight! <br/>Hold on, I'll go get my coat.  <br/>Wouldn't wanna catch a cold and have to take my mom's yucky medicine!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_117_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス！ あけましておめでとう！ところで今夜の予定決まってる？まだならうちで食べてかない？<br/>今日はママが、本気の料理をごちそうしてくれるよ！|text_cn=魔王新年好~嘿嘿晚上要不要来我家吃饭？今天妈妈亲自下厨，说要给我们做她的拿手菜，你有口福啦！|trans_en=Happy New Year, Boss!<br/>Do you have any plans for tonight? If not, wanna come to my place for dinner? <br/>My mom will make you some seriously good food!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_117_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえボス！ あたしね、また１つ大人に近づいたんだー！<br/>今年の誕生日のお願い事？それは…って、危ない危ない<br/>お願い事は、人に喋ったら叶わなくなるっていうからね<br/>いくらボスでも秘密だよ！|text_cn=嘿嘿，我又长大一岁咯！今年的生日愿望？那当然是……啊！好险好险，差点就告诉魔王了。<br/>咳咳，愿望说出来就不灵验了，我要好好保密才行！|trans_en=Boss! I'm one step closer to being an adult!<br/>What was my birthday wish? Well, I was thinking...<br/>Oh, I dunno if that's a good idea! They say your wish won't come true if you tell anyone! I can't even tell you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_117_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_117_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はいどうぞ。熱々のできたて長寿麺だよ！<br/>ちなみにこれ、麺を途中で切っちゃダメだからね？<br/>長寿麺っていうのは、最後まで切らないで食べるから、縁起物って言われてるんだもん<br/>というわけで、これからは毎年あたしが作った長寿麺でお祝いしようね！|text_cn=热腾腾的长寿面来咯~魔王，吃的时候可不要把面条咬断啦，长寿面就是要整根吃进肚子里。嘿嘿，讨个好彩头嘛~<br/>以后的每一年，我都会为魔王做长寿面庆祝生日哦！|trans_en=Here you are! Boiling hot, fresh longevity noodles!<br/>Make sure you don't bite them in half, okay?<br/>You're supposed to eat the whole thing, and that'll give you good luck for a long life.<br/>I'll make some longevity noodles every year so we can celebrate from here on out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Chinese New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc117_ChineseNewYear26_day01_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc117_ChineseNewYear26_day01_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日の夜って空いてる？よければご飯食べに来てよ♪<br/>やっぱり春節は、みんなで集まって楽しく過ごさなきゃね！|text_cn=新春快乐~今晚来和我们一起吃团圆饭吧。<br/>新年嘛~就是要大家一起团团圆圆，热热闹闹！|trans_en=Are you free tonight?Come and eat if you like ♪<br/>After all, for Springseek Festival, everyone should get together and spend a good time!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_118_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=健康なら私のところに来ちゃいけないのかって？フフ…さあどうかな|text_cn=多喝热水，你就可以少见到我几次……但我不介意多见你几次。|trans_en=You want to visit me even when you're not sick? Well, there's no rule against it, I suppose...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_118_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=顔色が悪いね。新しい薬を調合してみたんだけど…試してみる？|text_cn=你看上去精神不振，气血不足。试试我的新药吧？|trans_en=You're looking pale. Care to try a new medicine I've created?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_118_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよう。今日も元気そうだね。ん～？その顔、何かいいことでもあるのかな？|text_cn=早啊，今天精神不错，看来你有按时吃药。|trans_en=Good morning. You seem lively today... In fact, you're positively beaming. Did something happen I should know about?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_118_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はどの子とランチを――誰とって、もちろん骨格標本だよ|text_cn=嗯……今天该邀请哪位“骨”东和我共进午餐呢？|trans_en=Who should I have lunch with today? ... Hmm? Yes, of course I'm talking about my skeleton specimens.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_118_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私と忘れられない夜を過ごしてみる？もちろん…標本室でね|text_cn=今晚，要不要跟我一起……<br/>在标本室度过一个难忘的夜晚？|trans_en=Care to spend an unforgettable evening with me? <br/>In the lab, naturally.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_118_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこを見てるの？大鎌？目？それとも…|text_cn=你在看什么呢？这把镰刀，我的眼睛？<br/>还是……？|trans_en=What are you staring at? My scythe? My eye?<br/>Or perhaps...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_118_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=大鎌をくれた患者にまた会いたいかって？<br/>そうだね…その時はぜひ研究にも参加してほしいかな|text_cn=送给我镰刀的病人？<br/>嗯……<br/>有机会再见面的话，倒是希望她能留下来参与我的研究。|trans_en=Do I want to meet the patient who gave me this scythe again? <br/>Yes, as a matter of face. <br/>I'd like her to join my research as well.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_118_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=当時はやんちゃで、危うく食べられそうになったけど<br/>いまはこんなに大人しくなって。フフ…どう？ 可愛いでしょ？|text_cn=我差点就成了它的食物……不过，现在换我来宠爱它了……<br/>呵呵，怎么样？是不是很可爱？|trans_en=I thought I was going to be eaten alive. But now look how docile she is. <br/>Hehe ... pretty cute, huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_118_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この頭蓋骨綺麗でしょ？<br/>正中の亀裂がこうしてまっ直ぐに入ってるのはとっても珍しくて。まるで芸術品みたいだ|text_cn=不觉得这个颅骨很美吗？<br/>你看，很少有颅骨的中缝可以如此笔直，就像艺术品一样。|trans_en=This skull is stunning, isn't it? <br/>The seams are so perfectly straight, it's like it was made by a master craftsman, such a rare piece of art.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_118_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人から『魅力的だ』って言われないか？興味ないね<br/>だって私、目が4つある訳でもないし。むしろ興味って話なら…<br/>頭の天辺からつま先まで、キミの秘密を一つ残らず暴いてみたいけど|text_cn=“有没有人说我长得很有魅力”？<br/>嗯……从生理结构来看，我好像也没有多长一只眼睛。<br/>倒是你，满是谜团的香气……<br/>值得把玩一番。|trans_en=Do I have charm? <br/>I wouldn't know. I don't have four eyes or anything, at least. <br/>But if we're talking about curiosity... Well, I've got that in spades! <br/>For example, I'd love to know everything about you, from crown to metatarsal!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_118_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=病人の治療には興味ないよ。あれはただの『ついで』<br/>そもそも魔王さん以上に興味をそそられるものなんて存在しないから|text_cn=我对医治病人并没有太大的兴趣，治疗只是顺道为之……<br/>要说我最有兴趣的，当然还是您了。|trans_en=Treating patients is just an afterthought. <br/>Honestly, nothing fascinates me more than you, Boss.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_118_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここの標本は大半が巡遊者から買ったりマーケットで見つけたものだけど<br/>中には私が作ったものもあるよ。フフ…作り方が気になる？|text_cn=这里的标本，大部分都是从旅人手里收购的，还有一些是在市场淘到的。<br/>当然，我自己做的也有，要我给你讲讲制作过程吗？|trans_en=Most of these specimens were bought from Trekkers or markets, but some I created myself. <br/>Heh... Curious about the process?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_118_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=美味しいご飯を奢ってくれる？食事はただのエネルギー補給だし味なんて気にしないけど…<br/>他ならぬキミの誘いだ、付き合ってあげるよ|text_cn=请我吃大餐？<br/>嗯……理论上，进食，只是为了养分在生物间顺利流转……<br/>不过，既然是你的邀请，我愿意赴约。|trans_en=You'll treat me to a nice meal, you say? <br/>Alas, food is just fuel to me. I pay no attention to taste.<br/>But yes, I'll join you, if you insist.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_118_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=今月の収支は…赤字スレスレ？お金をもらい忘れないようにしないとね…|text_cn=嗯？诊所这个月的开支这么高吗？<br/>看来之后还是要记得收钱……|trans_en=We're barely breaking even this month? <br/>I'll need to remember to collect payments.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_118_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=最近は忙しくて、助手でも雇おうかと思ってるんだけど…<br/>フフ…キミは私の助手に向いてそうだね|text_cn=最近确实有些忙不过来，要不招个助手吧？<br/>嗯……你就很合适。|trans_en=I've been so swamped lately, I'm considering hiring an assistant. <br/>Hmm... You might fit the bill.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_118_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この薬の作り方？残念だけど秘密だよ。でもキミが助手になってくれるなら…考えてあげる|text_cn=想看这些药剂的制作过程？<br/>伤脑筋，这些药剂的配方可是保密的，但如果你做我助手的话……|trans_en=How do I brew this medicine? <br/>Sorry, that's a secret. But if you become my assistant, maybe I'll teach you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_118_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星輝会での研究もそれなりに楽しかったけど…<br/>それよりもっと面白そうなものを見つけてね<br/>この診療所を開いたのも、それがきっかけなんだ|text_cn=星辉之眼的研究项目也很有趣，只是后来，我有了更感兴趣的事情，所以就有了这间诊所。|trans_en=Researching at the Eye of Starlight was pretty fun.<br/>But I found something even more interesting.<br/>And that's why I opened this clinic.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_118_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この目の秘密？教えるのは構わないけど、ならキミの体の秘密も教えること<br/>その方が公平でしょ？|text_cn=我眼睛的秘密……？<br/>嗯，就拿你身体的秘密来交换好了。<br/>是不是很公平？|trans_en=The secret of this eye? <br/>I'll tell you, but only if you share your body's secrets with me. <br/>It's only fair, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_118_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この義眼をよく見せてほしい？<br/>うーん、あらためて人に見せるようなものでもないんだけど…<br/>でも、私のヒミツを暴いてみたいなんて、積極的な魔王さんもめずらしいし<br/>フフ…いいよ。キミだけには特別に見せてあげる|text_cn=想要仔细观察我的眼睛吗？这可不是能随随便便给人看的东西哦……<br/>不过，你渴望从我这儿获得秘密的样子可真可爱。<br/>呵呵，来吧，我身体里珍贵的一部分，就特别允许你探究一番吧。|trans_en=Want to touch my artificial eye? <br/>I don't mind. <br/>Actually, come to think of it, it's about due for a recalibration.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_118_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=聴診器の使い方が知りたい？ならまずは耳にはめて、チェストピースはここに…<br/>どう？私の心臓の音、聞こえた？|text_cn=想试试听诊器怎么用？<br/>可以哦，像这样戴在耳朵上，再把听筒放到这里……<br/>怎么样？能听到我的心跳吗？|trans_en=Want to learn how to use a stethoscope? <br/>First, put the buds in your ears, then place the diaphragm against my skin like so... <br/>Hear that? That's my heart beating.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_118_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=コハク？あぁ…彼女ってすごく興味をそそられるよね|text_cn=琥珀吗？那孩子……令我着迷。|trans_en=Amber? Ah, yes. Fascinating girl, isn't she?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_118_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=セイナはいい子だね。被検体はあのくらい元気でなくちゃ…フフ<br/>是非とも研究に協力してほしいものだよ|text_cn=我很喜欢尘沙……毕竟，没有研究者会不喜欢活蹦乱跳的样本……<br/>要是她也同意参加我的临床试验就更好了。|trans_en=Noya is very good. You know, I do like an energetic test subject. <br/>I wonder if she'd help me out with my research.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_118_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメって子、取れる資格はすべて取ったんでしょ？ふぅん…研究者に向いてるかも|text_cn=我听说过哦，那个叫鸢尾的小姑娘考完了所有的资格证。<br/>嗯，是个适合做研究的人呢。|trans_en=That Iris girl? They say she's earned every qualification possible. <br/>I imagine she'd make an excellent researcher.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_118_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=前に塔の中で女の子を見かけてね傷の処置をしてる間も、シャロを抱いたまま離さなくて<br/>あの生物に鎮痛効果なんてあったっけ？|text_cn=说起来，我在塔里遇到过一个落单的孩子，想给她包扎的时候，她抱着企鹅夏洛克一直不肯松手……<br/>难道那个企鹅有镇痛作用？|trans_en=I once saw a girl in the Monolith. Even while I treated her wounds, she wouldn't let go of Sherlock. <br/>Does that creature relieve pain somehow?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_118_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=最近、患者たちからアオバって魔法少女の話をよく聞くんだけど…<br/>彼女、相当ストレスを溜めてるねどうしてわかるのかって？顔を見ればすぐわかるよ|text_cn=最近的病人们好像都在讨论那个叫青叶的魔法少女。<br/>虽然看上去很有活力，但她精神压力很大吧。<br/>我怎么知道？只要看气色就能明白了。|trans_en=Lately, all my patients are talking about the magical girl Aobelle. <br/>She has a terrible weight on her shoulders. <br/>... How do I know? I only need look at her.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_118_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん？ようやく研究に参加する決心がついたのかな？さすがは私の見込んだ被検体だ|text_cn=怎么？终于下定决心协助我的研究了吗？<br/>不愧是我最期待的实验体……|trans_en=Hmm? Have you finally decided to join my research? It's about time, too! <br/>I've wanted you as a test subject since we first met.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_118_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっとは落ち着いたら？あんまりうるさいと鎮静剤を注射するよ？|text_cn=冷静点，不然我得给你打些镇定剂了。|trans_en=Why don't you calm down? Keep that up and I'll sedate you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_118_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミの骨格なら…うん、新しく買った標本棚にピッタリだ|text_cn=嗯，你这体型……我新买的标本架，塞进去正合适。|trans_en=Your skeleton would be a perfect fit for my new specimen cabinet.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_118_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私を放置するなんて…キミってそういうプレイが好きなの？|text_cn=故意不理我……？原来如此，你有这种癖好啊。|trans_en=So you're ignoring me. You like playing childish games, do you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_118_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミの観察記録を書いてるだけだから、私のことは気にしなくていいよ<br/>それにしても…実に興味深い|text_cn=不必在意我，我只是在写你的观察记录。<br/>嗯，有趣的行为可真不少。|trans_en=Don't mind me, I'm just jotting down observations. <br/>I find you surprisingly interesting.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_118_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミが噂の魔王さん？よければ全身を検査させてくれないかな？|text_cn=你就是魔王大人吗？久仰大名，请务必让我替你做个“全身检查”。|trans_en=Are you the rumored Boss? Then I should conduct a full-body examination.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_118_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにかと縁があるようだし、近くまで来たときは、是非顔を見せてくれると嬉しいな|text_cn=看来我们还挺有缘的，要不来我诊所坐坐？|trans_en=There seems to be some fated connection between us, so I'd love for you to stop by next time you're in the area.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_118_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=斬新だね。けどそれも悪くない|text_cn=不错的手段，思路很新颖。|trans_en=Very clever. Consider me impressed.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_118_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんな方法もあったんだね。参考になったよ|text_cn=原来还可以这样提升吗？学到了。|trans_en=This technique is new to me. I'll have to remember it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_118_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう。これはきっと、私にとって大切な思い出なんだろう|text_cn=……谢谢你。那一定是，非常重要的回忆。|trans_en=Thank you. I'll be sure to cherish this memory.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_118_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=音楽はある種の娯楽。でも時に、他人の精神に干渉する道具にもなるのさ|text_cn=音乐能让人愉悦，也能作为入侵精神世界的武器。|trans_en=Music is largely entertainment. But it can also be tool to exert psychological control.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_118_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=大鎌が唸ってる…フフ、この子も喜んでるみたいだ|text_cn=镰刀在低吟，它也很喜欢这份力量。|trans_en=My scythe's purring... It seems we're all enjoying ourselves.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_118_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この子を撫でてるとね、不思議と穏やかな気持ちになるんだ|text_cn=摸一摸它，我烦躁的内心就能平静下来……|trans_en=When I pet this little one, it gives me a strange sense of calm.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_118_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=疲れたなら診療所で仮眠を取るといいよ。患者用のベッドしかないけどね|text_cn=累了的话可以在诊所里睡会，不过我这里只有病床哦？|trans_en=If you're tired, feel free to nap in the clinic. I hope you like rubber sheets.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_118_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=体は大切に。フフ…キミはとっても珍しいサンプルなんだから|text_cn=你的身体是很珍贵的材料，无论如何，还请你多在意一下自己的健康。|trans_en=Take care of your body. You're a rare specimen, after all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_118_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=冒険なんかどうでもよくて、珍しい生物や塔の影響を受けた変異体のサンプル<br/>あとは医療用の神器が手に入ればそれでいいんだ<br/>あぁ、もちろん『魔王さん』も…ね|text_cn=比起冒险本身，那些珍奇的动植物样本，稀有的医疗神器……<br/>以及受塔影响异变的生命形态，才是我真正感兴趣的东西……<br/>当然，也包括“魔王大人”你哦～|trans_en=It's not the adventuring that draws me out of the lab—<br/>it's the rare creatures, specimens mutated by the powers of the Monoliths, and medical artifacts. <br/>Oh, and you too, of course.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_118_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミが望むなら、もっと深い関係を持ったっていい。<br/>肌と肌を合わせて、人体の不思議を探求するような…ね。<br/>具体的には、今すぐベッドで横になって、被検体として私に体を差し出すとか、どうだろう？|text_cn=如果你想的话，我不介意跟你进行一点更深入的交流，探索一下人体的奥秘……<br/>或者尝试一些零距离的接触，比如……<br/>现在就躺上我的病床，让我仔细剖析一下“魔王大人”的身体。|trans_en=If you wish, we could forge a closer relationship by exploring the wonders of the human body together.<br/>Specifically, I'll set you up on my surgical table to conduct tests.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_118_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くない。いただくよ|text_cn=看着不错，我收下了。|trans_en=Not bad. I'll take it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_118_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…お礼は健診チケットでよかったかな？|text_cn=作为感谢，回赠你一张“体检优惠券”怎么样？|trans_en=Will a Free Consultation Coupon serve as thanks?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_118_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=素晴らしいね。標本にして、永遠に保存しておこう|text_cn=我打算把这个做成标本，这样就能永久保存了。|trans_en=Excellent. I'll preserve it as a specimen for eternity.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_118_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=構わないよ|text_cn=好。|trans_en=Fine by me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_118_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメ|text_cn=不行。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_118_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは？|text_cn=这是什么？|trans_en=What's this?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_118_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Hmm?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_118_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そっか…|text_cn=是吗……|trans_en=I see...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_118_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかすると…！|text_cn=啊，这难道是……！|trans_en=Could it be...?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_118_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=なっ…！？|text_cn=你这家伙……！！|trans_en=What the—!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_118_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふんふんふ～ん♪|text_cn=♪～♫~|trans_en=Hmm-hmm-hmm! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_118_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=(sigh)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_118_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=あらゆる命は、いずれ骸になる|text_cn=一切生命都终将变成骸骨。|trans_en=We all become skeletons, eventually.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_118_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…怖くないよ|text_cn=没什么可怕的。|trans_en=Hehe. Don't be afraid...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_118_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしあれを壊したら…命の保証はしないから|text_cn=碰坏那个的话，后果很严重哦。|trans_en=If you break that... I doubt you'll survive the aftermath.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_118_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=実にくだらない…|text_cn=真无聊……|trans_en=Truly absurd...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_118_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_118_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=研究させてくれない？|text_cn=让我研究一下吧。|trans_en=Care to let me research that?}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_118_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=標本にしてあげよう…！|text_cn=成为我美丽的标本吧！|trans_en=I'll turn you into a specimen.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_118_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=臨床試験、開始だ…！|text_cn=临床试验，开始。|trans_en=Commencing clinical trial.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_118_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=薬が足りなかったかな…|text_cn=身上的药，不够了吗……|trans_en=I didn't bring enough meds...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_118_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=素材集めはここまでだね…|text_cn=不能继续收集材料了吗……真可惜。|trans_en=No more specimen collecting for me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_118_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは…なかなか役に立ちそうだ|text_cn=嗯，这对我很有帮助。|trans_en=This could prove very useful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_118_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=なるほど、この感覚…分析する価値がありそうだ|text_cn=啊……这美妙的感觉……值得我好好分析一下。|trans_en=⁠Fascinating. This sensation may be worth analyzing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_118_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…早く試してみたいね|text_cn=呵呵……我已经迫不及待，想要试用一番了。|trans_en=Oh-ho! I can't wait to test this out.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_118_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=往診の準備もできたし、先に進もう|text_cn=做好出急诊的准备了。|trans_en=I'm ready to make house calls. Try to keep up.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_118_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミたちのバイタルチェックなら、私が一手に引き受けよう|text_cn=至少我可以帮你们维持生命体征。|trans_en=I'll take care of checking all your vitals myself.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_118_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…さっさと終わらせよう。この後も治験の予定が詰まってるからね|text_cn=唉……结束之后还要回去给病人试药，速战速决吧。|trans_en=Phew. Let's finish this quickly. I've got more trials scheduled.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_118_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この義眼が気になる？フフ…なら、私の戦いをよーく観察するといいよ|text_cn=对我的眼睛感兴趣吗？呵呵……那你等下记得仔细观察哦~|trans_en=Curious about my eye? Of course you are. I suggest you observe me closely in the next battle.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_118_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この大鎌、綺麗でしょ？昔、とある患者に貰ったんだ|text_cn=这把镰刀很漂亮吧？那是很久之前，一个病人送给我的。|trans_en=This scythe is beautiful, isn't it? A patient gave it to me long ago.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_118_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はどんな珍しい病気を見つけられるかな？|text_cn=今天会遇到什么奇怪的病例呢？|trans_en=I wonder what rare diseases I'll discover today.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_118_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい医療用神器が見つかれば、もっとやる気がでるんだけどね|text_cn=如果能找到点新的医疗器材，我会更有干劲。|trans_en=I'd be more motivated if I could find a medical artifact.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_118_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは…他の塔に比べて、『重症』だね|text_cn=这里……好像“病”得更严重了呢~|trans_en=Compared to other Monoliths, I'd say this one is in ... critical condition.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_118_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初めての星ノ塔か…ふふ。新しいサンプルが見つかりそうだ|text_cn=新的星塔，那应该会有新的样本吧？|trans_en=A new Monolith? I hope I'll find some fresh samples here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_118_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここ、標本も置いてる？|text_cn=这里会卖标本吗？|trans_en=Are there any specimens around?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_118_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=少し仮眠を…ん？キミもこっちで休んだら？|text_cn=我想睡会……怎么了？你也想一起？|trans_en=I need a quick nap. ... Hmm? Well, why don't you nap next to me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_118_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…新しい患者かな？|text_cn=哦？已经有患者在候诊了？|trans_en=Well, well … a new patient, huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_118_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん。いいデータが集まった|text_cn=收集到了不错的数据。|trans_en=Good. I collected some useful data.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_118_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=静かすぎて、なんだか物悲しい気がするね|text_cn=真是冷清啊。|trans_en=It's so quiet, it's almost depressing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_118_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=言うことを聞かずに暴れた罰だよ|text_cn=这就是无理取闹的下场。|trans_en=That's what you get for resisting and causing trouble.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_118_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=安心して、彼らを標本にはしないから|text_cn=放心，我手下留情了。|trans_en=Don't worry, I won't turn them into specimens.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_118_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この生物の体、ちょっともらっていいかな？|text_cn=这个能不能切下来送我？|trans_en=May I collect a few samples? I don't need the whole body...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_118_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんな傷口を見たのは初めてだよ。フフ…ゾクゾクするね|text_cn=我还没见过这样的伤口……啊，兴奋起来了。|trans_en=How exciting. I've never seen a wound like this before.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_118_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=逃げられた…せっかくのサンプルだったのに、残念|text_cn=……真可惜，新鲜的样本又跑掉了。|trans_en=It got away? Pity to lose such a valuable specimen.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_118_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…どんな生物に出会えるんだろうね|text_cn=……这次会遇到什么有趣的生物呢？|trans_en=Hehe... I wonder what creatures we'll encounter today.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_118_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありきたりな報酬に興味はないよ|text_cn=我要的报酬可不普通哦。|trans_en=I'm not interested in ordinary gifts.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_118_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪いけど、治療に興味はないんだ|text_cn=我可不会治疗。|trans_en=Sorry, I'm not interested in any treatment.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_118_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=適度に頑張るよ|text_cn=好，知道了。|trans_en=I'll make an appropriate effort.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_118_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_118_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『惚れ薬』なんて作ったことないけど…<br/>今日だけは特別、キミのために、あまーい栄養剤を作ってあげるよ？<br/>フフ…なんてね。はい、ホットチョコレート<br/>心を込めて作ったから、よーく味わってね|text_cn=哎呀，我这里可没有什么能让人一见钟情的药剂~不过呢，倒是可以在这个甜蜜的节日里，给你做瓶好喝的营养剂，来试试吧？<br/>呵呵，骗你的，这是热巧克力，是我精心准备的礼物哦～|trans_en=I've never made a Love Potion before, but today I'll make an extra sweet Health Potion just for you!<br/>Hehe, just kidding! Here's some hot chocolate! I put lots of love into it, so enjoy every drop!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_118_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=近所の子どもが診療所の裏に集まってるみたいだけど…<br/>雪合戦？ まあいいや<br/>ケガには気をつけるよう言っておいて。いちいち診察するのは面倒だし|text_cn=诊所外怎么围了一圈小孩子……你是说，你们想借诊所后面那块空地打雪仗？呵呵，可以~<br/>小心点，我可不想见谁打着打着就被抬了进来。|trans_en=It looks like the kids are gathering behind the clinic. <br/>A snowball fight? Oh, fine. <br/>Just tell them to be careful. I don't want to have to treat all of them.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_118_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう。それじゃ、早速今年最初の健康診断といこうか|text_cn=魔王大人，新年快乐呀。看来你已经做好准备了？呵呵，放心，我会很温柔地给你做一套新年体检的~|trans_en=Happy New Year! Let's get started with your first health exam of the year!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_118_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この頭蓋骨実に素晴らしいね。本当にもらっていいの？<br/>ああそうか、今日は私の誕生日だっけ。ありがとう。大切にするよ|text_cn=这是……很漂亮的一个头骨呢。哎呀，原来今天是我的生日？呵呵，真是有心了。|trans_en=This skull is truly beautiful. Can I really have it? <br/>Oh, right! Today is my birthday. Thank you! I will treasure it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_118_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_118_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日おめでとう。またひとつ、私の研究対象に近づいたね<br/>歳を重ねるごとに経験値が増え、研究対象としての価値は高くなっていくものだから<br/>フフ…早く極上の被検体になったキミに会いたいな♪|text_cn=呵呵，我很期待魔王大人未来的变化。你经历得越多，便越有研究的价值……<br/>哎呀，想必最后呈现在我面前的，会是一个绝妙的实验体呢~|trans_en=Happy birthday. That's one year closer to being my research subject.<br/>Each year represents more experience that increases your research value.<br/>Hehe... I can't wait for the day you become my ultimate test subject! ♪}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_119_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お帰りなさいませ。お食事とお風呂、どちらになさいますか？|text_cn=魔王大人欢迎回来，请问您是想先吃饭，还是先洗澡……？|trans_en=Welcome home. Will you have your meal, or take a bath?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_119_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨夜は月が綺麗でしたね。魔王様は…どう思われましたか？|text_cn=魔王大人，昨晚的月色……您也觉得很美吗？|trans_en=The moon sure was very beautiful last night. Did you see it, too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_119_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはようございます。お茶とコーヒー、どちらをご用意――<br/>え、白湯を？変わったものを好まれるのですね|text_cn=早安，魔王大人，请问您需要茶还是咖啡……<br/>白开水？真是独特的喜好呢。|trans_en=Good morning, Boss. Shall I prepare tea or coffee—? <br/>Sorry? A cup of boiled water? Well, you certainly have peculiar tastes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_119_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんにちは、魔王様。ナノハは訓練を終えたところなのですが…<br/>もしや、わざわざお待ちいただいていたのですか？|text_cn=午安，魔王大人，我刚刚结束训练，您这是特意在此地等我吗？|trans_en=Good day. Boss, I have just finished my training exercises... I didn't keep you waiting, did I?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_119_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おやすみなさいませ。よい夢が見られますよう<br/>…ナノハがずっと、おそばにおりますから|text_cn=晚安，魔王大人，祝您好梦。<br/>……花原一直都在。|trans_en=Good night, and pleasant dreams... <br/>Nanoha will be right here by your side, all night.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_119_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=袖の向日葵が綺麗？お褒めにあずかり光栄です|text_cn=花原衣袖上的向日葵很漂亮……？<br/>谢谢您的称赞。|trans_en=You find the sunflowers on my sleeves beautiful? <br/>Why, what a lovely compliment. Thank you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_119_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日のご予定？でしたらナノハがまとめておきました|text_cn=今日的行程安排？花原已拟定完毕，请您过目。|trans_en=Today's schedule? Oh, I have it all written up for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_119_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王様を想って作ったこちらのケーキ…どうぞお召し上がりください|text_cn=魔王大人，这份心意满满的蛋糕……请您和我一起品尝吧。|trans_en=Nanoha made this cake just for you, Boss. Here, please enjoy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_119_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=他のお菓子作りにも挑戦されますか？<br/>魔王様なら…きっとすぐにご上達されますよ。ふふっ|text_cn=魔王大人，要试着做些其他甜品吗？以您的天分，一定会很快上手的！|trans_en=How about trying your hand at baking other sweets? I have no doubt you'll be an expert in no time... Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_119_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『月光そそぎて 風鈴たわむれ』…風鈴の音は心地よく、いつまでも聞いていられます<br/>魔王様も、お好きなのですか？|text_cn=月华簌簌下，戏于风铃间……<br/>风铃颤悠的声音，花原似乎能一直听下去……<br/>魔王大人，您也喜欢吗？|trans_en="Bathed in moonlight, the wind-bells frolic"... <br/>The chimes are so soothing... I could listen to them all day. <br/>Do you like them too, Boss?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_119_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=バター、ミルク、ベーキングパウダー…<br/>量を変えるだけで、まったく違うお菓子になります。不思議ですね…|text_cn=黄油、牛奶、泡打粉……<br/>只是调整一下比例，却能组合出不同的甜点呢……|trans_en=Butter, milk, and baking powder... <br/>Just change the ratio of each, and you get a completely different kind of pastry. Amazing, isn't it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_119_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=メイドとして至らない点も多い私ですが…成長を見守っていただき、感謝しております|text_cn=作为女仆，花原还有很多不足，谢谢您愿意陪我一起练习。|trans_en=I'm still not yet the maid I strive to be. But I'm glad you're here to help me learn.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_119_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=向日葵が太陽を見つめるのは、成長しきるまで。人と同じですね…|text_cn=向日葵并非一直朝向太阳，当它成熟之后，便不会再转动了。<br/>人，也是如此这般……|trans_en=Sunflowers turn toward the sun until they're fully grown. <br/>A bit like people, if you think about it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_119_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=あそこに見える塔…アイスクリームのコーンが、逆さまに立っているみたいです…|text_cn=远方的高塔……好像冰淇淋蛋筒倒扣在大地上一样。|trans_en=That Monolith in the distance... Does it look like an upside-down ice cream cone to you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_119_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=『赤椿 白い椿と 土に落つ』<br/>…美しい俳句なのに、どうして切ない気持ちになるのでしょうか|text_cn=“红山茶，白山茶，叠地有落花。”<br/>好美的句子，但读来总觉得有些忧伤。|trans_en="Red camellias, white camellias, leaving layers of falling petals." <br/>What a beautiful verse... But why does it make me feel so sad?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_119_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハの髪は、そんなにもしなやかでしょうか？<br/>魔王様こそ、素敵な髪でいらっしゃるかと…|text_cn=诶，花原的头发很柔软吗？<br/>但在我看来，魔王大人的发质更好……|trans_en=Oh? You think Nanoha's hair is soft? <br/>But yours is so much softer...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_119_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日はまた、鳳凰炒飯で食事をなさいましたね…？<br/>やはりナノハの料理では、まだまだご満足いただけないのでしょうか…|text_cn=听说您昨天又去凤凰炒蛋了，花原的厨艺果然还是不够精湛啊……|trans_en=Did you eat at the Fenghuang Diner again yesterday? I guess my cooking skills are not good enough to gratify your taste...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_119_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご要望がありましたら、なんなりとお申し付けください。何でも叶えてご覧に入れましょう|text_cn=如果有需要，请尽管吩咐花原……<br/>任何事都可以哦。|trans_en=If you have any requests, please let me know.<br/>I'll do my best to fulfill them, whatever they may be.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_119_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしもナノハがお菓子屋さんを開いたら…お越しいただけますか？<br/>そして経営が上手くいったら、お店を増やして、お庭を花でいっぱいにして<br/>さらに子ネコを一匹…|text_cn=如果……未来的某天，花原开了一家甜品店……您会来捧场吗？<br/>要是生意兴隆，还可以开分店，在院子里种上好多的花，再养一只小猫……|trans_en=If I can open a pastry shop someday ... would you be a patron? <br/>And if I manage it well, I will open more branches, decorate the whole garden with flowers, and even get a kitten...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_119_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王様、お顔にクリームが…<br/>きゃっ！？き、急に顔を寄せられますと、驚いてしまいます…|text_cn=魔王大人的脸上好像沾到了奶油……<br/>呜哇——<br/>……您突然凑近，我会站不稳的……|trans_en=Boss, you have a spot of cream on your face—eek! <br/>Y-You startled me, leaning in suddenly like that...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_119_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=本日のお茶会でお出しするのは、セイナ様がご所望されたピーチ味のパチパチメテオです<br/>魔王様もいかがですか？|text_cn=今天的下午茶，有尘沙小姐指定的桃子味能量沛沛……<br/>魔王大人要来一罐吗？|trans_en=At Noya's request, we'll be serving peach-flavored Pep Pep Juice at today's tea party. <br/>Would you like some, Boss?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_119_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日はアヤメ様と帳簿の確認をしておりました<br/>今月は…さらに節約しなければならないようです|text_cn=昨天和鸢尾小姐一起核对了这个月的账目。<br/>下次采购食材，要更节省一点了。|trans_en=I was checking the accounts with Iris yesterday, and, uh... <br/>I am afraid we need to cut down on expenses even more this month.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_119_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=先ほどお手紙を届けてくださった方…用が済むなり、すぐに去ってしまいました<br/>子ネコのようで、愛らしかったですね…|text_cn=刚才来送信的那个女孩子好像小猫呀，“咻”地一下就跑掉了……<br/>真可爱。|trans_en=That girl who delivered the letter departed as suddenly as she arrived. <br/>She was as adorable as a kitten...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_119_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=福引きで一等を引いた時、ちょうどカシミラ様に出会ったのですが…<br/>そのおかげでしょうか|text_cn=我曾与卡西米拉小姐有过一面之缘，托她的福，我那次抽到了一等奖。|trans_en=I met Kasimira right as I was drawing first prize in the raffle. Was that just coincidence, I wonder?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_119_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=罪を犯した一族の者は…いずれその代償を支払うことになるでしょう|text_cn=我们一族里，那些犯下恶行之人……<br/>总有一天，要为自己的所作所为付出代价。|trans_en=In my clan, those who commit a crime always pay for it ... sooner or later.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_119_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お、おやめください…ナノハはボールフィッシュではありませんから…<br/>つつかないでください…|text_cn=唔唔……请不要戳花原的脸，花原的脸不是嘭嘭鱼……|trans_en=P-Please stop poking me. I'm not a Puffloon fish, you know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_119_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=勝負ですか？ならば受けて立ちましょう|text_cn=很好，花原接受您的挑战。一决胜负吧。|trans_en=A challenge? Very well, I accept.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_119_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=瞑想も修行のうちです|text_cn=静息也是修行的一环。|trans_en=Meditation, too, is a part of training.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_119_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハはここにおりますよ|text_cn=花原随时等待您的召唤。|trans_en=Nanoha will be here waiting!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_119_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王様はお目覚めでしょうか…い、いえ、ナノハは覗いておりませんよ|text_cn=魔王大人，您醒了吗？我、我没有偷看喔……|trans_en=Are you awake, Boss? ... What? N-No! I have NOT been staring at you all night...}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_119_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=日々の生活のお手伝いさせていただきます<br/>谷風家政のメイド、ナノハと申します|text_cn=谷风家政，满足您日常生活的一切需求。<br/>初次见面，我是女仆花原，请多关照。|trans_en=I am Nanoha, one of the maids from Goodwind Homecare. <br/>I can help you with your everyday chores.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_119_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご無沙汰しております。今回は何をいたしましょう？|text_cn=很高兴又和您见面，这次需要哪些服务？|trans_en=It's been a while. What would you have me do today?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_119_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=メイドとして、またひとつ成長しました|text_cn=作为女仆的评级，又提升了呢。|trans_en=Yet again, I have grown as a maid.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_119_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハと葵嵐は一心同体です|text_cn=花原与葵岚，心意相通。|trans_en=Aoi Arashi and Nanoha are of one mind.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_119_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=遙か昔、夢の世界に忘れてきたもの…<br/>一緒に聴いていただき、ありがとうございます|text_cn=那遗落在遥远过去的梦境……感谢您与我共同聆听。|trans_en=A thing long forgotten, lost in the world of dreams... Thank you for listening to it with me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_119_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この曲…一体どなたの追憶を閉じ込めているのでしょう|text_cn=这一曲，又承载了何人的追忆……|trans_en=I wonder ... whose memories this song is capturing?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_119_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=常にお側で寄り添い続けましょう影のように、夢のように…|text_cn=如真似幻，如影随形。|trans_en=Let me stay by your side, always. Like a shadow, like a dream...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_119_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハだけの、特別な贈り物…絶対、大切にします。ふふ♪|text_cn=这份特别的礼物……我会好好珍藏。|trans_en=A special gift just for me? Why, I promise to treasure it forever. Hehe... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_119_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この温もり…ナノハ、絶対に忘れません|text_cn=花原绝不会忘记……这从未感受过的温暖。|trans_en=Nanoha shall never forget this ... warm feeling.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_119_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私のような暗闇を歩む者を受け入れてくださったことに、心からの感謝を<br/>これから先、どこまでもお供いたします|text_cn=花原本是行走于黑暗边缘之人……<br/>承蒙厚爱，不胜感激，花原会永远追随您。|trans_en=I walk in the shadows, but you still accept me with an open heart. <br/>I won't forget your kindness, and I shall follow you anywhere.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_119_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今後も、満月の夜はナノハと２人でお月見をいたしましょう|text_cn=魔王大人，希望以后每一个满月的夜晚，花原都能与您一同欣赏。|trans_en=From now on, let's watch every full moon together.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_119_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=忠実なメイドは、主人のために全てを捧げるもの…<br/>魔王様について行くと決めたあの日から、ナノハは覚悟ができています|text_cn=忠诚的女仆，会为主人献上一切……<br/>当花原决定追随魔王大人的那一刻……<br/>就已经做好了保护您直至最后的觉悟。|trans_en=A devoted servant gives her all to her master. <br/>I resolved to do just that, from the day I decided to follow you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_119_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=感謝いたします|text_cn=花原不胜感激。|trans_en=My pleasure.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_119_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなに素敵なもの…ありがとうございます|text_cn=谢谢。花原……很喜欢。|trans_en=How wonderful... Thank you very much.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_119_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これほど素晴らしいものをいただけるなんて…夢みたいです|text_cn=竟然送我如此贵重的礼物……就像在做梦一样……|trans_en=Not in a thousand years did I imagine I would receive such a thing... It's like a dream.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_119_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=承知しました|text_cn=了解。|trans_en=Understood.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_119_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいえ|text_cn=不。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_119_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Yes?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_119_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっ…|text_cn=诶……|trans_en=Eh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_119_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…|text_cn=唔……|trans_en=(Sniffle)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_119_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=はわぁ…|text_cn=啊~|trans_en=Wow...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_119_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=いけません|text_cn=不可以。|trans_en=That won't do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_119_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ|text_cn=哈……|trans_en=Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_119_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=哎……|trans_en=(Sigh)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_119_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=かしこまりました|text_cn=谨遵吩咐。|trans_en=Understood.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_119_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=そ、そんなに見つめられては…|text_cn=请、请不要这样盯着花原啦……|trans_en=D-Don't stare at me like that...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_119_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=これはメイドとしての使命です|text_cn=这是女仆的使命。|trans_en=This is Nanoha's duty as a maid.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_119_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=美味しいケーキを…|text_cn=蛋糕……美味的蛋糕……|trans_en=Cake ... delicious cake...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_119_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_119_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=お覚悟を|text_cn=觉悟吧。|trans_en=Prepare yourself.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_119_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=咲き誇れ――終末の花！|text_cn=自阴影中绽放，终末之花！|trans_en=Bloom in your full beauty! Doomsday Blossoms!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_119_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=破滅の美、ご覧あれ|text_cn=终结的艺术，请您欣赏。|trans_en=Witness the beauty of destruction.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_119_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=申し訳ございません…|text_cn=拖累大家了……抱歉。|trans_en=My apologies...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_119_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ、倒れるわけには…|text_cn=不，花原应该继续战斗……|trans_en=I can't lose now...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_119_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=感じます…風の力を|text_cn=我领悟到了，这涌动的风。|trans_en=I can feel it... The power of the wind!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_119_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=また一歩、目標に近づきました|text_cn=离目标更近了一步。|trans_en=I'm one step closer to my goal.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_119_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=太陽を目指す花の如く、より高みへ|text_cn=向阳而生的花，绽放得愈加绚烂。|trans_en=Like a flower reaching for the sun, onward and upward.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_119_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハにお任せを|text_cn=请放心交给花原处理。|trans_en=Please leave it to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_119_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=向日葵の香りが、一層強くなりました|text_cn=向日葵的气息更浓烈了……|trans_en=The fragrance of sunflowers grows stronger.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_119_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お手伝いできることはございますか？|text_cn=我能陪您做点什么吗？|trans_en=Is there anything I can help you with?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_119_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=以前はいつも、一人で任務を遂行していました|text_cn=以前执行任务的时候，都只有我一个人。|trans_en=In the past, I always carried out missions by myself.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_119_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=葵嵐は、ナノハの自信作です|text_cn=葵岚，是花原的得意之作。|trans_en=Aoi Arashi is my very own masterpiece.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_119_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハにとって、星狩りは修行の一環にすぎません|text_cn=“摘星”并不是为了实现愿望，而是一种自我修行。|trans_en=As far as I'm concerned, going star plucking is merely one part of my training.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_119_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=故郷に残した小さな苗…無事大輪の花をつけたでしょうか|text_cn=离乡前种下的花，不知现在开了吗……|trans_en=The tiny seedlings I planted back home... Have they blossomed yet into majestic blooms?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_119_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これまでの塔よりも、危険な気配を感じます…|text_cn=今天来的地方有些熟悉，但似乎更加危险……|trans_en=This Monolith feels more dangerous than any other I've seen...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_119_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=情報がございません。どうぞお気をつけください|text_cn=情报不足……请谨慎前行。|trans_en=We have no intelligence. Please tread with caution.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_119_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お買い物ですか？私は大丈夫ですお気遣いいただきありがとうございます|text_cn=感谢您的好意，不过，花原今天不需要采购。|trans_en=Going shopping, are you? No, I don't need anything. But thank you for asking.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_119_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごゆっくりお休みください。あの…膝枕はご入用でしょうか？|text_cn=请好好休息，需要花原的膝枕吗？|trans_en=Please, rest your weary self. You can use Nanoha's lap as a pillow, if you like.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_119_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どのようなお話が聞けるのでしょう？|text_cn=在这里能探听到什么情报呢……|trans_en=What stories will we hear, I wonder?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_119_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=対象を排除しました|text_cn=目标已清除。|trans_en=Targets eliminated.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_119_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=お掃除はお任せください|text_cn=善后工作交给花原就好。|trans_en=Please leave the cleanup to Nanoha.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_119_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ようやく静かになりました|text_cn=终于安静了。|trans_en=Peace and quiet once more.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_119_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご依頼通り、勝利しました|text_cn=如您所愿的胜利。|trans_en=We are victorious, just as requested.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_119_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=思ったより、簡単なお仕事でしたね|text_cn=又是轻松获胜，有些无趣……|trans_en=That was an easier job than I expected.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_119_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この屈辱は、いつか必ず…|text_cn=我会洗刷这次的耻辱。|trans_en=I will not forget this humiliation...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_119_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハの失態です。反省しなければ…|text_cn=虽说胜败无常……但我会记住这次的教训。|trans_en=This was my fault. I need to reflect on this...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_119_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハ、参ります|text_cn=花原，参上。|trans_en=Nanoha takes the stage!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_119_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハ、承りました|text_cn=花原，遵从召唤。|trans_en=Acknowledged!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_119_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご指導お願いいたします|text_cn=花原，请多指教。|trans_en=I ask for guidance.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_119_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=推して参ります|text_cn=花原，准备出击。|trans_en=I shall intervene!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_119_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_119_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ささやかではありますが、手作りのチョコレートをご用意いたしました<br/>ナノハの気持ち、どうぞ受け取ってください|text_cn=这盒巧克力是花原亲手做的……啊，请不要有压力，只是花原的一点心意。|trans_en=It's not much. Just a little bit of hand-made chocolate.<br/>Please take it, as a token of my affection for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_119_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=綺麗な雪景色…庭の小路も、まるで粉砂糖をまぶしたケーキのようですね<br/>あ、ケーキといえば、クリスマスケーキをご用意したのですが…一切れいかがですか？|text_cn=今天下雪了呢，庭院的小路上好像洒了一地的糖霜……您要来尝尝花原做的节日蛋糕吗？|trans_en=What a beautiful snowy landscape. Why, even the garden paths look like the icing on a cake, dusted with powdered sugar.<br/>Ah, speaking of cake, I baked us one for the Snowish Festival. Would you like a slice?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_119_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとうございます、魔王様<br/>本年も何卒よろしくお願いいたします<br/>年の始まりは…いつも不思議と胸のあたりが温かくなりますね|text_cn=新年的第一天是个让人感到温暖的日子……今年也请您多多关照。|trans_en=Happy New Year.<br/>Here's to another wonderful twelve months with my favorite Boss.<br/>You know, the start of a new year always gives me a warm, fuzzy feeling in my chest.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_119_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まさか、他人から誕生日を祝っていただく日が来るなんて…<br/>貴方様のお祝いの言葉は、ナノハにとって最高のプレゼントです♪|text_cn=您是第一个为花原庆祝生日的人，没想到您会记得这一天……<br/>今年许下的生日愿望，已经实现了呢。|trans_en=I never thought I'd see the time when I could celebrate my birthday with a friend...<br/>Your kind words are the greatest gift I could have ever hoped for... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_119_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_119_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日のケーキをご用意いたしました<br/>どうぞお好きなものを…はい？多すぎる…ですか？<br/>実は、貴方様の喜ぶお顔を想像しているうちに、つい…♪お口にあえばよいのですが|text_cn=花原为您准备了生日蛋糕，还请您随意挑选。太多了……？<br/>因为担心做得不够好，所以尝试了各种配方……不知道有没有合您口味的呢？|trans_en=I baked a few birthday cakes for you.<br/>Go on, pick whichever one you like. ... What? Too much?<br/>Well, the truth is, I started imagining your joyful face and got completely carried away... ♪ Bon appetite!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_120_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=脳に酸素を送るため、勉強の合間の運動は非常に効果的なんだ<br/>というわけで、一緒に散歩でもどうかな？|text_cn=学习之余，也要记得活动身体，一起出去走走？|trans_en=I recommend light exercise between study sessions to get oxygen flowing to the brain.<br/>Do you want to take a walk with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_120_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=目つきが怖い？すまない、3時間しか寝られなくてな…|text_cn=诶？我的眼神很吓人吗？抱歉，昨天只睡了三个小时……|trans_en=I look scary? Oh, I'm sorry. I only slept three hours last night.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_120_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一日の計は朝にあり。さて、今日の予定は？|text_cn=一日之计在于晨，今天有什么计划吗？|trans_en=Your morning decides your day. What shall we do today?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_120_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昼寝をするなら、本を枕にしてみるといい。これがなかなか快適なんだ|text_cn=午休是很重要的，虽然没有枕头，但我推荐你直接枕在书上，很舒服的。|trans_en=Try using a book for a pillow when napping. It's surprisingly comfortable.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_120_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう寝るのか？ふむ…なかなか健康的だな。外はまだ暗いというのに|text_cn=这个点就要睡了？嘶……好健康的作息……天都还没亮呢。|trans_en=Going to bed already? Well, "early to bed," they say. It's not even light outside yet...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_120_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=知識を与える代わりに、キミの冒険譚を聞かせてほしい|text_cn=用我的知识来换你冒险的故事如何？|trans_en=I'll give you knowledge, and you tell me about your adventures.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_120_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=堅苦しいドレスは苦手なんだよ。やっぱり私には、この格好のほうがあっている|text_cn=相比那些拘谨的礼服，还是这样的穿着更适合我。|trans_en=I don't get on with stiff, formal attire. This outfit is much more my style.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_120_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここ数日のキミを見ていたら、みんなが頼りにする理由を、ようやく理解できた|text_cn=和你共度的这几天我也学到了很多，总算明白为什么你深受其他人信赖了。|trans_en=Now that I've been with you for a few days, I finally understand why everyone trusts you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_120_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=使命を果たした後は、私のところでアシスタントをしてみないか？|text_cn=等你完成了自己的使命，要不要考虑来当我的助教？|trans_en=Want to become my assistant once you've finished your mission?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_120_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星輝附属大学は、実践主義を掲げているせいか、生徒の個性をおろそかにしがちでな<br/>だが私としては、そうは思わない生徒たちに必要なのは、自らの考えと個性を発揮できる場だ<br/>だからこそ私は、教育者として努力は惜しまないつもりだ|text_cn=星辉大推崇实用主义的教育方针，因此会忽视学生的个性发展。<br/>但我一直觉得，学生应该有机会展示自己的想法和独特之处。为此，身为老师，我也必须要努力。|trans_en=Grace Light Academy emphasizes hands-on learning and practical knowledge, so it can sometimes overlook students' individuality. <br/>But I think what they really need is a place to express their ideas and personality.<br/>That's why I work so hard to hone my skills as a teacher.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_120_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=徹夜による疲労感に対抗するべく1秒で眠りにつく方法を編み出したんだ<br/>ただ…周囲からは、気を失ったのかと心配されてしまうのが難点でな|text_cn=为了对抗熬夜带来的疲惫，现在的我已经可以随时随地一秒入睡。<br/>只是……偶尔被人撞见，总会被误会成是我突然晕了过去。|trans_en=To deal with fatigue caused by all-nighters, I've learned to fall asleep in just one second.<br/>It does tend to alarm people though—they think I've passed out, or worse...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_120_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=真実を追い求めることは否定しない。だがそれには多くの代償と勇気が必要なんだ<br/>なんて、偉そうなことを言っているが…<br/>私の場合、キミから勇気をもらってばかりだけどね|text_cn=追寻真相需要代价和勇气。代价我已经承担了，至于勇气，在遇见你之后，也终于变得完整。|trans_en=Seeking the truth is a noble thing, but it demands courage, and can often exact a heavy price.<br/>Of course, that sounds very grand and all, but the fact is...<br/>Most of my courage comes straight from you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_120_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=アモールの由緒正しい家柄に生まれたんだが…昔いろいろあって、家を離れたんだ<br/>といっても、後悔はしていないむしろいまの自由気ままな生活を存分に楽しんでるくらいさ|text_cn=我出生在千塔一个古老的家族。之前发生了一些事……让我离开了那里。<br/>不过说实话，我并不觉得难过，不如说，现在的日子，对我来说更加轻松自在。|trans_en=I was born into a distinguished family in Emor, but certain circumstances compelled me to leave.<br/>Sad, but I can't say I have regrets—I love the life of freedom and discovery that I have now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_120_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミと出会ったあと、興味本位で『魔王』という言葉の由来を調べてみたんだが…<br/>結局、謎は深まるばかりだったよほぼすべての資料は閲覧禁止だし手がかりになるものはなにもない<br/>でも私はそれでいいと思うんだ。謎があるからこそ真実はよりその価値を増すからね<br/>ふふ。キミもそう思わないか？|text_cn=第一次听说你的时候，我就对“魔王”这个词展开了追根溯源的考究，结果什么都没有查到。<br/>大多资料都被封禁了，连点蛛丝马迹都没留下。不过，正因为如此，真相才越有价值，你也这么觉得吧？|trans_en=After meeting you, I got curious and looked into the etymology of "Tyrant."<br/>Strangely, it was difficult to find any hard data, as a lot of the ancient records were sealed.<br/>But you know, I don't mind at all. After all, mystery is the spice of life!<br/>Hehe... You must know what I mean. Right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_120_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=マーカーを付けながら本を読むと知識が頭に入った気になるそうだ|text_cn=据说看书时，大量使用荧光笔划重点，会给人已经掌握了知识的错觉。|trans_en=Studies show that highlighting textbooks makes people feel like they've absorbed the material.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_120_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=メガネをかけているけど、実際に目がわるいわけじゃない<br/>その…昔から目つきが怖いとよく言われてね<br/>だから生徒を威圧しないよう、教師の仕事が決まったその日に買いに走ったんだ<br/>え？外したところが見たい？いや、それは…考えさせてくれ…|text_cn=这副眼镜只是装饰。以前老被人说眼神太凶，所以当老师的第一天我就买了这个……<br/>你想看我摘下眼镜的样子？我，我得考虑一下……|trans_en=Yes I wear glasses, but the truth is, my eyes are perfectly fine.<br/>The thing is, people used to say that they were scared to look me in the eye.<br/>The moment I was hired as a teacher, I rushed out to buy these so I wouldn't intimidate my students.<br/>What's that? You'd like to see me without them? Well ... I'll have to think about that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_120_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=伝説上の存在が、こうして目の前に立っているなんてな<br/>いつも不思議な気持ちにさせられるよ<br/>だがいくら本の中のキミに触れようと…<br/>私がいまこうして話しているキミこそが真実なんだろう|text_cn=有时候我经常会感慨，那个“传说”的本尊竟然就站在我面前。比起文字上的记载，果然还是切身感受到的你要更加真实。|trans_en=So here I am standing in front of a legendary entity.<br/>It's something to think about, I have to say.<br/>No matter how much I try to get to know you through books and study...<br/>The fact is, I'm actually talking to the real you, right here and now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_120_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふむ…キミ、よく見ると、貴族のような格好をしてるな？<br/>となると…今度パーティーに呼ばれたときは、キミにエスコートを頼んでみるのも悪くないか<br/>ふふ。だいぶ気が楽になりそうだ|text_cn=唔……仔细一看，你穿上礼服还真有几分贵族气质。下次要是被邀请去那种正式场合，让你陪我一起也不错……<br/>呵呵，这样一来，我大概就不会觉得那么难熬了。|trans_en=Hm... The more I look at you, the more you look like a noble.<br/>Maybe next time I'm invited to a wine and cheese at the Academy, I'll get you to be my escort.<br/>Hehe. That would liven things up, I bet!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_120_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の夢は大学を変えること<br/>ノヴァ全土の教育方針を見直し、全ての人に学びの機会を与えたいんだ。キミと一緒に、ね|text_cn=我想改变这里，乃至整个诺瓦的教育方针，让每个人都有获取知识的权利。这个梦想，我想和你一起完成。|trans_en=My dream is to change this university.<br/>I'd reimagine Nova's entire curriculum and give everyone a shot at an education. With you by my side, of course.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_120_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=久々に夢を見たよ<br/>クラスメイトのキミと隣の席で授業を受け、放課後一緒に帰宅していたんだ<br/>ははっ…単純だけど、贅沢な夢だね|text_cn=久违地做了一个梦，梦见我们成为了要好的同桌，一起上课一起放学回家……感觉是一个既简单又奢侈的愿望呢。|trans_en=I actually dreamed last night. You were in the same class as me, and we went home together after school.<br/>Haha... A prosaic yet exquisite dream.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_120_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホタルのやつ、また勝手に遊びに行ったのか…<br/>いや、探しにいかなくていい。あの子なら、お腹が減ったらひょっこり帰ってくるよ<br/>そもそもどこで遊んでいるのやら|text_cn=火垂又不见了？别担心，那孩子肚子饿了的话，自己会悄悄溜回来的。|trans_en=That Firefly took off on her own, yet again...<br/>I wouldn't bother looking for her, either. She'll slink back once she's hungry enough.<br/>I do wonder where she goes to all day...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_120_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アッシュエリアが生んだ天才、ミネルバだろう？もちろん知っているよ<br/>確固たる信念を持っているし、おまけに成績優秀で可愛い<br/>ぜひ我が校に来てほしいくらいだが…引き抜きは難しいだろうな|text_cn=密涅瓦？我认识她，成绩好，有个性，还很可爱，可以的话希望她能来我们这上学，不过……<br/>呵呵，还是算了。|trans_en=Minova, the genius from the Ash District?<br/>Well, she's focused on her goals, gets excellent grades, and she's cute to boot.<br/>Frankly, I wish she'd come to my school, but that could be difficult to arrange.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_120_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=暇さえあれば本を読んでいるあの子は…そうか、アヤメというのか。<br/>彼女を見ていると、なんだかとても懐かしい気持ちになるよ|text_cn=闲下来就看书的那位叫鸢尾是吧，看她读书的样子，总觉得有些怀念……|trans_en=That girl who always reads whenever she has a free moment... Iris, right?<br/>She really reminds me of myself at that age.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_120_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=野菜をたくさん買ったんだ。よければ少し持っていかないか？<br/>あの3人は育ち盛りだし、きちんと栄養をとらないとね|text_cn=我买了些蔬菜，你拿回去吧。那三个孩子都在长身体，营养这块别落下了。|trans_en=I got lots of vegetables. Would you like some?<br/>You've got three growing girls who need proper nutrition.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_120_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=料理では柔軟な思考が鍵になる。そう考えると、鳳凰炒飯はいい線をいっているね。<br/>食材の良さを生かした料理は、まるで物語のようだ|text_cn=做菜就和学习一样，不能太死板。<br/>在这点上我看好凤凰炒蛋的经营理念，海纳百川，各具特色，每一道菜就好像一个故事。|trans_en=You have to stay flexible with cooking, just like studying.<br/>Come to think of it, Fenghuang Diner is good at that.<br/>Making a good meal is a lot like writing a good story.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_120_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ああ、わかったわかった。順番に話を聞くから、焦るんじゃない|text_cn=知道啦知道啦，别着急，我会耐心听你说~|trans_en=All right, all right. Settle down. I'll hear everyone in turn.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_120_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ、私は…太っていないだろう！？|text_cn=诶？我没有长胖吧！|trans_en=I-I am NOT fat! ... Am I?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_120_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はもう限界か？ならここまでにしよう<br/>無理をすると、かえって悪い結果を招くこともあるんだ。覚えておくといい|text_cn=累了吗？今天要不就先到这里，太过勉强的话可能会适得其反哦。|trans_en=Reached your limit? Well, why don't we just wrap up here?<br/>Overdoing things can lead to worse results, as you should know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_120_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王というのは、なにを考えて過ごしているんだ？ふむ…どんどん気になってきたぞ|text_cn=身为魔王的你，现在又在想些什么呢？|trans_en=Now I'm curious. What does a tyrant spend their day pondering? Any ideas?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_120_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この寝顔、何度見ても飽きない…ふふ|text_cn=这张睡脸真是怎么看都不腻……呵呵~|trans_en=I love looking at this sleeping face. Hee hee.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_120_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめまして。私はカナーチェ、星輝附属大学の教師だ。<br/>キミがあの伝説の魔王か…ふふ。ともに過ごす時間、楽しみにしているよ|text_cn=初次见面，我是星辉附属大学的老师，叫我卡娜丝就好，你就是传说中的魔王啊……呵呵，很期待与你接下来的合作。|trans_en=Hello. My name is Canace, a professor at the Grace Light Academy.<br/>You must be the legendary boss I've read about.<br/>Hehe. I'm looking forward to spending time with you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_120_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また会えてうれしいよ。それで…旅の途中、なにか新しい発見はあったかな？|text_cn=又见面了！如何，旅途中有没有新的发现？|trans_en=It's a pleasure to meet you again. So... Did you make any new discoveries on your adventures?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_120_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=大事なのは、日々の積み重ねだ|text_cn=日益精进，持之以恒。|trans_en=Day-to-day consistency is the key.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_120_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=風の音が、はっきりと呼び掛けてくる|text_cn=风的律动，无比明晰。|trans_en=The sound of the wind is calling to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_120_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これで、今日までの努力が報われたんだろうか…|text_cn=现在所成就的一切，是否对得起过去的那些日子呢……|trans_en=At last, all that hard work has paid off.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_120_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい着眼点だ。キミは音楽にも理解があるようだな|text_cn=不错，看来你对音乐也略懂一二。|trans_en=Interesting. It seems you know a thing or two about music.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_120_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミの期待に応えるためにも、そろそろ本気を出そうか|text_cn=看来我得拿出真正的实力来回应你了。|trans_en=I guess I should get serious if I want to live up to your expectations.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_120_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミといると、勉強になるな。教師になってからは中々味わえない体験だ|text_cn=和你在一起能学到不少东西，当了老师之后，这样的感觉还是头一次。|trans_en=As a teacher, it's rare for me to learn from anyone. But it's different with you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_120_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=客間を片付けておいた。旅に疲れた時はいつでもうちに寄ってくれ<br/>私としても、賑やかなのは嫌いではないんだ|text_cn=我腾出了一间客房，你在外旅行累了的话，就来住一段时间吧。<br/>家里多个人也会热闹些。|trans_en=I got my guest room set up, so stop by whenever you get tired.<br/>I wouldn't mind some company at my place.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_120_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=塔を登るときも研究するときも、キミといるのが当たり前だと感じるようになってきたよ<br/>ふふ。それで…このあと予定は？|text_cn=无论是爬塔还是研究，我好像已经习惯有你在身边了。所以……最近有时间吗？|trans_en=Whether it's research or climbing towers, it feels like whatever I'm doing, you should be there beside me.<br/>Hehe... So, do you have any plans right now?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_120_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=退勤までまだ少し時間があるし…次の授業内容を確認しておこう<br/>お、ちょうどいいところに…！どうかな、私の授業、特別に聞いていかないか？|text_cn=哈啊，都这个点了吗？虽然下班时间还没到……但我不介意多一个备课的帮手。<br/>哈哈，怎么，难道你也有想补的课吗……？|trans_en=I've still got a bit more time, so I guess I'll look over the next lesson plan.<br/>... Actually, this is perfect timing. How would you like to sit in on one of my classes?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_120_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまには仕事を忘れて、風の吹くまま旅に出てみるのも悪くはなさそうだ<br/>目的地？そんなのキミと一緒ならどこでもいいよ|text_cn=偶尔也想暂时放下手头上的事，来一场说走就走的旅行。<br/>目的地不重要，重点是和你一起。|trans_en=Every now and then, it's not a bad idea to just forget work and set off wherever the wind takes me.<br/>Destination? Doesn't matter, as long as I'm going there with you at my side.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_120_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう、その気持ちだけで嬉しいよ|text_cn=你的这份心意，我就收下了。|trans_en=Thanks. The thought alone is enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_120_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ。私の好みを正確に把握してるなんて、やるじゃないか|text_cn=用心做功课了啊，竟然知道我喜欢什么~|trans_en=Hehe. Well done. You know my tastes perfectly.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_120_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんな貴重なものを見つけてくるなんて…大変だったろう？<br/>ありがとう、感謝するよ|text_cn=真亏你能找到这个，费了不少心思吧？谢啦！|trans_en=You found this precious thing just for me? That can't have been easy.<br/>Thank you, from the bottom of my heart.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_120_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいだろう|text_cn=嗯哼。|trans_en=Sure.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_120_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=駄目だ|text_cn=不可以。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_120_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=どういう意味だ？|text_cn=什么意思？|trans_en=What do you mean?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_120_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=理解できないな|text_cn=我不理解。|trans_en=I don't understand.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_120_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=……|text_cn=……|trans_en=...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_120_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんだと！|text_cn=真的吗！|trans_en=What!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_120_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=馬鹿者！|text_cn=蠢货！|trans_en=Idiot!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_120_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くない|text_cn=不错。|trans_en=Not bad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_120_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=(Sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_120_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=よくやった|text_cn=干得不错。|trans_en=Great job!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_120_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=久しぶりだな。元気だったか？|text_cn=别来无恙。|trans_en=It's been a while. How've you been?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_120_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ノヴァの謎は、私が解き明かす|text_cn=诺瓦的谜题，我会解开的。|trans_en=I'll crack Nova's mysteries.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_120_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ…これは面白い|text_cn=呵……有意思。|trans_en=Heh heh... Very interesting.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_120_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_120_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、授業の時間だ|text_cn=快过来，上课时间到了。|trans_en=Right, time for class.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_120_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=学問の奥深さ、教えてやろう！|text_cn=感受知识的风暴！|trans_en=I'll teach you the power of learning!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_120_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=風よ、真理へ導いてくれ！|text_cn=风起，照见真知！|trans_en=Wind, guide the ignorant to truth!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_120_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=智者の一失、か…|text_cn=骑者善堕……|trans_en=Even a genius makes mistakes...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_120_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=役目を、果たせていないのに…|text_cn=责任，尚未完成……|trans_en=I haven't completed my task...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_120_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=学問に終わりはない|text_cn=学无止境。|trans_en=Knowledge knows no bounds.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_120_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=眠っていた力が、目を覚ましたような気分だ|text_cn=我能感受到，力量被唤醒了。|trans_en=It's like some power has been awakened.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_120_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くない。また一つ正解に近づいた|text_cn=不错，给了我新启发。|trans_en=Not bad. One step closer to the solution.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_120_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=授業で教えた通りにすれば、きっと上手くいく|text_cn=按我圈的重点来，就不会有问题。|trans_en=Just do as you've been taught and it will work out.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_120_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=生徒を導くのは、教師の使命だ|text_cn=引导学生，是老师的职责。|trans_en=A teacher’s role is to guide their students.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_120_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミと星ノ塔に登ると、なぜだかはじめての体験をすることが多いんだ|text_cn=和你一起探索星塔，总能获得新的体验。|trans_en=When I climb the monolith with you, for some reason, I have a lot of novel experiences.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_120_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい風だ。職員室に閉じこもったままでは味わえなかっただろう|text_cn=我喜欢微风拂过身体的感觉，这可是在办公室里享受不到的体验。|trans_en=The air is so fresh. I'm glad I decided to take a break from the faculty office.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_120_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=今回はどんな発見があるんだろうな！|text_cn=唔……这次能有什么新发现呢？|trans_en=I wonder what new things we'll discover this time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_120_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=教科書はあくまで出発点でしかない。実践こそが見識を広げる鍵となるんだ|text_cn=课本只是起点，实践才是探索世界的钥匙。|trans_en=Book learning is only the beginning. Real knowledge lies in actual doing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_120_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=結果だけでなく、そこに至る過程も重要なんだ。冒険でも、人生でもね|text_cn=结果固然重要，但也别忽视过程中的美好，旅途也是，人生也是。|trans_en=On an adventure as in life, it's not the destination, but the journey.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_120_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=しっかり勉強すれば、どんな難問でも解けるようになるさ|text_cn=不要怕题难，多做多练就能过关。|trans_en=Keep studying hard, and you'll learn how to solve any problem.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_120_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初めて見る問題だな。だが解き方は今までの応用だ|text_cn=虽然是新的题目，但解题思路是一致的。|trans_en=This is a novel problem, but just apply what you've learned so far.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_120_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここの店員はいつ来ても起きているな…<br/>寝なくても生きていける方法があるなら聞いてみたいものだが|text_cn=这里的店员一看就是熬夜高手，想去和她交流下心得啊。|trans_en=The staff here are awake at all hours.<br/>I wish they'd teach me how to get by without sleep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_120_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=遠くまで行くつもりなら、適度に休憩を挟むこと|text_cn=劳逸结合才能走得更远。|trans_en=Be sure to take some breaks if you plan on traveling far.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_120_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=四択問題で迷った時は3を選ぶこと。五択なら4だよ|text_cn=三长一短选最短，三短一长选最长。|trans_en=If you don't know the answer, pick C. Unless there are five choices. Then pick D.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_120_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ケガをした者はいないか？|text_cn=没有人受伤吧。|trans_en=Anybody hurt?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_120_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう時間か、授業はここまで|text_cn=好，准时下课。|trans_en=Time's up already? Class dismissed.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_120_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=肩が凝ったな…|text_cn=肩膀有点累了……|trans_en=I could use a massage...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_120_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちゃんとノートを取って、次の戦いに備えること|text_cn=做好笔记，应对下一场战斗。|trans_en=Take notes in preparation for the next battle.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_120_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ペンは剣よりも強し|text_cn=智谋为先，方能制胜。|trans_en=The pen is mightier than the sword.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_120_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たった一度の失敗で、落ち込むことはない|text_cn=只是一次失败而已，没什么大不了的。|trans_en=One loss is not the end of the world.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_120_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=同じミスを繰り返さないように|text_cn=一道题不要错两次。|trans_en=Don't make the same mistake twice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_120_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい選択だ|text_cn=明智之选。|trans_en=Good choice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_120_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=教師として最善を尽くそう|text_cn=你挑对老师了。|trans_en=You picked the right teacher.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_120_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=任せてくれ|text_cn=交给我就好。|trans_en=Leave this to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_120_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=人を見る目があるな|text_cn=眼光不错。|trans_en=You know how to pick 'em.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_120_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_120_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=バレンタイン…なるほどな。どうりで生徒たちがそわそわしていたわけだ<br/>ただ…申し訳ない。最近忙しくてキミへのチョコを用意し忘れていてね<br/>ああそうだ、少し遅くなるが…よければ帰りに、一緒に買いに行かないか？|text_cn=情人节……原来如此。难怪学生们都有些莫名骚动……<br/>但是……抱歉啊，最近太忙了所以完全没时间给你准备巧克力。<br/>对了，虽然有些晚了……等今天下班之后我们一起去买吧。|trans_en=Valentine's Day? Ah. That explains why the students were acting so strange.<br/>You'll have to forgive me. I've been so busy, I completely forgot to make you any chocolate.<br/>Oh, I have an idea. Why don't we go back together and we'll pick some up at the shop along the way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_120_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=窓際に座り、コーヒー片手に、雪合戦する生徒たちを眺める…<br/>大人の私にとっては、そんな時間こそがクリスマスプレゼントみたいなものかな<br/>なにより今日はキミも一緒だし、そういう意味じゃ、期待した以上のサプライズプレゼントだ|text_cn=坐在窗前，喝着咖啡，看操场上的孩子们打雪仗……对现在的我来说，这样的时光。已经算得上是最好的雪愿节礼物了。<br/>呵~更何况还有你在我身边，这个日子好像变得更特别了……|trans_en=Sitting by the window, sipping a hot mug of coffee, watching my student charges having snowball fights...<br/>For grown-ups like me, such things are the real pleasures of the Snowish Festival.<br/>And now you're here too—which is like a surprise gift, but twice as good!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_120_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう。ん？その顔…ふふ。なにか特別な計画でも立てているのかな？<br/>去年はキミと過ごす中でいくつも新しい発見があったし…<br/>もしなにか考えているなら、ぜひ協力させてくれ<br/>今年もいろいろなことに、ふたりで挑戦していこう|text_cn=新年快乐，魔王。唔，看你的样子，果然又在盘算些什么特别的计划吧？<br/>过去一年，你总给我带来一些意想不到的惊喜，如果今年你有新的目标或想法，记得随时找我聊聊。<br/>今年也一起迎接新的挑战吧。|trans_en=Happy New Year. ... Hm? You've got a look on your face as if you're plotting something.<br/>Well, I made lots of interesting discoveries with you this past year...<br/>And if you're thinking of more adventures, then count me in.<br/>I want to take on even more challenges this year, especially with you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_120_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は私の誕生日だったのか。研究のことばかり考えていたからすっかり忘れていたよ<br/>それにキミから祝ってもらえると思っていなかったからな。嬉しいよ…ありがとう<br/>そうだ。よければこのあと、食事に付き合ってくれないか？|text_cn=我的生日？唉呀……最近忙得都把这事给忘了。<br/>谢谢你啦，魔王，我知道一家不错的店，能赏脸陪我一块吗~？|trans_en=Oh, is it my birthday? I've been so busy with my research I completely forgot.<br/>And even if I had remembered, I certainly wouldn't have expected you to celebrate it with me...<br/>But thank you. Shall we go out for dinner?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_120_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_120_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はキミの誕生日だったな。ふふ。もちろん覚えているさ<br/>さて、丸一日休暇にしたししたいことをなんでも言ってみてくれ|text_cn=你的生日？我当然记得，为此我还特地请了一天假。那么，今天有什么打算？|trans_en=So today is your birthday. ... Hehe. Of course I didn't forget.<br/>In fact, I cleared my whole schedule just so we can spend the day doing whatever you want.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_123_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わは～！こんなところにまうまうみっけ！|text_cn=哇！是野生的魔魔王！|trans_en=Whoa! What's Big Bo doing here?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_123_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえ、アンズと一緒に遊ぼ！|text_cn=嘿嘿，要不要和杏子一起玩~|trans_en=Come on, play with me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_123_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=朝なの～！ほらほらまうまう！早くお外に遊びに行くの～！|text_cn=早上啦！快带杏子出去玩！|trans_en=It's morning! C'mon, Big Bo! Let's go outside and play!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_123_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わふぅ、遊び疲れたの…ふぁあ…まうまう～、アンズと一緒にねんねしよ～…|text_cn=呜诶，玩累了……<br/>呼哇~~<nowiki/>~和杏子一起睡午觉吧……|trans_en=Phew, I'm so tired... <br/>(yawns) Let's take a nap together, Big Bo...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_123_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わおーん――えへへ、ココのまねっこなの。ココは夜になると、よくこうしてるの|text_cn=嗷呜呜呜——嘿嘿，晚上可可就喜欢这样~|trans_en=Awooooo... Hehe, I was just doing my impression of what Coco does every night.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_123_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココはちっさくなれるの！ぎゅーってすると、ふわふわであったかいの！|text_cn=可可还能变小哦，抱起来软软的，暖呼呼的~|trans_en=Coco can get smaller, you know? She's so warm and fluffy when you give her a big hug!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_123_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=まうまうから麦のいい香りがするの！|text_cn=魔魔王身上香香的，有麦子的味道！|trans_en=You smell really nice! Like barley and oats!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_123_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=むにゃむにゃ…村のみんなと、たき火の周りで歌って…おててをぎゅーして、仲良しこよし…|text_cn=呼……村里的大家……<br/>一起围在篝火边……<br/>手牵手，唱着歌……|trans_en=Mumble, mumble... <br/>Singing around the bonfire with everyone in the village... <br/>Holding hands and getting all cozy with my besties...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_123_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ばいばいは嫌なの…まうまうと、ココとポポ、村のみんなで…|text_cn=我们不要分开……<br/>……可可……魔魔王，还有村子里的大家……|trans_en=I hate bye-byes... <br/>Whether with you, Coco, Bubble, or the villagers...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_123_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココの名前は、ホットココアからつけたの<br/>だって身体がココアみたいにあったかいから！|text_cn=可可的名字是怎么来的？<br/>因为她和热可可一样，都暖乎乎的嘛~|trans_en=I named Coco after hot cocoa. <br/>I mean, her body's as warm as a cup of hot chocolate!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_123_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=大人たちは、いい暮らしがしたいからって、村を出ていくけど…<br/>村でみんなと一緒にいる方が幸せじゃないの？|text_cn=大人们总说要去外地讨生活……<br/>唔，可是离开了家乡，还算是生活吗？|trans_en=Grown-ups say they leave the village to live a good life...<br/>Is that really happier than staying with everyone in the village?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_123_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココ、おすわり、おて！あっ、まうまう！まうまうもおすわり、おて、するの？|text_cn=可可坐下，握手手~<br/>啊，是魔魔王……<br/>嘻嘻，魔魔王坐下，握手手~|trans_en=Coco! Sit! Paw! <br/>Oh, Big Bo! <br/>Do you wanna make Coco do tricks too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_123_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズの村では、田んぼにポンポン魚を放しておくの<br/>わるわるな虫を食べてくれるから、お米がおっきく育つの…<br/>わは、思いついた！今日から村の名前をポンポン魚村にしよ！<br/>かわいい名前だから、きっとお客さんがいっぱい来るの！|text_cn=大人们把嘭嘭鱼养在田里，让他们去捉害虫，所以村子里的水稻才长得又大又好！<br/>对了，应该把村名改成嘭嘭鱼鱼村，这么可爱的名字一定会吸引很多人来我们的村子！|trans_en=In Ann's village, we put PonPon fish in the rice fields 'cause they eat all the bad bugs and help the rice grow big and strong.<br/>... Oh, I just had an idea! <br/>We should start calling the place PonPon Village! It's a cute name, so I'm sure tons of people will come 'n' visit!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_123_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=まうまう、今度アンズのおうちに来て！ココが作ったごはん、ごちそうしてあげるの！<br/>ん、どうしたの？ココだってお料理くらいするよ？|text_cn=魔魔王下次来杏子家里做客吧，可可做的菜很好吃的！<br/>嗯？怎么了，一直都是可可做饭呀。|trans_en=Big Bo, come to Ann's house sometime, okay?! You can try out all the dishes Coco cooks! <br/>Hm, what's the matter? Of course Coco can cook!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_123_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=森には探検隊のメンバーが作った秘密基地があるの。最近はあんまり使ってないけど…<br/>でもでも、いつかはみんな戻ってくるはずだから、毎週お掃除しないと！|text_cn=森林里有一个侦查小队成员们一起搭的秘密基地，唔……<br/>虽然现在用不上了，但杏子每周都会去打扫。大家总有一天会回来的，要做好准备才行！|trans_en=There's a secret base in the forest that the scout buddies built. <br/>They don't use it much these days, though. <br/>But I'm sure they'll come back someday, so I always clean it, every week!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_123_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえ、一緒にココのお散歩行かない？じゃあ、ココの背中に乗って！<br/>大丈夫、まうまうはお友達だから、乗ってもココは気にしないの！|text_cn=要不要一起陪可可去散步？那快坐到可可背上来吧~<br/>放心啦，魔魔王已经是我们的好朋友了，可可不会介意的！|trans_en=Hey hey, wanna go for a walk with me and Coco? Then climb onto Coco's back! <br/>Don't worry, you're a friend! Coco won't mind you riding her!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_123_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=探検隊の臨時メンバーに、まうまうを任命するの！<br/>ほらほら、頭を下げて…はい、アンズの手作り花かんむりなの～！|text_cn=魔魔王已经是侦查小队的编外成员了。来，头低一下~<br/>嘿~送给你，这是杏子亲手做的花环~|trans_en=I hereby appoint Big Bo as an honorary member of the scout team! Come on, lower your head... <br/>Here you go, Ann's homemade flower wreath!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_123_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お部屋を真っ暗にしてねんねするのは怖くないの<br/>でも…たまに悪い夢を見るの…起きた時に、まうまうがいてくれたらいいのに…|text_cn=虽……虽然现在杏子已经不会再害怕关灯睡觉了……<br/>但是偶尔还是会做噩梦……<br/>呜，要是醒来的时候都有魔魔王在该多好啊。|trans_en=Ann's not scared of sleeping in the dark. <br/>But ... sometimes I have bad dreams. <br/>It'd be so much nicer if you were there when I wake up...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_123_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほんとのパパとママは知らないの。でも寂しくないの<br/>アンズには、ココとポポと村のみんな…それとまうまうがいるの！|text_cn=爸爸妈妈在哪里……我不知道。但杏子也有很多重要的家人，可可，泡泡，村子里的大家……还有魔魔王！|trans_en=I don't know my real mommy or daddy. But I'm not lonely. <br/>Ann's got Coco, Bubble, and everyone in the village... And best of all, I've got you, Big Bo!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_123_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日の夜、流れ星にお願い事をしたの！まうまうがずーっと側に――<br/>ってだめだめ！何をお願いしたか教えたら、叶わなくなっちゃうの！<br/>聞かなかったことにして、ね…？|text_cn=杏子昨晚看到了流星~还许了愿，希望魔魔王能留下来永远陪着我——<br/>啊！愿望说出来就不灵了！魔魔王就装作没听到……好不好？|trans_en=Last night I made a wish on a shooting star! I wished you'd always be by my—<br/>no, wait! If I tell you what I wished, it won't come true! Can you pretend you didn't hear that? Pleeease?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_123_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まうまう、『カフェ・猫の箱』って知ってる？<br/>ネコちゃんがいっぱいいるカフェなんだって！かわいいだろうなぁ…<br/>あっ、でもでも！世界一かわいいのは、ココなの！|text_cn=有一个叫猫箱咖啡屋的地方，那里有好多猫咪，好可爱哦……唔，但是！可可才是世界第一可爱！|trans_en=Big Bo, ever heard of the Cat Box Café?<br/>It's got tons and tons of kitties! I bet they're all super cute... But the cutest animal in the world's definitely Coco!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_123_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前田んぼで見かけた騎士のお姉さん、こんなポーズで『変身！』って叫んでたの<br/>かっこよかったの！|text_cn=之前在稻田边看到一个骑士姐姐，还大喊“变身”什么的……好酷哦！|trans_en=I saw the knight lady in this rice field the other day scream "TRANSFORM!" as she posed just like this. It was sooooo cool!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_123_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=鎌を持ってる白いお姉さん、どうしていつもアンズを見てるのかな…<br/>えっ、お医者さんなの？ア、アンズ、毎日歯磨きしてるの！|text_cn=那个穿白大褂拿镰刀的大姐姐为什么总是盯着杏子？<br/>医生？杏、杏子有好好刷牙哦！|trans_en=Why's that pale girl with the scythe always staring at Ann? <br/>Huh? She's a doctor? B-But I brush my teeth every day!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_123_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ササお姉さんのことは知ってるの<br/>前にあの人が木に引っかかってたのを、ココと一緒に助けてあげたの！<br/>そしたら、このことは『他の人』にしゃべっちゃダメって…<br/>あっ。まあでも、まうまうは『他の人』じゃないからいいんだよね？|text_cn=杏子以前见过莎莎姐，她当时倒挂在树上，是我和可可把她救下来的，她还叮嘱过不要告诉别人。<br/>不过，魔魔王不算是“别人”，应该不要紧吧……|trans_en=I know Sis Tessa. She got caught in a tree this one time, and me and Coco helped her out! She told me not to ever tell anyone about it... <br/>Oh, but you're not just "anyone," so it's okay, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_123_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=レンレンお姉さんは『あの人たち』と一緒にいるのにアンズに優しいの<br/>それに背が高くて、とっても綺麗…<br/>アンズもおっきくなったら、お姉さんみたいになれるかな？|text_cn=<nobr>冷冷翠姐姐虽然有时候和“那些人”走在一起，但是对杏子却很好……</nobr><br/>而且她又高又漂亮，唔……杏子长大了也能变得像她一样吗？|trans_en=Even though that Firenze's with those scary people, she's nice to Ann. <br/>Plus, she's tall and super-duper pretty... Will I be like that when I grow up?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_123_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わは～、くすぐったい！|text_cn=哈哈~好痒~|trans_en=Wahahaha! That tickles!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_123_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ポポをつんつんしてみて！ぽんぽんぽ～んって膨らむの！|text_cn=来戳戳泡泡，它会嘭得一下鼓起来哦！|trans_en=Try poking Bubble! She puffs up like a balloon!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_123_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まうまうは…帰ってくる、こない、くる、こない…むぅうう、もう一回やるの！|text_cn=魔魔王会回来，不会回来，会回来，不会……<br/>咕呜！重来！|trans_en=Big Bo will come back, won't come back, will come back, aaand ... won't come back. <br/>Argh! I'll try one more time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_123_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=つんつん、つんつん…わふぅ、起きない…<br/>あっ、ココ！まうまうをくわえて持って帰るのはめっなの！|text_cn=戳戳~没有反应呢……<br/>诶？！可可！不能叼回家啦！|trans_en=Poke-poke, pokity-poke... Hm, still won't wake up. No, Coco! <br/>You can't carry Big Bo back in your mouth!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_123_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえまうまう。アンズ、果物を持ってきたの。だから…こっち向いて？|text_cn=呜呜……魔魔王，杏子给你带了水果，不要不理我嘛……|trans_en=Hey hey, Big Bo. Ann brought some fruit. So ... could you turn this way?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_123_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まうまう、やっと会えたの！アンズを冒険に連れてって！|text_cn=魔魔王~杏子终于见到你啦，诶嘿，能带杏子一起去冒险吗~|trans_en=Big Bo, I finally got to meet you! C'mon, take Ann on an awesome adventure!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_123_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わは～！かくれんぼ、また見つかっちゃった！じゃあ今度はアンズが鬼なの！|text_cn=哇~魔魔王又找到杏子啦~那下次轮到杏子来找你啦~|trans_en=Wahaha! You found me again! Now it's Ann's turn to be "it"!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_123_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これでどんなにわるわるなやつが来ても、アンズには勝てないの！|text_cn=坏蛋们再也不是杏子的对手啦~|trans_en=Now not even the baddest of the baddies can beat Ann!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_123_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココがまうまうに『ありがとう』だって！|text_cn=嘿嘿~可可在感谢你呢~|trans_en=Coco says, "Thanks, Big Bo"!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_123_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このお歌…昔聞いたことがある気がするの<br/>たしかあの時は…ココの隣に、大人が2人…|text_cn=杏子好像记起了以前的童谣，还有站在可可身边的，两个大人……|trans_en=I think I heard this song a long time ago. I'm pretty sure ... there were two adults next to Coco at the time...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_123_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいお歌！歌えるようになったら、まうまうにも聞かせるの！|text_cn=好好听！等我学会了就唱给魔魔王听~|trans_en=What a nice song! I'll sing it to Big Bo—if I ever learn how!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_123_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズもココもポポも、みんなみんな強くなってるの！<br/>だからまうまう、早く出発しよ！わるわるなやつを倒しにいくの～！|text_cn=杏子和可可泡泡都变得更厉害啦~魔魔王快跟上，我们要去打坏人啦！|trans_en=Ann, Coco, and Bubble have all gotten soooo strong! So, come on, Big Boss! Let's hurry up and get going! Let's beat up those baddies!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_123_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=すぅ、すぅ…アンズは、ずっとずっとみんなと一緒に…|text_cn=呼……杏子，要和大家一起，永远都不要分开……|trans_en=Zzz... Ann's gonna stay with everyone forever... Zzz...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_123_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=森で一番甘い果物がどこで取れるか、アンズ知ってるの<br/>ほらほら、お耳を貸して。まうまうにだけ教えてあげるの！|text_cn=杏子知道森林里最甜的野果在哪里，嘿嘿，只偷偷跟魔魔王说哦~|trans_en=Ann knows where you can get the sweetest fruits in the forest. Hey, listen real close 'cause you're the only one I'll tell, Big Bo!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_123_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…昨夜は、嫌な夢を見たの<br/>ねえまうまう…まうまうのすごい力で、夢の中のわるわるなやつをやっつけて？|text_cn=呜……昨天晚上做噩梦了。魔魔王那么厉害，可以把杏子梦里的坏东西都赶跑吗？|trans_en=(sniffle)... I had a nasty dream last night. Hey, Big Bo... Could you use your amazing powers to beat up all the baddies in my dreams?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_123_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズは最近、読み書きの練習を頑張ってるの！<br/>まうまうに会えない時、お手紙書いたりしたいから！<br/>そしたらまうまうも、アンズにお返事くれるよね？わは～、じゃあ指切りするの！|text_cn=最近杏子努力学习识字了！<br/>希望魔魔王不在的时候，我们也能靠写信联系！<br/>魔魔王收到后，也会给杏子回信的吧？拉钩钩！|trans_en=Ann's been working hard practicing reading and writing! <br/>'Cause I wanna write you letters when you're far away! <br/>You'll write me back, won't you? Yay, then let's pinky promise!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_123_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=決めたの！<br/>みんなと力をあわせて、まうまうがずーっとここにいたいって思える村にするの！|text_cn=决定了，杏子要和大家一起，把村子变成更加棒的地方！让魔魔王来了就不想走~|trans_en=I've made up my mind! <br/>Ann's gonna work with everyone to make this village into the kind of place Bossy will always want to be!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_123_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まうまうからのプレゼントー！アンズ、ずっと大事にするの！|text_cn=是魔魔王送的礼物~杏子会好好收起来的！|trans_en=A present from Big Bo! Ann will treasure it forever and ever!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_123_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わーい！アンズ、これほしかったのー！まうまうは人の心が読めるの！？|text_cn=好厉害……魔魔王是不是会读心术呀？|trans_en=Yay! This is just what Ann wanted! You can read minds!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_123_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズもココもポポも！みーんなこれ大好きー！|text_cn=杏子喜欢这个！可可和泡泡也喜欢这个！|trans_en=Ann, Coco, and Bubble ALLLLL love this!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_123_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うんうん！|text_cn=嗯嗯！|trans_en=Mm-hm!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_123_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=だめだめ！|text_cn=不行不行！|trans_en=Nuh-uh!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_123_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え～？|text_cn=诶~？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_123_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズわかんない…|text_cn=杏子不懂……|trans_en=Ann's confused...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_123_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…|text_cn=呜呜……|trans_en=(sniffle)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_123_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=わは～！|text_cn=哇！|trans_en=Yay!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_123_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=がおー！|text_cn=嗷！咬你哦！|trans_en=Grrr!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_123_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふんふんふ～ん♪|text_cn=啦啦啦啦~♪|trans_en=Hm, hm, hm. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_123_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=わふぅ…|text_cn=呜诶~|trans_en=(sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_123_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=お日様、明日も会えるよね？|text_cn=太阳公公，明天也会出来吗？|trans_en=The sun'll come out tomorrow too, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_123_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=田んぼのわるわるな虫をやっつけに行くの？|text_cn=要和杏子来田里捉坏虫虫吗？|trans_en=Wanna go beat all the bad bugs in the rice fields?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_123_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズは森から帰ったばかりなの！|text_cn=杏子刚从森林回来！|trans_en=But Ann just got BACK from the forest!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_123_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=村のみんなはどこに行ったんだろ…|text_cn=村里的大家都去哪了呢……|trans_en=I wonder where all the villagers went...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_123_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_123_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココ、起きて！ぱとろーるの時間なの！|text_cn=可可别睡啦，到巡逻的时间咯~|trans_en=Coco, wake up! It's time for patrol!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_123_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココとポポ、みんなでいっけぇ！|text_cn=可可，泡泡，大家一起上！|trans_en=Coco and Bubble... Let's do it together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_123_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココとポポのすごさを見せてやるの！|text_cn=让你们知道可可泡泡的厉害！|trans_en=I'll show you just how awesome Coco and Bubble are!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_123_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなと、離れたくないの…|text_cn=不想，和大家分开……|trans_en=I don't wanna leave you guys...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_123_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…もう、眠いの…|text_cn=想睡觉了……|trans_en=Ngh... I'm so sleepy...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_123_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わは～！ココがもっと強くなったの！|text_cn=可可好像变得更厉害了~|trans_en=Wow! Coco, you've gotten even stronger!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_123_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=見て！果物入りのかご、２つも持ち上げられるようになったの！|text_cn=杏子也变强了，可以举起两筐水果啦~|trans_en=Look! I can carry two baskets of fruit now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_123_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ポポ、前よりまんまるになっちゃった？|text_cn=泡泡是不是长得更圆啦？|trans_en=Bubble, have you gotten even rounder?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_123_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=がおー！これでも～っと頑張れるの！|text_cn=杏子会努力的！|trans_en=Awooo! Now Ann can work even harder!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_123_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココとポポとアンズ、みんな準備おっけー！|text_cn=可可泡泡和杏子都准备好啦！|trans_en=Coco, Bubble, and Ann, all ready to go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_123_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ピーピー。こちら探検隊１号、周りに異常なし、おーばーなの|text_cn=哔哔~这里是侦查小队一号，周围没有发现异常，完毕。|trans_en=Beep-beep. This is Scout Squad One. Situation is normal. Over.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_123_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…ココがいないと、アンズ…迷子になっちゃうかも…|text_cn=唔……没有可可的话，杏子大概会迷路的吧……|trans_en=Ooh... Maybe... Ann gets lost when Coco isn't around...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_123_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、アンズは緊張なんかしてないの…<br/>だからココも安心してね。ほら、なでなでしてあげるの|text_cn=杏、杏子没在紧张……所以可可也不要紧张！来，杏子摸摸你吧~|trans_en=Oh, Ann's not nervous, okay? So calm down, Coco. Here, I'll pet you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_123_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなと一緒なら、アンズは何も怖くないの！ご、ゴーヤ以外は…|text_cn=只要和大家在一起，杏子就什么都不怕啦。除了苦瓜……|trans_en=As long as I've got all of you, I'm not scared of anything! ... Well, maybe I'm a little scared of boiled spinach.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_123_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=お出かけの前に、ココがい～っぱいお菓子を作ってくれたの！<br/>これでお腹ぺこぺこにならないの！|text_cn=出发前，可可做了好多煎饼，这样就不怕等下饿肚子啦。|trans_en=Coco made TONS of pies before we headed out! Now I'll never be hungry!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_123_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=怖くないよ、ココ。アンズが守ってあげるの|text_cn=可可别怕，杏子会保护好你的！|trans_en=Don't be scared, Coco. Ann'll protect you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_123_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=村の外は広いの。星ノ塔がたくさんさん！|text_cn=村子外的世界好大啊，星塔有好多好多。|trans_en=The world outside of the village sure is big. So many Monoliths!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_123_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わは～、村のお店よりひろひろなの！|text_cn=比村里的小卖部还要大~|trans_en=Whoa, this is so much bigger than the village store!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_123_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココと一緒なら、どこに行っても安心なの！|text_cn=只要有可可在，不管到哪都很安心～|trans_en=I feel safe no matter where we go, as long as I'm with Coco!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_123_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=面白いものあるかな～？|text_cn=会有好玩的东西吗？|trans_en=Anything interesting in here?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_123_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=がおー！わるわるなやつを倒したの！|text_cn=坏蛋被打倒啦！|trans_en=Awoooo! We beat the baddies!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_123_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココもポポも、まだまだ元気いっぱいなの！|text_cn=可可还很有力气，泡泡也是~|trans_en=Coco and Bubble are still raring to go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_123_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココとポポはさいこーにつよつよなの～！|text_cn=可可泡泡就是最厉害的~|trans_en=Coco and Bubble are the strongest ever!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_123_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わるわるなやつを懲らしめたの～！|text_cn=杏子打跑了坏蛋！|trans_en=We taught the baddies a lesson!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_123_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココ、はいたっち――ひゃ、舐めるのは違うの～！|text_cn=可可来拍个手~呀！不是舔啦~|trans_en=Coco, high-five! Eek! No, I don't want you to lick me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_123_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ううっ…ご、ごめんなさい…|text_cn=对、对不起嘛……|trans_en=Ugh... I-I'm so sorry...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_123_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=むぅうう…次は絶対負けないもん！|text_cn=哼！下次杏子会打赢你的！|trans_en=Ngh... I promise not to lose next time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_123_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココ、しゅつげーき！|text_cn=到我们啦，可可！|trans_en=Coco, let's go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_123_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=わるわるなやつはど～こだ！|text_cn=坏蛋在哪里？|trans_en=Hey, baddies! Come out, come out, wherever you are!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_123_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=早く早く！早く行くの～！|text_cn=出发！出发！出发！|trans_en=C'mon, c'mon, c'mon! Let's go! Right now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_123_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ココとポポに気合いをちゅーにゅー！|text_cn=可可泡泡打起精神来！我们要去打坏蛋了！|trans_en=Coco and Bubble, time to get PUMPED!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_123_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_123_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズ、よくわからないけど…<br/>『ばれんたいん』って、大好きな人にプレゼントをあげる日なんでしょ？<br/>だからアンズ、まうまうにクッキー作ってきたの！<br/>たくさんあるから、いーっぱい食べてね！|text_cn=“青人……节”？唔……杏子不太懂，不过，是送喜欢的人礼物的节日吧。<br/>给你~杏子自己做的小饼干，全部都要吃掉哦！|trans_en=I'm not sure, but... "Valluntine's" is when you give presents to someone you like a lot, right? <br/>So, I made cookies for you, Bossy!  I made lots and lots, so eat as many as you want!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_123_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まうまう！ こっちこっち！ココのそばはね、とってもあったかいのー！<br/>あとこれ、まうまうのために小さな雪だるまさんを作ってポケットに入れて…<br/>わふ～ん！？ 雪だるまさん、溶けちゃってるのー！|text_cn=魔魔王！快来快来，可可身边超暖和的~对了，其实今天杏子还堆了一个小雪人送给魔魔王，就在这……<br/>诶？雪人……化掉了！|trans_en=Hey, Bossy! Over here! It's nice and warm next to Coco!  <br/>I made you a cute little snowman. He's right here in my pocket...  <br/>Whaaa?! Oh, no! Now he's all melty!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_123_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとっ！えへへ、まうまうにご挨拶するのアンズがいちばんなの♪|text_cn=新年快乐！魔魔王！嘿嘿~杏子是第一个来说新年快乐的！|trans_en=Happy new year! Hehe, Ann's the first one to wish you a happy new year! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_123_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はアンズのお誕生日なの！今年のお願い事は…おなかいーっぱい、ごちそうを食べる<br/>ことなの！あとは、『お米がたくさん収穫できますように』でしょ？それから『たくさんの<br/>人が遊びに来たくなるような、素敵な場所になりますように』でもいちばんのお願い事は<br/>『今日一日、まうまうがアンズと一緒にたくさん遊んでくれますように』なの！|text_cn=今天是杏子的生日！杏子的生日愿望是吃到大餐！还希望明年村子的收成变得更好！<br/>还有还有，希望村子能变成大家都想要来的地方！噢！最重要的是，希望魔魔王今天能陪杏子玩一整天！|trans_en=Today is Ann's birthday! This year, my wish is ... to eat until my tum-tum is all nice and full! And also for a big rice harvest! <br/>And also that this will become a place that lotsa people wanna come visit!<br/>But my biggest wish is that Bossy will play with Ann aaalll day today!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_123_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_123_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズ知ってるの！今日はまうまうのお誕生日なの！<br/>だからココに作り方を聞いて、イッシ村の伝統のケーキを作っておいたの！<br/>形はキレイじゃないけど…<br/>とっても甘くて、おいしく作れたから、召し上がれーなの♪|text_cn=今天是魔魔王的生日~杏子给魔魔王做了伊西村风味蛋糕！嘿嘿，蛋糕的做法是可可教给杏子的~<br/>唔……虽然样子不好看，但是味道甜甜的很好吃！|trans_en=I know! Today is Bossy's birthday!<br/>So, I asked Coco how to make Eaze Village's legendary cake!<br/>It's not very pretty ... but it's super sweet and yummy! I hope you like it! ♪}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_125_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『いかなる困難が立ち塞がろうと、己の信念を貫き通す』<br/>トーナちゃんとテレサちゃんと新しいスローガンを考えたのですが、いかがでしょう？|text_cn=万水千山，皆因信起，风雪无阻，只为信念。<br/>……魔王，这是我们最新的宣传语，您觉得怎么样？|trans_en="No matter what troubles beset us, we hold to our convictions." <br/>A new slogan that Donna, Teresa, and I invented. What do you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_125_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨロズ配達にご依頼…ではなく、私に会いに？<br/>ではせっかくですし、紅茶でもいかがです？|text_cn=魔王，有什么委托要交给万送屋吗……只是来和我打个招呼？不着急走的话，要不要来杯红茶？|trans_en=A Post Haste request...? Oh, I see. It's just an informal visit. Then, let me offer you some tea.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_125_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスは『早起きがつらい』とよくおっしゃいますが…<br/>このような美しい朝陽を眺めていると、その考えも変わるのではありませんか？|text_cn=虽然您常说“早起令人痛苦”……<br/>但能看到这样美丽的日出，也还不错吧？|trans_en=You often say it's hard to get up early... <br/>But behold that sunrise, and tell me you won't change your mind!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_125_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=しーっ…お静かに。子ネコがお昼寝中ですの|text_cn=嘘……动作轻一点，这里有只小猫在睡午觉。|trans_en=Shh... The kitten is taking a nap.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_125_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=眠れないのでしたら<br/>ホットミルクを飲んだり、ストレッチをしてみるのはいかがでしょう？<br/>あるいは…お望みとあらば、私の手で眠りへと誘うこともできますわ|text_cn=听说您最近有些失眠，可以试试睡觉前喝一杯热牛奶，做一些拉伸运动……<br/>或者，我可以帮助你强制休眠，物理意义上的。|trans_en=If you're having trouble sleeping, how about a glass of hot milk, or doing some stretches? <br/>Or perhaps ... I could personally lull you to sleep?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_125_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=大人しく手紙を渡すまで、ここから先へは行かせませんわ|text_cn=乖乖交出信件吧……你已经被我盯上了。|trans_en=You shall go no further. Not until you hand over the letter.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_125_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=トーナちゃんから、こうすればボスに配達のご依頼をいただけると聞いたのですが…<br/>本当でしょうか？|text_cn=多娜说这样做的话，您就会把信交给我们……<br/>是真的吗？|trans_en=Donna told me that if I do this, you will give me a delivery job... <br/>Is she right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_125_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=雨音が聞こえますわね…|text_cn=魔王，你听，是雨的声音。|trans_en=Ah, the pitter-patter of rain...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_125_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この雨、いつまで続くのでしょう…|text_cn=这场雨……会下多久呢……|trans_en=Just how long will this rain continue?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_125_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=知らない場所にお手紙を届けるたび、想像以上に世界が広いことを実感しますわ<br/>この大地に果てなどあるのでしょうか…？|text_cn=每次去陌生的地方送信时，都觉得世界比我想象中宽广得多……<br/>您说，这片大地会有尽头吗？|trans_en=Every time I deliver a letter to a new place, I realize that the world is far bigger than I ever imagined. <br/>Is there an end to this vast land...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_125_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=屋台でアイスを買ったこと、トーナちゃんには秘密にしてくださいまし<br/>10本だけ、帰るまでにすべて食べきりますから|text_cn=拜托了，不要告诉多娜我买了路边摊的碎碎冰……<br/>只有十根而已，我会在回家前全部吃掉的。|trans_en=Please don't tell Donna that I bought ice cream at the stall. <br/>I'll eat all ten of them by the time we get back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_125_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ドーラはなぜ、使うとすぐに無くなるのでしょう…|text_cn=朵拉这种东西，为什么花掉就没有了啊？|trans_en=Why does Dorra run out so quickly whenever I spend it...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_125_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ケータイがまた壊れてしまいましたわ…使い方が間違っているのでしょうか？|text_cn=手机又出问题了……是我使用的方式不对吗？|trans_en=My mobile phone broke again! Am I using it wrong?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_125_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は手紙の配達中に、愛らしい女の子が私を『お姉ちゃん』と呼んでくれまして<br/>飴をあげたら、そのお礼にとお花をもらいましたの|text_cn=今天送信的时候，有个小女孩一直追着我叫“姐姐”……<br/>我给了她一颗糖，她送了我一朵花。|trans_en=When I was delivering letters earlier today, an adorable little girl called me "Big Sis." <br/>I gave her some candy, and she gave me flowers in return.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_125_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=月を追いかければ、道に迷わず進めます<br/>けれど時には…ひとつの星を見るために、足を止めるのも悪くありませんわね|text_cn=只要跟着月亮走，就不会迷失方向，但偶尔……<br/>也会为了一颗星星停下脚步。|trans_en=Follow the moon and you'll never get lost. <br/>But sometimes, you should tarry a while, and gaze upon a single star.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_125_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス。もしよろしければ、こちらの手紙の仕分けをお手伝いいただけませんか？|text_cn=魔王，如果方便的话，可以陪我把这些信件分个类吗？|trans_en=If you don't mind, could you help me sort these letters?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_125_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=帽子のネコ耳は、トーナちゃんがつけてくださったのですが…<br/>おかしくないでしょうか？え、可愛い？あ、ありがとうございます…|text_cn=帽子上的猫耳是多娜帮我缝上的，会不会不太适合我……<br/>很可爱吗？谢谢您。|trans_en=Donna sewed these cat ears on this hat... It looks odd, doesn't it? <br/>Oh? You think it's cute? W-Well, thank you...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_125_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夜更かしをすると、怪物に攫われてしまいますわよ…<br/>いえ、冗談ではありません。私もよく、夢の中で彼らと決闘していますもの。ですがご安心を<br/>あなたが怪物に攫われた時は、夢だろうと現実だろうと、私が助けに参ります|text_cn=从小妈妈就告诉我，如果不按时睡觉的话，会被可怕的怪物抓走……<br/>不，我没有开玩笑，我常常在梦里和它决斗。<br/>魔王，如果你也遇到了怪物，我很乐意当你的决斗代理人。|trans_en=If you stay up late at night, you'll be abducted by monsters... <br/>No, I'm not joking. I often duel those fiends in my dreams. <br/>But there's no need for YOU to worry. <br/>Should they take you, I shall track you down and save you—be it in a dream, or in the real world.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_125_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お出かけされるのでしたら、私が送っていって差し上げますわ|text_cn=魔王，您今天有出行计划吗？请务必让我载您一程。|trans_en=If you intend to head out, let me see you off.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_125_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=最近、このようなことを学びましたの<br/>『コミュ力を向上させるには、相手を服従させ、飼育…』<br/>あら、申し訳ありません。ページを間違えたようですわ|text_cn=魔王，我来向您汇报学习心得了：“如何提高沟通能力……应当主动驯服、饲养对方……”<br/>啊，不好意思，我好像翻错页了。|trans_en=I learned something new recently. <br/>"In order to improve communication, first dominate your opponent, then domesticate them." <br/>... Oh, my apologies! That was the wrong page.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_125_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=トーナちゃん、さてはまた迷子になりましたわね<br/>お迎えに向かいますが、ご一緒されますか？|text_cn=多娜好像又迷路了，我准备去接她，您要和我一起吗？|trans_en=I'm afraid Donna has gotten herself lost again. I have to go find her. Would you join me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_125_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今月はテレサちゃんに色々と修理をお願いしましたの<br/>お礼をしたいのですが…色違いの大きな毛糸玉５つでいかがでしょうか？|text_cn=这个月，特丽莎帮我修了好多东西，我想送她一份特别的礼物……<br/>五个不同颜色的大毛线球怎么样？|trans_en=I turned to Teresa many times this month for repairs. I'd like to thank her... <br/>Do you think she'd appreciate five balls of wool in different colors?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_125_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前行ったスイーツ専門店に、ナノハさんがいらっしゃいましたの<br/>彼女の手作りメープルケーキはとても美味しくて。お陰で、つい食べ過ぎてしまいましたわ…|text_cn=上次去甜品店遇到了花原小姐，她做的枫糖蛋糕太好吃了，不知不觉就吃了好多……|trans_en=I ran into Nanoha at the confectionery the other day. <br/>Her homemade maple cakes are delectable, and well... I ended up eating FAR too much.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_125_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=こちらのお手紙、すべて『アオバ』さん宛なのですが…<br/>どの封筒にも、『スーパー無敵可愛い』、『大好き』などと書かれていて<br/>アオバさんとは一体どのような方なのでしょう？|text_cn=这批信的收件人都是“青叶”，信封上还写了“超级无敌可爱”、“最喜欢”之类的话……<br/>……青叶小姐，究竟是什么人呢？|trans_en=These envelopes addressed to Aobelle all refer to her as "super-cute," "unrivaled," and "my deeply beloved." <br/>This Aobelle must be unusually charming...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_125_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=クルニスさん…不思議なお方でしたわ。病院の場所からしてわかりにくいですし<br/>配達に伺った際、身体検査を勧められたのですが…<br/>一瞬で終わってしまったため、どのような検査をされたのかすら分かりませんでした|text_cn=科洛妮丝小姐是一位神秘的客人，我花了好久才找到她的诊所。<br/>她邀请我做身体检查，我只是闭了一下眼，检查就结束了，可我却不记得发生了什么。|trans_en=Coronis is such a peculiar individual. <br/>Her clinic is difficult to find, and when I tried to deliver letters, she insisted I take a physical exam...<br/>which was over so quickly that I'm not sure she examined anything at all!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_125_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら？決闘をご所望ですの？でしたらお仕事の後、例の場所でお会いいたしましょう|text_cn=嗯？魔王是想邀请我决斗吗？等送完这封信后，我们老地方见。|trans_en=Oh? You'd like a duel? Then let's meet at the usual location, once our work is finished.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_125_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=申し訳ありませんが、『レゾン』に触れるのはおよしください<br/>この子は他人に触れられるのが好きではありませんの|text_cn=您是想摸一摸「理性」吗，抱歉，它不太喜欢被其他人触碰。|trans_en=My apologies, but I must ask you not to touch Reason. My faithful companion cannot stand the touch of strangers.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_125_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はいつもより配達物が多い気がしますわ。どうすれば最短で回れるのでしょう…？|text_cn=今天要去好几个地方送信，该怎么走才最方便呢？让我想想……|trans_en=I have a feeling there will be far more deliveries today than usual. I wonder if there's any way I can shorten the route...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_125_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=こうして屋上であなたと風に当たる…とても心地が良いです|text_cn=像这样和您一起站在天台吹风，感觉好舒服。|trans_en=The breeze up here on the roof is refreshing, don't you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_125_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=…完敗ですわ。ボスは『だるまさんが転んだ』がお強いのですね|text_cn=好吧……我输了。<br/>“一动不动木头人”游戏，是您获胜了，魔王。|trans_en=... I have been bested. <br/>You are truly a master of Red Light Green Light.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_125_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご一緒することが出来て光栄ですわ。以後お見知りおきを|text_cn=很荣幸与您同行，请多指教。|trans_en=Pleased to make your acquaintance. It is an honor to become one of your allies.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_125_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人は再会を喜ぶものですが…ボスはいかがですか？|text_cn=人们都说“重逢令人欣喜”……魔王，您是怎么看的呢？|trans_en=Most people enjoy reunions... Do you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_125_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力があれば、自信をもって決闘に臨めますわ|text_cn=决斗需要力量、技巧，以及经验，感谢您的指教。|trans_en=With this power, I can face any duel undaunted.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_125_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=感謝いたします。これですべてを切り拓きますわ|text_cn=感谢您，赐予我斩断一切的力量。|trans_en=You have my thanks. Soon nothing will be able to stop me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_125_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=過去と向き合う勇気が湧いてきましたわ。ありがとうございます|text_cn=是您给了我面对过去的勇气。|trans_en=You've given me the courage to face my past, and I thank you for it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_125_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=音楽を聴くと、癒やされますわね|text_cn=感到疲惫的时候，不妨听一听音乐吧。|trans_en=Listening to music is soothing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_125_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=立ち塞がる者は、すべて排除いたします|text_cn=我将铲除妨碍您的一切。|trans_en=I shall eliminate any who stand in our way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_125_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=雨の日を…好きになれたかもしれませんわね|text_cn=我好像……开始喜欢下雨天了。|trans_en=Perhaps... I've learned to appreciate rainy days.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_125_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=以前お借りした傘…もう一度お借りしてもよろしいでしょうか？|text_cn=上次下雨时的伞，可以再借给我一次吗？|trans_en=The umbrella you lent me before... Might I borrow it again?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_125_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これから先、どんなに強い敵と出会おうとも…あなたがいれば、恐れることはありません|text_cn=未来还会遇到许多强敌，但……您的存在让我感到无比安心。|trans_en=No matter how powerful the foes may be going forward, as long as I have you, there will be nothing to fear.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_125_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=上手に気持ちを表現することができず、誤解を招いてしまうことが多くて…<br/>ですがあなたは…私の気持ち、理解してくださいますわよね？|text_cn=我不太擅长表达，也总是闹出一些言语上的误会，但我想……<br/>您应该会明白我的心意吧。|trans_en=My inability to express my feelings often leads to misunderstandings... <br/>But we don't have that problem, do we?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_125_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=大切な人の存在は、弱点にもなるのですけれど…<br/>私はあなたの姿を見るだけで、無限に力が湧いてきますわ|text_cn=站在决斗场上的我，心中一旦有了牵挂的人，就会生出弱点……<br/>可是，当我注视着您的身影时，就好像拥有了无限的力量。|trans_en=Caring deeply about others may be a weakness. <br/>But the mere sight of you fills me with limitless strength.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_125_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご厚意、感謝いたします|text_cn=感谢您的慷慨。|trans_en=I thank you for your kindness.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_125_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まさか、私の好みを的確に把握されているとは…|text_cn=真没想到，您已经如此了解我的喜好了……|trans_en=I scarce imagined you'd learn my tastes so ... precisely.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_125_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こういった時は難しく考えず、心から感謝の言葉をお伝えするべきなのかもしれませんわね|text_cn=或许我该抛下那些繁文缛节……诚挚地对您说一声：谢谢。|trans_en=I mustn't overanalyze things. At a moment like this, the right thing to do is offer a sincere and simple "thank you."}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_125_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=ええ|text_cn=好的。|trans_en=Yes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_125_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=いえ…|text_cn=不……|trans_en=No...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_125_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Oh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_125_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうなのですか…？|text_cn=是这样吗？|trans_en=Is that so...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_125_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…|text_cn=怎么会……|trans_en=It cannot be...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_125_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当ですの？|text_cn=真的吗？|trans_en=Is that true?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_125_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=許しませんわ|text_cn=不可饶恕。|trans_en=Unforgivable.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_125_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=素晴らしいです|text_cn=那太好了。|trans_en=How wonderful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_125_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=(Sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_125_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当に…似合っていますの…？|text_cn=……真的适合我吗?|trans_en=Does this really suit me, I wonder...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_125_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨロズ配達は、真心をお届けしますわ|text_cn=万送屋，竭诚为您服务。|trans_en=Post Haste delivers sincerity.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_125_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=テレサちゃん、トーナちゃんが『食事の時間だから帰ってくるように』と|text_cn=特丽莎，多娜喊你回家吃饭。|trans_en=Teresa and Donna say it's time to eat and you should come home.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_125_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=後ろに隠れていてくださいまし|text_cn=站在我身后。|trans_en=Hide behind me, please.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_125_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_125_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=全力で参りますわ！|text_cn=我不会手下留情的。|trans_en=I shall face the enemy with all my strength!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_125_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=破滅の運命を受け入れなさい！|text_cn=接受毁灭的命运吧。|trans_en=Accept your ruinous fate!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_125_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪者にはご退場いただきましょう！|text_cn=消失吧！碍事的家伙！|trans_en=Let’s show the bad guys the way out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_125_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=敵ながら…見事です…|text_cn=精彩的……对决……|trans_en=Foe though you may be ... you are truly impressive...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_125_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私はまだ…やれますわ…|text_cn=不用扶我……我还可以……|trans_en=I ... can keep going...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_125_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新たな力を戦斧に込め、必ずやお役に立ってみせますわ|text_cn=渴望力量的巨斧随时等待召唤。|trans_en=I shall infuse this new power into my battleaxe—and make fine use of it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_125_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=一瞬の美しさも、氷で包めば永遠に残しておけますわ|text_cn=结冰之后，就可以永远保持盛开的姿态了。|trans_en=Even the most fleeting beauty can be preserved, if entombed in ice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_125_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=氷の花びらは、刃より鋭いものですわ|text_cn=冰凌花的花瓣，可是很锋利的。|trans_en=Shards of ice are even sharper than blades of steel.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_125_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『レゾン』が、私たちの道を切り拓きますわ|text_cn=「理性」会为我们开辟道路。|trans_en=Reason shall pave our way forward.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_125_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=氷と共に舞いましょう|text_cn=我将与冰霜共舞。|trans_en=Let us dance with ice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_125_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいお天気、絶好の決闘日和ですわね|text_cn=今天的天气很好，适合决斗。|trans_en=What splendid weather—a perfect day for a duel, in fact.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_125_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここでも自転車を使えれば、より簡単に進めると思うのですが…<br/>はい？どうして、やめておいた方がよいのです？|text_cn=如果能在星塔里骑自行车的话，登顶就能更轻松了吧……|trans_en=If we were to use bicycles, we could move much faster... Hm? Really? You think that's a bad idea?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_125_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=『レゾン』は頼りになる相棒ですもちろん、あなたもですわ|text_cn=「理性」是我信赖的伙伴……您也是。|trans_en=Reason is a trustworthy partner. As are you, of course.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_125_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ジャンケンポン…私の勝利です。では次の戦いは、私が先陣を切るということで|text_cn=石头剪刀布……我赢了。这次我想打头阵。|trans_en=Rock, paper, scissors ... and I win. That settles it. I shall take the vanguard in the next battle.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_125_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=ジャンケンポン…負けましたわ…今回はあなたの指示に従います|text_cn=石头剪刀布……我输了……这次全听您安排。|trans_en=Rock, paper, scissors ... and I have lost. Then I shall follow your orders, for now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_125_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=力がついたのなら、より強い相手と戦いましょう敵とはいえそれが公平ですもの|text_cn=实力变强了，就要面对更强大的敌人，这很公平。|trans_en=As we grow stronger, so too does the enemy. Though they are our foes, it is only fair.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_125_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新たな舞台への挑戦…私は逃げも隠れもしません|text_cn=新的挑战，新的决斗场。我不会退缩。|trans_en=A new stage awaits. I shall neither run nor hide.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_125_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なるほど…ここが噂の『金銭を無限に呑み込む深淵』ですのね|text_cn=这里就是……吞掉金钱的深渊吗？|trans_en=Intriguing. So this is the infamous "bottomless abyss that eternally devours all coins."}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_125_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごゆっくりお休みください。私が見張りに立ちます|text_cn=魔王，我负责守卫，您可以好好休息了。|trans_en=Please feel free to rest. I shall watch over you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_125_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=見知らぬ場所にはリスクが潜むもの。お気をつけくださいませ|text_cn=魔王，请小心，未知与风险总是相伴而行。|trans_en=Unfamiliar places hide many threats. We must be careful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_125_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…問題解決、ですわ|text_cn=血液……冷却下来了。|trans_en=Hmph... Challenge accepted, and met.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_125_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=さて…次に参りましょう|text_cn=呼……下一位。|trans_en=Now. Let us move on. More battles await.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_125_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=服を汚さずに済みましたわね|text_cn=太好了，没有弄脏。|trans_en=It's good that I didn't get my clothes dirty.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_125_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の正しさが証明されましたわ|text_cn=胜利的石碑上只会刻着我的名字。|trans_en=Once again, I am proven correct.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_125_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…予想通りの結果ですわね|text_cn=哈……意料之中的胜利。|trans_en=Hmph. I anticipated as much.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_125_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが敗北…二度と味わいたくありませんわね|text_cn=失败的滋味……我不会品尝第二次。|trans_en=So this is defeat...? I hope to never taste it again.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_125_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=申し訳ございません…今後はさらに精進いたします|text_cn=抱歉……我一定会变得更强。|trans_en=Forgive me... I'll do my best not to let you down again.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_125_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この決闘に、すべてを懸けますわ|text_cn=我会在决斗场上奋战到底。|trans_en=I shall risk everything in this duel.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_125_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=問題ごとは、決闘で解決しましょう|text_cn=战斗的气息……令人兴奋。|trans_en=A good duel solves any manner of problems.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_125_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=皆様との共闘…全力を尽くしますわ|text_cn=同大家一起战斗吗……我会努力的。|trans_en=Because we fight together ... I will spare no effort.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_125_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=私も、一族の歴史を紡ぐ者ですから|text_cn=家族的荣耀，由我来续写。|trans_en=I, too, must play my part in weaving the history of my clan.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_125_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_125_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は街中に甘い香りが漂っていますが…イベントかなにかでしょうか？|text_cn=总觉得今天的街道上漂浮着一股甜甜的味道，是什么特别的日子吗？|trans_en=There's a sweet fragrance in the air today. Is something going on in town?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_125_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=メリークリスマス<br/>今夜はヨロズ配達のみなさんとパーティーをする予定なのですが<br/>よろしければご一緒にいかがですか？|text_cn=节日快乐。今晚万送屋准备了丰盛的大餐，您要来一起享用吗？|trans_en=Happy Snowish Festival. I and the rest of my fellows in Post Haste are planning a party tonight. Care to join us?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_125_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとうございます普段は日付が変わっても、感じることなど特にないのですが…<br/>年をまたぐと、不思議と気持ちが引き締まりますわね|text_cn=虽说新的一天与旧的一天没什么太大差别，但年历的更替寓意着崭新的开始，祝您新年快乐。|trans_en=Happy New Year.<br/>I don't normally get excited about a simple flip of the calendar... <br/>But somehow, crossing that liminal space into a new year stokes something inside me and sharpens my mind.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_125_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=え、今日は私のお誕生日？あ…言われるまで、すっかり忘れていましたわ<br/>それでしたら…もしよろしければ、後ほどお散歩をご一緒していただけませんか？|text_cn=今天是我的生日吗？虽然我没有庆祝的习惯，不过，如果您有空的话，待会儿一起去散散步吧？|trans_en=Hm? My birthday? It's today? <br/>Oh, fancy that. I'd completely forgotten. <br/>... Well, seeing as it IS my special day, perhaps we could go for a stroll later?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_125_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_125_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとうございます<br/>あなたの毎日が、これからもたくさんの幸せで溢れんことを<br/>ありきたりな言葉ではありますが…心より、そう願っておりますわ|text_cn=祝您生日快乐，身体健康，平安幸福……这些话听起来可能有些普通，但每一句都是我真心的祝愿。|trans_en=Happy birthday. <br/>May your days overflow with joy this year as they did the last. I know, I know.<br/>It's a trite sentiment … but heartfelt all the same.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc125_NewYear26_day05_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc125_NewYear26_day05_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス。このお手紙、受け取っていただけませんか？<br/>新年最初の配達物は、あなたに届けたいと思い…したためましたの<br/>昨年の感謝と、今年も共に在りたいという想いを込めましたわ。手に取って読んでくださいませ|text_cn=魔王大人，能否请您……收下这封信？<br/>我想要把……新年第一份快递送给您……便写下了这封信。<br/>信中包含着去年对您的感谢，以及今年也想与您共度的愿望。还请您过目。|trans_en=Boss. Can you please accept this letter?<br/>I wanted to give you the first delivery of the new year... so I wrote it.<br/>I included my gratitude for last year and my wish to be with you again this year in it. Please accept it and read it.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_126_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そこのあなた、マジックはいかが？カタ～イ顔を、笑顔に変えちゃう素敵な魔法よ|text_cn=想看场魔术表演吗，能让你僵硬的脸上浮现出笑容哦~|trans_en=You there! How about a magic show? Let's turn that frown upside down!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_126_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなた、ついてるわね。実はちょうどスケジュールに空きができたの<br/>どう、一緒にお出かけしない？|text_cn=恭喜你，幸运的观众，我正好档期有空闲，陪我上街探店如何？|trans_en=Well, lucky you! I happen to be free at the moment. Shall we go somewhere?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_126_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふわぁ～、まだ眠いわぁ…うひゃあっ！いるなら声かけなさいよ！|text_cn=哈啊~还没睡够……<br/>呜哇！你在的话就吭个声啊！|trans_en=(Yawn) <br/>I'm still so sleepy... Agh! I didn't know you were here!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_126_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=日差しが眩しいわねぇ。はい、私の帽子貸してあげる。安心して、ハトは出てこないから|text_cn=日光有些刺眼，这顶帽子就借给你吧！<br/>放心，不会有鸽子飞出来的。|trans_en=It's so bright! Here, let me give you my hat. <br/>Don't worry! There're no doves in it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_126_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=演劇を楽しむなら、やっぱり夜よね。と言うわけで、どう？一緒に見に行かない？|text_cn=晚上好。夜色已至，华灯初上，正是观影看戏的好时机，有没有兴趣一起来？|trans_en=Performances are always better at night. How about it? Shall we?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_126_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このトップマジシャンがいる限り、あなたを退屈になんてさせないわ♪|text_cn=有我这个大魔术师在，你的生活不会无聊的~|trans_en=There's never a dull moment with the world's greatest magician! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_126_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=マジックワンドのヒミツが知りたい？<br/>ふふっ、じゃあちょっと耳貸して…ほら、もっとこっち|text_cn=想知道这根魔杖的秘密？呵呵，竖起耳朵，凑近点。|trans_en=I can teach you my magic wand's secret. But you have to come closer... That's it, don't be shy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_126_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ～お、こんな素敵なドレス初めて見たわ！<br/>私一人でうまく着られるかしら～？ チラッ、チラッ|text_cn=啊~多么完美的礼服，完美到只靠我一人，无法将它穿上！|trans_en=This is the most beautiful dress I've ever seen!<br/>How can I possibly wear it alone? Ahem!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_126_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと、困ってるのは見ればわかるでしょ！笑ってないで手伝ってよ！|text_cn=你这人……既然都知道了，就别站在一边偷笑了，快点来帮我呀！|trans_en=I'm clearly in a bind here! Don't just stand there laughing! Help!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_126_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=社長ともなると、日頃から悩みの種が尽きなくてね<br/>あなただって経営者なんだから、分かってくれるでしょ？|text_cn=身为事务所的所长，每天要操心的事情数不胜数，同为经营者的你，肯定能理解我吧。|trans_en=Being a CEO is incredibly demanding.<br/>As a manager yourself, you must understand.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_126_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=フラヴィオのことが知りたい？<br/>ふふ。別にいいけど、全部語るとなると一晩じゃ足りないわね～|text_cn=想了解弗拉维奥的情报？呵呵~那得说上好几个夜晚了。|trans_en=Would you like to know about Flavio? Hehe. I have to warn you, I could talk all day...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_126_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=芸術には、自己表現を追求すべきって意見と、大衆に受け入れられるべきって意見があるわ<br/>あなたはどっち？|text_cn=有人说艺术应该是极度的自我，又有人说应该接受普世的认同。呵呵~我比较好奇你的看法。|trans_en=Some people say art is all about self-expression, while others say it needs to have broad appeal.<br/>What do you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_126_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=量産型の録画箱って、一部がカットされてたり、途中に広告が入ってたりするし<br/>作品に集中したいなら、星ノ塔のオリジナル版を探した方がいいわよ|text_cn=市面上出售的留影盒，多多少少都会删改一些内容，还会乱加广告……<br/>如果想要好的体验，还是直接去星塔里找原版比较好~|trans_en=Cheap recording boxes cut some parts out or put ads in the middle. <br/>Monolith originals really give the best viewing experience.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_126_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=事務所での新人教育ってね、昔はとっっっっても厳しかったの<br/>最近じゃ多少はマシになってるけど…<br/>でも煌びやかなステージの裏に、沢山の汗と涙があるのは、今も昔も変わらないわ|text_cn=在过去，很多事务所里都存在“体罚”的现象。<br/>现在虽然情况有所改善，但想要站在光辉的大舞台上，需要付出的汗水与泪水从未减少过。|trans_en=New talent training at the agency used to be SUPER harsh. <br/>It's not as bad as it was... But people have no idea how much blood, sweat, and tears go into being famous.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_126_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=裏表が激しい人ってどう思う？え、たくさん見てきた？へぇ…そうなんだ…|text_cn=你对一个表里截然相反的人是怎么看的？<br/>见过很多？诶……这样啊……|trans_en=What do you think of backstabbers? <br/>You know a lot of them? Oh... I see...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_126_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ステージでの名声はもう十分<br/>今後は裏方として、後輩たちを支えるプロデューサー業務に従事しようと思うの<br/>ギルドを裏で支えてる、あなたみたいにね、ふふっ|text_cn=说实话，我已经在舞台上“风光”够久了，比起台前，我更想当幕后的制作人，帮助那些想要圆梦的后辈们……<br/>呵呵~就像你在幕后支持着旅团一样。|trans_en=I'm tired of being famous.<br/>Now I'd rather be a producer and support upcoming talent.<br/>Kind of like how you support the guild behind the scenes. Hee hee.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_126_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『遠くから呼びかける彼。でも私は決して応えない。そして穏やかに――』<br/>あらっ♪丁度いいところに。ショーの練習に付き合ってもらえる？|text_cn=“他从远方，以蝴蝶之名唤我，我不会回答，静静地”……<br/>呀！是你啊，正好，要不要来帮我搭个戏？|trans_en="He calls out to me, but I refuse to answer. And then, gently..." <br/>Oh! ♪ Perfect timing! Care to help me rehearse?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_126_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ～、疲れたぁ<br/>一日中ステージに立ちっぱなしだと、作り笑顔のまま表情が凝り固まっちゃうのよね…<br/>ってなによ。ちょっとくらい気を抜いたっていいじゃない。他に誰もいないんだから|text_cn=啊……累死了。营业了一天，我的脸都要僵了。<br/>怎么，不习惯我这副模样？让我放松一下嘛，反正现在也没别人~|trans_en=Whew, I am beat! It's hard being on stage all day with a fake smile plastered on your face. <br/>What? I'm not allowed to take a break sometimes? There's no one else here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_126_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ゆったりめの部屋着を一着増やしたの<br/>リラックスしたい時は、あなたも動きやすい服にしてみたら？<br/>え？もうそうしてる？ふふっ、わかってるじゃない|text_cn=我又买了一些宽松的居家服，放松的时候果然还是要穿舒适的衣服……<br/>诶，你也这么觉得？很懂嘛。的确，总是穿着礼服装模作样，很累的。|trans_en=I got some comfortable loungewear.<br/>It's great when you want to relax.Why don't you try it?<br/>Oh, you already do that? Hee hee, great minds think alike!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_126_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はうちに泊まっていかない？<br/>で、お菓子を食べながら映写機でオススメのキネマを見るの<br/>え…それより私の昔のステージが見たい？だ、ダメよ、絶対にダメ！！|text_cn=要不要一整天都待在我这？<br/>我去准备零食和显影器，今天就来看几部我推荐的影戏吧~<br/>咦……更想看我以前的演出？不行！绝、绝对不行！|trans_en=Wanna stay at my place tonight? <br/>We can have some snacks, watch flicks on the old kinema-scope...  <br/>What? You'd rather see my old performances? But I'd die of embarrassment!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_126_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの子…物静かで可愛い顔してるけど、かなりの手練れね<br/>谷風家政のメイド？ふぅん…つまり私みたいに、今の姿は表の顔ってところかしら|text_cn=那孩子虽然恬静可爱，但仔细观察她的一举一动，就会发现她经历过长期的训练。<br/>谷风家政？女仆？原来如此，也是表面的工作啊。|trans_en=That girl looks quiet and cute, but she's a heavy hitter.<br/>She's a Goodwind Homecare maid? Ah, so this is just her cover, then. Kind of like me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_126_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=まったく、騒々しいわねぇ<br/>どうせあの性格が捻じ曲がった魔女も、近くでビックニュースを狙ってるんでしょ？<br/>ま、丁度いいわ。私もフラヴィオの最新情報をチェックしときたかったし|text_cn=哼，这躁动的氛围，想必那位专盯乐子和新闻的魔女就在附近吧……<br/>正好，我也想了解一下弗拉维奥最新的消息了。|trans_en=Well, well, isn't this a funny to-do? I'm sure that twisted witch is somewhere nearby looking for some big news. <br/>Fine with me. Who doesn't want to hear the latest about Flavio?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_126_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=シーミャオって子に言われるまでもなく、炎の危険性くらい理解してるわ<br/>それでも私は、自分の演出スタイルを変えるつもりはないの|text_cn=那个叫师渺的小姑娘说得很有道理，火焰的危险我自然也知道，但我不会改变我的演出方式的。|trans_en=I don't need that Shimiao girl to educate me on the dangers of fire. I won't change my act for the sake of health and safety.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_126_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=新聞なんかじゃ『フローラが業界を変えた！』みたいに書かれるけど…<br/>結局本質は何も変わってないの。輝く街に憧れて、夢を抱いた人が集まってくる<br/>それは今も昔も変わらないから|text_cn=报纸上说，我影响了业界。<br/>但我的离开并不能改变什么，不夜城的灯光永远不会停歇，无数的追梦者仍在前仆后继地奔向霓虹。|trans_en=The newspapers are all like, "Flora has changed the game!" <br/>But the truth is nothing has changed. People with dreams always come to the big city.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_126_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=あのキュートな手紙の配達員さんは、アイドルに向いてると思うわ<br/>一つ一つの仕草が魅力的だし、自分の素顔を上手く隠してるもの<br/>ふふ、私って人を見る目はあるのよ♪|text_cn=我和那位送信的小姑娘有过一面之缘，她很适合来弗拉维奥当偶像呢……<br/>不仅言行举止很可爱，还能把自己的另一面掩饰得很好。<br/>呵呵，我看人可是很准的。|trans_en=That cute little courier could be a pop star. <br/>Everything she does is adorable, and she hides her true self really well. <br/>Hehe, I know a star when I see one!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_126_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょ、子供みたいなことはやめなさい|text_cn=别闹，你该成熟一点了。|trans_en=Hey! Quit being childish.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_126_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=な～にぃ、お姉さんが恋しくなっちゃった？|text_cn=怎么，在想我的事？|trans_en=What's that? Aw, did you miss me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_126_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私がいるのに見向きもしないなんて…失礼しちゃうわ|text_cn=这样放着我不管，是不是太没礼貌了？|trans_en=I'm right here and you won't even look at me... Oh, I'm so hurt.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_126_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと、何か言いなさいよ…！|text_cn=唔，你倒是说句话呀！|trans_en=Well, say something!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_126_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうせ寝たふりなんでしょ？<br/>カウントダウンでゼロになるまでに起きなかったら帰るからね！<br/>3・2…<br/>2.5…|text_cn=我知道了，你肯定是在装睡吧！<br/>再、再不回话我可要走咯！<br/>三，二……<br/>二点五……|trans_en=I know you're not really asleep!<br/>If you're not up by three, I'm leaving! <br/>One... Two... <br/>Two-and-a-half...}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_126_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめまして、マジシャンのフローラよ<br/>私のことは噂で色々聞いてるかもしれないけど…実際がどうなのか気になる？<br/>ふふ、教えてもいいけど…何が嘘で何が真実かなんて、マジックに関係あるかしら？|text_cn=初次见面，我是魔术师紫槿，也许你曾听过有关我的各种传闻……<br/>呵呵，很在意？但对于魔术来说，是真是假，又有什么关系呢？|trans_en=Hi there! I'm Flora the magician.<br/>Heard of me, right? Wanna know the real me?<br/>Hehe, I could tell you... But in magic, does "real" even matter?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_126_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当なら同じマジックは一度しか見せないんだけど…今回だけ特別よ？|text_cn=同样的手法我不会演示两遍，这一次，请仔细看清楚了~|trans_en=Normally, I would never do the same trick twice... Just this one time, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_126_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだまだいくわよー！|text_cn=这还不是我的上限呢~|trans_en=I'm just getting started!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_126_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おひねりありがとー！もらった分の期待には応えてみせるわ！|text_cn=感谢投资，我不会辜负你的期待~|trans_en=Thanks for the tip! It motivates me to do even better!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_126_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マジックを後輩に伝える役目と、旅に出た理由…<br/>それだけは何があっても忘れるわけにはいかないの|text_cn=魔术的传承，以及旅途开始的意义，无论如何我都不会忘记。|trans_en=I can never forget my duty to pass on my magic, and the reason that I started on this journey.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_126_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この曲、プレイリストに追加しようかしら|text_cn=适合加入我的歌单。|trans_en=I think I'll add this song to my playlist.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_126_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、魅惑のステージの開演よー！この奇跡、ばっちり心に刻み込んであげる！|text_cn=盛大的演出就要开始了，将这份奇迹牢记于心吧！|trans_en=Behold—the stage of wonder begins! I'll show you things you'll never forget!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_126_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はいはい、見とれるのは終わり。もうすぐ開演だから、早く手伝って|text_cn=看入迷了？好啦，快点来帮忙吧，演出就要开始了。|trans_en=Okay, enough staring. The show's about to start, so how about some help?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_126_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ショーの練習に付き合ってくれない？簡単だから平気、平気<br/>台詞、立ち位置、ポーズから表情まで、手取り足取り教えてあげるし|text_cn=来和我搭一场戏吧~<br/>这没什么难的，我会从台词到走位，从姿态到神情，一点一点，手把手教你的。|trans_en=Could you help me rehearse? <br/>Oh, don't worry. It's super easy. I'll teach you the lines, spots, poses, and facial expressions.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_126_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっ？ま、まさかそんなことまで気にかけてくれるなんて…<br/>言っておくけど、私…そんなに安い女じゃないわよ|text_cn=哦……？没、没想到你这么关照我啊……<br/>事先说好，我可不是那么好搞定的女人哦。|trans_en=Why would you even care about something like that? <br/>Just so you know... I'm not easily wooed.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_126_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつか、すべてをやり遂げて引退したら、改めてこの大陸を回ってみたいわ<br/>今度は巡業じゃなくて、ゆっくり景色を堪能するの。その時は…一緒に来てくれる？|text_cn=如果有一天我真的可以安心退居幕后了，我想再一次环游大陆。<br/>不是巡演，而是仔细领略那些错过的风景……<br/>届时，期待你能与我同行。|trans_en=One day when I accomplish everything and retire, I'd love to travel around Nova again. <br/>It's hard to relax and enjoy the scenery while you're on tour. <br/>Would you ... consider going with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_126_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昔、ブラックな事務所と契約を破棄した時<br/>払える代償は全部払ってでも関係を切ったけど…<br/>あなたと歩む人生の契約なら、むしろ喜んでついていくわ。なんてねっ♪|text_cn=我曾和黑心事务所签过终身协议，为了摆脱它，我付出了太多……<br/>不过，如果是和你签署“终身”协议的话，我想我会心甘情愿吧，呵呵~|trans_en=I once paid a ton of money to get out of a contract with a sketchy agency, never mind the price.<br/>But I'd gladly sign a lifetime contract with you. Hee hee hee! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_126_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう、遠慮なくいただくわ|text_cn=谢谢~我就笑纳了。|trans_en=Thanks! Don't mind if I do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_126_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=う～ん、どうやってお返ししようかしら…ちゃんと考えて、あなたの気持ちに応えないとね|text_cn=头疼了，该想想怎么给你回礼才行……<br/>你的心意我可得好好对待。|trans_en=Hmm... How can I repay your kindness? <br/>I need to think about this very carefully...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_126_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これこそ人を笑顔にするマジック…いいえ、魔法ね。ありがとう、一生大切にするわ|text_cn=这是什么令人开心的魔术……不，魔法吗？<br/>谢谢你，我会一辈子珍惜的！|trans_en=Now this is what I call an entertaining trick ... or should I say "magic"?<br/>Thanks. I'll always treasure this.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_126_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=せいか～い♪|text_cn=正解~|trans_en=Bin-go! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_126_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=違うわ|text_cn=那里不对。|trans_en=That's incorrect.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_126_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ？|text_cn=哈？|trans_en=Excuse me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_126_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=何がダメなの…？|text_cn=是哪里搞错了……|trans_en=What's the problem?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_126_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=今は一人にして…|text_cn=让我安静会……|trans_en=I need to be alone...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_126_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当！？|text_cn=当真！？|trans_en=Really?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_126_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=黙って|text_cn=闭嘴……|trans_en=Be quiet.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_126_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ|text_cn=哼哼~|trans_en=Hee hee.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_126_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=すぅ～…はぁ～…|text_cn=呵……哈——|trans_en=(Sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_126_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=それでは、みなさんご注目！|text_cn=仔细看好，别眨眼！|trans_en=Your attention, everyone!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_126_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=しぃ～…みんなにはヒミツよ|text_cn=嘘……这是秘密~|trans_en=Shh! Don't tell anyone!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_126_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミュージックスタート！ショーの始まりよ！|text_cn=音乐奏响，好戏开场！|trans_en=Music! And now for the show!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_126_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなに知りたいなら、教えてあげてもいいわよ|text_cn=想学？我可以教你~|trans_en=I'll tell you if you want to know that bad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_126_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_126_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…また失敗だわ|text_cn=哈啊……又搞砸了……|trans_en=(Sigh)... I blew it again.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_126_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=奇跡の時間よ、刮目なさい！|text_cn=别眨眼，奇迹就在此刻！|trans_en=Watch in wonder as I perform a miraculous feat!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_126_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=イッツ・ショーターイム！|text_cn=终演开幕！|trans_en=It's showtime!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_126_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これにて、閉幕ね…|text_cn=帷幕落下，观众离场……|trans_en=And that concludes our show...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_126_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ステージは、まだ…|text_cn=演出……还未完成……|trans_en=The show ... must ... go...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_126_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くないわ。新しいマジックに使えるかも|text_cn=不错的技巧，适合搭配新的魔术。|trans_en=Hm, not bad. I can use this in a trick.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_126_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナイスなアイディアが浮かんだわっ♪|text_cn=我想到一个很棒的点子！|trans_en=This just gave me a great idea! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_126_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ、いいセンスね|text_cn=呵呵~有品味~|trans_en=Hee hee, that will do nicely.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_126_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=熱いステージをご覧あれ|text_cn=感受到了吗，这份炽热。|trans_en=Now, eyes on stage!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_126_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=真のマジックをご覧にいれましょう|text_cn=该让你见识一下真正的魔术了。|trans_en=Now, witness true magic!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_126_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=奇跡のショーの開演よ。ポップコーンは？用意できてる？|text_cn=好戏开场，爆米花都准备好了吗？|trans_en=The mesmerizing performance is about to begin! Do you have your popcorn?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_126_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=トップマジシャンに相手してもらえるなんて、幸運な敵ね|text_cn=能和最伟大的魔术师做对手是他们的荣幸。|trans_en=Lucky you! You're up against the best magician in the world!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_126_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=さて、今日イチついてるお客さんは～…|text_cn=让我来挑选一位幸运观众~|trans_en=And now, today's lucky guest is...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_126_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=炎を甘く見てると、いつかその身を亡ぼすことになるわよ|text_cn=火焰不是玩具，玩火者自焚。|trans_en=They say when you play with fire, you might get burned...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_126_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=き、緊張？この私が？ふんっ…そんなの気のせいよ|text_cn=我看上去很紧张吗？咳咳！大概是错觉吧。|trans_en=M-Me? Nervous? Hmph. Not a chance!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_126_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふ～ん、ここならちょっとは楽しめそうね|text_cn=好吧，开始有点乐子了~|trans_en=Hmm, this looks like it could be fun.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_126_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新たなステージね、華麗にいくわよ|text_cn=崭新的舞台正等待我们华丽登场。|trans_en=Time to grace a new stage with my presence!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_126_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしよう、また財布を忘れちゃったぁ…|text_cn=糟了，又忘带钱包了……|trans_en=Oh, no. I forgot my purse again...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_126_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=楽屋では、しっかり休んどかないとね|text_cn=到后台了，就得好好休息。|trans_en=I better take a rest while I'm backstage.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_126_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=マ、マジシャンにとって、トークは基本中の基本なんだから！|text_cn=我、我可是魔术师哦！应酬这种事我最擅长了！|trans_en=W-Working a crowd is second nature to a magician!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_126_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=退屈すぎて寝ちゃうところだったわ|text_cn=无聊到我都要睡着了。|trans_en=I almost fell asleep there.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_126_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=本気を出すまでもないわね|text_cn=走个过场罢了~|trans_en=Didn't even break a sweat.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_126_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ。これが星骸消失マジックよ♪|text_cn=哼哼，完美的星骸消失术~|trans_en=Hee hee. That's my vanishing Stellaroid trick! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_126_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=当然の勝利ね|text_cn=理所当然的胜利。|trans_en=A predictable victory.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_126_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=マジックのタネにもならないわ|text_cn=真弱~连取材的价值都没有。|trans_en=How uninspiring.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_126_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこに問題が…|text_cn=问题到底出在哪……|trans_en=What went wrong?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_126_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=調子に乗りすぎたのかしら…|text_cn=对不起，是我得太意忘形了……|trans_en=I was too careless...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_126_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん～、どうしたの？|text_cn=嗯~怎么啦？|trans_en=Hm? What's the matter?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_126_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=焦らず自分のペースでいきましょ|text_cn=别着急，按你自己的节奏来就好。|trans_en=Keep calm and carry on.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_126_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=手伝いましょうか？|text_cn=需要我帮忙吗？|trans_en=How can I help?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_126_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=開演の時間？もちろん準備はバッチリよ|text_cn=登台？哼，早就准备好了~|trans_en=It's stage time? You know I'm ready!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_126_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_126_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=バレンタインといえば、特別な人にチョコと一緒に想いを届ける日だけど…<br/>みんなは今日、誰と過ごすのかしら？<br/>ふふ…心配しなくても平気よ。あなたとの時間は、ちゃーんとキープしてあるから♪|text_cn=情人节嘛，就是要把最甜的巧克力送给最喜欢的人∼大家今天准备和谁一起过呢？<br/>呵呵，不用担心啦，和你单独相处的时间，我早就空出来了~|trans_en=Valentine's Day! A day where people convey their feelings alongside chocolates to their special someone ...<br/>I wonder who everyone will spend their day with?<br/>Hehe... No need to worry! I've scheduled plenty of time just for you! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_126_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=クリスマスくらい雰囲気を変えて氷や雪を使ったマジックを考えてみようかしら？<br/>あとはそうね…<br/>帽子からハトの代わりにお菓子を出したら、子どもたちも喜んでくれるかしら|text_cn=嗯……我是不是也该思考下雪愿节特供魔术了……你觉得把冰雪相关的元素融入进去会不会更好？<br/>帽子魔术也可以调整一下……把鸽子换成糖果的话，小孩子看了也会更开心吧？|trans_en=Why not change things up for the Snowish Festival with a little bit of winter magic?<br/>And just maybe... I'll try pulling candy from a hat for the children instead of doves!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_126_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとっ。ところでいまちょっと時間ある？<br/>このあとかくし芸イベントにゲストとして呼ばれてるんだけど<br/>この日のために用意した、スペシャルマジックの感想を聞かせてほしいの|text_cn=新年快乐∼对了，你现在有空吗？有节目组邀请我作为嘉宾去表演特别舞台！<br/>为此我特意准备了新的魔术，你愿意来当第一位观众吗？记得告诉我你的感想哦~|trans_en=Happy New Year! Do you have a moment?<br/>I've been invited to a talent show as a guest performer in a bit!<br/>I'd love your feedback on a special magic trick I've been working on for it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_126_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=デビューしたばかりの頃はね、誕生日も番組の収録だったりファンミーティングで毎年大忙し<br/>その日の主役のはずが、帰る頃にはへとへとよ。まあそれはそれで充実してたけど<br/>そういうわけだから、こうして特別な人と一緒に<br/>当たり前のように『普通』の日を過ごせるのが、いまは嬉しいの|text_cn=刚入行的时候，每年的生日不是录节目，就是开粉丝见面会，还有堆成山的工作需要处理。充实倒是充实……<br/>但原本值得庆祝的日子，反倒成了最累的一天。<br/>不过今时不同往日，现在的我终于可以用最“普通”的方式，和最特别的人一起度过这一天了。|trans_en=After I first made my debut, I was always super busy with tapings and fan meetings, even on my birthdays.<br/>Even though it was my special day, I was beat by the time I finished. Well, it was fulfilling, in a sense.<br/>But it's because of that I appreciate how nice it is to spend a normal day with someone I care about.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_126_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_126_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はあなただけに贈る、特別なステージを用意したの<br/>なにが飛び出すかは、ステージを見てのお楽しみよ♪<br/>安心して。誕生日プレゼントの消失マジックなんて、そんなベタなことはしないから|text_cn=今天是一位特殊观众的生日，为此我也准备了特别的演出！<br/>拿好咯，这可是你的专属门票~别担心，像把生日礼物变没这种无聊的魔术我才不会表演呢！|trans_en=I've prepared a special show today just for you!<br/>You'll just have to watch the stage to see what jumps out! ♪<br/>Oh, and don't worry! I won't be doing anything dumb like making birthday presents disappear!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_127_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うにゃにゃ～！ボスに会うと、元気が湧いてくるにゃ～♪|text_cn=喔！魔王，见到你心情都变好了呢~|trans_en=Yay! I always cheer up when I see you, Boss!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_127_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=聞いて聞いて！今日ね、また新しい宝物を見つけたの！|text_cn=听我说听我说！我今天又淘到新宝贝了哦！|trans_en=Hey, guess what? I found some new treasure today!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_127_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁあ～…今何時にゃ…|text_cn=哈啊……现在几点了喵……|trans_en=(yawn)... What time is it...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_127_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんにちは。ボスも魚の缶詰食べる？<br/>――え？昨日も同じことを言ってた？|text_cn=中午好呀，要不要来点鱼罐头，诶……我昨天也是这么说的吗？|trans_en=Hey there. Want some canned fish? ... Huh? I asked you the same thing yesterday?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_127_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夜になるとキラキラするの、いっぱい持ってるよ。…見たい？|text_cn=我有好多能在夜里发光的小玩意，想不想看？|trans_en=I've got those things that sparkle at night. Wanna see?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_127_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボ、ボス…！ウチのゴーグルどこかで見なかった！？…え？　頭の上？|text_cn=魔王！我找不到我的护目镜了，你有看……诶？就在头上？|trans_en=B-Boss! You haven't seen my goggles, have you?! No WAY? They were on my head this whole time!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_127_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい天気だし、一緒に宝探しに行かない？|text_cn=今天天气不错呀，要不要一起寻宝~|trans_en=It's a great day outside. Wanna go treasure-hunting with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_127_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの、ボス？ウチがケガしたこと、誰にも言わないで？|text_cn=魔王，我受伤的事，不要告诉别人……|trans_en=Um, Boss? Don't tell anyone I got hurt, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_127_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ぎに゙ゃ～！もっと優しく！優しくして～！|text_cn=喵啊！轻一点，再轻一点。|trans_en=Yeowch! Not so rough, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_127_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスに木登りを教えてあげる！視野が広がって、効率よく移動できるはずだよ|text_cn=魔王，我教你爬树吧！这样才能看得更远，走得更快~|trans_en=Boss, I'll teach you how to climb trees. That way, you can see where the roads go! Pretty handy, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_127_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ルートを選定して、全部の手紙を無事に届ける――それがウチの仕事だよ|text_cn=确保道路通畅无阻，把每一封信都安全地送到人们手里，这就是我的工作哦。|trans_en=Finding the best route to deliver the mail is my job!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_127_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=バンソウコウとガーゼを使い切っちゃった…はにゃ！？な、何でもないにゃ！|text_cn=糟了，创口贴和纱布用完了……啊！没、没什么 ！|trans_en=Yikes! I've used up all the bandages ... What?! N-No, it's nothing. Everything's a-okay!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_127_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=前に、きーぼーど？っていう神器を拾ってね<br/>使い方はわからないけど、指で押すと気持ち良かったんだ<br/>あれは…そう、ネコの爪とぎボードみたいな！|text_cn=我捡到过一个叫键盘的神器，虽然不知道怎么用……<br/>但是手指按上去的感觉很舒服，很像……对！猫抓板！|trans_en=I picked up this artifact called, er, a... "key board" I think?<br/>I didn't know how to use it, but it was fun pressing down the white and black keys—<br/>you know, kind of like how a cat plays with a scratching post?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_127_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=危険を察知したら、ウチが毛を逆立てて――え、やんのかステップ？<br/>違う違う。ウチは『テレサアラート』って呼んでるにゃ|text_cn=察觉到危险的时候，我的寒毛会突然竖起来……<br/>“炸毛”？不不，我管这个叫“特丽莎一激灵”。|trans_en=I bristle at the sight of danger... Hm? <br/>Like a cat arching its back? I guess. But I call it "Teresa's Alert Mode."}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_127_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=この大剣はグラムっていって、前に古代遺跡で拾ったんだ<br/>はじめは売るか悩んだけど…何度も助けられるうちに、宝物になったにゃ♪|text_cn=我的那把大剑叫格拉姆，是我很久以前在古代遗迹里捡到的！<br/>虽然当初想把它卖掉……但它毕竟救了我很多次，现在已经是我最珍视的宝物了~|trans_en=This huge sword is called Gram. I found it in some ruins, and at first I was gonna sell it.<br/>But it's saved me so many times now there's no way I'm letting it go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_127_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、えっと…今日の分の手紙は全部配達したから、いくらでも時間はあるよ！|text_cn=那个……我今天提早把所有的信都送完了，所以，现在很闲哦！|trans_en=Oh, hey there. I finished delivering today's mail, so I've got plenty of time to play!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_127_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=に、苦ぁ…これがミルクなしミルクティー？<br/>へ？べ、別に無理してないよ。ウチもボスみたいにすごい人になりたいから…|text_cn=呜呜，好苦……这就是不加奶的奶茶吗？<br/>诶，也没有在勉强自己啦……可是，我也想变得和你一样成熟嘛……|trans_en=Gah! Bitter! So this is what tea tastes like without milk and sugar? <br/>... What? N-No, I-I like it. I wanna become an amazing person, just like you, so...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_127_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスはネコが好きなの？あ、ううん。特に意味はないからすぐに答えなくていいよ…！|text_cn=魔王你喜欢猫吗？<br/>啊，不用急着回答，没有别的意思，就是问问而已……|trans_en=Do you like cats, Boss? <br/>... Hm? Oh, no reason. Just wondering. You don't have to answer right away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_127_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いろんなデザインのバンソウコウを集めたから、好きなの持ってって<br/>遠慮しなくていいよ。保存用と普段使い用で分けてるし♪|text_cn=我收藏了很多不同款式的创口贴，你喜欢哪个就拿走吧。<br/>不要紧的，每种款式我都买了收藏用的和日常用的。|trans_en=I've collected a ton of bandages in a bunch of different sizes, so take whichever ones you like. <br/>I've sorted them into "regular use" and "my personal collection."}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_127_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=冒険で外に出るのもいいけど、狭いところも好きなんだ<br/>例えば…タンスの中とか、金庫の中。ボスも試してみない？すごく落ち着くよ♪|text_cn=在外冒险是不错，但有时候我也喜欢待在狭窄的地方……<br/>比如衣橱、保险柜之类的，总觉得很安心。<br/>魔王要不要也来试试？|trans_en=Going on adventures in the great outdoors is nice and all, but I like hanging out in little hideaways, too. <br/>Like ... the inside of a cabinet, or underneath a sofa. <br/>You should try it yourself, Boss. It's super relaxing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_127_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=トーナはね、毎日大忙しなんだ<br/>ヨロズ配達の依頼をさばいて、経費の管理もして、配達ルートも決めて<br/>無理してないか、本当に心配だよ…|text_cn=多娜其实很辛苦的，每天都要安排万送屋的委托，清算账单，还有规划送信流程。<br/>我有些担心，她是不是一直在勉强自己……|trans_en=Donna's crazy busy every day. Completing orders for Post Haste, managing expenses, deciding delivery routes... <br/>I'm seriously worried she might be pushing herself too hard.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_127_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=お母さんはいつも『フリージアちゃんを見習いなさい』って言うけど…<br/>ウチ、斧なんて使わないのになんでだろう？|text_cn=妈妈让我多向苍兰学习，可我也不会用斧头啊。|trans_en=Mom always says I should "follow Freesia's lead"... But why should I? It's not like I have an axe or anything.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_127_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウィンドアッシュの人って、みんなスケボーが上手なんだって<br/>いいなぁ～、ウチも練習したいな～！<br/>え？転ぶと危ない？へへ、転ぶのは慣れてるし、大丈夫だよ♪|text_cn=我听说灰风俱乐部的人都很擅长玩滑板，一定很帅气吧，我也想学！<br/>什么？容易摔倒？没事，反正我也习惯了~|trans_en=I hear that everyone in the Ashwind Clan is really good at skateboarding. I'm soooo jealous. I wanna practice too! <br/>... Huh? It's dangerous because I could fall down? Hehe! That's no problem—I fall down all the time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_127_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=アンズ！？あ、いや…なんでもないよ。ちょっと面識があるだけで…<br/>ホントだって、あの子に訊けば――やっぱ今のナシ！あの子には訊いちゃダメ！|text_cn=杏子？呃……没、没什么，我们只是有过一面之缘哦。<br/>真的，不信你问她，啊不对不对！还是不要问了！|trans_en=Ann! Oh gosh! ... Er, I mean, no, I barely know her.  <br/>Seriously. Ask her if you don't—no, wait, scratch that! Don't tell I said anything! Please!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_127_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまに思うんだけど…<br/>ウチがレッドアイズの人みたいに空を飛べたら、配達の効率が上がるのかな～って|text_cn=有时候我在想，如果能像绯瞳的那些人一样骑扫帚飞来飞去，送信会不会更方便一点？|trans_en=Every now and then I get to thinking... <br/>Wouldn't mail deliveries be way more efficient if we could fly through the air like the people in Scarlet Sights Media?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_127_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=に゙ゃぁ～！ウチは犬じゃないから、頭を撫でないでぇ～！|text_cn=喵哇~不要摸我的头，我可不是小狗。|trans_en=Agh! I'm not a dog! Stop petting me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_127_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あイタっ！もう、そこは触らないで…！<br/>あ、別に怒ってるわけじゃなくてケガしたところがまだ治ってないんだぁ|text_cn=别碰那里！<br/>啊……我不是凶你，只是之前的伤还没好呢……|trans_en=Ugh, don't touch me there! <br/>... No, it's okay, I'm not mad. It's just that I got hurt there and it hasn't healed yet.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_127_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボ、ボス？ジッとこっちを見て…どしたの？<br/>一応言っとくけど、ウチは煮干しなんて隠してないよ…？|text_cn=魔王……怎么老盯着我，先说好，我可没偷偷藏小鱼干哦……|trans_en=B-Boss? Why are you staring at me like that? Just to let you know, I'm not hiding any dried fish, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_127_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…急に静かになったけど、どうかした？もしかして…ウチ、何か気に障ることしちゃった？|text_cn=怎么突然不说话……我是不是做错了什么……？|trans_en=Um, you got quiet all of a sudden. What's the matter? Did I say something that hurt your feelings?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_127_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=え、なに？そんなにジッとこっち見て…<br/>あ、わかった！どっちが瞬きしないでいられるかの勝負だね！<br/>受けて立つにゃ！うぅ～…め、目が乾くぅ～|text_cn=怎么了？一直盯着我……<br/>我知道了，这是比谁先眨眼的游戏吗，哼哼，我接受挑战！<br/>………………<br/>呜……眼睛好酸。|trans_en=Uh, what? Why do you keep staring at me...? <br/>Oh, I get it!  You wanna do a staring contest! You're on! Nnnnnngh... <br/>Argh, my eyes! <br/>They're drying out already!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_127_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うおー！こんなところに新しい配達ルートが！<br/>ウチはヨロズ配達のテレサ。手紙を出す時は声をかけてね|text_cn=喔~又发现一条新航道！哼哼~我是万送屋的特丽莎，想寄信时，您和我说一声就行。|trans_en=Whoa! There's a new delivery route here! I'm Teresa from Post Haste, by the way. Let me know if you want anything delivered.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_127_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=久しぶり、ボス！うちの配達サービスには、満足してくれてる？|text_cn=又见面了，魔王，万送屋的服务您还满意吗？|trans_en=Long time no see, Boss! Are you getting the mail all right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_127_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これで痛いのも怖くないよ！|text_cn=这下更不怕痛了~|trans_en=Now I'm not scared of getting hurt anymore!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_127_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=グラム…進化ぁー！！|text_cn=格拉姆，进化！|trans_en=Gram ... is even better!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_127_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=…うん、ありがとう。一番大事な『手紙』はたしかに受け取ったよ|text_cn=谢谢你，最重要的“信”我已经收到了。|trans_en=... Mm-hm, thanks. Now I've received the most important letter of them all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_127_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい音だね～。なんていうか、こう…とにかくいい音だにゃぁ～|text_cn=好听！呃，想不出合适的词语来形容……总之就是好听~|trans_en=It's so beautiful. It's like, er ... oh, I don't know. Something that sounds really nice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_127_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今のウチなら、伝説のドラゴンだって倒せるかも！|text_cn=现在的我，说不定连传说中的龙也能打倒呢！|trans_en=I might even be able to vanquish a legendary dragon now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_127_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスって、本当になんでもお見通しなんだね…|text_cn=真是的……好像什么都瞒不住你呢……|trans_en=You really do see through everything, don't you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_127_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=煮干しとお宝、どっちも半分あげるから、一緒に配達に行かない？<br/>えっと…二人で配達した方が、効率がいいかなって|text_cn=小鱼干和宝藏分你一半，下次送信能陪我一起吗?<br/>唔……我只是觉得两个人送信会更有效率点。|trans_en=I'll give you half of my dried fish and half of my treasure if you come with me on my deliveries. <br/>... You know, 'cause it'll be more efficient that way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_127_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん…これからはケガしないように気をつけるよ。心配してくれて、ありがとね|text_cn=知道了，既然你都那么在意，以后我会少让自己受伤啦……|trans_en=Mm... I'll be careful not to get injured from now on. Thanks for worrying about me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_127_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスは、方向感覚に自信ある？<br/>もし不安なら…こ、この先出かける時は、ウチを連れてってよ！|text_cn=魔王魔王，你擅长认路吗？<br/>我、我只是在想……如果害怕迷路的话，以后出门就都叫上我吧！|trans_en=Boss, do you trust your sense of direction? <br/>Cause if you don't—even a little bit—then you should take definitely take me when you head out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_127_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスとは長い付き合いだからこそきちんと伝えておきたいことがあって…<br/>誰かに手紙を書くのは、配達員になって以来初めてで緊張するけど…<br/>受け取ってくれる？|text_cn=和你相处了这么久，有些话我却只想写在信里。<br/>成为信使后，我还是第一次想给别人写信，我们以后能保持书信往来吗……？|trans_en=I've known you for a long time now, so I want to share my true feelings for you.<br/>This'll be the first time I've written a letter since I started delivering mail, so I'm really nervous... Will you accept it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_127_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=拾ったお宝？ウチ、こういうのも好きにゃ！|text_cn=是捡来的宝藏吗？喜欢喵！|trans_en=You found it? I love stuff like this!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_127_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=にゃ！？これどこで拾ったの？今度行く時はウチも連れてってよ！|text_cn=哇！这是从哪里弄来的？下次带上我一起好不好？|trans_en=Whoa! Where'd you find this? Take me with you the next time you go, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_127_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=すっごく嬉しい！今夜は抱きしめて寝よっと！|text_cn=好棒！今晚我要抱着它一起睡觉~|trans_en=I'm SO happy! I'm going to sleep with this in my arms tonight!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_127_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=わかった！|text_cn=明白！|trans_en=Gotcha!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_127_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメ！|text_cn=不行！|trans_en=Nuh-uh!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_127_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ！？|text_cn=诶！？|trans_en=Huh?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_127_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=うにゃぁ～…|text_cn=呶呶呶……|trans_en=Whaaaaaa...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_127_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなぁ…|text_cn=怎么会……|trans_en=No way...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_127_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=うにゃぁああああ！！！|text_cn=呜噢噢噢哦哦！！！|trans_en=Whoooooooa!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_127_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=フシャー！|text_cn=喵！|trans_en=RGH!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_127_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=やったやったぁ！|text_cn=好耶好耶~|trans_en=Aw yeah!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_127_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっちゃったぁ…|text_cn=搞砸了……|trans_en=I really screwed up...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_127_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウチの力、思い知ったかぁ！|text_cn=知道我的厉害了吧~|trans_en=How'd you like my power?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_127_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=見せて見せて！|text_cn=让我康康~|trans_en=Show me, show me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_127_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=おっ！ターゲット発見！|text_cn=哦！发现目标！|trans_en=Ah-ha! Target in sight!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_127_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=べ、別にケガなんてしてない、ホントにしてないから…|text_cn=我才没有受伤，没有哦。|trans_en=I-It's not like I'm injured, y'know? Seriously, I'm fine...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_127_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_127_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…ウチのことはほっといて…|text_cn=唔，不用管我了啦……|trans_en=(sniffle)... Leave me alone...}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_127_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一刀両断――魔剣、グラム！|text_cn=一刀两断——魔剑，格拉姆！|trans_en=Cut them in half, magical blade Gram!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_127_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウチの最強の一撃――喰らえにゃあー！|text_cn=这就是我，最强的一击——喝啊喵！|trans_en=Ready for this? It's my ultimate attack!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_127_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ手紙、届けてないのに…|text_cn=信，还没送到……|trans_en=But I haven't delivered the mail yet...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_127_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=トーナ…フリージア…|text_cn=多娜……苍兰……|trans_en=Donna... Freesia...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_127_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よくわかんないけど…とにかくウチが強くなったってことだよね！|text_cn=虽然不太懂，总之就是变强了吧！|trans_en=I don't really know how ... but I think I've gotten stronger!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_127_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=バンソウコウはもういらないにゃー|text_cn=准备好的创可贴用不上啦。|trans_en=I don't need any more bandages!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_127_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=今のウチなら、グラムを二本だって使いこなせるにゃ～|text_cn=现在的我，两把格拉姆也挥得动~|trans_en=I bet I could use two Grams right now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_127_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなのために、最短ルートを探すね|text_cn=我会带大家找到最快的路线~|trans_en=I'll search for the shortest route, guys.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_127_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=グラムの力でみんなを守るよ！|text_cn=格拉姆会保护大家！|trans_en=I'll use Gram's power to protect everyone!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_127_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お宝がないか探すにゃ～|text_cn=找找看有没有值钱的东西~|trans_en=Better see if there's any treasure...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_127_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いろいろ拾って帰れば、トーナもフリージアもきっと喜んでくれるよね|text_cn=我多捡点东西回去的话，多娜和苍兰一定也会高兴的。|trans_en=Donna and Freesia'll be real happy if I bring a ton of stuff back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_127_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=お腹減ったの？ん～と…煮干しならあるけど、食べる？|text_cn=零食……我带了点小鱼干，你要不要吃？|trans_en=Hungry? Hm, let's see... Well, I've got dried fish. Want some?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_127_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=この先で何か光ってる。お宝かにゃ？|text_cn=前面好像闪着亮光，难道有宝藏？|trans_en=There's something shiny up ahead. Could it be treasure?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_127_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=通った道に印を付けてるの。そうすれば迷子にならないからね！|text_cn=走过的路我都会做标记，这样就不怕迷路啦！|trans_en=I've been marking our path. That way we won't get lost!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_127_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ブレイブリーテレサは、どんな困難も恐れないよ～♪|text_cn=勇敢特丽莎，不怕困难~|trans_en=Valiant Teresa isn't scared of anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_127_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初めての塔でも、ルート開拓なら任せといて！|text_cn=不论哪座星塔，肯定都能找到捷径。|trans_en=Even if it's our first time in a Monolith, I'll still find the way!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_127_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=急いで出発したせいで、お財布忘れてきちゃった…|text_cn=出门走得急，忘带钱包了……|trans_en=I was in a big rush and forgot my coin purse.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_127_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=見張りはウチがするから、先に休んでて|text_cn=你先休息吧，我来给你放哨~|trans_en=I'm on guard now, so go take a nap, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_127_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あとのことは、全部お任せするにゃ～|text_cn=还是你来做决定吧，都听你的~|trans_en=Guess I'll leave this to you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_127_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=全部片付いたにゃー！|text_cn=都清理干净啦！|trans_en=All cleaned up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_127_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=お次は…あっちに行くにゃー！|text_cn=接下来往——那边走！|trans_en=Next up... That way!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_127_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこもケガしてないよ！|text_cn=我没有受伤哦！|trans_en=I didn't get hurt! Not even a bit!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_127_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=楽勝楽勝～！|text_cn=轻轻松松~|trans_en=Piece of cake!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_127_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、手紙が…！ふぅ…無事でよかったぁ|text_cn=信封！呼……还好没事。|trans_en=Ah, the mail! Phew... Looks like everything's here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_127_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…全部ウチのせいだ…|text_cn=呜……都怪我……|trans_en=(sniffle)... This is all my fault...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_127_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もっと上手く立ち回ってれば…|text_cn=要是我能做得更好……|trans_en=If only I'd fought better...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_127_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっぱりウチが出ないとね！|text_cn=果然还是得靠我嘛！|trans_en=I guess it's gotta be me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_127_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=着陸ー！|text_cn=着陆！|trans_en=Touchdown!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_127_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘ならウチに任せて！|text_cn=战斗就交给我吧！|trans_en=Leave the combat to me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_127_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=お宝が見つかるといいなぁ～|text_cn=希望能找到些宝藏~|trans_en=Hope I find some treasure...}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_127_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_127_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスー！大事な荷物の受け取りを忘れてるにゃ！<br/>ほら、いますぐサインすればまだ受け取れるから！<br/>え？ どんな荷物かって？それは…ウチの手作りチョコだよ|text_cn=魔王魔王，你漏收了重要货物——！现在签收还来得及！这个……这个是我自己做的巧克力……|trans_en=Boss! You forgot to pick up an important package, nya!  <br/>But if you sign right now, you can still pick it up!  <br/>Hm? What's in the package? It's ... my homemade chocolates.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_127_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスー！メリクリだにゃ！<br/>一緒に熱々の焼き魚を食べて、その後みんなでおっきい雪だるま作るにゃ！|text_cn=魔王！雪愿节快乐~要不要来一串热乎乎的烤鱼？吃完之后，我们就一起去堆雪人吧~|trans_en=Boss! Happy Snowish Festival, nya!  <br/>Let's have some grilled fish and then make a giant snowman together, nya!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_127_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今年最初のお手紙、ボスのポケットにお届けしたよ！<br/>本当なら日付が変わってすぐに渡したかったんだけど…でもいいんだ！<br/>前にお母さんがね、「真っ直ぐ気持ちを伝えることが一番大事」って言ってたから！|text_cn=今年的第一封信已经塞进你口袋啦！本想零点准时送达的……<br/>不过没事！妈妈说过，不管是早到晚到，最重要的是心意传达到！|trans_en=I delivered the first letter of the year to your pocket, Boss!  <br/>I actually wanted to give it to you just as soon as the date changed ... but it's okay!  <br/>My mom once told me "the most important thing is to share your honest feelings"!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_127_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日のウチは絶好調にゃ！だって誕生日には、幸運が舞い込むって言われてるし<br/>だからボス、ウチと一緒に宝探しに行くにゃ！|text_cn=今天的我可是很强的！听说过生日的当天会有好运……我得赶紧出发去寻宝喵∼！<br/>魔王，你也一起来好不好？|trans_en=I feel amazing today, nya! <br/>They say a person's birthday is their lucky day!  <br/>Let's go treasure hunting together, Boss!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_127_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_127_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスー！ 匿名の手紙で、緊急の依頼が入ったにゃ！「生クリームとイチゴ<br/>卵と牛乳を買ってきてね。お誕生日会のことはボスにナイショだよ？」<br/>…あ。間違えてトーナに渡されたお買い物リストを読んじゃったにゃ！<br/>ボスー！お誕生日会のことは聞かなかったことにしてぇ～っ！|text_cn=魔王！这里有一封给你的匿名信！里面有委托给你的紧急任务！唔……<br/>“需要买奶油、草莓、鸡蛋和牛奶，生日派对的事要对魔王保密哦！”<br/>……啊。呜喵！糟了不小心把多娜给我的购物清单念出来了！魔王！你就当没有听过好不好？|trans_en=Boss! We got a letter with an urgent request from an anonymous sender, nya!  <br/>"Get some cream, strawberries, eggs, and milk from the store. Don't tell Boss about the birthday party!"  <br/>Oh. Oops. I guess I wasn't supposed to read that letter from Donna out loud, nya!  <br/>Just pretend you don't know anything about your birthday party, okay?}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_130_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=配達の依頼はヨロズ配達へ！今日も元気に営業中！|text_cn=万送屋营业中，现承接各类委托~|trans_en=Bring delivery commissions to Post Haste! Cheerfully open for business today too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_130_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ？この手紙…配達し忘れちゃったみたい<br/>ねえねえ魔王さん、悪いけど、ついてきてくれない？|text_cn=这封信好像被漏掉了……<br/>呀，<username>，要跟我一起去送信吗？|trans_en=Hm? This letter... Looks like I forgot to deliver it.<br/>Hey, hey, Tyrant, sorry, but can you come with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_130_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよっ、魔王さん！新聞のお届けだよー！|text_cn=早呀，<username>，这是今天的报纸~|trans_en=Good morning, Tyrant! Here's your newspaper!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_130_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お腹すいたぁ～……えっ、今からご飯？なら私も一緒に行こっかな～|text_cn=肚子好饿……要去吃饭吗？带上我吧！|trans_en=I'm starving... Huh? Lunchtime? I'll join you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_130_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私は…昼よりも夜の方が好きかな|text_cn=比起白天，我更喜欢夜晚~|trans_en=I prefer nighttime over daytime.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_130_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい、決めポーズ☆どう、可愛くない！？|text_cn=诶嘿，多娜的招牌动作，可爱吧~|trans_en=Alright, striking a pose! Cute, right?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_130_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=トーナ、難しいお話よくわかんな～い|text_cn=复杂的事情，多娜听不懂啦。|trans_en=I don't really get complicated stuff...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_130_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よ～し、これにきーめた♪ヨロズ配達のメンバーは、いつでも可愛くなくっちゃね☆|text_cn=嗯，选这件吧，万送屋的信使就是要无敌可爱。|trans_en=Okay, I've decided on this ♪ Post Haste members always have to be cute ☆}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_130_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんは、どんな服が私に似合うと思う？|text_cn=<username>~你觉得我这么穿好看吗？|trans_en=What kind of clothes do you think suit me, Tyrant?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_130_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=スターシェイクで人気のお店があるでしょ？<br/>クーポンがあるんだけど、一緒に飲みに行かない？<br/>なんと一つ買うと、もう一つ無料でもらえるんだよ！|text_cn=要一起去吃星塔严选的星旋风吗？我这里有优惠券，买一送一哦。|trans_en=You know that popular shop in Starshake?<br/>I've got a coupon. Wanna go for a drink?<br/>If you buy one, I get one free!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_130_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=手紙っていうのは人と人とを結ぶもので、配達員はそこに込められた気持ちを運ぶ使者なの<br/>そう考えると、私たちのお仕事って、とっても素敵だよね！|text_cn=信是连结人和人关系的载体，而信使则是让这一连结得以实现的使者。<br/>这样想的话，就觉得我们万送屋是在做一件了不起的事情！|trans_en=Letters connect people, and we're the messengers who carry those feelings.<br/>When you think about it that way, my job is pretty amazing, isn't it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_130_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私がよく道に迷うって？あはは、そんなわけないでしょ<br/>こっちは配達員だよ？だ、だからぁ……<br/>もうっ、そんな目で私を見ないでよ！|text_cn=听说我经常迷路？作为信使怎么可能会迷路啊哈哈哈……<br/>没错那是谣言！|trans_en=You heard I get lost a lot? Haha, no way!<br/>I'm a courier, after all...<br/>Hey! Quit looking at me like that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_130_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんな困難な状況でも…ヨロズ配達のみんなで力を合わせれば、きっとなんとかなる！|text_cn=无论什么困难，只要万送屋的大家一起努力，总能找到方法克服的~|trans_en=No matter how tough the situation, we can handle anything if everyone at Post Haste works together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_130_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=フリージアとテレサが溺れてたらどっちを先に助けるかって？<br/>ボスー、そうやって仲間割れさせようとするのはよくないよ～？|text_cn=苍兰和特丽莎同时掉进水里我要先救谁？魔王，不可以挑拨离间哦？|trans_en=If Freesia and Teresa were both drowning, who would I save first?<br/>Boss, that's a terrible question! Don't make us take sides!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_130_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨロズ配達では、手紙の他にも新聞とミルクの配達も承ってまーす！<br/>お求めの際は、是非ご連絡くださーい！|text_cn=万送屋的业务除了送信，还有送报纸送牛奶送快递哦。有需要的话，欢迎随时来找我们~|trans_en=At Post Haste, we deliver more than just letters, we also handle newspapers and milk!<br/>If you need anything, just let us know!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_130_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=見て見て！この可愛い服、私が作ったんだよ♪<br/>というわけで魔王さん、ちょっと着てみてくれる？|text_cn=<username>~今天可以做我的模特吗~<br>我给你做了一件很可爱的衣服哦~|trans_en=Lookie here! I made this cute outfit myself ♪<br/>Boss, would you try it on for me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_130_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん～、なにしてるのかって？見ての通り、大切な人にプレゼントする服を作って…<br/>えっ、誰へのプレゼントかって？にはは、誰だろうね～？当ててごらん♪|text_cn=我在做什么？这个是新衣服哦！要给一个重要的人的……<br/>是谁？嗯……是谁呢？你猜猜~|trans_en=Mmm, what am I doing, you ask? As you can see, I'm making clothes as a gift for a special person...<br/>Eh? A present to whom? Nyahaha, who could it be? Try and guess ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_130_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この弓……トーミナって名前でね<br/>私が寂しくないようにって、お父さんたちが残してくれた大切な家族なんだ|text_cn=我手里的这把弓叫多米纳，和我的名字很像吧~<br/>它一定是我的父母为了不让我孤单，给我留下来的重要的家人。|trans_en=This bow... Its name is Domina.<br/>My father left it behind for me, so I wouldn't feel lonely. It's a precious family member to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_130_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ～、今月も赤字かぁ…いつになったら三人乗りの自転車を買えるんだろう|text_cn=完蛋了，这个月又超支了……按照这个情况我们要到什么时候才能存够钱买三人自行车……|trans_en=Sigh... Another month in the red. When can I afford that three-seater bicycle?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_130_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夜が好きな理由？特に何かあるわけじゃないけど…<br/>あの静けさが好きなんだよね。誰も見てないし、素の自分でいられるっていうか|text_cn=很在意我喜欢夜晚的理由？<br/>没那么复杂啦，就是很喜欢夜深人静时的那份安宁，大家都睡着了，所以不强打精神也没关系。|trans_en=The reason I like night? There's nothing in particular...<br/>I like that quietness. No one is looking, and I can just be myself, I guess.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_130_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キャンピングカーの話、セイナに詳しく聞いてみたいな～<br/>だってさ、もしかしたら私たちのあの機関車だって、また走るようになるかもしれないでしょ？|text_cn=好想找尘沙多聊聊房车的事，说不定能找到方法，把我们住的那个火车头也开起来！|trans_en=I'd love to hear more about that camping car from Noya.<br/>I mean, maybe our locomotive could start running again too, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_130_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハの仕事仲間って、みーんな可愛いメイド服を着てるんだって<br/>いいよね～、今度うちのふたりにも作ってあげよっかな～♪|text_cn=花原说，她们家的女孩子会穿很可爱的女仆装。真好啊，要不下次给大家也都做一件好了~|trans_en=I hear that all of Nanoha's coworkers wear cute maid's outfits.<br/>That's nice. Maybe I will make some for my two as well ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_130_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前配達してる時、カッコイイ女の子に助けられたんだ。<br/>名前は…カシミラさん、だったかな？また会えるといいな～|text_cn=之前送信的时候被一个人救了，是个非常帅气的女生，叫卡西米拉。要是下次还能见面就好了~|trans_en=I was saved by a really cool girl while making a delivery the other day.<br/>Her name was Kasimira, I think? I hope I get to see her again.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_130_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？フリージアが私のこと、頼りになるって？<br/>にはは♪そりゃあ私は、真面目で賢くて、超無敵の可愛さを誇るトーナちゃんだからね～☆|text_cn=觉得苍兰好像很依赖我？<br/>那当然是因为我是万送屋超级无敌可爱勤劳聪明又可靠的多娜呀~|trans_en=Hm? Freesia said I'm reliable?<br/>Nyahaha ♪ That's because I'm Donna, serious, smart, and boasting unbeatable cuteness ☆}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_130_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=テレサって、眠る時ドーラを枕の下に置くんだけど…<br/>あの子が寝てるうちに、私とフリージアでこっそり１ドーラ追加しててね<br/>だからテレサは、枕にお願いすると、起きた時にお金が増えるって信じてるんだよ|text_cn=我偷偷跟你说个秘密哦，特丽莎喜欢在枕头底下藏朵拉，我和苍兰每次都会趁她睡着多塞一个朵拉给她。<br/>她到现在都还觉得只要对着枕头许愿，第二天就会增加一个朵拉。|trans_en=Teresa keeps the Dorra under her pillow when she sleeps...<br/>But Freesia and I secretly slip in extra Dorra while she's sleeping.<br/>She thinks that wishing on her pillow nets her more money!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_130_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おやおや～？そんなに慌ててどうしたのかな～？|text_cn=什么事这么着急呀？|trans_en=Oh my... What's got you all flustered?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_130_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=にはは。もしかして魔王さん、トーナにかまってほしいの？|text_cn=哎呀，魔王这是在跟我撒娇吗？|trans_en=Nyahaha. Could it be, Tyrant, that you want my attention?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_130_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=特別に秘密を教えてあげるね。実はこの前……って、もう。ちゃんと聞いてる～？|text_cn=偷偷告诉你一个秘密，上次我……<br/>喂，你在听我说话吗？|trans_en=I'll let you in on a little secret. The other day... Hey, are you even listening?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_130_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう怒った。これ以上無視するなら、トーナは帰っちゃうからね？<br/>な～んちゃって☆|text_cn=再不理我的话，多娜就要回去了哦？|trans_en=Now I'm mad. If you keep ignoring me, I'm going home.<br/>Just kidding! ☆}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_130_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=退屈退屈～。魔王さん、どこ行ったの～？|text_cn=好无聊啊，魔王去哪了？|trans_en=I'm. So. Bored. Where'd you go, Tyrant?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_130_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どーもー、ヨロズ配達のトーナで～す！<br/>雨が降ろうが雪が降ろうが、大事なお手紙をお届けします！<br/>安心安全がモットーのヨロズ配達を是非ご利用ください！|text_cn=初次见面，万送屋为您服务。无论是雪山还是雨林，你邮我寄，让信件平安传递！|trans_en=Hello! I'm Donna from Post Haste!<br/>Rain or snow, I'll make sure your precious letters arrive safely!<br/>For reliable and secure deliveries, choose Post Haste!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_130_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしてここにいるのかって？ただボスについてきただけだよ。道に迷った訳じゃないって|text_cn=诶？又见面了？啊哈哈，我才没有迷路！我是故意跟着你的。|trans_en=Why am I here? I just followed Boss. I'm not lost or anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_130_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うんうん。優秀な配達員になるには、たくさんの経験を積まないとね～|text_cn=好的信使就要经验多多~|trans_en=Yep! To be a top-tier courier, I need lots of experience!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_130_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=配達少女トーナ、ハイパーエボリューション☆|text_cn=信使少女，超——进化～|trans_en=Donna the Courier, Hyper Evolution!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_130_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あれ？こんな大切なこと、どうして忘れちゃってたんだろう……？|text_cn=诶？我怎么忘记了这么重要的事情？|trans_en=Huh? How could I forget something this important?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_130_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ♪この旋律に、人の想いが詰まってるんだね|text_cn=这个旋律里藏着思念呢。|trans_en=Hehe. ♪ You can feel people's emotions in this tune.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_130_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして私、また可愛くなってる？|text_cn=哇呜，我是不是变得更可爱了？|trans_en=Wait. Did I just get even cuter?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_130_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=トーナちゃん、可愛く大変身！|text_cn=多娜~可爱变身！|trans_en=Ta-da! This is my super cute transformation!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_130_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん魔王さん！私たちヨロズ配達に投資してみない？|text_cn=<username>~要不要投资我们万送屋呀~|trans_en=You there, Boss! How about investing in Post Haste?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_130_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=配達員の仕事って、結構楽しいんだよ<br/>もし興味あるなら、魔王さんも一回くらい体験してみるといいかも<br/>え……あはは、やだなぁ。別に勧誘じゃないってば|text_cn=当信使很有意思吧？如果哪天<username>有兴趣的话也可以来体验一下哦！<br/>哎呀，我没有在忽悠你入伙啦~|trans_en=Being a courier is actually pretty fun!<br/>If you're curious, maybe you should try it sometime.<br/>Huh? Haha, no, I'm not trying to recruit you or anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_130_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごめ～ん、今日はもう体力が限界で…でも明日には元気になってるはずだから、<br/>メイド服に着替えたトーナが一日中一緒にいてあ・げ・る☆<br/>――って、即答で断るなぁ～！|text_cn=多娜今天没力气了，要明天才能恢复精力。<br/>不过作为今天不能陪你的补偿，就让明天的多娜穿女仆装陪你吧！呀，不要拒绝得这么快啦~|trans_en=Sorry, I'm totally out of energy today. But I'll be all better tomorrow!<br/>And I'll spend with you in a maid outfit for the · whole · day.<br/>Hey, don't turn me down!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_130_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ピンポーン。ヨロズ配達で～す。えっと、実はあなた宛に匿名の手紙を預かってて…<br/>…ちょ、ストップストップ！私の前で読んじゃダメ！<br/>と、とにかく誰からの手紙か想像してみて？答え合わせは……ヨロズ配達で待ってるから|text_cn=叮咚~万送屋竭诚为您服务，这里有封给您的匿名信……<br/>啊！等一下！多娜在的时候不准读这封信！<br/>总之，等你读完再猜猜看是谁给你寄的！到时候就来万送屋跟我对答案吧！|trans_en=Knock knock! Post Haste here! So, um... I have an anonymous letter addressed to you.<br/>W-Wait, stop! Don't read it in front of me!<br/>A-Anyway, guess who sent it, okay? I'll be waiting at Post Haste for the answer!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_130_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんは、トーナちゃんのご機嫌取りをしたいの～？<br/>な～んて、ウソウソ。ありがたくいただくね！|text_cn=这也是在讨人欢心吗？开玩笑的，我收下了，谢谢你！|trans_en=Boss, are you trying to get on my good side?<br/>Just kidding! I'll gladly take it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_130_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウルトラハイパー可愛いトーナにプレゼント！？<br/>なら私からは…ハートをプレゼント！にははっ、うれしいでしょ？|text_cn=是给无敌可爱的多娜特地准备的吗？嘿嘿~比个心！|trans_en=A present for ultra hyper cute Donna!?<br/>Then from me... I'll give you my full heart! Nyahaha, does that make you happy?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_130_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…これ、ほんとにくれるの？もちろんすっごくうれしいよ！<br/>むしろ嬉しすぎて…にはは、うまく言葉が出てこなくて|text_cn=这个礼物真的是给我的吗？不、不是，没有不喜欢，我……我太开心了不知道要说什么了！|trans_en=Um... Are you really giving this to me? Of course, I'm extremely happy!<br/>In fact, I'm too happy... Nyahaha, the words won't come out right.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_130_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん！|text_cn=没错！|trans_en=Yup!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_130_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=違う違う|text_cn=不对不对。|trans_en=No, no, no!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_130_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれー？|text_cn=咦？|trans_en=Whaa?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_130_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなぁ|text_cn=为什么呢？|trans_en=Nooo...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_130_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=こっち見ないで…|text_cn=你不要看我……|trans_en=Don't look at me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_130_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=やったぁ！|text_cn=好耶！|trans_en=Yay!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_130_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=怒るよ？|text_cn=多娜要生气了！|trans_en=I'm gonna get mad, you know?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_130_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=にはははっ☆|text_cn=开心~|trans_en=Nyahaha ☆}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_130_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=哎……|trans_en=(sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_130_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=手紙のお届けなら、私にお任せ☆|text_cn=寄信可以找我哦~|trans_en=I'll deliver your letters!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_130_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヤッバ…また迷子になっちゃった☆|text_cn=啊，又迷路了。|trans_en=Oh no... I got lost again.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_130_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=なになに、トーナちゃんが可愛いって？|text_cn=你说我可爱？|trans_en=Hmm? Did I hear someone say Donna is cute?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_130_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=仕事の時間だよー！|text_cn=现在是送信时间！|trans_en=It's work time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_130_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_130_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかしてサボり？|text_cn=难道说……你在偷懒？|trans_en=You slacking off?}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_130_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたのハートを射抜いちゃうぞっ☆なんちゃって～♪|text_cn=爱神之箭——骗你的~|trans_en=I'm gonna shoot straight through your heart. Just kidding! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_130_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日の天気は～…矢の雨だよ～♪|text_cn=今天的天气，局部有箭雨~|trans_en=Today's forecast is an arrow storm! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_130_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=早く、帰らなきゃ…|text_cn=我还得回去……|trans_en=I have to get back ... fast...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_130_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=手紙は無事だね…|text_cn=还好……信件没事……|trans_en=The letters are safe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_130_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ～お！なにこれすごいじゃん！|text_cn=让我看看……好像很厉害嘛~|trans_en=Wow! What's this? It's amazing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_130_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふっふっふ♪強くて可愛いトーナちゃんを、とくとご覧あれ！|text_cn=这下多娜岂不是又强又可爱？|trans_en=Heh heh ♪ Get ready to witness the strong and adorable Donna!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_130_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ～ん♪どんな小さい的でも百発百中！|text_cn=哼哼，我的命中率，会吓你一跳~|trans_en=Hm hm ♪ I never miss no matter how small the target!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_130_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=にはは～♪この弓は、ただの飾りじゃないんだなぁ～|text_cn=哼哼~这把弓可不是什么摆设哦~|trans_en=Nyahaha ♪ This bow is not just a decoration.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_130_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私はいつだってみんなと一緒だよ♪|text_cn=我会一直陪着大家的~|trans_en=I'm with all of you, no matter what ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_130_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい感じの生地があったら、新しい服を作りたいな！|text_cn=如果找到了可爱的布料，就拿来做新衣服吧！|trans_en=I'd love to make a new outfit with some nice fabric!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_130_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえ魔王さん。もし塔の中で手紙を見つけたら、私のところまで持ってきてくれないかな？<br/>巡遊者が落としたものなら、届けてあげないと|text_cn=<username>，等下如果在塔里看到了信件的话，记得帮我收集起来喔。那可能是某个旅人遗失的，很重要的东西。|trans_en=Hey, Boss! Bring me any letters you find in the Monolith.<br/>If a Trekker dropped them, I have to deliver them!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_130_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=もし星ノ塔の中まで営業範囲を広げたら…<br/>星骸って、ちゃんと報酬くれると思う？な～んてね☆|text_cn=如果想把万送屋的业务拓展到星塔里，嗯……星骸会支付报酬吗？|trans_en=If we expand business into the Monolith...<br/>Do you think the Stellaroids will pay us? Just kidding ☆}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_130_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヤバ、今月も赤字…<br/>で、でも大丈夫！次の依頼でドカンと稼ぐ予定だから！|text_cn=这个月万送屋的开销又又又超支了……没关系，这次赚回来！|trans_en=Oh no, this month is in the red too...<br/>B-But it's okay! We'll make a bunch of money on the next commission!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_130_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=前にも言ったよね？<br/>私、予定が狂うのってあんまり好きじゃないの。そのためのスケジュールなんだし|text_cn=多娜不喜欢被打乱计划，要乖乖按照计划好的来哦~|trans_en=I said it before, right?<br/>I don't really like it when plans get derailed. That's what the schedule is for.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_130_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨロズ配達の一員として、どんな困難も乗り越えてみせる！|text_cn=身为万送屋的信使，再大的困难我也能克服。|trans_en=As a member of Post Haste, I'll overcome any challenge that comes my way!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_130_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この塔からは、どんな神器が手に入るかな？<br/>せっかくなら、たくさんのリボンでデコった３人乗りの自転車とかいいよね～♪|text_cn=多娜想找到可爱的代步工具，比如绑着缎带的三人自行车~|trans_en=I wonder what Artifacts we can get in this Monolith.<br/>While we're at it, a three-person bike decorated with lots of ribbons would be great ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_130_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=買い物、買い物～♪可愛い雑貨とかないかな～|text_cn=来采购啦~让我看看有什么可爱的东西~|trans_en=Shopping time! ♪ Any cute trinkets around?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_130_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ～……疲れたぁ。ちょっとお昼寝してかない？|text_cn=好累啊——小睡一觉好了。|trans_en=Yaaawn... I'm so tired. How about a little nap?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_130_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はここでチラシ配りしよっか？|text_cn=要不要在这里发点传单？|trans_en=How about handing out some fliers here today?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_130_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=がんばった分、ちょっとでいいから報酬おまけしてほしいな～？|text_cn=多娜表现得这么好，这次报酬就多给点嘛！|trans_en=I worked so hard, so I'd like a little extra reward for my effort~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_130_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=順調順調♪いい感じだね|text_cn=没有意外，一切正常~|trans_en=Smooth sailing! Everything's going great!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_130_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=にはは♪ねぇねぇ、戦ってるトーナちゃんも可愛いでしょ？|text_cn=多娜战斗的样子，很可爱吧？|trans_en=Nyahaha ♪ Hey, hey, I'm cute when I fight, too. Right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_130_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=良いものが手に入ったらいいな～|text_cn=让我看看这次又有什么好东西~|trans_en=I hope we got something good.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_130_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=イエーイ☆みんな、祝杯の準備はいーい？|text_cn=可以喝点什么庆祝一下吧？|trans_en=Yaaay ☆ Is everyone ready to celebrate?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_130_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そ、そんなぁ……|text_cn=怎么会这样……|trans_en=N-No way...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_130_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あはは……失敗失敗……|text_cn=啊哈哈，失败啦……|trans_en=Ahaha... A major fail...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_130_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=配達なら、私たちプロにおまかせあれっ！|text_cn=送信我们可是专业的！|trans_en=For deliveries, leave it to us pros!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_130_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=にはは♪手伝いに来たよ～|text_cn=呀~我来帮忙啦~|trans_en=Nyahaha ♪ I'm here to help~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_130_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=配達エリアはどこかな？|text_cn=这次又要去哪里送信？|trans_en=What's the delivery area?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_130_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨロズ配達ぅ～…しゅっぱぁ～～つ！|text_cn=万送屋信使，出发~|trans_en=Post Haste, rolling out!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_130_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター！|text_cn=YOSTAR！|trans_en=Yostar!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_130_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ハッピーバレンタイーン！いつもお世話になってる魔王さんに、手作りチョコを作ってみたんだー<br/>ちなみにコレ、トーナちゃん特製の隠し味が入ってるんだけど…魔王さんはわかるかな？<br/>にははっ☆変なものじゃないから、心配しないで食べてみて！|text_cn=这个是送给你的~嗯？没错是多娜亲手做的情人节的巧克力哦！你的这份可是特别“加料”过的~<br/>啊啊不是什么奇怪的东西啦！你自己尝尝就知道了！|trans_en=Happy Lovers' Day! I made homemade chocolate for you, who always takes care of me ♪<br/>By the way, this has a secret ingredient made specially by me... Can you guess what it is?<br/>Nyahaha ☆ It's nothing weird, so don't worry and try it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_130_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=働き者だし頼りになるし、しかもかわいいヨロズ配達のマスコット的な存在！<br/>そんなトーナちゃんへのクリスマスプレゼントはどこかなー？<br/>なーんてね！はいコレ、魔王さんへのプレゼントだよ！ほらほら、遠慮しないで開けてみて☆|text_cn=可爱勤劳可靠的多娜的雪愿节礼物在哪呢~是不是在你这里呀~<br/>哎呀，难道没有吗？嘿嘿，没有也没关系，聪明勇敢的<username>的礼物在这里！|trans_en=She's hardworking, reliable, and on top of that, like a cute Post Haste mascot!<br/>Where's the Snowish present for such a perfect Donna?<br/>Just kidding! Here, this is a present for you, Tyrant! Come on, don't be shy, open it ☆}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_130_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=クラッカー発射！バーン！にはは、あけましておめでとう☆<br/>どうどう？このクラッカーきれいだったでしょ？<br/>というわけで、今年も一年ヨロズ配達をよろしくね〜！|text_cn=邦——！新年快乐！怎么样？这个礼花是不是很漂亮？<br/>新的一年也要继续照顾我们万送屋的生意哦~|trans_en=Cracker launch! Bang! Nyahaha, happy New Year ☆<br/>How was it? That cracker was pretty, right?<br/>With that, please continue to support Post Haste this year, too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_130_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほらほら魔王さん。隠してるつもりかもしれないけど、こっちからは丸見えだよ？<br/>それってトーナへの誕生日…あれ？てっきりプレゼントかと思ったんだけど…空の紙袋？<br/>え？本物は後ろにある？わっ、ソーイングセットだぁ！<br/>にはは、すっかり騙されたよ。ありがとう、魔王さん！|text_cn=嗯哼？你在偷偷摸摸藏什么东西？我看到啦再藏也没有用咯——！<br/>哎？你说这是障眼法，现在转身？……骗人？这是给我的生日礼物？呜啊……|trans_en=Hey, hey, Tyrant. You might think you're hiding it, but I can completely see it from here.<br/>Is that for my birthday... Huh? I thought for sure it was a present... an empty paper bag?<br/>Ehh? The real one is in the back? Wah, a sewing set!<br/>Nyahaha, I was totally fooled. Thanks, Tyrant!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_130_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_130_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん魔王さん！さっきね、めちゃめちゃかわいい女の子に、これを届けてって頼まれたんだ<br/>それから伝言も預かってて…『お誕生日おめでとう！私の手作りケーキ、味わって食べてね！』<br/>だって。ほらほら、食べてみて！きっとその子も、魔王さんの感想を待ってるだろうしね♪|text_cn=<username>~刚刚有超级无敌可爱的女孩子委托我给你送个包裹，还让捎句话给你，她说……<br/>祝你生日快乐！快看，这是我给你选的蛋糕~|trans_en=Tyrant, Tyrant! Earlier, a super cute girl asked me to deliver this to you.<br/>She also left a message... "Happy birthday! Please enjoy my homemade cake!"<br/>That's what she said. Hey, hey, try it! I'm sure that girl is looking forward to your reaction ♪}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_132_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほら、気合い入れてけ。出発すんぞ|text_cn=喂，打起精神来，我们要出发了。|trans_en=C'mon, look alive! We're headin' out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_132_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=よぉボス、今日もいい日になりそうだな。ん、いつも同じこと言ってるって？<br/>へへっ、そりゃあ今の環境を楽しむのも、悲観するのも、結局は自分の気持ち次第だからな|text_cn=魔王，今天的天气不错啊。<br/>嗯？我每天都这么说吗？<br/>灰风每天都要出门工作，既然不能改变，不如每天都是“天气不错”。|trans_en=Hey-ho, Boss. Looks like it's gonna be another great day. <br/>... What that's? I say that all the time? <br/>Yeah, well, sure. Glass half full or half empty—it's all in your head anyway, right? Might as well go the positivity route.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_132_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよーっす。そういや昨夜は眠れたか？夜中までスケボーの音がうるさかったろ？|text_cn=早啊，魔王，昨晚滑板动静有点大，没吵到你睡觉吧。|trans_en=Moooornin'! The noise didn't keep you up last night, did it? <br/>I was trying to nail down some new skateboard tricks and I kinda lost track of time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_132_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪いボス、ちょっくら寝てくるわ昼休みが終わったら起こしてくれ|text_cn=魔王，我去睡一会，午休结束记得叫我。|trans_en=Sorry, Boss. I gotta get some shuteye. Wake me up when lunch break's over.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_132_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=水道橋から見る夜景って、なんか落ち着くんだよな<br/>そうだボス、これから見に行かねぇか？あたしのスケボーに乗ってさ|text_cn=水道桥上的夜景，总是令人安心。<br/>魔王，要一起去兜风吗？|trans_en=The view of the Waterway at night is so relaxin', y'know? <br/>Say, Boss? What say we cruise down on my 'board and take a look?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_132_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=力を持たないヤツらを守るため、誰よりも強くならねぇと…！|text_cn=想保护弱者，就要比强者更强。|trans_en=I gotta get stronger than everyone so I can protect the powerless!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_132_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=テメェの頭なんざ、バットを汚す価値もねぇんだよ！くくっ…どうだ、ビビったか？|text_cn=你的头，配不上我的球棒。嘿嘿，怎么样，有没有被吓到？|trans_en=Your head ain't worth gettin' my bat all dirty! Hehehe... Did I just freak you out?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_132_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ま、漫画のことは…二人だけの秘密にしといてくれ<br/>なんなら血判でも…や、今のは冗談だけど|text_cn=漫画的事......就当做是我们之间的秘密吧。<br/>要不要滴血立誓？<br/>开玩笑的。|trans_en=L-Listen... About the comics thing. Can we make that our little secret? <br/>Maybe sign a blood pact to seal the deal? <br/>... Okay, that last bit was a joke.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_132_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=漫画の主人公みたいで…二重生活も悪くありませんよ|text_cn=两种身份的生活也不错，就像……漫画主角一样。|trans_en=Having a double life like the hero in a comic ... is actually kind of cool.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_132_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ハハッ！水くさいこと言うなってあたしたちとボスの仲じゃねぇか！|text_cn=魔王，别和我客气。灰风受了你那么多关照，你的事就是我们的事。|trans_en=Haha! Boss, c'mon! Lighten up—no need to be all stiff an' formal with me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_132_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=スケボー乗りにとって最高の瞬間？そりゃあ高い場所から飛び降る時だろ<br/>いつか塔のテッペンから、一気に駆け降りてみたいぜ|text_cn=我最喜欢从高处飞下去的感觉。总有一天，我会从星塔顶端一路滑下来。|trans_en=The best moment when ridin' a skateboard? <br/>Well, that'd be comin' down from somewhere real high, of course. I'd love to ride down from the top of a Monolith sometime.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_132_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=チビどものテストの採点してたらいつの間にか朝になっててさ<br/>あたしとしたことが、ボーッとして<br/>『二次関数』を『二段加速！』って叫びそうになっちまって<br/>…っておい！なに笑ってんだよ！|text_cn=昨晚改试卷改到三点，结果今天上课的时候差点把“二次函数”说成“二段加速”……<br/>喂，不准笑！|trans_en=I was grading the kids’ tests last night, and before I knew it, it was morning. <br/>Weesh. I think it gave me a brain fever—I couldn't stop reading "quadratic function" as "aquatic luncheon"!…<br/>Hey! What’s so funny?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_132_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=見てくれよ！ついに『幻影爆弾騎士』の最新巻が出たんだ！<br/>あ～…つーわけで、ちょっと見張りを頼むな|text_cn=《幻影炸弹骑士》最新卷到手了！咳……可以帮我把风吗……|trans_en=Check it out! I finally got my hands on the latest volume of the Phantom Bomb Rider!<br/>Sooo, yeah. Gonna be busy for spell. So ... take my lookout shift for me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_132_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=最近また目が悪くなった気がするな…<br/>けどガン飛ばしたら前より迫力があるってメンバーに言われたし…逆にいいこと、なのか…？|text_cn=最近感觉近视程度又加深了……但其他成员都说，我的眼神更犀利了。<br/>也算是件……好事吧？|trans_en=Feels like my eyes have gotten even worse lately. But the girls said I look more intimidating when I glare. <br/>So ... maybe that's actually a good thing?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_132_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=なあボス、スケボーしに行かねぇか？んなビビんなくても、怖くねぇって<br/>橋の上の風なんか、めちゃくちゃ気持ちいいんだぜ？ほら、早くこいよ|text_cn=魔王，和我一起去飙滑板吧？不用紧张，这又不是什么可怕的运动。<br/>而且桥上的风可是很舒服的。好啦，赶紧出发吧。|trans_en=Hey, Boss, wanna go 'boarding? C'mon, don't chicken out on me. It ain't scary.<br/>The wind feels great when you're grindin' down from the top of a suspension bridge. So let's go already!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_132_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アッシュエリアじゃ、ナメられた時点で終わりなのさ<br/>けどな、んなことよりも自分を曲げず、仲間を大切にする方がよっぽど重要なんだ|text_cn=在灰城区，不会打架是站不住脚的，但比打架更重要的……<br/>是我们的初心，是身边的同伴。|trans_en=In the Ash District, if someone doesn't take you seriously, it's all over. <br/>But, y'know what? It's way more important to cherish your pals than tryin' to pretend you're something you're not.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_132_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしはウィンドアッシュの総長だからさ<br/>あいつらの前では、いつだって堂々としてなきゃいけねーんだよ。でも…<br/>ボスの前でなら、ちょっとくらい素を出してもいいのかもな|text_cn=很多时候，我得装成另一副模样，不这样做的话，就没法撑起灰风老大的气势。<br/>但在你面前，自然一点也挺好的。|trans_en=With me being the head honcho of the Ashwind, I've got to play it cool in front of the gang, y'know?<br/>Buuut... I don't mind letting my guard down around you, Boss.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_132_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんなヤツでも教育を受けることができて、みんなが楽しく過ごせる街を作りたい<br/>そのためにも…ボス、手を貸してくれねぇか？|text_cn=我希望创造一个人人都能读书，人人都能过得开心的街区。<br/>来帮我吧，魔王。|trans_en=Just 'bout everyone wants to live in a district where you can have fun and get a proper education.<br/>So Boss ... could you help me make that a reality?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_132_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、スケボーしに行こうぜー！<br/>おっいいね、乗り気じゃんか。なら今日は、新しい技を教えてやんよ<br/>んで、練習してもっと上手くなったら、いろんなとこに風とスピードを感じに行こうぜ|text_cn=魔王，一起去玩滑板吧！<br/>嗯，这次答应的很爽快嘛。那今天我就教你一个新技巧吧。<br/>等你熟练了，我们就能一起去更多的地方，去享受风和速度。|trans_en=Boss, let's go shreddin'! <br/>You're rarin' to go, I know it! <br/>I'll teach you some new tricks, and if you practice enough, <br/>I'll take you to places where we can feel the wind on our faces at supersonic speeds!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_132_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウィンドアッシュ…いや、ボスと一緒に思い描いた夢を守るため、あたしは力をつけてきたんだ<br/>だからさ、きっといつか…あたしたちの手で、アッシュエリアに新しい風を吹かそうぜ！|text_cn=我一直都在努力变得更强，不只是为了灰风，也是为了守护你和我们共同的梦想。<br/>魔王，有你在，我相信终有一天，风会席卷灰城区，吹散这片阴霾。|trans_en=See, Boss, the Ashwind Clan's got a dream, y'know? ... Well, actually, it's yours and mine now, too.<br/>In any case, I've been working on getting stronger,<br/>so one day we can whip up a storm in Ash District and make the place something to be proud of again!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_132_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=試験の問題数、もう少しくらい多い方がいいかもしれませんね…<br/>アヤメに頼んで作ってもらいましょうか|text_cn=试卷不够用了啊……下次得把鸢尾请过来，帮我多出几套题。|trans_en=Maybe we should up the number of problems in the exam... I'll ask Iris to handle it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_132_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ネールモントは、将来機械整備士になりてぇんだとよ<br/>そしたら、それを聞いたフォルモントは、消防士になりてぇとか言い出してな|text_cn=新月的梦想是成为一名机械师。<br/>满月听了后，把自己的梦想改成“消防员”了。|trans_en=Neuvira said she wants to be a mechanic someday. <br/>When Vollara heard that, she said something about wanting to be a firefighter.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_132_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=帝国護衛隊も、悪いヤツばっかじゃねぇ<br/>あの金髪の従騎士なんか、組織同士のいざこざは気にしないで、あたしらに協力してくれたしな|text_cn=帝国卫队里也有好人，比如那个金发的侍从。<br/>骑术很棒，还不计前嫌帮我们解过围。|trans_en=The Imperial Guard ain't all bad guys. <br/>After all, that blonde squire helped us out, even though we're supposed to be rivals and everythin'.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_132_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=アッシュエリアの孤児院は、エレーって人がひとりで切り盛りしてたみたいでさ<br/>なんでも常勝無敗の『地獄の料理人』って通り名で有名だったらしい|text_cn=听说灰城孤儿院曾经的大姐头，艾蕾阿姨，是个战无不胜，威名赫赫的绝世高手。<br/>有着“地狱料理人”这种恐怖的头衔……|trans_en=The old Ash District orphanage was run singlehanded by someone called Allie.<br/>Apparently, people knew her as the indomitable Cook from Hell. Not sure if they called her that to her face, though.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_132_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=一番好きなレストラン？<br/>そりゃあもちろんウィンドアッシュ御用達、安い、美味い、鳳凰炒飯だろ！|text_cn=最喜欢的餐厅？<br/>当然是灰风俱乐部的指定聚餐地——便宜好吃的凤凰炒蛋！|trans_en=My favorite restaurant? <br/>Well, that'd be the Ashwind Clan's very own cheap and tasty Fenghuang Diner, obviously!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_132_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おいテメェ、コラ、ケンカ売ってんのか？|text_cn=嘿，你这家伙想打架吗？|trans_en=Hey, punk. You lookin' for a fight?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_132_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ～ギブギブ！もうボスの勝ちでいいよ|text_cn=好啦，魔王，我打不过你，认输认输！|trans_en=Ah, I give up! Uncle, uncle! You win this one, Boss!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_132_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=次の冒険に行かれるんですか？戻ったらお話を聞かせてくださいね|text_cn=开始新的冒险了吗？那等你回来后，跟我说说新的冒险故事吧。|trans_en=Goin' on a new adventure? Tell me all about it when you get back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_132_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=お、おい。そんなにジロジロ見んなっての…暇なら、身体でも鍛えてろ|text_cn=别一直盯着我看啊，魔王。有空的话，不如去锻炼一下身体。|trans_en=H-Hey, don't stare at me like that... If you've got a time on your hands, then go work out or somethin'.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_132_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このあたしを呼び出して、無言でガン飛ばすとは…<br/>いい度胸してんじゃねぇか？いいぜ、付き合ってやんよ|text_cn=叫我出来又不说话，只是看着，这是什么新的决斗方式吗？<br/>真没办法，就陪你一次吧。|trans_en=You called me here just to glare at me in silence, huh...? Well, you've got guts, I'll give you that.<br/>Fine, a starin' contest it is!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_132_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初めての共闘でも心配はいらねぇウィンドアッシュはお前の味方だ|text_cn=魔王，第一次正式合作，灰风不会辜负你的期望。|trans_en=You don't hafta worry about fightin' when you're with me. The Ashwind Clan's got your back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_132_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よっ、久しぶりだな。なんか前より話しやすくなったんじゃねぇか？|text_cn=魔王，又见面了，我们的默契又多了一些。|trans_en=Yo, it's been a while. Is it just me or has it gotten easier to chat recently?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_132_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ははっ、バットが軽くなった気がするぜ|text_cn=球棒挥起来更轻松了。|trans_en=Haha. Feels like my bat's gotten lighter.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_132_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今ならどんな球でもホームランにできそうだぜ。へへっ、見せてやろうか？|text_cn=现在的我，能百分百全垒打。魔王，要不要现在就展示给你看看？|trans_en=Feels like I could hit a home run with anything now. Want me to show you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_132_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとな。この記憶を見つけてくれて<br/>あたしにとっては、すごく…大事なものだったんだ|text_cn=谢谢你帮我找回丢失的记忆，这些记忆……对我非常重要。|trans_en=Thanks for findin' this memory.<br/>It was ... really important to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_132_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=へぇ、いい曲じゃねぇか|text_cn=我喜欢这段旋律。|trans_en=Heh. Now this is a cool groove.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_132_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さ、行こうぜ。大丈夫だって。仲間といりゃあ、何も怖くねぇから|text_cn=只要和伙伴在一起就没什么好怕的。魔王，我们一起前进吧。|trans_en=C'mon, let's go. I'm tellin' you we'll be fine. There's nothing to fear as long as we're together.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_132_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ひ、人のことばっか見てねぇで…気になるなら、お前もこっちに来て読めばいいだろ？|text_cn=别光看我啊……你也坐过来挑本漫画看吧。会很开心的。|trans_en=S-Stop staring at me... If you're that curious, why don't you come over here and read with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_132_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なあボス、一緒にトレーニングしようぜ<br/>冒険ってのは、体力勝負だからなじゃなきゃ旅の途中でバテちまうしよ|text_cn=魔王，要不要一起锻炼身体，旅人要长途跋涉，有个好身体很重要哦。|trans_en=Hey, Boss, let's go train. <br/>Adventures are tests of strength, after all. If we don't prep, we'll be dead on our feet before we've barely started.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_132_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=世の中物騒だからな。危険な目に遭いそうな時は、迷わずあたしに連絡しな<br/>ウィンドアッシュが力になってやる|text_cn=在外面要注意保护自己。不行的话就来找我们，我和灰风就是你最强的后盾。|trans_en=It's a tough world out there. If you're ever in danger, don't hesitate to holler for help. The Ashwind Clan'll come running.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_132_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスが星ノ塔から持ってきた本には、マジで助けられたぜ。この恩は一生忘れねえ<br/>つーわけで、いつかもし助けが必要になったときは、真っ先にあたしを呼びな<br/>どこにいたって飛んでいくからよっ！|text_cn=魔王，谢谢你从星塔带回来的书，这份恩情……嗯？不需要我报恩？那我把灰风二把手的位置给你吧，认真的。|trans_en=That book you brought back from the Monolith seriously saved my bacon. I’ll never forget this debt. <br/>So remember this, okay? If you ever—and I mean EVER—need help, you call me first, 'kay? 'Cos I'll come flyin'!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_132_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボスが旅先から送ってくれた手紙を読むと、なんだか一緒に旅をしている気分になります<br/>でも機会があるなら…やっぱりあなたと、本物の旅をしてみたいですね|text_cn=拿着你从远方寄来的信，读着那些文字，感觉就好像和你一起在纸上旅行……<br/>但有机会的话，还挺想和你一起来一场真正的旅行。|trans_en=The letters you send back from your travels make me feel like I'm on the road, too.<br/>But frankly ... it'd be ten times better if I actually WAS out there with you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_132_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=へえ、悪くねぇな。サンキュー|text_cn=这东西不错，谢啦。|trans_en=Whoa, not bad. Thanks!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_132_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいじゃねぇか。コイツが好きなんだよ|text_cn=挺上道的嘛。我就喜欢这个。|trans_en=Sweet. I really like this.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_132_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんな貴重なモンをためらいもせずに…！？その器のデカさ…感服だ|text_cn=这么贵重的东西，竟然毫不犹豫就拿出来了。<br/>魔王，你这份气度……我心悦诚服。|trans_en=Wowzers! Now this is something special. <br/>I've never had a gift like this before...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_132_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=ああ|text_cn=嗯。|trans_en=Yeah.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_132_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメだ|text_cn=不行。|trans_en=Nah.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_132_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=ぁん？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=What?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_132_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんだと？|text_cn=你说什么？|trans_en=What'd you just say?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_132_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん…|text_cn=嗯……|trans_en=Mm...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_132_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=素敵です！|text_cn=好棒。|trans_en=Fantastic!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_132_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=失せろ|text_cn=滚。|trans_en=Get lost.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_132_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=よくやった！|text_cn=干得不错！|trans_en=Great job!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_132_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉。|trans_en=(sigh)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_132_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=任せろ！|text_cn=交给我。|trans_en=Leave it to me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_132_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=行け！|text_cn=上吧！|trans_en=Go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_132_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ケンカはいけません|text_cn=不要吵架。|trans_en=Don't pick fights!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_132_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=なるほどな|text_cn=原来如此。|trans_en=I see.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_132_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_132_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=夜露死苦ぅ！|text_cn=有何见教！|trans_en=Stay wild!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_132_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さぁて――タイマンと乱闘、どっちがお好みだぁ？|text_cn=我给你个机会，单挑还是群殴？|trans_en=So, what'll it be? One-on-one or a brawl fest?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_132_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=言い訳は後で聞く。歯ぁ食いしばれぇ！|text_cn=有什么废话，等你躺下了再说。|trans_en=Save your excuses for later. Right now, prepare for pain!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_132_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お前ら…後は頼んだぞ…|text_cn=后面的事……就交给你们了。|trans_en=Sorry guys... The rest's in your hands...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_132_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アッシュエリアの風は…止まねぇぞ…|text_cn=灰城区的风，不会停下来。|trans_en=The Ash District dream ... doesn't end with me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_132_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヘヘッ、イカしてんじゃねぇか|text_cn=挺帅的嘛。|trans_en=Yeah! This is frickin' awesome!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_132_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=カッケー技なら強ぇえに決まってんだろ！|text_cn=酷，这招一定很强。|trans_en=Well, obviously super-cool techniques are gonna be insanely strong!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_132_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=っしゃあ、燃えてきたぜ！|text_cn=很好，燃起来了。|trans_en=Aw yeah! I'm gettin' pumped!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_132_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=心配すんなって。あたしが面倒見てやるからさ|text_cn=没问题，我罩着你。|trans_en=You just chill, okay. I'm gonna take care of you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_132_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これで強くなれんのか？んじゃ、さっさと試してみようぜ|text_cn=它能让我更强？那就试试吧。|trans_en=This'll make me stronger, huh? Okay, I'll give it a shot.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_132_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは…スケボーの練習にはもってこいの場所だな|text_cn=这地方，拿来当滑板训练场的话，感觉还挺不错的。|trans_en=This place ... is the perfect spot for shreddin'!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_132_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この世界で成り上がるには、教養を身につけつつ、想像力を磨くことが重要です|text_cn=想要在这个世道上混得成功，不仅需要磨炼自己的身心，更重要的是，永远保持想象力。|trans_en=If you want to get ahead in this world, you have to cultivate your imagination while getting an education, too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_132_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=オラ気合い入れろ！そんなんじゃ勝てるケンカも勝てねぇぞ！|text_cn=都打起精神来！不然能打赢的架都打不赢了！|trans_en=Get your head in the game! If you don't shape up, you'll lose battles you coulda won!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_132_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=メガネは必要ありません。戦い方は身体が覚えていますから|text_cn=不戴眼镜也没问题，我更习惯凭感觉战斗。|trans_en=I don't need glasses. My body knows how to fight, all on its own.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_132_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの、ボス？シャロを捕まえてもいいですか？実は今、モデルが必要で…|text_cn=魔王，能把夏洛克抓来看看吗？我想画个企鹅主题的滑板。|trans_en=Hey, Boss? Okay with you if I catch Sherlock? Thing is, I need a model right now, so...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_132_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここに次の巻がありゃいいんだが…あ、いや、漫画の話じゃねぇぞ！？<br/>今のは新しい参考書の話だからな…！|text_cn=要是能找到下一卷就好了……啊，我不是在说漫画，只是想找点新的参考书。|trans_en=Would be cool if the latest volume's in, but—Say what? Nah, I'm not talking comics. I mean the latest textbook!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_132_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初めての星ノ塔で迷うのは、恥ずかしいことじゃねぇ<br/>だが人生って道には、絶対迷うんじゃねぇぞ？|text_cn=在没有探索过的星塔里，迷路很正常。<br/>但在人生道路上，千万不要迷失方向。|trans_en=No shame getting lost in a new Monolith. <br/>But getting lost in life is whole other dealio!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_132_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=買い物か。ならあたしは…棒付きキャンディー、ひとつもらえるか？|text_cn=买东西？那就来根棒棒糖吧。|trans_en=Shopping, huh? Alright, I'm in. But only if I get a lollipop, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_132_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=冒険ってのは体力勝負だ。長く続けてぇなら、休める時にはしっかり休んどけ|text_cn=冒险是一场耐力赛，适当的休息能让我们走得更远。|trans_en=On an adventure, you've gotta play the long game. Which means taking a break when you need to.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_132_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=へぇ？なかなかいい場所じゃねぇか|text_cn=有点意思。|trans_en=Woah. This place is groovy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_132_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は調子がいいみてぇだ|text_cn=气势不错。|trans_en=Oh yeah. I'm in tip-top shape today.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_132_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=連勝街道まっしぐらだぜ！|text_cn=就这样一路赢下去吧。|trans_en=Goin' full throttle down the highway of consecutive V's!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_132_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう終わりかよ、根性なしどもが|text_cn=也太不经打了。|trans_en=Over already? Buncha wimps!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_132_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=勝利の味は格別だぜ|text_cn=胜利的味道会让人上瘾。|trans_en=The taste of victory's somethin' else.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_132_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ったく、雑魚ばっかだなぁおい…|text_cn=无聊，一个能打的都没有。|trans_en=Jeez, nothin' but weaklings...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_132_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=必ず勝てるケンカなんざねぇからな|text_cn=世上没有必胜的比赛。|trans_en=Ain't no such thing as a fight you're guaranteed to win.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_132_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ま、気にすんな。スパイシーロリポップでも食うか？|text_cn=别灰心，要不要来根辣味棒棒糖？|trans_en=Eh, don't sweat it. Want a spicy lollipop?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_132_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さぁて、今回の相手はどいつだ？|text_cn=魔王，这次要修理谁？|trans_en=Alright, who's the opponent this time?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_132_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヘヘッ。まとめてかかってきな|text_cn=一起上吧。|trans_en=Yeah? So you're all gonna take me on, eh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_132_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=カチコミなら任せときな|text_cn=打架？去哪？|trans_en=Leave the scraps to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_132_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=露払いなら任せとけ|text_cn=我会冲在最前面。|trans_en=I'll clear the way for you.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_132_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_132_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=手作りチョコねぇ？<br/>わざわざ溶かして形を作り直すとか、あたしにゃまるで理解できねーけど<br/>だって普通に考えりゃ、形よりもダンゼン量だろ<br/>つーわけで、袋いっぱいチョコを詰めて、車の前に置いといたぜ。遠慮しないで食べてくれよな|text_cn=好麻烦的节日，干嘛要把好好的巧克力融化了再重新凝固啊。<br/>总、总之，只要送的够多，外形就不重要了。去家门口看看吧，我给你放了足够吃一年的巧克力。|trans_en=Handmade chocolates, huh? <br/>Y'know, I never got the deal with that fussin' and makin' cute shapes and sprinklin' sprinkles and all that jazz.<br/>I mean, c'mon—quantity beats fancy looks any day, right?<br/>So yeah, I stuffed a sack full of chocolate and left it in front of your car. Bon appetit!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_132_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なあボス！一緒に雪合戦しようぜ！<br/>ウィンドアッシュのチビたちも、お前が来るのを楽しみにしてるんだよ<br/>ハハｯ！そう心配すんなって。なにも動く的にしようだなんて考えてねーからさ|text_cn=魔王，来跟我们一起打雪仗吧！灰风的孩子们都在等你来。<br/>哈哈，别担心，我们可没特别为你准备一万个雪球。|trans_en=Hey, Boss! Come to our snowball fight, 'kay? The Ashwind kids are expecting an epic battle, so you can't let 'em down.<br/>Haha! Don't look so scared—it's not like we're gonna use you as a moving target for trainin' or anything...}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_132_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よっ、ボス。あけおめ。今年も一緒に、たちの悪いカンパニーだったり<br/>星骸だったり、思いっきりぶっ飛ばしにいこうぜ！|text_cn=魔王，新年快乐。接下来的日子我们也会并肩作战。新的一年，我们继续把糟糕的公司和星骸都打飞吧。|trans_en=Hey-ho, Boss. Happy New Year an' all that. <br/>Let’s make this a full-on year of takin' down evil megacorps and kickin' Stellaroid butt!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_132_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日プレゼント、たしかに受け取ったぜ。ありがとな<br/>あ…ただ、気持ちは嬉しいんだけどさ<br/>できれば次からは、中身が見えないようにして置いといてくれないか？<br/>少女漫画は…さすがに恥ずい|text_cn=魔王，谢谢你的生日礼物，果然还是你懂我。<br/>就是......下次不要把装着少女漫画的盒子直接放在门口，被人发现我就完了。这件事就当做我们之间的秘密吧。|trans_en=Got the b-day present, thanks. 'Preciate the gesture and all that.<br/>But, er, next time ... maybe wrap it up so half of Ash District can't see that someone's given me a bunch for girlie comic books?<br/>It was kinda embarrassin'...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_132_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_132_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボス、誕生日おめでとう。プレゼントに、あたしのと同じバットを持ってきたぜ<br/>ガシガシ使ってくれよな！…ん？重すぎて振れない？<br/>だったら肩にでも担いどきな。いまより多少はボスらしさが出るだろ|text_cn=生日快乐，魔王，我给你做了根球棒，打起人来超顺手。<br/>哎，你说挥不动？那就扛在肩上吧，做魔王的，气势一定要到位。|trans_en=Happy birthday, Boss. Guess what? I got you a bat just like mine! Feel free to swing away whenever you're in the mood.<br/>... What's that? Yeah, I guess it is kinda heavy. <br/>Well, you can always just sling it over your shoulder and march around, right? It might even make you look like a real Boss.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_133_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=来てくれたのね、会えてうれしいわ|text_cn=很高兴今天也能见到你，伙伴。|trans_en=Oh, you're here. I'm glad to see you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_133_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんにちは、調子はどう？|text_cn=你来了，今天心情如何？|trans_en=Hello. How are you doing?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_133_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=爽やかな朝の風、気持ちいいわね|text_cn=起得真早啊，你也觉得早上的风很舒服吧？|trans_en=The fresh morning breeze feels so nice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_133_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お昼はもう食べた？よかったら一緒にどう？|text_cn=吃过午饭了吗？……没有的话，要不要和我一起？|trans_en=Have you had lunch? How about going together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_133_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そろそろ休んだら？体調管理も巡遊者の仕事のうちよ|text_cn=早点休息，健康的体魄是展开一切事业的基础。|trans_en=Why not take a break? Proper rest is also part of a Trekker's job.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_133_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ…どうしてかしら？あなたがそばにいるだけで、不思議と安心するの|text_cn=看到你在我身边，总觉得很安心。|trans_en=Hehe... I wonder why... I just feel so relaxed around you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_133_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私でよければ手を貸すから、困ったときはいつでも声をかけてちょうだい|text_cn=别担心，我一直都在，需要帮忙就尽管开口。|trans_en=If you'd like, I'm happy to lend a hand. Whenever you're in trouble, feel free to call on me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_133_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=カラカラ回る風車を見ていると…小さい頃、これを持って野原を駆け回った記憶が蘇ってくるわ|text_cn=看着风车“吱呀呀”地转，让我不由得回忆起了，小时候举着风车在旷野里奔跑的时光。|trans_en=Whenever I see a pinwheel... Memories of running through the fields with one as a child come rushing back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_133_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=時と場合によって、人の考え方は往々にして変化するものよ<br/>だけど…紡いだ絆は、そう簡単に消えはしない。私はそう信じているの|text_cn=人的想法会随着时间流逝、身份不同而改变，但我相信，人和人之间的牵绊是不会轻易消失的。|trans_en=One's way of thinking always changes with time and circumstances.<br/>But our connections with people don't fade so easily. At least, that's what I believe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_133_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=水遊び？夢中になるのはいいけど、足を滑らせて落ちないようにね？|text_cn=你们要去玩水吗？那一定要注意安全哦。|trans_en=Playing with water is fine, but be careful not to slip and hurt yourself.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_133_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=一緒に水遊びしないか？そうね…いえ、やめておくわ。まだ仕事が残っているし<br/>で、でも気分転換ってことで、少しくらいなら…<br/>それじゃあ着替えてくるから、ちょっとだけ待っててくれる？置いていったら許さないわよ？|text_cn=问我要不要去玩水？我还有工作……<br/>不过，稍微放松一下也挺好，我先去换件衣服回来，请稍等片刻……<br/>一定要等我哦？|trans_en=You want to play in the water with me? Uh... I think I'll pass. I still have work to do.<br/>W-Well, maybe a little would be a nice break...<br/>Would you mind waiting while I get changed? Don't go without me, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_133_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=効率よく仕事を続けるなら、まずはしっかりと休むこと<br/>え？私の場合、どうやって休んでいるか？本を読んだり、散歩をしたり…<br/>最近は、あなたと話すのもいい気分転換になっているわ|text_cn=越是在乎工作的人，越要懂得劳逸结合，只有这样效率才能提高。<br/>压力大的时候，我会看书或散步……不过最近，和你聊天也成了不错的放松方式。|trans_en=Efficient work requires proper rest.<br/>Hm? What do I do to rest and recover? Well, I love to read, take walks...<br/>And lately, chatting with you has been a nice change of pace.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_133_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=誰かに言われて動くようじゃ責任を伴うとは言えない<br/>本当の責任というのは、自分の掲げる信念から自ずと生まれてくるものよ|text_cn=真正的责任不靠外界给予，而是源于内心的信念。|trans_en=Simply doing as you're told isn't the same as taking responsibility.<br/>True responsibility arises naturally from the convictions you hold dear.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_133_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔法の効果は決まっているけど、それをどう使うかによって、可能性は無限に広がっていくの<br/>そう聞くと…どう？興味が湧いてこない？|text_cn=魔法运作本身有其极限，但要论实现效果，则要依赖于人的想象力。<br/>怎么样，有兴趣深入了解一下吗？|trans_en=The magic's effects are fixed, but how you use them opens up infinite possibilities.<br/>What do you think? Does it pique your interest?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_133_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=夢っていうのは、夜空に輝く星のように、いつも手の届かない場所にあるの<br/>でも諦めずに追いかけ続ければ…必ず私たちを導いてくれるわ|text_cn=梦想总是遥远的，就像天上的星星。但只要心怀希望，抬起头就能看到它在指引着我们。|trans_en=Dreams are like stars shining in the night sky, always just beyond our reach.<br/>But if we pursue them without giving up, they will never lead us astray.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_133_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=楽しいこともツラいことも、たくさんあったけど…<br/>やっぱり私は、このフィーリエっていう美しい街が好き。あなたはどう？|text_cn=虽然发生过那么多事，但我还是发自内心地觉得，菲莱是一座美丽的城市，你觉得呢？|trans_en=There've been good times and bad times, but...<br/>I love this beautiful city called Philae. How about you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_133_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今後の参考までに、ぜひあなたの意見を聞かせてほしいの<br/>誰にも邪魔されたくないし…よければ、ふたりきりになれる場所に行かない？|text_cn=关于今后的发展，我想参考一下你的意见，这件事可能会耗费不少精力。<br/>我们约个能长时间独处的地方吧。如何？|trans_en=For future reference, I'd really like to hear your opinion.<br/>I don't want anyone to disturb us, so... how about we go somewhere just the two of us?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_133_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夏が過ぎたら、私をあなたの夏にして。小鳥の歌が終わったら、私の歌に耳を傾けて…<br/>…あら？顔を赤くして、どうしたの？<br/>いまのは新しい魔法の詠唱よせっかくだから、あなたの前で披露しようと思って<br/>でも…ふふ、そんなに期待してくれたなら、あなたに贈る詩も考えてみようかしら？|text_cn="请许我成为你的夏季，当夏日的光阴已然流逝；请许我成为你的乐曲，当夜鹰与金莺皆已缄默”。<br/>怎么了？别害羞，这是我最近打算使用的魔法咏唱语，只是希望你能帮我参考一下……<br/>呵呵，如果是送给你的诗歌，我会亲自撰写。|trans_en=When summer is gone, let me be your summer. Once the birds stop singing, listen to my song...<br/>Hm? Why are you blushing?<br/>It's a new spell I've been working on, and I figured I'd unveil it in front of you.<br/>Hehe... but if you're expecting it so much, maybe I should write you a real poem.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_133_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いくら相手が友だちでも、すれ違うことはあるし…<br/>そう考えると、他人を信用するのは簡単なことじゃないわね<br/>でも、ここまでともに歩んできたいまならハッキリと言える――<br/>あなたのことは、心から信頼しているわ|text_cn=全心全意相信一个人是很困难的。哪怕是朋友，也会有相互不理解的时候。<br/>但是和你一起经历了这么多，现在我很确定，你是值得信任的伙伴。|trans_en=Even with friends, misunderstandings happen...<br/>And that can make it kind of hard to trust people.<br/>But, after coming this far together with you, I can say with total confidence—<br/>I trust you with all my heart.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_133_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私としては、世界中の巡遊者が自分らしく、自由に生きていくための手助けをしたいの<br/>あなたのことだって、絶対に幸せにしてみせるんだから|text_cn=我想让这个世界上的所有旅人——不止是菲莱的大家——每一个勇于前往荒野的人，都过上自己想要的生活。<br/>与此同时，我还希望……能给你带来幸福。|trans_en=Personally, I want to help Trekkers all over the world to live free and follow their hearts.<br/>And I'll make sure you find happiness too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_133_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フユカはもう立派な巡遊者ねこれもあなたの指導があったおかげよ|text_cn=真让人欣慰，冬香已经是位优秀的旅人了。也要感谢你这位师父，帮助她成长到今天这个地步。|trans_en=Fuyuka has become an amazing Trekker, and that's all thanks to your leadership.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_133_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アグリ・ユニオンのフィレン、その名前なら、噂で何度も耳にしているわ<br/>敵に回すと厄介だけど…味方につければ、きっと心強い存在になるでしょうね|text_cn=那位是……联合种业的翡冷翠吧？我有听说过她的名字。<br/>像她这样的人，作为敌人很可怕，但若是能与之结盟，她就会成为可靠的强援。|trans_en=Firenze of United Harvest... A name I've heard many times in hushed whispers.<br/>She'd be troublesome as an enemy... But if we could win her over, she would surely be a very reliable ally.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_133_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=普段はダラケてるナズナだけど、やる気を出したら案外頼りになるのよね<br/>といっても、すぐサボろうとするから、誰かが見てないといけないんだけど<br/>え？私が見ていれば大丈夫？そうね…でも、私以上の適任がいるんじゃないかしら？|text_cn=小禾平时看起来一副提不起劲的样子，但一旦认真起来，就会变得很可靠。<br/>不过，要让她充分发挥实力，还是需要有人在身边督促。<br/>你说让我来？呵呵，还是交给更合适的人吧。|trans_en=Nazuna is usually pretty lazy, but she's surprisingly hard-working when she's motivated.<br/>But still, she'll slack off right away, so someone has to keep an eye on her.<br/>Hm? I should be the one to do that? I suppose... But isn't there someone more qualified than me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_133_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=実力のある巡遊者なら、これまで何人も見てきたけど…<br/>特に印象に残っているのは、黎明団のレイスさんね<br/>肩書に縛られず、自由に生きる…あの生き方は正直うらやましいと思うこともあるわ|text_cn=有没有让我印象深刻的旅人？唔，厉害的旅人我见过不少，不过要说印象深刻，果然还是“风影”吧。<br/>在我看来，她并未被身份所束缚。那份自由令人羡慕，或许这正是她的魅力所在。|trans_en=I've seen many strong Trekkers on my journeys...<br/>But one who really stands out is Wraith from Sentinel of Dawn.<br/>Unbound by titles, living freely... Honestly, I sometimes envy that way of life.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_133_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=花咲旅団の中で、誰がお母さんみたいな存在か？<br/>それは全員一致で彼女の名前を挙げるんじゃないかしら？<br/>ときに優しく、ときに厳しく、そっと背中を押してくれる…<br/>カエデのことは、私も本当のお母さんみたいに思っているわ|text_cn=花令旅团中最不可或缺的人是谁呢？就算嘴上不说，其实大家心里都是明白的。<br/>正是因为有她在，旅团才能维系至今，无论遇到什么，她都不会放弃任何一个人。<br/>对我来说，枫她就像是真正的姐姐，一直照顾着我、温暖着我……|trans_en=Which member of Petal Bloom is more like a mother figure?<br/>I think everyone would say the same name.<br/>Sometimes she's kind, sometimes strict, but always gently pushing us forward...<br/>I truly think of Kaede as if she were my own mother, too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_133_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしたの？|text_cn=怎么了？|trans_en=What is it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_133_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここにいるけど、なにか用？|text_cn=我在，有事吗？|trans_en=Yes, I'm here. Can I help you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_133_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=がんばるのはいいけど、休むときはちゃんと休むのよ？|text_cn=最近辛苦了，好好休息吧。|trans_en=Hard work is good, but rest time is for resting, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_133_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=次の探索の準備でもしているの？|text_cn=是在做出发的准备吗？|trans_en=Getting ready for your next expedition?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_133_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まさか…わざと無視しているわけじゃないでしょうね？|text_cn=……你，应该不是故意不理我吧？|trans_en=Wait... You're not ignoring me on purpose, are you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_133_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめまして、ナツカよ。私に背中を預けてくれるなら、その期待には必ず応えてみせるわ|text_cn=你好，我是夏花。希望我能在未来的旅程中帮上你的忙，也希望你能给予我信赖，以后请多指教。|trans_en=Nice to meet you. I'm Nazuka. If you're willing to put your trust in me, I'll make sure to live up to your expectations.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_133_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また会えてうれしいわ。元気にしてた？|text_cn=又见面了，感觉如何？……呵呵，我还挺开心的。|trans_en=It's good to see you again. How have you been?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_133_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたがくれたこの力、決して無駄にしないわ|text_cn=我不会辜负这份信赖。|trans_en=I will not put this power you've given me to waste.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_133_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力で、私は進み続ける|text_cn=未来我仍会继续向前。|trans_en=With this strength, I can move forward.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_133_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこか懐かしさを感るような…森を吹き抜ける風の音みたいね|text_cn=这声音……就像林间涌动的风，让人怀念。|trans_en=It somehow brings back memories... Like the sound of the wind blowing through the forest.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_133_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この音色、嫌いじゃないわ|text_cn=嗯，很好听呢。|trans_en=I actually like this melody.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_133_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=追い風に乗って進みましょう|text_cn=风与我同在。|trans_en=I'll ride this wind to victory.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_133_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今度はどこに出かけましょうか？|text_cn=下次有机会的话，我们再一起去哪里逛逛吧？|trans_en=Where should we go next?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_133_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=助けてもらってばかりだけど、たまには私もあなたの力になりたいから…<br/>もし助けが必要なときは、遠慮しないで声をかけてね|text_cn=一直以来都在接受你的帮助，我也想为你做些什么。有什么想要的吗？|trans_en=I'm always the one getting help, but I want to be there for you sometimes too...<br/>Please, if you ever need help, don't hesitate to ask me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_133_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=代表執行官という立場上、あなたには責任と選択が常につきまとうでしょうけど…<br/>安心して。なにがあっても私だけはいつでもあなたの味方だから|text_cn=我能感觉到，你身上肩负着沉重的责任，总有一天，你会不得不面对它……<br/>不过，别担心，不论发生什么，我都站在你这边。|trans_en=I guess responsibilities and tough choices are part of your job as CEO...<br/>But don't worry. No matter what, I will always be on your side.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_133_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私たちが手を取り合えば、お互いにとってきっと最高のパートナーになるはず…<br/>ふふ。そうなったら、どんな困難が押し寄せようと、向かうところ敵なし…でしょ？|text_cn=我相信，通过我们的努力和坚持，我们会成为最有默契的伙伴。<br/>即使面对风雨，只要我们在一起，就没有什么能够阻挡我们前进的步伐。|trans_en=If we join hands, we'll surely become the best partners for each other...<br/>Hehe. Then, no matter what hardships come our way, we'll be unstoppable... Right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_133_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=自分を偽るくらいなら、誰にも理解されなくていい…それが私の本心<br/>でもね、ときどき…本当にたまにだけど、不安になることもあって…<br/>そのときは、あなたにだけ…ちょっぴりあまえちゃってもいいかしら？|text_cn=哪怕孤身一人，我仍旧会坚持自我。但偶尔……<br/>只是偶尔，我会期待有那么一个人，能让我放下戒备，成为我可以休息的港湾。<br/>你……愿意吗？|trans_en=If I have to be someone I'm not, then I'm fine with no one understanding me. That's how I really feel.<br/>But sometimes ... just once in a while... I lose my confidence.<br/>When that happens, just with you, can I... lean on your shoulder?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_133_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=素敵な贈り物ね。うれしいわ|text_cn=很棒的礼物，谢谢。|trans_en=What a lovely gift. I'm glad to have it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_133_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の好きなもの、わざわざ調べてくれたのねありがとう、大切にするわ|text_cn=你有在关注我的爱好呢。|trans_en=You even researched what I like? Thank you. I will treasure it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_133_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これを私に？そ、そう…ふふ♪私のこと、ちゃんと見てくれていたのね<br/>ありがとう、すごくうれしいわ。あなたからの気持ち、大切にするわね|text_cn=这个很珍贵，我真的可以收下吗？……谢谢，这份心意让我很温暖。|trans_en=For me? R-Really? Hehe♪ You were really paying attention to me, weren't you?<br/>Thank you. I'm so happy. This really means a lot to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_133_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=ええ|text_cn=是。|trans_en=Yes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_133_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=違うわ|text_cn=不对。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_133_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=欸？|trans_en=Hm?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_133_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら？|text_cn=咦？|trans_en=Oh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_133_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…|text_cn=唔……|trans_en=Oh no...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_133_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=きゃっ|text_cn=哎呀！|trans_en=Kyah!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_133_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメよ|text_cn=不行！|trans_en=No way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_133_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ|text_cn=太好了！|trans_en=Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_133_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉。|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_133_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私を信じて|text_cn=请相信我。|trans_en=Trust me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_133_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたを信じるわ|text_cn=我相信你。|trans_en=I trust you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_133_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが風の力よ！|text_cn=这是……风的力量。|trans_en=This is the power of the wind!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_133_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者のみんなが、幸せに過ごせますように|text_cn=我希望旅人们都能得到幸福。|trans_en=May all the Trekkers find happiness.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_133_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_133_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私についてきて！|text_cn=跟我来。|trans_en=Stick with me!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_133_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=風よ…集え！|text_cn=请束手就擒吧。|trans_en=Wind... Gather to me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_133_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=風の守護を！|text_cn=风会庇护我们。|trans_en=Unleash the wind's defense!!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_133_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=倒れるわけには…|text_cn=我不能……倒下……|trans_en=I can't ... fall...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_133_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あとは、お願い…|text_cn=接下来就拜托了……|trans_en=Please keep going...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_133_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力、役立ててみせるわ|text_cn=我必须把这份力量用在正确的地方。|trans_en=I'll put this power to good use.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_133_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=力を持つということは、それだけ責任が増すということよ|text_cn=强大不仅仅是力量，更是责任。|trans_en=With great power comes great responsibility.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_133_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=風の呼び声が聞こえるわ|text_cn=我听见了风的声音。|trans_en=I can hear the call of the wind.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_133_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=全力でサポートするわ|text_cn=我会站在你们身后，成为你们的助力。|trans_en=I'll offer my full support.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_133_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=危険を感じたら、いつでも頼ってね|text_cn=遇到危险时，就请依靠我吧。|trans_en=Call on me whenever you're in danger.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_133_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔…本当に不思議な場所ね。いったいどれだけの秘密が隠されているのかしら？|text_cn=星塔真是神秘的存在，它究竟隐藏了多少秘密？|trans_en=Monoliths ... are such fascinating places. What incredible secrets do they contain?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_133_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=すべてを忘れて、ただひたすらに上を目指し続ける…<br/>塔に登ることは、私にとって密かな楽しみなの|text_cn=暂时搁置烦恼，只是不断向上攀登……<br/>专注攀登星塔的时光，对我而言别有一番乐趣。|trans_en=Forget everything, and just keep going upward...<br/>Ascending Monoliths is my secret pleasure.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_133_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私はいつだって本気よ|text_cn=我不会吝啬自己的力量。|trans_en=I am always serious.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_133_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんな困難が待ち受けていようとも、私たちなら向かうところ敵なしね|text_cn=无论前方有多少未知，只要我们齐心协力，就能面对一切难关。|trans_en=No matter what challenges may lie ahead, we're more than a match for anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_133_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=星骸の気配よ、集中して|text_cn=敌人正在靠近，务必提高警惕。|trans_en=I sense Stellaroids. Stay focused.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_133_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=覚悟はいい？本当の挑戦はここからよ|text_cn=做好准备了吗？现在开始才是真正的挑战。|trans_en=Are you ready? The true challenge starts now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_133_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめて見るものが多いわね。しっかり記録しておかないと|text_cn=从未见过的地方……嗯，或许可以考虑记录下来。|trans_en=So many things I've never seen. I need to make sure I record everything.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_133_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おすすめの商品をチェックしておいたわ|text_cn=我列了一张推荐购买的商品清单。|trans_en=I've already checked out the recommended products.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_133_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=肩の力を抜いて、少し休んだら？|text_cn=休整时间到了，放松一下吧。|trans_en=Why don't you let loose and relax a little?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_133_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=交渉なら私に任せて|text_cn=不要担心，交涉的事就交给我来处理。|trans_en=Leave the negotiations to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_133_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=気を抜かず、次に備えましょう|text_cn=别太骄傲哦，这只是一个开始。|trans_en=We must stay on guard for the next one.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_133_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう、みんなのおかげよ|text_cn=多亏了大家的配合，战斗很顺利。|trans_en=Thank you. It's nice to have you all!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_133_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=お疲れさま、ゆっくり休んでちょうだい|text_cn=大家都辛苦了，休息一会儿吧。|trans_en=Well done. Take a little break.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_133_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなで掴んだ勝利よ。お疲れ様|text_cn=这次多亏了大家的努力，辛苦各位了。|trans_en=This is everyone's victory. Well done.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_133_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう。みんながいてくれたおかげよ|text_cn=能和你们一起前进，我感到很幸运。|trans_en=Thank you. I couldn't have done it without you all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_133_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この失敗を、次に活かしましょう|text_cn=别在意，失败是成功之母。|trans_en=Let's learn from this defeat.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_133_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=反省を活かして、次こそは…|text_cn=<nobr>回去之后总结经验教训，下次……</nobr>赢的会是我们。|trans_en=I will learn from this, and next time...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_133_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=与えられた役目、きっちり果たしてみせるわ|text_cn=我会好好完成委托的。|trans_en=I will surely fulfil my duty.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_133_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうやら私の出番のようね|text_cn=到我了吗？|trans_en=Looks like it's my turn.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_133_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=サポートも任せてちょうだい|text_cn=我很乐意帮助你。|trans_en=Leave the support to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_133_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなとチームを組めるなんて、うれしいわ|text_cn=很荣幸与大家并肩作战。|trans_en=I'm so glad to be on a team with everyone.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_133_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_133_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まさか普通の女の子みたいに、バレンタインの贈り物をする日が来るなんて…<br/>い、いえ。いまのは独り言だから気にしないでちょうだい|text_cn=没想到有一天能这么自然地送给你情人节礼物……<br/>不，没、没什么。|trans_en=I never imagined I'd end up giving Valentine's gifts like a normal girl...<br/>N-Nothing. Never mind. I was just talking to myself.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_133_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一緒に雪を見に行かないか？ええ、それはかまわないけど…<br/>って、いまから！？ちょ、ちょっと待って、心の準備が…！<br/>ふぅ～…そ、それじゃあ行きましょうか|text_cn=想要和我一起去看雪？好啊，那之后——<br/>……欸？现在就去吗？请、请让我做一下心理准备！<br/>呼……好，我们走吧。|trans_en=You wanna go look at the snow with me? Sure, I don't mind...<br/>Wait, you mean right now!? B-But my heart's not ready...!<br/>Phew... O-Okay... Shall we go?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_133_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう。去年はいろいろと迷惑をかけた気もするけど…<br/>それに懲りず、今年も仲良くしてもらえるとうれしいわ|text_cn=新年快乐。去年你对我多有关照，真的很感谢。<br/>如果你愿意的话……以后还能继续留在我身边吗？|trans_en=Happy new year. I feel like I caused you some trouble last year...<br/>I hope we can put that aside and have a great new year together.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_133_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日は誰にとっても大切な記念日で、ひとつひとつの思い出が、積み重なってできているの<br/>だからこそ、その大切な日を誰と過ごすかが重要なのよ|text_cn=生日的意义在于纪念，纪念则由回忆缀连。所以，相比起日历上的一行数字，与谁在一起才更重要。|trans_en=Birthdays are important milestones for everyone, built up by accumulating each and every memory.<br/>That's exactly why it's so important to spend them with the right person.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_133_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_133_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日おめでとう。心からの祝福をあなたに贈るわ<br/>これから先、楽しいことばかりとは限らないけど…<br/>一緒に困難を乗り越えて、来年もまたふたりでお祝いしましょう。約束よ？|text_cn=今天是最值得庆祝的日子，向你献上衷心的祝愿。<br/>愿你在未来的日子里，依然保持坚强与温柔。无论遇到什么困难，我都会与你一起面对。<br/>明年我也会为你庆祝生日的，说好了喔。|trans_en=Happy birthday. My heartfelt wishes for another wonderful year.<br/>Not everything ahead will be joyful......<br/>But let's overcome the hardships together, and celebrate again next year... Just the two of us. Promise?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc133_NewYear26_day06_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc133_NewYear26_day06_cn.ogg|text_jp=…なんだか魔王さん、輪郭がふっくらしてきたような…？<br/>季節柄、気が緩んでのんびりし過ぎているんじゃない？まあ、たまにならいいと思うけど…<br/>気になるなら、少し体を動かしに行くのはどうかしら？その…私も手伝ってあげるから|text_cn=魔王大人，您的脸好像变得有些圆润了？<br/>是因为这段时间太放松了吗？虽然偶尔这样也没关系。<br/>但为了身体着想，要不要去稍微活动一下？当然，我也会陪着你的。|trans_en=Um, Boss... have you gotten a bit... rounder?<br/>Maybe you're letting yourself go a bit because of the season? I guess that's fine sometimes...<br/>If it bothers you, why not go for some exercise? I can, um ... help you out, if you like.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Half Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc133_HalfAnniversary_day04_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc133_HalfAnniversary_day04_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さん、突然ごめんなさい。実は最近、フユカがスランプ気味で…フユカを言い訳にしないで？<br/>じゃあナズナがちっとも部屋を片づけようとしないから、掃除を手伝って…これでもダメ？<br/>なら、カエデが久しぶりにみんなで一緒にごはんでもどうかなって魔王さんを誘って――<br/>うぐっ…だ、だって！ちゃんとした理由もないのに魔王さんを誘ったら、迷惑かもしれないし…|text_cn=魔王……不好意思突然来打扰你……其实最近，冬香她心情有点低落……好像拿冬香来当借口不太好……<br/>那……小禾完全不想打扫房间，所以希望你能过来帮个忙……好像这个也不行……<br/>那就……枫说大家好久没聚了，要不要一起来吃个饭什么的……<br/>呜……怎么办啊！要是没有正经理由就去邀请魔王，会给他添麻烦的……|trans_en=Sorry to bother you out of the blue, Tyrant, but Fuyuka's been in a slump lately... I should not use Fuyuka as an excuse?<br/>Uh... Nazuna doesn't clean her room at all, so I thought you could help us tidy up... Still no?<br/>Well, Kaede said we should grab a meal together and told me to invite you—<br/>Ugh... B-Because! If I invited you without a proper reason, I was afraid it'd be a bother...}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_134_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あの…師匠？人と話す練習がしたいので、少し付き合ってもらえませんか…！？|text_cn=师父，来、来和我练习怎么跟其他人说话吧！|trans_en=U-Um... Master? I want to practice how to talk to people, could you help me with it a little bit...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_134_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あれ？隠れてたつもりなんですけど、どうしてわかったんですか？|text_cn=咦——？为什么我躲在角落都会被发现……|trans_en=W-What? I thought I was hidden! How did you find me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_134_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お、おはようございます……|text_cn=早、早上好……|trans_en=G-Good morning...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_134_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？わたしなんかとお昼をご一緒してくださるんですか…！<br/>ま、待ってください、今心の準備を…！|text_cn=欸？我这么微不足道不足挂齿无足轻重的人，竟然有资格与您共进午餐吗？！<br/>请、请稍等……让我做一下心理准备！|trans_en=W-Wait, someone as insignificant as me gets to have lunch with you?!<br/>P-Please hold on... I need to mentally prepare myself!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_134_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=師匠と一緒に星を眺める、なんて……緊張するような、安心するような……<br/>不思議な気分です♪|text_cn=跟师父一起看星星，有点紧张，又有点安心……真不可思议……|trans_en=Watching the stars with you ... makes me feel nervous, but ... also kind of safe...<br/>It's a strange feeling...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_134_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしのガントレットに触ってみたい、ですか？は、はい。どうぞご自由に……！|text_cn=想要摸摸我的手甲？请、请便……！|trans_en=Y-You want to touch my gauntlet?O-Okay. Go for it...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_134_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力はみんなを守るためのものですから…<br/>きちんとコントロールできるようにならないと…！|text_cn=为了保护大家，我要学会控制这份力量……|trans_en=This strength is for protecting everyone...<br/>So, I have to learn how to control it...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_134_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=春になって、小鳥たちがすくすく育ってくれるといいなぁ|text_cn=等到冬天过去后，小鸟们会平安长大的吧。|trans_en=When spring comes, I hope the little birds grow up strong and healthy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_134_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あぅ～…もう立てません。すみません師匠、手を貸してもらえませんか？|text_cn=呜……站不起来了……<br/>师父，可以、可以扶我一下吗？|trans_en=Oof... I can't stand up anymore. Sorry, Master, can you help me up?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_134_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ああっ…す、すみません！この『人の心を動かす社交スキル100選』を<br/>丸暗記するつもりで読んでいたから、前を見てなくて…！<br/>本当にごめんなさい！おケガはありませんか…！？|text_cn=对不起！我、我在看这本《打动人心的100个社交技巧》，打算把上面的内容全部背下来，所以没注意到您……<br/>真的很对不起！没被撞疼吧？！|trans_en=Ahh... S-Sorry!I was reading this "100 Social Skills to Move People's Hearts"...<br/>... and trying to memorize it word for word, so I wasn't looking ahead...!<br/>I'm truly sorry!Are you hurt...!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_134_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=知らない人と話すのは苦手ですけど…<br/>たくさんの人と話せば、臆病な自分を変えられるってナズナセンパイも言ってたし…<br/>で、でもわたしみたいな変な子に突然話しかけられたら、みなさん迷惑なんじゃ…<br/>わ、わたし、いったいどうすればいいんですかぁ～！|text_cn=和陌生人说话好难……枫前辈告诉我，多和人说说话就不会那么胆小了。<br/>但、但是，如果突然找人搭话，对方会不会觉得我是个怪人……呜呜，到底该怎么办才好啊……|trans_en=I'm not good at talking to strangers...<br/>But Nazuna said that if I keep at it, I can change my timid self.<br/>B-But if a weird one like me suddenly talks to people, won't they be annoyed...?<br/>W-What on earth should I do?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_134_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ソファの下に落ちた物を拾おうとしたんです<br/>でもガントレットがつっかえて、奥まで手が入っていかなくて…<br/>そういう意味では不便なときもありますけど、でも顔を隠すには丁度いいんです|text_cn=刚、刚才从沙发底下拿东西的时候，手甲卡住了……<br/>虽然平时有些不方便，但我还是会戴着它，因为必要时可以挡住我的整张脸。|trans_en=J-Just now, I was trying to grab something that fell under the sofa...<br/>... but my gauntlet's too big to reach for it...<br/>It's inconvenient in moments like these, but it is perfect for hiding my face.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_134_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=街でファンの方に声をかけられても、驚いてしまって結局何も話せないんですよね…<br/>きっとみなさんガッカリして…えっ、むしろクールでかっこいいと思われてる？<br/>それは…喜んでいいんですか？|text_cn=路上遇到热情的粉丝时，我总是被吓到一句话都说不出，肯定让他们失望了吧……<br/>欸？他们反而觉得很酷很有型？那真是……太好了……？|trans_en=When people recognize me on the street, I get so startled that I can't say anything.<br/>They must be so disappointed... H-Huh? They actually think it makes me cool and mysterious?<br/>A-Am I supposed to be happy about that...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_134_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者になった理由？<br/>そうですね…フィーリエでは人気の職業ですから、流されるままなんとなく選びました<br/>で、でもいまは違います。センパイたちと冒険してると、ちっとも寂しくなくて…<br/>だからこの仕事が本当に大好きなんです…！|text_cn=当旅人的原因吗……最开始的时候，只是因为这个行业在菲莱很热门，所以我就跟着潮流迷迷糊糊来当旅人了……<br/>但、但是，现在的我已经喜欢上了这份工作，和朋友们一起冒险的话，就不会觉得孤单了……|trans_en=Why did I become a Trekker?<br/>Well... It was a popular profession in Philae, so I sort of went with the flow.<br/>B-But now it's different. When I go on adventures with the guild, I never feel lonely...<br/>That's why I really love it now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_134_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=小動物っていいですよね。人と違って、一緒にいても全然緊張しませんから…|text_cn=我很喜欢小动物，和它们在一起的时候，不会像面对人类时那么紧张……|trans_en=Small animals are so nice. They don't make me nervous at all, unlike people...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_134_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたし、狭くて暗い場所が好きなんです<br/>箱の中、クローゼットの中、机の下…えへへ、なんだか安心するんですよね|text_cn=我喜欢狭窄的，阴暗的角落，比如箱子、壁橱、桌子下面……<br/>嘿嘿，躲在这种地方很有安全感，很舒服的哦……？|trans_en=I really like small, dark spaces.<br/>Inside a box, inside a closet, under a desk... Hehe, it just makes me feel safe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_134_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キャンプでみなさんに囲まれた時は、師匠がいてくれたからなんとかなったけど…<br/>はぁ…いつになったら、自分で対応できるようになるんだろう？|text_cn=上次在营地里又被热情的旅人们围住了，幸好您在场。 <br/>什么时候，我才能鼓起勇气一个人面对这些呢……？|trans_en=That time we were surrounded by everyone at the campsite... I only managed to get through it because you were there.<br/>Sigh... When will I be able to handle situations like that on my own?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_134_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人に助けてもらうのは恥ずかしいことじゃないです<br/>わたしが言っても説得力がないかもしれませんけど…<br/>えへへ、ギルドっていうのは人と人とがお互いに助け合う場所だと思いますから|text_cn=被人帮助不是什么丢脸的事情……虽然由我这样的人来说显得缺乏说服力，嘿嘿……<br/>但、但是，旅团不就是一群渴望帮助他人，渴望被他人帮助的人聚在一起，互相取暖的地方吗？|trans_en=Relying on others isn't something to be ashamed of.<br/>I might not be the most convincing person to say that, but...<br/>Hehe, guilds exist so that people can support each other, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_134_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『欲しいものがあるなら、きちんと言葉にする』<br/>これは師匠が教えてくれたことです<br/>だから、その…もう少し二人きりでいたいです。隣に座ってもいいですか？|text_cn=“想要什么，就要大声说出来”，这是师父告诉我的……<br/>那、那个，我、我现在想要和您独处一会儿……我能坐在师父身边吗？|trans_en="If you want something, you should speak up."<br/>This is what you taught me.<br/>So... Um... I'd like to stay with you a little longer. May I sit next to you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_134_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=センパイたちには自分の目標があるから…<br/>いつかはわたしを置いて旅立ってしまう日がくるかもしれません。…でも、怖くはないんです<br/>だって、どんなに離れていても、センパイたちとは心が通じあってるって信じてますから|text_cn=前辈们都有自己的目标……也许有一天，大家会留下我独自一人，踏上各自的旅程。<br/>但现在，我已经不害怕了，因为我知道，无论相隔多远，大家的心都是紧紧相连的。|trans_en=The seniors all have their own goals...<br/>There may come a day when they leave me behind and set off on their journey... But I'm not afraid.<br/>No matter how far apart we are, I believe our hearts will always be connected.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_134_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナツカセンパイは、わたしの憧れであり目標なんです<br/>もしあの人に出会わなければ、いまのわたしは存在してなかったと思いますから<br/>いつか…センパイみたいに強く、堂々と振る舞えるようになれたらいいな|text_cn=夏花前辈是我很尊敬的人，没有她，我肯定走不到今天。<br/>真希望能有一天变得像她一样坚强，能够坚守自己的信念，毫不动摇。|trans_en=I look up to Nazuka and she's also my goal.<br/>If I hadn't met her, I'm pretty sure I wouldn't be who I am now.<br/>I hope that someday, I can have her strength and be confident like her, too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_134_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=先日、箱の中に隠れていた時――<br/>自称いにしえの…ほにゃららにゃにゃ教団？のスナイパーと出会いました<br/>なんでもその箱は、彼女が見つけた偽装用アイテムで、中に隠れると絶対に敵に見つからないと…<br/>そ、そんなの嘘ですよね？|text_cn=之前躲在箱子里的时候遇到过一个自称是上古……什么喵喵喵教团……的狙击手。<br/>她说这是她找到的潜伏道具，只要钻进里面，就没有任何敌人能发现……是、是骗人的吧？|trans_en=The other day, while I was hiding in a box...<br/>I met someone who called herself an ancient... um ... Nyan-something sniper?<br/>She claimed that the box was actually a special camouflage tool, and that hiding inside it made her completely undetectable.<br/>Th-There's no way that's true, is there?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_134_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=フィレンさんは、冷たい人ってイメージがあって、ちょっと怖かったというか…<br/>アグリ・ユニオンの中では、まともに挨拶することすらできませんでした<br/>で、でもあのタイプの人って、自立してて、かっこよくて…わたし、すっごく憧れます！|text_cn=翡冷翠小姐……看起来很冷酷呢。我在联合种业的时候都不敢主动和她打招呼……<br/>不、不过，这样的人总是独立又帅气，感觉好羡慕啊。|trans_en=I always thought Firenze was a cold person, so I was intimidated...<br/>Back when I was with United Harvest, I could barely even greet her properly.<br/>B-But people like her are so independent, so cool... I really admire them!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_134_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナズナセンパイが見守っててくれると、すごく安心できて<br/>えへへ…みんなで力をあわせて戦うのって、それだけでなんだかうれしくなりますね|text_cn=有小禾前辈在身边，我就会感到很安心。嘿嘿，和大家一起并肩作战的感觉……真好啊。|trans_en=It's so reassuring to know that Nazuna is watching over me.<br/>Hehehe... Just working together with everyone and fighting somehow makes me happy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_134_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=カナーチェさんに、自分の授業を受けないかと誘われました<br/>なんでもポテンシャルを秘めてる子に興味があるらしく、指導するのも慣れてるからと…<br/>あの、師匠はどう思いますか？|text_cn=卡娜丝小姐上次见到我的时候，邀请我去她那里上课。<br/>她说自己对有着强大潜力的孩子很感兴趣，也擅长教导学生……<br/>那个，师父，请问您怎么想？|trans_en=Canace invited me to take one of her lessons.<br/>She said she's always interested in people with hidden potential, and that she's experienced in training others...<br/>So, um, what do you think I should do?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_134_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ぷふっ…あ、ちょ、くすぐったいです|text_cn=有点痒痒的。|trans_en=Pfft... Ah, w-wait, that tickles!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_134_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ど、どうしました？|text_cn=怎、怎么了 ？|trans_en=Wh-What's wrong?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_134_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたし、何か気に障ることしちゃいましたか？|text_cn=我是不是做了让您生气的事……|trans_en=D-Did I upset you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_134_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もし怒らせちゃったなら、ごめんなさい…|text_cn=如果我做了坏事，请原谅我……|trans_en=If I did something wrong, I'm really sorry...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_134_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして、師匠……わたしに気づいてないとか？|text_cn=难道师父……没发现我吗？|trans_en=Could it be... Master doesn't notice me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_134_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここ、こんにちは、師匠！ふ、ふふ、フユカでちゅ！<br/>あぅ～…いっぱい練習したのに、結局嚙んじゃいましたぁ～…|text_cn=师父您好！我……我我、我是冬香！<br/>呜呜，怎么会这样，明明私下里练习了那么久，却还是咬到舌头了……|trans_en=H-Hello, Master!I-I'm F-F-Fuyuka...!<br/>Agh! I practiced so much, but I still ended up biting my tongue...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_134_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ま、また会いましたね。わたし個人としても、花咲旅団の一員としても<br/>師匠の力になれたら嬉しいです|text_cn=又、又见面了，如果您还需要我和花令旅团的力量，那就太好了……|trans_en=W-We meet again. Both personally and as a Petal Bloom member,<br/>I hope there is some way I can help you, Master.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_134_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ、わたし、少しは成長できましたよね？|text_cn=我是不是有所成长了呢？|trans_en=H-Have I grown a little?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_134_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このガントレット、前よりうまく使いこなせてる気がします|text_cn=感觉……能更好地驾驭力量了……|trans_en=I think I'm getting better at handling these gauntlets now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_134_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが、わたしの心の声？本当に大切なものは、すぐそばにあるって…|text_cn=这就是我内心深处的声音，它说真正值得追求的东西，就在我身边……|trans_en=This is the voice of my heart?It's telling me what truly matters is right beside me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_134_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=とても心地良いメロディーです…♪|text_cn=我听到了好好听的旋律……|trans_en=This melody is so beautiful... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_134_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=信頼に応えられるよう、精いっぱい頑張ります…！|text_cn=为了回报您的信任，我一定会加倍努力！|trans_en=I'll do my very best not to disappoint you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_134_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あぅ～…そ、そんなにジッと見つめないでください～…|text_cn=呜，请、请不要盯着我看……|trans_en=Ahhh... P-Please don't stare at me like that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_134_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=自分の力が怖かったんです<br/>でもわたしはひとりじゃない――周りには師匠もセンパイたちもいるんだって気づいたら…<br/>これは、大切な人たちを守るための力だって思えるようになって<br/>だからいまでは、この力を持って生まれたことに感謝してるくらいなんです|text_cn=我总是在害怕自己的力量，直到我意识到自己从来不是孤身一人，我的身边还有那么多朋友和同伴……<br/>力量是为了守护大家而存在的，我现在很感谢它。|trans_en=I used to be afraid of my own strength.<br/>But when I realized I wasn't alone—that I had Master and the guild around me...<br/>I started to think of this power as something meant to protect the people I care about.<br/>Now, I'm even grateful to have been born with this power.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_134_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘で勝つのと違って、自分に勝つのはすごく難しいです<br/>…え？普通の巡遊者は、戦闘で勝つのもひと苦労？<br/>いえいえいえ！いまのは自慢じゃなくて…！あくまで個人的な感想です〜！|text_cn=我发现，战胜敌人很简单，战胜自己却很难……<br/>咦？对普通旅人来说战胜敌人也很难？这、这只是我个人的想法啦……|trans_en=Winning a battle is one thing, but overcoming myself is much harder.<br/>...Huh? Most Trekkers already struggle just to win battles?<br/>Oh, no, no! I wasn't bragging just now! I-I mean, that was just my personal opinion...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_134_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=臆病でおどおどした性格は…そう簡単には変えられません<br/>でも逃げ出したくなる時は、いつも師匠が背中を押してくれるから…<br/>わたしは本当に、幸せ者だと思います…！|text_cn=也许，胆怯、内向……这些缺点再也无法改变了，但每当我想要逃避的时候，总有像您这样的人愿意拉住我的手。<br/>我真的觉得自己很幸运……！|trans_en=My timid, hesitant nature isn't something I can change so easily.<br/>But whenever I feel like running away, you're always there to take my hand, Master.<br/>That's why I feel like the luckiest person in the world!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_134_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たくさんの人が、花咲旅団を信じて、応援してくれるようになりました<br/>これもすべて師匠のおかげです。だから、これからもずっと…<br/>わたしの手を引いて、導いてほしい……です♪|text_cn=如今，有越来越多的人愿意信赖花令旅团，越来越多的人支持我们……这都是您所带来的改变。<br/>我希望您能像现在这样，一直带领我，在前方指引我的道路……|trans_en=So many people believe in and support Petal Bloom now.<br/>And that's all thanks to you, Master. So, I want you to always...<br/>... be the one to take my hand and guide me. Please... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_134_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっと、あ、ありがとうございます…師匠|text_cn=谢谢你，师父……|trans_en=U-Um... Th-Thank you... Master.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_134_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんな素敵な贈り物、わ、わたしなんかが受け取ってしまっていいんですか…！？|text_cn=诶？这么好的礼物……我真的可以收下吗？|trans_en=D-Do I really deserve such a wonderful gift?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_134_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、その…えっと…あ、あああ、ありがとうございます～！|text_cn=哇、哇哇！谢、谢谢、谢谢谢谢！|trans_en=Uh, um...err...th-th-thank you so much!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_134_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい|text_cn=我知道了。|trans_en=Yes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_134_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=無理です！|text_cn=这样……不对。|trans_en=I can't!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_134_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=可以吗？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_134_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=あぅ〜…|text_cn=呜，我，我不清楚……|trans_en=Hng...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_134_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなぁ…|text_cn=呜呜……|trans_en=Nooo...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_134_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当ですか！？|text_cn=真的吗？|trans_en=Really?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_134_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=イヤです！|text_cn=我讨厌这样！|trans_en=Stop!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_134_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ|text_cn=太好了……|trans_en=Hee hee.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_134_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ……|text_cn=呜呜……|trans_en=Haah...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_134_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=が、頑張ります……！|text_cn=我会努力的！|trans_en=I-I'll do my best!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_134_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=みなさんの期待に応えてみせます|text_cn=我不想辜负大家的期待。|trans_en=I won't let you down!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_134_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=怖くない、怖くない……|text_cn=不要害怕，不要害怕……|trans_en=I'm not scared at all...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_134_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力、しっかりコントロールしなきゃ|text_cn=我会控制自己的力量。|trans_en=I have to control this power properly.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_134_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_134_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっと…花咲旅団の団長、フユカです|text_cn=我、我是冬香……是花令旅团的团长。|trans_en=Um... I'm Fuyuka, leader of the Petal Bloom Guild.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_134_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが私の決意――わぁあああ！？|text_cn=这一拳，象征我的决意——<br/>呜啊！|trans_en=This is my resolve—Waaah?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_134_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ、わたしの拳を、あっ、甘くみないで…！|text_cn=不、不要小看我的拳……拳头！|trans_en=D-Don't underestimate my f-fists!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_134_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=体が……動きません……|text_cn=身体……动不了了。|trans_en=I-I can't move properly...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_134_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなと離れたくない……|text_cn=我不想离开大家……|trans_en=I don't want to leave everyone...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_134_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが、星ノ塔からもらった力……|text_cn=这就是星塔赐予的力量……|trans_en=So this is the power from the Monolith...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_134_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力があれば、もう失敗しませんよね…|text_cn=有了这份力量，应该就不会失败了吧……|trans_en=I shouldn't fail anymore with this power, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_134_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=さらに力持ちになった気がします|text_cn=感觉力气又变大了。|trans_en=I feel stronger than before.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_134_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=み、みなさんの足を引っ張らないようにしないと…！|text_cn=我、我不会拖后腿！|trans_en=I-I must make sure not to hold everyone back...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_134_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=全力で拳を振り抜いても、大丈夫…ですよね？|text_cn=全力挥拳，也不会出问题吧……？|trans_en=Even if I throw all my weight into a punch, it should be okay, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_134_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=塔の中って、何かが急に飛び出してきそうで…ちょっと怖いです<br/>どこに隠れればいいかもわからないし…|text_cn=塔里的氛围好可怕啊……走着走着就觉得会有什么东西蹦出来，都不知道该躲在哪里……|trans_en=The Monolith is so eerie, like something will jump scare you at any moment...<br/>I don't even know where to hide...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_134_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=以前は一人で塔に登ってたんです<br/>だって、それなら本気を出しても仲間を巻き込んだりしないし…<br/>あ、で、でも今は違って、みなさんと一緒に登る方が好きです！|text_cn=以前单独爬过几次塔。一个人的时候，我可以使用全力，不用担心伤到其他人……<br/>不、不过，我觉得还是和大家一起爬塔比较好！|trans_en=I used to climb the Monolith on my own.<br/>That way, I could use my full strength without worrying about hurting anyone.<br/>... B-But now, I definitely prefer going with other people!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_134_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ、わたしが指揮を！？無理です無理です！<br/>何の取り柄もないわたしなんかでは、師匠の足元にも及びませんから！<br/>指揮は師匠にお任せします～！|text_cn=欸？让我指挥？不行不行！像我这种没有一点可取之处的人，肯定连师父的脚跟都不如！还是您来吧！|trans_en=Huh? You want me to lead? No way, no way!<br/>Someone like me, with no talents whatsoever, is nowhere near as capable as you, Master!<br/>P-Please take command, Master!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_134_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘では、仲間との連携が重要で、敵を倒すことがすべてじゃない<br/>だからわたしの拳で勝機を作れるなら、それでいいんだよね…<br/>うん、ちゃんと覚えておかなきゃ|text_cn=战斗中最重要的是配合，挥出拳头的目的不一定是为了打倒敌人，也可以是为同伴制造胜机……<br/>嗯，我要好好记住这一点。|trans_en=In battle, teamwork is essential. Defeating the enemy isn't everything.<br/>So if my punch can create an opening for allies, that'd be enough, right...<br/>Yes, I need to remember that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_134_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔の中って不思議ですよね。まさかこんな景色が見られるなんて…|text_cn=每次进入星塔时都会觉得很不可思议，世界上竟然还存在这样的景色啊……|trans_en=The Monolith is so mysterious. I never imagined seeing landscapes like this...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_134_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=師匠と一緒なら、何も怖くない…うん、大丈夫|text_cn=有师父和我在一起，没事的……不用害怕……|trans_en=As long as you're with me, there's nothing to be afraid of... Y-Yeah, I'll be fine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_134_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初めての塔ですけど…が、頑張ります！|text_cn=是从来没探索过的塔……加、加油！|trans_en=A new Monolith... I-I'll give it my all!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_134_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お、お買い物ができるみたいです今足りないものは、なんでしょうか…？|text_cn=好像可以在这里买补给品。我想想，我们现在缺什么……？|trans_en=We can buy supplies here. Umm... What do we need?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_134_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あの…あまり目立ちたくないので、隅っこにいていいですか？|text_cn=那、那个……我不太想引人注意，我可以找个角落呆着吗？|trans_en=U-Um... I don't want to stand out, so can I just stay in the corner?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_134_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ、悪いことが起こりませんように…！|text_cn=千、千万不要有坏事发生……！|trans_en=P-Please don't let anything bad happen!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_134_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう敵はいないみたいです|text_cn=这里已经没有敌人了。|trans_en=Looks like no enemies are left.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_134_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ、わたし…床とか壊してないですか？|text_cn=地板……没被我砸坏吧？|trans_en=I-I didn't break the floor, did I?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_134_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=壊した施設、弁償しなきゃダメですか？|text_cn=破坏星塔里的公物，不用赔偿吗？万、万一旅团经费不够赔的话怎么办……|trans_en=Do I have to pay for damaging the building?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_134_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんとか勝てました……|text_cn=这是来之不易的胜利……|trans_en=We managed to win...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_134_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっとみなさんのお役に立てました|text_cn=终于能帮上大家的忙了。|trans_en=I finally managed to be of help.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_134_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=大丈夫です。つ、次はきっと…上手くいくはず、です！|text_cn=别在意，下次，下次一定能做得更好……！|trans_en=It's okay... We'll do better next time for sure!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_134_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あぅ～…全部わたしのせいですぅ～…|text_cn=呜……都是我的错……|trans_en=Ahh... It's all my fault!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_134_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みなさんをガッカリさせないようにしなくちゃ…|text_cn=我不想让大家失望……|trans_en=I can't let everyone down...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_134_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=みなさんと協力しないと…うん、頑張れわたし！|text_cn=要和大家一起并肩战斗了……我、我会加油的！|trans_en=I have to be a team player... I-I'll do my best!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_134_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしも貢献してみせます|text_cn=我会努力帮忙。|trans_en=I'll do what I can to help.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_134_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=精一杯頑張るので、よろしくお願いします…|text_cn=我会好好努力的，请多担待……|trans_en=I'll try my hardest. Please be patient with me.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_134_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨ、ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Y-Yostar!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_134_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…今日は特別な日というか…うぅ、やっぱり恥ずかしい…師匠は…わかってますよね？<br/>と、とにかく手作りチョコを用意したので…よければ食べてもらえると、うれしいですぅ～！|text_cn=今、今天是……就是……就是那个节日……<br/>我、我不好意思说啦，反正师父肯定知道……<br/>总、总之，我亲手做了巧克力，能请您品尝一下吗？|trans_en=Um... Today's kind of a special day... Oh, this is so embarrassing... You understand... right, Master?<br/>A-Anyway, I made some chocolates for you... I'd be so happy if you tried them!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_134_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=メリークリスマスです、師匠。今夜、花咲旅団のみんなでパーティーをするんですけど…<br/>もしご迷惑でなければ、師匠もご一緒にいかがでしょうか？<br/>え？パーティーなんだから、堅苦しいのはなし？わ、わかりました…！|text_cn=雪、雪愿节快乐，师父！晚上花令旅团的大家要一起办个派对……<br/>想邀请您来一起庆祝，您、您愿意赏脸莅临吗？<br/>诶……不用这么正式？|trans_en=Happy Snowish Festival, Master. We're all having a party at Petal Bloom tonight...<br/>Um, if it's not too much trouble, would you join us?<br/>Eh? A party invitation shouldn't be so stiff? S-Sorry about that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_134_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=師匠、去年は本当に…いろんなことで助けていただき、ありがとうございました！<br/>それで、あの…もしよければ、今年も一年、いっぱい助けてもらえると…うれしいです！|text_cn=谢谢师父过去一年的照顾和教导！新的一年……<br/>希望师父还能一直在我身边，帮助我……指导我……那那那个……可以吗？|trans_en=Master, this past year... Thank you so much for all you've done for me!<br/>So, um... If you don't mind, I... I sure hope you'll help me out this year too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_134_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あわわわ…！師匠にわたしの誕生日を、お祝いしてもらえるなんて…！<br/>あ、ありがとうございます！師匠のおかげで、いつも以上に、素敵な誕生日になりそうです♪|text_cn=师父要亲自为我过生日吗……？<br/>嘿嘿……谢谢师父！有您的陪伴，这个生日一定会很特别。|trans_en=Wahh...! I can't believe you remembered my birthday, Master!<br/>Th-Thank you so much! I think this might just be my best birthday ever! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_134_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_134_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…師匠、お誕生日おめでとうございます！<br/>師匠がこの世界に生まれてきたから、こうして出会えたわけで…恩恵の神様に感謝ですね！|text_cn=今天是师父降生在这个世界上的日子，我对此深怀感激。师父，生日快乐。未来的日子，还请多多关照……|trans_en=Um... Master, happy birthday!<br/>If you had never been born, I would never have met you like this... I'm so grateful to the God of Grace!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc134_NewYear26_day07_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc134_NewYear26_day07_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？わたしを後ろから見ると、上から下まで真っ白で、お餅が歩いてるみたい…ですか？<br/>あ、お餅の話をしてたら、お腹がすいてきました…師匠、一緒に食べませんか？|text_cn=诶？您说……从后面看我，像是个会走路的白年糕吗？<br/>年糕啊……唔，肚子突然饿了。嘿嘿，师父，我们一起去吃年糕吧～|trans_en=Huh? When you look at me from behind, I'm all white from top to bottom like a rice cake walking?<br/>Ah, talking about rice cake is making me hungry... Master, shall we eat together?}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_135_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら？昼間からぼけ～っとして、いいご身分ねぇ？<br/>暇してるなら、アタシが予定を決めてあげましょうか？|text_cn=嗨~！今天打算做些什么？<br/>看你头脑空空的样子……要不就都听我的吧！|trans_en=Oh? Must be nice being able to zone out in the afternoon like that.<br/>Maybe I should put a schedule together for you, if you've got nothing to do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_135_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふ…♪アタシのキャワワ～な魔王さまは、何をしてるのかしら？|text_cn=让我瞧瞧，我可爱的魔王正在做什么呢？|trans_en=Hee hee... I wonder what my cute-as-a-button Boss is up to now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_135_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよ。そろそろ起きてちょうだい。いつまでもダラダラしてちゃダメよ|text_cn=早安。已经到开工的时间了，不许赖床喔。|trans_en=Morning. It's about time you woke up. You can't just laze about all day.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_135_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アフタヌーンティーのお茶は…ボスのチョイスでよ・ろ・し・く♪|text_cn=快来，帮我看看今天下午茶喝什么？|trans_en=Afternoon tea? I'll let you make the call, Boss.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_135_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねぇボス。今日撮った写真を整理するんだけど、ちょっと手伝ってくれない？|text_cn=魔王，有没有空来帮我看看今天拍到的素材？|trans_en=Hey, Boss. I've got to sort through all the photos I took today. Can you help me out?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_135_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=面白そうなことはないの～？このままだと寝ちゃうわよ？|text_cn=不做些有趣的事吗？我可要睡着了哦？|trans_en=Isn't there anything fun to do? If this keeps up, I'm gonna nod off.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_135_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと～。自分のことばっかりしてないで、たまにはこっち見なさいよぉ|text_cn=偶尔也抬头看看我嘛——从俗事里脱身吧？|trans_en=Come on. Quit thinking about yourself and look at me once in a while, all right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_135_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=噂の『魔王』が目の前にいるなんて――うふふ、魔女魂が刺激されるわァ♪<br/>ね～え？アナタのヒミツ、アタシにだけ教えてくれない？|text_cn=一想到身边有你这样一个神秘的“魔王”，我就忍不住兴奋了起来。<br/>现在，是否有空与我“深入交流”呢？|trans_en=I've got the notorious Boss right in front of me... Hee hee. This kind of thing sets my witch heart racing.<br/>So, got any deep, dark secrets you want to share with me and my millions of viewers?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_135_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんな鍵ならボスの心を開けられるのかしらね～？中を確かめる日が楽しみだわ|text_cn=要用怎样的钥匙才能打开你的心门？我好期待呀。|trans_en=I wonder what the key is to opening the Boss's heart. I can't wait until for the day I pry that thing open and shine a light inside!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_135_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=カボちゃんとランちゃんは人を驚かせるのが好きなの<br/>がお～っ♪うふふ…こんな風にね★|text_cn=小南瓜和小提灯，它们喜欢恶作剧。就像这样……啊唔！|trans_en=Lanterna and Pumpka love surprising people. Roar! Hee hee... See? Just like that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_135_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今～？写真の整理中よ。あなたも一緒にやる？|text_cn=我？我在整理照片呢。要和我一起吗？|trans_en=What am I doing? Sorting through photos, obviously. Want to help?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_135_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=見ての通り、アタシは魔女<br/>エネルギッシュでストロングなブレイブチャーミー魔女、ミスティちゃんよ★|text_cn=如你所见，我是魔女，将胆识、勇气、魅力、活力集于一身的魔女！|trans_en=As you can see, I'm a witch. The vigorous, vibrant, and valiant witch Mistique!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_135_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ネタとの出会いは一期一会。一度のチャンスを大切になさい<br/>ということで――今すぐ現場に直行よ！|text_cn=错过这店，明天还能再吃；错过新闻，就什么都没有了！|trans_en=Every scoop is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity that you have to grab with both hands—<br/>which is why I'm heading to the site right now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_135_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=話題の人も、激レア写真も、ゴシップも…<br/>午後のティータイムと同じくらい人生には欠かせないものなの♪|text_cn=有趣的人，有趣的事；好照片，好新闻——<br/>它们就像下午茶一样，必不可少！|trans_en=The people everyone's talking about, the super-rare photos, the latest gossip...<br/>They're all just as essential to life as afternoon tea.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_135_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=さてと――アナタのヒミツ、洗いざらい話してもらうわよ<br/>ぜ～んぶ話すまで、逃さないんだから♪|text_cn=别逃呀，我还没问够呢……<br/>来，好好聊聊你的秘密吧！|trans_en=Okay, here's the deal. You're going to tell me every last one of your secrets in painstaking detail—<br/>and I'm not letting you go until you tell me EVERYTHING!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_135_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『魔王』って響き、アタシは結構好きよ。だって『魔女』と似てるし…<br/>2つ並んでると、何か起こりそうじゃない？|text_cn=虽然但是，我还是更喜欢“魔王”这个读音。<br/>“魔王”和“魔女”在一起，总觉得会发生点什么，不是吗？|trans_en=I like how the title "Boss" sounds. It's got the same kind of vibe as "Witch"...<br/>Put them together, and stuff is bound to start happening, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_135_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=カボちゃんとランちゃんが、ボスに会いたかったそうよ<br/>ええ、この子達の話。アタシは別に…どっちでもよかったけどね|text_cn=小提灯和小南瓜说它们想你了。<br/>——嗯，是它们想你了，不是我哦。|trans_en=Lanterna and Pumpka have been really wanting to meet you, Boss.<br/>Yes, I'm talking about these two. Me...? Uh, I couldn't really care one way or the other...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_135_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アナタとの思い出、だいぶ増えたわねェ。もうアルバム1冊じゃ収まりきらないわ|text_cn=自从认识你，珍贵的回忆就越来越多了。<br/>你看，一本相册已经装不下了。|trans_en=I've got a lot of many memories with you now—<br/>so many that a single photo album isn't enough to hold them all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_135_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=その話、興味深いわねェ。うふふ…詳しく聞かせてちょうだい<br/>えっ！？ちょ、初耳なんだけど！今メモを…！|text_cn=再让我多听一些——你美妙的故事吧……<br/>啊，好猛的料！好棒的料！|trans_en=That sounds really fascinating—do tell more. <br/>... What!? I didn't hear about that! Argh, quick! Get me something to write on!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_135_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=大丈夫、全部アタシに委ねて。そう、そのまま…はい、チーズ★|text_cn=对，把一切都交给我吧……<br/>很好，就是这个姿势……茄子——！|trans_en=It's all right, it'll be great. Trust me. <br/>... Okay, perfect! Hold that pose and say cheese!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_135_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの歌声に、奇跡のようなパフォーマンス、アオバこそ伝説の魔法少女よ！<br/>なのに私としたことが、今まで気付かなかったなんて…一生の不覚だわ<br/>まあでも、これからは普通にインタビューできるからいいけど♪|text_cn=传奇的魔法少女，动听悦耳的歌声，那宛若奇迹的演出……<br/>哦不！太可惜了！我错过了偶像青叶的成名之路！<br/>——呃，不过现在要是能采访到的话，也不亏吧？|trans_en=That beautiful voice, that miraculous performance—Aobelle truly is a legend!<br/>To think I didn't realize it until now... What a dumbass, huh?<br/>Then again, I guess I can just interview her whenever I want now, so it's no biggie.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_135_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=競合他社を力で黙らせ、泥沼にはまっても不死鳥の如く蘇る<br/>頭脳明晰で超絶優秀なアグリ・ユニオンの鬼――じゃなくて幹部・フィレン！<br/>あぁ…1対1の特別インタビューとかしてみたいわね。ヒミツをぜ～んぶ聞き出してやるわ★|text_cn=商战硝烟，她谈笑间决胜千里；身处漩涡，她弹指间全身而退……<br/>精明能干的魔头——啊不，是高管！<br/>好想给翡冷翠来一场独家专访，挖一挖狠料！|trans_en=Shutting down rival companies by sheer willpower, rising from the ashes of bankruptcy like a phoenix...<br/>Firenze, United Harvest's brilliant-minded and incredibly talented demon—er, I mean CEO—is one inspiring girl!<br/>I'd love to do a one-on-one and make her spill all her secrets!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_135_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍族のお茶って、独特の風味で奥深いわよね<br/>うふふ…ちょっとボス、どこに売ってるのか聞いてきてくれない？<br/>特別にアタシがレビューを書いて宣伝してあげる|text_cn=龙裔的香茶，和魔女喝的完全不是一个风味……真令我陶醉！<br/>快帮我问问哪儿有卖的……我来给他们打个广告？|trans_en=There's something about Loong tea that sets my tongue tingling!<br/>Say, Boss, could you find out where it's sold? I'll do them a favor by writing up a review to spread the word.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_135_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=アッシュエリアの闇医者って、ものすごく変わり者みたいよ<br/>態度は悪いけど、患者からお金を取らないんですって。どうすれば取材に応じて…<br/>あぁそうだわ、怪我人を装って、お近づきになればいいんじゃない？|text_cn=在灰城区的暗处，有一位密医。传言，她总是对病人态度古怪，出言不逊，却总会不计回报、救死扶伤，甚至分文不取……<br/>啊，我该假扮病人做个暗访调查吗？|trans_en=That doctor in the Ash District is a real eccentric. She seems like a total cold fish, but she never accepts money from her patients.<br/>Wish I could figure a way to interview her... Wait! I could just pretend to be injured and get close to her that way, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_135_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=オフィールが行く場所では、いっつも事件が起こるのよねェ<br/>アイツが魔女じゃなくて、ほんと良かったわ<br/>じゃなきゃスクープを独り占めされちゃうもの！|text_cn=为什么奥菲尔在的地方总是有事件发生呢！好羡慕——<br/>还好她不是记者，不然就算跟着她跑也没新闻蹭啦！|trans_en=Stuff seems to happen wherever Orpheus goes.<br/>Thank goodness she's not a witch—if she was, she'd have a monopoly on all the good stories!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_135_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=写真を撮ってって？はい、チーズ★|text_cn=嗯？来笑一个——茄子！|trans_en=You want me to take a picture? All right, say cheese!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_135_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あらぁ～？また会いに来たの？うふふ…ボスって暇なのかしら？|text_cn=喂喂，这么频繁来找我真的好吗？<br/>魔王应该有很多事情要忙吧？|trans_en=Oh? Another visit? Hee hee... <br/>Guess you've got a lot of time on your hands, eh, Boss?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_135_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アタシを放置するなんて…うふふふ、いい度胸してるじゃない？|text_cn=诶~你是在小瞧魔女吗？|trans_en=You've got quite the nerve, you know, leaving me high and dry all the time... Hee hee.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_135_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいのかしら～？アナタがサボってるの、バレバレよ？|text_cn=嘿嘿，被我抓到你在偷懒了！|trans_en=You sure this is all right? I mean, it's pretty obvious you're slacking off.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_135_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら、もしかして寝ちゃった？それじゃあ今のうちに…パシャ、っと！<br/>うふふ…ボスの寝顔いただき～♪これは高く売れるわよ|text_cn=呜哇，不会真睡着了吧！<br/>魔王的独家睡眠写真，你的粉丝一定会乐意掏钱的。|trans_en=Oh, asleep, are you? Well in that case, I might as well strike while the iron is hot... Snap!<br/>Hee hee... A shot of the Boss asleep, for sale to the highest bidder!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_135_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みーつけた★最近有名な魔王って、アナタのことでしょ？<br/>アタシは天才敏腕魔女のミスティよ！それじゃあインタビューを始めましょうか|text_cn=找到你了！最近很火的那位“魔王大人”!   <br/>我叫雾语……既是天才的魔女也是敏锐的记者！接受我的采访吧！|trans_en=Found you! You're the infamous Boss everyone's been talking about, aren't you?<br/>I'm ingenious ace witch, Mistique! Ready for an interview?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_135_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また取材に来てあげたわよ！はい、チーズ！あら素敵♪次は別の表情もちょうだい！|text_cn=茄子！我又来拜访了！诶~这是啥表情？让我多收集收集！|trans_en=I'm back for more material! Say cheese! Awesome, love it! Now give me a different look for this next shot!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_135_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして今のアタシ、魔法少女よりキラキラしてる？|text_cn=说不定，我会变得比魔法少女还要闪亮喔？|trans_en=Wait! Am I even more sparkly than the magical girl herself?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_135_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やぁ～ん★気前の良い魔王さまって、す・て・き♪|text_cn=诶~这次居然这么大方！哇哦，魔王你可真好！|trans_en=Gracious. You are SO generous! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_135_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=へぇ～？なかなかいいセンスしてるじゃない。うふふ…褒めてあげる|text_cn=你的品味偶尔还是可以夸赞一下的。|trans_en=Huh? You've got some pretty good taste. Hee hee... Hats off to you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_135_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまには曲のレビューでも書いてみようかしら|text_cn=这又是哪首曲子？让我锐评一下。|trans_en=Maybe I should write song reviews every now and then.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_135_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあボス！世界のヒミツを取材しに行くわよ！|text_cn=和魔女一起，窥探世界的秘密吧！|trans_en=C'mon, Boss! Let's head out and uncover some new stories!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_135_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アタシのヒミツを教えてあげるから、アナタのヒミツも教えてちょ～だいね★|text_cn=我的秘密，你已经尽收眼底了！你的秘密，也快点呈上来吧！|trans_en=If I tell you my secrets, you have to tell me yours. Deal?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_135_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もっとじっくりボスの話を聞かせてちょうだい★<br/>うふふ…質問はまだまだい～っぱいあるわよ♪|text_cn=好啦，把深藏在心里的想法都吐露出来的话，会更轻松哦~<br/>……让我好好享用你的全部吧~|trans_en=Tell me more about yourself, Boss. Hee hee... <br/>I've got soooo many questions for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_135_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほらほら、胸に溜めてるもの、ぜ～んぶ吐き出して楽になっちゃいなさい？<br/>うふふ…アナタのすべて、アタシに見・せ・て♪|text_cn=……对我再坦诚一些吧，让我好好见识下你的秘密！|trans_en=Come on, take a load off your chest and spill all those secrets you've bottled up inside. It'll make you feel better, I promise!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_135_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アナタって人はほんとに…！こうなったら、黒歴史を掘り起こして<br/>――ってダメよ、自作自演は魔女のポリシーに反するわ|text_cn=诶！你可真是……<br/>坏了，这下我该从哪里找你的黑料呢……<br/>不对不对，记者可不能参与到事件里去啊……|trans_en=Listen!   <br/>If you're not going to share with me, I'll just have to go digging into your past myself—and you might not like what I turn up!<br/>... Ah, who am I kidding? I bet you've got nothing to hide...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_135_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アナタのこと、調べられるだけ調べたわ<br/>でももし、まだ他の人に言ってないヒミツがあるなら…アタシにだけ、教えてくれない？|text_cn=……这就是我全部的独家报道了！<br/>更多的就没有啦！<br/>你……还有更多要告诉我的事吗？|trans_en=I've dug up all I could find. <br/>But if there are still any secrets you haven't told anyone ... let me be the one person you tell, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_135_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=無難なところだけど、チョイスとしては悪くないわ|text_cn=很机灵嘛，挑了些不会出错的东西。|trans_en=It's a safe choice, but it's not bad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_135_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちゃんとアタシの好みをリサーチしてきたのね。きゃはっ★わかってるじゃない♪|text_cn=诶——有偷偷调查我的喜好啊~不错不错，开窍了呢~|trans_en=So you researched what I'm into.<br/>Eek! I can't believe you get me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_135_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アタシの好みを完全に把握してるなんて、正直驚いたわ<br/>うふふっ…心まで丸裸にされちゃった気分よ♪|text_cn=连我喜欢这个都调查出来了啊，那是不是可以认为……<br/>你对我的了解已经非、常、深、入了？|trans_en=I'm honestly shocked that you so perfectly understand my tastes. <br/>Hee hee... It feels like you've laid my heart bare.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_135_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふッ|text_cn=嗯哼。|trans_en=Hee hee.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_135_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=いやいやいや|text_cn=不不不。|trans_en=No, no, no.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_135_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=はァ？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Uh, what?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_135_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=変ね|text_cn=奇怪。|trans_en=That's odd...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_135_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=…うぅ|text_cn=……呜。|trans_en=...(sniff)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_135_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=落ち着きなさい…|text_cn=要冷静……深呼吸……|trans_en=Calm down...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_135_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅん？|text_cn=啧。|trans_en=Hmph.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_135_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=あらあら～？|text_cn=哎呀~|trans_en=Oh yes?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_135_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉。|trans_en=(sigh)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_135_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=逃がさないわ★|text_cn=你要逃吗？|trans_en=I'm not letting you get away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_135_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=それじゃ、遊びましょう★|text_cn=那就来玩玩吧。|trans_en=Now then, let's have some fun.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_135_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=キャワワ～★|text_cn=真是可爱呢~|trans_en=Unbelievably cute!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_135_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ざんね～ん|text_cn=可惜——|trans_en=Too bad!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_135_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_135_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=正義のキャワワ～な魔女、ミスティちゃんよ★|text_cn=因为我是可爱又正义的魔女嘛！|trans_en=Mistique, the unbelievably cute witch of justice!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_135_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もっといろんな表情を見せてちょうだい|text_cn=让我欣赏——更多有趣的表情吧！|trans_en=Okay. Now show everyone how you really feel!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_135_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アタシの情報網からは、逃げられないわよッ★|text_cn=我是不会——让你从我的情报网里逃走的哦！|trans_en=There's no escaping my information network!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_135_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あと…もう一枚、だけ…|text_cn=让我……再拍一张照片……|trans_en=Just ... one more shot...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_135_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=覚えてなさい…|text_cn=你们等着……我要用小本本都记下来……|trans_en=You'll regret this!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_135_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ～ん？面白いアイディアじゃない|text_cn=嗯——这个方案的味道不错！|trans_en=Hm? This is an intriguing idea.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_135_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ただでさえキャワワ～なミスティちゃんが、さらに魅力的になったわァ★|text_cn=可爱魔女——待会更闪亮！|trans_en=The unbelievably cute Mistique has gotten even more charming!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_135_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ノヴァ大陸いちキャワワ～なミスティちゃんにぴったりじゃな～い♪|text_cn=不错，这个衬我！|trans_en=Oh, goodie! This is just what the cutest girl in Nova needed! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_135_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キャワワ～な魔女の活躍に、ご期待あれッ★|text_cn=敬请期待魔女登场~|trans_en=Watch how the cutest witch in the business does things!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_135_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふふ…魔女の本気ってやつを見せてあげる♪|text_cn=这下轮到我表现了！|trans_en=Hee hee... Now watch and learn, because this witch means business! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_135_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふ…スクープはいただきよ★|text_cn=这次能搞到什么大新闻呢？|trans_en=Hee hee... This scoop's all mine!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_135_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=最近、ネタがマンネリ気味なのよね～|text_cn=最近的素材，感觉都没什么话题性呢~|trans_en=I need stories with more substance...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_135_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=誰かさんが応援してくれたら、やる気が出るのになぁ～？|text_cn=要是某个人能给我加加油、鼓鼓劲的话，我会更有干劲喔！|trans_en=I'd be more into this if a certain someone cheered me on...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_135_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえボス？アタシ～、写真器を新調したいのぉ～♪|text_cn=来进货啦~我要换个新的留影器！|trans_en=Hey, Boss? I really need a new camera.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_135_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=こ～んなにプロ意識が高い魔女、めったにいないんだからね★|text_cn=唉，像我这么有职业精神的记者，可不多见啦。|trans_en=Professional witches like me don't grow on trees, you know!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_135_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=無茶振りにも平然と応えるミスティちゃん、さすがでしょ？<br/>うふふ、報酬を弾んでくれてもいいのよ？|text_cn=我这可是知难而进，再多给我点奖励吧？|trans_en=Check me out responding to totally unreasonable requests without a squeak of complaint! <br/>Feel free to reward me generously any time, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_135_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ネタの匂いがするわ！さっさと取材を始めるわよッ★|text_cn=哇哦，新感觉，新素材！来拍照吧？|trans_en=I smell a story—time to start interviewing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_135_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お金が足りない時はぁ…うふふ、アナタっていくらで売れるのかしら？|text_cn=付不起钱的话，我就把你抵押在这咯！|trans_en=Sometimes when I'm strapped for cash... I wonder how much could I sell you out for?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_135_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ～あ…なんだか眠くなっちゃった。アナタ達も好きにしてちょ～だい|text_cn=我要躺一会，你自便吧~|trans_en=(yawn)... Sorry, but I need some shuteye. You kids go and do whatever.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_135_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ビビビッと来たわ！ビッグニュースの予感よ★|text_cn=前面出啥事了？莫不是有大新闻？|trans_en=My reporter senses are tingling—big story incoming!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_135_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=きゃはは♪さすがはミスティちゃんね★|text_cn=瞧，我很靠谱吧？|trans_en=Hah-ha! ♪ The amazing, adorable Mistique strikes again!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_135_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=は～い、おしまい。今回も楽勝だったわ♪|text_cn=收工收工~轻轻松松~|trans_en=Yeah, yeah, all done. Another piece of cake.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_135_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=気にしないでちょ～だい。これも魔女のお仕事だから|text_cn=这也是魔女的例行公事呢。|trans_en=No worries. This is just part of a witch's job.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_135_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日も一日、頑張って働いたアナタを褒めてあげる★|text_cn=辛苦啰。向你奉上足够的敬意！|trans_en=Credit where credit's due—you've been putting in the hard work!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_135_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご褒美に、キャワワ～な魔女とのティータイムはいかが？|text_cn=作为给你的奖励……和魔女一起喝杯下午茶吧！|trans_en=For your reward, how about tea time with an unbelievably cute witch?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_135_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=悔しい？ならもう一回試してみる？|text_cn=要是不甘心的话……要不你再试试？|trans_en=Frustrated yet? Then let's go again.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_135_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はもう帰って、しっかり準備してから出直しましょう？|text_cn=没必要这么拼吧？不如回去再多调查一下？|trans_en=Why don't you call it a day, and come back when you're better prepared.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_135_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=スクープがアタシを呼ぶ声が聞こえるわ！|text_cn=我听到了，新闻呼唤我的声音！|trans_en=I hear a scoop calling my name!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_135_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アナタがアタシを呼ぶ声が聞こえるわ！|text_cn=我听到了，你呼唤我的声音！|trans_en=I hear you calling my name!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_135_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=いっくわよ～！魔女しゅつどぉ～★|text_cn=收到！魔女，马上启动！|trans_en=Let's go! It's time for this witch to head on out!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_135_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=スクープあるところにアタシありよッ！|text_cn=有趣的素材？我来啦~|trans_en=I'm wherever the scoops are!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_135_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター★|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_135_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=バレンタインっていい日よね～<br/>なにもしなくても、スキャンダルのほうから勝手に歩いてきてくれるんだもの<br/>キャハッ♪せっかくだし、アタシたちもツーショットとか撮っちゃう？|text_cn=所谓情人节……正是绯闻四起，满地大新闻的好日子！<br/>话说……我们要不要也来一张……充满绯闻感觉的合影？来来，尝尝我准备的巧克力吧！|trans_en=Valentine's Day is absolutely my favorite special day of the year. <br/>The scandals and stories just jump into my lap with me having to lift a finger! Hehe ♪.<br/>Say, while you're here, why don't we take a quick selfie together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_135_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=仮装用の衣装を持ってきたわよ～！<br/>さ、一緒にクリスマスを楽みましょう♪<br/>ほら、笑って笑って…はい、チーズ★|text_cn=美好的雪愿节，祝你心想事成！<br/>来来，这是我送你的雪愿特制装扮——快来摆个造型~三、二、一，茄子~！|trans_en=I brought a costume so we can play dress-up!<br/>C'mon, let's get into the Snowish spirit ♪<br/>Give me a big smile~And... CHEESE! ★}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_135_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新年の挨拶に来たわよ～！あけましておめでとう♪ちなみに今年のアタシの目標は…<br/>『毎日楽しく過ごして、毎日ビッグニュースをすっぱ抜く』ってとこかしら★|text_cn=新的一年，新的大新闻！祝你每天都有好心情，每天都有大新闻！|trans_en=I've come to wish you a Happy New Year! ♪ <br/>Do I have a New Year's resolution? <br/>Oh, you know I do. "Have fun every day, and score a big scoop every day, too!" How does that sound?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_135_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ああっ♪まさかあの魔王様が、アタシの誕生日を覚えていてくれたなんて…！<br/>光栄すぎて、涙が溢れちゃいそうだわぁ★この恩は、きっと一生忘れない…かも♪|text_cn=魔王大人，居然记得我的生日吗……！天呐，这可是我的无上殊荣！魔女一定会记得您的大恩大德！|trans_en=Oh my! ♪ To think the big scary tyrant actually remembered my birthday! <br/>I'm so honored, I think I'm going to burst into tears! ... I-I'll never forget this honor ... probably. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_135_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_135_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=や～ん★今日の主役がボケーっとしてる顔、撮っちゃった～♪フィルムを返してほしいなら…<br/>そうねぇ、代わりに『願い事をしながら、ケーキのロウソクを吹き消すところ』でも<br/>撮らせてもらおうかしら？|text_cn=喔！在这万家共庆，天地同欢的日子里，魔女代表全宇宙，祝您生日快乐！身体健康！|trans_en=Hehe! I just snapped a shot of the star of the day, looking totally zonked out. ♪ <br/>I suppose I COULD delete the photo and not post it everywhere ... <br/>but in return, I want a photo of you blowing out your birthday candles while making a wish. Deal?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc135_NewYear26_day04_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc135_NewYear26_day04_cn.ogg|text_jp=去年は何度もボスの密着取材をさせてもらっちゃったけどぉ…<br/>全然ネタが尽きなくてびっくりしちゃったのよね。まだまだいくらでも記事が書けちゃいそうだし…<br/>てことで！今年も四六時中、べったりねっちょり密着させてもらうから、覚悟してよね♪|text_cn=虽然去年已经让我做了好几期魔王的贴身专访……<br/>可素材根本挖不完，连我自己都吓一跳！总觉得随随便便就能再写出十几篇……<br/>所以你就做好觉悟吧！今年我也会二十四小时黏在您身边继续取材的哦~|trans_en=Last year, I got to do several exclusive interviews with you...<br/>I was surprised that I never ran out of material. I could still write so many more articles...<br/>So! I'll be sticking super close at all times this year too, so get ready ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's Day 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc135_Valentine26_day05_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc135_Valentine26_day05_cn.ogg|text_jp=アタシのことだから、全身にチョコをかけて、自分を贈り物にしそうって？<br/>や〜ねぇ、いくらビッグニュースのためとはいえ、ミスティちゃんでもそこまでしないわ<br/>だって、特別な相手とはいえ…ううん、特別な相手だからこそ、そんなの…恥ずかしいじゃない？<br/>ウフフ♪シャッターチャーンス！そのドキッとした顔、いただきよっ★|text_cn=你说，我看起来像是会把自己浑身裹上巧克力，再把自己送出去的样子？<br/>讨厌啦~再怎么为了大新闻我也不会做到那种地步的~<br/>就算是给特别的人……不对，正因为是特别的人这样子……才让人更觉得害羞嘛~<br/>呵呵~好机会！啊~这个让人心动~的表情，我就收下了~|trans_en=You think I would cover my whole body in chocolate and make myself a gift?<br/>Oh, come on! Even for big news, Mistique wouldn't go that far.<br/>Even if it's for someone special...No, I mean, if it's really for someone special, wouldn't that be ... embarrassing?<br/>Hehehe ♪ Shutter chance!I'll take that flustered look on your face★}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_137_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=見てください！あの雲…ふふ。ウッドモットみたいです♪|text_cn=快看，那朵云……好像一只树树鼠呀~|trans_en=Look there! That cloud... Hehe. It looks like a Shrubshrew♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_137_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩、わたしの限定版シャロチャームを見ませんでしたか？<br/>奮発して買ったもので、大切にしていたんですが…え、あれって偽物！？<br/>『トゥールセレクト』って、星ノ塔で作られたものじゃないんですか…！？|text_cn=前辈看到我的限量版夏洛克挂件了吗？这可是我花了大价钱买来的~<br/>诶？是盗版？“星塔严选”不是在星塔里生产的吗？|trans_en=Mentor, have you seen my limited edition Sherlock charm?<br/>I treated myself to it so I treasure it dearly... Eh? It's a fake!?<br/>But it's "Monolith Premium"... Doesn't that mean it was made in the Monolith...!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_137_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩、わたしが考えた健康にいい朝食を試してみませんか？<br/>バーニンフルーツジュースに砂糖焼きキノコ串を合わせ…<br/>あっ、ちょ、先輩！？どうして逃げるんですか…！|text_cn=前辈要不要尝尝我新开发的健康早餐？<br/>炽焰果榨汁配糖烤蘑菇串……别走啊前辈……|trans_en=Mentor, would you like to try my healthy breakfast that I came up with?<br/>To go with the Ignis Fruit juice, add glazed mushroom skewers...<br/>Ah, wait. Mentor!? Why are you running away...!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_137_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お昼寝に時間を使うなんて、もったいないです！<br/>探索したい場所は、まだまだたくさんありますからね！|text_cn=我才不要把时间浪费在午睡上，还有许多地方等着我去探索呢！|trans_en=Taking naps is such a waste of time!<br/>There's still plenty of places that I want to explore, you know!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_137_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えへへ…今日はすっごく疲れましたけど…<br/>巡遊者として充実しているって、きっとこういうことを言うんですよね♪|text_cn=好累啊，前辈……这就是……充实的旅人生活吗……|trans_en=Hehe... I'm so worn out today...<br/>But I guess this is what it means to be fulfilled as a Trekker♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_137_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者の生活って、想像していたものとは少し違いましたけど…<br/>でも、毎日予想もしないことがいろいろ起きて、本当にたのしいです！|text_cn=旅人的生活和我以前想象得有些不一样，每一天都比我预想的更有趣！|trans_en=The Trekker lifestyle isn't entirely what I had in mind...<br/>But I really enjoy the many different surprises that happen every day!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_137_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=このトランクを軽々持ち上げられるように、これまで訓練をがんばってきたんです！|text_cn=为了能轻松提起这个箱子，我可是认真锻炼了好久呢！|trans_en=I can now lift this trunk easily! Because I've been training so hard all this time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_137_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩、よければ一曲、わたしと踊っていただけますか？|text_cn=前辈，和我再跳一支舞吧？|trans_en=Mentor, if it's all right with you, would you dance with me for one song?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_137_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=失敗しても大丈夫ですよ。恥をかくことを恐れないで…<br/>わたしの目を見て、身を任せてください。さあ、そこから一歩踏み出して…|text_cn=别担心，看着我的眼睛，跟着我就好。来，先往前迈第一步……|trans_en=It's okay to make mistakes. Don't be embarrassed...<br/>Look into my eyes and trust me to guide you. Now, take the first step...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_137_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=冒険の計画なら、もちろん立てていますよ！<br/>3年でギルドを有名にして、5年で星ノ塔を制覇し…<br/>そして10年後には、『巡遊者エレノア』の冒険譚を大陸中に広めるんです！|text_cn=我已经做好了未来的冒险计划：三年组建知名旅团，五年登顶所有星塔，十年后“旅人埃莉诺”的故事将会传遍诺瓦大陆的每一个角落！|trans_en=Of course I've planned our adventures!<br/>In 3 years, we'll make our guild famous, and we'll conquer the Monolith by year 5...<br/>Then after 10 years or so, the adventures of "Eleanor the Trekker" will have spread across the continent!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_137_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔の最上階って、どんな場所なんでしょう？<br/>ぜひ１度、自分の目で見てみたいです|text_cn=星塔的最顶层是什么样的呢？真想亲眼看一看呀。|trans_en=I wonder ... what kind of place is the highest floor of a Monolith?<br/>I'd really like to see it with my own eyes one day.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_137_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなにはまだ内緒にしているんですけど…実はわたしたちの冒険譚を漫画にしてみたんです<br/>ふふふ♪いつかきっと大ヒットしますよ|text_cn=偷偷告诉你，前辈，我把我们的冒险故事画成了漫画，以后一定会大卖的！|trans_en=I haven't told anyone this but, I'm actually turning our adventures into a manga.<br/>Hehehe♪ It will definitely be a big hit someday.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_137_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩、この場を離れましょう。じっとこちらを見ている方は、おそらく両親が手配した護衛です|text_cn=嘘……前辈，我们快走，那边的保镖好像认识我，千万不能被他们发现了。|trans_en=Mentor, let's get out of here. The person staring at us is probably a bodyguard that my parents arranged.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_137_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩のカンパニーは、資金繰りに困っているんですか？<br/>大丈夫ですよ。わたしが先輩に投資しますから！|text_cn=前辈的公司最近是不是资金周转有困难？没关系，就由我来投资前辈吧！|trans_en=Mentor, is your company having financial difficulties?<br/>It'll be fine. I'll invest in you, Mentor!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_137_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩、聞いてください！荒野でのサバイバル術を学んだんです！<br/>うっかり穴に落ちてしまったときは、ポンポン魚を驚かせるんです！<br/>そうすると空気を吸い込むので…それに掴まれば、外へ出られるそうですよ！<br/>荒野には不思議な生き物がいるんですねぇ|text_cn=前辈前辈，我最近学到了新的荒野求生妙知识！<br/>在野外要是不小心掉入坑洞或陷阱，可以通过吓唬嘭嘭鱼的方式，让它的身体充满气，旅人就可以拽着它离开了。好神奇的生物呀……|trans_en=Mentor! Hear this out! I've learned some techniques for surviving in the Wilds!<br/>When accidentally falling into a pit, try scaring the Puffloon fish!<br/>That makes it gulp air... And if you grab onto them, you can get back out.<br/>There are some really strange creatures out there in the Wilds, don't you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_137_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…先輩の肖像画を描いてもいいですか？も、もちろん練習のためです…！|text_cn=前辈，我可以为您画一幅肖像吗？只、只是用来练手啦。|trans_en=Um... Mentor. Is it okay if I draw your portrait? O-Of course, it's just for practice...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_137_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの、先輩？来週のオークションなんですが…<br/>わたしが無茶をしないよう、先輩も一緒に参加していただけませんか？<br/>あ、でも…先輩がほしいと思ったものだけは、全力で競り落としにいきますけど！|text_cn=下周的拍卖会，前辈愿意陪我一起参加吗？我保证不会再乱出价了，除非……那是前辈喜欢的东西。|trans_en=Um... Mentor? Next week is the auction, so...<br/>To make sure I don't do anything reckless... Could you come with me?<br/>Ah, but... If there's something you want... I'll win it at all costs!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_137_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=知っていますか？空に浮かぶ雲は自由で、同じ形のものは存在しないんです<br/>いいなぁ…わたしもあんなふうに自分の将来を自由に選べたらなぁ|text_cn=前辈，您认真看过天上的云吗？日出前，或者下雨之后，它们每一片都不一样……<br/>有时候我会想，要是我也能像云一样自由就好了。|trans_en=Mentor, did you know? Clouds float in the sky freely, and no two clouds are the same.<br/>That must be nice... I wish I could be like them... Free to choose my own destiny.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_137_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わっ、わっ、わぁ～っ！！ち、違いますよ！いまのは先輩を見ていたわけではなく…！<br/>そう、小鳥です！先輩の頭の上に巣を作ろうとしていた小鳥を観察しようと思いまして…<br/>ち、ちなみにその小鳥はもう飛んでいっちゃいました！|text_cn=呜哇——我、我没有在偷看您，这个望远镜是用来观察在您头顶上方搭窝的那只小鸟的……<br/>它、它刚刚飞走了！|trans_en=Whoa, whoa, whoa!! I-I wasn't staring at you, Mentor...!<br/>It was this little bird, you see! I was just looking at the little bird making a nest above your head...<br/>Ah...! By the way, it has already flown off into the distance!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_137_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=以前までのわたしは、見たことのない景色を自分の目で見られたらそれでいいと思っていたんです<br/>でもいまは、その…ひとりではなく、先輩と一緒に新しい景色を見られたらなって…<br/>だってそうすれば、どんな景色も一生忘れられない思い出になると思いますから！|text_cn=前辈，我想看的风景还有很多……<br/>以前的我只觉得，只要能亲眼看到那些没见过的景色，就已经很满足了。<br/>不过现在，我会忍不住想，如果那些重要的旅途都能和您一起走过，一定会变得更加难忘吧。|trans_en=I used to think that seeing scenery that I've never seen before with my own eyes was enough for me.<br/>But now, well... I want to see it not by myself, but with you, Mentor...<br/>Because in that way, any sight we see will become a memory that I never forget for the rest of my life!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_137_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの、先輩？ひとつ気づいたことがあって…<br/>優れた巡遊者ほど、コハク先輩のように多くは語らないものなんですよね|text_cn=我发现，越是厉害的旅人，越不爱说话，就像琥珀一样。|trans_en=Um... Mentor. I happened to notice something...<br/>The best Trekkers are the ones that say the least, just like Amber.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_137_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウィンドアッシュの皆さんは、本当に親切で、優しくて、素晴らしい技術を持っていて<br/>彼女たちと話していると、それだけでとても勉強になります|text_cn=灰风俱乐部的大家热心又善良，个个都身怀绝技……我从她们身上能学到很多东西。|trans_en=The Ashwind Clan is so friendly, kind, and skilled.<br/>I was able to learn so much just by talking with them.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_137_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者の活動を始めてから、ウィローさんには、たくさんお世話になりました<br/>あの方って、まさに小説に出てくる都会のエリートって感じで…！<br/>ヤバくないですか？本当にかっこいいですよね！|text_cn=薇洛小姐帮了我很多。我觉得她就像是小说里那种都市精英，真的好帅气呀！|trans_en=When I first started as a Trekker, Willow was such a big help for me.<br/>She reminds me of a high-class character straight out of a novel...!<br/>Isn't that crazy?She is so awesome!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_137_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=レイスさんの言っている、「目についた武器を大量に買い込んでいるお嬢さん」とは…<br/>きっとわたしのことですよね？まあその分、何度も騙されたりもしましたが…<br/>それは他のお客さんの代わりに騙されたとも言えますし<br/>ある意味、みなさんのお役に立てたのではないでしょうか！|text_cn=风影说的那个“一上来就买了一堆武器的大小姐”……应该就是在说我？<br/>唔……不过从另一个角度来说，我也算是替大家排除了很多不值得买的选项吧！|trans_en=When Wraith said, "The lady who keeps buying whatever weapons catch her eye"...<br/>Was she talking about me? You could say I was easily swindled many times but...<br/>I like to think I was swindled in place of other customers...<br/>So in a way, I think I was a lot of help to other people!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_137_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメ先輩に、家計簿をつけてみてはどうかとご意見をいただいたんですが…<br/>そもそもどうすればあんなにたくさんの数字を頭の中で処理できるのでしょうか…|text_cn=鸢尾说我应该养成记账的习惯，可是，我要怎么做才能记住那么多数字啊？|trans_en=Iris suggested I should keep a ledger book but...<br/>How does she manage to keep track of all those numbers in her head to begin with...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_137_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい？巡遊者の間で流行っている最新の挨拶…ですか？<br/>そういうことなら、わたしも覚えて実践しないと…！|text_cn=嗯？这是旅人之间最新的打招呼方式吗？那我也要学一学……|trans_en=Huh? Is that the latest way to greet among Trekkers?<br/>If so, I'd better learn it and use it too...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_137_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして、ハイタッチですか？では…今日も素敵な1日を過ごせた記念に！ターッチ！|text_cn=前辈，我们来击掌吧！庆祝又度过了美好的一天！|trans_en=Are you asking for a high-five? Then... here's to an amazing day! High-five!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_137_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わかりましたよ、先輩。これは巡遊者としての忍耐力を鍛えるための訓練なんですよね？<br/>そういうことならその挑戦…わたしが受けて立ちましょう！|text_cn=前辈是在考验我有没有作为旅人的耐心吗？好，我接受挑战！|trans_en=I see, Mentor. Is this to train me to have better patience as a Trekker?<br/>If that's the case, I accept your challenge!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_137_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=むぅ…先輩？これ以上わたしを無視すると…<br/>こっちから、先輩のおそばに行っちゃいますよ？|text_cn=前辈，再不理我的话，我可要主动凑过去了哦……|trans_en=Hmm... Mentor? If you keep ignoring me like this...<br/>I'll have to come over there myself, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_137_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もうすぐ！もうすぐ描き終わりますから！<br/>あとちょっと、そのポーズをキープしてください！|text_cn=对，就是这样，保持这个姿势，我马上就要画好了！|trans_en=Almost there! I'm almost done drawing!<br/>Please keep that pose just a little more!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_137_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩と一緒に、早く冒険に行きたいです！<br/>そうだ！よければ星ノ塔にまつわるお話を聞かせていただけませんか？|text_cn=我已经等不及和前辈一起去冒险了！可以给我讲讲和星塔有关的故事吗？|trans_en=I can't wait to go on an adventure with you, Mentor!<br/>That's right! If you don't mind, could you tell me some stories about the Monolith?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_137_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『巡遊者幸運手帳』に書いてあったことは本当でした…！<br/>また会いたいと願う人のことを強く思い続ければ、その願いはきっと叶う…<br/>わたしと先輩は、やっぱり最高のパートナーなんですね！|text_cn=《旅人好运手册》说得没错，只要一直想着某个人，就可以再次相遇……我和前辈一定是最完美的冒险搭档！|trans_en=The thing written in "Trekker's Lucky Planner" is true...!<br/>If you keep thinking about the person you want to meet again, that wish will surely come true...<br/>You and I make the best team after all, Mentor!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_137_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者として、学びを得ました！忘れないように、しっかり復習しておかないと|text_cn=又学到了新的旅人知识，我得好好复习一下！|trans_en=I must say I've learned a lot as a Trekker! I'll make sure to keep reviewing so I don't forget.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_137_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつかわたしも、誰かの先輩に…ふふ♪|text_cn=总有一天，我说不定也能成为某个人的前辈呢……呵呵。|trans_en=If one day I can be someone's mentor, too... Hehe♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_137_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そういえば、旅の資金を少しずつ貯めていたような…どこにしまったんだっけ？|text_cn=我想起来了，我以前好像攒了一笔“旅行资金”……放在哪了？|trans_en=Come to think of it, I think I saved some money for the journey... Where did I put it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_137_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=素敵な旋律…どなたの作品なんでしょうか？|text_cn=旋律可真好听啊……是出自哪位名家之手呢？|trans_en=That's a splendid tune... Which piece is that from?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_137_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩、わたしのこと、誇りに思っていただけていますか？|text_cn=前辈，你会为我感到骄傲吗？|trans_en=Mentor, are you proud of me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_137_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ先輩、私の手をしっかり握っていてください<br/>そうです、そのまま…ふふ。先輩の手、温かいです♪|text_cn=来，前辈，请牵住我的手。呵呵，没错，就是这样……前辈的手心，很温暖呢。|trans_en=Mentor, hold my hand tightly, please.<br/>That's it, just like this... Hehe. Your hand is so warm♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_137_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者の生活は、思っていたよりも大変なことが多いです。でも…<br/>先輩がそばにいてくれるなら、どんな困難が立ちはだかろうと、わたしはがんばり続けますよ！|text_cn=旅人的生活，确实比我想象中辛苦许多……但有前辈陪在我身边，再难再累我也会坚持下去！|trans_en=The life of a Trekker is a lot harder than I imagined. But...<br/>As long as I have you by my side, Mentor, I can keep going on, no matter what challenges might stand in the way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_137_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩に出会えて、本当によかったです。巡遊者として必要な知識を教えてくださるだけでなく…<br/>いつだってわたしを支えて、励ましてくれて…<br/>えへへ、どうやって感謝を伝えればいいのか、わからないくらいです♪|text_cn=能遇见前辈，真是太好了。前辈不仅教会了我很多身为旅人的知识，还一直支持我、鼓励我……我都不知道该怎么感谢您才好呢？|trans_en=I'm so glad that I met you, Mentor. You not only teach me the necessary knowledge to be a Trekker...<br/>... But you are always there to support me and encourage me...<br/>Hehe... I don't even know how to thank you♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_137_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩の背中を追いかけて、追い越して…<br/>いつか先輩たちみんなを守れるような、立派な巡遊者になってみせます！|text_cn=我要努力跟上前辈的脚步，努力成为能保护前辈的人，努力变成超级厉害的旅人！|trans_en=I'll follow your footsteps and surpass you...<br/>And one day, I'll become a great Trekker, who can protect all of you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_137_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩とともに歩んだ道、冒険の記憶が、いまのわたしを形作っているんです！<br/>これから先もずーっと一緒に、この素敵な世界を冒険していきましょうね！|text_cn=我记得和前辈走过的每一条小路、经历过的每一次冒险。未来，我们也要一直在一起，一起探索这个有趣的世界！|trans_en=The path I walked beside you, Mentor, and the memories of our adventures... They're what shaped who I am today!<br/>Let's keep exploring this wonderful world together for many years to come!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_137_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁ…！巡遊者同士では、こういったものを贈りあうんですね！|text_cn=哇，这就是传说中的“旅人特产”吗？|trans_en=Whoa...! So Trekkers exchange gifts like this?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_137_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしてわたしの探していたものがわかったんですか！？ありがとうございます！|text_cn=前辈怎么知道我找它找了好久？太感谢你了！|trans_en=How did you know this was the thing I was searching for!? Thank you so much!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_137_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この贈り物…きっと先輩が、わたしのために真剣に選んでくれたものなんですよね…♪<br/>職人さんに専用の棚を注文して、大切に飾っておきますね！|text_cn=这份礼物，一定花了前辈很多心思吧……我要请工匠打造一个专门的展示柜，把前辈给我的礼物都收藏起来！|trans_en=This gift... Mentor... You must have chosen it carefully just for me, right...?<br/>I'll order a special shelf for this from a craftsman and place it in a good spot.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_137_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい！|text_cn=好！|trans_en=Yes!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_137_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=違います|text_cn=不对哦。|trans_en=You're mistaken.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_137_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Yes?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_137_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=はあ？|text_cn=这样吗？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_137_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…|text_cn=怎么会……|trans_en=Why...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_137_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁ…！|text_cn=哇——|trans_en=Wah...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_137_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメです！|text_cn=不可以！|trans_en=No!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_137_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=よかったぁ|text_cn=太好了！|trans_en=I'm glad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_137_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Hahh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_137_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしたんですか？|text_cn=发生什么事了？|trans_en=What's wrong?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_137_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつかきっと、1番の巡遊者になってみせます！|text_cn=我要成为最厉害的旅人！|trans_en=Someday, I'll definitely become the number one Trekker!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_137_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここはわたしが払うので、お金のことは気にせず楽しんでください|text_cn=今天的消费由我来买单，大家放心玩！|trans_en=I'm paying for this, so please have fun and don't mind the money.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_137_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここからここまでの商品、すべていただけますか？|text_cn=这个，这个，还有这个不要，剩下的都帮我装起来吧！|trans_en=Could I have all the merchandise from here to there, please?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_137_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_137_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=世界をじっくり観察するなら、望遠鏡は必須ですよ！|text_cn=想要更加清晰地观察这个世界，当然是使用望远镜啦！|trans_en=If you want to get a good look at the world, a trusty telescope is what you need!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_137_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…これがわたしの本気です！|text_cn=这就是，梦想的一击！|trans_en=Whew... Time to show you what I'm really made of!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_137_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=夢は…この手で掴みます！|text_cn=优雅前进，全力出击！|trans_en=My dreams... I'll make them a reality myself!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_137_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなところじゃ、終われない…|text_cn=冒险……还没结束……|trans_en=It can't ... end here...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_137_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたし…負けたくない…|text_cn=我不想……认输……|trans_en=I ... don't want to lose...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_137_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが伝説の『巡遊者の秘伝書』なんですか！？|text_cn=这就是传说中的“旅人秘籍”吗？|trans_en=Is this the legendary "Trekker's Secret Manual"?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_137_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが…わたしの力…！|text_cn=这就是……属于我的力量~|trans_en=This ... is my power...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_137_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=早く次の冒険に行きたいです！|text_cn=我已经在期待下一次的冒险了！|trans_en=I can't wait to get to the next adventure!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_137_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=全知全能の恩恵の神よ、わたしに力を貸してください！|text_cn=万能的恩赐之神，赐予我力量吧！|trans_en=O Almighty God of Grace, bless me with your power!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_137_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力で、今度はわたしがみんなを助けます|text_cn=被帮助着走到这里的我，现在也能帮助同伴了！|trans_en=I'm going to help everyone I can with what I've got.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_137_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者として必要な知識、いろいろ学んでいかないと！|text_cn=嗯，今天也要认真积累旅人的经验！|trans_en=To be a Trekker, there're a lot of things I need to learn!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_137_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=向こうで光っているのは…もしかして、祈願箱でしょうか！|text_cn=那边亮晶晶的……不会是宝物吧？|trans_en=That light over there... Is that a Wishing Box?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_137_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=塔の中の景色って、どこを切り取っても絵になりますよねぇ♪|text_cn=这里的景色很适合画下来。|trans_en=You could frame any view inside the Monolith, and it'd look like a work of art♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_137_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=近くにお土産を売っているお店はないでしょうか？|text_cn=不知道附近有没有卖纪念品的地方。|trans_en=Does there happen to be a store that sells souvenirs close by?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_137_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=本で読むのと実際に見るのとでは、全然違うんですね|text_cn=书上写的和亲眼见到的，真的完全不一样……|trans_en=Reading about it and seeing it for yourself are completely different things.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_137_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘前、恩恵の神様にお祈りすると、いいことがあるそうですよ！|text_cn=听说战斗前拜一拜恩赐之神，就会发生好事呢！|trans_en=If I pray to the God of Grace before a fight, good things will happen!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_137_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=来ました、未知なる星ノ塔！新たな冒険の始まりです！|text_cn=来吧！新的星塔，新的冒险！|trans_en=We arrived! The mysterious Monolith! It's the start of a new adventure!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_137_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしがまとめて支払うので、必要なものがあれば遠慮なく選んでくださいね|text_cn=有什么需要的吗？你尽管挑，我来买单！|trans_en=I'll be paying, so please feel free to choose anything you need.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_137_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先は長いですからね、このあたりで少し休みましょう|text_cn=好好休息一下吧，之后还要走很久呢。|trans_en=Since it's a ways away, let's rest a bit around here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_137_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごめんください。少々お時間よろしいでしょうか？|text_cn=失礼了，方便打扰您一下吗？|trans_en=Excuse me. Do you have a minute?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_137_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが巡遊者の方々の日常…勉強になります！|text_cn=这就是旅人每天都会经历的事吗？真了不起！|trans_en=So this is the daily life of a Trekker... I'll keep that in mind!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_137_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=冒険でしか味わえない感覚…とっても刺激的です|text_cn=刚才真刺激呀，这就是冒险的感觉吗！|trans_en=A feeling you can only experience on an adventure... It's such a thrill!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_137_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=訓練に付き合っていただき、ありがとうございました！|text_cn=谢谢你们陪我训练！|trans_en=Thank you very much for helping me train!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_137_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは巡遊者の歴史に刻まれる、大いなる勝利です！|text_cn=一场足以载入旅人史册的伟大胜利！|trans_en=This was a great victory that will forever be etched into the history of Trekkers!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_137_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=祝勝会をしませんか？食事の手配はおまかせください|text_cn=去吃顿大餐庆祝一下吧！我来给大家安排！|trans_en=Shall we have a victory celebration? Leave the catering to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_137_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=訓練が足りませんでした…|text_cn=我还是太不成熟了……|trans_en=My training wasn't enough...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_137_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もっと努力しないと…|text_cn=旅人之路漫漫，我还要继续努力…|trans_en=I need to try harder...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_137_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご一緒できて光栄です。よろしくお願いしますね！|text_cn=很荣幸与各位共事，请多指教！|trans_en=It's an honor to be on the team. I look forward to working with you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_137_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=新人という立場にあまえず、精いっぱいがんばります！|text_cn=虽然我还是新手，但绝不会拖后腿！|trans_en=I won't use being a rookie as an excuse. I'll give it my all!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_137_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=このトランクには、いろんなものが入っていますよ！|text_cn=我的箱子里什么都有哦~|trans_en=This case has all sorts of things in it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_137_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵の神様…どうかうまくいきますように！|text_cn=恩赐之神保佑，一切顺利！|trans_en=O God of Grace... Please let this go well!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_137_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=Yostar|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_137_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=先輩、チョコをどうぞ！その…やはり手作りのほうが気持ちが伝わると思いまして…<br/>で、ですがもしお口にあわなかったときは、遠慮なくおっしゃってください！<br/>そのときは、プロのパティシエにお願いして、先輩の好みにあわせて作っていただきますから！|text_cn=前辈，这是巧克力！那个，我想了很久，还是觉得自己做的更能体现我的心意……<br/>啊、没事的，前辈要是觉得味道不好，我这里还准备了十个专业的甜点师，想吃什么口味他们现场给您做！|trans_en=Here you go, Mentor! Well... I thought homemade chocolate would really convey my feelings better...<br/>B-But if the taste doesn't suit you, don't hesitate to let me know!<br/>If so, I can hire a professional pastry chef to make something to your liking!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_137_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=メリークリスマス、先輩！こんな素敵な日は、みんなで集まってたのしく過ごさないと！<br/>というわけで、会場と食事の手配は済んでいますから、迎えが来たら、みんなで移動しましょう！|text_cn=前辈，雪愿节快乐！这样的节日，就该把烦恼都放到一边，和大家一起热热闹闹地庆祝才对。<br/>我已经预定好了节日会场，准备了好吃的甜点、热饮……<br/>还有符合节日气氛的装饰。对了！我还准备了接送大家的车，一会儿就到~|trans_en=Happy Snowish Festival, Mentor! A wonderful day like this should be spent with everyone!<br/>With that said, I have prepared the event space and meals already, so when you're ready, let's head out together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_137_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとうございます、先輩！<br/>新しい1年を迎えるにあたり、早速今年の冒険の計画を立ててみてはいかがでしょう？|text_cn=又是一年新的开始！呵呵，前辈，接下来是不是该制定今年的冒险计划了呢？|trans_en=Happy New Year, Mentor!<br/>As we embrace the New Year, why don't we start planning this year's adventure itinerary right now?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_137_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日が近づいてくると、毎年決まって考えてしまうことがありまして<br/>来年の自分は、たくさんのことを経験して、いまより巡遊者らしくなれているのかな…と|text_cn=前辈，今天是我的生日……<br/>每到这种时候，我都会忍不住去想，明年的今天，我会不会已经看到了更多的风景？<br/>学会了更多的东西了，是不是比现在更像真正的旅人了呢？|trans_en=Whenever my birthday comes around, I always catch myself wondering...<br/>Will I have enough experience next year to become more of a Trekker than I am now?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_137_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_137_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとうございます！<br/>今日という日が最高の1日になるよう、わたしが全力でおもてなししますから！<br/>先輩は、思う存分たのしんでくださいね！|text_cn=前辈，生日快乐！为了今天，我认真准备了很久。礼物也好，蛋糕也好，之后的安排也好，我都想尽量准备到最好……<br/>这可是前辈的生日，一定要好好庆祝啊！|trans_en=Happy Birthday!<br/>I'm going to make sure that today is the best day ever for you.<br/>So Mentor, please enjoy today as much as you want!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_139_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=最近は冷えてきたから、風邪を引かないように温かい格好をするのよ？|text_cn=最近几天有些降温了，记得多穿一点衣服，不要着凉了哦。|trans_en=It's been getting chilly. Make sure you bundle up so you don't catch a cold.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_139_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=最近帰りが遅いけど、あんまり心配かける子は、今度から迎えに行くからね？|text_cn=你最近回来得越来越晚了。再这样下去，我可要亲自去接你了。|trans_en=You've been getting home late, and since you're worrying me so much, I'm going to start coming to pick you up, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_139_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キッチンで爆発音が聞こえた？うふふふ…やだもう、あなたの聞き間違いよ<br/>ほらほら、そんなことより朝食にしましょう♪|text_cn=厨房的爆炸声……？你听错了，来，先吃早饭吧。|trans_en=What, you heard an explosion in the kitchen? Hehe... No way. I think you're hearing things.<br/>Anyway, enough of that. Let's have some breakfast ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_139_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あとでお掃除しに行くけど…もちろんあなたも手伝ってくれるわよね？|text_cn=我等会儿准备去打扫卫生，你愿意来帮忙吗？|trans_en=I'm going to go clean up in a bit... Of course you'll help me, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_139_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お帰りなさい、今日もがんばったのね。うふふ、えらい、えらい♡<br/>いま温かいお茶を淹れてくるから、少し待っていてね|text_cn=欢迎回来，忙碌了一天，你一定累坏了吧，我去给你倒杯热茶，有安神效果哦。|trans_en=Welcome back! You worked really hard today, didn't you? Hehe... good job, good job ♥<br/>Wait a bit while I go make some hot tea for you, alright?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_139_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=子どもたちのお世話をしていると、それはもちろん大変なこともあるけど…<br/>毎日すくすくと成長していくところを見ていると<br/>そんな苦労が、すべて報われるような気持ちになるの♪|text_cn=只要看着那些孩子一天天长大，我就觉得，再辛苦也值得。|trans_en=Of course there are many challenges when taking care of kids...<br/>But when I see them growing up so well day by day...<br/>Feels like every bit of that hardship is worth it ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_139_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうして孤児院の院長が、武器をたくさん持ち歩くのか？<br/>うふふ。子どもたちを護るためだもの、当然のことよ♪|text_cn=身为孤儿院的院长，为了保护那些孩子，随身带着一堆防身的东西……也很合理吧。|trans_en=Why does the director of the orphanage carry tons of weapons on the job?<br/>Heheh. To protect the kids, of course ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_139_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=結婚式の『マネごと』とはいえ、お嫁さんになるっていう夢を叶えてくれたんだもの<br/>ふふ、それだけで十分すぎるくらいうれしいわ。ありがとう、魔王さん♪|text_cn=虽然只是“婚礼游戏”……可你还是帮我实现了成为新娘的愿望，我已经很满足了。谢谢你，魔王。|trans_en=Although it's only a make-believe wedding, you fulfilled my dream of becoming a bride.<br/>Hehe, with that, I'm more than satisfied. Thank you, Boss♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_139_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今度は飛ばされないように干さないと…って、あら？ジッと見つめて、どうしたの？<br/>え？もう少しこのままがいい？ふふ、もう…しょうがないわね♪<br/>それじゃあ、あとちょっとだけ花嫁さんの気分を味わわせてもらおうかしら♡|text_cn=床单也差不多该挂回去了……嗯？你还想再看一会儿？<br/>真是的……那就满足你的愿望，再这样待一会儿吧。|trans_en=Gotta hang it tight so that it doesn't fly off again… Eh? Why are you staring? What's wrong?<br/>Huh? You want me to stay like this for a little longer? Hehe… I guess I got no choice ♪<br/>Then… Let me have a taste of what it's like to be a bride for a bit longer ♥}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_139_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=エリーお姉さん？うふふ、魔王さんったら、照れちゃってかわいい♪<br/>でもアヤメたちの仲間なんだし、あなたも遠慮しないでエリーママって呼んでいいのよ？|text_cn=阿姨？魔王，孤儿院的孩子们都是喊我艾蕾妈妈的哦，你千万别跟那三个孩子学坏了……<br/>至于阿姨……到底是在叫谁呢？|trans_en="Miss Allie"? Hehe... You're so cute when you get all shy, Boss ♪<br/>But, since you're a friend of Iris and the others, you can call me Mom, too~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_139_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=レシピには粗塩を少々…醤油を適量って書いてあるけど…<br/>少々と適量って、具体的にはどれくらいの量を指しているのかしら？<br/>え？アヤメも同じことを言っていたの？|text_cn=嗯……书上说粗盐少许，酱油适量……少许和适量……到底是多少呢……？<br/>欸？你说鸢尾也问过一样的问题？|trans_en=For this recipe, a little bit of salt... But it says to add soy sauce "as much as needed."<br/>A little bit and as much as needed... How much is that referring to exactly?<br/>Huh? Iris said the same thing too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_139_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日の依頼からの帰り道、おいしそうなお菓子を見かけたから、あなたの分も買ってきたの<br/>はい、食べさせてあげるから、あ～んして？|text_cn=今天的委托很顺利。回来的路上看见有卖点心的，我就顺手给你带了些~<br/>来，张嘴——|trans_en=On the way home from today's commission, I found some delicious-looking sweets. So I bought you some too.<br/>Here, I'll feed you. Say ahh~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_139_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=私が家事をしようとすると、子どもたちがいっせいに集まってきて、仕事を持っていっちゃうの<br/>うふふ、やさしい子に育ってくれて、ママはうれしいわ♪|text_cn=每当我要做家务的时候，孩子们都会围过来，从我手上把活抢走……他们真懂事啊，妈妈我好欣慰。|trans_en=Whenever I start doing housework, the kids all gather together and take me away from work.<br/>Hehe... I'm so happy they've grown up to be such kind kids ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_139_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミラーシュは昼と夜で寒暖差が激しいから、いくら暑くても、防寒着は忘れず持っていってね？|text_cn=米拉什的昼夜温差很大，就算白天再热，出门时也要记得带件保暖的衣服哦。|trans_en=There's a sharp difference in temperature between day and night at Mirage. No matter how hot it is, don't forget to bring some warm clothes, alright?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_139_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=お掃除はお部屋をきれいにするためにするはずなのに…<br/>私がやると、どうしてお掃除の前よりもお部屋が散らかっちゃうのかしら…|text_cn=打扫原本应该是让房间变整洁的……对吧？可为什么到了我这，反而越收拾越乱呢……|trans_en=Cleaning is supposed to make the room look nice and neat...<br/>How come when I do it, the room ends up even messier than before I started...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_139_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=町の外に行っても、ちゃんと水分補給をして、規則正しい生活をして、疲れたときは休むこと<br/>いい？絶対に無理をしちゃダメよ？|text_cn=出门在外，要多喝水，按时吃饭，累了就要休息，千万不要勉强哦~|trans_en=Even when you're outside of town, make sure to stay hydrated, maintain a regular routine, and rest when tired.<br/>Okay?And don't push yourself too hard.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_139_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=子どもたちには『ママ』って呼んでもらっているけど…<br/>実際には結婚なんてしていないし、そもそも誰かを好きになったこともないんだから<br/>でもいいの。あの子たちが私を本当のお母さんのように慕ってくれるのは、すごくうれしいから|text_cn=别看孩子们都叫我妈妈，我还很年轻哦，连恋爱都没谈过呢……<br/>不过，本来就是我让他们这么叫我的，能被他们这样依赖着，我觉得很满足。|trans_en=The kids call me "Mom" but...<br/>I'm not actually married, nor have I fallen for someone before.<br/>But that's fine. The fact that they adore me like their real mother makes me so happy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_139_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=孤児院を開いたばかりの頃は、子どもたちを守ることくらい簡単だって思っていたの<br/>でもね、守るという言葉にはお料理やお掃除で、あの子たちを支えるという意味もあって…<br/>ふふ。毎日苦労は絶えないけど、逆にみんながお手伝いしてくれるおかげで、ここまで続けられたわ|text_cn=我原本以为顾好一个孤儿院不是什么难事，可真到做的时候，不管是做饭还是打扫……<br/>都出了不少意外……多亏了有大家的帮忙，让我能坚持下来。|trans_en=Around the time when the orphanage first opened, I thought looking after the kids would be easy.<br/>But looking after them also means cooking and cleaning...<br/>Hehe. The struggle never stops, but thanks to everyone helping out, I've been able to keep this up so far.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_139_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お掃除をするとき、どうしていつも失敗しちゃうのか、真剣に考えてみたんだけど…<br/>きれいに片づけなきゃって思った途端、体が無意識に本気を出していることに気づいたの<br/>家事をするときの力加減ってとっても難しいわ…|text_cn=我认真想过了……打扫房间总是出问题，可能是因为我太想把房间收拾得干净整洁，一不小心就用力过头了……<br/>……看来做家务的时候，还是要温柔一点呢。|trans_en=I seriously tried to figure out why I always mess up whenever I clean...<br/>I realized that the moment I thought, "I have to tidy everything up," my body unconsciously went all out on its own.<br/>It's really hard to control my strength when doing housework...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_139_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=帰りたいと思う場所があって、帰りを待っていてくれる人がいれば、自然とそこが家になるの<br/>だからあなたも…たまにでもいいから、私たちの家に帰ってきてね？|text_cn=在我看来，家并没有什么固定的形式。只要有人愿意回来，有人愿意留下，慢慢地，就会有家的样子了~<br/>所以，你也要……常回家看看啊。|trans_en=If there's a place you want to go back to, and someone's there waiting for you, then that place naturally becomes your home.<br/>You too... Come home to us sometimes, okay? Even if it's only now and then.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_139_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=セイナは孤児院から巣立っていった頃よりも、だいぶ頼もしくなったわね<br/>でもパチパチメテオが好きなところは変わっていないみたいだし<br/>うふふ、今度差し入れに持っていってあげたら、よろこんでくれるかしら？|text_cn=尘沙比离开孤儿院时看起来可靠了不少，做的饭也更好吃了……<br/>不过，她还是这么爱喝能量沛沛……下次我也给她带几瓶吧，她一定会很开心的。|trans_en=Noya has become so much more dependable than she was when she left the orphanage.<br/>Though it seems like she hasn't given up Pep Pep Juice.<br/>Hehe... I wonder if she'd like it if I brought some as a treat next time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_139_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたたちとよく一緒にいる黒ネコは、コハクが飼っているの？<br/>そう、あの子も空白旅団の仲間で名前はクロっていうのね<br/>そういうことなら、クロもこの孤児院に歓迎するって伝えておいてくれる？|text_cn=那只一直跟着你们的黑猫，是琥珀养的吗？它叫小黑，是你们的伙伴……？<br/>这样啊，我明白了。只要它愿意，孤儿院也可以是它的家哦。|trans_en=That black cat who's always with you all... Does Amber take care of it?<br/>Yes, that kid is also a member of the New Star Guild who goes by the name Inky.<br/>So, could you let Inky know that she's welcome at the orphanage too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_139_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメは臆病な子だったから、独り立ちしたあと、うまくやっていけるか心配だったけど…<br/>でもいまはセイナもコハクもいるし、あなたもいる<br/>だからきっと、もう私があれこれ心配する必要はないのかもしれないわね|text_cn=鸢尾……她一直是我最放心不下的孩子。<br/>不过现在，她的身边有尘沙和琥珀，还有你这么可靠的同伴，我好像也没什么可担心的了。|trans_en=Iris was a very skittish kid, so I worried if she would be alright after becoming independent...<br/>But because Noya, Amber, and you are there...<br/>I probably don't have to worry about that anymore.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_139_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=谷風家政で家事の講習会を開いてくれないかしら…？<br/>もし開いてくれるなら、絶対に申し込むわ！|text_cn=谷风家政啊……不知道她们会不会开设一些家政课程呢？如果有的话，我一定会报名参加的。|trans_en=I wonder if Goodwind Homecare would be willing to hold a housework training session...<br/>If they do, I'll definitely sign up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_139_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=劇団白猫のことはよく知らないのに…<br/>一緒に戦っていると、どこか懐かしい気持ちになるのはどうしてかしら…？|text_cn=白猫剧团啊……她们还是和以前一样，虽然偶尔会有些乱来，但依然是值得信赖的伙伴。|trans_en=I don't know the White Cat Troupe that well...<br/>But why do I feel so nostalgic when we fight together...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_139_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ、どうしたの？ママにあまえたいのかしら？|text_cn=嗯？是有什么要紧的事情吗？|trans_en=Hehe... What's the matter? Are you looking for some attention from Mommy?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_139_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダ、ダメよ。子どもたちが見ているもの…|text_cn=别这样，孩子们还在看着呢……|trans_en=S-Stop it. The kids are watching...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_139_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんなに忙しくても、きちんと3食ごはんを食べることいい？|text_cn=再忙不要忘记吃饭哦。|trans_en=No matter how busy you are, make sure to eat three proper meals a day. Okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_139_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら、眠くなっちゃった？ふふ、それなら子守唄でも歌ってあげましょうか？|text_cn=想听我给你唱摇篮曲吗？|trans_en=Oh, are you sleepy? Hehe, then how about I sing you a lullaby?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_139_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ…私も疲れちゃったし…一緒にお昼寝しようかしら|text_cn=呼……我也累了，一起休息会儿吧……|trans_en=Phew... I'm also exhausted... Shall we take a nap together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_139_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私はエリー。ヒナギクの家という孤児院の院長をしているの<br/>よければこれからは、ここを自分の家だと思ってちょうだい<br/>新しい家族が増えたって、きっと子どもたちもよろこぶはずよ♪|text_cn=我是艾蕾，雏菊孤儿院的院长。如果你愿意，可以把这里当作暂时歇脚的地方。要是能陪孩子们一起玩一会儿，大家一定会很高兴的。|trans_en=I'm Allie, the director of Daisy Orphanage.<br/>If you don't mind, please think of this place as your home.<br/>I’m sure the kids will be happy to have a new family member ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_139_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また会えたわね。元気にしていたかしら？<br/>ちゃんとごはんは食べてる？困っていることはない？|text_cn=又见面了，这段时间你过得怎么样？有按时吃饭吗？|trans_en=We meet again. How are you doing?<br/>Have you been eating well? Is there anything that's troubling you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_139_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これでいまより家事がうまくなる……かも？|text_cn=这样一来，说不定连做家务也能更顺利了。|trans_en=And now I can handle housework better… I think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_139_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力で、子どもたちを守ってみせるわ|text_cn=我会用这份力量保护好每一个孩子的~|trans_en=With this power, I will protect the kids no matter what.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_139_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=小さい頃は、自分たちだけの力じゃなにもできなかったのに…<br/>いまではお互いに支えあって、立派に生活しているんだもの。ふふ、感慨深いわ♪|text_cn=那时她们还什么都不会呢，现在都已经能照顾彼此了……真让人欣慰。|trans_en=When we were little, we really couldn't do much of anything... and yet...<br/>We've supported each other ever since and made a fine livelihood. Heh... Brings back memories ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_139_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お掃除しながら聴くのに、ちょうどよさそうね♪|text_cn=真是首适合边打扫边听的音乐啊~|trans_en=This seems to be the perfect thing to listen to while cleaning ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_139_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私のかわいい子どもたちも、魔王さんも、みーんなまとめてママが守ってあげるわ♡|text_cn=孤儿院的孩子们……还有魔王，就由我来守护！|trans_en=My little darlings and Boss as well, Mom's going to protect you all ♥}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_139_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こうして向かい合っていると、なんだか花嫁さんのヴェールを上げているみたいで緊張するわ…|text_cn=现在这样……就像是在掀开新娘的头纱……|trans_en=Facing you like this, feels like I'm lifting up a bride's veil. It's making me feel rather nervous...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_139_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつもありがとう。魔王さんがお手伝いに来てくれるおかげで、すごく助かっているわ|text_cn=魔王隔三差五就会来孤儿院帮忙，让我轻松了不少，真是太感谢了~|trans_en=Thank you, as always, Boss, for coming to my aid. You really helped me out here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_139_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当のことを言うとね、はじめのうちはあなたを信用していなかったの<br/>でも一緒に過ごしているうちに、少しずつあなたという人を理解して…<br/>いまなら、どうしてあの子たちがあなたを頼りにしているか、私にもわかるような気がするわ|text_cn=老实说，一开始我对你还是有些顾虑的。可相处下来之后，我慢慢发现，你确实是个值得信赖的人。<br/>现在，我也能理解，那些孩子为什么会这么依赖你了。|trans_en=To be honest, I didn't trust you at first.<br/>But as we spent more and more time together, I have gotten to know you better.<br/>Now, I think I understand why those kids rely on you so much.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_139_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたは他の人の幸せばかり考えて、自分のことは後回しにしがちでしょう？<br/>だからね、これからは私があなたのお世話をしようと思うの。どうかしら？|text_cn=你平时总是为其他人奔波，却对自己的事不上心……所以之后就由我来照顾你，好吗？|trans_en=You tend to care about other people's happiness before your own, right?<br/>That's why I want to take care of you from now on. What do you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_139_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=最高級のおもてなしはできないかもしれないけど…<br/>ふかふかのお布団と、温かいごはんを用意しておくから<br/>疲れたときは、遠慮しないでいつでも帰ってきてね|text_cn=要是你累了，就回我这里休息一下吧。我会替你准备好热腾腾的饭菜，也会把你换下来的衣服洗干净。<br/>或许算不上多丰盛周到，但至少有点家的味道。|trans_en=I might not be able to offer the finest hospitality, but...<br/>I'll have a fluffy futon and a warm meal ready for you.<br/>When you're tired, don't hesitate to come home, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_139_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう。あなたの気持ち、ありがたく受け取らせてもらうわね|text_cn=谢谢你的好意，我就收下啦~|trans_en=Thank you. I really appreciate this kind gesture.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_139_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=助かるわ。これ、ちょうどほしいと思っていたのよ。ありがとう|text_cn=太感谢了！我最近正好需要它！|trans_en=This really helps. I was just thinking I needed this. Thank you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_139_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんな素敵なものを…私に？誰かに大切に想ってもらうのってこんな感じなのね…ありがとう|text_cn=好精致的礼物啊……这是送给我的吗？呵呵，这就是被人放在心上的感觉吗？|trans_en=Something this lovely... For me? So this is what it feels like to be cherished by someone... Thank you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_139_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=はーい|text_cn=好~|trans_en=Okay~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_139_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダーメ|text_cn=不可以哦~|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_139_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら？|text_cn=怎么了？|trans_en=What?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_139_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=え…|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Huh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_139_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうして…|text_cn=没关系的。|trans_en=Why...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_139_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=あらあら|text_cn=哎呀！|trans_en=Oh my!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_139_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう|text_cn=……够了。|trans_en=Hmphf...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_139_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふ|text_cn=真好啊~|trans_en=Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_139_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Hah...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_139_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=大丈夫？ママが慰めてあげるから、元気出して？|text_cn=你看起来没什么精神……|trans_en=Are you okay? Mom's here for you, so cheer up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_139_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=お外に行くときは、気をつけるのよ？|text_cn=出门要小心哦。|trans_en=Be careful when you go out, alright?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_139_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私のかわいい子どもたちに手を出したら…うふふふ…ただじゃおかないわよ？|text_cn=如果有人想要对孩子们图谋不轨的话……可以试试看呢~|trans_en=If you lay a finger on my precious kids... Hehehe... I'll make you regret it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_139_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメでしょ。好き嫌いをしていたら、大きくなれないわよ？|text_cn=……真是的，不可以挑食哦~|trans_en=This won't do. If you're this picky, you won't grow up to be big and strong.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_139_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_139_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい子でお留守番していてね|text_cn=要乖乖的哦~|trans_en=Be a good kid and watch the house while I'm away.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_139_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=きつーいお仕置きが必要みたいね？|text_cn=呵呵，看来……要好好教育一下你们了呢~|trans_en=Looks like you need a harsh punishment.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_139_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ…本気でいくわね。|text_cn=是时候拿出真本事了，呵呵……|trans_en=Hehe... Time to get serious.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_139_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなを、守らないと…|text_cn=我必须保护孩子们……|trans_en=I must ... protect everyone...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_139_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=早く、逃げて…|text_cn=别管我……快走……|trans_en=Hurry, get out of here...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_139_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは役に立ちそうね|text_cn=嗯，这个看起来很有用。|trans_en=This looks useful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_139_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=言うことを聞かない悪い子は…これでお仕置きよ♪|text_cn=正好用来管教不听话的坏孩子。|trans_en=Naughty kids who don't listen... Here's your punishment ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_139_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=おいしいごはんを作る力はないのかしら…|text_cn=有没有能让饭菜变得好吃的力量呢？|trans_en=I wonder if I just don't have what it takes to cook a good meal...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_139_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私はいつだって、みんなの味方よ|text_cn=我一定会照顾好你们的。|trans_en=I'll always be on your side, no matter what.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_139_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつでも私に頼ってね？|text_cn=大家就交给我照看吧。|trans_en=You can always count on me, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_139_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=洗濯物を干したまま来ちゃったから、急いで終わらせないと|text_cn=晾在外面的衣服还没收回来呢，得抓紧时间了。|trans_en=I left the laundry hanging out, so I need to hurry and finish this up.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_139_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの子たち、きちんとお留守番できているかしら？|text_cn=希望在我外出的时候，孩子们都能照顾好自己……|trans_en=I wonder if those kids are behaving themselves while I'm gone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_139_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=はーい、みんなついてきて|text_cn=好了，我们出发吧。|trans_en=Okay, everyone, follow me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_139_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=スープを火にかけたままだったような…たしかに火は消したわよね？|text_cn=我好像把汤留在灶台上了……应该关火了吧。|trans_en=Did I leave the soup on the stove...? No, surely I turned off the heat, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_139_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=安心して。子どもたちを守るように、みんなのことも守るから|text_cn=我会像保护孩子们一样，保护大家的。|trans_en=Relax. I'll protect you all just like I protect my kids.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_139_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今回は、ちょっとだけ本気出しちゃおうかしら|text_cn=看来这次要认真一些了。|trans_en=Maybe I should go all out this time, just a little.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_139_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは…なんの部屋かしら？みんな、迷子にならないようにちゃーんとついてきてね|text_cn=是没见过的房间……都跟紧点，千万不要走丢了！|trans_en=What is this room...? Everyone, keep close to me so you don't get lost!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_139_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お金って、いざ必要になるときほど、足りないものなのよね…|text_cn=唉，钱这种东西啊，真到了要用的时候，总嫌不够。|trans_en=Money always seems to fall short right when you need it most...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_139_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はーい、ここで少しだけ休憩しましょうか|text_cn=好~一起休息会儿吧。|trans_en=Okay, let's just take a quick break over here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_139_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=知らない人にやたらと話しかけちゃ…え、あなたの知り合い？うふふふふふ…|text_cn=不要和陌生人说话……欸？是你的熟人吗？|trans_en=Now, don't go talking to strangers all willy-nilly... Oh, you know them? Hehehe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_139_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=きれいに片づいたし、次の階層に行きましょうか|text_cn=都打扫干净了，我们去下一层吧。|trans_en=Everything's nicely cleaned up. Shall we move on to the next level?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_139_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほらほら、襟が乱れているわよ？直してあげるから、ジッとして|text_cn=领子歪了，来，我帮你整理下。|trans_en=Oh dear, your collar's all out of whack. I'll fix it for you—hold still.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_139_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふ、今日は順調ね♪|text_cn=呵呵，今天还挺顺利的~|trans_en=Hehe, so far so good ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_139_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=それじゃ、帰ってごはんにしましょうか♪|text_cn=好啦~准备回家吃饭了~|trans_en=Well then, head back home and eat, shall we ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_139_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんな、ケガはしていないかしら？|text_cn=大家都没受伤吧？|trans_en=Is everyone okay? Nobody hurt?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_139_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=体勢を立て直して、次こそ勝ちましょう！|text_cn=让我们重整旗鼓，再试一次吧！|trans_en=Let's pick ourselves up and win the next one!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_139_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごめんなさい。みんなの失敗は、私の責任よ|text_cn=抱歉，让大家失望了……|trans_en=I'm sorry. This one is on me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_139_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=見た目で判断すると、痛い目を見るわよ？|text_cn=以貌取人，可是会吃苦头的，呵呵。|trans_en=If you judge me by appearance, you're going to regret it, you know?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_139_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=すぐに終わらせるから、心配いらないわ|text_cn=别担心，很快就结束了~呵呵。|trans_en=Don't worry. This won't take long.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_139_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=うふふ、久しぶりに本気でいこうかしら♪|text_cn=是该活动一下筋骨了呢。对吧？|trans_en=Hehe... Maybe I should go all out like I used to ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_139_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=言うことを聞かない悪い子はどこかしら？|text_cn=看来，有孩子不听话呢~呵呵。|trans_en=Where are those naughty kids who don't listen?}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_139_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=Yostar|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_139_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いま、少しいいかしら？実はあなたに渡したいものがあって…<br/>ほら、今日はバレンタインでしょ？だからがんばって、手作りのチョコを用意してみたの<br/>私にしてはうまくできたほうだと思うから…ぜひ食べてもらえるとうれしいわ|text_cn=今天我也想稍微任性一点……把你的时间留给我，可以吗？当然，我也准备了给你的礼物。<br/>我想着既然要送给你，还是亲手做会更有诚意一些，所以是从研磨可可豆开始……<br/>收下吧……啊，但是不要一次性吃太多哦。|trans_en=Do you have a moment to spare? I actually have something I want to give to you...<br/>Today is Lovers' Day, you know? That's why I applied myself and made some chocolate.<br/>Personally, I think it turned out pretty well, so... I'd be really happy if you'd try them.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_139_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=庭にあるクリスマスツリーはどうしたのかって？<br/>あれはね、ペンキを塗った木の板を組み合わせて、私が自分で作ったのよ♪<br/>ほらほら、外は冷えるから、中で子どもたちと一緒にケーキを食べましょう|text_cn=院子里的雪愿树是从哪来的？那个啊……是我用木板和油漆做的假雪愿树。<br/>怎么样，看起来跟真的一样吧？<br/>好啦，你也别在外面站着了，快进屋和孩子们一起过节吧~|trans_en=What's with the Snowish tree in the yard, you ask?<br/>That's a painted wooden board that I put together myself ♪<br/>Now hurry up, it's getting cold outside. Let's head inside and have cakes with the kids.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_139_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう。え、今年の抱負？それはもちろん――<br/>子どもたちが楽しく健やかに過ごせるように、家事の腕を上達させることよ<br/>上達したら魔王さんのお世話もしてあげるから、応援よろしくね？|text_cn=不知不觉又过了一年呢……希望在新的一年里，这些孩子们都能健康快乐，也希望自己的家务能力能进一步提升……<br/>要是变得更擅长家务事了，我也能帮上你更多。你可要给我加油哦。|trans_en=Happy New Year. Huh, my resolution for the new year?That is of course...<br/>To improve my housekeeping skills so I can make sure that the kids enjoy a happy and healthy life together.<br/>Once I improve, I can take care of Boss too. Wish me luck, will you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_139_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら、このケーキは…あなたが子どもたちと一緒に作ってくれたの？<br/>ふふ。ここ数日、あの子たちがずっとそわそわしていると思ったら、そういうことだったのね<br/>これ以上ないくらい、最高のプレゼントだわ魔王さん、ありがとう|text_cn=这是给我的生日蛋糕？而且，还是你和孩子们一起做的？<br/>呵呵，你们瞒得可真好……难怪这几天一直神神秘秘的。谢谢你们，这真是最好的生日礼物了。|trans_en=Oh, you made this with the kids for me?<br/>Hehe. They have been fidgety these days, so I knew something was up.<br/>There isn't a present that could top this. Thank you so much, Boss.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_139_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_139_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとう、魔王さん。私にはお裁縫くらいしか取り柄がないけど…<br/>プレゼントに手作りの服を作ってみたから、よければ着てくれるとうれしいわ|text_cn=生日快乐，魔王！这是给你的生日礼物，是我亲手做的衣服，呵呵，这也是我难得擅长的事了……<br/>我特地做得宽松了些，穿着应该会更舒服。要记得穿哦？|trans_en=Happy Birthday, Boss. The only thing I'm good at is sewing, so...<br/>I tried making handmade clothes for you. I'd love it if you'd try this on.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc139_FirstAnniversary_day06_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc139_FirstAnniversary_day06_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの子たちとの旅が始まってから、もう1年になるのね<br/>ここまでいろいろとお世話になったみたいだし、みんなのママとして、お礼を言うわ<br/>これから先も大変なことがあるでしょうけど、この孤児院を自分の家だと思って、そして…<br/>私を本当のママだと思って、疲れたときは遠慮しないでいつでも帰ってらっしゃい|text_cn=不知不觉，你和那些孩子们一起踏上旅途，已经有一年了呢。<br/>这一年来，大家似乎都受了你不少照顾。作为院长……也作为那些孩子们的“妈妈”，我真的很感谢你。<br/>往后的路上，恐怕还会遇到很多辛苦的事……但不管发生什么，你都可以把这里当成自己的家。<br/>还有我也……如果你愿意，也可以像依赖妈妈那样依赖我哦。要是累了，随时都欢迎你回来。|trans_en=It's been a year since the kids and I started our journey.<br/>You've been taking such good care of them all this time. As their Mom, I can't thank you enough.<br/>There's going to be hard times ahead of us, but please think of this orphanage as your home, and...<br/>Think of me as your real mother. Whenever you need a place to rest, don't hesitate to come home.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_141_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は気分がよいからな。そなたの似顔絵を描いてやろう。そこから動くでないぞ|text_cn=你在这啊，别动，我给你画张像，保证像个人。|trans_en=I'm in a good mood today. I shall draw you a portrait. Now hold still!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_141_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=遊びに行くなら連れていけ！わらわを置いて行くなど、言語道断じゃ！|text_cn=你要去哪？出去玩竟然不带我？|trans_en=If you're going out to play, take me with you! Leaving me behind would be unforgivable!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_141_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはようなのじゃ～…ところで、朝ごはんはまだかのう？|text_cn=早啊……还有早餐吗？|trans_en=Good morning. Sooo ... is breakfast ready yet?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_141_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昼ごはんは…！なに？また魚じゃと？|text_cn=午饭吃什么？呃、怎么又吃鱼？|trans_en=Lunch time! Wait, fish again!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_141_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夜は好かんのじゃ。暗くなると、オバケがどこからともなく…|text_cn=我讨厌夜晚，太阳下山之后，就会有魑魅魍魉冒出来……|trans_en=I hate nighttime. When it gets dark, ghosts just start popping up out of nowhere...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_141_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんじゃ？なにか面白いことでもあるのか？|text_cn=嗯？有热闹？在哪在哪？？|trans_en=Huh? Something amusing going on?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_141_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふん！わらわのしっぽに見とれておるな？|text_cn=你在盯着什么呢……啊？没见过我这么帅气的尾巴吗？|trans_en=Heh! I caught you staring at my tail, didn't I?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_141_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うひゃあ！？しっぽを引っ張るな！！びっくりするじゃろ！|text_cn=哇！别突然拽我尾巴啊！！吓死我了！|trans_en=Eeep!? Don't pull my tail! That's a good way to get burned!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_141_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=う、上を見るでないぞ。見たらしっぽではたいてやるからな！|text_cn=喂……要是抬头乱看的话你就死定了。|trans_en=D-Don't look up! If you do, I'll swat you with my tail!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_141_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わらわの筆を知らんか？いや、大きい方ではなく、いつも霊符の修練に使っておるやつじゃ|text_cn=你看到我的毛笔了吗？呃……我没在说这个大的，是问平时练习画符用的那支！|trans_en=Have you seen my brush?<br/>No, not the big one, the one I use for talisman practice!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_141_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いま描いてるのは火の霊符でな、敵に投げると…<br/>な、落書きぃ！？貴様、もういっぺん言ってみるのじゃ！|text_cn=我画的这个是火符，用的时候只要扔出去……哈？！你说我画得像只小鸡？！你再说一次！？|trans_en=I'm drawing a fire talisman. If you throw it at enemies, it—<br/>What? A DOODLE!? Say that again, I dare you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_141_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんじゃ、わらわは玄師じゃぞ。経くらい普通に唱えられるわ|text_cn=干嘛……作为玄师念诵经文有什么问题吗？|trans_en=Hey now, I am a proper Xuan Shi. Of course I can chant scriptures!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_141_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=画仙紙は…おお、あったあった。これでやっと絵を描け…ん？墨はどこにいったのじゃ？|text_cn=我的宣纸去哪了……啊，找到了，这样的话东西就齐了……嗯？我墨水呢？我刚拿的这么大一瓶墨水呢？|trans_en=Rice paper, rice paper ... ah, found it! Now I can FINALLY start.<br/>... Wait, where did my ink go?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_141_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=何度言えばわかる！わらわはほんの少～しだけ暗いのが苦手なだけじゃ！<br/>べ、別にオバケなど関係ないわ！|text_cn=要我说多少次，我只是有一点点、一点点点点怕黑而已，绝对绝对绝对！没有怕鬼！|trans_en=How many times must I say it!? I'm just a tiny bit nervous about the dark, that's all!<br/>It has nothing to do with ghosts!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_141_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=うーん…前に教わった霊符、どう描くんじゃったかの…師匠、この霊符――<br/>はっ！？ち、違うぞ！いまのは魔王と師匠を呼び間違えたわけではなく…！|text_cn=唔……之前师父教我的“火焰山头往家搬”符是怎么画来着？<br/>师父——这个符……啊？不、不是……那个……刚刚是习惯还没改过来，不是在喊你师父！|trans_en=Hmm... How do you draw this talisman again?<br/>Master—uh, I mean Boss!<br/>And no, that wasn't a slip-up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_141_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そ、そなたの後ろの茂み、動いておらぬか？<br/>ダ、ダメじゃ、そっちに行ったら――え、ネコ？よかったぁ～…|text_cn=那个，你后面是不是有什么东西在动……呜哇你你不要过去万一……啊？原来是树叶啊。|trans_en=H-Hey, is that bush behind you moving!?<br/>D-Don't go over there! Eh? A cat? Oh thank goodness...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_141_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=玄師になれた理由？よくわからんが、わらわの溢れる才能あってのことじゃろう！<br/>師匠はそれを見抜いて側においておったのじゃな！|text_cn=为什么会成为玄师？不记得了……反正十有八九是师父看我天资聪颖，是个当玄师的好苗子，就把我放在道场里跟着她了。|trans_en=Why did I become a Xuan Shi? Hmm... Mostly due to my massive talent, I think.<br/>Master saw it and instantly had to have me as a star student...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_141_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なあ、わらわはそんなに頼りないか？…ふふ、やはり違うよな！<br/>さあ魔王よ、最強玄師であるこのわらわに、開運も魔除けも任せておけ！<br/>あ…でも恋愛成就だけは駄目なのじゃ|text_cn=那什么……我也没有那么不靠谱吧？嗯？魔王你也觉得我很厉害？我就说嘛！<br/>以后无论是祈福转运，还是驱邪避祟，都欢迎来找我，保证灵验~<br/>哦……求姻缘就算了，不接不接。|trans_en=Hey, do I really seem that unreliable? ... Heh, I didn't think so either!<br/>So, Boss, leave the luck and warding to me, the mighty Xuan Shi!<br/>I don't do love charms, though. I'm no good at those.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_141_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほかの玄師なら、外の世界で修行したあと、みんな道場に戻ったぞ<br/>ま、わらわとしては、あちこち見て回る方が好きなのでな<br/>面倒な事がないわけではないが…魔王がいるから大丈夫なのじゃ♪|text_cn=大部分玄师在历练完后，都会选择回到道场继续修行。<br/>不过那样也太没意思了，还是在外头到处跑比较好玩……<br/>反正，就算遇到了麻烦事，也还有你在嘛！|trans_en=Most Xuan Shi return to their base of studies after their training in the outside world.<br/>But me? I like wandering and seeing the world.<br/>It's not all easy, but ... with you at my side, Boss, I'll be just fine. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_141_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=しっぽを触りたい？別にかまわぬが…うひゃあっ！？<br/>へ、変な触り方をするのはやめろぉ！|text_cn=想摸摸尾巴上的鳞片？唔……行吧，不过……<br/>呜哇！不要用那种奇怪的方式摸啊！|trans_en=Wanna touch my tail? I don't mind, but... Eep!?<br/>H-Hey! Don't touch it all weird like that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_141_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=シーミャオ？ええっと…ああ、シーミャオ妙妙剣のか！|text_cn=师渺？谁来着……啊！那个师渺妙妙剑是吧！|trans_en=Shimiao? Oh, you mean Shimiao's Miaovelous Sword?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_141_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメはオバケを怖がらないタイプじゃな<br/>むしろああいうやつには、オバケの方も近づかんじゃろうし…<br/>今度から暗い場所へ行くときは、あやつを連れて行くか|text_cn=鸢尾看上去就是不怕鬼的类型……说不定可以有镇鬼驱邪的效果？要不下次把她绑走试试看好了……|trans_en=Iris is the type who doesn't get scared of ghosts.<br/>Honestly, I bet the ghosts are scared of HER...<br/>Maybe I should take her along next time I explore somewhere dark.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_141_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前、コゼットと森に行ったら突然後ろから妙な声が聞こえてな<br/>2人して思わず叫んでしまったが、正体はただのカラスで…<br/>あっ。この話、他のやつに話すでないぞ？|text_cn=说起来有点好笑，之前我跟珂赛特在森林里，被一只乌鸦吓得嗷嗷叫……<br/>这事我只跟你一个人说，不许背叛我啊！|trans_en=Last time I went into the woods with Cosette, we heard a weird noise behind us.<br/>We both screamed. Turns out it was just a crow.<br/>Don't go telling anyone that story, all right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_141_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=セイナの顔には、とんでもない災いに見舞われる相が出ておるぞ<br/>師匠を紹介するから、一度しっかり占ってもらった方がよいかもしれん|text_cn=说起来，我前阵子看了尘沙的面相……总觉得她命里有劫？但我看的不是很清，也许应该让师父来看看。|trans_en=Noya's face shows signs of major misfortune... She should meet my Master and get a proper reading done!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_141_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前、龍璟樓へ食事に行ったらジンリンに火起こしの手伝いを頼まれてな<br/>火を喚ぶ霊符をササッと書いてやったんじゃ<br/>魔王も、料理で火力が足りないときは、わらわに頼るとよいぞ！|text_cn=上次我去怀璟食府吃饭，吃到一半被璟麟拉去后厨帮忙生火。<br/>我“欻欻”两笔，就把火生起来了。要我说，想要猛火爆炒，还得靠我！|trans_en=When I went to dine at Huaijing Restaurant, Jinglin asked me to help start the fire. <br/>So I whipped up a fire-summoning talisman for her!<br/>Boss, if you ever need more fire for cooking, just call me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_141_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おい…いつまでわらわのしっぽをつついておるのじゃ|text_cn=我说啊……不要总是戳我的尾巴！|trans_en=Hey... How long do you plan on poking my tail?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_141_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=頭を撫でるなぁ！|text_cn=不准摸我头！|trans_en=Quit patting my head!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_141_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王ー？どこじゃー？|text_cn=喂——人呢？|trans_en=Boss? Where'd you go!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_141_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=用がないなら、わらわは休むぞ|text_cn=没事的话我先歇了。|trans_en=If there's nothing to do, I'm taking a nap.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_141_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なぜ誰もおらんのじゃ…ひぃっ！？いま外でなにか動いたぞ！|text_cn=怎么一个人都没有……呃、窗户边是不是有什么东西闪过去了？|trans_en=Where is everybody? Eek!? Something just moved outside!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_141_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わらわはチーシア。玄の理を極めた雲笈道場の玄師で、えっと…<br/>細かいことはよい！そんなことよりこの霊符を買わぬか？<br/>効果絶大、効かなかったらそのときは…なんでもしてやるぞ！|text_cn=我乃赤霞，云笈道场的正统玄师。初来乍到，愿以玄之法理……<br/>呃，这开场白好难背。总之，要给你画几张符吗？绝对灵验，不灵包售后。|trans_en=I am Chixia, a Xuan Shi of the Yunji Studio, and mistress of mysterious arts! And...<br/>Well, other stuff that I forget! Here—take this powerful talisman!<br/>If it doesn't work… I'll make it up to you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_141_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おお、元気そうじゃな、魔王！うむうむ、よいことじゃ！また霊符でも買って行くか？|text_cn=又见面啦，看你气色不错，甚好甚好~怎么样，上次给你的符效果不错吧，要回购些不？|trans_en=Ah, you're looking lively, Boss! Very good.<br/>Care to buy another talisman while you're here?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_141_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=すぐ覚えられたぞ！やっぱりわらわは天才じゃな！|text_cn=我果然是个大聪明~一点就通~|trans_en=See? I memorized it super fast! I am a genius!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_141_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほぉ…こういう火の使い方もあるのか|text_cn=火还能这么用吗？学会了。|trans_en=Huh. So that's another way to use fire...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_141_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい曲じゃのう。創作意欲が昂ぶるわ！|text_cn=这旋律，就应该配一张我的大作~|trans_en=Nice tune. It's getting my creative juices flowing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_141_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うむうむ、悪くない曲じゃ|text_cn=这啥曲儿？还挺好听。|trans_en=Hmm, not a bad song at all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_141_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=炎の霊符よ、その力を示せ！火徳顕現、悪霊退散！|text_cn=炎符天降，火德显彰。火符闪耀，赤焰昭昭。邪魅消散，万祸不殃。|trans_en=O fire talisman, reveal your power! Manifest the virtue of flame. Banish the evil spirits!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_141_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいい、いますぐ誓うのじゃ！どこにも行かない、ずっとわらわの側にいると…！|text_cn=那、那你现在就发誓，说你哪儿都不去，就呆在我旁边……动一下也不行！|trans_en=P-Promise me! Right now! Say you'll stay with me forever, and you won't go anywhere!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_141_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ど～～～してもと言うなら、お守りの霊符を作ってやらんこともないぞ<br/>魔王なら、特別に割引もしてやろう！|text_cn=如果你想要的话，我也可以给你画几张护身符，看在咱们这么熟的份上，就给你打个折呗~|trans_en=If you insist, I might be persuaded to make you a protective charm.<br/>For you, Boss, I'll even throw in a special discount!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_141_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王、今週は暇であろう？<br/>道場主催のありがた～い儀式があるから、とっっっっても忙しいわらわが時間を作って案内を…<br/>う、嘘ではない！わらわは玄師ゆえ、毎日予定がギッチリなのじゃ！！|text_cn=道场这周有祈福仪式，你想来的话，我可以百忙之中抽空陪你逛逛……<br/>你不信？我、我可是师父面前的大红人，整个道场最忙的就是我！|trans_en=You're free this week, right? <br/>The studio's hosting a super-important ceremony,<br/>and I, despite my packed schedule, managed to make time to take you.<br/>What? It's not a lie! I'm a proper Xuan Shi! I'm always busy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_141_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まずいぞ！今度師匠が、わらわの修練の成果を見定めに来るらしいのじゃ！<br/>は、早く言い訳を考えねば…そうじゃ！<br/>「大きな不幸に見舞われたそなたを救うため、わらわはそばから離れられなかった」<br/>そう伝えてはくれぬか！？|text_cn=坏了，师父传信说要我过阵子回道场一趟，她要检验一下我的历练成果……<br/>你快帮我找个借口！你就说……<br/>就说遇到了大问题必须由我这个玄师寸步不离地跟着你才行……求你了！|trans_en=This is bad! Master's coming soon to check my training progress!<br/>I-I need an excuse fast... Wait, I've got it!<br/>Tell whoever asks that she couldn't leave the Boss, who was struck by a terrible misfortune. That'll work, right!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_141_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前道場で、腕輪型のお守りの作り方を教わったのじゃ<br/>これには命を守る効果があるのでな…ほれ、そなたにやろう|text_cn=前阵子在道观里学了怎么编手绳，我缠了个保命符进去……喏，拿去吧。|trans_en=I learned how to make bracelet-type charms at the studio!<br/>They're protective too. Here, take this one, just for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_141_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほう、わらわにくれるのか。魔除けの効果はあるかのう？|text_cn=给我的？是驱邪的吗？|trans_en=Oh-ho? You're giving this to me? Does it have any warding properties, I wonder?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_141_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ…ずっと探しておったものじゃ！なぜわかった！？感謝するぞ！|text_cn=这个是……你怎么知道我在找这个？谢啦！|trans_en=Whoa! I've been looking for one of these forever! How did you know!? Thank you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_141_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こ、これをわらわに！？えっ、ええええっ？か、感謝する…<br/>し、しっぽに火が付いたのは、別に嬉しいからとかではないのじゃ！|text_cn=给我的礼物？欸欸欸？？那个、谢谢……啊啊啊我没有开心到尾巴冒火，没有！|trans_en=Y-You're giving this to me!? Wh-Whaaat!? Th-Thank you...<br/>M-My tail caught fire, but it's not because I'm happy or anything!!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_141_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うむ！|text_cn=知道啦！|trans_en=Mm! Thanks!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_141_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当か？|text_cn=认真的？|trans_en=Really!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_141_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=は…？|text_cn=哈？|trans_en=Huh...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_141_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんなのじゃ？|text_cn=这是什么？|trans_en=What is it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_141_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=泣いてない…！|text_cn=我没哭……！|trans_en=I'm not crying!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_141_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんじゃあ！？|text_cn=什么什么！|trans_en=Whaaat was that!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_141_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=こやつめ…！|text_cn=你这家伙……！|trans_en=Y-You little...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_141_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くないのじゃ！|text_cn=真不错啊！|trans_en=Not bad at all!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_141_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Sigh…}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_141_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん、なにか言ったか？|text_cn=你说啥了？|trans_en=Hm? Did you say something?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_141_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=わらわに任せるのじゃ！|text_cn=包在我身上~|trans_en=Leave it to me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_141_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=お、オバケなんか全然怖くないのじゃ！|text_cn=谁、谁说我怕鬼！|trans_en=I-I'm not scared of ghosts, not one bit!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_141_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=面白い話はあるか？|text_cn=有八卦？|trans_en=Got any fun stories?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_141_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_141_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=わらわの霊符はどこじゃ～？|text_cn=我的符纸放哪了？|trans_en=Where's my talisman!?}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_141_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=不幸を焼き払え、急急如律令！|text_cn=炼冶神火，扫荡不祥。急急如律令 ！|trans_en=Burn away misfortune, fall swift the hammer of the law!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_141_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=猛き炎よ、穢れを祓え！|text_cn=赤焰之符，火德之精。焚邪破秽，烈焰随行。|trans_en=O fierce flame, purge all defilement!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_141_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ戦えるのじゃ…|text_cn=别拦着我，我还能……|trans_en=I ... can still fight...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_141_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだうじゃうじゃと…|text_cn=这些家伙……|trans_en=They just kept coming...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_141_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おお～っ、火力も上がりそうじゃ！|text_cn=这个是……火的味道？想吃烤串了！|trans_en=Oooh! This might boost my firepower!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_141_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔除けにもなるのか？|text_cn=可以辟邪吗？|trans_en=Does it work as a charm against spirits too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_141_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=心身強靭、気息流転、その次は…なんじゃったかの？|text_cn=气息流转，体魄强韧……后面是什么来着？|trans_en=Mind and body as one. Breath and spirit as one. And then ... um, what comes next?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_141_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おぉ…すごいのじゃ！|text_cn=哦……噢噢！！|trans_en=Ooh... Amazing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_141_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=案ずるな、わらわに任せておけ！|text_cn=放心！我靠谱着呢！|trans_en=Don't worry. Leave it to me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_141_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは経でも唱えて落ち着こう！最初は…ぐぬぬ、思い出せぬ。と、とにかく行くのじゃ！|text_cn=别急，先让我念几句经文安定心神……算了，忘记开头了，直接上吧。|trans_en=I-I'll calm myself by reciting scriptures!<br/>Let's see ... um... Hhnnngh, I can't remember! Going in anyway!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_141_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほ、星ノ塔に、オバケはおらんのじゃろう…？|text_cn=星塔里……应该没有鬼吧？|trans_en=Th-There aren't any ghosts in the Monoliths, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_141_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=自分の身は自分で守るのじゃぞ。いざというとき、助けられるとは限らんからな！|text_cn=小心点，遇到危险我可不会救你哦？|trans_en=You've got to protect yourself out there! There's no guarantee someone will save you all the time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_141_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=お守り用の霊符を魔王にも1枚やろう|text_cn=要我给你一张保命符吗？|trans_en=Here, Boss, have one of my talismans. It'll protect you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_141_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=ま、魔王が先に行くとよいぞ！なっ！？べ、別に怖がってなどおらぬぞ！|text_cn=要不还是魔王走前面吧……我、我才没怕！|trans_en=Y-You go first, Boss! ... Not that I-I'm scared or anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_141_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この場所、前にも来たよな？そうであろう？|text_cn=这个地方我好像来过，我来过的吧？|trans_en=Haven't we been here before? We have, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_141_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=知らぬ気が漂っておるな…|text_cn=这什么鬼地方？|trans_en=Something feels unfamiliar...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_141_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=むふふっ。師匠がおらんうちに、お菓子を買いあさるのじゃ！|text_cn=天高皇帝远，到了这儿，连师父也不能阻止我买零食了！哈哈！|trans_en=Mmmph! Time to stock up on snacks before Master notices!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_141_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ、疲れた…休憩するのじゃ～|text_cn=歇会吧，我走累了。|trans_en=Phew. I'm beat... Time for a break.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_141_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=な、なにかの気配が…うひゃぁあああ！？驚かせるなぁ！！|text_cn=我的第六感告诉我，有东西要出现了……哇啊不要吓我！|trans_en=S-Something's here... Waaah! D-Don't sneak up on me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_141_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やれやれ。たわいないのう|text_cn=总算消停了。|trans_en=Well, that's a win.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_141_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=わらわの役目は霊符を作るだけではなかったのか！？|text_cn=我要抗议！说好的我只负责画符呢！|trans_en=I thought making talismans was my only job!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_141_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっと終わった…まだ来るなら火を噴いてやるのじゃ！|text_cn=没了吧？再来我要喷火了！|trans_en=Finally over. If more show up, I'll roast them too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_141_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わらわの勝利～！ってその顔はなんじゃ！|text_cn=你那是什么表情？这不是理所当然的吗？|trans_en=Victory is mine! Hey, what's with that look!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_141_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=わーっはっはっは！さすがわらわじゃ！|text_cn=不愧是我！|trans_en=Wahahaha! I'm too awesome!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_141_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日の運勢を確認しておけばよかった…|text_cn=……出门忘看黄历了。|trans_en=I should've checked my fortune today...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_141_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=た、たまたま失敗しただけじゃぞだから、許される…じゃろ？|text_cn=偶尔失手也是可以被原谅的吧……不能吗？|trans_en=Th-That was just a fluke, okay!? You'll let it slide, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_141_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=身代わりの霊符、特別に売ってやろうか？|text_cn=保命符五百万，不灵不要钱。|trans_en=I'll sell you a talisman that could save your life. Just for you, Boss.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_141_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=オバケ退治ならお断りじゃぞ|text_cn=抓鬼的业务不要找我啊……欸？不是吗？|trans_en=Exorcism? That's outside my area of expertise. Wait, it's not!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_141_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=霊符を描く仕事以外、絶対にやらんぞ！|text_cn=……除了画符我什么都不会干的。|trans_en=I'm not doing any job other than making talismans!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_141_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=面倒なのじゃ～…|text_cn=好麻烦……|trans_en=Ugh... What a pain...}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_141_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=Yostar|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_141_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ばれん、たい…ん？なっ、ば、馬鹿にするでないわ！<br/>もちろんバタータインくらい知っておるのじゃ！<br/>あ…アレじゃ、みんなでバターを舐める日…<br/>そうじゃろ？仕方ない、わらわが今日一日付き合ってやるわ|text_cn=干、干嘛这样看着我？呃、我当然知道今天是情人节！我……我没人约怎么了！<br/>既然这样，你就哪都不许去，陪我吃喝玩乐一整天！|trans_en=Balen...ti—huh? Wh-What!? D-Don't make fun of me! Of course I know what Buttertine is! <br/>It's, uh ... that day when everyone licks butter together, right? F-Fine! I'll spend the whole day with you, so there!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_141_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この寒い中、外で遊びたがるなど理解できぬわ。わらわは炬燵でぬくぬくできればそれでよい<br/>なに？雪合戦でわらわが勝てばプレゼントを用意するじゃと？<br/>ふむ…よいじゃろう！わらわが負けることなどぜぇーったいにあり得ぬのじゃからな！<br/>はっはっはぁ！いまのうちにプレゼントの内容を考えておくことじゃ！|text_cn=搞不明白，天气这么冷怎么还有人兴致勃勃地出去玩，这种天气我恨不得躲在被窝里……<br/>嗯？你说出去打雪仗？输了要给赢的人节日礼物？<br/>那我可不会输的！你就趁现在赶紧想想要给我准备什么礼物吧！|trans_en=Wanting to go out and play in this cold? I'll never understand it... A blanket and a charcoal brazier under the table is all I need.<br/>Wait, what? A snowball fight? Winner gets a present!? Hmm... In that case, you're on!<br/>Haha! You'd better start thinking about what present you'll give me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_141_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけおめじゃ！それよりこれを見てくれ！早速、今年最初の作品を描いたのだが…<br/>どうじゃ？めちゃめちゃリアルでめちゃめちゃイカしておるじゃろ？<br/>…は？空飛ぶツイストドーナツの絵？<br/>ば、馬鹿者ーっ！これは龍じゃ龍！そなた、目が腐っておるのではないか！？|text_cn=魔——王~哈！新年快乐！哈哈哈哈吓到了吗？快看！这是我的新年第一画，厉害吧？是不是栩栩如生威风凛凛？<br/>嗯？你说这是飞天麻花？这是龙！龙！！你根本不懂欣赏！！|trans_en=Happy New Year! <br/>More importantly, look at this! I just finished my first drawing of the year! Well? It's super realistic and super cool, right!?<br/>... Huh? A flying breadstick? FOOL! It's a dragon! Get your eyes checked!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_141_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はわらわの誕生日なのじゃ！おぬし、渡したいものがあるのではないか！？ん？ん？|text_cn=今天是我生日，你有礼物要给我吗？一定有对吧对吧！|trans_en=It's my birthday today! Don't you have something for me!? Hmm? Hmmm?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_141_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_141_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=暇なら少し付き合ってくれぬか？買い物をして、行きつけの店で昼食を食べて、ケーキも食べて…<br/>なっ…！ば、馬鹿者！そこは気づいても気づかぬふりをするところであろうが…まったく<br/>計画はくるってしまったが…今日の主役はそなたじゃ。誕生日おめでとう|text_cn=你今天有空吗？跟我出去一趟吧~上午先去逛街，中午去一家我推荐的店里看看，下午我们去吃个大蛋糕，晚上再——<br/>什、什么过生日？啊啊你就不能装作什么都不知道吗！真是的，礼物拿去，那个，生日快乐……|trans_en=Got time to spend with me? We can shop a bit, have lunch at my favorite place, and finish with a huge cake.<br/>W-Wait, what? Silly! You're supposed to pretend not to notice!<br/>Well, anyway. The plan may have gone a bit wrong, but it's still your special day... So happy birthday!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Chinese New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc141_ChineseNewYear26_day02_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc141_ChineseNewYear26_day02_cn.ogg|text_jp=うひゃあ！？ビックリした…いつの間に来ておったのじゃ？<br/>危うく爆竹に火を点けてしまうところだったではないか…<br/>まあよい。それより蒼梧城名物の花火を特別に見せてやろう！よーく見ておくのじゃぞ！|text_cn=呜哇！你、你什么时候来的？我差点把花炮点歪了……<br/>哼哼，正好你来了，就让你免费看一场苍梧特色烟花秀吧！你可要睁大眼睛好好看哦！|trans_en=Uwhaaa?!That surprised me...When did you get here?<br/>I almost set off the firecrackers...<br/>Well, that's ok. More importantly, I'll give you a special show of famous Cangwu fireworks! Be sure to watch carefully!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_142_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よーし、今日こそ魔王を連れ去って――<br/>え？いつからそこにいたの？|text_cn=今天一定要抓住机会绑走魔王……欸？你什么时候来的？|trans_en=Today's the day I kidnap Boss—<br/>Gah?! When did you get here?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_142_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、魔王。ひとりでのこのこ私の前に現れるなんて、不用心もいいとこ――<br/>あれ？もしかして…手に持ってるのってサイダー！？|text_cn=啊，是魔王！你竟敢一个人出现在我面前，就不怕我……嗯？你手里拿的是不是碳酸饮料？！|trans_en=Wanna go to town with me? Oh, Boss. Pretty reckless of you to approach me all by yourself—<br/>Wait. Is that cider you've got there?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_142_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっと…朝ごはんに豆乳はついてくる？|text_cn=早……早餐有豆浆吗？|trans_en=Um... Does breakfast come with soymilk?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_142_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだお腹すいてないから、お昼ごはんはいらないかな<br/>あ、でもミズタマウォーターがあるならもらってもいいよ|text_cn=午饭？不用，我还不饿……要是有水玉我可以考虑一下！|trans_en=I'm not really hungry, so I'll pass on lunch.<br/>But I'll have some Liquid Jade if you've got any!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_142_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまより強くなるために、寝る前はホットミルクを飲まないと|text_cn=睡觉前就是要喝热热的牛奶，这样就能变得更厉害了!|trans_en=Some hot milk before bed'll help me get even stronger!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_142_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=せいぜい油断しないことだね。いつか必ず、私が魔王を始末してみせるんだから<br/>あれ？ねえ魔王、手に持ってるのってなんの飲み物？私も飲んでみたい！|text_cn=总有一天，我会找到悄无声息绑走你的方法，你……什么、什么饮料，我要喝！|trans_en=You can try all you want, but I'll catch you slipping one day, Boss.<br/>Wait. Is that a drink you've got there? Can I have some?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_142_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=尾行って…退屈。ちょっとくらいなら昼寝してもいいかな？|text_cn=盯梢好无聊啊……偷偷眯一会应该不会被发现吧？|trans_en=Tailing is so boring. Can I take just a tiny little nap?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_142_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…この飲み物、どうして取れないの？|text_cn=这里面的饮料，要怎么拿出来……|trans_en=Heeey! Why can't I get this drink out?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_142_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=おおお～！これは、激レアな限定パッケージ！|text_cn=呜哇！这个是超稀有限定包装！|trans_en=OH! This is an ultra limited edition package!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_142_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミズタマウォーターは、一日一本までって決めてるけど…<br/>よし、誰も見てない。今ならバレないはず|text_cn=今天已经喝了一瓶饮料了，一天一瓶，唔……<br/>没人看见的话，再来一瓶也没关系吧？|trans_en=I know I'm only supposed to have one Liquid Jade a day, but ...<br/>as long as no one's looking...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_142_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=窓の外、何かが浮かんでる？ねつ…気球？へえ、人を乗せて空を飛ぶんだ…すごいね|text_cn=窗外是不是有什么东西在飘？那是……？<br/>热气球？可以把人送到天上吗？好厉害……|trans_en=Something's floating outside the window.<br/>A balloon? Wow, and it's carrying people! That's amazing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_142_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=放っておいて。私には重要な任務が…<br/>え？みんなで買い物に行くの？いいなぁ…<br/>えっと…私も一緒に行っていい？|text_cn=我现在可是有重要的任务在身……啊？你们要出门买东西吗？真好啊……<br/>嗯……能不能带我一起？|trans_en=Leave me alone. I've got an important mission...<br/>Hm? Going shopping with everyone? That sounds fun.<br/>Um... Can I go too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_142_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=今まで見上げてた空は、こんなに綺麗じゃなかったから<br/>でもここで見る空は青くて、とっても大きな湖みたい|text_cn=诺瓦的天空很蓝，像很大很大的水池。我以前看到的天空不是这种颜色，没有这么漂亮。|trans_en=The sky above is so beautiful. <br/>I've never seen such a gorgeous deep blue before, it's like a huge lake.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_142_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？どうしていつも永夜から来るのが私なのか？<br/>む…それってどういう意味？私だと問題あるの？|text_cn=你问为什么永夜总派我来？什么意思……派我来有什么问题吗？|trans_en=Why is it always me who comes from Nocturn Eterna?<br/>Mm... What's that supposed to mean? Is there a problem with that?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_142_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王は私が永夜だって知ってるでしょ？なのにどうして――<br/>むぅ…そうやってまた飲み物で釣って誤魔化そうとしてる…|text_cn=魔王明明知道我是永夜的成员，为什么……<br/>唔！你每次都是拿饮料来糊弄我！|trans_en=You know I'm in Nocturn Eterna, right? So why—<br/>Grr. There you go trying to distract me with a drink again!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_142_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=角？あったよ。でも任務のために切り落としちゃった|text_cn=角……？我原本是有的，为了方便行动，锯掉了。|trans_en=Yeah, I used to have horns. I had to cut 'em off for the mission.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_142_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしていつもつきまとうのか？それは組織が――永夜があなたを危険人物と認めたから<br/>つまり私の任務はあなたの監視。わかった？わかったらあんまり仲良くしないほうが身のためだよ<br/>…さっきのお菓子、もう一袋だけもらってもいい？|text_cn=为什么我总盯着你不放？你是组织的敌人，我的使命就是监视你的一举一动，所以你还是不要跟我走这么近比较好……<br/>刚刚那个小零食可以再给我一包吗？|trans_en=Why do I always follow you? Because the organization— Nocturn Eterna— has deemed you a threat.<br/>My mission is to monitor you. Got it? Getting too close to me is bad for your health.<br/>Hey, could I get another pack of those snacks?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_142_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務の報告書を書かなきゃ…<br/>今日は魔王を捕まえる罠に自分が引っかかって、おもいっきり転んじゃったけど…<br/>そのあと魔王もおもいっきり転んで膝を打ってた。オーロラへの報告はこれでよし<br/>わっ、魔王！？いきなり後ろに立たないで…！|text_cn=唔……今天的任务成果是，虽然在暗算魔王的时候不小心摔了一跤，但是正好把魔王也绊倒了。<br/>魔王磕到了膝盖，所以他今天遭受到了重创。嗯哼，极光大人一定会夸我的……<br/>呜哇！你怎么悄无声息地出现在人身后啊！|trans_en=I need to write a mission report.<br/>Today, I got caught in a trap I had set for Boss and fell really hard.<br/>Then he fell and hurt her knee. That should be enough for Aeloria.<br/>Gah! Boss! Don't startle me like that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_142_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=身寄りのない私を、組織が育ててくれた。だから私も、組織のために命を捧げるつもり<br/>でも魔王からは、自分の気持ちを最優先にするようにって…<br/>え？『自分の気持ち』って、魔王のじゃなくて『私の気持ち』ってこと？|text_cn=这个口味是新出的，甜甜的，很好喝！魔王可以试试……我的意思是，这瓶送给你……！|trans_en=They took care of me when I had no one. It's only fair I pledge my life to them. <br/>But you're saying that the individual is more important... <br/>Wait. By "individual," are you referring to me and not yourself?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_142_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=物心ついたときには両親がいなくて、そんな私に居場所をくれたのが組織…永夜だった<br/>だから永夜に与えられた任務ならなんでもする。魔王の世界征服を妨害することも、そのひとつだよ<br/>わかった？ようするにこの任務が終わるまで、あなたは私から逃げられないってこと<br/>どこに行くときもずーっと一緒だから、ちゃんと覚えといてね？|text_cn=我没有关于父母的记忆，是组织给了我容身之所，所以，只要他们需要我，无论什么事我都会做……<br/>哪怕只是拖慢你统治世界的进程，也算是我给组织作贡献了。在完成任务之前，我会一直缠着你的，你就等着吧！|trans_en=I never even knew my parents. The organization... Nocturn Eterna is the one that took me in.<br/>That's why I'll do any mission they assign me, which includes stopping you from taking over the world.<br/>I'll be with you wherever you go. Got it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_142_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前、新発売の激辛サイダーをミネルバのところに持っていったんだ<br/>食べ物と飲み物は大歓迎だって、すごく喜んでたよ|text_cn=说起来，之前买了新出的辣味汽水去找密涅瓦小姐，她好像很喜欢的样子。|trans_en=I took some of that new fiery hot cider to Minova once.<br/>She told me that food and drink are always very welcome!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_142_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいなーコハク、いつもかわいいネコと一緒で|text_cn=那个叫琥珀的女孩子，她身边的小猫咪好可爱……|trans_en=You're so lucky you always get to be with a cute cat, Amber.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_142_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=報告書を提出したら、オーロラに「いい日記だ。それで報告書は？」って言われたんだ<br/>あんなに詳しく魔王と過ごしたことを書いたのに…どこが間違ってたんだろう？|text_cn=极光大人对我任务报告的评语是【是很好的日记，所以，你报告书呢？】，明明我写得非常详细啊……到底是哪里有问题？|trans_en=I submitted my report and Aelroria said, "Cute diary, where's your report?"<br/>I wrote about all the time I spent with you in great detail, so I don't understand her question.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_142_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=金色の…長い髪の子？この前パチパチメテオの話で盛り上がったけど、その子かな？|text_cn=金色长发……？啊！是恩人！上次见面她给了我一瓶桃味汽水。|trans_en=Long blonde hair? I'm in her debt too. She gave me a peach soda one time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_142_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は弓を持った、はい…たついんけん？巡遊者の女の子に会ったの<br/>でも、はいたついんけん巡遊者ってなんだろう？|text_cn=今天有个背着弓箭的女孩说自己是……心石旅人？那是什么？专门收集心相石的旅人吗？|trans_en=I met a Trekker with a bow today from ... Post Waste or something? Had no clue what that could be.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_142_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ？また見つかっちゃった？なにがいけなかったんだろう…|text_cn=收到！哇啊！又被你发现了！到底怎么注意到的……|trans_en=Huh? You found me again? What exactly gave me away...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_142_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ひゃっ！？くっ…これが魔王の反撃…|text_cn=可恶！这就是你的反击手段吗？|trans_en=Gyah?! Ugh... So, this is Boss's counterattack...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_142_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よし、いまのうちに飲み物買ってこよう<br/>監視対象がいないんだから…サボりじゃないよね？|text_cn=好，就趁现在去买饮料吧……这不是在偷懒，只是因为监视对象不在我才……|trans_en=Now's a good time to get a drink.<br/>I don't have anyone to monitor, so it should be okay. Right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_142_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王も寝ちゃったみたいだし、ちょっとくらい休んでも平気だよね？|text_cn=魔王都睡着了，那我跟着歇会也没关系吧？|trans_en=Boss's asleep, so I guess it's okay for me to take a little break, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_142_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=むにゃむにゃ…とっちゃダメぇ…それ…私の飲み物…|text_cn=啊……哈……不许跟我抢，那是我的饮料唔……|trans_en=Zzz... No, stop... That's my drink...}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_142_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私はコゼット、永夜の始末屋だよあなたは…あれ、魔王？<br/>失敗した…自分から顔を見せちゃうなんて…|text_cn=我是珂赛特，永夜的清道夫。你……欸？<br/>魔王？不好，竟然这么轻易就在魔王面前暴露长相了……|trans_en=I'm Cosette, Nocturn Eterna's Disposer.<br/>And you are... Wait, Boss? Oops... You weren't supposed to see my face...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_142_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あれ？また会っちゃった？おかしいな、ちゃんと隠れてたはずなのに…|text_cn=啊哈哈……又、又见面啦？我明明藏得很好啊……|trans_en=Uh, what? How did this happen again? I thought I was pretty well hidden...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_142_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わかった。神器をうまく使えば、尾行がバレにくくなるんだね|text_cn=愿来如此，只要运用科学系统的潜伏方法，就不会轻易暴露了。|trans_en=I see. If I know how to use artifacts, I can tail without being detected.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_142_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力があれば…魔王の尾行がもっと楽になりそう|text_cn=只要有了这份力量，跟踪魔王就变得更轻松了~|trans_en=With this power... Tailing Boss should be easier.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_142_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、この音…ミックスフルーツソーダみたい！|text_cn=啊，这段旋律……是混合果汁汽水的味道！|trans_en=Oh! That sounds like mixed fruit soda!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_142_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ…何て曲だろう？|text_cn=这个曲子……有名字吗？|trans_en=What song is this?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_142_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=永夜の始末屋の力…甘く見てるとケガするよ？|text_cn=再怎么说，我也是永夜的清道夫，可不要小瞧我啊！|trans_en=Underestimating Nocturn Eterna's Disposer can get you hurt.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_142_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あれ…引っかかって落ちてこない…どうしよう、揺らしたら取れるかな？|text_cn=饮料好像卡住了，拿不出来，怎么办？摇一摇有用吗？|trans_en=Aw... Looks like the drink's stuck... Maybe if I give it a shake...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_142_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつもの鋭い視線を感じない？ふふ。よく気づいたね<br/>今日は休暇だから、なにもしないって決めてるの<br/>だから任務はまた明日ね|text_cn=你今天是不是觉得特别自在？那当然，咳咳……我今天休息，所以不会对你出手了，任务就明天再说吧！|trans_en=Don't feel my usual sharp gaze? Hehe. So, you noticed.<br/>It's my day off, so I'm not doing anything today.<br/>But it's back to work tomorrow.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_142_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=明日ね、新しいフレーバーの飲み物が発売されるらしいの<br/>時間があったら、魔王も一緒に――え？でー…と、みたい？でーとって、何？|text_cn=明天好像会有新口味的饮料发售，魔王要是有空的话，能和我一起去买吗？<br/>听起来像约会邀请？唔……约会是什么？|trans_en=There's a new drink coming out tomorrow! Do you wanna go with me to— <br/>A "dayt"? Um... What's a "dayt"?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_142_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=明日、新商品の飲み物が発売になるんだって。もし暇なら、一緒に買いにいかない？<br/>え？なんだかデートみたい？…そうだよ、これはデートの誘いだから来てくれるでしょ？<br/>ふふ。ふたりきりになれば、魔王の秘密を探りやすくなるはず…|text_cn=明天好像会有新口味的饮料发售，魔王要是有空的话，能和我一起去买吗？<br/>听起来像约会邀请？唔……没错！就是约会邀请！要是只有我们两个人，就一定会找到魔王的破绽，哼哼……|trans_en=There's a new drink coming out today. You wanna go try it with me?<br/>Hm? Sounds like a date? Yes. That's exactly what it is, so you'll join me, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_142_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の任務は魔王の監視。でも必要に迫られれば、正々堂々この力で戦ってみせるよ<br/>む…なんでニヤニヤしてるの？もしかして、私が適当なことを言ってると思ってる？|text_cn=就算我的任务是监视魔王，那我也会堂堂正正地潜伏，然后凭本事出击，不会在这种时候搞偷袭暗算的……<br/>你怎么笑得这么奇怪？啊！你是不是又当我小孩子乱说话！|trans_en=My job is to monitor you, but I'll also fight you head-on if necessary.<br/>Grr. What's so funny? You think I'm playing around here?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_142_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これを、私に？ありがとう|text_cn=送给我的？谢谢。|trans_en=For me? Thank you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_142_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ…この前一緒に街で見て、ちょっと気になってたやつ。ありがとう！|text_cn=啊，是之前我们上街时看到的！谢谢你！我很喜欢！|trans_en=Oh, this is the one I was looking at in town a while ago! Thank you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_142_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=本当に私がもらっていいの？プレゼントをくれたからって、監視をやめたりしないよ？<br/>え？私のよろこぶ顔が見れればそれでいい？<br/>変なの。でも…あ、ありがとう|text_cn=真的是送给我的吗？我可不会因为收了你的礼物就放你一马哦？<br/>欸？你说只要我开心就行？真是个怪人。不过……谢、谢谢啦。|trans_en=Really? I can have this? But this doesn't mean I'll stop monitoring you, okay?<br/>What? You just wanted to see me smile?<br/>What a weirdo. But... Th-thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_142_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=わかった|text_cn=我知道了。|trans_en=Understood.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_142_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうじゃない|text_cn=不对吧？|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_142_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうなの？|text_cn=是这样吗？|trans_en=Really?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_142_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=…なに？|text_cn=什么？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_142_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうして…|text_cn=为什么……|trans_en=Why...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_142_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=おおっ！！|text_cn=哦！|trans_en=Whoa!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_142_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=くぅ…！|text_cn=唔……！|trans_en=Grr...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_142_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=わあぁ…！|text_cn=哇！|trans_en=Yay!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_142_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=呼……|trans_en=(Sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_142_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=しーっ。いま魔王の尾行中だから|text_cn=嘘，我在跟踪魔王。|trans_en=Tell me what to do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_142_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私は永夜の始末屋|text_cn=我可是永夜清道夫！|trans_en=My hero!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_142_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=そろそろ遊びに行っていい？|text_cn=可以去玩了？|trans_en=I always carry out orders.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_142_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにそれ！？|text_cn=那是什么？|trans_en=What is that?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_142_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_142_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=飲み物が欲しいな♪|text_cn=想喝饮料……|trans_en=I want something to drink! ♪}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_142_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=長しえの闇に…葬り去る！|text_cn=在黑暗中消失殆尽吧！|trans_en=I condemn you to a tomb of eternal darkness!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_142_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=命に代えても、遂行する！|text_cn=哪怕拼上性命，我也不会退让！|trans_en=I will carry out orders even if it costs my life!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_142_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私は…まだ…|text_cn=我还没有……|trans_en=I ... still ... haven't...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_142_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務を…続けなきゃ…|text_cn=任务……无法继续……|trans_en=The mission ... must go on...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_142_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力…悪くない、かも？|text_cn=这个……好像很厉害的样子？|trans_en=I could use this ... maybe?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_142_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと強くなったような…不思議な感じ|text_cn=奇妙的力量……有点不习惯。|trans_en=I feel a little stronger... It's ... strange.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_142_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ、私がもらっていいの？|text_cn=我真的可以使用吗……|trans_en=Can I have this?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_142_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=後ろの敵は任せて|text_cn=背后的敌人就交给我来解决！|trans_en=I'll take the enemies in the back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_142_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=サポート役？うん、了解|text_cn=让我支援……我明白了。|trans_en=Understood. I'll handle support.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_142_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんでだろう。ここ、来るたび違った気配がする|text_cn=要上了！|trans_en=I wonder why it feels different each time I come here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_142_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=早く行こう|text_cn=听说有香菜味的水玉，要是能许愿出来就好了。|trans_en=Let's get going.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_142_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=パクチー味のミズタマウォーターがあるって聞いたんだけど…<br/>星ノ塔でお願いしたら、手に入るかな？|text_cn=为什么要来星塔里冒险？我不知道，我只要听从命令就好了。|trans_en=I've heard there's cilantro-flavored Liquid Jade.<br/>I wonder if I can wish for it in a Monolith?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_142_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=珍しい飲み物、見つかるといいな|text_cn=要是能找到稀有饮料就好了。|trans_en=I hope we find some interesting drinks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_142_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務と関係ないけど…ちょっと様子を見に行こうかな|text_cn=好像不是这次任务的目标……唔，先去看看吧。|trans_en=It's not related to the mission, but ... maybe I'll take a look.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_142_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここ、ちょっと大変そう…<br/>えっ…！最上階には飲み物がいっぱい置いてあるの！？<br/>なら登ってみようかな…|text_cn=看上去好难……什么？最高层有一整排饮料？那我就试试看好了……|trans_en=This looks kind of tough...<br/>What? The top floor has lots of drinks?!<br/>What are we waiting for?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_142_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今までの塔と違う気がする…|text_cn=这里跟之前去过的星塔都不太一样……|trans_en=This Monolith seems different than the others...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_142_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっと…私、飲み物が欲しい！|text_cn=呃……我可以买饮料吗？|trans_en=Um... I want something to drink!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_142_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…疲れた。ちょっと休んでいい？|text_cn=我累了，我们不能歇会吗？|trans_en=Phew... I'm so tired. Can we take a break?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_142_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと怪しいけど…なんだろう？|text_cn=有不好的预感……总觉得有点可疑。|trans_en=Hmm... I'm not so sure about this...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_142_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たいしたことなかったね|text_cn=轻松搞定。|trans_en=They were nothing special.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_142_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…やっと片付いた|text_cn=呼……也太多了吧……|trans_en=Phew... Glad that's over.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_142_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の実力、見ててくれた？|text_cn=这下该对我刮目相看了吧！|trans_en=Did you see me in action?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_142_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王の監視より簡単だったよ|text_cn=比监视魔王容易多了~|trans_en=That was easier than monitoring you, Boss.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_142_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=早く飲み物買いに行こう|text_cn=任务完成。我们快去买饮料吧！|trans_en=Let's go get some drinks!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_142_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務失敗？そんな…|text_cn=欸？任务失败？为什么……|trans_en=Mission failed? No...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_142_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私…まだやれるよ…|text_cn=我……我……|trans_en=I'm... not finished...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_142_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わかった。今日は指示に従う|text_cn=好吧，今天就听你的。|trans_en=Got it. I'll follow your directions today.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_142_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あとで飲み物買ってね？|text_cn=之后要给我买饮料哦。|trans_en=Buy me a drink later, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_142_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私が出ればいいの？|text_cn=诶？让我去吗？|trans_en=Is it my turn?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_142_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=準備はできてる|text_cn=我准备好了。|trans_en=I am ready!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_142_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=Yostar？|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_142_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=バレンタインデー？へえ、ノヴァではチョコレートをプレゼントする日なんだ？<br/>あ。いいこと思いついた。それなら魔王にシビレチョコをプレゼントすれば…<br/>食べて動けなくなったところを簡単に捕まえられるかも？<br/>あれ、でもひとつ余っちゃった。捨てるのはもったいないし…味見してみようかな…ぱく|text_cn=情人节？诶，是在诺瓦用巧克力当礼物的日子吧？啊，突然想到个好主意。<br/>要是把麻痹巧克力当礼物送出去……魔王吃了之后动不了了，说不定就能轻松抓住啦。<br/>咦，不过还剩下一颗。扔掉也太可惜了……我自己尝尝看吧……啊呜——|trans_en=Valentine's Day? People in Nova give out chocolates?<br/>That gives me an idea. What if I give Boss some laced chocolates...<br/>Maybe I can capture her while she's paralyzed...<br/>Oh, there's one left over. It'd be a shame for it to go to waste. Gulp.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_142_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=クリスマス…まえにオーロラから聞いたことあるよ<br/>一年間いい子にしてたら、その日にプレゼントがもらえるんだよね？<br/>それじゃあ私のプレゼントは？|text_cn=雪愿节？好像听极光大人提到过，只要当一整年的好孩子，就能在今天收到礼物。我的礼物呢？|trans_en=Snowish... Aeloria told me about it once.<br/>You get presents if you've been good all year, right?<br/>So, where's my present, then?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_142_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう<br/>去年の任務では失敗続きだったけど…<br/>でも油断しないほうがいいよ。今年こそ、必ずあなたを捕まえてみせるから<br/>怯えて待ってて|text_cn=新年快乐，今年我一定能成功绑架你的……呃，虽然去年一直在失败……哼，今年不一样，今年我绝对会完成任务的，魔王你等着吧！|trans_en=Happy new year!<br/>I may not have accomplished my mission, but...<br/>You'd better not let your guard down. I swear I'll capture you this year, so you better be scared.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_142_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あの…あっちの自動販売神器にね、飲んでみたかった飲み物が全種類売ってて…<br/>誕生日って、なんでもお願い叶えてくれる日なんだよね？<br/>なら…私、あの自動販売神器の中身、全部欲しいな？|text_cn=那、那个……那边的自动售货机里，我想喝的饮料居然全都有在卖！<br/>今天是我生日，无论什么愿望都可以实现对吧？那……我、我想要那台自动售货机里的所有饮料！|trans_en=So, um... That vending machine artifact has every single drink I've been wanting to try.<br/>You're supposed to get anything you want on your birthday, right?<br/>Then... I wanna try them all!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_142_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_142_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、魔王…くらえーっ！<br/>え？これはなにって？もちろんプレゼントだよ。罠に仕込んだら、驚くかと思って<br/>ふふ。私、罠を仕掛けるのは得意だからね<br/>とにかく、お誕生日おめでとう|text_cn=嘿咻，魔王——看招！诶？你问这是什么？当然是礼物啦。<br/>我特意把它藏在了惊喜盒子里，就是想看你被吓一跳。呵呵，我可是很擅长偷袭的。总之，生日快乐！|trans_en=Hey, Boss... Take this!<br/>What is it? It's a present, of course! I thought making it look like a trap would be fun!<br/>Hehe. Because I'm good at setting traps!<br/>Anyway, happy birthday!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_143_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ…ようやく気づいたね。もう少し観察力を養ってはどうかな？|text_cn=现在才注意到我吗，我已经观察你很久了。|trans_en=Hehe... You finally noticed me.Maybe you should work on your observation skills a bit more.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_143_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=永夜の情報を掴んだら、すぐに連絡してくれたまえ|text_cn=如果发现了永夜的行踪，请随时联系我。|trans_en=If you get any information about Nocturn Eterna, contact me immediately.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_143_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やあ、おはよう。これから依頼に出るんだが、キミも一緒にどうだい？|text_cn=早上好，我正打算去完成新的委托，要一起吗？|trans_en=Hey, good morning.I'm about to go on a commission. Do you want to join me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_143_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、リロードの時間だ。…ん？いまのは弾の補充を人間の食事にたとえた冗談だよ<br/>ふふっ♪なかなかイケてるだろう？|text_cn=这个时间，该“装弹”了。我是说把人比喻成枪，吃饭就等于在装弹，这是个笑话……<br/>哈哈哈。|trans_en=Now, time to reload.Hm? That was just a joke comparing reloading bullets to humans eating.<br/>Hehe♪Pretty good, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_143_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おや、眠れないのかな？ふむ…ならキミが眠るまで、私が側にいるから安心したまえ|text_cn=睡不着吗？有我在，安心休息吧，我会守在你身边的。|trans_en=Oh, you can't sleep?Hm... Then, I'll stay by your side until you fall asleep, so don't worry.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_143_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=呼ばれた気がしたが…私の出番ということかな？|text_cn=刚刚是你在叫我吗？发生什么事了？|trans_en=I think someone called for me...Is it my turn to step in?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_143_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=地理協会に登録する写真が必要になるそうでね。このポーズ…キミはどう思う？|text_cn=地理协会的人要给我拍一张登记照……<br/>这个动作，你觉得怎么样？|trans_en=It seems a photo is required to register with the Trekker Association. How about this pose?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_143_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミといるときだけは、肩の力を抜いてもいいと思えるようになったんだ<br/>安心感…なるほど、それがこの心地よさの名前か。覚えておこう|text_cn=和你独处的时候，我的神经终于可以不用绷得那么紧……<br/>这就是“安心”的感觉吗？原来如此，我记住了。|trans_en=I've come to feel that I can let my guard down only when I'm with you.<br/>A sense of security... I see. That's the name for this comfort. I'll remember that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_143_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=すまない…少し、休ませてくれ…|text_cn=好像……有点困了……|trans_en=Sorry...Just let me rest a little...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_143_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誰でも簡単に扱える武器を造ってみたんだ。ぜひ試してみてくれたまえ|text_cn=我做了一些普通人也能使用的简易武器，你要来试试吗？|trans_en=I made a weapon that anyone can use easily. Be sure to give it a try.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_143_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=食事へのこだわり？栄養さえ摂取できれば問題ないよ<br/>戦う力が湧いてくれば、私としてはそれで十分だからね。いや、冷却剤のアイスは別腹だ|text_cn=食物不过是填饱肚子的手段，只要有力气战斗就可以了。<br/>不过，雪糕除外。|trans_en=Preferences about food?As long as I can get the nutrients, all is fine.<br/>If it fuels my fighting strength, then that's enough for me. Well, ice cream as a coolant is a different story.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_143_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘の後は、火照った体を冷水で冷やすと疲れが取れるんだ。砲身を冷却するのと同じ原理だよ|text_cn=战斗结束后我通常喜欢泡冷水澡来缓解疲劳，就像武器过热需要冷却一样。|trans_en=After battle, cooling my overheated body with cold water relieves fatigue. It's the same principle as cooling a gun barrel.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_143_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…暑くなってきたな。服の中に熱がこもって…ん？どうしたんだ？<br/>なにをしているのかって？見ての通り、汗ばんできたから服を脱ごうかと…ダメなのか？|text_cn=好热啊……衣服里好闷……<br/>嗯？怎么了？<br/>看了不就知道了……衣服都被汗浸湿了，所以要脱掉……<br/>不能这样吗？|trans_en=Phew... It's gotten hot. Heat is trapped inside my clothes...Hm? What's wrong?<br/>What am I doing, you ask?As you can see, I'm sweating, so I thought I would take off my clothes... Is that not okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_143_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の家は、代々狩猟で生計を立てていたんだ。そしてそんな彼らが残した――<br/>『獲物によって、武器を使い分けろ』という教訓を<br/>私はいまでも忠実に守っているというわけさ|text_cn=在我的故乡，先祖们世代以狩猎为生。他们留下的最宝贵的告诫就是：看清猎物，选择合适的武器。|trans_en=My family has made a living by hunting for generations. And what they passed on—<br/>The lesson "use different weapons depending on the prey"...<br/>... is something I faithfully abide by to this day.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_143_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の故郷では、燦烈者が星ノ塔に登り、人々に暖を取るための神器をもたらしていたんだ|text_cn=在过去，我的家乡会定期选出强者攀登星塔，他们会为族人带回能够取暖的神器。这些人还有一个响亮的称号，叫“猎火者”。|trans_en=In my hometown, the Flame Hunters climbed the Monoliths and brought the people Artifacts to keep warm.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_143_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人の顔はなかなか覚えられないのに、キミの顔だけはすっと頭に入ってきたんだ<br/>なぜだろう？キミの顔に秘密が？ふむ…すまないが、少し観察させてくれないかな|text_cn=我总记不住人的长相，但你却是个例外……<br/>这张脸，难道有什么特别之处？<br/>别动……让我研究一下。|trans_en=Though I am not good at remembering faces, yours is the only one I can recall clearly.<br/>I wonder why. Is there a secret to your face? Hm... Excuse me, can you let me observe you for a bit?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_143_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の趣味は、なかなか人に理解してもらえなくてね<br/>でも武器への理解を深めれば、自然とその魅力に気づくはずなんだ<br/>もし興味を持ったなら、そのときは私のコレクションをみせてあげよう|text_cn=我的爱好确实小众。不过……如果肯稍微了解一下，你就会感受到武器的魅力。<br/>要是哪天你突然感兴趣了，我很乐意给你展示我的收藏，你会喜欢的。|trans_en=My hobby isn't something people tend to understand.<br/>But if you deepen your understanding of weapons, you'll naturally come to appreciate their charm.<br/>If you become interested, I'll show you my collection.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_143_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=暑くなるとダメだな…どうしても思考が鈍ってしまう<br/>すまないが、少し肩を借りてもいいかな？<br/>キミの体はひんやりしていて、クールダウンするのにちょうどいいんだ|text_cn=唔……一热起来脑子就变得迟钝了……<br/>不好意思，肩膀借我用一下？<br/>你的身体凉凉的，正好适合用来降温。|trans_en=I don't like when it gets hot...My thinking gets dull no matter what.<br/>Sorry, but can I borrow your shoulder for a moment?<br/>Your body feels cool, and it's just right for cooling down.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_143_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=以前は自分さえ生き残れば、それでいいと思っていた<br/>でも最近は、少しだけ考え方が変わってね<br/>『あらゆる脅威からキミを守る』そんなことを思ってしまうんだ|text_cn=我以前只在意自己能不能活下来，但最近在意的事情多了一件，我还要确保你也“活下来”。|trans_en=I used to think that as long as I survived, that was enough.<br/>But recently, my way of thinking has changed a little.<br/>"Protect you against all threats."Thoughts like this come to my mind too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_143_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=故郷が再興したあかつきには、キミを連れていくと約束しよう<br/>狩りと美酒だけでなく、あの地には歴史と文化も色濃く残っているんだ|text_cn=等我的族人们重建家园，我会把你带去介绍给他们，届时你就会发现，我们不仅有狩猎和美酒，还有历史与诗歌。|trans_en=When my hometown is restored, I promise I'll take you there.<br/>Not just for hunting and fine wine, but because that land still holds deep traces of history and culture.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_143_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=すまないが、空白旅団の剣を使うお嬢さんに礼を伝えてもらえないかな？<br/>この前もらったソーダ、とてもおいしかったと|text_cn=替我向你们空白旅团那个单手剑道个谢，上次她给我的那瓶汽水，味道还不错。|trans_en=Could you pass on my thanks to the young lady in the New Star Guild who wields the sword?<br/>Tell her the soda she gave me the other day was very delicious.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_143_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=鎖の音…あの戦闘狂の審問官が、近くにいるようだね<br/>見つかれば丸一日手合わせに付き合わされるだろうし…目立つ行動は控えよう|text_cn=我听见锁链声了，那个变态战斗狂修者就在附近。<br/>小心不要暴露了，不然她会缠着要和我切磋一整天……|trans_en=The sound of chains... That battle-crazed Inquisitor seems to be nearby.<br/>If I'm spotted, I'll be forced to spar with her for a whole day...Best to avoid drawing attention.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_143_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前、大斧を持った配達員のお嬢さんに出会ったんだ<br/>彼女の斧はよく手入れされていてとても美しかったが…<br/>それでも私の『ゼロ式・改』のほうが間違いなく美人だ|text_cn=前段时间我遇到了一位信使大小姐，她手上的那把长柄斧被保养得十分美丽。<br/>不过，我的“零式·改”，才更配得上美人之称。|trans_en=The other day, I met a young delivery woman carrying a large axe.<br/>Her axe was well-kept and very beautiful, but...<br/>Still, my "Bayonet Zero Alter" is undoubtedly the real beauty.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_143_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者になったばかりのお嬢さんが、目についた武器を大量に買い込んでいると聞いたんだ<br/>もちろん武器を集めることは否定しないが…<br/>私がまとめたメモを渡したら、きちんと読んでくれるだろうか…|text_cn=听说有位大小姐，刚当上旅人就一股脑买了一大堆武器。<br/>当然，我并不否定收集武器的行为。但还是希望她能看完我写的武器横评再做决定……|trans_en=I heard there's a young lady who just became a Trekker has been buying a large number of weapons that caught her eye.<br/>Of course, I don't oppose collecting weapons...<br/>If I hand her the notes I compiled, do you think she'll read them?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_143_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=劇団白猫のメンバーは全員専用の銃を持っているそうだね。ふふ…おもしろい<br/>見かけたら手合わせしてみよう。ついでに仲良くなって、銃を見せてもらえたらうれしいな|text_cn=听说白猫剧团的成员都配有一把专属枪械，要是哪天遇上了，就和她们切磋一番吧，能借此机会研究下她们的枪就更好了。|trans_en=Seems that all members of the White Cat Troupe have their own guns. Hehe... That's interesting.<br/>If I see them, I'll challenge them to a duel. And if we happen to hit it off and they show me their weapons, that'd be great.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_143_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=湿気で髪がゴワゴワする…もし手が空いているのなら、櫛でといてくれないかな？|text_cn=头发变得毛毛躁躁的……你有空的话能帮我梳一梳吗？|trans_en=My hair is frizzy due to the humidity... If your hands are free, could you comb it for me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_143_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=先に手を出したのはキミだからな|text_cn=这是在挑衅吗？我不会手下留情的。|trans_en=You are the one who starts it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_143_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=シッ…息を潜めて、敵に気づかれないように…|text_cn=嘘……屏住呼吸，不要动，别被敌人发现了。|trans_en=Shh... Hold your breath so you don't get noticed by enemies...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_143_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい武器があれば、こんなにも手持ち無沙汰にはならなかっただろうに|text_cn=如果现在手边能多一把新武器，我大概就不会这么无聊了。|trans_en=If I had a new weapon, I probably wouldn't have become so bored with nothing to do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_143_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=気持ちよさそうなキミの寝顔を見ていたら――ふぁぁ…私のほうまで眠くなってきたよ|text_cn=不知道为什么，看着你的睡脸，连我都感觉到困意了。|trans_en=Watching your peaceful sleeping face—Ahh... It's making me sleepy too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_143_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私はレイス。今回の依頼ではよろしく頼むよ<br/>もし気づいたことがあれば、遠慮せず言ってくれたまえ。|text_cn=风影，即日起与你展开合作。目标是什么，直说就行。|trans_en=I am Wraith. I look forward to working with you on this commission.<br/>If you notice anything of concern, please do not hesitate to speak up.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_143_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミにまた会えるとはね。前回の共闘も悪くなかったし、今回も楽しみにしているよ。|text_cn=又见面了，上次我们的合作得不错，之后也期待与你一起行动。|trans_en=I'm surprised to see you again.Our last team-up wasn't half bad, and I'm looking forward to this one too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_143_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、実戦で試してみよう|text_cn=我已经在期待下一场战斗了。|trans_en=Okay. Let's try this in real battles.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_143_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=体が軽くなった。これでいまよりも戦闘の幅が広がりそうだ|text_cn=嗯……参数提升了。接下来的战斗，会更加游刃有余。|trans_en=My body feels lighter. I can see new possibilities for my combat tactics.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_143_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=過去を振り返っている暇はない。|text_cn=旧日之事，无需怀念。|trans_en=There's no time to look back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_143_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=次はこのリズムで体を動かしてみよう。|text_cn=下次试试跟着节拍战斗吧。|trans_en=Next time, I'll fight to this rhythm.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_143_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう逃げ場はない。覚悟しろ|text_cn=做好觉悟吧！你们无路可逃！|trans_en=You're cornered. Face your end!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_143_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私だって馬鹿ではないんだ。こんな姿を晒すのは、信頼している人の前でだけさ|text_cn=我可不是笨蛋。只有在信赖的人面前，才会暴露出这副毫无防备的样子。|trans_en=I'm not stupid, you know. Only in front of someone I trust would I show this side of myself.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_143_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミにはいつも助けられているな。本当にお返しはいらないのかい？|text_cn=很感谢你一直以来的帮助，不过，真的不需要我回报什么吗？|trans_en=You are always helping me out.Are you sure you don't want anything in return?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_143_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=伝承の中で、魔王がどのように語られていようと、知ったことではないさ<br/>なぜかって？それはもちろん、私の知っている魔王は、強くて優しいキミだけだからさ|text_cn=故事里的那位“魔王”，我并不了解。我只知道站在我面前的你，既温柔，又强大。|trans_en=I don't care how the Tyrant is portrayed in legends.<br/>Why? Because the only Tyrant I know is just you, strong and kind.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_143_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この世界は、キミが思っている以上に危険で溢れている<br/>だが恐れることはない。キミに呼ばれれば、世界の果てでもすぐに駆けつけよう|text_cn=这个世界远比你想象的要更加危险，但只要你需要我，无论天涯海角，我都会赶来你身边。|trans_en=This world is far more dangerous than you imagine...<br/>But there is nothing to fear. If you call me, I'll rush even to the ends of the earth.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_143_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんな困難が降りかかろうと、自らの力で切り抜けてきたし、むしろそれが当たり前だった<br/>だがいまは…ふふ。私を変えた責任はとってもらうよ|text_cn=我早已习惯了独自生存，独自战斗，你的出现改变了这一切，现在我已经不想回到过去了，你也不准逃跑。|trans_en=No matter what difficulties came, I handled them with my own strength, and in fact, that was just the norm.<br/>But now... Hehe. You're going to take responsibility for making me change.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_143_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう。キミの気持ちたしかに受けとった。|text_cn=谢谢，我收下了。|trans_en=Thank you. Your kindness means a lot.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_143_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう。使用感をレポートにまとめるから、ぜひ一読してくれたまえ。|text_cn=谢谢，我会写一份详细的使用测评报告的。|trans_en=Thank you. I'll summarize my user experience in a report. Please be sure to read it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_143_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ガラにもなくはしゃいでいるせいか、胸の鼓動が抑えられないんだ。<br/>ありがとう、大切にするよ|text_cn=心跳得有点快，大概是因为太开心了……谢谢你。|trans_en=Uncharacteristic as it is for me, I find I cannot calm my racing heart.<br/>Thank you—I will treasure this.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_143_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=ああ|text_cn=嗯。|trans_en=Yeah.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_143_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=いや|text_cn=不。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_143_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Hm?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_143_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふむ？|text_cn=这样吗？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_143_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…|text_cn=不……|trans_en=Oh no...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_143_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほう？|text_cn=好的！|trans_en=Oh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_143_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=まったく…|text_cn=你这家伙……|trans_en=Unbelievable...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_143_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くない|text_cn=不错。|trans_en=Not bad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_143_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…|text_cn=呼……|trans_en=Phew...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_143_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=敵なんて、つまりは動くだけの的だよ。当てるだけなら簡単さ|text_cn=不过是个移动的靶子。|trans_en=Enemies are basically just moving targets. Hitting them is easy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_143_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=銃声が響くと、辺り一帯は沈黙に包まれるんだ。|text_cn=枪响之后，一切都将沉默在风雪中。|trans_en=When the gunshot rings out, the whole area becomes silent.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_143_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=邪魔しないでくれ|text_cn=别来碍事！|trans_en=Don't get in my way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_143_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=任務が終わったら、一緒にミルクレープアイスでもどうかな？|text_cn=任务结束后，我要一份千层雪糕。|trans_en=Once we're done with work, how about having mille crêpe ice cream together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_143_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_143_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の武器は人を傷つけるためのものではない。守るための力だ。|text_cn=举起武器，是为了守护，而不是杀戮。|trans_en=My weapon is not something for hurting people. It's a power to protect.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_143_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=掃除の時間だ…！|text_cn=现在是，清场时间！|trans_en=It's cleanup time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_143_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=一気に片付けよう…！|text_cn=目标锁定，全数清除！|trans_en=Let's get it done all at once...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_143_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんな…ところで…|text_cn=只差……一点……|trans_en=Not... in a place like this...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_143_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう一度、故郷に…|text_cn=荣耀归于北境……|trans_en=Once again, to my hometown...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_143_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一発たりとも無駄にはしない|text_cn=我不会浪费任何一发子弹。|trans_en=I won't waste a single shot.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_143_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=止められるものなら止めてみたまえ|text_cn=没有人能阻止我。|trans_en=Stop me, if you dare.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_143_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=重要なのは、力と技術のバランスだよ|text_cn=力量与技巧，缺一不可。|trans_en=A balance of strength and technique is what's important.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_143_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=援護は私に任せておきたまえ|text_cn=这次换我来掩护你。|trans_en=Leave the support to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_143_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまには共闘するのも悪くない|text_cn=偶尔合作一下，倒也不错。|trans_en=It's not bad to team up once in a while.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_143_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ミッションスタート。常に警戒を怠らないように|text_cn=行动开始，保持警惕。|trans_en=Mission start.Always stay alert.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_143_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=力の差を思い知るがいい。|text_cn=它们应该感到害怕。|trans_en=They should learn their place.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_143_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=弾丸…装填完了、セーフティ解除|text_cn=子弹上膛，保险解除。|trans_en=Bullets... Loaded. Safety off.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_143_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=この程度の星ノ塔なら、眠っていても上まで登れそうだ|text_cn=这种程度，我闭着眼都能爬上去。|trans_en=A Monolith of this level? I could climb it in my sleep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_143_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=手短に？いいだろう|text_cn=速战速决？没问题。|trans_en=Make it quick? Got it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_143_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここには強敵がいるんだってね。ぜひ刃を交えてみたいものだ|text_cn=听说这里有强者？那就让我来验证一番吧。|trans_en=I hear there are strong enemies here. I'd love to cross blades with them.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_143_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=武器の性能テストには、ちょうどよさそうだ。|text_cn=陌生的环境才能测试武器的性能，放马过来吧！|trans_en=This seems just right for testing weapon performance.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_143_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=装備のメンテナンス用品がほしいところだが…ここにはあるだろうか？|text_cn=这里有维护装备的道具吗？|trans_en=I could use some equipment maintenance supplies... I wonder if they have any here?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_143_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=狩りの効率を上げるためにも、こまめな休息を意識したまえ|text_cn=充分的休息是为了更好的狩猎。|trans_en=To improve hunting efficiency, remember to take regular rest.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_143_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=恐れることはない。自分の信じた道を進むといい|text_cn=来者无惧，大胆地做出选择吧。|trans_en=There is nothing to fear.Follow the path you believe in.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_143_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さて、次の戦場へ向かおう|text_cn=那么，前往下一个战场吧。|trans_en=Well then, let's head to the next battlefield.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_143_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=次は別パターンを試してみよう|text_cn=忘记留给它们说遗言的时间了，下次我会注意。|trans_en=Next time, let's try a different pattern.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_143_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=武器のテストとしては上々だ|text_cn=呼……帽子歪了，算它们还有点本事。|trans_en=That is excellent as a weapon test.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_143_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=計算通りだ|text_cn=毫无悬念的结果。|trans_en=Just as planned.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_143_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまたま調子が良かっただけさ|text_cn=今天的状态不错，收工。|trans_en=Luck was on my side today.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_143_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=失敗を恐れるな。生きていればチャンスは巡ってくる|text_cn=失败只是暂时的，重要的是活下来。|trans_en=Do not fear failure. Chances come as long as you're alive.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_143_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この借りは、次こそ必ず…|text_cn=我会夺回属于我们的一切。|trans_en=This debt... I will surely repay it next time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_143_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=邪魔者は蹴散らす|text_cn=我会把他们全部碾碎。|trans_en=I'll clear away any meddlers.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_143_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=勝利をこの手に|text_cn=我将取得胜利。|trans_en=Victory is in my hand.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_143_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=生け捕りがお望みかな？|text_cn=要留活口吗？|trans_en=Would you like them captured alive?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_143_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、武器の動作チェックだ|text_cn=实战也是测评的一环。|trans_en=Alright, time to test the weapons.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_143_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_143_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=弾薬を1箱キミに渡しておこう。扱いにはくれぐれも注意するように<br/>ふふ…なんてね。安心してくれたまえ。それはただのチョコレートだ<br/>バレンタインに向けて、ひと月前から準備した甲斐があったよ|text_cn=喏，送你一盒子弹，省着点用哦。<br/>呵呵……不用那么紧张，这些只是巧克力。<br/>今天不是要给特别的人送巧克力吗？大概一个月前我就开始准备了。|trans_en=I'll hand you one box of ammunition. Be very careful handling it.<br/>Hehe... just kidding. Don't worry. That's just chocolate.<br/>It was worth preparing a month in advance for Lovers' Day.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_143_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=メリークリスマス。先日、高台から都市の夜景を一望できる場所を見つけたんだ<br/>よければこのあと、一緒にどうかな？|text_cn=雪愿节快乐。前几天我发现了一个好地方，可以从高处观赏整个城邦的夜景，要一起来吗？|trans_en=Happy Snowish Festival. The other day, I found a spot where you can see the city's nightscape spread out below.<br/>If you'd like, how about we go there together later?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_143_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう。たとえ苦労の絶えない1年だったとしても――<br/>この日を迎えると、不思議と清々しい気持ちになるものだね|text_cn=新年快乐。不管过去一年过得如何，每当新的一年来临，就会觉得特别神清气爽。|trans_en=Happy New Year. Even if it was a year of endless hardships...<br/>When this day comes, there's strangely a refreshing feeling.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_143_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日プレゼントにはなにが欲しいか？<br/>気にしなくていい。私としては、祝ってもらえるだけで十分すぎるくらい嬉しいから<br/>いや、でもせっかくだし…アイスをひとつだけもらおうかな|text_cn=庆祝一个人诞生的日子，真是奢侈又幸福……<br/>问我想要什么礼物？<br/>不用在意，对我而言，有人为我庆祝生日就已经很开心了。<br/>不过……机会难得，我就要一根雪糕吧。|trans_en=What do I want for my birthday present?<br/>No need to worry about it. Honestly, just having you celebrate with me is more than enough<br/>But... Since it's a special occasion... Maybe I'll just ask for one ice cream.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_143_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_143_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日おめでとう。え？どうして知ってるのかって？<br/>特別な相手の記念日を覚えるのは、当然だろう？<br/>では早速、一緒にプレゼントを選びに行こうか|text_cn=生日快乐。怎么？我也是会为了特别的日子收集情报的。走，我们一起去给你挑礼物吧。|trans_en=Happy birthday. How did I know, you ask?<br/>It's natural that I would remember a special person's special day, right?<br/>Well, let's hurry and go pick out a present now.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_144_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おかえりなさいませ。お茶を淹れますので、一杯いかがでしょう？|text_cn=您回来了。我刚刚沏了杯茶，要尝尝吗？|trans_en=Welcome back. Shall I pour you some tea?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_144_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=本日はなにを斬りましょう？|text_cn=今天主公要砍什么？|trans_en=What are we going to swing at today?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_144_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お出かけですか？ええと…2時間後には雨が降りますので、傘を忘れずにお持ちください|text_cn=您等会要出门吗？请等一下……<br/>嗯，两小时后应该会下雨，莫忘带伞，主公。|trans_en=Are you leaving? Erm... It shall rain in two hours, so be sure to take your umbrella.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_144_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お昼は梅のおにぎりにされますか？<br/>それとも昆布のおにぎりにされますか？|text_cn=午饷是要吃这个梅子饭团还是昆布饭团呢？|trans_en=About lunch. What do you fancy?<br/>Would you like pickled plum on your rice balls, or dried kelp?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_144_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセが一晩中お側についておりますゆえ、どうぞごゆっくりお休みください|text_cn=要休息了吗？请安心睡吧。妾身会陪伴在侧，护您一夜安稳。|trans_en=You may rest easy and sleep well. I shall be at your side ... all night.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_144_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ…これは主殿、もしよろしければ、本日はチトセと一緒に…<br/>いえ、本日もご指導をよろしくお願いいたします|text_cn=啊……主公，今天能陪我——唔，能请您指导我修行吗？|trans_en=Er ... my lady? If it pleases you, perhaps we could spend time together...<br/>Ah, no. Ignore me. It's you who makes requests, not me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_144_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセは主殿を守護する刀<br/>たとえこの身が砕けようとも、何人たりとも御身に触れさせはしません|text_cn=此身为主公之刃，即便粉骨碎身，也绝不允许任何宵小伤您分毫。|trans_en=Chitose is the blade that guards you.<br/>Even if I am broken, I shall let no one harm you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_144_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=濡れたままで、寒くないのか？ご心配にはおよびません<br/>主殿とご一緒していると、不思議と胸のあたりが温かくなりますので|text_cn=请不用担心淋雨的事。只要能陪在主公身边，妾身的心中便会感受到温暖，连雨水都变得柔和了起来。|trans_en=You're asking if I'm cold? Why, you don't have to worry about that.<br/>So long as I'm in my lady's presence, my heart burns, and I feel warm all over.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_144_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=主殿、こちらでチトセとともに、雨音に耳を傾けませんか？|text_cn=主公，若是不嫌弃的话，要和妾身一同赏雨吗？|trans_en=My lady, would you like to tarry here, and listen to the rain with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_144_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=五感を研ぎ澄ますこと、これもすなわち修行となります|text_cn=饮食起居，闻风听雨，皆是修习。|trans_en=Sharpening your senses is a part of training.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_144_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=素振りとは、刀を振り下ろす単純動作ですが、常に実戦を意識することが大切です|text_cn=举刀挥刃，虽为平凡之举，然心存实战之念，方显修行之真谛。|trans_en=It's a simple act, to swing a sword. But it's vital to always be ready for battle.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_144_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=刀で斬れるものならば、恐れるに足りません|text_cn=能以剑断者，皆非难事。|trans_en=So long as it can be cut by a blade, you need not fear it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_144_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=この三振の刀は、それぞれ父、母、そして師匠として、日頃より修行を見守ってくれています<br/>いつかチトセ自身も、このような立派な刀へと成長を遂げたいものです|text_cn=从我记事起，行囊里的三把刀……便是我的父亲、母亲和师父，他们一直默默守护着我。<br/>我定不负他们的期望，终有一日，也会成长为和他们一样的利刃。|trans_en=These three blades have watched over my training, as Father, as Mother, and as Master.<br/>I too, wish to become as fine a blade as they were.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_144_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=この装束ですか？<br/>これはチトセがいた道場の稽古着で、門下生は皆、これを着て鍛錬に励んでいました|text_cn=我身上穿的衣服？这是道馆的传统服装，每个孩子都穿着这身道服苦行精进。|trans_en=My outfit? It's the training uniform of my dojo.<br/>It's what all the pupils wore, back when we were training.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_144_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=野宿では、時折ケモノの声を聞くこともありましたが…<br/>目にすることがなかったのは、きっと父や母、師匠が枕元で守ってくれていたからでしょう|text_cn=露宿荒野的时候，有时也会听到野兽的叫声，但每次都相安无事，也许是因为父亲、母亲与师父在枕边守护着我吧。|trans_en=Sometimes, when camping at night, I would hear wild beasts...<br/>But I never saw even one. I believe my father, mother, and Master were keeping watch over me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_144_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセは凪島から出てきたばかりゆえ、もしよろしければ、ご案内いただけますと幸いです|text_cn=我离开风息岛不久，对这片大陆还不是很熟悉，您若是有时间的话……可以带我走走吗？|trans_en=I have only recently left Windhowl Island, so I'd be grateful for your guidance.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_144_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセの故郷――凪島には、季節になると美しい桜が一面に咲き誇ります<br/>主殿にも、ぜひ御覧になっていただきたいです|text_cn=妾身的故乡——风息岛上也有这样的樱花。<br/>主公，待到漫山遍野，万树樱华之时，就请与妾身一同前去赏花吧。|trans_en=In spring back in Windhowl Island, the countryside comes alive with cherry blossoms.<br/>I would love to show you that, some day.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_144_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=寒さが厳しいこの時節は、精神の鍛錬にうってつけです。主殿もご一緒にいかがですか？<br/>はい？寒くはないのか？<br/>問題ありません。主殿とふたりでいると、寒さなど感じませんから|text_cn=冬将军要来了，寒风和大雪对心境的修习大有裨益……<br/>主公愿意陪妾身一起吗？若能与您共赏这漫天飞雪，纵使寒意沁人，心中也尽是暖意。|trans_en=This cold season is the perfect time for steeling your mind.<br/>Would you care to join me, my lady?<br/>Hm? Am I cold, you ask? Why, no, as long as you're here by my side.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_144_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=幼き頃、目をとおした本には『秋の夜は長く退屈である』とありましたが…<br/>どうやら間違いのようです。主殿と語らっているだけで、もう夜が明けようとしていますから|text_cn=我记得幼时看过的书中曾叹道秋夜苦长，现在看来不过是空谈罢了，才和您稍微交谈了几句，天便要亮了。|trans_en=When I was a child, I read that autumn nights are long and dull. But that seems wrong now.<br/>When I talk to you, the dawn seems to come in an instant.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_144_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=湿った空気が気流で押し上げられて…これは豪雨の予兆<br/>ですがあいにく、本日チトセは傘を持っておりません<br/>よろしければ、今夜一晩主殿のもとに…置いていただけないでしょうか？|text_cn=空气中有雷鸣的预兆，今夜……怕是会有场暴雨。<br/>主公，妾身今日未曾携带雨具，可否在此留宿一晚？|trans_en=The damp air rises on the wind. Heavy rain is coming.<br/>... And here I am, without an umbrella.<br/>Would it be possible for me to stay here tonight with you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_144_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=レイスさんはとても強いので、刃を研ぐのに最適です|text_cn=风影很强大，很适合作为磨砺锋刃的砥石。|trans_en=Wraith is very strong. Perfect for honing one's blade.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_144_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=クルニスさんは、刀であるチトセに大変ご興味を持たれており<br/>何度か身体検査にお誘いいただいたのですが…<br/>主殿への忠義に反すると思いましたので、丁重にお断りいたしました|text_cn=科洛妮丝医生对“我是刀”这件事很感兴趣，几次邀请我去检查身体，但我都婉拒了。<br/>总觉得……这不合礼仪。|trans_en=Coronis seems very interested in me, as a blade.<br/>She invited me for assessment several times.<br/>But I declined ... out of loyalty to you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_144_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=オトハというかたは、チトセの来歴をご存知のようですが…<br/>考えすぎでしょうか？|text_cn=那位叫乙叶的人，似乎知道我的来历？或许是我多心了吧。|trans_en=Otoha seems to know a lot about my past...<br/>Should I be worried?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_144_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍璟楼の料理は、手頃な価格なのにとても美味しいです<br/>そこで先日、麻婆豆腐を入れたおにぎりを提案したのですが…<br/>鬼のような形相の店主さんに、却下されてしまいました<br/>麻婆豆腐がお好きではないのでしょうか？|text_cn=怀璟食府的料理味美价廉。<br/>有一次饭后我向这位小老板提议用麻婆豆腐制作饭团，被她用奇怪的表情拒绝了，看来她不喜欢吃麻婆豆腐。|trans_en=The prices at Jing's Bistro are reasonable, but the food is excellent.<br/>The other day, I tried ordering rice balls with Mapo tofu on the inside...<br/>But the cook looked enraged at the idea.<br/>Maybe they don't like Mapo tofu?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_144_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=キャラメルという名の演奏家に出会ったのですが…<br/>彼女の奏でる音は、精神を研ぎ澄まし、心で感じ取ることでようやく理解できる気がします<br/>そういった意味では、集中力の鍛錬に最適なのかもしれません|text_cn=那位名为焦糖的乐手……她的音乐需要静下来用心聆听和感受，这对心境的修习很有作用。|trans_en=I met a performer named Caramel...<br/>The music she played seemed to sharpen my senses, and when I let it into my heart, I suddenly understood so much more.<br/>It would be fine music to train to, I think.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_144_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは…異国の習慣でしょうか？|text_cn=您的举动……是什么异乡的礼仪吗？|trans_en=Is this some kind of foreign custom?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_144_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=刀身は、繰り返し鍛えてこそ強靭なものとなります<br/>ですので、もう少し強くしていただいてかまいません|text_cn=刀身要经过反复锻打才会变得坚韧，主公的力度可以再大一些吗？|trans_en=A blade is tempered by repeated forging and beating.<br/>So tap away, if you wish. I will only grow stronger.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_144_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このままでは、刀身が錆びついてしまいそうです…|text_cn=唔……刀要生锈了。|trans_en=A blade left unused will soon rust.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_144_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=刀は常に磨き清めなければ、その斬れ味を保てません<br/>主殿、そろそろお手入れされてはいかがでしょうか？|text_cn=刀要经常擦拭才能保持锋利和干净，主公要试试吗？|trans_en=To keep its edge sharp, a blade must be polished and cleaned.<br/>My lady, perhaps you can attend to it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_144_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=動かざること山の如し…動かざること山の如し…<br/>やはりいまのチトセでは、まだまだ主殿の境地には遠く及ばないようです|text_cn=岿然不动，止语定心，果然我和您的境界还是差太远了。|trans_en=As immovable as a mountain... As immovable as a mountain...<br/>It seems I've a long way to go yet, my lady, before I'm at your mighty level.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_144_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=凪島にて鍛え上げられた一振りの刀、名をチトセと申します<br/>主殿をお護りするため、誠心誠意お仕えいたしましょう|text_cn=妾身乃风息岛上精心锻造的利刃，名为千都世。为守护主公，妾身必将以至诚之心，竭力侍奉。|trans_en=I am Chitose, a blade forged and tempered on the isle of Windhowl Island. <br/>I pledge myself to your service and protection, my lady.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_144_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夢の中で何度もお目にかかりましたが…<br/>やはり直接お会いできたほうが、その喜びはひとしおです|text_cn=“纵然梦里常幽会，怎比真如见一回。”主公，又见到您真是太好了。|trans_en=I have met you many times in my dreams...<br/>But nothing compares to the joy of seeing you here in person.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_144_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=刀身が鋭さを増しました|text_cn=妾身已更加锋利。|trans_en=My blade grows sharper...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_144_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=道を塞ぐものは、すべて斬り伏せます|text_cn=妾身之躯所向，万物皆断！|trans_en=I'll cut down anything that stands against us.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_144_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=主殿さえよろしければ、チトセとともに凪島へ参りませんか？|text_cn=等您有空的时候，愿意跟我回风息岛看看吗？|trans_en=If it pleases you, my lady, would you journey with me to Windhowl Island?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_144_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この拍子は、鍛錬にちょうどよいですね|text_cn=这段旋律，很适合修行时听。|trans_en=This is good training, for the both of us.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_144_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=覚悟が決まりました|text_cn=此刃此心，已不再迟疑。|trans_en=I have steeled myself.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_144_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセの願いは、主殿のおそばに置いていただくことのみです|text_cn=主公，让我一直为您所用，好吗？|trans_en=My only wish, my lord, is to stay close to your side.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_144_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめてお目にかかったとき、貴方様こそ我が主だと確信いたしました<br/>事実、出会ったばかりにもかかわらず、主殿はチトセを苛む問題を払拭してくださって…<br/>できることは限られていますが、チトセのすべてを懸け、このご恩に報いてまいります|text_cn=见到您的第一眼，我就确信，您就是我要找的持刀人。<br/>果然，才相处不久，一直未能突破的瓶颈便有所松动。<br/>虽然能做的有限，但为了报答您，妾身会献上自己的一切。|trans_en=I knew you were my lady, from the moment I set eyes on you.<br/>Indeed, even at our very first meeting, I felt the burden of all my trials lifted from my shoulders.<br/>Though I'm still limited in what I can do, I pledge everything I have to your service.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_144_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=刀は使い手の健康状態を常に把握しておくものです<br/>ゆえにチトセがおそばにいる間、主殿の健康管理はどうぞお任せを<br/>では早速…こちらの栄養満点の料理を、お召し上がりください|text_cn=对刀来说，持刀人的健康很重要。至少妾身在的时候，会好好监督您的。<br/>这份加入很多滋补之物的料理，还请您全部吃掉。|trans_en=A blade is ever mindful of the state of the one who wields it.<br/>Which means that as long as I'm at your side, I will see to your well-being.<br/>With that said, please dive in and enjoy this nutritious dish I have prepared for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_144_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまはまだ、主殿の見据える先を想像することができません<br/>ですがいつか、その日が来るまで…<br/>チトセは主殿を支え続けると心に誓っています|text_cn=现在的我，还不清楚您眼中看到的是怎样的景象，但在您抵达之前，妾身这把刀，会一直护您周全。|trans_en=Even now, I cannot begin to imagine the path that you envision.<br/>Someday I hope I can. Until then...<br/>I swear to stand by you, and serve you with unwavering devotion.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_144_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまのチトセは、刀としてはまだまだ未熟なれど…<br/>主殿と共に過ごすことで、必ずや立派な刀となってみせます<br/>ですから、どうかこの先も…チトセをひとりにしないでください|text_cn=现在的千都世或许还不能被称为一把成熟的刀……<br/>但我相信，只要在您身边，妾身一定会成为完美的利刃。<br/>所以，请不要放开我，好吗？|trans_en=Even now, my steel is crude and unrefined.<br/>But each day we are together, I grow stronger. Soon I will become a truly magnificent blade...<br/>So please, let me serve you, and do not let me be alone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_144_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=主殿より頂戴したものなら、どのようなものでも嬉しく思います|text_cn=只要是您送的礼物，我都会心怀感激地收下。|trans_en=Whatever I receive from you, my lady, it would bring me joy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_144_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このような品を頂戴するなど、想像していませんでした…<br/>主殿は、いつからチトセの考えていることがわかるようになられたのですか？|text_cn=竟能收到此物……妾身是何时与主公心意相通的呢？|trans_en=I never imagined I would receive such a gift…<br/>My lady how did you know? Have we become so close that you can read my mind?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_144_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとうございます。お返しできるような品は持ち合わせておりませんが…<br/>その代わり、全身全霊をかけ、お仕えいたします|text_cn=妾身无以为报，甘愿为主公赴汤蹈火。|trans_en=Thank you. I have nothing to offer that is worthy of such a gift.<br/>Instead, I pledge to serve you, my lady, with every fiber of my being.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_144_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=御意|text_cn=了解。|trans_en=As you wish.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_144_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=否|text_cn=不对。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_144_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい？|text_cn=欸？|trans_en=Yes?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_144_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…|text_cn=唔……|trans_en=Erm...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_144_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=問題ありません|text_cn=不……妾身没事。|trans_en=I'm fine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_144_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=合点しました|text_cn=原来如此！|trans_en=I understand.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_144_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんの真似でしょう？|text_cn=无礼！|trans_en=What are you doing?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_144_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ…|text_cn=呵呵。|trans_en=Hehe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_144_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=呼。|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_144_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=心は止水の如く…心は止水の如く――|text_cn=心如止水，心如止水。|trans_en=My heart is as still as a forest pond...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_144_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセの斬れ味をご覧ください|text_cn=千都世，拔刀。|trans_en=Behold the edge of Chitose's blade.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_144_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=主殿に仇なす者は容赦しません|text_cn=是恶，即斩！|trans_en=My lady's enemies shall know no mercy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_144_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=問題ごとは、斬って解決しましょう|text_cn=复杂的问题，斩断就好。|trans_en=I'll slice through every problem that comes along.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_144_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_144_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=修行に役立ちそうです|text_cn=此事对剑道的修习大有裨益。|trans_en=This looks useful for training.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_144_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=凪島流抜刀術、蛟噛！|text_cn=刀出鞘，敌无存！|trans_en=Windhowl sword style: Wyrm Fang!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_144_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセの間合いです、逃しません|text_cn=刀锋所至，万物皆寂。|trans_en=You cannot escape Chitose's wrath!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_144_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=早くお逃げください…|text_cn=主公……快逃……|trans_en=Please ... save yourself...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_144_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ…折れていません…|text_cn=妾身……还不能折断……|trans_en=I ... refuse to break...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_144_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=鋭さが増した気がします|text_cn=锋芒再添。|trans_en=My blade feels keener now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_144_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=試し斬りをしてみましょう|text_cn=试斩于此。|trans_en=Let's see how my steel strikes now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_144_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=人刀一如でまいりましょう|text_cn=心剑合一。|trans_en=Soul and blade dance as one.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_144_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=懸待一致の心構えで|text_cn=悬待一致。|trans_en=With mind and soul aligned...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_144_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=白刃の華、咲かせてご覧にいれましょう|text_cn=必展剑华。|trans_en=Behold the blossoming of steel!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_144_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんなりとお申し付けください|text_cn=任您差遣。|trans_en=Say the word and I'll do your bidding.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_144_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセは常に、主殿のおそばにおります|text_cn=随您左右。|trans_en=I shall always be at your side, my lady.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_144_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=主殿、チトセをその手にお取りください|text_cn=听，是刀身颤鸣的声音。|trans_en=My lady, take me into your hand.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_144_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=先手必勝、参ります|text_cn=一击制胜的关键，便是抢占先机，出发吧。|trans_en=He who strikes first, wins.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_144_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=神器は高値で売れると耳にしましたが…<br/>残念ながら刀のチトセには願い事ができません|text_cn=听说出售神器可以获取很高的收入，可惜我并不会许愿。|trans_en=Artifacts fetch a high price, or so I've heard.<br/>But unfortunately, I don't know how to make such wishes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_144_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=露払いなら、チトセにお任せを|text_cn=无论前方是怎样的敌人，妾身都会为您斩断。|trans_en=Let me clear the way for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_144_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこへ赴こうと、チトセの役目はただ１つです|text_cn=每一次攀登都是独一无二的体验，我会全力以赴。|trans_en=No matter where we go, I have only one duty.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_144_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どちらをご所望でしょうか？チトセがお取りしま…はい？よろしいのですか？|text_cn=主公有看中的物品吗？妾身会为您取来。<br/>……欸，不行吗？|trans_en=Which would you prefer? I can fetch it for—oh, I cannot?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_144_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=刀は使っていただくことで、そこに価値が生まれます。遠慮などいりません|text_cn=刀本就是为持刀人所用，主公不必心生怜惜。|trans_en=A sword is only valuable when it is used. Do not hesitate. Wield your blade at will.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_144_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=仰せのままに|text_cn=我会遵从您的每个选择。|trans_en=As you command.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_144_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=傲ることなく、技を磨き続けましょう|text_cn=此身尚不圆满……|trans_en=With humility, let us continue to hone our skills.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_144_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この程度では、試し斬りにもなりません|text_cn=没有更强的敌人了吗？|trans_en=That hardly counts as a practice swing...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_144_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=心は常に、凪いだ水面の如く|text_cn=明镜止水。|trans_en=Let your soul be calm, like a still pond.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_144_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=刀としての役目、果たせたでしょうか？|text_cn=不辱使命。|trans_en=Did I do my duty as a blade?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_144_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=日頃の研鑽の成果です|text_cn=承让。|trans_en=These are the fruits of my training.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_144_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=力が及びませんでした、さらなる修練に励みます…|text_cn=是我技不如人，还需要更刻苦的修习。|trans_en=I was not strong enough. I must redouble my training.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_144_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=切れ味が足りなかったようです…|text_cn=是妾身还不够锋利。|trans_en=It seems my blade was too blunt...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_144_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この身は主殿をお護りする刃|text_cn=此身即为主公之刃。|trans_en=I am a blade forged to protect the wielder.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_144_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=チトセにお任せを|text_cn=交给妾身便好。|trans_en=Leave this to Chitose.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_144_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=正眼の構え|text_cn=千都世，出鞘。|trans_en=Prepare to fight.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_144_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=切っ先をお定めください|text_cn=主公，持刀吧。|trans_en=Aim the blade.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_144_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=Yostar|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_144_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=本日は、お慕いする方へ黒い板状のものを贈る日だと耳にしました<br/>仔細は存じ上げませんが…あいにく手持ちには、こちらの下緒しかなく…<br/>よろしければ、こちらを受け取っていただけますか？|text_cn=听闻这天要给喜欢的人赠送一种黑色的糖果？<br/>妾身不太了解这些，但节庆之日，总要有些仪式感，就把妾身的刀绪赠与主公吧。|trans_en=They say that today is the day you gift brown, flat objects to the one you cherish.<br/>I don't understand the meaning … and sadly, I have only this scabbard cord…<br/>But would you be so kind as to accept it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_144_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『冬の日は、天より舞い降りし六花が咲き乱れる』<br/>クリスマスにこのような美しい光景を目にできるとは…<br/>主殿、チトセと少し外を歩きませんか？|text_cn=“冬日花飘落，当空舞婀娜”。雪愿节恰遇如此美景，可以邀请主公陪我一起走走吗？|trans_en="Six-petalled flowers dance down from the sky on a cold winter's day"...<br/>To see such beauty, on the Snowish Festival day no less.<br/>My lady, would you take a walk with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_144_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今年最初の日の出、なんとも美しいです…<br/>あ――これは主殿、あけましておめでとうございます<br/>凪島にいた頃は、こういった風情ある景色に目を向ける機会がなかったので<br/>つい見入ってしまいました|text_cn=今年的第一次日出，真美啊……啊，主公，新年快乐。<br/>在风息岛的时候，我从未有机会欣赏到这样的景色，不知不觉就看得入了神。|trans_en=To behold the first sunrise of the day... Is there anything more beautiful?<br/>Oh, you're here... Happy New Year.<br/>On Windhowl Island I rarely had the chance to experience such things...<br/>I can't even look away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_144_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=本日は、チトセが刀として鍛え上げられた日ですが…主殿、ご存知だったのですね<br/>お祝いの言葉、恐れ入ります…はい？欲しいものですか？お気遣いは不要です<br/>なぜならチトセにとって、主殿のおそばにいられることが、何よりの幸せですから|text_cn=今天，是妾身作为刀被锻造出来的日子……没想到主公竟然知道。多谢主公惦念我的生日……<br/>欸？想要的礼物吗？能侍奉在主公身侧，便是最为珍贵的礼物了。|trans_en=Today marks the day I was first forged as a sword. Did you know that, my lady?<br/>Well, thank you for the kind words... A gift? Oh, no. There's no need for that.<br/>Just being at your side brings me all the happiness I can bear.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_144_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_144_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=主殿、お誕生日おめでとうございます<br/>贈り物を用意しようとも考えましたが、時が経てば、物はいずれ朽ちゆくもの<br/>ゆえに、主殿にはいつまでも変わることのない、チトセの気持ちをお贈りしたいと思います<br/>どうか…お収めください|text_cn=主公生日快乐。与你相处得越久，就越觉得我能赠予的一切都微不足道……<br/>唯有把自己磨砺得更加锋利，才能更长久地伴您左右。<br/>妾身没有准备什么特别的礼物，至少这份心意还请您收下。|trans_en=Happy birthday, my lady.<br/>I considered getting you a gift, but alas, mere objects are destined to wither away and disappear.<br/>I would rather give you something eternal ... namely, my feelings for you. <br/>I hope that you will keep them close to your heart, for they will never change.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Half Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc144_HalfAnniversary_day06_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc144_HalfAnniversary_day06_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの、主殿。修行を重ね、装いも新たになったチトセはいかがでしょう？<br/>頼もしく感じられますか？はい？少女らしさが増して、まるで妹のように愛らしい…ですか？<br/>はぁぁ…それはつまり、成長するどころかむしろその反対。刀として使い物にならなくなったと…<br/>そうではない？少女らしい見た目が気に入った？なるほど、主殿は少女が好き…覚えました|text_cn=那个，主公。经过一番修行，又换上新装束的千都世……您觉得怎么样？<br/>有觉得更值得依靠吗？诶？多了几分少女的模样，变得和妹妹一样惹人怜爱……？<br/>唉……换言之，千都世不仅没有成长，反而退步了。作为主公的刀已经变得不中用了吗……<br/>不是这样？您很喜欢这幅少女的模样？原来如此，主公喜欢少女，妾身记住了。|trans_en=Umm... Now that I've trained hard and have a new outfit, what do you think?<br/>Do I seem more dependable now? Yes? You mean I look more girlish… Even cute, like a little sister?<br/>Sigh... That means, far from growing up, it's actually the opposite. I've become useless as your blade...<br/>It's not like that? You like my girly look? I see, you like girly girls... I'll remember that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc144_FirstAnniversary_day04_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc144_FirstAnniversary_day04_cn.ogg|text_jp=この1年、チトセにとっては一生忘れることのできない年となりました<br/>長年探し求めていた、チトセという刀の使い手、主殿と出会うことができ…<br/>人刀一如へと至る道は険しいながらも、主殿と…その…新しい刀を打つ約束ができましたので…|text_cn=这一年，于妾身而言，注定会成为此生难忘的一年。<br/>妾身这把刀，长久以来一直在找寻自己的持刀人……如今，终于与主公相遇了。<br/>通往人刀合一的道路，想来仍是凶险重重。<br/>不过……主公已经跟妾身约好了……要一同锻造一把……新的刀了。|trans_en=For me, this year has been one that I shall never forget for as long as I live.<br/>I was able to finally find you, my lady... The wielder I've sought for so many years.<br/>Even though the road to mastering the Oneness is steep... I've made a promise to... Um... Forge a new blade with you, my lady...}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_145_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よくぞおいでくれなんした。さて、今日はいかようにもてなしんしょう？<br/>なにせアチキのもうひとつの顔はメイドでありんす。なんなりと申しつけておくんなんし|text_cn=你来了，想让我怎么招待你？不管怎么说，当年的我也是一名业务出色的女仆呢。|trans_en=Thank you for coming. Now, in what way may I entertain you today?<br/>After all, one of my other identities is that of a maid. Feel free to request anything.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_145_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もうちっと静かに歩きなんし。足音で居場所が気取られんすぇ|text_cn=轻一点……你的脚步声过于独特了，容易暴露自己。|trans_en=Walk a little more quietly. Footsteps will give away your location.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_145_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはようなんし。一日の始まりでありんす。しゃっきりしなんし|text_cn=早上好，打起精神来，美好的一天又开始咯~|trans_en=Good morning. It is the beginning of the day. Rise and shine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_145_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=午後のお天道さんは憎いねぇあれは人を老いさせる、一種の魔物さ|text_cn=要小心午后的阳光，它可是致人衰老的一大利器。|trans_en=The afternoon sun is a real pain. It's a kind of monster that makes you age.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_145_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おやすみなんし。ふふ。静かな寝息でありんすな|text_cn=晚安……你的心跳很平稳呢。|trans_en=Good night. Hehe… I hope you sleep soundly.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_145_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい月でありんすなぁ。これを肴に、アチキと語り合いんせんかぇ？|text_cn=今夜月色正好。以月为肴，要与我共饮一杯吗？|trans_en=The moon is beautiful, isn't it? Why don't we savor it and talk for a while?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_145_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=傘を差す理由でありんすか？ふふ…野暮な詮索はするもんじゃありんせん|text_cn=为什么总是打着伞？呵呵……这不就勾起了你的好奇心吗？|trans_en=The reason for opening an umbrella? Hehe... You really shouldn't pry like that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_145_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつもそうして、相手の目をジッと見ていなんしぇ？<br/>ほんに食えない人でありんすな|text_cn=你平时也是这样，一动不动盯着对方的眼睛看吗？还真是坦诚啊……|trans_en=Do you always stare right into others' eyes?<br/>You really are an impossible person.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_145_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アチキの秘密を知りたいねぇ？それなら言い出したヌシから話すのが筋じゃないかぇ？|text_cn=想要和我交换心底的秘密吗？呵呵，当然要你先说了。|trans_en=You want to know my secret? Since you brought it up, shouldn't you be the one to speak up first?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_145_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ビロードの服と麻の服、生地が違えば見栄えだって当然変わる<br/>けれど身につける人によっちゃ、麻で仕立てた服だって、上ものに見えるもんなのさ|text_cn=天鹅绒也好，麻布也罢，布料不同，质感自然也不一样。<br/>不过呢……关键还得看穿在谁身上。只要穿对了人，哪怕是朴素的麻衣，也会被人看作上等货。|trans_en=Velvet and linen clothes—if the fabric is different, the appearance is bound to change.<br/>But depending on the person who wears them, even clothes made of linen can appear to be of high quality.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_145_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=忍と月は、永遠の相棒のような関係さ|text_cn=月亮是忍者永恒的同伴。|trans_en=Ninja and the moon have a relationship like eternal friends.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_145_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=先日、1日だけ店主をやる機会があったんだけど、店の商品がひとつ残らず売れちまったんだ<br/>アチキには商売の才能があるのかもしれないね|text_cn=上次我去当了一天商店老板，货都卖空了，我果然有做生意的天赋啊。|trans_en=The other day, I had an opportunity to be a one-day shop owner, and every single item in the store sold out.<br/>Perhaps I've got a knack for doing business.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_145_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=息抜きは大事でありんす。アチキの場合、爪の手入れをするのが好きでね<br/>綺麗になった手元を見ると、それだけで気分がアガるのさ|text_cn=每个人都应当找一件能够让自己缓解压力的事情。<br/>我喜欢在闲暇的时候修理指甲，细细地磨出恰到好处的形状，很有意思呢。|trans_en=Taking breaks is important. In my case, I like taking care of my nails.<br/>Just looking at my hands becoming beautiful lifts my mood.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_145_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=人を壊すだけなら簡単さ。恐怖と絶望に、少しの『未知』を混ぜてやりゃいい<br/>そしたら狂気のほうから、勝手にやって来るもんだからね|text_cn=想要摧毁一个人，只需在恐惧与绝望中加入一点点未知，疯狂自会叩响他的门。|trans_en=Breaking a person is easy. Just mix a little "unknown" into their terror and despair.<br/>Then, madness will come crawling on its own.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_145_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=食べ物の好き嫌いは、するもんじゃありんせん<br/>もしそれで体を壊したとしても、自業自得でありんす<br/>え？ナノハが嫌いなものを残しても、同じことを言えるか？|text_cn=不要挑食，营养均衡才能保证身体健康——<br/>等你在逃命的关头跑不动的那一刻，会后悔自己某天中午少吃了一口蔬菜。<br/>诶？你问我是不是对花原也会这么说？|trans_en=Do not be picky about food.<br/>If you ruin your health because of it, it will serve you right.<br/>Huh? Would I say the same if Nanoha left food she dislikes, you ask?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_145_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい女には、秘密のひとつやふたつあるもんさね<br/>アチキの歳を聞いたところで、それが真の話とは限りんせん|text_cn=厉害的女人都会守住自己的秘密，年龄，只是其中最微不足道的一个。|trans_en=A good woman always keeps a secret or two.<br/>Even if I tell you my age, that doesn't mean it's the truth.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_145_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『甘味は人を弱くする』なんて、子どもを言いくるめる方便。大人は気にすることありんせん<br/>好きなときに好きなものを食べればいいでありんす|text_cn=“甜品会令人软弱”——这是针对小孩子的谎言，成年人不必在意。<br/>至少，我从没打算拿这句话要求自己。|trans_en="Sweets make people weak" is an expression often told to children. It's not something for adults to mind.<br/>It's fine to just eat whatever you like, whenever you like.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_145_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちっとばかし利用できればいいと思っていんしたが…<br/>存外、長い付き合いになりそうでありんすな|text_cn=本来只打算利用你一段时间，现在看来，计划得改得长久一点。|trans_en=I thought I'd just use you a little...<br/>But looks like this might turn into an unexpectedly long-term relationship.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_145_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=命知らずと言われようと、ヌシに背中を預ける――その覚悟に後悔はありんせん|text_cn=把我的背后交给你，是个危险的决定……不过我既然做出了这个决定，就不会后悔。|trans_en=Call me reckless if you will, but I'll entrust my back to you—I have no regrets about that decision.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_145_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=闇に足を踏み入れ、戻らなかった者を何人も見てきんした<br/>さて、ヌシはどうなるか…見ものでありんす|text_cn=我见过很多人走进黑夜，却和万物一起被黑夜吞噬，最后只剩影子……<br/>你会是那个例外吗？|trans_en=I've seen many who stepped into the darkness and never returned.<br/>Now, what will become of you?I'll be watching eagerly.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_145_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナノハはおとなしく、繊細で、おまけにすぐ情にほだされんす<br/>そのような性分の者は、本来忍には向きんせん<br/>それでもあの子は、常人離れした忍耐と執念で、見事忍として自立しんした|text_cn=花原这孩子本就不适合做忍者，她温顺、敏感，又容易心软……<br/>但她却用超乎常人的忍耐与执着，成为了一名优秀的忍者。|trans_en=Nanoha is quiet, sensitive, and easily moved by emotion.<br/>A person with that kind of nature is naturally unsuited to be a ninja.<br/>But even still, with her extraordinary endurance and tenacity, she has become an excellent ninja.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_145_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまでもときどき、ナノハとはじめて会ったときのことを夢に見んす<br/>恥ずかしがってうつむいたまま、母親の手を強く握って。ほんにかわいかったでありんす<br/>アチキがこんな話をしんしたことは、あの子に言わないでおくんなんし|text_cn=我偶尔会想起第一次见到花原时她的样子——个子小小的，牵着她妈妈的手，连头都不敢抬……<br/>每次想到那天的情景，就觉得她可爱得让人心软。<br/>这件事，你可要替我保密，千万不要告诉她。|trans_en=Even now, sometimes I dream about the first time I met Nanoha.<br/>She was shy, looking downward and holding her mother's hand tightly. She was really cute.<br/>Please don't tell her that I've told you this story.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_145_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=アグリ・ユニオンの頭は、油断なりんせん<br/>せいぜいヌシも、足をすくわれないよう気をつけなんし|text_cn=联合种业的那些女人个个都是狠角色，魔王你要小心哦，千万别被她们吃掉了。|trans_en=Do not underestimate the head of United Harvest.<br/>You should be very careful not to be caught off guard.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_145_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍璟樓で食事をしんしたが、あそこの店長の口のうまいこと<br/>皿の下に忍ばせた贈り物、気に入ってもらえるといいでありんすな|text_cn=上次我去怀璟食府吃饭，那位只比柜台高一点的小老板嘴巴可甜了，希望她能喜欢我压在餐盘下的礼物。|trans_en=I had a meal at Jing's Bistro, and their manager sure knows how to talk.<br/>I slipped a little gift under the plate—I hope she likes it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_145_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵意志、神の代理人を名乗る仰々しい組織でありんすが…<br/>果たして無私の守護者か、卑劣な盗人か…どちらでありんしょうね|text_cn=恩赐意志……一个自称“神明代理人”的组织。<br/>呵呵，到底是无私的守护者，还是卑劣的窃贼？谁又说得准呢。|trans_en=Grace Imperium is a pretentious organization that calls itself God's representatives...<br/>Are they selfless defenders, or despicable thieves... Which is it, I wonder?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_145_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=教わりんせんしたかぇ？女が髪を梳いてるときくらい、口を出しなんすなと|text_cn=有没有人教过你，不要在女士梳理头发的时候打扰她？|trans_en=Hasn't anyone told you? At least when a woman is brushing her hair, don't interrupt her.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_145_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ。獅子は子ネコにちょいと引っかかれたくらいじゃ、怒りやしんせん|text_cn=狮子可不会因为被小猫挠几下就发脾气……|trans_en=Hehe. A lion won't get angry just because a kitten gave him a little scratch.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_145_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おや、戻ってきんしたか。てっきりアチキには愛想つかしたのかと思いんしたぇ|text_cn=呵呵，你终于回来了？我还以为你已经对我厌倦，不想再搭理我了呢。|trans_en=Oh, you've returned. I thought for sure you had gotten tired of me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_145_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうされんした？封印魔法なぞかけた覚えはありんせんぇ？|text_cn=嗯？我不记得对你施加过封印术啊。|trans_en=What's wrong? I don't remember casting any sealing spells on you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_145_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こそこそしていても、ヌシの企みは筒抜けでありんす<br/>とはいえきちんと戻ってきんしたし、今回だけは大目に見てやりんしょう|text_cn=就算你躲起来不说话，我也知道你在做什么哦……<br/>但看在你最终还是会回来的份上，就不和你计较了。|trans_en=Even though you're sneaking, your plan is obvious.<br/>Be that as it may, you did return properly, so I will overlook it just this time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_145_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初対面で信用してほしいとは言いんせん<br/>まずは「オトハ」という名だけでも覚えていっておくんなんし|text_cn=让我想想，第一次见面，该用哪种身份才能让你更加信任我呢？不过首先，请你记住“乙叶”这个名字。|trans_en=I won't say I want you to trust me on our first meeting.<br/>For now, just try to remember my name—"Otoha."}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_145_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お初にお目にかかりんす。アチキは……<br/>ふふ、もちろん覚えていんす。いまのは場を和ますための冗談さ|text_cn=初次见面，请多关照……呵呵，我当然记得你，这只是个用来调节气氛的小玩笑。|trans_en=Nice to meet you for the first time. I am...<br/>Hehe, of course you remember. That was a joke to lighten the mood.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_145_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さらに精進しんしょう|text_cn=更进一步。|trans_en=Let's proceed further.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_145_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだまだこんなものではござりんせん|text_cn=触碰极限。|trans_en=This is nowhere near enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_145_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしあのときに戻れるのなら…なんて、ただの冗談さ|text_cn=如果时光能倒流就好了……哈，开玩笑的。|trans_en=If I could go back to that time... Well. I'm just saying.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_145_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この旋律は、耳に心地良いでありんす|text_cn=流动的旋律，令人愉悦。|trans_en=This melody is soothing to the ear.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_145_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夜は秘密を隠しんすにも、大掃除にもうってつけの時間でありんす|text_cn=黑夜不仅适合掩藏秘密，也是清理垃圾的绝佳时刻。|trans_en=Night is the perfect time to hide secrets—and for a thorough cleaning.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_145_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=変装ってのは、多少の「ほころび」があったほうが、それらしく見えるもんさ|text_cn=即使是最完美的伪装，也需要一点“破绽”才显得真实。|trans_en=A disguise with a few "flaws" actually looks more convincing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_145_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=結果は上々、文句のつけようがありんせん<br/>これからも連絡しんすから、よろしくお願い申しやす<br/>ふふ。必ずしも、ヌシにとって都合のいい時とは限りんせんけど|text_cn=你的表现着实超出了我的预期……以后我也会常联系你的，……在你意想不到的时候。|trans_en=The result is excellent and I have no complaints.<br/>I'll be in touch from now on. Thank you in advance.<br/>Hehe. Though it might not always be at a time that's convenient for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_145_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アチキらの出会いは偶然ではござりんせん<br/>ふふ…すべては入念に練り上げたアチキの計画どおりでありんす|text_cn=事到如今，你还以为我们的相遇是偶然吗？那可是我精心安排的计划，一切都是那么完美……|trans_en=Our meeting was by no means a coincidence...<br/>Hehe... Everything went exactly according to my carefully crafted plan.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_145_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=闇に慣れんした者は、蛍火ですらお天道さんに見紛うとおっせえす<br/>それもまた、もののあはれというものでござりんしょう|text_cn=人们常说，惯于行走在黑夜里，就会错以为萤火是阳光……但短暂的、一瞬的希望也足以令人珍视。|trans_en=They say those accustomed to darkness might mistake even a firefly's glow for the sun.<br/>Perhaps that is what we call the pathos of things.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_145_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヌシと出会うまで、あの願いは決して叶わぬものと諦めていんした<br/>けれどいまは違いんす。ヌシと一緒なら、きっと叶えられんしょう|text_cn=曾经我以为自己永远不可能实现那个愿望了，直到你出现……你一定能成为我最强的底牌。|trans_en=Until I met you, I had given up on that wish, thinking it would never come true.<br/>But things are different now.If I'm with you, I'm sure it will come true.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_145_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヌシからの贈り物なら、ありがたく頂戴いたしんす|text_cn=既然是你送的，我就收下了。|trans_en=Since it's a gift from you, I will accept it gratefully.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_145_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ。ヌシの感性は、いつもアチキの期待を裏切りんせんぇ|text_cn=呵呵，你的品味，一直没让我失望。|trans_en=Hehe. Your taste never disappoints me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_145_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この贈り物を選ぶのにも、ずいぶんと苦労をかけたでありんしょう？<br/>ありがとうござんす。いつまでも大切にしんす|text_cn=为了挑选这份礼物，你一定费了不少心思吧？多谢，我会好好珍惜的。|trans_en=You really went out of your way to find this for me, didn't you?<br/>Thank you. I'll cherish it forever.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_145_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=あい|text_cn=很好。|trans_en=Good.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_145_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=だめ|text_cn=是吗？|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_145_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Hm?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_145_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほう？|text_cn=哦？|trans_en=Oh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_145_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにさ…|text_cn=不……|trans_en=What...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_145_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふむ|text_cn=太好了。|trans_en=Hmm.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_145_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=にくらしい|text_cn=竟敢……！|trans_en=Detestable.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_145_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ようござんす|text_cn=真棒。|trans_en=Very good.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_145_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉。|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_145_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=妖しさと危うさは、いつだって表裏一体さ|text_cn=美丽与危险总是并存的。|trans_en=Mystery and danger are always two sides of a coin.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_145_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=アチキの名刺、大事にとっておきなんし|text_cn=这是我的名片，请您收好。|trans_en=Please keep my business card well.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_145_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=取引成立さね|text_cn=合作愉快。|trans_en=Deal's formed.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_145_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=遺言はあるかぇ？アチキが伝えておきんしょう|text_cn=有什么遗言吗？我会帮你转达的。|trans_en=Do you have any last words? I'll pass them on for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_145_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_145_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日一日のこと、アチキに聞かせてくなんしぇ|text_cn=今天有什么新鲜事吗？说来听听。|trans_en=Tell me all about your day, will you?}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_145_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=月明かりに酔いしれなんし、それ|text_cn=在月光中沉醉吧。|trans_en=Let the moonlight intoxicate you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_145_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これにて幕引きでありんす、ふふ|text_cn=花影散尽，此即终焉。|trans_en=And with that, the curtain falls.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_145_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これで、ゆっくりできそうだね…|text_cn=可以做个好梦了……|trans_en=Now, I can finally relax...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_145_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=終わりさね…|text_cn=落幕吧……|trans_en=This is the end...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_145_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こいつはおもしろくなりそうだね|text_cn=看来不会无聊了。|trans_en=Looks like it will be interesting.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_145_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい判断だよ|text_cn=最好的选择。|trans_en=That's a good decision.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_145_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力、アチキにしか御せやしんせん|text_cn=这样危险的力量，只有我能控制。|trans_en=This power can only be controlled by me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_145_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=厄介ごとは、すべてアチキに任せておきなんし|text_cn=有我在，很多事会简单许多。|trans_en=Leave all the troubles to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_145_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=興味深い組み合わせでありんす|text_cn=绝妙的搭配。|trans_en=What a fascinating combination.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_145_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者の鍛錬、なかなかおもしろいねぇ|text_cn=旅人们的训练方式还算有趣。|trans_en=Trekkers' training is pretty interesting.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_145_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アチキひとりじゃあ信用ならんかぇ？|text_cn=怎么，是信不过我一个人吗？|trans_en=Don't you trust me on my own?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_145_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=怖いのかぇ？ならもっとアチキのそばに寄りなんし|text_cn=呵呵，如果觉得害怕，就靠近一点……|trans_en=Scared? Then come a little closer to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_145_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=心配しなんすなぇ。アチキはヌシの味方さ。少なくともいまは…ね|text_cn=别担心，我站在你这边……至少现在是。|trans_en=Do not worry. I am your ally. At least, for now...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_145_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ…昨夜は寝る時間が遅くなりんしてなぁ<br/>ヌシの誘いでなければ、いま頃はまだ寝ていたでありんしょう|text_cn=哈……如果不是魔王约我，这会儿我还在休息呢。|trans_en=(yawn)... I slept at a late time last night.<br/>If not for your invitation, I'd probably still be asleep right now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_145_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どれ、軽く捻ってやりんしょう|text_cn=动动手腕的事情，你怎么还紧张了？|trans_en=Let's give it a little twist and see what happens.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_145_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまには趣向を変えてみるのも悪くありんせん|text_cn=不错，总要来点新花样。|trans_en=It's not bad to change things up once in a while.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_145_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの店員、どうにも疲れてるようでありんすな。いまなら…<br/>こういうときは、さりげなく店番を代わってやるのが、人情というものではないかぇ？|text_cn=那位店员小姐，看上去有些疲惫呢，或许我们可以趁她不注意的时候……好好帮她看管收银台。|trans_en=That shopkeeper seems very tired. You know...<br/>At times like this, isn't it an act of kindness to quietly step in and tend the shop for her?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_145_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしや…星ノ塔から出なければ、若さを保てるのかねぇ？|text_cn=如果一直呆在星塔里，是不是就可以永葆青春了？|trans_en=If you don't leave the Monolith, can you stay young forever?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_145_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=縁のあるお人が、お待ちかねのようだよ|text_cn=有缘之人在等我们呢。|trans_en=Looks like someone with a special connection to you awaits.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_145_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい夢は見られそうかぇ？|text_cn=让它们做个好梦吧。|trans_en=Do you think they'll have a good dream?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_145_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この程度、まだまだ序の口さ|text_cn=很惊讶吗？这只是个开始。|trans_en=This is just the beginning.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_145_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=一匹たりとも逃がしはしんせん|text_cn=真乖~一个都没逃走。|trans_en=I won't let a single one run away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_145_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=宴は結構でござんす|text_cn=庆功会我就不参加了。|trans_en=I'll pass on the victory party.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_145_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=行きんしょう。ここには残響とホコリしかありんせん|text_cn=走吧，这里只剩残响和尘埃了。|trans_en=Let's go. There's nothing here but echoes and dust.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_145_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おや、読みが外れたようでありんす|text_cn=嗯，这次是我算漏了一步。|trans_en=Oh, it seems I misread the situation.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_145_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=失敗から学ぶこともありんす|text_cn=任何经历都有存在的价值。|trans_en=There are things to learn from failure.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_145_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=厄介事に巻き込まれたのかぇ？|text_cn=是遇上大麻烦了吗？|trans_en=Did you get into trouble?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_145_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アチキの手が必要かぇ？|text_cn=怎么？是想要我帮你吗？|trans_en=Do you really need my help for this?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_145_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ずいぶん信頼されたもんだね|text_cn=呵呵，看来你对我很放心嘛~|trans_en=You trust me quite a bit.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_145_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=自己紹介は必要かぇ？|text_cn=不用自我介绍了吧。|trans_en=There's no need for self-introduction, right?}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_145_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=Yostar|text_cn=Yostar|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_145_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=かような特別な日には、ヌシのことだからとうに予定が入っていると思っていんしたが…<br/>え？アチキのために空けていたでありんすか？<br/>ふふ。それなら…誰の邪魔も入らない、とっておきの場所にお連れしんしょう|text_cn=像今天这样浪漫的日子，魔王一定早早有约了吧……<br/>嗯？你要和我一起过？<br/>呵呵，那我就带你去有趣的地方玩玩吧，是那种不会对外公开的地方哦。|trans_en=On a special day like this, I assumed you would already have plans...<br/>Huh? You kept today free just for me?<br/>Hehe. In that case... I'll take you to a special place where no one will disturb us.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_145_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=クリスマスくらい、好きに飲み食いするのもおつなもんさ<br/>ヌシもアチキと一緒にどうでありんすか？|text_cn=对我而言，雪愿节就是一个能放肆吃喝、心安理得休息的假期。<br/>如果你没有特别的安排，就留下来陪我喝一杯吧。|trans_en=At least at Snowish Festival, it's fine to eat as much as you like.<br/>How about you and me together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_145_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとうなんし。新しい年の始まりを、アチキとともに祝いんしょう|text_cn=年历上又是新的数字了，一同庆祝我们又平安度过了一年吧。|trans_en=Happy New Year. Celebrate the start of the new year with me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_145_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アチキの誕生日を祝ってくれるのかぇ？ふふ。ありがとうなんし<br/>なら、ちっとばかし贅沢を言わしてもらうと…<br/>そうさねぇ、ヌシのメイド服姿を拝んでみたいものでありんすなぁ|text_cn=祝我生日快乐？谢谢，既然你都开口了，我提一个生日小愿望不过分吧？让我想想……<br/>我还没见过你穿女仆装的样子呢。|trans_en=You're going to celebrate my birthday? Hehe. Thank you.<br/>In that case, if I may be so bold...<br/>Hmm, I'd really like to see you in a maid outfit.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_145_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_145_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日おめでとうござりんす<br/>この世に生を受けんしたからには、この先も胸を張って、人生を謳歌しなんし<br/>アチキもずっと、ヌシと一緒にいんしょう|text_cn=生日快乐，魔王，今天过得还好吗？既然来到了这个世界，就别停下脚步——<br/>我会陪你一直往前走的。|trans_en=Happy birthday.<br/>Since you were born into this world, keep your head held high and live life to the fullest.<br/>I will always be here with you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Half Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc145_HalfAnniversary_day07_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc145_HalfAnniversary_day07_cn.ogg|text_jp=ずいぶんと楽しそうでありんすなぁ<br/>アチキの知りんせん、ヌシが旅したこの半年間の冒険譚。ぜひ聞かせておくんなんし|text_cn=你看起来很开心呢。看来这半年的旅程中，发生了不少有趣的事吧？<br/>那些我还没听过的冒险故事，来说给我听听吧。|trans_en=Sounds like you've had a lot of fun.<br/>Your adventure stories of the past six months that I don't know about... Tell me about them.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc145_FirstAnniversary_day05_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc145_FirstAnniversary_day05_cn.ogg|text_jp=陰に身を潜め、表には顔を出さぬのが、本来あるべき忍の姿<br/>とはいえこのような機会をいただきんした以上、顔を出さぬわけにはいきんせん<br/>はて？アチキに聞きたいこと？この愛らしいモフモフな尻尾を、普段どのように隠しているのか？<br/>それは…まだ秘密でありんす。もう少し仲が深まれば、その折にお教えいたしんしょう|text_cn=忍者本就该将自己藏进阴影里，不轻易在旁人面前现身。<br/>不过，既然都给了我这样的机会，偶尔露个脸也无妨。<br/>嗯？想向我打听什么？这条毛茸茸的尾巴平时是怎么藏起来的……<br/>那个嘛……暂时还是秘密。等我们的关系更进一步，我或许就会告诉你哦。|trans_en=A true ninja stays hidden and never shows their face.<br/>That said, for an opportunity like this, I can hardly resist making an appearance.<br/>Well? Anything you want to ask me? How do I normally hide my adorable and fluffy tail?<br/>That's ... a secret for now. It shall be revealed when we get to know each other a little better.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_147_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いま作ってる曲ができたら、一番最初に聴いてくれませんか？|text_cn=我在写新的曲子，要当第一位听众吗？|trans_en=Listen. I want you to be the first to listen to my new song, 'kay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_147_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=最初はこっちのエフェクターでしょ。で、スラップのときはコンプレッサーに切り替えて…<br/>って、わひゃあっ！？プ、プロデューサーさん！いつからいたんですか！？|text_cn=等到演出的时候这段就先这样，再这样……最后——<br/>哇！制作人，你什么时候来的？！|trans_en=So, this pedal first, then switch over to the compressor... <br/>Gyah! P-Producer! I didn't know you were there!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_147_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさん、おはようございまーす！|text_cn=早上好，制作人！|trans_en=Good morning, Producer!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_147_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさん、お弁当を作ってきましたよ！<br/>なんと、私の得意料理…『ベース温泉たまご』です！よかったら食べてみてください！|text_cn=制作人，我给你带午饭来啦~快尝尝我拿手的贝斯蒸蛋！|trans_en=I made you some lunch! And it's my specialty! Bass boiled eggs! I really hope you'll like them!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_147_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今夜は空が澄んでますね。星見のおともに、ベースの音色はいかがですか？|text_cn=今晚的星空也很美啊，还没睡的话，听听我的演奏吧？|trans_en=It's a great night for star-gazing. How about a little bass to set the mood?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_147_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん〜っ、いい天気♪弦がキラキラ光ってて、音の粒がベースの上で踊ってるみたい|text_cn=天气真好，阳光洒在琴弦上，弹出的每一个音符都在闪闪发光。|trans_en=What an awesome day! ♪ The strings are sparkling and it feels like music dust is dancing to the bass!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_147_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=音楽は、耳じゃなくて心で聴くんです！<br/>そうすれば、きっとベースの魅力に気づいてもらえるはずです！|text_cn=音乐需要用心去听。没错，用心去倾听的话，一定能感受到贝斯那独特的魅力！|trans_en=If you listen with your heart instead of your ears, I'm sure you'll come to love the bass!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_147_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして、ベースに興味あるんですか？<br/>えへへ…プロデューサーさんが聴きたいっていうなら、いくらでも演奏してあげますよ？|text_cn=嘻嘻……想听再久都没关系哦，制作人……|trans_en=Are you interested in bass? Hee hee... I'd be happy to play as long as you want, Producer!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_147_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=異なる二つのメロディーが混ざり合うと、どんな音楽を奏でるんでしょうね。わくわくします♪|text_cn=当不同旋律碎片碰撞时，会迸发怎样的灵感呢？制作人，我已经开始期待了……|trans_en=Wanna see what happens when you mix two different melodies together? C'mon, it'll be fun! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_147_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさんって、星ノ塔で眠ってたんですよね？<br/>それってなんだか神秘的で、特別で…<br/>プロデューサーさんの存在そのものが、未完成の名曲みたいです！|text_cn=制作人是从星塔中走出来的。既特别，又闪耀……还能听懂我琴声。<br/>这样的存在……本身就是首未完成的协奏曲！|trans_en=You were sleeping in the Monolith, right? That's kinda of weird and mysterious. <br/>Your whole life is like a hit song waiting to be written!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_147_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=毎日全力で練習してたら、体が壊れちゃうんじゃないか？ふふ、大丈夫ですよ<br/>この子は頑丈だし、演奏後は毎回きちんとお手入れしてますからね！|text_cn=每天这么高强度练习，会不会吃不消？<br/>没关系的！我可是每天都有在好好保养贝斯呢。|trans_en=Practicing all-out every day is unsustainable? <br/>Hehe, no need to worry. This baby is tough, and I take good care of her after every session!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_147_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=『ベース温泉たまご』の作り方？<br/>たまごをお湯に浸してる間、ベースの音を聴かせ続けるだけでできますけど…<br/>ふふ、簡単でしょ？<br/>あのトロットロのたまごがあれば山盛りごはんもペロッといけちゃうんですよねぇ～♪|text_cn=贝斯蒸蛋的做法很简单的！打个蛋，放蒸锅蒸十分钟，期间不间断地演奏贝斯来调味……<br/>每当想奖励自己的时候，我都会做一碗这样的贝斯蒸蛋，小小一份就能拌一大锅饭呢~|trans_en=Making bass boiled eggs is easy. You just put them in boiling water and play the base next to them. <br/>Hee hee! And those ooey-gooey eggs go great on a heaping mountain of rice! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_147_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=海はとても温かくて…ひとりで演奏してると、波の音が優しいリズムを刻んで<br/>私を包み込んでくれます。空は…ちょっぴり冷たいときもありますが<br/>ときどき雨を降らせて、演奏で火照った体を冷ましてくれますね<br/>同じ自然でも、性格は正反対ってことでしょうか？|text_cn=大海很热情，在我演奏的时候，它经常会和我一起打节拍。<br/>天空就比较冷淡了……不过偶尔它也会下场雨来回应我~不同的听众，性格也大不一样呢。|trans_en=The ocean's so warm, and when I play alone, it's like the waves are carrying me in their gentle rhythm. <br/>The sky... Well, it can be cold sometimes, but a nice rain after a long, hot set is refreshing. <br/>I guess nature has all kinds of different personalities.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_147_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=フラヴィオで路上ライブしてた頃毎日聴きにきてくれる女の子がいたんです<br/>そしたらある日、こっちにトトトッて近づいてきて…<br/>『お姉ちゃん、わたしにギター教えて！』って。あぁ…かわいかったなぁ…|text_cn=在弗拉维奥街头演出的时候，有个小女孩每天都过来听。<br/>后来有一天，她跑过问我：姐姐，我能跟你学吉他吗？真是可爱的孩子啊……|trans_en=Back when I was doing street shows in Flavio, there was a little girl who used to come listen every day. <br/>One day, she toddled up and asked if I would teach her the guitar. It was so adorable!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_147_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=ライブ衣装で出歩くのって、そんなにおかしいですか？<br/>星ノ塔の御使いさんたちは、みんなこういう服を着てますし…<br/>だからこそ、その服装を真似たほうが、星ノ塔にも認めてもらえそうな気がするんです！<br/>個人的には、もうちょっと派手でもいい気がするんですけど…♪|text_cn=为什么要一直穿着演出服到处跑？可星塔里的神使都是这么穿的呀……<br/>制作人，你觉得这样的穿着，星塔会认可吗？是不是还需要加点金属装饰之类的……|trans_en=Is it weird to wear a show costume out in public? I don't think so.<br/>The Monolith Angel always dresses like this, so I thought this would be a good way to get some Monolith-based recognition! <br/>Frankly, I wish it was a bit more showy, but I guess it will do... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_147_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ソロで活動する理由？<br/>前にバンドを組んだこともあるんですが、呼吸があわなかったというか<br/>音楽性の違いというか…みんな本当にいい人だったんですけどねー<br/>「ベースは前に出るな」とか言わなければですけど～|text_cn=为什么一直独行？嗯……以前也有和一些人合作过，但总感觉没有遇到很契合的伙伴。<br/>不过，只是在音乐上有些理念不合而已，大家都是很好的人！如果不总说“贝斯的音量要再收一收”就更好了……|trans_en=Why did I go solo? Well, I WAS in a band, but we didn't mesh musically or whatever...<br/>I mean, they were good people, <br/>except for when they would say stuff like "bass is a backup instrument, don't steal the spotlight."}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_147_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=「どうしてギターにしないの？」って、よく聞かれるんですよね<br/>たしかにギターは派手で人気もありますけど…<br/>そもそも私、人気者になりたくて音楽やってるわけじゃありませんから<br/>ベースで『星ノ塔の音』に応えていつか私の奏でる音を塔に認めてもらえれば、それでいいんです|text_cn=有人劝我改弹吉他……为什么呢？虽然弹吉他会很有人气，可我并不是想要人气呀……<br/>我只是想用手中的贝斯回应星塔之音，让我的旋律得到星塔的认可。|trans_en=People always ask why I don't play guitar. <br/>It's true that it's flashier and more popular, but I don't do music because I want to be famous or anything. <br/>I just wanna accompany the Monolith Notes with my bass and be recognized by the Monolith for it someday.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_147_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさんと一緒なら、いつかきっと<br/>私の音楽は星ノ塔に認めてもらえると思います！|text_cn=如果有你的帮助……我的音乐，一定能响彻星塔吧。|trans_en=As long as I stick with you, I just know that one day my music will be recognized by the Monolith!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_147_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=しばらくベースを弾かない場合、弦を緩めとかないとネックが反っちゃうんです<br/>それはプロデューサーさんも同じですよ？たまには気持ちを緩めないと♪<br/>というわけで…ふたりだけのライブとか、どうですかね？|text_cn=琴如果一段时间不弹的话，就要把弦松一松，不然一直紧绷着，琴颈就会被拉变形。<br/>制作人也是这样，操心的事太多，就更要记得放松喔。<br/>所以……制作人，我们去星塔里开演唱会吧？|trans_en=If I'm not going to play my bass for a while, I have to loosen the strings so the neck doesn't warp. <br/>The same applies to people, you know? You have to loosen up sometimes, or you'll end up twisted. ♪ <br/>So how about we do a show in the Monolith, just me and you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_147_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=路上ライブをしてると、よく子どもたちが集まってきて。その笑顔を見てると、だんだん<br/>私の気分までノッてくるんです。あはは…ちょっと前までは、他人の感想なんて<br/>全然気にしてなかったんですけどねー。プロデューサーさんのおかげで、心の声にも耳を<br/>傾けられるようになりました！お客さんの声や、熱狂する気持ちも、音楽の一部…なんですよね|text_cn=在路边即兴演奏时，经常会有孩子围上来。他们的笑脸会让我的拨弦节奏变欢快，安静的注视又让旋律不自觉地温柔起来……<br/>以前我从不认为他们是“听众”，是制作人教会我如何感受心灵的声音，那些轻浅的呼吸，热情的惊叹，都成了即兴演奏的和声。|trans_en=Lots of children watch my street gigs, and their smiling faces always cheer me up. It's funny.<br/>I never used to care about people's opinions, but thanks to you, I've started paying more attention to feelings. <br/>I've realized that my fans' thoughts and energy are also a part of my music!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_147_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=前に星ノ塔の御使いさんに会ったとき、どうしたら塔に認めてもらえるのか、聞いてみたんです<br/>でもどういうわけか、ただニコって笑いかけてくるだけで…<br/>はぁ～、私の実力が足りないから、教えてもらえなかったんでしょうかぁ…|text_cn=之前我去星塔里请教神使大人，怎么样才能得到星塔的认可。<br/>她们就只是微笑……是我的实力还不足以让她们赐教吗？|trans_en=I've asked the Monolith Angels before what I need to do for the Monolith to recognize me. <br/>The only answer I got was a slight smile... (Sigh) Guess I'm not even good enough to deserve a proper reply...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_147_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ライブでアオバさんみたいに派手なパフォーマンスを入れれば<br/>私も星ノ塔に認めてもらえるのかなぁ…？|text_cn=要是我的演奏，也能像青叶的表演那样闪耀的话……我就能被那高塔之上的星光眷顾了吧？|trans_en=Maybe if I do a crazy show like Aobelle, the Monolith will finally recognize me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_147_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍族の料理って、すっごくおいしいですよねぇ～♪<br/>お店でバイトしたら、毎日食べさせてもらえないかなぁ…<br/>報酬はまかないだけでいいんだけど…♪|text_cn=龙裔的料理真好吃啊，要是天天都能吃到就好了……<br/>要不然我去她们店里打工吧！不需要什么报酬，只要能管饭就行……|trans_en=Loong cuisine is so good! ♪ <br/>Would they let me eat for free if I worked at the shop? I wouldn't ask for a salary or anything... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_147_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=セイナさんに星ノ塔の話を聞かせてもらいたいんですけど、なかなかきっかけが…|text_cn=好想找尘沙了解更多星塔的事……可是，要怎么开口比较好呢？|trans_en=I've always wanted to ask Noya about the Monolith, but I haven't had a chance...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_147_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=シャトンって傭兵の子に、特訓のためだとかで、激しい曲を演奏してって頼まれたんですけど…<br/>なかなか大変なことになりそうです|text_cn=那位叫猫眼的佣兵说，她喜欢节奏感强的音乐，还邀请我去帮她特训……听上去是好艰巨的挑战。|trans_en=The mercenary Chaton asked me to play something aggressive for her special training. <br/>I think it's going to be hard work for both of us...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_147_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ひぃ～ん…！プロデューサーさぁん！耳ばっかり触らないでください～！|text_cn=制作人！不要摸我的耳朵……|trans_en=Eep! Producer! Please quit touching my ears!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_147_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまのリズム、いい感じです！<br/>プロデューサーさんには、ドラムの才能があるかもしれません！|text_cn=刚才这段的节奏感真好！您或许很适合当鼓手呢。|trans_en=I like that beat! You might have some talent for the drums, Producer!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_147_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさんのお仕事が終わるまで、ここで練習しながら待ってますね！<br/>…あ～、もしかして邪魔しちゃってます？|text_cn=制作人是在忙吗？那我在这里练一会琴……不会吵到你吧？|trans_en=I'll just get some practice in here until you're finished with work! I hope I'm not getting in your way...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_147_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの…ずっと黙り込んでますけど、もしかして悩みごとですか？|text_cn=怎么这么安静……是有什么心事吗，制作人？|trans_en=... You're awfully quiet. Something on your mind?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_147_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さすがですプロデューサーさん！<br/>私が隣で楽しくベースを弾いてても、全然集中を切らさないなんて！心から尊敬します！|text_cn=制作人做事真专注啊……我弹了这么久，您竟然完全不受影响，好厉害！|trans_en=Wow! You can even keep your concentration with me playing bass right next to you! That's an amazing accomplishment!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_147_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔の鼓動を、リズムに乗せて届けます！<br/>ソロ活動中のベーシスト、キャラメルだよ！よろしくね！|text_cn=自由贝斯手——焦糖！是名用琴弦连接星塔之音的乐手∼|trans_en=Solo artist Caramel here, rocking to the beat of the Monolith! Enjoy the show!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_147_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わーっ！また私の演奏聞きにきてくれたんですかぁ！？<br/>…あ、もしかしてプロデューサーさん、もうすっかりベースのトリコになっちゃったとか？<br/>いいですよ、今日はどの曲が聴きたいですか？|text_cn=您又来听我演奏啦~难道说……制作人喜欢上我的贝斯了？！这次想听什么曲子呢？|trans_en=Yay! You've come to hear me play again? <br/>Could it be that you've fallen in love with the bass? I'll play whatever you want, so make a request!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_147_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=リズムにノッてくよー！|text_cn=享受每个音符的律动！|trans_en=I'm on the beat!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_147_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=弦の振動にあわせて、魂がビートを刻んでる！|text_cn=震颤的不是琴弦，是灵魂的共鸣！|trans_en=My very being is resonating with the beat!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_147_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そっか…この音にはじめて出会ったのは、あのときだったんだね…|text_cn=最初令我着迷的，正是这仿佛包罗万象的音律啊……|trans_en=I see... That was the first time I heard this sound...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_147_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うーん…ちょっと低音が足りない気がする|text_cn=嗯……低频好像不太够的样子。|trans_en=Hmm... I don't think it has enough bass.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_147_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ベース旋風を巻き起こすよー！|text_cn=我，即是那迫近的风暴！|trans_en=Get ready for a bass tornado!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_147_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の心の声、プロデューサーさんにちゃんと届いてるかな？|text_cn=我的心声，有成功传达给你吗，制作人？|trans_en=Are you feeling the rhythm? Are you feeling ME?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_147_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんでかな？プロデューサーさんと一緒にいると<br/>きれいなメロディーが胸の中に流れ込んでくるような気がする|text_cn=和制作人在一起的时候，美妙的旋律总是在我心里，源源不断地流淌……|trans_en=I don't know why, but I always feel like beautiful music is flowing right through me when I'm with you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_147_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんなに遠く離れた場所にいても…音楽が、大切な気持ちを届けてくれる<br/>プロデューサーさん、私の心の声、ちゃんと聞いててね|text_cn=音乐能够打破内心与外界的屏障，琴弦的震动传递着那些难以言说的祈盼。<br/>制作人，我的心声……你可要认真听哦。|trans_en=Music speaks straight from the heart, across time and space. <br/>I hope you'll listen for the sound of MY heart, Producer.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_147_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさんが私を信じてくれるから、私も自分を信じられる<br/>だから…その日が来るまで、そばで支えてくれると嬉しいです|text_cn=谢谢你，制作人。你的认可与鼓励，让我更加坚信，我的梦想一定会实现。<br/>在那天到来之前，你可以一直在我身边支持我吗……？|trans_en=You believing in me makes me believe in myself. <br/>So, please ... stay by my side until THAT day comes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_147_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いままでは、大自然の中で演奏して、星ノ塔に認めてもらえればそれだけでいいと思ってたんです<br/>でも…プロデューサーさんに出会ってから、大自然の鼓動も、私の演奏を笑顔で聴いてくれる<br/>人たちの声も、すべてがあわさって一つの音楽になってるんだって気づきました<br/>だから…この先もずっと、一緒にいてくれると嬉しいです|text_cn=曾经的我一直认为，我的琴声只为了星塔而鸣，山川星辰才是我的最佳听众……<br/>但制作人让我意识到，无论是风雨声、雷鸣声，还是人们的心跳声，终将不分彼此，汇聚为星塔之音。<br/>只要和制作人在一起，我就能更接近星光所在的地方。|trans_en=I always thought I'd be happy just playing by myself in nature and being recognized by the Monolith. <br/>But since I met you, I've come to realize that nature's rhythms and the fans' smiling faces are all part of the music.<br/>That's why ... I hope you'll always stay by my side.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_147_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁーっ！プロデューサーさん、ありがとうございます！|text_cn=哇！谢谢制作人！|trans_en=Wow! Thank you so much, Producer!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_147_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=きれい…♪星みたいにキラキラしてます|text_cn=像星星一样闪闪发光呢！|trans_en=It's beautiful... ♪ It twinkles like a star.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_147_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わーい！ベースケースに入れて、毎日持ち歩きますね！|text_cn=嗯！我要把它放进我的包里随身携带，就像……你一直在身边一样！|trans_en=Yay! I'll put it in my bass case and take it everywhere!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_147_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=ですね|text_cn=没错。|trans_en=Right.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_147_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=え～|text_cn=不会吧？|trans_en=Umm...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_147_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=そう？|text_cn=对吗？|trans_en=Really?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_147_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうだろう…|text_cn=我不明白……|trans_en=I dunno...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_147_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなぁ…|text_cn=怎么会？|trans_en=No way...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_147_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=すごーい！|text_cn=好厉害！|trans_en=That's amazing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_147_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=もぉーっ！|text_cn=我生气了！|trans_en=(Pout)}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_147_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=いぇーい！|text_cn=好耶！|trans_en=Yay!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_147_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ〜…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=(Sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_147_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=がんばれ私…！|text_cn=我还要更加努力……|trans_en=You can do it, Caramel!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_147_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさん、よろしくお願いします！|text_cn=拜托了，制作人。|trans_en=Thanks for your support, Producer!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_147_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=聞こえますかー？|text_cn=能听到吗？|trans_en=Can you hear me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_147_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=どっちでも大丈夫ですよ|text_cn=我都行。|trans_en=Either way is fine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_147_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_147_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ベースの素晴らしさよ、みんなに届け！|text_cn=来感受贝斯的魅力吧！|trans_en=Feel the power of bass!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_147_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=圧倒的な音圧でぶっ飛べー！|text_cn=感受这绝妙的律动吧！|trans_en=Have a taste of this sonic blast!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_147_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魂のビートをくらえーっ！|text_cn=这就是终结一切的击勾！|trans_en=Hyper bass! Feel the beat of my soul!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_147_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう…無理です…|text_cn=我还能……坚持……|trans_en=The show ... can't go on...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_147_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=リズム、狂っちゃった…|text_cn=节奏……乱了……|trans_en=I lost the beat...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_147_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、星ノ塔にベースの音を響かせるよ！|text_cn=我会让贝斯声响彻星塔。|trans_en=I'm feeling the bass now! The Monolith's gonna rumble!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_147_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=このグルーヴ感、さいっこー！|text_cn=框架要搭建起来了。|trans_en=Woohoo! I'm in the groove!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_147_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ベースソロ、いっきまーす！|text_cn=下面是独奏环节！|trans_en=Time for a bass solo!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_147_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここのリズムは任せて！|text_cn=这里的节奏就交给我吧。|trans_en=I'm all over this beat!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_147_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい感じの音が作れました！|text_cn=低音准备就绪。|trans_en=Mm-mm, love this sound!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_147_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=都市での演奏もいいんですけど、やっぱりこっちのほうがテンションあがりますね！|text_cn=相比在城里的舞台上，我还是更享受在这里的演出。|trans_en=Playing in the city is fun, but this is WAY more exciting!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_147_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=塔の中で流れてる曲って、リズム取りやすくていい感じなんですよねー♪|text_cn=这里的曲速，正好在我的拍上！|trans_en=Music in the Monolith has a nice beat that's easy to follow!  ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_147_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=次のライブどうしよっかなー？<br/>アタック感強めのスラップから入って、エモいフレーズにつないで…速弾きも入れたいし…|text_cn=我想好了，这次就先来一段帅气的拍弦，然后琶音，速点……唔，还要考虑动态平衡的问题……|trans_en=What should I do for my next show? Maybe get it going with a slap guitar groove, slip in an emo melody ... then start shredding...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_147_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=そろそろ新しいエフェクターも試してみよっかなー|text_cn=来试试新的效果器吧。|trans_en=Maybe I should try some new effects pedals...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_147_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=チューニングよし！いつでも始められます！|text_cn=调试完成，随时可以开始演奏。|trans_en=I'm in tune and ready to go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_147_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここで最高の演奏をすれば、星ノ塔に認めてもらえるかな？|text_cn=这场演出，如果拼尽全力的话，星塔会认可我吗？|trans_en=You think the Monolith will pay attention if I put on the show of my life?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_147_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=即興？あわせるのは得意だよー♪|text_cn=要即兴演出了吗，我很擅长哦。|trans_en=A jam session? You know I can keep up! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_147_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここでの買い物はドーラがいらないなんて…神！！|text_cn=在这里可以用辉光币付账，真是太好了……|trans_en=I don't need Dorra to buy stuff here? That's so lit!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_147_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=弦って強く張ると切れちゃいますし…<br/>プロデューサーさんも、あんまり無理しないでくださいね？|text_cn=弦绷太紧的话会断哦，来休息下吧，制作人。|trans_en=Even the best strings break when you wind them too tight... So don't overdo it, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_147_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よかったら、セッションしませんかー？|text_cn=来一段即兴演奏吧~|trans_en=Wanna jam together a little?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_147_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれー？みんな、盛り上がってる？|text_cn=咦？怎么这么安静，是我的演奏不够精彩吗……？|trans_en=Why's everyone so quiet? Not feeling it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_147_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ？私のピック、どこいったんだろう？|text_cn=等等，我捡一下地上的拨片……|trans_en=Huh? Where did my pick go?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_147_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい、今日のライブはここまでー！|text_cn=抱歉，这里没有安可环节。|trans_en=And that's the end of our show!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_147_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=完璧なプロデュースでした！次もお願いしますね！|text_cn=真不愧是制作人，下次也拜托你指导啦。|trans_en=Perfect producing! Thank you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_147_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日の演奏の感覚、しっかり覚えとかないと|text_cn=印象深刻的演出，我会好好记录下来的。|trans_en=I'm totally going to remember this performance.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_147_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔の音、まだ理解できてなかったのかな…|text_cn=我对星塔之音的理解，还远远不够……|trans_en=I guess I just don't understand the Monolith Notes yet...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_147_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=同じミスは繰り返さないようにしなきゃ…|text_cn=刚刚的失误……下次绝对不会再犯了……|trans_en=I need to learn from my mistakes...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_147_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=チームのリズムは私に任せて|text_cn=请让我来把控节奏。|trans_en=Leave the beat to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_147_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう一回リハいっとく？|text_cn=不需要再彩排一下吗？|trans_en=Should we rehearse again?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_147_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=もうちょっとだけ、ボリューム上げていいですか？|text_cn=嗯……我可以把音量调大一些吗？|trans_en=Can I turn up the volume just a little?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_147_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=チューニング完了！ライブスタート！|text_cn=调音完成，随时开场。|trans_en=I'm in tune and ready to start the show!}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_147_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=YOSTAR|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=YOSTAR}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_147_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はバレンタインですね！<br/>というわけで…手作りチョコに、甘くて幸せなメロディを聴かせたら<br/>ようやく思い描いた理想の味に近づいたんです<br/>なので、その…よかったら、味見してもらえませんか？|text_cn=听说这一天大家都会把巧克力送给自己重要的人……我一边制作巧克力，一边弹奏甜甜蜜蜜的乐曲，终于调出了理想的味道……<br/>那个，要尝尝看吗？|trans_en=It's Valentine's Day! <br/>I made chocolates and played a sweet and happy melody as I did. I think I came pretty close to the flavor I was aiming for. <br/>So, um... Would you like to try some?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_147_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさん！一緒に雪景色を見に行きませんか？<br/>あ、でもその前に…聴いてください――『火山を讃える曲』<br/>…どうですか？なんとなく、胸のあたりがポカポカしてきませんか？<br/>ふふ。これで、寒さもへっちゃらですね！|text_cn=制作人，我们去欣赏雪景吧~啊，不过请先稍等……这是我为火山写的曲子，怎么样，是不是感觉暖和起来了？这样就不怕着凉了！|trans_en=Producer! Wanna go look at the beautiful snow? But before we go...<br/>Here, listen to this—"An Ode to Volcanoes." <br/>Well? Doesn't it just totally warms you up inside? Hehe. No need to worry about getting cold now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_147_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=初日の出に、なにをお願いしたか？<br/>ダメですよ、そういうのは人に喋ったら叶わなくなるって言われてますからね<br/>あ、でも…ふふ、私のお願いは、もう叶ってるのかもしれません♪|text_cn=新年愿望？愿望说出来就不灵啦。嘻嘻，不过有制作人在身边，我相信愿望一定会实现的~|trans_en=What was your New Year's wish? <br/>Wait! They say if you tell anyone, it won't come true. But, um... I have the feeling that my wish has already come true! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_147_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日ということで、星ノ塔でバースデーライブとかどうでしょう？|text_cn=难得的生日，等下我们去星塔里面，举办生日专场演出好不好？|trans_en=How about I do a birthday show at the Monolith?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_147_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_147_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プロデューサーさん、お誕生日おめでとうございます！<br/>それでは聴いてください。この日のために作った特別な一曲…<br/>『魔王メモリアルバースデー＝ストーム＝ラプソディ』|text_cn=生日快乐，制作人！请听这首为你而作的，《魔王诞生日风暴狂想曲》！|trans_en=Happy birthday, Producer! <br/>Hey, listen to this! I made a special song just for this day. It's called "Boss's Special Birthday Storm Rhapsody."}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_140_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラボラビ、おもてなしモード！かわいいケーキとお茶はいかが？|text_cn=兔子派切换到“管家模式”了。要她给你泡杯茶吗？再配上点可爱的小蛋糕怎么样？|trans_en=Rabbit Pie, hospitality mode! How about a cute cake and tea?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_140_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日のあなたも、最っっっ高にキュート！見てるだけで元気が湧いてきちゃう♡|text_cn=今天的你也超级无敌可爱！看到这么一张脸心情都变好了~|trans_en=You are UNBELIEVABLY cute today, too! Just looking at you energizes me~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_140_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよう。朝はトーストでいい？って、そんなに驚くところ？<br/>たしかに職人は夜ふかししてる人も多いけど、私の場合は生活のリズムを大事にしてるの♪|text_cn=早上好，来份烤面包？呃，至于这么吃惊吗？<br/>不是每个工匠都喜欢熬夜搞发明，我可是很讲究作息规律的。|trans_en=Good morning. Is toast for breakfast okay? Wait, why are you so surprised?<br/>It's true that there are many professionals who stay up late, but in my case, I make sure to keep a good routine ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_140_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お昼ごはんにウサギ餅を作ったんだー♪<br/>作り方は簡単だよ。お米をこねたらそれをウサギの形にして、お砂糖をかければ出来上がり！|text_cn=午饭我做了兔子麻薯~<br/>制作方法很简单，只要把米碾碎做成兔子的形状，再撒上糖霜……就完成了~|trans_en=I made bunny mochi for lunch ♪<br/>It's easy to make. Once you knead the rice, shape it into a bunny, then put some sugar on it, and it's ready!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_140_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ、もう夜？いろいろやってると、1日があっという間に感じるなぁ<br/>でもせっかく来てくれたんだし、ちょっとお話ししていかない？|text_cn=嗯？已经是晚上了？一忙起来，时间一下就过去了……<br/>不过既然你来了，我们就一起休息会儿吧~|trans_en=Oh, is it night already? When I'm doing various things, one day feels like an instant.<br/>But since you came here, why don't we talk a little?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_140_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ？私のアイデアノートだよ。機密情報ってわけでもないし、もし見たければ、ひと声かけてね<br/>機密情報はどこにあるのって？それはもちろん、私の頭の中だよ|text_cn=我手上这本？这是我的发明笔记。想看的话随时和我说。<br/>哎呀，算不上什么机密……毕竟，最关键的数据都在我脑子里呢。|trans_en=This? It's my idea notebook. It's not secret info or anything, and if you want to see it, just say it.<br/>Where is the secret info, you ask? Of course, it's in my head.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_140_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=スーパーオートラビには、なんとマッサージ機能つきなの！このベルを鳴らすとね――<br/>あっ、ちょっと待って！せっかくだし、あなたが座って試してみて♪|text_cn=超级行动派自带按摩功能哦，只要摇一下这个铃……<br/>啊，这样吧~先等我移到另一把椅子上，你坐上来亲自感受一下。|trans_en=Super Action Pie has a massage function! When you ring this bell—<br/>Oh, wait a minute! Since you're here, you should sit down and try it ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_140_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ま、魔王さん！笑ってないで助けてぇ～～！<br/>スーパーオートラビが猛スピードで暴走して、目が回っちゃって…|text_cn=魔王，帮下忙！超级行动派暴走了！它的转向指令输出成了把我转向……别、别光顾着笑啦！|trans_en=Oh, Tyrant! Don't laugh, help me!<br/>Super Action Pie is running wild at ultra speed...! I'm getting dizzy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_140_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁぁ～……あれ？なんで私、こんなところで寝てるんだろう？<br/>さっきまでロングイヤーラボラビのデザインを考えてたのに<br/>って、そんなことより魔王さん！体起こすの手伝ってぇ～！|text_cn=呼……咦，我、我怎么在这儿睡着了？<br/>不对，我明明在构思新的长耳朵瞭望派……总之，魔王快来扶我一把啦~|trans_en=Yawn... Huh? Why am I sleeping in a place like this?<br/>I was just thinking about a design for a long-eared Rabbit Pie until a moment ago.<br/>But more importantly, Tyrant! Help me get up!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_140_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ブロッチが持ってきた依頼、どれも退屈そうだし、いまからでも断っちゃいたいなぁ…<br/>う～ん…でも一度は引き受けるって言っちゃったし…う～ん…|text_cn=好想把布洛可硬塞给我的那堆订单全扔了，都是些无趣的需求，浪费我的时间。唉，但接都接了……|trans_en=The commissions Bloc brought all look boring, and I want to refuse them even now...<br/>Hmm... But I did already say I would take them... Hmm...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_140_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえ、魔王さん？もっとよ～く顔を見せて？<br/>にゅふふ。こんなにかわいい顔を眺めて仕事ができるなら、面倒な依頼もがんばれるのに♡|text_cn=魔王，来来……你再靠近点~ 啊……<br/>呵呵，要是每天都能看到这么一张可爱的脸……那些讨厌的订单好像也变得能接受了呢~|trans_en=Hey, hey, Tyrant?Show me more~ of your face?<br/>Nyehehe. If I could work while looking at such a cute face, I could do my best on even tedious commissions.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_140_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと待って。かわいいネジの締め方を思いついたから…<br/>はい、できたー♡それでお話しってなに？|text_cn=稍等，我刚想到一个可以把螺丝拧得很可爱的方法……<br/>嗯~好了！现在可以专心听你说话了，你要找我聊什么？|trans_en=Wait a minute. I thought of a cute way to tighten screws...<br/>Okay, it's done~ So, what did you want to talk about again?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_140_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんって、フィーリエで起きた『暴走植物事件』の現場にいたんでしょ？<br/>知性植物って、ラボラビたちと似てるところがある気がして、実は私も前から気になってたの<br/>アグリ・ユニオンの研究者と会って、詳しく話を聞いてみたいなー|text_cn=听说你是菲莱那场“植物混乱”的亲历者？嗯……智慧植物的思路倒是和我的兔子派有相似之处……<br/>兔子派是通过内部对大量信息的筛选与逐步推导来完成指令，智慧植物呢？真想和它们的研究者见个面好好聊一下啊~|trans_en=Boss, you were at the scene of the "Intelligent Plant incident" in Philae, right?<br/>I feel like intelligent plants are slightly similar to Rabbit Pies, and it's been on my mind for a while.<br/>I'd like to meet with United Harvest researchers and listen to them talk in detail.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_140_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんなに性能がよくたって、見た目がかわいくなかったら、テンション上がらないでしょ？<br/>私がかわいいデザインにこだわってるのは、そういう理由なの♪|text_cn=再好用的设备，如果长得不可爱，用起来也会心情低落吧？<br/>所以我会在设计上增加一些可爱的“小装饰”，这样才有益身心健康嘛！|trans_en=No matter how good the performance, if it doesn't look cute, it's not exciting enough, right?<br/>My insistence on cute design is for that reason ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_140_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=ムーナワークスの職人はラボを隠そうとするけど…<br/>私としては、帝国護衛隊が絶対に追いつけないラボを作ったほうがおもしろいと思うの|text_cn=柔光会社的人，最重要的就是隐匿自己的工坊。<br/>可我倒是觉得，光隐匿也太被动了，不如造一个让帝国卫队追不上的工坊比较有趣。|trans_en=Neo Grace Organization workers try to hide the lab, but...<br/>As for me, I think it would be more interesting to make a lab that the Imperial Guard could never catch up to.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_140_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=スーパーオートラビに乗ると、歩く速さの3倍のスピードで移動できるの！<br/>それに加速するときの音はオルゴール風にしてあるから、とっても快適なんだー♪|text_cn=“超级行动派”的移动速度比步行快三倍，而且加速时的引擎声，我特意调成了八音盒的音色。<br/>我可是很注重体验的~|trans_en=When you ride the Super Action Pie, you can move at three times walking speed!<br/>And when you accelerate, it is like a music box, so it's very pleasant ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_140_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今度スーパーオートラビに、魔王さん専用の特別シートをつける予定なの<br/>もちろん一緒に乗ってくれるでしょ？きっといいストレス解消法になるよ|text_cn=我打算给“超级行动派”追加一个魔王专用副驾驶位，等做好了，就喊你来体验一下~<br/>到时候我们一起轻松愉快地去飙轮椅，很解压的！|trans_en=I plan to put in a special seat in Super Action Pie exclusively for you, Tyrant.<br/>Of course, you'll ride with me, right? I'm sure it will be a good way to relieve stress.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_140_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラボラビを作ったのは、寝る前におとぎ話を読んでもらうためだったの<br/>でもちっともうまく喋ってくれなくて…<br/>にゅふふ。平気だよ。新しい技術は、失敗を糧に日々進歩するものだからね|text_cn=制造兔子派的初衷，是希望她能给我读睡前童话的，只可惜，它的发声方式太僵硬，语音模块还有很大的改进空间……<br/>呵呵~我可没有灰心，每一项新技术的诞生，都要经历这样的阶段。|trans_en=The reason I made Rabbit Pie is so I could have a fairy tale read to me before I sleep.<br/>But it doesn't speak well at all...<br/>Nyehehe. It's fine. New technology uses failure as fuel to progress day by day.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_140_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつかメカマオーンは本物の魔王さんを超えるか？<br/>にゅふふ～、どうかなー？魔王さんがも～っといっぱいデータを提供してくれたら…<br/>その可能性は、ゼロではない…かもね♪|text_cn=魔王派在未来是否会取代魔王？呵呵，你真是提了一个尖锐而有趣的问题~<br/>如果能给我更多了解你的机会……这个假设或许有成真的可能？|trans_en=Will Boss Pie surpass the real Tyrant someday?<br/>Nyehehe, I wonder. If you provide me with more~ and more data...<br/>That chance is not zero... Maybe ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_140_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしても断れない依頼以外は、かわいい人のために時間を使いたいんだー<br/>そういうわけだから、かわいい魔王さんからの依頼なら、手続きなしで受けてあげるからね♡|text_cn=除了那些无法推脱的订单需求，我更喜欢给可爱的人发明有趣的东西。<br/>尤其是你——如果是来自可爱魔王的委托~就不用走那些麻烦的流程啦！|trans_en=Other than commissions I absolutely can't turn down, I want to use my time for cute people.<br/>Because of that, if it's a commission from the cute Tyrant, I'll accept it application-free~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_140_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ブロッチってば、いつもあなたを使って私を説得しようとするの。ほんと困ったものだよ<br/>魔王さんの顔を見たら、私が断れなくなるって知ってるんだよね|text_cn=布洛可总是找你帮忙说服我。哎，真是被她拿捏住了喜好……<br/>对着你的这张脸，我就知道自己没办法拒绝她的请求。|trans_en=Bloc always uses you to try to persuade me. It's such a bother.<br/>When I see Tyrant's face, I become unable to refuse, and she knows that.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_140_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=レオはよく「発明勝負だ！」って挑んでくるんだけど…<br/>私と勝負したいなら、もっと修行したほうがいいと思うんだよね|text_cn=莱欧总是缠着我要比试发明，哎，我劝她还是再练几年吧~|trans_en=Leona often challenges me saying "Invention battle!"...<br/>If she wants to battle me, I think she better train some more.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_140_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=レッドアイズの魔女たちがノロノロ飛んでるのは、空気力学を理解してないからだよ<br/>あんな抵抗の大きな箒で、速く飛べるはずないでしょ？|text_cn=绯瞳传讯那些魔女，飞行速度提不上去，纯粹是因为她们不懂空气动力学。扫帚的阻力那么大，怎么可能飞得快？|trans_en=The reason Scarlet Sights Media witches fly slowly is that they don't understand aerodynamics.<br/>There's no way to fly fast with a broom with so much resistance, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_140_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウィローは全然わかってない！義手が拡声器に変形するとか、絶対実用的なのに<br/>まあ…ウィローはかわいいから、私のアイデアが採用されなくても許してあげるけど|text_cn=真搞不懂薇洛怎么想的。她不觉得义肢能变形成喇叭，是多么便捷和精妙的设计吗？唉……<br/>算了。谁让她长得那么可爱呢？|trans_en=Willow doesn't understand at all!A prosthetic that transforms into a megaphone is definitely practical.<br/>Well... Willow is cute, so I'll forgive her even if my idea is not adopted.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_140_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=照明機能もついてるし、クルニスの義眼って、すっごくおもしろいよね<br/>ラボラビにも搭載できないかな？|text_cn=科洛妮丝医生的义眼很有趣，她还向我展示了其中的一项照明功能……<br/>或许我也可以试着给兔子派加装一个？|trans_en=There's even a lighting function with Coronis's prosthetic eye. Really interesting, isn't it?<br/>I wonder if I can install one in Rabbit Pie?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_140_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんって、よく私にツンツンってするよね？<br/>目的はわからないけど…より本物に近づけるために、メカマオーンにも実装しよっかな|text_cn=魔王有时不时戳我一下的习惯。虽然不知道这么做有什么意义……<br/>但为了追求更高的还原度，就把这个功能也实装到魔王派上吧~|trans_en=Tyrant, you often poke here and there, right?<br/>I don't know the point, but... To get closer to the real thing, maybe I'll implement this trait in Boss Pie?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_140_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=暇なら私のラボに来る？おもしろいものがたくさんあるよ|text_cn=如果你觉得无聊，可以去我的工坊坐坐，里面有不少好玩的东西。|trans_en=If you're free, why not come to my lab? There are a lot of interesting stuff.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_140_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして、私がゆっくり考える時間を作ってくれてるの？にゅふふ。魔王さんは優しいね|text_cn=这是……留给我安静思考的时间吗？真是体贴啊，魔王。|trans_en=Could it be that you're making time for me to think carefully? Nyehehe. You're so kind, Tyrant.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_140_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=人と話すと、頭の中を整理できるからね。魔王さん、よければちょっとお話ししない？|text_cn=有时，适当的交流也会有助于我的思考，所以……魔王，你在吗？|trans_en=When I talk to people, I can organize my thoughts. Tyrant, if it's okay, will you talk with me for a bit?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_140_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ、魔王さん？どこ行っちゃったんだろう<br/>でもちょうどいいし、新しい童話を読んで待ってようかな|text_cn=魔王……似乎不在？正好这篇童话没还看完，我就在这里边看边等好了。|trans_en=Huh, Boss? Where did you go?<br/>But that's just right, maybe I'll read a fairy tale and wait.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_140_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ようこそ、スパクルの移動式ラボへ――<br/>ってやだっ、あなたすっごくかわいい！かわいすぎて鼻血出そう！<br/>ラボラビ、スーパーオートラビ、私たちの新しいお友だちにご挨拶して！|text_cn=欢迎来到斯帕克拉的移动工坊……等等，这张脸可爱超标了……兔子派，超级行动派，快来打个招呼，之后这位就是我们的新朋友了~|trans_en=Welcome to Sparkla's mobile lab...<br/>—Wait, you're SO cute! Too cute, my nose might bleed!<br/>Rabbit Pie, Super Action Pie, greet our new friend!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_140_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして、メカマオーンの試運転に協力してくれるの？開発者としては頼もしい限りだよ|text_cn=你是决定……亲自参与魔王派的测试了吗？呵呵，对魔王派的发明者来说，这可真是一个好消息!|trans_en=Are you saying that you'll help in the test run of Boss Pie? As a developer, I couldn't ask for anything better.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_140_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=パラメータ、調整完了。前より手触りがよくなったよ♪|text_cn=参数调整完毕，手感比之前好多了。|trans_en=Parameter adjustment complete. The feel is even better now ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_140_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=制限解除！これからは、このかわいさに見合う性能にしないと♪|text_cn=限制解除~接下来，也要让性能配得上这份可爱才行！！|trans_en=Limit released! From now on, I have to make the performance match the cuteness ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_140_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この旋律…なんだか懐かしい歌を思い出すなぁ|text_cn=这个旋律……让我想起一段熟悉的歌谣。|trans_en=This melody... It somehow reminds me of a nostalgic song.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_140_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…なんだか落ち着くなぁ|text_cn=呼……心情似乎放松了一些。|trans_en=Phew... Somehow, I feel calm.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_140_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=行こう、ラボラビ！私たちの物語の始まりだよ！|text_cn=兔子派，冲呀！我们的童话冒险，正式启程~|trans_en=Let's go, Rabbit Pie! It's the beginning of our story!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_140_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=前にこの体勢で考え事をしてたとき、すっごくいいアイデアを思いついて気づいたんだ〜<br/>この姿勢だと脳の血行が促進されるから、思考効率が上がってブレストがはかどるんだよ<br/>集中しすぎると、風邪引いちゃいそうだけど…|text_cn=呵呵，自从上次用这样的姿势敲开了灵感的大门后，我就发现……<br/>只要保持这样的姿势，就能促进大脑血液循环，提高思考效率，有助于我更好地进行头脑风暴。<br/>不过，要是太过专注的话，会不会感冒呢……？|trans_en=When I was thinking in this position before, I thought of a great idea and realized something.<br/>When I'm in this posture, it promotes brain blood circulation, so thinking efficiency increases and brainstorming goes smoothly.<br/>But it seems like I will catch a cold if I concentrate too much...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_140_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラボラビが、魔王さんをこのラボの『特別メンバー』に設定してくれたよ<br/>これで急に訪ねてきても、いきなり砲門を向けられる心配はないから安心してね♪|text_cn=兔子派已经将你识别为“斯帕克拉工坊的特别顾问”。以后，你就不用担心敲门后会面对她黑漆漆的炮口了，呵呵~|trans_en=Rabbit Pie set you as a "special member" of this lab.<br/>Now even if you visit suddenly, there's no concern about having guns pointed at you, so don't worry ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_140_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=足が痛くなってきちゃったな…えっ、マッサージしてくれるの？ならお願いしてもいい？<br/>スーパーオートラビのマッサージ機能も悪くないけど、温もりが足りなくて|text_cn=嘶……腿又开始疼起来了。什么？你还会按摩？那来试试吧。超级行动派的机械臂虽然精准，但确实少了点……温度。|trans_en=My feet are starting to hurt... Oh, you'll give me a massage? Then can I make a request?<br/>Super Action Pie's massage function isn't bad, but the warmth is not enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_140_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたにマッサージしてもらうの自分でするより気持ちよくて、くせになっちゃいそう<br/>手の感触が柔らかくて、温かくて…なんだか安心するな～♪|text_cn=被你触碰双腿的感觉，让人有些上瘾。柔软、温暖……却又和自己的手不同，真让人安心啊……|trans_en=Having you massage me feels better than doing it myself, and I might get hooked.<br/>The touch of your hands is soft and warm... Somehow makes me feel at ease ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_140_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=少し前までは、想像力があれば、空想の中でノヴァ大陸のどこにだって行けると思ってたの<br/>でもあなたと出会って、世界の本当の広さに気づいたんだ<br/>だから今度旅に出るときは…私も一緒に連れてってほしいな？|text_cn=以前我一直觉得，想象力是无限的。就算不离开这个工坊，我也能在脑海里想象整个世界。<br/>但认识你之后我才发现，世界比想象中的还要大。所以，下次旅行的时候也带上我吧。|trans_en=Until very recently, I believed that with imagination, I could go anywhere on the Nova continent in my daydreams.<br/>But I met you, and I've realized how vast the world really is.<br/>So, next time you go travel... Could you take me along with you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_140_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁ、かわいいラッピング♪ありがとう、魔王さん。|text_cn=哇，好可爱的包装！谢谢你，魔王。|trans_en=Wow, cute wrapping! ♪ Thank you, Tyrant.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_140_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わっ、かわいい～♪さすが魔王さん、私の好みをバッチリわかってくれてるね！|text_cn=这个造型好可爱，真不愧是最懂我审美的人~|trans_en=Wah, cute ♪ I knew you perfectly understood my preferences, Tyrant!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_140_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このプレゼント、あなたみたいにかわいい～♪ありがとう、大切にするね！|text_cn=这礼物就跟你一样可爱~我会好好保管的！|trans_en=This present is just as cute as you are ♪ Thank you, I will treasure it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_140_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん|text_cn=不错~|trans_en=Hmm~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_140_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヤダ|text_cn=不行。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_140_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Eh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_140_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=う～ん？|text_cn=不明白……|trans_en=Umm...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_140_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=え…|text_cn=哎……|trans_en=Hah...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_140_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=かわいい♡|text_cn=好可爱啊！|trans_en=Cuute~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_140_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=も～！|text_cn=你……|trans_en=Heyyy~!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_140_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=にゅふふ|text_cn=哼哼~|trans_en=Nyehehe~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_140_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_140_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ブラックリストに入れちゃうから！|text_cn=你已经被我拉黑了！|trans_en=I'll put you on the blacklist!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_140_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の発明品を使っていいのはかわいい人だけって決めてるの|text_cn=只有可爱的人才配使用我的发明。|trans_en=I've decided that the only ones who can use my inventions are the cute ones.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_140_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい、ラボラビに挨拶して♪|text_cn=来，和兔子派打个招呼~|trans_en=Hay, say hello to Rabbit Pie ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_140_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=帝国護衛隊だ！急いで逃げるよ！|text_cn=快走，帝国卫队来了！|trans_en=It's the Imperial Guard! Hurry and run!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_140_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_140_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=指名手配の私の似顔絵…下手すぎ|text_cn=外面的悬赏令……画得真丑。|trans_en=A wanted sketch of me... It's too terrible.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_140_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おやすみ～。あとはよろしく～…<br/>ハッ、寝坊！？どうして起こしてくれないのぉ～！|text_cn=休息时间到~兔子派，交给你了。<br/>睡过头了！你怎么不叫醒我啊……|trans_en=Good night. Please take care of the rest~<br/>Wah! I overslept? Why didn't you wake me up?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_140_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラボラビ、できるだけ静かにお願いね～<br/>もぉ～！静かにって言ったでしょ～！|text_cn=兔子派，尽量安静地解决。<br/>都说了要你安静解决了！|trans_en=Rabbit Pie, please do it as quietly as possible.<br/>Hey! Didn't I tell you to be quiet?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_140_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…設計ミス…？|text_cn=设计……有漏洞……|trans_en=No... A flawed design...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_140_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラボラビ…逃げて…|text_cn=兔子派……撤退……|trans_en=Rabbit Pie... Run...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_140_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔って、謎だらけでほんと楽しいね♪|text_cn=有意思，星塔真是一个充满谜团的地方。|trans_en=Monoliths are so full of mystery and fun ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_140_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=頭の回転が早くなってる？にゅふふっ、おもしろい現象だね！|text_cn=思维变快了，呵呵，真是有趣的现象。|trans_en=Is my mind working faster? Nyehehe, that's an interesting phenomenon.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_140_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=アイデアの神が降りてきた♪早くラボに戻って形にしないと！|text_cn=有新思路了！真想快点回工坊。|trans_en=The god of ideas has come down ♪ I need to hurry to the lab and give it shape!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_140_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと待ってね。すぐに改造しちゃうから|text_cn=给我几分钟，改装一下武器。|trans_en=Wait a minute. I'll modify it right away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_140_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=にゅふふ。私の発明品をナメたら、痛い目をみるよ？|text_cn=哼哼，要是小瞧我的发明，可是会吃苦头的哦？|trans_en=Nyehehe. If you underestimate my invention, you're in for a rude awakening.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_140_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔って、どんな仕組みで動いてるんだろう？分解して考察してみたいなぁ|text_cn=让我看看这儿的机关到底是如何运作的。|trans_en=I wonder how the Monoliths work? I want to take one apart and examine it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_140_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=アイデアなんて、そこら中に落ちてるものだよ。たとえば…星骸だって、そのひとつだね♪|text_cn=灵感不分来源，星骸也是很好的素材哦~|trans_en=Ideas are just lying around everywhere. For example... Stellaroids are one of them, too ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_140_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=索敵完了！ここは私の発明に任せといて♪|text_cn=索敌成功。别担心，相信我的发明。|trans_en=Enemy search complete! Now leave this place to my invention ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_140_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなの戦闘データを取りに…レッツゴー♪|text_cn=出发~去收集大家的战斗数据咯~|trans_en=To get everyone's combat data... Let's go! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_140_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=よく見ると、星骸にもかわいい子がいるんだよね～♡|text_cn=仔细一看，星骸里也有不少可爱的家伙嘛。|trans_en=If you look closely, there are even some cute little ones among the Stellaroids~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_140_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラボラビが警報を鳴らしてる。周囲に警戒して。|text_cn=兔子派响起了警报，小心前进吧。|trans_en=Rabbit Pie is sounding an alarm. Be alert to our surroundings.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_140_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=見て見て！ラボラビに偵察用プラグインを入れてみたの♪|text_cn=快看！我给兔子派装载了新的侦查插件~|trans_en=Look, look! I tried installing a reconnaissance plug-in on Rabbit Pie ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_140_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここに必要なものが置いてあるといいんだけど…|text_cn=希望这里有我需要的东西。|trans_en=I hope they have what we need here...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_140_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえ、一緒にお茶しない？|text_cn=要不要一起来喝杯茶？|trans_en=Hey, hey, have tea together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_140_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人と話すとき用のラボラビも作っとこっかな～？|text_cn=要不要做只专门负责跟人沟通的助理机关兔呢……|trans_en=Maybe I should make a Rabbit Pie for talking to people, too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_140_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=敵影消失。いまのうちに休んどいてね|text_cn=没有侦查到任何危险目标，趁现在休息一下吧~|trans_en=Enemy presence eliminated. Take a rest while you can.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_140_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=周りを見てくるから、ちょっとだけ待ってて！|text_cn=这个房间还挺有趣的。让我研究一下……你等我一下喔！|trans_en=I'll go take a look around, so wait just a while!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_140_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=にゅふふ。いいデータが取れちゃった♪|text_cn=呵呵~拿到了不错的数据呢。|trans_en=Nyehehe. I got good data ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_140_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラボラビの進化は止まらないよ♪|text_cn=兔子派的进化是不会停止的~|trans_en=Rabbit Pie's evolution won't stop ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_140_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=思ったより簡単だったねー|text_cn=比我想的简单嘛~|trans_en=That was easier than I thought~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_140_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アイデアを否定されたときよりショックかも…|text_cn=唉，心情比方案被否定时还要糟糕……|trans_en=Maybe more shocking than when my ideas got rejected...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_140_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこで間違っちゃったんだろう？|text_cn=……是哪一条指令出错了吗？|trans_en=Where did I make a mistake?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_140_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=装備の調整完了、しゅっぱーつ！|text_cn=武器校准完毕，出发。|trans_en=Equipment adjustment complete, departing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_140_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい武器を試してみよっと！|text_cn=正好测试一下新发明。|trans_en=Let's try the new weapon!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_140_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラボラビ、準備オッケー？|text_cn=准备好了吗？兔子派？|trans_en=Rabbit Pie, are you ready?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_140_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまには外の空気も吸わないとね|text_cn=偶尔也要出门透透气。|trans_en=Once in a while, I need to get some fresh air.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_140_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=Yostar|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_140_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はどこに行っても、チョコの甘～い香りが漂ってるね<br/>にゅふふ。もちろん、かわいいあなたの分はちゃ～んと用意してきたから、安心していいよ♪<br/>ラボラビ、お茶の支度をよろしく|text_cn=今天四处都弥漫着巧克力的甜味呢。呵呵，放心好啦。你的那份我当然也准备好了~毕竟你这么可爱~<br/>啊，兔子派，记得准备好茶哦~|trans_en=Today, no matter where I go, the sweet smell of chocolate is in the air.<br/>Nyehehe. Of course, I came prepared well~ with your portion, so don't worry ♪<br/>Rabbit Pie, please prepare the tea.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_140_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごめんなさい！ラボラビへの指示、取り消すの忘れちゃってて…！<br/>まさかオアシス号の前に、こんなにおっきな雪だるまを作るなんて…<br/>オアシス号、動かせそう？もし無理そうなら、雪だるまに穴をあけるけど…どうしよっか？|text_cn=抱、抱歉，给兔子派的指令忘记删除一个参数了……<br/>没想到她一晚上就堆了这么大一个雪人，还堆在了幸运绿洲号前面……<br/>你、你们还能出来吗？要不、我让她轰一个出口……|trans_en=I'm sorry! I forgot to cancel the instructions to Rabbit Pie...!<br/>I can't believe it'd make a snowman this big in front of Lucky Oasis...<br/>Can Lucky Oasis get out? If it's difficult, I can open a hole in the snowman... What should we do?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_140_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう！ほらほら、外は寒いし、ラボの中に入っておいで！<br/>にゅふふ～、今年もこうしてふたりでお茶しながら、のんびりまったり過ごしたいね～<br/>魔王さんを見てると、いいアイデアがどんどん湧いてくるし♪|text_cn=新年快乐！呜哇……外面太冷了，到工坊里来吧！<br/>呵呵~今年也像这样两个人一起喝着茶悠悠闲闲度过吧~只要这样看着你，灵感就一个个蹦出来了~|trans_en=Happy New Year! Look, look, it's cold outside, so come inside the lab!<br/>Nyehehe, I want to take it easy and relax together like this while having tea this year too.<br/>When I'm looking at you, a lot of good ideas come up ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_140_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=すっごく大きなプレゼントの箱。中身は…わぁ、自動で動き回るオートドールだぁ♪<br/>わざわざ着ぐるみ姿で、サプライズプレゼントを持ってきてくれるなんて！<br/>ありがとう、魔王さん！|text_cn=好大的礼物盒啊！里面是……会、会动的玩偶？！<br/>原来这是给我的生日惊喜啊！谢谢你特地穿着玩偶服过来，魔王~|trans_en=A very big present box. Inside is... Wow, it's an auto doll that moves around on its own ♪<br/>To think you went out of your way to bring me a surprise present in a costume!<br/>Thank you, Tyrant!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_140_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_140_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとう、魔王さん！<br/>ラボラビからは手作りケーキ、メカマオーンからは焼き肉セットを預かってきたよ<br/>それとこれは私から…じゃーん！魔王さんと私をモデルにしたオートドールだよ！<br/>特別な機能はないけど、とってもかわいくできたから、大切にしてね♪|text_cn=生日快乐。这是兔子派做的蛋糕，这是魔王派做的烤肉~<br/>还有这个……是我做的代表我和你的小机关人。虽然没有其他功能，只是观赏用玩具，但是非常可爱哦！|trans_en=Happy birthday, Tyrant!<br/>I got a homemade cake from Rabbit Pie and a grilled meat set from Boss Pie.<br/>And this is from me... Ta-da! It's an auto doll modeled after you and me!<br/>There are no special functions, but it is very cute, so take good care of it ♪}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_149_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アナタ、懺悔したいの？それとも…ウフフ<br/>脱魂がお望み？|text_cn=你是要忏悔，还是解脱？|trans_en=Do you wish to repent? Or... Hehehe...<br/>Is it ecstasy that you seek?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_149_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=顔色もいいし、胸の鼓動もすっごく元気<br/>活きが良くて素敵♪|text_cn=你的气色不错，连心跳都如此鲜活……多美妙啊~|trans_en=A good complexion and a powerful pulse...<br/>Ooh, so full of life and lovely... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_149_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよう。<br/>今日もアナタが、平穏で穏やかな一日を過ごせるよう恩恵の神に祈っておいたわ|text_cn=早安，愿你度过平静祥和的一天。|trans_en=Good morning.<br/>I petitioned the God of Grace for another day of peace and blessings upon you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_149_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昼でもアナタを目にした途端、血が沸き立って、体が熱くなっちゃうの♪<br/>フフ…なにかを期待してるってことかしらね？|text_cn=哪怕是在白天，只要见到你，体温就会上升，血液也开始躁动不安……<br/>呵呵，大概是我在期待什么吧？|trans_en=Even when I see you during the day, my blood roils and I get hot! ♪<br/>Hehe... I guess it must be anticipating something!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_149_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夜はアブナイ予感と死の気配を運んでくるの。う～ん…スイート♪|text_cn=夜晚带来危险和死亡，令人迷醉。|trans_en=The night brings the scent of danger and death. Mmm... It's so sweet. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_149_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ソウルカラーについて詳しく知りたい？<br/>それはいいけど…それなりの代償を払ってもらうわよ|text_cn=想知道这根绳子的来历吗？可以哦，不过……你可要付出相应的“代价”……|trans_en=Want me to tell you about Soul Cord?<br/>I can do that ... but it will cost you dearly.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_149_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=教会の仕事って、ほーんと退屈<br/>やっぱりアナタと一緒にいるほうが、何千倍も楽しいわ|text_cn=圣所的工作太无聊，果然只有跟你在一起时灵魂才会悸动啊~|trans_en=Working at a church is sooo boring.<br/>Being with you is about a million times more fun.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_149_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウフフフ…ねえ、ワタシをこんなふうに扱うなんて、どんな気持ち？<br/>背徳感？それとも…脱魂を感じてる？|text_cn=呵呵，这样对待我，你有什么感觉？<br/>是有强烈的背德感？还是说……感受到了无上的欢愉呢？|trans_en=Hehehe... How do you feel treating me this way?<br/>Naughty? Or... Does it make you feel ecstasy?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_149_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほらほらぁ、しっかり握って。紐から手を放しちゃダメよ？<br/>アハッ…このスイートでゾクゾクする感覚クセになっちゃいそう♪|text_cn=来吧，请不要停下，继续触摸这根绳子。<br/>对，像这样……给予我无上的奖励，啊……这感觉可真让人上瘾。|trans_en=Hold on tight, now. Don't let go of the rope, okay?<br/>Ha... Ooh, this sweet sense of danger is so hot! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_149_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=苦痛っていうのはね、虚ろな世界に抗うための、唯一の薬なの|text_cn=疼痛是对抗虚无世界最好的良药。|trans_en=Suffering is the only medicine for those who reject this world of lies.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_149_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=教会で仕事してると、たまに葬儀に関わることがあって<br/>みんなは嫌がるけど…ワタシはそうでもないのよね<br/>だって自分の手で葬れるなんてとっても素敵なことじゃない？|text_cn=圣所偶尔也会有葬仪相关的工作……有的修者会抗拒，但我从来都不排斥。<br/>相反……能亲手送他们最后一程，我觉得很幸福。|trans_en=I sometimes handle funerals at the Sanctum.<br/>Everyone thinks they're unpleasant... But not me.<br/>I mean, it's a beautiful thing to be able to bury someone with your own hands.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_149_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=穏やかなだけの毎日なんて、なにが楽しいのかしら？<br/>混沌とした戦いの中にいてこそ胸に空いた穴を埋められるのに|text_cn=平静的日子只会让我窒息，唯有把自己置身于混乱与危险中，才能填满这无尽的空虚。|trans_en=What's so great about living a peaceful life?<br/>Only the chaos of battle can fill the void in my soul.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_149_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=このロープはファッションでも飾りでもないの<br/>あんまりナメてると、痛い目見るわよ？|text_cn=这根绳子可不是装饰，小看它的人，都要付出生命的代价。|trans_en=I don't wear this cord as some kind of fashion statement.<br/>Do you need to find out the hard way?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_149_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=修道服は悪くないけど…いろいろ窮屈でね<br/>自分なりにアレンジしてみたんだけど、どう？<br/>アナタだって、こっちのほうが好きなんでしょ？|text_cn=修者的制服还挺可爱的，就是穿起来……总觉得有点束缚，所以我结合自己的喜好做了些改动。<br/>你看，现在的样子，是不是……你也更满意了？|trans_en=Wearing a Seeker’s cloth isn’t the worst … but it sure feels stuffy.<br/>So I kind of changed some things and made it my own.<br/>Well? You like this better, don't you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_149_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=迷える子羊に道を示し、絶望した者の傷ついた心を慰め、罪人の懺悔を聞く<br/>それはシスターの仕事であってワタシの仕事じゃないわ<br/>でもアナタが命令するなら…それらしく振る舞ってあげる|text_cn=为迷途的羔羊指引方向，抚慰绝望之人内心的悲伤，倾听有罪之人的忏悔……<br/>这可不是我的工作。<br/>不过，如果你强行命令我的话……我会很开心哦。|trans_en=Shepherding the lost, comforting the broken-hearted, hearing the confessions of sinners.<br/>That's the role of a sister, but it's not my role.<br/>But if you command me... I can at least pretend.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_149_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この先の予定を教えてくれる？そうすれば、アナタが出かける前に無事を祈ってあげられるわ<br/>え？ストーキング？ふふ、少なくとも…今はまだ、その必要はないわね|text_cn=把你的行程都告诉我吧，这样我才能在你每一次出发前，为你虔诚地祈祷……<br/>跟踪？呵呵，我可没那个时间，至少……现在还不需要。|trans_en=What are your plans? If you tell me, I can pray for your safety before you set out.<br/>Hm? I'm stalking you? Hehe. There's no need for that ... at least, not yet.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_149_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=子どもの頃に読んだ絵本は、悪い竜を倒した勇者が、お姫様を救うお話だけ<br/>周りの子はみーんなお姫様に自分を重ねてたけど…<br/>ワタシは違う悪い竜に自分を重ねてたの<br/>もし魔王のアナタが絵本の主人公なら…ワタシをどんなふうにしてくれるのかしら♪|text_cn=小时候，我唯一看过的绘本，就是勇者斩杀恶龙、救出公主的那个老故事。<br/>别的孩子都喜欢把自己想成被拯救的公主，可我认为，自己更像那个等着被打倒的恶龙。<br/>如果被称为“魔王”的你成为了故事的主角，又会怎样对待身为“恶龙”的我呢？|trans_en=When I was little, all the fairy tales were about some hero slaying some evil dragon and rescuing some princess.<br/>All my friends saw themselves as the princess...<br/>But I always saw myself as the evil dragon.<br/>If you were the hero in the story... What would you do to me? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_149_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=顔を水に浸けて、息が保たなくなる限界までガマンするの<br/>そうするとね、胸いっぱい息を吸い込んだとき「いまワタシ、生きてるんだ」<br/>そう実感できるのよ。きっと癖になるから、よければ今度アナタも試してみて<br/>あ、でも…アナタが手伝ってくれたら、いまよりスイートな生の実感を味わえるのかしら？|text_cn=我喜欢把自己沉在水里，直到快要窒息才浮出水面。<br/>只有那一刻，大口呼吸的时候，我才觉得自己还活着。<br/>呵呵，如果是你来帮我的话，说不定会有更为臻致的体验~|trans_en=I hold my head underwater until my lungs are about to burst.<br/>I feel so alive when I come up and fill them with air.<br/>It's so amazing. I know you'd love it if you tried it.<br/>Or... Maybe if you hold me down, it'll make that feeling of being truly alive even sweeter?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_149_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=明日と死、どっちが早く訪れるかなんて誰にもわからない<br/>いままでは自分のためにしか祈ってこなかったけど…<br/>一緒に長いときを過ごせるようこれからは、アナタの分も祈ってあげる|text_cn=明天和死亡，谁会先来没有人知道。曾经的我只会为自己祈祷，但现在……<br/>只要能一直注视着你，我也愿意为你献上我的祈愿。|trans_en=No one knows which day will be their last.<br/>All my life, I've only prayed for myself...<br/>But now I'm praying for you too, so we can be together for a long time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_149_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=信仰だの名誉だの、そんな無意味なものはぜんぶ捨ててきたはずなのにね<br/>アナタが目の前に現れたその瞬間ワタシの中に火が灯ったの<br/>ウフフ…ワタシだけを見て、ワタシのすべてを奪って、アナタのすべてを…<br/>ワタシに刻み込んで♪|text_cn=信仰？荣誉？那些虚无的东西早就被我踩在脚下。自你出现的那一刻起，我心中的欲望就开始燃烧……<br/>魔王大人，赐予我你的目光，你的支配，你的全部吧。|trans_en=Faith and honor... I thought I had left such meaningless ideas behind.<br/>But a fire was kindled inside me when you appeared.<br/>Hehehe... I want you to look only at me, take everything from me, and carve your entire essence...<br/>... into my soul ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_149_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『闇医者』の噂を知ってる？もし会うことがあれば、この医学書を渡してほしいの<br/>え、どうして？別に理由なんてないわ<br/>教会の地下で眠らせとくよりマシだと思っただけよ|text_cn=你见过那位“密医”了吗？可以的话，帮我把这些医书交给她吧。<br/>比起在圣所的地下室里长眠，不如把它们送到更有意义的地方去。<br/>没有为什么，只是跟她有过一面之缘罢了。|trans_en=Have you heard about the underground healer? Give her this medical text if you ever see her.<br/>Why? No particular reason.<br/>It's better than collecting dust in the Sanctum basement.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_149_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=蒼梧城にはお祓いの専門家がいるって聞いたんだけど、今度紹介してくれない？<br/>ただの人間とか魔物じゃ、もうワタシの相手にはならないから<br/>幽霊っていうのがどんな『味』なのか試してみたかったのよねぇ|text_cn=听闻苍梧城有镇鬼驱邪的专家，能带我去见见吗？<br/>普通的人类和魔物已经满足不了我了，正好试试传闻中的恶鬼是什么“味道”。|trans_en=Could you introduce me to that exorcist in Cangwu sometime?<br/>I can't find any people or monsters that are a challenge for me anymore.<br/>So I want to see what evil spirits taste like.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_149_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまに星輝附属大学の上を飛び回ってる子…ホタルだっけ？<br/>あの子、幼い見た目してるわりに妙な気配を感じるのよね<br/>今度会ったら、ちょっと味見してみようかしら？|text_cn=那个偶尔在星辉附属大学上空盘旋的少女……是叫火垂吧？<br/>她身上有种强者的气息，有机会的话，真想和她以命相搏啊。|trans_en=That girl who flies around Grace Light Academy sometimes... Firefly, was it?<br/>She looks like a little girl, but I get a strange feeling from her.<br/>Maybe I'll take a little taste next time I see her...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_149_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ノヴァの外から来た敵なら、ワタシを楽しませてくれると思ったんだけど…<br/>バイヤ人っていっても、所詮は人間<br/>ワタシとまともにやりあえたのなんて、片手で数えられるほどしかいなかったわ|text_cn=本以为来自大陆外的敌人能让我燃起斗志，可惜……<br/>我遇到过的拜雅人少之又少，能称之为对手的更是屈指可数。|trans_en=I thought enemies from outside Nova might be entertaining...<br/>But I guess Bayans are still human.<br/>I can count the number that gave me a challenge on one hand.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_149_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=あのレイセンって子の武器、ワタシの『イーラ』に形が似てるけど…<br/>あっちは命を育む力を持ってるらしいのウフフ…実に興味深いわね|text_cn=那个叫岭川的小姑娘，她手里拿的武器形制跟我的“宽恕”相仿，不过她的武器是用来播种生命的呢。<br/>呵呵，有意思……|trans_en=That girl Ridge's weapon looks like my "Mercy"...<br/>But hers has the power to give life. Hehe... How very interesting.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_149_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなんじゃ全然足りないわ。よければワタシがやりかたを教えてあげましょうか？|text_cn=需要我吗？我可以先来满足你哦……|trans_en=Is that supposed to satisfy me? Here, let me show you how to do it the right way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_149_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あぁ…もっと…もっともっともっともっともっと！激しくしてくださぁ～い♪|text_cn=呵呵~用力点用力点！再用力点！|trans_en=Oh... More... More, more! More, more, more! Do it harder! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_149_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もし暇なら…刺激的なこと、したくなーい？|text_cn=闲着也是闲着，不如来做些刺激的事吧。|trans_en=Are you free? Wanna do something exciting?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_149_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうやって放置して、ワタシのリアクションを楽しもうってわけね？<br/>ゾクゾクするわぁ♪|text_cn=故意把我丢在一边吗？<br/>啊……心脏跳得好快……呵呵。|trans_en=Ooh, you're leaving me alone to enjoy my reaction?<br/>That's so hot! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_149_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=放置されるのもいいけど…そろそろなにかしてくれてもいいのよ？<br/>ねえお願い…アナタのお願いも聞いてあげるから…ね？<br/>とびっきりの脱魂がほしいのぉ～っ！|text_cn=把我晾在一边这么久……也该对我做点什么了吧……<br/>快过来……让我也聆听你的愿望……好吗？<br/>带给我至高的欢愉吧！|trans_en=I don't mind being left alone... But maybe you could do something soon?<br/>Pleease? I'll even let you do whatever you want...<br/>I need that sweet, sweet ecstasy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_149_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめまして。ワタシは恩恵意志のグレイ<br/>この心の渇きを潤してくれるならアナタに『特別』なものを見せてあげる<br/>でもあんまり待たせちゃダメよ？|text_cn=我是恩赐意志的格芮，只要你能满足我心底的渴望，我就会为你展示更多“特别”的东西……<br/>呵呵，请不要让我等得太久哦。|trans_en=Nice to meet you. I'm Gerie of Grace Imperium. <br/>If you can quench my thirsty heart, I just might show you something "special."<br/>But don't make me wait too long!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_149_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=虚ろに沈む心を満たしてくれるのは…アナタだけ。<br/>さあ、アナタのスイートな刺激をワタシにくださぁ～い！|text_cn=魔王大人，只有您才能让我感受到满足……请给予我更多吧，我会把渴望与沉沦……全部奉献给您！|trans_en=The only one who can satisfy this desolate heart is ... you.<br/>Give me all your sweet thrills!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_149_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅん？ワタシにもまだ伸びしろがあったのね|text_cn=没想到我还能有所成长。|trans_en=Oh? I didn't even know I had room to grow.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_149_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=強くなるのはいいけど、生の実感を与えてくれる相手は減ってくのよねぇ…|text_cn=力量不断攀升，可赐我痛楚之人却已愈发难寻……|trans_en=The only problem with getting stronger is I run out of enemies that make me feel alive...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_149_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ワタシのヒミツをあばきたい？いいけど…ワタシの愛と狂気に溺れる覚悟はできてるかしら？<br/>ウフフ…そのねぶるような視線ゾクゾクしちゃう♪|text_cn=想窥视我的秘密吗？那就请做好被我的爱意与疯狂吞噬得一干二净的觉悟吧，魔王大人……<br/>让我在您的注视下欢愉颤抖！|trans_en=You want to know my secrets? I hope you're ready to be consumed by my love and madness.<br/>Hehehe... Oh, that hungry look... it's so hot! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_149_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アナタのセンスに任せるわ好きに選んでちょうだい|text_cn=我相信你的品味，所以不必询问我的意见。|trans_en=I trust your judgment. Pick whatever you like.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_149_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はソウルカラー握ってくれないの？そんな、イジワルしないでぇ～っ！|text_cn=你不打算牵住我的项圈吗？可是……我的灵魂已经忍耐不住震颤了……<br/>不要欺负人嘛……|trans_en=You won't hold Soul Color today? Aw, why're you being so mean?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_149_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…他人の魂を握りしめるのは、どんな気持ち？|text_cn=呵呵~握住别人的灵魂，感觉如何？|trans_en=Hehe... How does it feel to have a grip on someone's soul?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_149_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなこう言うわ。アイツと関わるとロクなことにならない<br/>だからワタシから逃げなかったアナタの勇気は、評価してあげる|text_cn=大家都说，跟我扯上关系不是什么好事，但你却没有从我这儿逃走……<br/>这份勇气，我很欣赏。|trans_en=Everyone's always saying "stay away from that girl" about me.<br/>That's why you not running away from me is so impressive.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_149_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そろそろ気づいたころかしら？<br/>アナタとワタシの運命は、もうとっくに絡み合ってるのよ|text_cn=还没感觉到吗？命运已经将我们交织在了一起。|trans_en=Haven't you figured it out?<br/>Our fates have been intertwined for a while.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_149_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アナタの匂い…しっかり覚えたわ<br/>ウフフ…逃げても無駄よ地の果てまでだって追いかけていくんだから|text_cn=你的气味……我已经记得很清楚了，无论你怎么逃，我都会追你到天涯海角。|trans_en=I know your scent too well.<br/>Hehe... You'll never escape me. I'll follow you to the ends of the earth.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_149_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは…本当に静かね。爆発しそうな魔力も感じないし、胸の苦しさも感じない<br/>まさか死が迫る感覚以外にワタシを慰めてくれるものがあったなんて…<br/>ウフ…もしかして、アナタがワタシの「祝福」なのかしら？|text_cn=这里……好安静。既没有满溢而出的魔力，也没有令人窒息的混乱。<br/>呵呵，原来除了死亡，还有别的东西能让我平静下来。<br/>也许，你就是我的“福音”吧。|trans_en=It truly is quiet here. I don't sense any volatile magic or feel tightness in my chest.<br/>I never thought anything other than the feeling of impending death could calm me...<br/>Hee hee... Perhaps you're the grace that's been given to me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_149_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お返しはなにがいい？言ってくれれば、なんでも用意してあげる♪|text_cn=是有什么想要的吗？只要你开口，我会满足你的。|trans_en=What do you want in return? I'll give you anything. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_149_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うーん、素敵♪お返しに、祈っといてあげるわ。|text_cn=这个不错，作为回礼我会为你祈祷的。|trans_en=Oh, how lovely! ♪ I'll be sure to pray for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_149_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなにスイートなものをくれるなんて。ふふ…ワタシを堕落させるつもりかしら？|text_cn=要小心哦，送这么好的东西，会让我堕落的……呵呵。|trans_en=What a sweet gift! Hehe... Are you trying to corrupt me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_149_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいじゃない|text_cn=好啊~|trans_en=Why not?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_149_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメよ|text_cn=不。|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_149_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ？|text_cn=唔……？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_149_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=哈？|trans_en=Um?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_149_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…なるほど|text_cn=呵呵……原来如此……|trans_en=Hehe... I see.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_149_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウフフフフ…|text_cn=呵呵呵呵！|trans_en=Eh hehehe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_149_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=もういいわ|text_cn=够了！|trans_en=Whatever!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_149_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウフッ♪|text_cn=呵呵~|trans_en=Hee hee! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_149_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=まったく…|text_cn=真是的……|trans_en=Seriously?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_149_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=棺桶の準備はいい？|text_cn=选好心仪的坟墓了吗？|trans_en=Is the coffin ready?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_149_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=慌てなくても、次はアナタの番よ|text_cn=不用急~下个就轮到你啦~|trans_en=Oh, don't worry. You're next.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_149_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=懺悔なさい|text_cn=忏悔吧。|trans_en=Repent.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_149_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=この痛み…スイート♪|text_cn=疼痛的感觉，多么美妙啊~|trans_en=This pain... It's so sweet. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_149_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_149_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=見ててあげるから、逝っちゃいなさい|text_cn=让我送你最后一程吧。|trans_en=I'll gladly watch as you return to dust.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_149_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=死が迫りくるこの感覚…最ッ高にスイート！！|text_cn=啊~这甜美的死亡，我收下了。|trans_en=This feeling of impending death... It's so deliciously sweet!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_149_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウフフフフ…極上の脱魂のなかで逝かせてあげる！|text_cn=啊哈哈哈！在毁灭中感受极乐吧！|trans_en=Hehehe... Now die in the throes of the sweetest ecstasy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_149_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この感覚…悪くないわ…|text_cn=感觉也不坏……|trans_en=This feeling ... is not so bad...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_149_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=やるじゃない…|text_cn=干得漂亮……|trans_en=Not bad...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_149_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=へぇー、おもしろそうね|text_cn=呵~有趣~|trans_en=Ooh, this should be fun.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_149_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=このスイートなパワー、素敵♪でも、まだ足りないわ|text_cn=美妙的力量~但还不够。|trans_en=This sweet power is so lovely. But it's not enough.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_149_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ガマンしたぶんだけ、スイートな気持ちが待ってるの|text_cn=就当是为欢愉做准备吧~|trans_en=The more one endures, the sweeter the reward.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_149_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘は大好きよ。だって…生を実感できるんだもの|text_cn=每一场战斗，都在磨砺我的灵魂。|trans_en=I love combat. It ... makes me feel so alive!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_149_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=神の恵みを得ることで、ワタシはまだまだ強くなるの！|text_cn=荣获恩赐，我愈强盛。|trans_en=By the grace of God, I grow ever more powerful!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_149_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウフフ…死の匂いがするわ…|text_cn=我闻到了死亡的气息~|trans_en=Hehehe... The smell of death is in the air...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_149_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=全力を出しても、壊れちゃわない敵はいないかしら？|text_cn=值得我全力以赴的对手在哪？|trans_en=I just want an enemy who won't break when I unleash my full power!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_149_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=せいぜい祈りなさい。それがアナタたちに与えられた最期の懺悔のときなんだから|text_cn=祈祷吧，把它当做你们临终的忏悔。|trans_en=Pray for mercy. It is the final act of repentance appointed for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_149_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ…もっともっと足掻いて、ワタシを楽しませてちょうだい！|text_cn=逃吧逃吧~让我更加愉悦吧！|trans_en=Yes... The more you struggle, the more I enjoy this!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_149_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=ただ祈ってるだけじゃ、すぐに死んじゃうわよ？<br/>死にたくないなら、武器を取って立ち向かわないと|text_cn=经文不会教你怎么活命，想要生存就拿起武器反抗。|trans_en=You know prayer alone won't save you, right?<br/>Draw your weapon if you want to live.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_149_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=闘いの中で、一緒に脱魂を感じましょう！|text_cn=让我们来享受厮杀的乐趣吧！|trans_en=Feel the ecstasy in the midst of battle with me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_149_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=少しは楽しませてちょうだいね|text_cn=这次可别再让我感到无聊。|trans_en=Ooh, let me have a little fun.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_149_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=拷問具の取り扱いは？え？ない？残念だけど、仕方ないわね|text_cn=这里有什么拷问用品吗？没有？那还真是遗憾……|trans_en=Where are your torture devices? What? You don't have any?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_149_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=傷を癒やすのは、もう一度その痛みを味わうためよ♪|text_cn=抚平伤疤，是为了迎接更剧烈的苦痛。|trans_en=Healing wounds lets us feel the sweet pain all over again. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_149_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=戦闘じゃないの？はぁ…残念|text_cn=不战斗吗？啊……真可惜。|trans_en=I don't get to fight? Aw...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_149_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=歯ごたえのあるやつはいないのかしら？|text_cn=就没有更厉害的对手吗？|trans_en=Can't anyone give me a challenge?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_149_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ワタシを楽しませてくれる子羊ちゃんはどこかしら？|text_cn=好无聊，能让我愉悦的迷途羔羊在哪儿？|trans_en=Where's a little lamb I can have some fun with?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_149_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この程度で贖罪がすむと思ったら大間違いよ？|text_cn=这点试炼，就想赎清罪孽吗？|trans_en=That doesn't even begin to pay for your sins!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_149_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=スイート、魂の悲鳴が聞こえるわ|text_cn=啊……灵魂在悲鸣。|trans_en=Oh, I can hear the sweet screams of their souls.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_149_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この感覚…何度味わってもたまらない…|text_cn=呵呵……真让人欲罢不能。|trans_en=Ooh, this feeling ... the taste never gets old...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_149_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと遊びすぎたかしら？|text_cn=是玩得太过头了吗？|trans_en=Maybe I played too much?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_149_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら、負けちゃった。どんな罰が待ってるのかしら？|text_cn=我输了……你会惩罚我吗？|trans_en=Looks like I lost. Ooh, what punishment awaits?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_149_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、狩りの始まりよ|text_cn=挽钟奏响，狩猎开始。|trans_en=Let the hunt begin.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_149_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=生け捕り？やってみるわ|text_cn=要留活口的话，记得提前说哦~|trans_en=Live capture? I'll try it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_149_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はどんな相手かしら？|text_cn=希望这次能令我满足。|trans_en=Who'll we face today?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_149_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ワタシだけじゃ物足りない？|text_cn=有我还不够吗~|trans_en=Am I not enough?}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_149_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=Yostar|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_149_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は特別な相手にプレゼントを贈る日ってことで、いろんな味のチョコを用意したわ<br/>でもチョコはただのオマケ。本当のお楽しみは箱の中<br/>フフ…どれから食べる？先に言っとくけど、開けたら戻らないものもあるから気をつけて？|text_cn=今天是特别的日子，要向自己的心仪之人送上礼物~我给你准备了不同口味的巧克力……<br/>当然这不过是前菜，真正的惊喜还藏在盒子里。你想先享用哪种口味的？<br/>呵呵，事先说好，有些东西，拆开了可就收不回去了哦。|trans_en=Today is when we give presents to that special someone, so I brought you an assortment of chocolates. <br/>But that's just a little something extra. The real present is in the box.<br/>Hehe... So, which one first? But I must warn you, some things can't be put back once you open it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_149_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=毎年この日になると、きれいに飾り付けられた教会で、人々は聖歌に耳を傾けて、神に願うの<br/>シスターはなにをしてるのか？フフ…そんなのアナタが知る必要なんてないわ<br/>だってどうせこっそり抜け出して雪の中、アナタが来るのを待ってるんだから<br/>それとも…寒さで気絶するまでワタシを放置してみる？|text_cn=每年的这一天，圣所都会被精心装扮，人们聆听圣歌，为自己的心愿祈祷。<br/>你问身为修者的我会干什么？<br/>呵，当然是偷偷溜出来，悄悄守在雪地里等你。<br/>你会来找我吧？还是让我在雪里等到失去知觉呢？|trans_en=Each year on this day, people come to our beautifully decorated church to listen to hymns and pray to God.<br/>And what are the sisters doing? Hehe... You don't need to know that.<br/>I'll probably sneak out and wait for you in the snow anyway, so...<br/>Wanna try leaving me there until I pass out from the cold?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_149_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんな一年を過ごしたとしても、この日だけは誰もが平等に神の祝福を受けられる<br/>あけましておめでとう今年は一年、アナタにいっぱい束縛されますように♪|text_cn=“无论在过去的一年我们经历了怎样的人生，都可在这一天平等地领受神的祝福。”<br/>新年快乐~希望……今年我的每一天都能被你占有。|trans_en=No matter what you did the previous year, everyone can freely receive God's grace on this special day.<br/>Happy new year! I look forward to having you tie me up all year long! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_149_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=「毎日死にそうになる苦痛を味わって、毎日生まれ変わる」それがワタシのモットーなの<br/>だから本当の誕生日なんて気にしてなかったけど…<br/>ありがとう。仕事が終わったら少し時間をもらえる？|text_cn=“在濒死的痛楚里品味欢愉，于轮回的毁灭中复得新生”——这是我的信条。<br/>所以我根本没注意到今天是我真正的生日。<br/>谢谢，等工作结束后，可以占用你接下来的时间吗？|trans_en="Daily rebirth through excruciating pain" is the principle I live by.<br/>So, my real birthday has never meant much to me.<br/>But, thank you. Can you spend some time with me when you're done working?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_149_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_149_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=アナタがこの世界に生まれてきたことに感謝を。これからの人生に喜びと祝福を――<br/>マジメなワタシはめずらしい？それはそうよ。だって今日は特別な日なんだから<br/>これからのアナタの人生は、ワタシが見守っていくから安心してちょうだい<br/>あらためて、お誕生日おめでとう|text_cn=为你的诞生之日献上祝福，愿你今后的人生平安喜乐，万事顺意。<br/>怎么，这么一本正经让你不习惯了吗？呵呵，毕竟我也是个修者。<br/>不用担心，我会时刻关心你的快乐，你的未来，你的一切……生日快乐，魔王大人。|trans_en=I'm grateful that you came into this world and I pray for joy and grace in your life.<br/>I'm not usually so serious? Of course I'm not. Today is a special day.<br/>And I'll be watching over all of your days, so don't worry about a thing.<br/>Happy birthday.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_150_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ～…あ、来た。それじゃ、あたしはちょっとサボってくる|text_cn=哈啊——你来啦，那我去歇一会……|trans_en=(Yawn)... You finally made it. Just in time for my break.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_150_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=最高の一日はサボりから！でしょ？|text_cn=美好的一天，就应该从逃班开始，你说是吧？|trans_en=A great day starts with the decision to skip work! Right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_150_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっぱ釣りに行くなら朝でしょ！ちょうどいい水温だから、魚が活性化してるんだよね<br/>それに人通りも少なくて、警戒心も薄れてるし<br/>場所取りしやすいってのもいいよね～。ってなわけで、釣りに行くぞ～～！|text_cn=早晨可是钓鱼的黄金时段！<br/>水温还没升起来，鱼的活性够高，光线柔和，鱼的警惕性也会降低……<br/>而且，早起才能占到好位置。走，咱们去钓鱼吧~|trans_en=Early morning is best for fishing! <br/>The temps are just right and the fish are out looking for food. <br/>Plus, it's not crowded yet so they're not on guard and I don't have to fight for a spot. <br/>What are we waiting for?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_150_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっぱ釣りに行くなら昼でしょ！<br/>水温が上がって反応が鈍くなるけど、昼間でも活発な魚はいるからね<br/>ポイントもばっちり頭に入ってるし。ってなわけで、釣りに行くぞ～～！|text_cn=中午可是钓鱼的好时机！<br/>有些鱼只有在水温高的情况下才更愿意咬钩，好多菜鸟觉得中午太热，鱼不开口就都回去了……<br/>正好让我占个好位置大钓特钓。走，咱们去钓鱼吧~|trans_en=Middle of the day is best for fishing! <br/>The warm water relaxes the fish, but some are still active. I've got the perfect spot in mind right now. <br/>What are we waiting for?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_150_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっぱ釣りに行くなら夜でしょ！<br/>日が沈んで魚が活性化するし、夜になってから動き出す魚もいるんだよねー<br/>しかも退勤したあとだから、上司に邪魔される心配もない！<br/>ってなわけで、釣りに行くぞ～～！|text_cn=晚上可是钓鱼的天赐良时！<br/>晚上气温降下来了，鱼也更活跃，更能钓到白天钓不上的鱼。<br/>最最关键的是，下班时间，就不用一边钓鱼一边提防领导查岗了！走，咱们去钓鱼吧~|trans_en=Evening is best for fishing! <br/>The fish get active after sunset, and the nocturnal ones start feeding too. And no need to worry about calls from the boss!<br/>So what are we waiting for?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_150_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえあんた、一緒に――え～、サボんないの？よく考えてみなって<br/>どれだけ頑張ろうが、結局お金はカンパニーのもの<br/>けどサボった時間は自分だけのものなんだよ？|text_cn=嗯？不摸吗？<br/>嗨呀……你干再多都是公司的，但摸的鱼可是自己的呀。|trans_en=Hey, do you wanna—<br/>Huh? Why not? <br/>No matter how hard you work, the company keeps all the money. But you get to keep all the time you spend slacking off. Think about it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_150_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=青空の下、釣りをしながらフライドポテトを食べる。これが至福のトキってヤツかぁ～|text_cn=一根钓竿，一包薯条，晒晒太阳钓钓鱼……嗐！又是快活的一天呐！|trans_en=Fishing and having fried potatoes in the cool, fresh air. Pretty sure this is heaven.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_150_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よく見てなよ？謝罪するときってのはさ、こうして上目遣いにするだけで…<br/>なんと75％の確率で許してもらえちゃうんだよね～♪|text_cn=看好了，谢罪的时候只要摆出这种楚楚可怜的样子，就有高达百分之七十五的几率蒙混过关~|trans_en=Watch what I do. <br/>See how I tuck my chin down and look up imploringly as I apologize? That boosts your odds of getting a pass to 75%! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_150_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=このポーズの素晴らしさがわからないって？<br/>フッ…甘いね。これがベテランのテクニックってわけ♪|text_cn=这种姿势很别扭？哼哼，我可告诉你，职场老油条就该这么拧！|trans_en=What? You don't know this pose? Amateur. This is how a real pro does it! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_150_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=別に目標なんてないし。あたしの夢は、さっさと定年退職して、年金生活を満喫することなの<br/>これぞ最高の人生設計ってね♪|text_cn=目标？我可没什么目标。<br/>我的毕生梦想就是美美摸鱼、早早退休，拿着大把退休金逍遥自在——<br/>完美人生不过如此啊~|trans_en=I don't have any goals. <br/>My dream is to retire as soon as possible and collect my pension.<br/>What can be better than that? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_150_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔で手に入れた『働いたら負け！最強人生攻略法』って本に<br/>『油を売る』って言葉があったんだ。いい響きだよね。人生のモットーにしようかな～|text_cn=“摸鱼”这个词啊……是我从星塔里一本《最强摸鱼指南！工作就输了》里看来的。<br/>啊，怎么会有这么完美的词，简直就是我的人生写照~|trans_en=I found this book called "Work is for Suckers! How to Live Your Best Life!" in the Monolith. <br/>The best chapter was "Pretending to be Busy." Although I'm already a pro at that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_150_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=バレないようにサボるのが、社会で生き抜くコツだよ<br/>大丈夫だって、人がいっぱいいれば、誰がサボってるかなんてどうせわかんないんだから|text_cn=别一天天把自己搞得那么紧绷嘛，该请假的时候就要大肆请假，公司没了你照样转！|trans_en=Slacking off without getting caught is the key to getting by. <br/>When there's lots of employees, it's harder for the bosses to notice one or two missing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_150_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ツラいこと？永遠に終わんない報告書、ギスギスした人間関係、人事部の鬼畜の所業…<br/>ううっ、考えただけで胃が痛くなってきた…|text_cn=讨厌的东西……没完没了的汇报总结，一塌糊涂的职场关系，还有人事不干人事……<br/>呜啊，想起太多痛苦的事，胃都开始痛了！|trans_en=What stresses me out? Endless reports. Yucky office politics. Evil HR departments. <br/>Ugh. Just thinking about it gives me a headache.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_150_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんで外回りの仕事ばっかり選ぶのかって？決まってるじゃん<br/>経費も下りるし、釣りにも行ける、自由そのものだからね～♪|text_cn=去星塔的理由？哈哈，这可是外出啊——外出就意味着报销、摸鱼、自由！|trans_en=Why do I always volunteer to work outside the office? Because I get paid travel costs to go fishing! Duh! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_150_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんで終わった仕事をさっさと提出しないのかって？<br/>そんなの、それがあたしにとっての美学だからに決まってんじゃん<br/>こうすれば、締め切りギリギリまでサボれるしね～♪|text_cn=为什么明明做完了却不提交？嗐，这可就是我人生哲学的精髓了。<br/>只有这样，才能在规定期限里摸更多的鱼！|trans_en=Why don't I hand off my work as soon as I finish it? That's one of my secret techniques, grasshopper. <br/>Why turn anything in before a deadline, when all they'll do is give me more work!? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_150_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵意志の秘密ぅ？そんなの教えるわけないじゃん<br/>秘密保持契約にサインだってさせられてるし。よっぽどのことがなきゃ…<br/>えっ、シャロキングのフライドポテト、一生食べ放題のチケットと交換だとしたら？<br/>それは…待って、本気で考えさせて！|text_cn=想找我打听恩赐意志的机密情报？哎，不行不行，我可是签了保密协议的！<br/>除非……除非什么呢？你让我想好了再说~|trans_en=Grace Imperium's secret? I'd never tell you that! I signed an NDA and everything. <br/>It'd take a lot to get me to—<br/>What? A free lifetime supply of King Sherlock fried potatoes? Um. Wait. I'll have to give that some serious thought!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_150_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうして恩恵意志に入ったか？待遇がいいし、定年まで安定して働けるからかな<br/>別に高尚な理由なんていらなくない？<br/>人生なんてラクに楽しんだもの勝ちなんだからさ♪|text_cn=我进恩赐意志倒也没什么特别的理由，就是冲着这里待遇高福利好，不捅大篓子的话能安安稳稳干到退休……<br/>对，没错，我就是这么胸无大志！人生在世，没必要把自己搞得那么累嘛~|trans_en=Why did I join Grace Imperium? Because the benefits are great and I can easily make it to retirement. <br/>No lofty reason! Hey, life's meant to be fun! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_150_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=カンパニーの経営って大変じゃない？働きすぎて仕事中毒になりそうだし<br/>てなわけで、あたしがいいこと教えてあげる♪<br/>ポテトってね、一本でも口にした途端、悩みなんてぜーんぶ吹っ飛んでくんだから？<br/>どう？試したくなった？|text_cn=开公司很辛苦吧，看你都快被工作腌入味了。来来，我教你一招~<br/>看到这包薯条了吗，只要吃上一口，什么烦恼都能忘掉。怎么样，要来一根吗？|trans_en=Running a company is hard. You're basically a workaholic. But guess what? ♪ <br/>A single fried potato can make aaall your worries just melt away. Wanna try one?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_150_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あいーっす、遊びにきたよー。だってここ、ダラダラするのにちょうどいいんだもん<br/>お菓子もあるし、上司への言い訳もあんたに相談しながら考えられるし<br/>ねぇ～、もっとここにいていいでしょ～？<br/>お返しに恩恵意志で流行ってる噂を教えるからさぁ～|text_cn=怎么又是我？哎呀，你这里又舒服又自在，有吃有喝，上司查岗你还能帮我打掩护……<br/>就让我多待待嘛~作为交换，我来给你讲讲恩赐意志员工的爱恨情仇！|trans_en=I came to hang out because this is the perfect place to sit around and do nothing. <br/>I can think of excuses to give my boss with your help while munching on snacks.<br/>Come on, let me stay a little longer. I'll tell you all the latest Grace Imperium gossip!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_150_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王っち～。いつかあんたんとこのカンパニーがノヴァ大陸で最大手になったらさ<br/>あたしにもちゃーんといい役職用意してよ？別に贅沢言わないからさ<br/>毎日ゆっくりお茶飲んで、ダベって、テキトーに指示出して…<br/>あとはマスコットとして、魔王っちを和ませてあげるよ♪どう？欲しくなった？|text_cn=魔王啊……等你的魔王协议变成全诺瓦最大的公司，记得给我也留个好职位啊。<br/>我要求不多，每天的工作就是喝喝茶聊聊天指手画脚当当吉祥物讨你开心……<br/>怎么样，是不是很划算！|trans_en=Hey, Tyrant! Once your company is the biggest in all of Nova, you better hire me! <br/>The job doesn't have to be anything special. I'll just have some tea, sit around and chat, boss some people around...<br/>Basically, be like a mascot figure and have fun with you. ♪<br/>Well? I know you wanna hire me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_150_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしの上司について？あいつは…うん、悪魔だね、悪魔<br/>散々こき使ってくれちゃってさ、このまま仕事続けて<br/>ストレスでハゲたらどうしてくれんのって感じ？<br/>直接やり取りしてたら、間違いなく手ぇ出してるね|text_cn=我对大领导的看法？听说那是个彻头彻尾的恶魔，除了使唤人就是使唤人……<br/>要是跟了她，头发都得少一半！还好我不用直接和她对接……|trans_en=My boss? Ugh. She's an absolute monster. She runs me ragged, sometimes, I think the stress is gonna make my hair fall out.<br/>She's just lucky we never meet face-to-face, or I'd...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_150_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウィローってさ、なんで地理協会になんて入ったんだろう？<br/>あれだけ仕事できるなら、恩恵意志に来ればよかったのに<br/>そしたらあたしの仕事も手伝ってもらえたのになぁ～|text_cn=论业务能力，薇洛可是一流的。可惜啊可惜，怎么最后就去了那小小的地理协会任职呢……<br/>要是也来恩赐意志，她就能帮我分担重担了！|trans_en=Why did Willow start working for the Trekker Association? With her talent, she should've joined Grace Imperium. <br/>Then she could help with my work...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_150_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ニュクスって、やる気がないふりしてるけど、影じゃ努力してるタイプだよね～<br/>あたしは絶対真似したくないけど|text_cn=星雁这个人，有一股很讨厌的味道……外表看起来像绵羊，内在却是狮子——<br/>换句话说，她绝对就是那种晚上留下来偷偷加班的卷王啊！|trans_en=Nyx is the type who seems lazy, but secretly, she's working really hard.<br/>I, on the other hand, don't PRETEND to be lazy at all...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_150_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして、フィレンって過去にニュクスとなにかあった？<br/>知ってることがあれば教えてほしいんだよね～<br/>…いやいや、別になにか企んでるとかじゃなくてさ<br/>ただの好奇心だよ。他のカンパニーはどんな感じなのかな～って|text_cn=那个叫翡冷翠的……是不是和星雁之间发生过什么啊？你要是知道什么内幕的话，不如来和我说说？ <br/>没有没有，这怎么能算八卦呢？我只是想感受一下其他公司的企业文化嘛~|trans_en=Did something happen between Nyx and Firenze? Do you know anything about it? <br/>... I wouldn't use the gossip against them or anything. I'm just curious about other companies, is all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_150_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=シーミャオって子、なかなか筋がいいね。魔王っち、あの子に連絡取ってくれない？<br/>新しいプロジェクトがあるんだけど、人手不足でさ<br/>たぶん当たり前のように残業してくれそ――<br/>じゃなくて、素晴らし～い人材だから推薦したいのぉ～|text_cn=我看师渺那小姑娘骨骼精奇，长得就很适合加班——<br/>不不，我是说一看她就是百年不遇的奇才，我们这有个新项目，刚好需要人手——<br/>——你要不帮我去给她送个内推邀请？恩赐意志可是大企业哦？|trans_en=That Shimiao is really talented. Can you get in touch with her?<br/>I've got a new project and I'm short-handed, and she seems like the type who'd totally do everyone's work for them—<br/>uh, I mean, she'd be a great asset to the team.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_150_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=無理で～す。指示書をもらうまで仕事しませ～ん|text_cn=干嘛，有活要我干的话先提申请单。|trans_en=No can do. I'm not working until I see the instructions.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_150_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょ、待ってってば。上司に頼まれた仕事をさっさと片付けないと|text_cn=别、别急，一个一个来，我要优先处理领导的任务。|trans_en=H-Hey, wait. I need to finish up this work my boss asked me to do.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_150_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王っちー、ここで一緒にサボらない？<br/>大丈夫だって、仕事を押しつけようだなんて思ってないから♪|text_cn=放心~没有新需求，过来摸鱼啊~|trans_en=Hey, hey. Wanna slack off with me? Don't worry! I won't push off any work on you! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_150_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魚たちがあたしを呼んでる気がする…よーし、今日の仕事はサボっちゃお～っと♪|text_cn=嗯……翘个班吧，鱼儿还在水里等着我呢。|trans_en=I can hear the fish calling me... Yep, I think it's a skip work kind of day! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_150_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ～…そろそろ休んだら？残った仕事は明日の自分に任せりゃいいんだし|text_cn=哈啊……你忙完了吗？要不就先歇了吧，把困难留给未来的自己！|trans_en=(Yawn)... Why don't you take a break? The work'll still be there tomorrow, you know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_150_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵意志から派遣されたラールだよ。よろー<br/>さーてと、挨拶も終わったし、残りの時間はテキトーにサボ…げっ、上司からの通話…<br/>あ～、もしもし？え？や、やだなぁ、まだサボってませんって～|text_cn=感到荣幸吧！在你面前的可是恩赐意志的精英——菈露大人！等会……我先接个电话。<br/>啊~老大！您讲，我在听。我……我现在正在出差，是是，那件事今天一定搞定，哪怕熬夜也会搞定。|trans_en=I’m Laru from Grace Imperium. Pleasure to meet you.<br/>Alright, formalities done—time to slack off—wait, boss call!<br/>Hello? W-What? O-Of course I'm working…}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_150_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あい～っす。またサボりに来たよー。上司が探しに来たら、うまく誤魔化しといてー|text_cn=哦，又见面了。有什么需求？先说说看吧。|trans_en=Wussuuup! I'm back to slack off. Distract my boss if she comes looking for me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_150_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヤダ～♪これ以上強くなって、仕事が増えちゃったらどうしよ～？|text_cn=哇哦，本就十分天才的菈露小姐，变得更有才了。|trans_en=I don't wanna get TOO strong or I'll be given more work!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_150_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この勢いで給料が上がっていけば、定年後の貯蓄もたっぷり…フッ、完っ璧！|text_cn=继续这样下去，我就能猛猛加薪，提前攒好养老金……妙哇！|trans_en=If my pay keeps going up like this, I'll have plenty of savings for retirement!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_150_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=潮風を感じるような…でもどうして懐かしい気持ちになるの？|text_cn=为什么感觉这么熟悉，让人想到咸咸的海风……|trans_en=I can almost feel the ocean breeze... Why is this so familiar?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_150_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=釣りしながら聞くのにちょうどよさそう|text_cn=也还不赖，我钓鱼的时候可以听。|trans_en=This'll be nice to listen to while fishing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_150_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いっぱいサボったし、そろそろ本気を出しちゃおっかな～|text_cn=休息得差不多了，下面就让你见识见识我的真本事吧。|trans_en=Enough slacking off. Time to get to work.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_150_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごめんなさ～い。もうしないから…ね？今回は許してぇ？<br/>…どう？これがラール様流、カンパニーサバイバル術だよ|text_cn=对不起嘛~下次绝不会再犯了，我保证~<br/>学会了吗？菈露大人的职场求生技。|trans_en=I'm so sorry. I'll never do it again. Please give me another chance!<br/>Queen Laru's workplace survival techniques are pretty good, huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_150_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あんたってさ、けっこう頭いいみたいだけど<br/>あたしのビジネスパートナーになるには、もっと勉強してもらわないとねー|text_cn=干得不错，在我合作过的人中，你算是头脑机灵的那类了。不过要跟上我的节奏，你要学的东西还多着呢。|trans_en=You know, you seem pretty smart, but I'm gonna need you to study up a bit if you want to be my business partner.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_150_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=へぇ、やるじゃん。それじゃ今から、本当に役に立つスキルを教えてあげる<br/>これさえ覚えとけば、最っ高のビジネスパートナーになること間違いなし！<br/>てなわけで、とっておきの釣り場へレッツゴー！|text_cn=比我预想的还要能干嘛，那么接下来我要教你一点真本事了！<br/>放心，我会把你培养成一个优秀的摸——咳咳，合作伙伴的。走，我带你去我的秘密钓点~|trans_en=You're not bad. But let me teach you a really useful skill. <br/>It'll make you the world's best business partner, guaranteed! First, we need to head to my favorite fishing spot...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_150_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やるじゃん。あたしが教えることはもうないかなぁ<br/>てかむしろ、上司の目を誤魔化すテクニックを思いついたら、すぐ連絡してね♪<br/>もちろん適当な雑談を振ってくれてもいいから|text_cn=不错嘛，我已经没有什么可以教你了。以后你要是琢磨出新的领导糊弄学，记得分享给我~<br/>没有的话多分享点茶水间八卦也行~|trans_en=I don't think I have anything more to teach you. <br/>But definitely come talk to me if you have any techniques to get my boss off my back! ♪ <br/>Or if you just wanna chat. That's cool too...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_150_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やばいよやばいよ！急に上司が進捗確認に来るとか言い出してさ<br/>てかあたし、昨日は港でポテト食べてたからなんもしてないんだけど！<br/>…え？外回りの申請を出して、さっさと逃げちゃえばいい？わーお、あんた天才じゃん！<br/>それじゃ、今度からはその作戦でいくとしますか！|text_cn=完了完了，领导突击检查工作进度，但昨天我去码头吃薯条了，现在一点进度都没有……怎么办啊！你快帮我想想办法——<br/>诶？找个借口写外出申请然后赶紧溜？你可真是个天才！我以后的快乐摸鱼就靠你出谋划策啦！|trans_en=Oh, no! My boss is coming to check up on my progress, and I was out all day yesterday eating fried potatoes at the docks! <br/>Hm? Put in a request to do out-of-office work and then bail? Wow, you're a grade-A slacker genius! I'll try it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_150_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いや～悪いねぇ♪そんじゃ、お礼に職場で使える裏技を教えてあげよう！|text_cn=喔，这么贴心~那作为回礼，就让我再多教你几个职场小窍门吧！|trans_en=Hey, thanks a bunch. ♪ I'll teach you a little trick you can use at work as my thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_150_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おおっ？これはなかなか…<br/>お返しに、トゥールセレクトのファーストフードを奢ってあげるよ|text_cn=哇，这东西很不错啊。作为感谢，等会咱们去吃星塔严选的快餐吧，我请你！|trans_en=Oh? This is pretty nice. I'll treat you to some Monolith Select fast food by way of thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_150_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こ、こんなすごいもの、タダであたしに！？本当に裏とかない！？<br/>へ、へへへ…あんたみたいなのがカンパニーの代表なら、絶対に成功するよ！|text_cn=这、这就送我了？不需要我给你打个十天半月的工，就这么轻易送我了？！<br/>你这样的首席，做什么都会成功的！|trans_en=Y-You're give me this for free? No strings attached? Heh... Hehe... <br/>The sky's the limit with you as the company CEO!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_150_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=おっけー|text_cn=好~|trans_en=Okay.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_150_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=いーやーだー|text_cn=不要——|trans_en=No way, Jose.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_150_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=诶？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_150_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=えぇ…|text_cn=嗯……|trans_en=Uhh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_150_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=しょーがないじゃん…|text_cn=没办法啊……|trans_en=That's how it goes...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_150_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=マジ！？|text_cn=喂！|trans_en=Seriously?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_150_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=この！|text_cn=可恶。|trans_en=You...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_150_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くないね|text_cn=不错嘛。|trans_en=Not bad!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_150_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=(Sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_150_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=悩んでるなら、とりあえずポテトでも食べたら？|text_cn=别烦恼那么多，来根薯条吧~|trans_en=Why worry? Have some fried potatoes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_150_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=海釣りの爽快感って、わさび味のフライドポテト食べる感覚に似てるよねー|text_cn=呼——休息日去堤岸作钓，像吃芥末薯条一样畅快。|trans_en=Sea fishing and wasabi-flavored fries are the two best things in the whole world.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_150_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…布団がチーズフライドポテトみたいに温い…|text_cn=呜~被窝……比芝士薯条还温暖。|trans_en=This bed is as warm as a fresh batch of cheese fries.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_150_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=青い空！穏やかな風！絶好の釣り日和だ～！|text_cn=明媚的阳光，清新的空气！今天不去钓鱼真是太可惜了。|trans_en=Clear skies and a mild breeze! It's a perfect day for fishing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_150_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_150_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっと…とりあえず港でポテト食べてるから。あたしのことは気にしないでいいよ|text_cn=嗯……你们先聊，我、我去码头边上整点薯条。|trans_en=So, uh... I'll be at the port having some fries. No need to worry about me.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_150_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダイナマイト漁…解・禁！ドーン！|text_cn=看好了，这才是真正的——“炸鱼”！|trans_en=Blast fishing... Ready, set... BOOM!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_150_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしが窓際従業員って？残念でした～！|text_cn=你以为我只是条咸鱼？那就大错特错了！|trans_en=You thought I was just dead weight? Think again!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_150_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ～…やっと休める…|text_cn=我先……歇了……|trans_en=(Sigh)... At least now I can rest...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_150_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あーあ、やっちった…|text_cn=搞砸了……|trans_en=Aw, wouldn't you know it...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_150_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力、釣りに使えないかなー|text_cn=这力量，太适合拿来电鱼了！|trans_en=I bet I can use this for fishing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_150_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=へー、いいじゃん。塩味のポテトもそうだけど、やっぱ王道こそ正義だよね|text_cn=哦！像原味薯条一样经典。|trans_en=Hey, not bad. Keeping it old school, like salted fries.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_150_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=能力と責任の重さは比例するべき…<br/>って待って！それってつまり、いま以上に働けってこと！？|text_cn=能力越大，责任……诶？那我岂不是要干更多的活了吗！|trans_en=With great ability, comes great responsibility... Hey, wait! Does that mean more work for me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_150_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=サポートはするから、定時にあがれるように頑張れ～|text_cn=我给你打下手，你多加加油，咱们千万不能加班哦！|trans_en=Look, I'll help you, so let's try to knock off on time, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_150_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんだけ頑張ってんだから、ボーナス増やしてくんないかなぁ…|text_cn=我都这么努力了，能不能有奖金啊~|trans_en=I think I deserve a little something extra as my bonus this year...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_150_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ～…さっさと片付けて、残り時間はのんびりしよーっと|text_cn=哈啊——赶紧弄完，赶紧回家……|trans_en=(Yawn)... Let's get this over with and take the rest of the day off.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_150_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この香ばしい匂いは…フライドポテト！？|text_cn=嗯？是不是有薯条的香气？|trans_en=What's that wonderful smell? Fried potatoes?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_150_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=急いでもいいことないって。適度にサボりながらでいいじゃん|text_cn=别那么心急，偶尔摸摸鱼也是可以的嘛~|trans_en=What's the big hurry? It's okay to take it easy sometimes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_150_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しいルアー買っちゃおっかなー|text_cn=想去弄点新的路亚……|trans_en=Maybe I'll get a new lure...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_150_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=面倒な事務作業から解放されるし、やっぱ巡遊者ってラクでいいわ～♪|text_cn=还是跟着旅人一起爬塔轻松，不需要麻烦的流程申请，也不用提交一大堆报告。|trans_en=I love being a Trekker because it gets me out of all that boring office work! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_150_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと、この仕事まであたしにやれって言うの？|text_cn=嘶……你该不会是嫌我工作不饱和吧？|trans_en=Excuse me? This isn't in my job description.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_150_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい星ノ塔？はぁ…また仕事増えるじゃん|text_cn=新项目？唉，有得忙了……|trans_en=A new Monolith? Oh, great. Just what I needed. More work.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_150_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さーて、フライドポテトは～っと…|text_cn=走，咱们去整点薯条！|trans_en=And now for some fried potatoes...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_150_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=んじゃ、おやすみ～。なんかあったらメッセージ送っといて～|text_cn=我先睡了，有事请留言。|trans_en='Kay, goodnight. Text me if you need anything.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_150_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=接待？まあこっちだって社会人だし、やれと言われたらやるけどさ|text_cn=应酬？好好，没问题~我好歹也是正经打工人。|trans_en=Customer relations? I mean, I guess I'll do it if I have to as part of the job, but...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_150_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしにしては、頑張ってるほうでしょ？|text_cn=哎，我工作可太努力了！|trans_en=That was pretty good effort for me, huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_150_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=毎回このくらいラクならいいのに|text_cn=要是每次都这么轻松就好了。|trans_en=I wish it were always this easy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_150_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふん、まあざっとこんなもんでしょ|text_cn=哼哼~我可真是能力超群~|trans_en=Hehe. Easy-peasy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_150_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラール様の手にかかれば、このくらい楽勝～♪|text_cn=轻松得胜~菈露大人亲自出手，没有什么解决不了的~|trans_en=With Queen Laru on the job, this will be easy! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_150_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=直帰しま～す！|text_cn=搞定，下班！|trans_en=I'm heading home!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_150_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょーっと油断しちゃったかなぁ…|text_cn=不好，大意……了……|trans_en=Maybe I got a little careless...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_150_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あ゙だじのボーナズがぁ～|text_cn=搞砸了，我的奖金……|trans_en=Th-There goes my bonus...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_150_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？あたし？マジで言ってる？|text_cn=选我？你要不再多考虑考虑？|trans_en=What? Me? Seriously?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_150_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ～…えっ、また新しい仕事？|text_cn=哈啊——什么？又有工作。|trans_en=(Yawn)... Aw, more work?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_150_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=定時までに終わらせるよ～|text_cn=是、是，快点搞定吧。|trans_en=Let's get this done before quitting time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_150_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=さーて、外回りの申請出してこないと|text_cn=我先提个外出申请。|trans_en=Time to request outside work permission.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_150_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_150_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねーねー？チョコ味のフライドポテトと、フライドポテト味のチョコならどっちがいい？|text_cn=提问！你是想要巧克力味道的薯条，还是想要薯条味道的巧克力？|trans_en=Hey, which would you prefer? Chocolate flavored fried potatoes, or fried potato-flavored chocolate?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_150_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ホワイトクリスマスかぁ<br/>ちょうど仕事も片付いたし、今日はラール様と一緒に雪景色を楽しみに行かない？|text_cn=难得的雪愿节，就让好不容易闲下来的菈露大人带你欣赏千塔的雪景吧~|trans_en=I just got done with work. Wanna go enjoy a white Snowish Festival with Queen Laru?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_150_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけおめー<br/>去年は365日毎日サボって『サボりチャンピオン』の称号をゲットしたし、<br/>今年は引き続き連続サボり記録の更新を狙ってくよー|text_cn=恭喜你！累计摸鱼天数已达三百六十五天，获得称号“摸鱼大王”！新的一年，我们一起再接再厉，再创新高~|trans_en=Happy New Year. <br/>I took it easy all 365 days last year to win the Slack-Off Championship, and this year I'm trying to make it back-to-back!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_150_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やった！やった！！これでまたひとつ退職に近づいた！<br/>今日は景気づけに、誕生日限定のフライドポテト食べに行こう！|text_cn=祝我自己离退休又近了一步！走，我们去爽吃生日限定薯条∼|trans_en=Woohoo! One year closer to retirement! Let's go celebrate with some special birthday fried potatoes!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_150_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_150_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぴばー…って誕生日なのに仕事？あーダメダメ、そういうのよくないって<br/>あたしが釣りに連れてってあげるからさ、一日くらいゆっくりしなよ<br/>それに今日の主役が糸を垂らせば、珍しいなにかが釣れるかもだし|text_cn=生日还忙着工作？这思想觉悟不行啊！<br/>来来，今天我带你去钓鱼，放松放松。寿星甩竿，必有金光！|trans_en=Happy birthday to you—Wait. Are you actually working on your birthday? C'mon on, you can't do that!<br/>If there's ever a day you have to go fishing, it's today. Plus, birthday luck is definitely a thing—imagine what we might catch!}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=風がやさしい匂いを運んできたと思ったら…ふふ、きみだったんだねー|text_cn=风又变了，带来了新的气味，也带来了你。|trans_en=I thought the wind had brought me a breezy new scent... But in fact, it was you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…やることが多すぎて、ぜんぜんゆっくりできないや|text_cn=事情总是接连不断，还真是一刻都闲不下来呢。|trans_en=Gah... There's so much to do, I can't rest for even a second.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=朝食に、埠頭のお店の新商品、『漬け魚の缶詰』はどうかな？<br/>匂いがすごいけど、スープにすると他の料理にはない味わいになるみたいだよ？|text_cn=今天的早餐，要不要试试码头商店的新品——“腌渍鱼罐头”？用来熬汤应该别有一番风味。|trans_en=Let's try out that new item at the shop by the pier—"Grilled Fish in a Can".<br/>Sure, it's kind of stinky, but in a chowder it tastes like nothing else. Whaddya say?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この時間は、魚も涼しいところで休んでるからねー<br/>わたしたちも、日陰で少しお昼寝しよっか？|text_cn=这个时间，鱼儿都躲到阴凉处休息了，我也该去睡午觉了。|trans_en=This time of day, even the fish are taking a siesta in some cool spot. <br/>So why don't we make like a trout, find some shade, and have a snooze?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんばんは。一緒に海辺の散歩でもどうかな？<br/>町と違って光が少ないから、星がよく見えるんだー♪|text_cn=你来了，要不要和我一起去海边散步？夜晚的星空总是很清澈哦∼|trans_en=Evening! Fancy a walk on the beach together?<br/>Away from the lights of the town, we'll have an amazing view of the stars... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_155_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふたりっきりだね。ふふ…なにして遊ぼっか？|text_cn=难得只有我们两个人，玩点什么好呢？|trans_en=Just us two, huh? Hehe. So what do you suggest we do?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_155_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=時間があるなら、一緒に散歩とかどうかな？<br/>――え？ほんとにいいの？ちょ、ちょっと待ってね。すぐ準備するから…！|text_cn=要跟我海边散步吗~诶？你、你答应了……我还得准备一下呢。|trans_en=Er, if you've got nothing else to do, would you like to go for a walk?<br/>... What? You would? G-Golly! Okay, let me get ready—back in flash!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_155_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=替えの服、ちゃんと持ってきた？ずぶ濡れのまま帰ることになったら、大変だよー？|text_cn=你有带备用的衣服吗？等下弄湿了就不好了~|trans_en=Did you bring a change of clothes? You can't go tramping back home all soaking wet!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_155_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれれー？髪が絡まっちゃったー<br/>どこかのやさしいウサギさんが、解くの手伝ってくれないかなー？|text_cn=哎呀，头发缠在一起了，你能帮我解开吗？|trans_en=Oh, drat. Look at my hair. It's gotten all tangled.<br/>Wouldn't it be great if a kind-hearted bunny could help me fix it...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=帆船の操舵に、特別な技術はいらないよ<br/>大切なのは、風を感じることだけだからねー|text_cn=开帆船没有什么特殊的技巧，只需顺应风的指引。|trans_en=Steering a ship doesn't require any special skill. It's the ability to read the wind on your face that really counts.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=新鮮な魚はね、シンプルだけどお醤油とワサビで食べるのがすっごく美味しいんだよー♪|text_cn=新鲜捞上来的鱼，切成小块，撒上一点调料，便是最纯粹的美味。|trans_en=Fresh fish right out of the ocean, served with wasabi and soy sauce... Mm-mm! Is there anything better? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=小さい頃、おばあちゃんが漁に出るときは、わたしも一緒に連れてってもらってたの<br/>でも海に出るのはいつも暗い時間だったから…<br/>わたしは途中で眠くなって、波の音を聞きながらいつの間にか寝ちゃってたんだよ|text_cn=小时候，每次出海捕鱼，奶奶总会带着我一起。<br/>大多时候，出海时天色已经暗了，夜色下的小船摇啊摇，我在路上就开始犯困。听着海浪声，不知不觉就睡着了。|trans_en=When I was a little girl, Grandma would always take me fishing with her.<br/>We'd get up super early, and the ocean would still be pitch dark.<br/>I'd be so tired that before I knew it, the sound of the waves would lull me back to sleep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=まえにひとりで海に出たとき、すっごい嵐に巻き込まれちゃって<br/>そのときはもうダメかと思ったんだけど…<br/>家の匂いが、わたしに帰る方向を教えてくれたんだー♪|text_cn=有一次我独自出海，遭遇了风暴，那时我还以为自己再也回不来了，好在家的气味为我指引了方向。|trans_en=One time when I was out on the sea alone, a huge storm blew up out of nowhere.<br/>I really thought I was done for.<br/>But I made it back just by following the scent of home... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=キャンプファイヤーするなら、バーベキューと飲み物をい〜っぱい用意しなきゃね～♪|text_cn=沙滩上的篝火，当然要配上烧烤和饮料。|trans_en=If you're going to have a campfire, you've got to bring meat for the grill and a bucket of cold drinks! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=アモールってどんなところ？そこでも海は見えるのかな？|text_cn=千塔之城一定很气派吧？那里也能看到大海吗？|trans_en=So what kind of place is Emor? Can you see the ocean there, too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_155_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=砂浜にお願い事を書いて帰るとね、波が星まで運んでくれるって言われてるの<br/>そうすると朝起きたとき、お願い事が叶ってるかもしれないんだって|text_cn=据说，在沙滩上写下愿望，海浪会把愿望卷走，带到星星上。等你睡一觉醒来，愿望就会实现了。|trans_en=They say that if you write a wish in the sand before you go home, the waves will come in and carry it to the stars.<br/>Then when you wake up the next day, maybe you'll find your wish has come true.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_155_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいこと教えてあげる！サーフボードを抱えて眠ると、波に揺られてる気分になって…<br/>朝までぐっすり眠れるんだって。よかったら、今度試してみて？<br/>わたしと一緒に海ですごす夢を見られるかもよ？|text_cn=告诉你一个秘密：如果抱着冲浪板睡觉，就像被海浪轻轻摇晃着，特别容易安稳入睡。<br/>下次要不要试试？我可以陪你一起，做个关于大海的梦。|trans_en=Here's a hot tip for you. If you lie down on your surfboard and close your eyes, it'll feel like the waves are rocking you to sleep...<br/>You should try it—you'll wake up the next day totally refreshed.<br/>Plus, you might even dream about spending the day at the beach with me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_155_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この水着はね、おばあちゃんが誕生日プレゼントに買ってくれたものなの<br/>すっごく気に入っちゃったから、同じものを何着も買って、毎日着られるようにしたんだー♪|text_cn=这件泳衣是奶奶送我的生日礼物，因为太喜欢了，我又去买了好多件一模一样的，这样可以穿很久呢。|trans_en=The swimsuit? It was a birthday present from Grandma.<br/>I loved it so much, I bought one for each day of the week, so I can wear it all the time! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_155_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=海水とわたしの手、どっちが温かいと思う？<br/>ふふ…手をつないで一緒に海辺を散歩すれば、わかるかもねー♪<br/>それに手をつないでれば、もし波にさらわれたときでも安心だし…<br/>あ、でもふたりで一緒に流されちゃったら…そのときはどうしようね♪|text_cn=你觉得海水和我的手哪个更暖？要不要试试，牵着我的手走进海里？我会一直拉着你，不会让海浪把你卷走。<br/>除非……你想和我一起漂到更远的地方。|trans_en=Which is warmer, my hand or the seawater?<br/>Hehe. Maybe we should find out by holding hands and going for a walk along the beach. ♪<br/>Besides, holding hands is safer, in case a big wave comes in and tries to carry us off...<br/>Although if we both get swept away, what would we do then, I wonder...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_155_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ときどき考えるんだ、もしきみが魚だったら…<br/>わたしをサンゴ礁だと思って、ずっとそばを泳いでてくれるのかな？<br/>疲れて休むときは、わたしのところに戻ってきてくれるのかなーってね|text_cn=有时候我会想，如果你是一条鱼，会不会觉得我是珊瑚礁，一直在我身边游来游去？<br/>累了想休息的时候，也会回到我这里……呵呵。|trans_en=You know what? I sometimes imagine that you're a fish.<br/>Then if I were a coral reef, you could spend all your days swimming next to me.<br/>And when you got tired from swimming, you could even nestle up to me to sleep!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_155_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このまえコゼットって子に会ったの<br/>海辺限定の飲み物を探してたらしいんだけど…<br/>結局見つけられないまま、帰っちゃったみたい<br/>都市では、どういう飲み物が流行ってるのかな？|text_cn=之前遇到过一个叫珂赛特的女孩子，她特地跑到这边来寻找“海边限定饮料”，结果没找到，就失望地走了……<br/>原来城邦里的人喜欢这种东西吗？|trans_en=I met this girl called Cosette the other day.<br/>She was trying to find a drink that they only serve at the seaside.<br/>She couldn't find it though, and went home empty-handed.<br/>Do you think those kinds of drinks are in fashion now, back in the city?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_155_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっとまえに、カリンちゃんと新しいステラキネマを観たの<br/>世界中の海が干上がった、未来の話だったんだけど…<br/>カリンちゃんったら、夕飯も食べられないくらい泣いちゃって<br/>ふふ、かわいかったなぁ♪|text_cn=前不久，我和花铃看了一部新出的影戏，讲述的是在遥远的未来，所有的大海都干涸了……<br/>她哭得连晚饭都吃不下了。|trans_en=A little while ago, I went to see a new Stella Drama show with Karin.<br/>It was about a future in which all the oceans had dried up.<br/>Karin cried so much that she couldn't eat dinner afterwards.<br/>Hehe. Honestly, it was kind of cute... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_155_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=フライドポテトを食べながら、絶対に大物を釣るって言ってる釣り人がいて<br/>どこかの都市では、ポテトを食べながら釣りするのが普通なのかな？|text_cn=上次我遇到了一个奇怪的钓鱼高手，她一边拼命吃着薯条一边嘟囔着什么“绝不空军”……这是什么新型的捕鱼仪式吗？|trans_en=So I met this fisher eating a plate of fries and saying she was definitely going to catch a big one today.<br/>In the city, is it common to eat fries while you fish?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_155_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨日、ビッグニュースを探してるって魔女が突然訪ねてきて<br/>ウサギさんにどんな報酬を払ったのか質問されたんだけど…<br/>答えなくてよかったんだよね？|text_cn=那个整天嚷嚷着要做个大新闻的小魔女，昨天突然找上门来，问我给了你多少委托报酬……<br/>这是可以说的吗？|trans_en=Yesterday, a witch suddenly dropped by saying she was on the trail of some big news.<br/>She asked me how much of a reward I gave you.<br/>I refused to answer, but was that the right thing to do?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_155_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=コハクちゃんって、いつもわたしのことをジッと見てくるんだよねー<br/>あの子の匂いって、小さい頃にエサをあげてた猫ちゃんにそっくりで…<br/>も、もしかして…コハクちゃんってあの猫ちゃんだったりするのかな…！？|text_cn=琥珀那孩子，不知道为什么常常盯着我看呢……<br/>她身上的味道，和我小时候常常喂的一只小黑猫很像，该不会她就是那只黑猫吧？|trans_en=Amber is always staring at me with a funny look in her eyes.<br/>You know, she smells just like a cat I used to feed when I was young...<br/>You don't think she could be that same cat, all grown up?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_155_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれー？ウサギさんのほうからわたしにくっついてくるなんて…うふふ、めずらしいね♪|text_cn=嗯？今天角色对调了吗？还真是难得啊……|trans_en=Hello, little bunny. Are you cuddling up to me now? Hehehe... It's almost always the other way round! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_155_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしたの？そんなことしても、わたしは宝の地図なんて持ってないよ？|text_cn=真可惜，我身上可没有藏宝图哦~|trans_en=What's the matter? You can do that all you like, but I don't have any treasure maps, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_155_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さっきから、ジーッとこっち見てるけど…悩み事？わたしでよければ相談のるよ？|text_cn=一直盯着我看，是有什么心事吗？|trans_en=You've been staring at me for ages. Is something the matter? I'm willing to listen, you know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_155_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=そっちがかまってくれないなら…こっちから仕掛けちゃうよー♪|text_cn=再不理我的话，我可要主动出击了哦~|trans_en=Well, if you're not going to give me any attention, I guess I'll have to make the first move! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_155_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして…目を開けたまま寝てるのかな？<br/>すごーい！そんなことができるなんて、魚みたいだね！|text_cn=你不会睁着眼睛睡着了吧？真有趣，像鱼一样呢……|trans_en=Don't tell me you're sleeping with your eyes open.<br/>That's amazing! I thought only fish could do that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_155_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はじめまして。わたしはシア。あなたからは…ふふ、なんだか心が落ち着く匂いがする|text_cn=正式自我介绍一下，我是希娅。你的身上，有着可以信任的气味呢。|trans_en=Nice to meet you. I'm Shia. And from you, heh... I sense a scent that somehow calms my heart.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_155_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あっ、また会ったね！わたしたちの縁は、船を固定するロープよりも固いのかも♪|text_cn=又见面了~看来我们之间的缘分，比帆船的缆绳还要坚固呢。|trans_en=Ah, hello again! The bond between us must be stronger than a ship's mooring rope! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_155_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、波に乗ってくよ〜！|text_cn=掀起浪花吧。|trans_en=Yippee! Let's ride this wave!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_155_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これで嵐もへっちゃらだよ！|text_cn=这下，我们可以穿越暴风雨了。|trans_en=I can handle any storm now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_155_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=過去は過去、いまはきみとの航海を楽しみたいな♪|text_cn=旧的轨迹，新的开始。|trans_en=The past is past. The important thing is to enjoy the voyage together.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_155_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これ…ウサギさんが好きな曲？|text_cn=这是你喜欢的音乐吗？|trans_en=Is this your favorite tune?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_155_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=サーフィンの魅力、教えてあげるね！|text_cn=一起来感受冲浪的魅力吧！|trans_en=I'll show you the joy of surfing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_155_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの夜感じた、月の光と波の音…ふふ、きっとウサギさんも、この先ずーっと忘れられないよね|text_cn=那一晚的月光与海浪，想必你也无法忘怀吧。|trans_en=Ah, the night air, the moonlight sparkling on the waves... We'll never forget this moment, will we?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_155_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう。ウサギさんが信頼してくれるなら、わたしも張り切っちゃうよ！|text_cn=谢谢你，这份信任对我来说意义非凡。|trans_en=Thanks. So long as you believe in me, then I do too!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_155_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=クンクンクン…最近、なんだかウサギさんの匂いが変わったような…？<br/>それとも、変わったのはわたしの気持ちのほうかな…？|text_cn=你身上的气味，似乎又发生了一些改变……不，真正改变的应该是我的心境吧。|trans_en=*sniff sniff* The scent on your body seems to have changed slightly again...<br/>No, perhaps it is my own state of mind that has truly changed...？}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_155_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしこの先、この海を離れて遠い場所に行っちゃうとしても…<br/>ここで過ごした時間を、忘れないって約束してくれるとうれしいな|text_cn=你要答应我，即便将来离开了这片大海，前往更遥远的地方，也不要忘记在这里发生的一切。|trans_en=Even if the day comes that you set across the sea and leave me behind...<br/>I want you to promise that you'll never forget this precious time we spent together.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_155_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=真っ暗な海を漂ってるとね、むしょうに灯台の明かりが恋しくなるときがあるの<br/>その光には手が届かないってわかってても、自然と手を伸ばしちゃったりして…<br/>わたしにとっては、ウサギさんが灯台の明かりみたいなもの…なのかもしれないね、なーんて♪|text_cn=人在夜晚独自航行的时候，会格外留恋灯塔散发的光芒。明知它来自不可抵达的彼岸，却还是忍不住想把它抓在手中。<br/>也许，你就像那束光一样，让人舍不得移开视线。|trans_en=When you're adrift in a pitch-black sea, you sometimes find yourself yearning to see a lighthouse, shining in the darkness.<br/>You reach out to it instinctively, even though you know you can't reach it.<br/>What I'm saying is, sometimes I think you might just be my own personal lighthouse... Or not! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_155_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう、ちょうどほしかったんだー|text_cn=谢谢你，我正需要这个呢。|trans_en=Thanks. It's just what I wanted.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_155_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ、お返しはなにがいい？きれいな貝殻？それとも豪華な海鮮料理？|text_cn=我能给你什么回报吗？送你一些好看的贝壳？还是给你做一顿海鲜大餐？|trans_en=Hehe. What should I get you in return? A pretty shell? A delicious seafood buffet?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_155_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=宝物を守ろうとする海賊の気持ち…<br/>いまならわかる気がするよ<br/>ウサギさんからの贈り物、どこに隠そうかなー♪|text_cn=现在我可以理解那些捂紧宝藏的海盗了，我该把你送的礼物藏在哪里呢？|trans_en=Gosh! Now I know what it feels like to be a pirate trying to protect her secret stash of gold!<br/>So tell me, Bunny... Where should I hide this wonderful treasure? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_155_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん|text_cn=很好。|trans_en=Yep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_155_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=違うよ|text_cn=不对。|trans_en=Nope.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_155_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_155_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=おかしいなー？|text_cn=奇怪。|trans_en=Weird.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_155_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんなぁ…|text_cn=没关系，我只是……|trans_en=Aw...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_155_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=あっ！|text_cn=啊！|trans_en=Ah!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_155_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=もぉ〜|text_cn=我无法接受！|trans_en=Grrr...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_155_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=よかったぁ|text_cn=太好了。|trans_en=Great.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_155_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=(sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_155_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=不思議な匂い♪|text_cn=神奇的气味。|trans_en=Now that's a strange smell. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_155_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=クンクン…もうちょっと嗅がせて？|text_cn=嗯……让我再闻一下。|trans_en=*sniff sniff* Can I smell more?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_155_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしたちは、海に守られてるんだよー|text_cn=大海会庇佑我们。|trans_en=We're protected by the ocean, you know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_155_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=穏やかに見えても、海の中にはたくさんの秘密が眠ってるんだー|text_cn=平静的海面下，隐藏了太多秘密。|trans_en=It looks so calm, the sea. But it harbors lots and lots of secrets...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_155_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=夏っていいよねー♪|text_cn=夏天最棒了~|trans_en=Isn't summer great? ♪}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_155_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いっくよー！フワリととうちゃーく！|text_cn=轻飘飘，平稳着陆∼|trans_en=Here I go! Nice soft landing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_155_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日もいい波！水しぶきが気持ちいい♪|text_cn=呵呵，心跳浪花~|trans_en=Great waves today! Feel that ocean spray!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_155_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=波の音、聞こえない…|text_cn=浪停了……|trans_en=I can't hear the waves...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_155_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=海の匂い…どこ…|text_cn=海的气味……消失了。|trans_en=The smell of the ocean ... where is it...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_155_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=波に乗って、もっともっと高みを目指そう！|text_cn=谁不想乘着浪花冲得更高呢？|trans_en=Let's ride this wave and go even higher!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_155_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁ♪豪華な海鮮料理みたい！|text_cn=呵呵，堪比一顿海鲜大餐呢。|trans_en=Wah! ♪ It's like a fresh seafood buffet!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_155_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=すごーい！これ、深海に眠る宝物より貴重なものだよ|text_cn=比深海宝藏还要珍贵啊。|trans_en=Wowzers! This is more precious than deep-sea treasures.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_155_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これでいまよりも〜っと息があうはずだよ！|text_cn=我们的配合会更默契。|trans_en=It's like we're even more in synch than before!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_155_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ。わたしとチームを組んでよかったでしょ？|text_cn=作为搭档，我还不错吧？|trans_en=Hehe! Aren't you glad you and I are a team?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_155_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここ…潮の香りがしないから、なんだか落ち着かないな|text_cn=这里一点海的气味都没有，总觉得不太习惯。|trans_en=I really need to smell the ocean to feel at ease...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_155_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=塔の中ってちょっと息苦しいし、早く終わらせて帰ろっか？|text_cn=塔里的空气有点闷，我们速战速决吧。|trans_en=I hate being cooped up inside towers. Let's get this over with, 'kay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_155_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=そろそろ広い空と海が恋しくなってきちゃったなぁ|text_cn=我开始怀念没有天花板的地方了。|trans_en=I'm starting to miss the open sky and swelling ocean…}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_155_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=どっちが多く星骸を倒せるか勝負してみる？|text_cn=要不要定个挑战？看谁先解决这些小家伙？|trans_en=Want to see who can take down the most Stellaroids?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_155_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=私についてきて。星の輝きにも海にも、それだけの音があるんだー♪|text_cn=跟紧我，星光就和大海一样，都有属于自己的节奏。|trans_en=Stick with me. The stars and ocean each sing with their own music... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_155_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=嵐がくる前の匂い…ふふ、新たな挑戦の始まりだね|text_cn=空气里弥漫着暴风雨前的气息……是挑战即将开始的信号呢。|trans_en=*sniff sniff* I smell a storm coming... Hehe. Which means another new challenge.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_155_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よーし！わたしたちの手で、新しい航路を切り拓いていこう！|text_cn=又来开拓新地图了~|trans_en=All right! Now it's up to us to chart a new course!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_155_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなお店が海の近くにあれば、きっと観光客で大繁盛だねー|text_cn=如果海边也有这种店，一定会吸引很多游客吧？|trans_en=This place would do great with tourists if they set up shop near the ocean.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_155_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ときには立ち止まって、波音に耳を傾けてごらん？|text_cn=偶尔也要停下来，感受海面上微微泛起的浪花。|trans_en=Sometimes, you just need to stop and listen to the waves.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_155_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここの匂い…ちょっと気になるかも|text_cn=这里的气味……令人在意。|trans_en=Hmm. Now that's a curious smell...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_155_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よーし、これで安心して船を出せるよ|text_cn=好了，现在可以安心开船了。|trans_en=Great. Now we can set sail without any worries.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_155_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっと体が温まってきたのになぁ|text_cn=明明才热身完，这就收工了吗？|trans_en=Aw. I was just getting warmed up.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_155_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=甲板のお掃除おーわり！出航ー！|text_cn=甲板清理完毕，可以继续航行了。|trans_en=Deck's scrubbed spotless! Time to set sail!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_155_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=勝利の匂いは、何度嗅いでも飽きないね|text_cn=胜利的味道，真是百闻不腻啊。|trans_en=Ah, the scent of victory. I never get tired of it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_155_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ご褒美はなにかなー？|text_cn=说吧，打算怎么奖励我？|trans_en=So what's my reward?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_155_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=元気出して？魚が獲れない日だってあるよ|text_cn=别灰心，就算是老渔民也有失手的时候。|trans_en=Cheer up. Some days, the fish just aren't biting...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_155_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はもう帰港して、ゆっくり休んでね|text_cn=今天就返航吧，回去好好休息。|trans_en=Let's head back to port and rest for another day.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_155_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=出航するよー、準備はいい？|text_cn=各就各位，准备启航~|trans_en=Ready to set sail?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_155_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=波と追いかけっこだー|text_cn=走吧，像追逐浪花那样。|trans_en=Let's race the waves!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_155_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなで波を切り裂いて進もう！|text_cn=一起迎接风浪吧。|trans_en=We'll slice through the waves together!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_155_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんな、シーフードは好き？|text_cn=大家喜欢吃海鲜吗？|trans_en=Does everyone like seafood?}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_155_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_155_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ウサギさん、ハッピーバレンタイン！<br/>新鮮なサーモンを使ったチョコを作ってみたんだー。しっかり味わって食べてねー<br/>え？お返しはなにがほしいか？特に考えてなかったけど…なら、一緒にディナーとかどう？|text_cn=节日快乐~这份巧克力送给你，是我用新鲜鲑鱼精心制作的，你可要好好吃掉哦~呵呵。<br/>回礼？嗯……那你就邀请我共进晚餐吧？|trans_en=Hello Bunny, and happy Valentine's Day!<br/>I made some chocolate for you using fresh salmon. Make sure you eat it nice and slow, so you can appreciate it properly.<br/>Hm? What do I want in return? Well, I don't know. How about a nice dinner date?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_155_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=都市によっては、クリスマスに雪が降るって聞いたよ<br/>いいなぁ〜、わたしも雪が積もった浜辺で、きみと一緒に駆け回ってみたいなー♪|text_cn=听说有的城邦，雪愿节时会下雪呢。真好啊，我也想和你一起，踩在被冰雪覆盖的沙滩上呢。|trans_en=I've heard that in some cities, it actually snows on the Snowish Festival day.<br/>Gosh, what I wouldn't give to run around with you on a snow-covered beach some day! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_155_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとー！カリンちゃんがね、温泉に行きたがってるんだけど…<br/>よかったらきみも一緒にどう？お正月くらい、ゆったりのんびりしないとねー|text_cn=新年快乐~前几天花铃吵着要去泡温泉，你要不要和我们一起？难得有假期，好好放松一下吧。|trans_en=Happy New Year! Karin has been saying we should go to the hot springs for the holiday...<br/>Maybe you should tag along, too? It's New Year's, after all. What better time to relax in a hot bath?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_155_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=毎年、わたしの誕生日にはカリンちゃんと一緒に海に行くんだー<br/>潮騒やカモメの声に耳を傾けながら、砂浜に座って打ち寄せる波を眺めるの<br/>でもいまは…ウサギさんが一緒だから、かな？<br/>なんだかこれまでとは、すべてが違って見える気がするよ|text_cn=往年这一天，我都会和花铃一起去海边。我们静静地看着潮起潮落，听着海风和海鸟的叫声，安安静静地度过这个特别的日子。<br/>但现在，因为有你在身边，连日光和海风的味道都变得不一样了。|trans_en=Every year on my birthday, I go to the beach with Karin.<br/>We sit on the sand, listen to the waves and the cries of the seagulls, and watch the tide creep up the sand.<br/>But I don't know. It feels different this year, somehow.<br/>Maybe it's because you're here with me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_155_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとう！<br/>来年も再来年も、ウサギさんの未来が、海のようにどこまでも広がっていくことを祈ってるよ<br/>あと…来年も豪華な海鮮料理を用意するから、一緒にお祝いしようね♪|text_cn=生日快乐，愿你的未来像大海一样开阔自由，记得常回来看看，我会像今天一样，给你准备海鲜大餐的。|trans_en=Happy birthday!<br/>I hope your future is as wide and boundless as the ocean for many more years to come!<br/>Oh... And next year, I'll put together an even bigger seafood buffet so we can celebrate together. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greeting|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=風がやさしい匂いを運んできたと思ったら…ふふ、きみだったんだねー|text_cn=风又变了，带来了新的气味，也带来了你。|trans_en=I thought the wind had brought me a breezy new scent... But in fact, it was you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greeting|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…やることが多すぎて、ぜんぜんゆっくりできないや|text_cn=事情总是接连不断，还真是一刻都闲不下来呢。|trans_en=Gah... There's so much to do, I can't rest for even a second.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Morning|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=朝食に、埠頭のお店の新商品、『漬け魚の缶詰』はどうかな？<br/>匂いがすごいけど、スープにすると他の料理にはない味わいになるみたいだよ？|text_cn=今天的早餐，要不要试试码头商店的新品——“腌渍鱼罐头”？用来熬汤应该别有一番风味。|trans_en=Let's try out that new item at the shop by the pier—"Grilled Fish in a Can".<br/>Sure, it's kind of stinky, but in a chowder it tastes like nothing else. Whaddya say?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Afternoon|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この時間は、魚も涼しいところで休んでるからねー<br/>わたしたちも、日陰で少しお昼寝しよっか？|text_cn=这个时间，鱼儿都躲到阴凉处休息了，我也该去睡午觉了。|trans_en=This time of day, even the fish are taking a siesta in some cool spot. <br/>So why don't we make like a trout, find some shade, and have a snooze?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Night|file_jp=vo_155_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんばんは。一緒に海辺の散歩でもどうかな？<br/>町と違って光が少ないから、星がよく見えるんだー♪|text_cn=你来了，要不要和我一起去海边散步？夜晚的星空总是很清澈哦∼|trans_en=Evening! Fancy a walk on the beach together?<br/>Away from the lights of the town, we'll have an amazing view of the stars... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Conversation|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=帆船の操舵に、特別な技術はいらないよ<br/>大切なのは、風を感じることだけだからねー|text_cn=开帆船没有什么特殊的技巧，只需顺应风的指引。|trans_en=Steering a ship doesn't require any special skill. It's the ability to read the wind on your face that really counts.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Conversation|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=新鮮な魚はね、シンプルだけどお醤油とワサビで食べるのがすっごく美味しいんだよー♪|text_cn=新鲜捞上来的鱼，切成小块，撒上一点调料，便是最纯粹的美味。|trans_en=Fresh fish right out of the ocean, served with wasabi and soy sauce... Mm-mm! Is there anything better? ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Conversation|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=小さい頃、おばあちゃんが漁に出るときは、わたしも一緒に連れてってもらってたの<br/>でも海に出るのはいつも暗い時間だったから…<br/>わたしは途中で眠くなって、波の音を聞きながらいつの間にか寝ちゃってたんだよ|text_cn=小时候，每次出海捕鱼，奶奶总会带着我一起。<br/>大多时候，出海时天色已经暗了，夜色下的小船摇啊摇，我在路上就开始犯困。听着海浪声，不知不觉就睡着了。|trans_en=When I was a little girl, Grandma would always take me fishing with her.<br/>We'd get up super early, and the ocean would still be pitch dark.<br/>I'd be so tired that before I knew it, the sound of the waves would lull me back to sleep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Conversation|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=まえにひとりで海に出たとき、すっごい嵐に巻き込まれちゃって<br/>そのときはもうダメかと思ったんだけど…<br/>家の匂いが、わたしに帰る方向を教えてくれたんだー♪|text_cn=有一次我独自出海，遭遇了风暴，那时我还以为自己再也回不来了，好在家的气味为我指引了方向。|trans_en=One time when I was out on the sea alone, a huge storm blew up out of nowhere.<br/>I really thought I was done for.<br/>But I made it back just by following the scent of home... ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Conversation|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=キャンプファイヤーするなら、バーベキューと飲み物をい〜っぱい用意しなきゃね～♪|text_cn=沙滩上的篝火，当然要配上烧烤和饮料。|trans_en=If you're going to have a campfire, you've got to bring meat for the grill and a bucket of cold drinks! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Conversation|file_jp=vo_155_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=アモールってどんなところ？そこでも海は見えるのかな？|text_cn=千塔之城一定很气派吧？那里也能看到大海吗？|trans_en=So what kind of place is Emor? Can you see the ocean there, too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Favorability Cap|file_jp=vo_155_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれー？ウサギさんのほうからわたしにくっついてくるなんて…うふふ、めずらしいね♪|text_cn=嗯？今天角色对调了吗？还真是难得啊……|trans_en=Hello, little bunny. Are you cuddling up to me now? Hehehe... It's almost always the other way round! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Favorability Cap|file_jp=vo_155_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしたの？そんなことしても、わたしは宝の地図なんて持ってないよ？|text_cn=真可惜，我身上可没有藏宝图哦~|trans_en=What's the matter? You can do that all you like, but I don't have any treasure maps, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Hanging Out|file_jp=vo_155_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さっきから、ジーッとこっち見てるけど…悩み事？わたしでよければ相談のるよ？|text_cn=一直盯着我看，是有什么心事吗？|trans_en=You've been staring at me for ages. Is something the matter? I'm willing to listen, you know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Hanging Out|file_jp=vo_155_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=そっちがかまってくれないなら…こっちから仕掛けちゃうよー♪|text_cn=再不理我的话，我可要主动出击了哦~|trans_en=Well, if you're not going to give me any attention, I guess I'll have to make the first move! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Farewell|file_jp=vo_155_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_155_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして…目を開けたまま寝てるのかな？<br/>すごーい！そんなことができるなんて、魚みたいだね！|text_cn=你不会睁着眼睛睡着了吧？真有趣，像鱼一样呢……|trans_en=Don't tell me you're sleeping with your eyes open.<br/>That's amazing! I thought only fish could do that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Limited|file_jp=vo_story_155_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん|text_cn=很好。|trans_en=Yep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Limited|file_jp=vo_story_155_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=よかったぁ|text_cn=太好了。|trans_en=Great.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Limited|file_jp=vo_story_155_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしたちは、海に守られてるんだよー|text_cn=大海会庇佑我们。|trans_en=We're protected by the ocean, you know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Limited|file_jp=vo_story_155_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_155_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=夏っていいよねー♪|text_cn=夏天最棒了~|trans_en=Isn't summer great? ♪}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_156_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふわぁ～…お、また会ったね？今日も元気いっぱいだぁ…|text_cn=哦，又见面了？<br/>这一天天的，你可真有精神啊……|trans_en=Yaaawn... Oh, it's you again. Looking as energetic as ever...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_156_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ、どしたの？いまここでだったら、話きくよ？|text_cn=有事？如果是不用出门的那种，我可以考虑一下……|trans_en=Um? What's wrong? If it's here and now... I'm all ears.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_156_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふああ…あ、おはよ～。さて、あいさつもしたし…二度寝してこようかなぁ…<br/>魔王さんも、一緒にどう？|text_cn=早上好。招呼打完了，我回去继续歇着了……你也一起歇了吧。|trans_en=Yaawn... Hey, good morning. Now that I've said hello, I'm going back to sleep...<br/>Tyrant, wanna come with?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_156_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おなかすいた～…もう動けない～…<br/>そうだ！いまからご飯、食べにいこう！|text_cn=好饿……没力气……我们去吃饭吧。|trans_en=I'm so hungry I can hardly even move!<br/>Why don't we go grab something?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_156_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして、眠れないとか？なら、一緒に遊ぼうよ！よければ朝までつきあうからさ！|text_cn=睡不着的话，就一起玩个通宵！|trans_en=Can't sleep? Let's hang out! I'm good to go all night!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_156_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=真面目に生きるのって疲れない？<br/>適度に肩の力を抜くのも大事だし誰かと一緒にダラけるのもいいもんだよ|text_cn=人生就是又累又寂寞。所以才要学会忙里偷闲，要是能拉着别人一起“堕落”就更好了。|trans_en=Being serious all the time is tiring, isn't it?<br/>You've gotta loosen up sometimes, and it's more fun just slacking off with another person.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_156_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれあれ～？魔王さん、わたしに負けちゃうなんて体力なさすぎじゃない？<br/>ちゃんと鍛えとかなきゃダメじゃ～ん|text_cn=诶？不会吧，你这就不行了？体力竟然这么差……看来你得好好锻炼身体了。|trans_en=What's wrong, Tyrant? Lose to a girl like me? You've got zero stamina!<br/>You really need to work out more!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_156_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしかして…わたしにからかわれてよろこんでる？<br/>うわぁ…ごめん、わたしでもちょっと引いちゃうかも…|text_cn=难道你……喜欢被我捉弄的感觉？呜哇，真看不出来你是这种人。|trans_en=Wait a minute... You like it when I tease you, don't you?<br/>Sorry, that's a little cringe even for me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_156_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ、それって…わたしがあげたやつ？<br/>ちゃんと大事にしてたんだ…そっか、ふふん♪|text_cn=咦，那个是……我送你的礼物吗？<br/>看来你有好好保管呢~哼哼~|trans_en=Eh? Is that ... the one I gave you?<br/>You really did take good care of it... I see. Hehe ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_156_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんか忙しそうだけど…ちょっとくらいなら、のんびりしてもいいんじゃない？|text_cn=你还真忙碌呢，偶尔轻松一下如何？|trans_en=I know you're busy and all, but... You can relax a little sometimes, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_156_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=クレーンゲームにも飽きてきたし部屋に戻ってゴロゴロしよ～っと|text_cn=一直玩抓娃娃机也有点腻……这种时候就该回到房间，懒懒散散地躺一整天……|trans_en=I'm getting tired of these claw machines. I'll head back to my room and chill out.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_156_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者としてのスキルをどこで身につけたか？<br/>とくになにかしたわけじゃなくていろいろ経験してるうちに自然と身についたっていうか|text_cn=身为旅人的战斗技巧？那个啊，我从来没有专门学习过，都是摸爬滚打中领悟的。|trans_en=How did I get my Trekker skills?<br/>Nothing special. I just kinda picked them up by living life and doing things and stuff.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_156_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえ、知ってる？<br/>こう見えてわたし、フィーリエの最優秀巡遊者に選ばれたことがあるんだよね<br/>…まあ、わたしの力だけじゃなくカエデたちが協力してくれたおかげなんだけど|text_cn=别看我这样，我以前还当过菲莱本地的旅人之星哦。<br/>不过倒也不是全靠我自己……枫姐她们也帮了我很多就是了。|trans_en=Hey, did you know?<br/>Believe it or not, I was voted best Trekker in all of Philae.<br/>Well... I didn't do it all by myself, of course. Kaede and the others helped a bit, too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_156_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつまでも幸運に恵まれるとは限らないし…出会いは大切にしたほうがいいよね<br/>それで、いい縁はつかんだら離さないようにしなきゃ…ね！|text_cn=人不会一直幸运下去，所以遇到了好人好事，就得牢牢抓住才行。|trans_en=You can never just take good luck for granted, ya know? Connections are important.<br/>Once you find a good one, you have to hang on to it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_156_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=騙されるのって、いやになるよねわたし自身のこともそうだけど、友だちが騙されるのは特に、ね<br/>…周りがみんなお人よしすぎるせいで、苦労が絶えないってだけの話だよ|text_cn=我讨厌被欺骗，更讨厌朋友被欺骗……可惜身边的人都是些笨蛋滥好人，让人放心不下。<br/>唉，只能我来操这个心了。|trans_en=Getting fooled really gets old. Not just when it happens to me, but especially when it's my friends.<br/>Unfortunately, everyone I know is a sucker. I'm the only one keeping this ship from sinking.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_156_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつもいつもいろんな人のためにがんばって…なんていうか、本当に大変そうだね<br/>でも…そういうとこが魔王さんらしい気がするし…なんていうか、がんばってね♪|text_cn=每天为那么多人尽心尽力地奔波，你还真辛苦呢。<br/>不过……这样才像你嘛。你就继续加油吧！|trans_en=You're always, like, working so hard to ... like, help everyone and stuff.<br/>But that's just, like, who you are, I guess. So, like, keep up the good work and stuff! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_156_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また来たの？わたしなんかのとこに何度も来るなんて…もしかして、暇なの…？<br/>ああ、嫌とかそういうんじゃなくて…<br/>まあ、その…好きにすればいいんじゃない？|text_cn=你又来找我啦？难道你很闲吗……<br/>我没有嫌弃你的意思啦，你喜欢的话就来吧……我觉得也挺好的……|trans_en=Here to see me again? I guess you must be pretty bored or something...<br/>Oh, not that it bothers me or anything. <br/>I mean ... do whatever you want or whatever.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_156_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人生の目標？とくにはないかなぁ～<br/>ほら、わたしっていまを生きるタイプだからさ<br/>それに花咲旅団もあんたもいるし、それで十分だよ|text_cn=人生目标？我是个活在当下的人，从不考虑太远的事~<br/>现在有花令旅团，还有你在我身边，我已经很幸福了。|trans_en=My life's purpose? I don't really have one.<br/>I kinda just live in the now or whatever.<br/>Besides, my plate's pretty full with you and Petal Bloom and stuff.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_156_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さんって優しいから悪いやつに騙されないか心配なんだよね～<br/>ま、でもわたしが守ってあげるから、安心しなよ♪|text_cn=老是对人那么好，小心被坏家伙耍得团团转哦。<br/>不过现在有我看着你，就让我来为你操心吧！|trans_en=You're so nice that I worry about bad people taking advantage of you.<br/>But don't worry. I'm here to protect you from bad guys. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_156_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしには夢なんてないけどさ、あんたとずっと一緒にいるのは…悪くない…かも？<br/>だから、その…これからもわたしのそばにずっといてよね？<br/>だってあんたは、わたしが認めた魔王さんなんだから|text_cn=我是没有什么梦想啦……不过，如果能和你一起，感觉也挺不错的。<br/>你要一直罩着我哦，谁让你是我认可的魔王呢∼|trans_en=I don't have any dreams or whatever, but ending up with you might not be so bad.<br/>So, like ... stay by me so maybe I'll end up with you?<br/>After all, you are the one I've accepted.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_156_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ナツカってめんどくさい性格してるし、あんまりかかわらないほうがいいよ？<br/>え？いや、別にきらいとかじゃ…もしものときは、わたしがあいつを守ってやるし|text_cn=夏花那女人挺麻烦的，我劝你别被她牵扯进去哦。<br/>诶？也、也不是讨厌她……真是的，要是出了什么问题，还不是得靠我来帮她想办法……|trans_en=Nazuka is a pain to deal with and you should kinda stay away from her.<br/>Hm? No, I don't hate her or anything. I mean, I'd totally help her if she ever needed it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_156_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつの間にか…フユカも立派な巡遊者になっちゃって<br/>これもわたしみたいに、優秀な先輩が指導してるおかげかもね～<br/>って、ニヤニヤしてないでちゃんとつっこんでよ！|text_cn=不知不觉间，冬香也成长为厉害的旅人了。呵呵，这都是因为有我这么优秀的前辈在指导她吧！<br/>喂，你倒是说点什么啊……不要只是在那里笑！|trans_en=Wow, even Fuyuka is an excellent Trekker now.<br/>That's surely because she has excellent role models such as myself.<br/>Hey! Quit laughing! You're supposed to play along!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_156_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえ、魔王さん！？ホタルがシャロのぬいぐるみをいっぱい持ってるってホント！？<br/>ってことは…ホタルもクレーンゲームマスター…！？<br/>だとしたら…どっちのほうがうまいのか、白黒つけなきゃいけないね…！|text_cn=听说火垂有一屋子夏洛克玩偶，难道……<br/>她是抓娃娃的大神？！那就不得不一决高下了。|trans_en=Hey, Boss?! Is it true that Firefly has a bunch of Sherlock plushies?<br/>Is she a crane game master too?<br/>She and I are gonna have to have a showdown sometime...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_156_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=コハクは『森のクレーンマスター』ことわたしが認めた強者だからね<br/>特別に、いつでもわたしに挑戦できる権利をあげてもいいよ|text_cn=琥珀是得到娃娃机仙人认可的勇者。哼哼，我特别允许她随时向我发起挑战！|trans_en=I'm the one who declared Amber the powerful "Crane Master of the Forest."<br/>She's the only one qualified to challenge me at any time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_156_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵意志って、すごい人ばっかりいる場所だと思ってたんだけど…<br/>ラールみたいな人もいるんだね…？なんか、シンパシーを感じるっていうか…<br/>そんけーしちゃうかも|text_cn=没想到在恩赐意志那种精英汇聚的地方还能出现菈露这等人物，真是令人……令人尊敬。|trans_en=I used to think Grace Imperium only had the most amazing people in it...<br/>But then I found out about Laru... Gotta say, I feel a certain kind of sympathy ... or should I say respect for her.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_156_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう、さっきからなに？もしかして一緒に遊びたいの？|text_cn=有什么事？难道是想和我一起玩了？|trans_en=What is it you want? You trying to get my attention?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_156_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=はいはい、わかってるよ大丈夫、ちゃんと聞いてるって|text_cn=说吧说吧，我听着呢。|trans_en=Okay, okay! What is it? I'm listening.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_156_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王さ～ん？お～い？起きてる～？|text_cn=喂，你还醒着吗？|trans_en=Boss? Hello? You awake?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_156_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=むぅ…そこにいるなら、ちょっとは構ってくれてもいいじゃん…|text_cn=真不理我了？|trans_en=Boo... You'd think you could pay some attention to me once in a while...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_156_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねぇ？ねぇ？用がないなら、わたし、もう帰っちゃうよ？|text_cn=要是没事的话……我就先回去了？|trans_en=Hello? Hello? Okay, fine, then. I'll just go back to sleep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_156_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふわぁ…花咲旅団のナズナだよ。がんばるのはあんまり得意じゃないけど…<br/>魔王さんと一緒なら、ちょっとだけやる気、出してあげてもいいかな|text_cn=我是花令旅团的小禾。说实话，我不太擅长努力啦……<br/>但是跟你在一起的话，稍稍努力一下也不是不行……|trans_en=Yaawn... I'm Nazuna with Petal Bloom. I'm not great at working hard, but...<br/>I guess I can try a little as long as I'm with you, Boss.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_156_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、また会ったね魔王さん<br/>ああ、いいよいいよ、わたしのことはお構いなく。おたがいのんびりやってこうよ|text_cn=又见面啦……你先忙着，不用在意我。我们都放松一点就好啦。|trans_en=Hello again, Boss.<br/>Oh, no, no. Please don't worry about me. Let's both just take it easy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_156_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=力が湧いてきたかも？|text_cn=变强了呢。|trans_en=I guess I'm feeling stronger?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_156_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしなんかのためにがんばってくれちゃって…ふふん♪|text_cn=真亏你能在我这种人身上花心思……|trans_en=Thanks for always thinking of me or whatever... Hee hee! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_156_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ギルドのみんなが揃ってた頃も…あれはあれで楽しかったなぁ…|text_cn=大家在一起的日子可真快乐啊……|trans_en=Back when we had all the guild members together... That was a pretty fun time...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_156_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=音楽には詳しくないし…てきとーでいいんじゃない？|text_cn=真遗憾，我对音乐没什么研究|trans_en=I dunno much about music... Whatever's fine, I guess?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_156_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=シュババババッ！お～、なんか強くなった気がする|text_cn=咻咻咻！超绝厉害版小禾登场！|trans_en=Swish, swish, swish! Hoo, I feel a little stronger here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_156_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ばぁ～ッ！へへっ、どう？びっくりした？|text_cn=哇！嘿嘿，被吓到了吧~|trans_en=BOO! Hehe, did I scare ya?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_156_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=え、なに？そんなにジロジロ見ても…このぬいぐるみはあげないよ？|text_cn=什么啊，老是盯着我手上的娃娃看……<br/>就、就算你再喜欢，我也不会让给你的哦！|trans_en=Um, yes? Stare at it all you want... You're not getting this plushie.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_156_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたし、こう見えてけっこう忙しいんだよね～<br/>クレーンゲームをして、イタズラして、全力でゴロゴロして…<br/>え？星ノ塔についてきてほしい？…しょうがない。いいよ|text_cn=每天忙着抓娃娃，恶作剧，偷懒……我可是很忙的！<br/>啊？你想让我陪你爬塔？行……吧……|trans_en=I'm actually pretty busy, ya know?<br/>Between crane games, pulling pranks, hardcore chilling...<br/>You want me to go to the Monolith with you? Ugh. Okay. Fine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_156_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえ、一緒にあそばない？もし遊んでくれたら報酬は…<br/>あんたの良いところ、わたしが100コ言ってあげる♪|text_cn=快来，陪我玩会儿。你说报酬？真是的，我们之间还说这个……<br/>那，我这两天多说说你的好话，怎么样？|trans_en=Hey, wanna hang out? What's in it for you?<br/>I'll tell you 100 things I like about you! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_156_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？このぬいぐるみがほしいの？でもこれはわたしのお気に入りだからなぁ…<br/>そうだ！なら同じのを取ってあげるよ！そうすればわたしと…オソロだし♪|text_cn=看来你真的很喜欢我手上的娃娃呢。虽然我手上的不能给你，但是我可以再去帮你抓个一模一样的！<br/>这样……我们就有成对的娃娃了。|trans_en=Wait, you want this plushie? This is one of my favorites...<br/>I know! I'll get you one just like it! That way, we can be twinsies! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_156_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=え、もしかしてプレゼント？やったぁ、ありがとう！まあまあいいセンスだね！|text_cn=礼物啊，还挺可爱的~谢谢你。|trans_en=A present? For me? Yay! Thank you! Ooh, not too bad!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_156_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっ、これって…！このまえ欲しいって言ったやつ！？<br/>覚えててくれたんだ…！えへへ、なんか…うれしいね♪|text_cn=这不是我上次想要的那个嘛，没想到你那么关注我，嘿嘿，真让人害羞。|trans_en=Is this the one I was saying I wanted?!<br/>You remembered! Hehe, this is... kinda nice. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_156_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんないい物…もらっていいの？なにか下心とか…<br/>いやいや、疑ってないって…！ほんとにうれしいから…えっと…大切にするよ。ありがとっ♪|text_cn=这么好的东西就这样送我了？你、你该不会是对我另有图谋……<br/>咳咳，没有怀疑你！就是……哎呀我是很开心啦……<br/>我会好好珍惜的，谢谢你。|trans_en=Wow, this is seriously nice... Are you fishing for something here?<br/>No, I didn't mean it like that! I do really like it. Thanks so much. ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_156_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=そうだね～|text_cn=我知道。|trans_en=For sure.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_156_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=い～や～だ～|text_cn=不要啦！|trans_en=Nooope.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_156_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=是吗？|trans_en=Um?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_156_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=う～ん…|text_cn=呜……|trans_en=Mmm...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_156_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…|text_cn=我讨厌这样。|trans_en=Aw...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_156_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=むむっ…！|text_cn=哇哦！|trans_en=Oh!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_156_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=はあ！？|text_cn=开什么玩笑！|trans_en=Huh?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_156_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=んふふ～♪|text_cn=哼哼~|trans_en=Eehee hee!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_156_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=(Sigh)...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_156_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…はやく終わらせてクレーンゲームがしたいなぁ…|text_cn=啊~好想回去抓娃娃。|trans_en=(Sigh)... Let's get this over with so I can play some crane games.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_156_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふん♪こう見えて、見る目はあるほうだから|text_cn=哼，别小看我的眼力。|trans_en=Hee hee! ♪ I actually have a good eye for stuff.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_156_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=頭を使って、賢く生きないとね～|text_cn=开动脑筋，才能事半功倍~|trans_en=Gotta try to live smart or whatever.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_156_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=一緒に遊ばない？|text_cn=快陪我玩！|trans_en=Wanna hang out?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_156_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_156_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=そろそろのんびりしたいなぁ…|text_cn=该歇了该歇了……|trans_en=It's about time for a break...}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_156_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふん、びっくりさせてやるんだから！それ～！|text_cn=嘿嘿，送你们一个大惊喜！|trans_en=Haha! Here's a little surprise for you! Enjoy!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_156_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=いくよ！しっかりつかまって！おりゃ～！|text_cn=坐稳啦！我们去撞飞他们！|trans_en=Here goes! Hold on tight! Raagh!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_156_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっとやすませてぇ…|text_cn=我先休息会儿……|trans_en=I need a little break...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_156_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう無理ぃ…ばたり|text_cn=帮不了你啦，加油哦。|trans_en=I can't do any more...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_156_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こう見えても、結構がんばってるんだからね？|text_cn=我已经很努力啦！|trans_en=Despite how I look, I'm doing my best, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_156_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにこれ？もしかして、結構便利なやつ？|text_cn=欸……这力量好使吗？|trans_en=What's this? Might be pretty useful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_156_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっとやる気でた…かも？|text_cn=稍微有些干劲了……大概？|trans_en=Now I'm in the groove... Kinda.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_156_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=しかたない。ちょっぴり本気、出してあげるよ|text_cn=好吧，看在你的面子上。我就认真点。|trans_en=Oh, fine. I guess I can get a little serious.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_156_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=はいはい、いい感じにやっとけばいいんでしょ|text_cn=嗯嗯~知道了，用这个对吧。|trans_en=Okay, okay. I'll just vibe my way through it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_156_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたし、インドア派だからさぁ…もう動きたくないなぁ～？|text_cn=唉……我可是彻头彻尾的室内派啊……<br/>有点提不起干劲……|trans_en=I'm more of an indoor type, so yeah... I'd rather not...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_156_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえ、クレーンゲームしにいかない？|text_cn=走！去抓娃娃咯~|trans_en=Hey, wanna go play some crane games?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_156_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしとしては、自分の部屋にいるほうがいいけどなぁ|text_cn=还是待在家里最舒服。|trans_en=Personally, I prefer just hanging out at home...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_156_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=パパパッと片づけて、すぐ終らせたいよねぇ|text_cn=看我咻咻咻地收拾他们～早点搞定吧！|trans_en=Let's just hurry up and get this over with!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_156_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=不意打ちすれば、楽に星骸を倒せるんじゃない？|text_cn=偷袭星骸不算犯规吧？|trans_en=Wouldn't it be easier if we just sneak attack the Stellaroids?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_156_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんかやな感じ…帰っていいかなぁ？ええ、ダメなのぉ？|text_cn=我有种不好的预感……可以回去吗？<br/>诶……不行啊？|trans_en=Something feels off here... Can I go home? What? No?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_156_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにここ、初めてきたかも|text_cn=嗯嗯，这里还是第一次来呢。|trans_en=What is this place? I think this is my first time here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_156_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほしいものは…なんでもいいや。買い物は魔王さんに任せるよ|text_cn=你看着买吧，我都行。总之就交给你来决定啦~|trans_en=I'm good with pretty much whatever. I'll leave the shopping to you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_156_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やったぁ！休憩タイムだ～！|text_cn=终于可以歇啦！|trans_en=Yes! Time for a break!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_156_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうする？わたしはなんでもいいけど|text_cn=重要的选择就交给你了。|trans_en=What do you wanna do? I'm good with whatever.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_156_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=忘れ物ない？|text_cn=东西都拿好了吗？|trans_en=Got everything?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_156_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=だいじょぶ？誰もケガしてない？|text_cn=没人受伤吧？|trans_en=Is everyone okay? No one's hurt?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_156_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぅ…今日もがんばったぁ！|text_cn=我辛苦了！|trans_en=Phew... Good job, me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_156_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どう？見ててくれた？|text_cn=怎样怎样，我表现得不错吧？|trans_en=Didja see that?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_156_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=余裕余裕♪|text_cn=轻轻松松。|trans_en=Easy-peasy! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_156_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ま、まあこんなこともあるよ…あんまり気にしなくていいと思うな|text_cn=胜败乃兵家常事……呃，我的意思是，别气馁。|trans_en=This kind of thing happens... I don't think you need to worry about it much.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_156_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=だいじょぶだいじょぶ。次はきっと、うまくいくよ|text_cn=放宽心，总有下一次。|trans_en=You're fine, you're fine. You'll get 'em next time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_156_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わたしがいくのぉ…？|text_cn=真的要让我上场吗？|trans_en=What? Me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_156_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=はいはい、やりますよ～|text_cn=好好，我会帮你的。|trans_en=Yeah, yeah, I'll do it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_156_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=勝つためならなんでもやるよ|text_cn=为了胜利我什么都会做的哦~|trans_en=Whatever it takes to win.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_156_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=それじゃ、がんばってあげちゃいますか|text_cn=这份信赖可真沉重啊……|trans_en=Okay, I'll see what I can do.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_156_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_156_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほい、ハッピーバレンタイン。チョコ作ってみたから、もらってよ<br/>あんまりこういうの、得意じゃないから不格好かもだけど…がんばってみたからさ<br/>だから、絶対食べてみて<br/>あ、感想とかはいらないから！ホント、そういうのはだいじょぶだから！|text_cn=情人节快乐~喏，这是给你的巧克力。我、我不擅长做这种东西，但姑且还是做了一份……<br/>绝对要吃掉哦！要是难吃的话也不准告诉我！|trans_en=Happy Valentine's Day. Have this chocolate I made you.<br/>I'm not great at this kind of thing, so it's kind of awkward, but... Hey, I tried.<br/>So you better eat them.<br/>Oh, and no need to share your opinion! I'm all good on that, thanks!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_156_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うちのギルドでは、クリスマスは毎年、プレゼント交換、してるんだ<br/>それで…もしよければだけど…<br/>今日は地理セン、来てみない？魔王さんへのプレゼントも、用意、してるからさ|text_cn=每年的雪愿节，旅团的大家都会互相交换礼物。今晚你要来协会之家吗？我们给你也准备了礼物哦。|trans_en=My guild always does a Snowish gift exchange.<br/>So, uh ... you wanna come over to Trekkers' House today? There's a present or two waiting for you there.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_156_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、魔王さん！あけおめことよろ～！<br/>さて、あいさつも済んだことだし<br/>帰ってのんびり寝正月を過ごさせてもらっちゃいますか。…魔王さんも一緒に、どう？|text_cn=新年快乐，新的一年也请多多照顾咯。<br/>好，这样招呼就算打完了。外面太冷了，我打算回房间悠闲地度过一整天，你也一起来吧？|trans_en=Boss! Happy 'nother year or whatever!<br/>Okay, with that out of the way,<br/>I think I'll go home and enjoy a sleepy New Year. Wanna come with me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_156_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まあ…今日はわたしの誕生日なわけだけど…<br/>あんまり賑やかなのは…ちょっとね…<br/>みんなでのんびり気楽に過ごせるのが一番うれしいから、さ|text_cn=生日啊……<br/>太热闹的话反而有点不自在……大家随便聚一下就好，这样我就很开心啦。|trans_en=Today's my birthday or whatever...<br/>But I don't wanna make a big deal out of it, ya know?<br/>I'm actually good with everyone just relaxing and taking it easy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_156_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_156_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どりゃ～！ハッピーバースデー！<br/>今日は魔王さんの誕生日だからね<br/>しっかりパーティーの準備、しといたから！朝まで全力で遊び倒すよ！|text_cn=生日快乐！哼哼~做好觉悟吧！今天为你准备了超级厉害的派对哦！玩个通宵！|trans_en=Booyah! Happy birthday!<br/>Today's your special day!<br/>I planned a big bash for you! We're gonna party till you drop!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Half Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc156_HalfAnniversary_day05_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc156_HalfAnniversary_day05_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえねえ、魔王さん？フィーリエの近くに来ることがあったら、一緒にお茶でもどう？<br/>もちろんわたしも会いたいんだけど…ナツカがね。魔王さんに会いたいってうるさくて<br/>え、なにナツカ？迷惑かけたくないから、魔王さんに無理させないで？<br/>わかったわかった。聞いてのとおり、ナツカも会いたがってるから、前向きに検討してみてよ|text_cn=喂，魔王？你要是到了菲莱附近，就顺路来喝杯茶嘛？<br/>我嘛……就一般般想见你啦……主要是夏花她，老是吵着说想要见你。<br/>诶？怎么了夏花？不要太为难魔王会给他添麻烦？<br/>好好知道了知道了，你也听到了吧？夏花她可是超想见你的，你可得好好考虑一下哦~|trans_en=Hey, hey, Tyrant? If you ever come near Philae, how about having tea together?<br/>Of course, I want to see you too... But Nazuka keeps talking about how she wants to see you.<br/>Uh what, Nazuka? You don't wanna bother Tyrant too much? Okay, okay.<br/>As you heard, Nazuka wants to see you too, so think about it, okay?}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_157_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、えっと…また会うなんて、き、奇遇デスね！|text_cn=啊……！好，好巧呢，又碰到你了……|trans_en=Ah, um... Seeing you again... Wh-what a coincidence!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_157_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=まったく…あたしを待たせるなんて、いい度胸してるデスよ？|text_cn=怎么这么慢啊？我都已经等……咳，我都已经在这儿待好一会儿了。|trans_en=Seriously… Making me wait like that, you've got some nerve, don't you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_157_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっと起きたデスか？部屋の外まで寝言が聞こえてたデスよ|text_cn=终于醒啦？真是的，我在外面都听见你说梦话了。|trans_en=Did you finally wake up? I could hear you sleep-talking all the way outside the room.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_157_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あたしはお腹なんて減ってないデスけど…<br/>こんな時間だし？おまえ『は』お腹が減ってるかもしれないデスからね<br/>しかたないデスから、おいしいものを食べに連れてってやるデスよ|text_cn=我才没有饿到肚子叫呢……倒是你，现在这个时间肯定饿了吧。走，我带你去吃好吃的。|trans_en=Ah, I'm not hungry or anything, but...<br/>It's this late, right? YOU might be hungry, so...<br/>I guess there's no choice, I'll take you out for something delicious.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_157_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昼と夜じゃ、海辺で聞こえる音はぜんぜん違うデスよ<br/>波の音、虫の声、風の音…全部が心地よく混ざりあって…<br/>ほら、おまえもこっちに来て、耳を傾けてみるといいデスよ|text_cn=晚上海边的声音和平时不一样……浪声、虫鸣、风声，全都混在一起，你也来听听看？|trans_en=The sounds you hear by the sea are totally different during the day and at night.<br/>The sound of waves, the chirping of bugs, the rustling of the wind... They all mix together pleasantly...<br/>Here, come over and listen.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_157_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしは絶対に、すっごい航海巡遊者になってやるデス！<br/>目をかっぴらいて、よーく見てろデスよ♪|text_cn=我一定会成为超厉害的航海旅人！你就睁大眼睛好好看着吧！|trans_en=I will definitely become an amazing seafaring Trekker!<br/>Open your eyes wide and watch me closely!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_157_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=さっきからジロジロ…なんデスか？<br/>変なこと考えてるなら、通報するデスよ？|text_cn=干嘛一直盯着我看，果然是在想不好的事情对吧！|trans_en=You've been staring at me... What is it?<br/>If you're thinking anything weird, I'll get you warned!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_157_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こ、このかき氷は、いつも世話になってるお礼デス<br/>いいデスか？ただのお礼で、特別な意味なんてないデス！勘違いするなデスよ！？|text_cn=这个.....只是感谢你平时对我的照顾而已，绝对没有别的意思！你可别误会哦！|trans_en=Th-This shaved ice is just a thank-you for all your help.<br/>Got it? It's just a thank-you with no special meaning! Don't get the wrong idea, okay!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_157_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=なっ…！？このかき氷を『あ～ん』で食べさせてほしい…！？<br/>お、おまえ…！調子に乗るのもたいがいにするデスよ！|text_cn=哈？！居然还想让我喂你？！你、你不要得寸进尺！|trans_en=Wha...? You want me to feed you this shaved ice!?<br/>Y-You...! There's a limit to what you can get away with!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_157_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=リアクションがいちいち大げさすぎる？失礼なやつデスね…いいデスか？<br/>あたしには、おまえに聞こえない微かな音も聞こえてるんデスよ|text_cn=说我一惊一乍？真失礼啊！我那是听见了你听不见的动静！|trans_en=My reactions are too exaggerated? How rude... You know what?<br/>I can hear even the faintest sounds that you can't hear.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_157_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=また来た…おまえ、あたしと話す以外にすることないんデスか？<br/>言っとくデスけど、あたしはおまえと違って暇じゃないんデスよ<br/>…で、今日はなにを話しに来たデスか？|text_cn=你怎么又来了……算了，反正你总是这样。先说好，我可不是每次都有空陪你闲聊。<br/>……说吧，这次想聊什么？|trans_en=You again... Don't you have anything to do besides chatting with me?<br/>Just so you know, I'm not a slacker like you.<br/>... So, what did you come to talk about today?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_157_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぎゃ！？お、おい、ひとの耳元でしゃべるなデスよ！あたし、耳は敏感なんデスから…<br/>今度やったら、樽に詰めて塩漬けにしてやるデスよ！|text_cn=呀！不准贴着我耳边说话！我耳朵很敏感的……<br/>你、你再这样，我就把你塞进咸鱼桶里！|trans_en=Gyah! H-Hey, don't talk right next to people's ears! My ears are sensitive, you know...<br/>Next time you do it, I'll stuff you in a barrel and pickle you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_157_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたし、ラジオを聞くのが好きなんデスよ<br/>はじめはなにも聞こえなくても、チューニングをいじると、段々と音が聞こえてきて…<br/>その感覚が、フタを開けるまでは中身がわからない漂流瓶みたいでおもしろいんデス|text_cn=我喜欢听收音机。虽然开始全是杂音，但调着调着，忽然就冒出一个清楚的声音……<br/>就像漂流瓶一样，打开前根本猜不到里面是什么。|trans_en=I like listening to the radio.<br/>Even though you can't hear anything at first, when you tweak the tuning, the sound gradually becomes clear...<br/>That feeling is fun, like a message in a bottle where you don't know what's inside until you open it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_157_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=料理の腕はお姉ちゃんに敵わないデスけど、釣りの腕ならあたしが上デス！|text_cn=我跟你说哦，虽然我的厨艺比不上希娅，但要论捕鱼，还是我更占上风哦~|trans_en=I can't beat sis at cooking, but when it comes to fishing, I'm better!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_157_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=木々を揺らす風の音、遠くから聞こえる波の音…<br/>いつもと変わらないはずなのに、不思議と癒されるときがあるデス|text_cn=有时候，明明只是很普通的一天，可风声、潮声，还有远处传来的海浪声要是刚好听着舒服，心情也会变得轻松起来。|trans_en=The sound of the wind rustling through the trees, the sound of waves from afar...<br/>Even though they are the same as always, there are times when it's strangely soothing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_157_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしは知らないやつの相手をするのに慣れてないってだけで、人見知りじゃないデス<br/>あ…べ、別におまえを知らない人って言ってるわけじゃないデスからね！？|text_cn=我才不是怕生！只是不习惯应付陌生的家伙……但你已经算是我习惯应付的那种了。<br/>啊……我、我可没说你是陌生人啊！|trans_en=I'm just not used to dealing with people I don't know, it's not that I'm shy or anything.<br/>Ah, I-I'm not saying you're a stranger to me, okay!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_157_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誰よりもすごい航海巡遊者だったおばあちゃんに憧れて、あたしはお姉ちゃんの家を訪ねたデスよ<br/>でもそのときにはもう、おばあちゃんはいなくて…<br/>それ以来、お姉ちゃんはあたしの面倒を見ながら、ずっとそばにいてくれたデス<br/>だからあたしにとって、お姉ちゃんはとっても大切な家族なんデス|text_cn=希娅的奶奶以前是最厉害的航海旅人，我就是憧憬着那个人，才跑到这里来的。可是……我还是来晚了一步。<br/>后来，希娅一直照顾我、陪伴我。所以现在，她已经是我最重要的家人了。|trans_en=I looked up to my grandmother, who was the greatest seafaring Trekker of all, so I went to visit sis's home.<br/>But by that time, grandmother was already gone...<br/>Ever since, sis has been by my side taking care of me.<br/>So, to me, my sis is very important to me, we're like a family.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_157_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつか必ず、ノヴァ大陸で2番目にすごい航海巡遊者になるデスよ<br/>1番すごいのは誰かって？それはもちろんお姉ちゃんデス<br/>もしおまえにその気があるなら…3番目にすごい航海巡遊者に育ててやってもいいデスよ？|text_cn=我会成为全大陆第二厉害的航海旅人。嗯？第一名当然是希娅了。<br/>至于你嘛……你要是也有这个志向，我可以把你培养成第三厉害的航海旅人哦。|trans_en=Someday, I'll definitely become the second most amazing seafaring Trekker in Nova.<br/>Who's the best, you ask? Of course it's my sis.<br/>If you're up for it...I can train you to become the third. What do you say?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_157_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おまえもラジオが好きデスか？<br/>もし興味あるなら、特別にあたしのコレクションを見せてやってもいいデスよ？<br/>ただし、誰にでも見せてるわけじゃないデスからね。感謝するデス<br/>あと、見に来るからには、徹底的に解説してやるデスからねよそ見したら…許さないデス|text_cn=你也会喜欢收音机吗？感兴趣的话，我可以破例让你来参观我的收藏哦~<br/>先说好，不是谁都有这个资格的。你要是真的来了，就得把它们仔仔细细从里到外好好参观一遍哦……<br/>要是敢分心的话，我是不会原谅你的。|trans_en=You like radios too?<br/>If you're interested, I can show you my collection, as a special treat!<br/>I don't show it to just anyone, so be grateful.<br/>Also, since you're coming to see it, I'll be giving you a thorough introduction. If you don't pay attention... I won't forgive you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_157_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=聞いた話だと、ウサギはキチンとかまってあげないと、元気がなくなるらしいデス<br/>なっ…！？か、勘違いするなデスよ！<br/>あたしは一般的なウサギの話をしてるだけで、別にかまってほしいわけじゃないデス！|text_cn=我听说……兔子要是总被晾在一边，就会变得很没精神。<br/>你、你不要乱想，我不是在说我自己！只是顺口提一下而已……|trans_en=I heard that if you don't give rabbits enough attention, they'll lose their energy.<br/>Wha...!? D-Don't get it wrong!<br/>I'm just talking about rabbits in general! It's not like I want your attention!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_157_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お姉ちゃんは世界でいちばんやさしくて、きれいで、あたしの憧れの人デスよ！<br/>だからもしあたしの前で、お姉ちゃんの悪口を言ってるやつがいたら…<br/>誰であろうと、思いっきり海に蹴り落として魚の餌にしてやるデス！|text_cn=希娅是世界上最好的人！要是有人敢在我面前说她的坏话，我一定会狠狠把他踹进海里喂鱼！|trans_en=My sis is the kindest, prettiest person in the world, and I look up to her!<br/>If anyone ever talks bad about her in front of me...<br/>No matter who it is, I'll kick them into the sea and make them fish food!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_157_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前、またお姉ちゃんと一緒にステラキネマを観たデス<br/>海に沈んだ世界で、生き残った人たちが限られた資源を奪い合う内容だったデスけど…<br/>ステラキネマを観てるときのお姉ちゃんは…なんだか不安そうな顔をしてたデスよ|text_cn=前不久和希娅又看了一场影戏，是全世界都被海洋覆盖，人们争夺有限资源的故事，不知道为什么，她看的时候，表情有些严肃。|trans_en=Recently, I watched a Stella Drama with sis again.<br/>It was about survivors in a world submerged by the sea fighting over limited resources...<br/>When sis was watching the Stella Drama... She had a kind of worried look on her face.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_157_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=地理協会の人が、ものすっごく大きな船を造ろうとしてるらしいデスね？<br/>デ・ス・が！航海で重要なのは経験であって、船の大きさじゃないデスよ！|text_cn=我知道那个人，据说她打算在地理协会的总部造一艘很大很大的船。<br/>哼，听上去是挺了不起啦……出海比的是经验，又不是大小。|trans_en=I heard that someone from the Trekker Association is building a really huge ship?<br/>HOWEVER! What matters for sailing is experience, not the size of the ship!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_157_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=小さい頃、魔女たちは箒に乗って好きな場所に飛んで行けると思ってたデスよ<br/>でもお姉ちゃんの話だと、魔女でも入れない海域があるらしくて<br/>フフン！そんなときこそ、あたしたち航海巡遊者の出番ってわけデス！|text_cn=以前我以为魔女们总是想去哪就去哪，但希娅和我说，有些海域就连魔女也飞不进去。<br/>嗯~这种时候就需要我们航海旅人了吧！|trans_en=When I was little, I thought witches could just get on their brooms and fly wherever they wanted.<br/>But according to sis, there are regions of the sea that even witches can't go.<br/>Ha ha! That's exactly where seafaring Trekkers like us come in!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_157_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=この前、町に買い物に行ったら、大道芸をやってる人がいたデスよ<br/>フローラっていう、有名なマジシャンらしくて<br/>青い炎のチョウチョをたくさん出してて、すっごくきれいだったデスよ♪|text_cn=有次我去镇上买东西，刚好撞上了一场演出……表演的人好像是个很有名的魔术师，叫紫槿。<br/>她变出了好多冒着蓝色火焰的蝴蝶，真漂亮啊！|trans_en=Recently, when I went to town for shopping, I saw someone performing street magic.<br/>I believe she was a famous magician named Flora.<br/>She made so many butterflies with blue flame appear. It was really beautiful ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_157_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おまえ、馴れ馴れしいデスよ！<br/>あ、いや…ちょっと驚いただけで、別に嫌ってわけじゃないデスけど…|text_cn=你、你靠这么近做什么！我没说讨厌……只是太挤了而已！|trans_en=Hey! You're being too familiar!<br/>Oh, uh...I was just a little surprised. It's not that I don't like it...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_157_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ああもう！やめるデス！<br/>いい加減にしないと怒るデスよ…|text_cn=不、不准戳我！不然我要生气了……|trans_en=Ah, I swear! Stop it!<br/>If you don't cut it out, I'll get angry...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_157_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=な、なんで急に無視するデスか…|text_cn=怎么突然不理人了啊……|trans_en=Wh-Why do you ignore me suddenly...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_157_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしたデスか？悩みがあるなら、相談に乗ってやってもいいデスよ？|text_cn=你要是有什么心事，可、可以跟我说哦……|trans_en=What's wrong? If you have any worries, I don't mind going over them with you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_157_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おい…なにしてるデスか？こんなところで寝たら、風邪引くデスよ？|text_cn=喂——真是的，在这里睡觉会感冒哦——|trans_en=Hey... What are you doing? If you sleep here, you'll catch a cold, you know?}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_157_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしはカリン。いつか歴史に名を残す航海巡遊者になる者デス<br/>小さいからって、見くびらないことデスよ！|text_cn=我是花铃。先说好，我总有一天会成为名垂青史的航海旅人！不准因为我个子小就小看我哦！|trans_en=I am Karin. Someday I will become a seafaring Trekker whose name goes down in history.<br/>Don't underestimate me just because I'm small!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_157_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=またあたしに会いに来たデスか？フン…いちおう見る目はあるみたいデスね<br/>しょうがないから、もう1回だけ付き合ってやるデスよ|text_cn=又来找我了？哼，算你还有眼光……我就再帮你一次吧。|trans_en=You're here to see me again? Hmph... It seems at least you have good eyes.<br/>Alright, I guess I'll put up with you just one more time.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_157_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おまえの期待に応えてみせるデスよ！|text_cn=谢谢……我可不会让你白费功夫的。|trans_en=I won't let you down, you'll see!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_157_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここまであたしと真剣に向き合ってくれるなんて…おまえ、相当なもの好きデスよ|text_cn=竟然这么用心地培养我……你还真是个怪人。|trans_en=You're actually taking me seriously this far... You're quite the eccentric, aren't you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_157_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=えへへ、やっぱり海は最高デスね♪|text_cn=嘿嘿~大海是最棒的！|trans_en=Hehehe, the sea really is the best ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_157_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい音デスけど…何回も聞いてたら、そのうち飽きちゃいそうデス|text_cn=很好听呢~不过，听多了也有点腻。|trans_en=It's a nice sound, but... If I hear it so many times, I guess I'll eventually get tired of it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_157_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまのあたしには、海の声がハッキリ聞こえるデスよ！|text_cn=浪潮的声音，我听得一清二楚！|trans_en=I can hear the voice of the sea loud and clear now!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_157_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=な、なにひとのことをじろじろ見てやがるデスか？<br/>早くしないと、せっかくのかき氷が溶けちゃうデスよ…？|text_cn=别一直盯着我看……快吃，再不吃冰沙都要化了。|trans_en=Wh-What the hell are you staring at me for?<br/>If you don't hurry, the shaved ice will melt...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_157_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おまえのことは、いちおう認めてやるデスけど…<br/>変なことをしないか、常に見張ってるデスからね調子に乗らないことデスよ！|text_cn=就算暂时认可你了，我也还是会继续盯着你的……别得意忘形哦！|trans_en=I'll acknowledge you for now, but...<br/>I'll be watching out to make sure you don't do weird things and stuff. Don't get too comfortable!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_157_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまに挙動不審なときはあるデスけど…<br/>もしおまえが本当にアブナイやつなら、そろそろボロを出しててもおかしくないはず…<br/>もしかして、おまえってそんなに悪いやつじゃないんデスか？|text_cn=你这家伙，虽然还是有时候看着怪可疑的……不过，我都盯你这么久了，真要有问题，早就该发现了。就是……你这个人……还不赖啦。|trans_en=You do act a little suspicious sometimes, but...<br/>If you really were a dangerous person, it wouldn't be surprising if you'd started slipping up by now…<br/>Could it be that you're not a bad person after all?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_157_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、あたしの心臓がドキドキしてる音が聞こえた…！？<br/>バ、バカ言うなデスよ…！だいたい、あたしはおまえより耳がいいデスからね！<br/>本当にドキドキしてる音が聞こえるなら、真っ先にあたしが気づいてるはずデス…！|text_cn=听见了我的心跳声？怎、怎么可能啊！我耳朵这么灵，要是真有，我、我早就听见了。|trans_en=Y-You could hear the sound of my heart pounding...!?<br/>D-Don't be ridiculous…!Besides, my hearing is better than yours!<br/>If my heart is really pounding that hard, I'd be the first one to notice...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_157_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おい、おまえ。なんでそんなに遠くにいるデスか？<br/>そんなところにいたら、もしものとき守ってあげられないじゃないデスか…<br/>だから…ほら、もうちょっとこっちに来るデスよ。も、もっと…デス…|text_cn=你站那么远干嘛？要是真出了什么事，我都来不及护着你……再过来一点啊。<br/>嗯……还、还要再近一点。|trans_en=Hey, you. Why are you so far away?<br/>If you stay over there, I can't protect you if anything happens...<br/>So... Come on, get a little closer. C-Closer...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_157_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=急にやさしくしてくるなんて、なにか企んでるんじゃ…違う？なら…ありがとう、デス…|text_cn=怎、怎么突然这么好心，你有什么企图吗？没有？那就……谢啦……|trans_en=Being so nice all of a sudden... You must be up to something... No? Well... Thank you...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_157_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ、えっと…ありがとう、デス<br/>それじゃ、お返しにタラバガニの割引券をあげるデスよ。これで貸し借りなしデスからね？|text_cn=谢谢……我拿珍藏的帝王蟹优惠券和你换，这样就不算白拿你的了！|trans_en=Oh, um... Thanks.<br/>Well, I'll give you a discount coupon for king crab in return. This makes us even, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_157_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こ、これ…！ホントにくれるデスか！？でも、なにをお返しすれば…|text_cn=这真的是给我的吗！？呜呜……这下我要怎么还礼啊……|trans_en=Th-This...! Are you really giving this to me? But... What can I give you in return...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_157_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん|text_cn=嗯！|trans_en=Yep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_157_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=いやデス|text_cn=不对不对！|trans_en=Nope.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_157_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？|text_cn=什么？|trans_en=Huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_157_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=え～……|text_cn=啊……？|trans_en=Whaaat...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_157_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ……|text_cn=呜呜呜……|trans_en=Ughh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_157_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=おおっ！|text_cn=真的吗！？|trans_en=Whoa!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_157_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=ぶっ飛ばされたいデスか？|text_cn=小心我踢你！|trans_en=Do you want to get your butt kicked?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_157_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=やったデス！|text_cn=太好啦~！|trans_en=Yes!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_157_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ……|text_cn=哎——|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_157_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=おまえ…なにかよからぬことを考えてないデスか？|text_cn=你该不会是在打坏主意吧？|trans_en=You ... aren't thinking of something naughty, are you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_157_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=こっちで物音が聞こえたデス！|text_cn=有动静！在这边！|trans_en=I heard a noise over here!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_157_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=海を大切にしないやつは、成敗してやるデス！|text_cn=破坏大海的家伙，绝不原谅！|trans_en=I'll punish anyone who doesn't treat the sea well!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_157_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=出航の準備はできたデスか？|text_cn=出海的准备做好了吗？|trans_en=Are you ready to set sail?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_157_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_157_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ぐずぐずしてないで、さっさと行くデスよ！|text_cn=没时间磨蹭了，快走吧！|trans_en=Stop dawdling and let's get going!}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_157_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあサメ大将、いくデスよ！|text_cn=鲨老大，到你登场啦！|trans_en=Here comes Boss Shark!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_157_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=深海の覇者のお出ましデス！|text_cn=深海霸王，强势来袭！哇——|trans_en=Here comes the ruler of the deep sea!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_157_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ごめん、デスよ……|text_cn=呜……对不起……|trans_en=I'm ... sorry...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_157_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=音が…遠くなる、デス…|text_cn=什么都听不到了……|trans_en=The sound ... is fading away...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_157_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=慣れるまで、ちょっと待つデスよ……！|text_cn=等一下！让我适应一下！|trans_en=Give me a moment to get used to it...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_157_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしの実力、見せてやるデス|text_cn=这下轮到我大显身手了吧~|trans_en=I'll show you my true power!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_157_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=本気を出したあたしは、誰にも止められないデスよ！|text_cn=我认真起来可是超级不好惹的！|trans_en=When I get serious, no one can stop me!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_157_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ケチくさいデスね。もうひとつくらいよこせデスよ|text_cn=这么厉害……再给我一个也不过分吧？|trans_en=You're pretty stingy. Give me at least one more.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_157_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=聴力には自信があるデスからね、見張りはあたしに任せるデスよ|text_cn=我耳朵很灵的，警戒就交给我吧。|trans_en=I'm confident in my hearing, so leave the lookout to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_157_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしならできる、あたしなら…よし、行くデスよ！|text_cn=我可以的，我可以的……好，冲呀！|trans_en=I can do it, I can... Okay, let's go!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_157_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=向こうから音が聞こえたデス。しっかりついてくるデスよ|text_cn=我听到动静了……走这边~|trans_en=I heard a sound from over there. Stay close to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_157_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ボサッとしてないで、さっさと片づけて帰るデスよ|text_cn=别发呆啦，早点解决早点回去！|trans_en=Don't just stand there. Let's clean them up quickly and go home.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_157_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=サメ大将に目をつけられたが最後おまえたちはおしまいデス！|text_cn=你完了，鲨老大已经盯上你了！|trans_en=Once Boss Shark sets eyes on you, you guys are finished!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_157_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=怖くない、怖くない…ヒイイッ！？なんの音デスか！？|text_cn=冷静，冷静……噫！什么动静！？|trans_en=I'm not scared, I'm not scared... Eek! What's that sound?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_157_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんだか不気味な雰囲気デスよ…お、おまえ、あたしから離れるなデス。いいデスね？|text_cn=总觉得这里怪怪的……你、你可别离我太远。|trans_en=It's kind of creepy here... Y-You, stay close to me. Got it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_157_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんデスか、ここは…？べ、別に怖がってるわけじゃないデスからね！|text_cn=好陌生的环境……啊，我、我可没有在害怕！这种地方没什么大不了的！|trans_en=What is this place...? I-It's not like I'm scared or anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_157_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=品定めはあたしがやるデスから、おまえはステラコインを出すだけでいいデスよ|text_cn=比价的事我来，你负责掏辉光币就好！|trans_en=I'll do the appraisal, so you just bring out the Stella Coins.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_157_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=塔の探索でも航海でも、ときには体を休めることも大切デスよ！|text_cn=出海前的休息是很重要的！|trans_en=Whether it's Monolith exploration or sailing, it's important to take a break every now and then!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_157_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしは知ってるデスよ。こういうときは、決まってなにか起きるものなんデス…|text_cn=这种时候……通常都不会只是聊聊天那么简单吧？|trans_en=I can see where this is going. At times like this, something always happens...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_157_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっと静かになったデスね♪|text_cn=可算安静了~|trans_en=It's finally quiet ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_157_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=魚を捕まえるのと同じくらい簡単デスね|text_cn=也没比追鱼难多少嘛。|trans_en=It's just as easy as catching fish, isn't it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_157_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ケガはないデスか？べ、別に心配してるわけじゃないデス！|text_cn=没受伤吧？……我、我就是随口问问！|trans_en=Are you injured? I-It's not like I'm worried or anything!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_157_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしにかかれば楽勝デス！|text_cn=看吧~我就说我超厉害的！|trans_en=With me handling it, it's a piece of cake!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_157_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=か、勝ったデス…！ハッ……！？こ、これも想定どおりデスよ！|text_cn=赢、赢啦！咳，我是说，这本来就在预料之中！|trans_en=W-We won...!Ah...! Th-This was all part of the plan!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_157_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…納得いかないデス…|text_cn=呜……我不服气……|trans_en=Ugh... I can't accept this...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_157_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=次はうまくやるデスよ…|text_cn=下次不会这样了……|trans_en=Next time, I'll do well...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_157_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしを選ぶとは、見る目あるデスよ|text_cn=要我帮忙？那你可算找对人了！|trans_en=Picking me? You've got good eyes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_157_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=手伝ってほしい？仕方ないデスね|text_cn=需要我的力量？好吧~|trans_en=Want me to help? I guess I have no choice.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_157_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=邪魔なやつは追っ払ってやるデス|text_cn=快点把吵闹的家伙都赶跑吧！哼~|trans_en=I'll chase away anyone in my way.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_157_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほら、行くなら早く行くデスよ|text_cn=要出发就快一点，走吧！|trans_en=Hey, if you're coming, just hurry up.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_157_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_157_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日はバレンタインってことで、あたしが作っ――<br/>じゃなくて、何時間もかけて選んだチョコデスからね。よく味わって食べるデスよ|text_cn=给你这个，今天是那个节日对吧，这是我做……挑了几个小时才选中的甜品，你就心怀感激地吃掉吧。|trans_en=Today is Valentine's, so I made—<br/>I mean, I spent hours selecting this chocolate. Be sure to savor every bite!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_157_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=雪が降った日は、銀色に染まった砂浜が見られるデスよ<br/>でも冬の海辺はすっごく寒いデスから、興味本位で見に行ったら風邪引くデス<br/>どうしても見に行きたいなら…あたしを連れて行くといいデス<br/>その…お互いが風よけになるだけでも、多少寒さもマシになるはずデス|text_cn=下雪的时候，有机会看见银色的沙滩……<br/>啊，你可不要一时好奇就去看哦，海边那么冷，真要去的话也得带上我才行。<br/>我、我的意思是，人多好有个照应……|trans_en=On snowy days, you can see the beach dyed in silver white.<br/>But the seaside in winter is freezing, so if you go just out of curiosity, you can catch a cold.<br/>If you really want to see it... You should take me with you.<br/>Um... Even if we only have each other for windbreak, it should make the cold a little more bearable.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_157_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとうデス！ってなにのんびりしてるデスか？初日の出を見に海に行くデスよ！|text_cn=新年快乐！今天就不要赖床啦！我们一起去海边看日出吧！|trans_en=Happy New Year! Come on, quit dawdling! Let's go to the beach to watch the first sunrise of the year!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_157_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？おまえ、あたしの誕生日を知ってたデスか？<br/>ふーん…そ、そうデスか。<br/>だったらちょうど『魚のすり身ケーキ』ができたところデスから…<br/>よかったら、おまえもあたしと一緒にケーキ食べるデスか？|text_cn=我的生日……？啊，谢，谢谢……那个……<br/>正好小黄鱼蛋糕已经准备好了，我刚刚……本来就去找你问你要不要一起吃的。|trans_en=Huh? You knew it was my birthday?<br/>Hmm... I-I see.<br/>Well, I just finished making a fish paste cake, so...<br/>If you'd like, shall we eat it together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_157_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_157_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あいつ、いったいどこに行きやがったデスか…？<br/>これじゃあまるで、あたしがあいつの誕生日をお祝いしたくて待ってるみたいじゃないデスか…<br/>って、いるならいると早く言えデスよ！まったく…！<br/>えっと、だから…その…た、誕生日…おめでとう、デス…|text_cn=怎么还不来啊……我在这里等这么久了，会不会太奇怪了？要是被发现我是特地等……<br/>啊！你、你什么时候出现的？<br/>生生生日快乐！|trans_en=Where on earth did she go...?<br/>This makes it look like I'm just standing here waiting to celebrate her birthday...<br/>Hey! If you were there, you should've said so sooner! Urgh!<br/>Um, so... Yeah... H-Happy ... birthday...}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_158_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなに晴れた日は、静かな場所でサボるに限る！トーゼンでしょ？|text_cn=如此阳光明媚的一天，就应该找个安静的地方摸鱼，你说是吧？|trans_en=On a day this sunny, there's nothing better than slacking off somewhere quiet! Obviously, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_158_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふぁ～プレゼントの準備に夢中でうっかり徹夜しちゃった…|text_cn=哈啊——昨晚光顾着准备礼物，一不小心就通宵了……|trans_en=Yaawn... I got so into working on your present that I forgot to sleep.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_158_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよう。奇遇だねーせっかくだしさ、一緒にソリで出かけない？|text_cn=早啊，既然这么有缘，那就跟我一起乘着雪橇去兜风吧！|trans_en=Morning, fancy seeing you here. Might as well go sledding together, huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_158_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お昼は焼き魚にしない？これ、今朝寒い中釣った魚でさ<br/>新鮮で脂がのってて、ゼッタイおいしいから！<br/>えっ？仕事の合間に釣っただけだし、サボった範疇に入らなくない？|text_cn=午饭吃烤鱼吗？这可是我一大早冒着寒风钓上来的，鲜嫩肥美……<br/>呃，工作的间隙去钓一下鱼，怎么能算翘班呢？|trans_en=How about grilled fish for lunch? This is the fish I caught this morning in the cold.<br/>It's super fresh and fatty, so it'll be absolutely delicious!<br/>Huh? No, I caught it during my break! How is that even slacking off?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_158_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王っち～今夜も釣り行かない？|text_cn=今晚也跟我一起去夜钓呗~|trans_en=Hey, Tyrant! Wanna go fishing again tonight?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_158_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしてこんな衣装着てるのか？カンパニーの指示だからだよ。別に着たくて着てないっての…|text_cn=为什么要穿成这样？唉，这都是恩赐意志的要求，我也没有乐在其中……|trans_en=Why am I wearing this? Company rules. I'm not wearing it because I want to...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_158_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=プレゼントが欲しいの？なら期待しててよ<br/>ラール様が厳選したプレゼントで、必ず満足させるからさ！|text_cn=你也想要礼物？哼哼，那就好好期待一下吧~菈露严选，包你满意！|trans_en=Want a present? Well, get ready for it!<br/>A gift carefully selected by Queen Laru will delight you for sure!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_158_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王っちのおかげで最悪のクリスマスは回避できたよ|text_cn=呜呜……还好有你在，不然我就要度过一个糟糕的雪愿节了……|trans_en=Thanks to you, Tyrant, I managed to avoid the worst Snowish Festival ever.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_158_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほーら、ラールさんからの…てかラールさんがプレゼントだよ<br/>まさかとは思うけど…受け取り拒否とかしないよね？<br/>てか受け取り拒否されたら、魔王っちに捨てられたってみんなの前で泣くからね？|text_cn=继续在礼物盒里呆着……我岂不真成礼物了？<br/>喂，你不会要拒收吧！要是拒收的话，我就要哭诉你狠心把我抛弃了哦……呜呜。|trans_en=Here's a present from Lady Laru... No, Laru IS the present.<br/>Of course... You don't intend to turn this present down, do you?<br/>I mean, if you do, I'll cry in front of everyone about you abandoning me, so...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_158_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=凍った湖で釣りしたことある？氷に穴開けて、テント張って、炭火のコンロもあると快適だよね<br/>あっ、でも炭使うときは、煙吸ってうっかり窒息しないようにね<br/>釣りのプロからのありがた～いお言葉でした|text_cn=你试过在结冰的湖面上钓鱼吗？<br/>在冰面上凿个洞，支起帐篷，点上炭炉，就可以舒舒服服地钓鱼了。<br/>啊不过，烧炭的话记得通风，不然容易闷晕过去……哼哼，这可是专业人士的专业建议。|trans_en=Ever done frozen lake fishing? You drill a hole and set up a tent and a charcoal grill... It's the best.<br/>Of course, be sure to properly ventilate that charcoal smoke.<br/>That piece of professional fishing advice is on the house.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_158_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=冬は温かいブドウジュースとフライドポテトに焼き魚…<br/>ぷっはぁ～！最高の組み合わせだよね～|text_cn=冬天就适合来一杯葡萄热饮，再配上薯条和烤鱼……真是极致享受~|trans_en=Warm grape juice, fried potatoes, and grilled fish...<br/>Mmm! Nothing like it to beat the cold!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_158_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=年末忙しいのは諦めてるけど、サボるときはちゃんとサボらないと<br/>凍った湖で釣りなんてこの時期にしかできないからね！|text_cn=一到年末事情就变多了，这也没办法。不过该摸的鱼还是要摸……<br/>等湖面冻结实了，就去冰钓吧！这可是季节限定啊！|trans_en=I know the end of the year is always busy, but I take my slacking off seriously.<br/>It's the only time of year I can do frozen lake fishing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_158_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=いつもサボ活を応援してくれるお礼に、ラールさん厳選ツリーをプレゼントするよ<br/>大きさなら保障する…え？車に入らない？屋根に載せれば解決じゃん♪|text_cn=为了感谢你们平日对我摸鱼大业的支持，我决定送一棵菈露精选雪愿树给你们，保证超级巨大！<br/>啊？车里塞不下？那就放在车顶上嘛~|trans_en=As a thank you for always supporting my slack-life, accept this Snowish Festival tree personally selected by Lady Laru!<br/>I can vouch for the size. Eh? It won't fit in your car? So put it on the roof! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_158_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=そういえば…魔王っちはさ、クリスマスプレゼントでほしいものあったりする？<br/>あ！えっと！これはね、単純に…というかついでに…なんとなく聞いてるだけで……<br/>別に情報収集とかじゃないから！|text_cn=啊，说起来……你雪愿节想收点什么礼物吗？<br/>呃……我只是，嗯，顺便……随口……问问而已……才没有在打探情报哦！|trans_en=Come to think of it... Tyrant, anything you want for Snowish presents?<br/>Ah! Um! Well, this is just... I mean, kind of... I'm just asking out of curiosity...<br/>I'm not gathering information or anything like that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_158_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=はあぁ～～～～……魔王っち、この数日、あたしがなにしてたと思う？<br/>どんだけプレゼントのラッピングしたことか…もうリボンなんて見たくない|text_cn=哎，你都不知道这几天我是怎么过的，根本数不清自己打包了多少份礼物。<br/>我已经不想再看到礼物盒了……|trans_en=Sigh... Wanna know what I've been up to the past few days, Tyrant?<br/>I've been wrapping so many presents I never want to see any ribbon again!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_158_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ねえ魔王っちー、来年の冬もさ、例のプレゼント配りの業務委託、受けてみる気ない？<br/>そっちは労働の喜びを知る担当で、あたしはずっとそばで、魔王っちの仕事を監視する担当<br/>どうどう？聞いてるだけで、なんかワクワクしてこない？|text_cn=欸，你要不要考虑一下，明年冬天把派礼物的活都承包了？<br/>你度过了一段有意义的时光~我也能正大光明地摸鱼~这可是双赢啊！|trans_en=Hey, Tyrant! Wanna try that gift-delivery gig next winter?<br/>You'll get to experience the joy of labor, while I'll be right by your side, monitoring your work.<br/>Just the thought of it is exciting, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_158_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=純白の雪は恩恵の神からのご褒美なんだって。清らかな心で信仰してくれてありがとうって<br/>ちょっとありふれた話だけど、キレイな銀世界を見ちゃったら、特別な贈り物ってのは納得かもね|text_cn=有种说法，说雪之所以这么洁白，是因为它是神明送给虔诚信徒们的奖励……<br/>虽然听起来有点老套，但看这漫天铺开的银白，还真像是份特别的礼物。你觉得呢？|trans_en=They say pure white snow is a gift from the God of Grace, as if they're saying thanks for our pure faith.<br/>I know that may sound silly, but seeing the beautiful silver world, I kind of understand why people think it's a gift.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_158_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プレゼントに足がついてたら最高なのに～！そしたら次のクリスマスは楽できるし！<br/>祈願箱にお願いしたら実現したり…え？こういうのダメ？|text_cn=你说，如果礼物有脚，那该多好~以后的雪愿节，只要我一声令下，礼物们就会乖乖走到它们该去的地方。<br/>那我岂不是不用再干活了……下次我就这么去和星塔许愿吧！欸，不行吗？|trans_en=Would it be great if presents had legs? Next Snowish Festival would be sooo easy!<br/>If I make a wish in the wishing box, maybe it'll come true... Huh? That kind of thing's not allowed?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_158_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この服が変だからって、そんなじろじろ見なくても……<br/>え？鞭が気になる？魔王っち、まさかそういう癖？|text_cn=我知道这身衣服很奇怪啦，但你也不用一直盯着看吧……<br/>啊？在看我手上的鞭子？你难道是有什么癖好……？|trans_en=I know this outfit's weird, but do you have to stare?<br/>Hm? What about my whip? Wait a minute... You're into that?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_158_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=子供の夢は大事な宝物なのよあたしも、昔のあの魔女みたいにその宝物を守ってきたいの|text_cn=孩子们的梦和幻想是很珍贵的宝物，如果我也能像当年的那个魔女一样，守护这份宝物就好了。|trans_en=Children's dreams are precious treasures. I want to protect them just like that witch did a long time ago.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_158_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=配達の仕事やって思ったけど、やっぱりプロは違うわ<br/>フリージアって、ひとりでもあたしたちの2倍、プレゼント配っちゃうんだってさ|text_cn=送货上门这种工作还是信使旅人在行啊，听说光是苍兰，雪愿节当天派出去的礼物就是我们的两倍……|trans_en=Doing delivery work made me appreciate the pros.<br/>I heard Freesia can deliver twice as many presents as both of us combined all by herself!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_158_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=コゼットは、クリスマスツリーの精霊を本気で信じてるみたいでさ<br/>この前も、ツリーの下で、願い事してるのを見かけたよ。次こそ絶対魔王を捕まえる…って<br/>魔王っちってば、コゼットになにしたの？誰にも言わないから、こっそりあたしに話してごらん？|text_cn=说起来，珂赛特对雪愿树精灵的存在深信不疑，前不久我还看到她在树下许愿，说什么下次一定要成功绑架你~<br/>你和珂赛特之间到底发生了什么？你就偷偷告诉我吧，我保证不说出去！|trans_en=Cosette really believes in the Snowish Tree Spirit.<br/>I even saw her wishing under a tree the other day. Her wish was to catch you next time no matter what...<br/>So, what did you do to her? I promise not to tell anyone, so just secretly tell me about it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_158_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王っち、チケット余ってるんだけど、フローラのクリスマスショーに興味ない？<br/>もし興味あるなら、一緒に行ってもいいかな…って。まさか、断らないよね？|text_cn=紫槿的雪愿节演出还是挺有趣的，你有空吗？我这里刚好还有两张票……要不我们去瞅瞅？<br/>你不可能忍心拒绝我的，对吧！|trans_en=I've got an extra ticket to Flora's Snowish Festival show. You interested, Tyrant?<br/>I was thinking maybe we could go together... Of course, you won't say no, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_158_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=アヤメにクッソでっかい氷の像を作ってもらったらさ、今年のクリスマスは盛り上がるんじゃね？<br/>魔王っちとしてはどう？なかなかおもしろいアイディアだと思わない？|text_cn=雪愿节到了，让鸢尾造个超级无敌大冰雕，给大家都开开眼？<br/>你觉得怎么样，我这个提案是不是很有新意？|trans_en=What if we get Iris to make a freaking huge ice sculpture? That'll make this year's Snowish Festival a blast!<br/>What do you think, Tyrant? Pretty good idea, huh?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_158_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=去年のクリスマスはウィローが釣り具の神器を用意してくれて。でももらうには条件があってさ…<br/>地理協会主催のクリスマス演劇会に、役者として参加することだったんだよ<br/>あの日はプライドを捨てて、神器のために身も心もトナカイになりきってたよ|text_cn=你知道吗，去年雪愿节薇洛给我准备了一份“大礼”，说她淘到了一款新的渔具神器要送给我。<br/>但地理协会的雪愿节话剧演出正好缺了个人，让我去当替补……<br/>那一天，我舍弃了尊严。为了高级的渔具，不管是身体还是内心都完完全全成为了驯鹿的模样。|trans_en=Last Snowish Festival, Willow got me some fishing gear Artifacts, but there was a catch...<br/>I had to perform in the Trekker Association's Snowish Festival play.<br/>That day, I swallowed my pride for those gears and became the best reindeer—body and soul.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_158_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=帽子の角？ただの飾りだよ|text_cn=帽子上的鹿角只是装饰啦。|trans_en=The horns on my hat? They're just for decoration.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_158_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=必死になってどしたの？あ、鞭で引っ叩いてほしいとか？|text_cn=怎么？你也想试试鞭子的滋味？|trans_en=Why are you acting so desperate? Oh, want me to smack you with the whip or something?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_158_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=急ぎの用もないみたいだし、仕事サボって、凍った池で釣りしない？|text_cn=好闲啊……要不干脆翘个班……去冰钓吧。|trans_en=It doesn't look like you have any urgent business, so how about skipping work and going frozen lake fishing?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_158_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ、寝ちゃった？じゃあプレゼントは靴下に入れとくから|text_cn=睡着啦？那礼物我就给你放袜子里咯……|trans_en=Oh, did you fall asleep? Well then, I'll just slip this gift in your sock.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_158_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=眠すぎ…もう無理…まぶたが重すぎる…<br/>残りは明日のあたしに任せ、た……ガクッ|text_cn=好困……眼皮都在打架了，工作就留给明天的自己吧……|trans_en=So sleepy... I can't... keep my eyes open...<br/>I'll leave the rest to the tomorrow me... Zzz...}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_158_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=恩恵意志のスーパーエリート、ラール様がプレゼントをお届け♪<br/>あ、衣装への突っ込みは受け付けてないから|text_cn=感到荣幸吧！在你面前的可是恩赐意志的精英——菈露大人！<br/>……你那是什么表情？这只是恩赐意志发的雪愿节制服！|trans_en=Almighty Queen Laru of Grace Imperium presents you with a gift♪<br/>Ah, and I'm not interested in comments about the outfit.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_158_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また会ったね！一緒にプレゼント配りに行っちゃう？|text_cn=又见面啦，要跟我一起去发礼物吗？|trans_en=We meet again! Wanna go hand out presents together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_158_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=能力が上がったんだし、これで給料上げてくんないかなー？|text_cn=不错不错，这样一来领导就会通过我的调薪申请了！呃……会的吧？|trans_en=Now that my abilities have improved, I wonder if they could raise my salary with this?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_158_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんだけ能力上がれば、さすがに給料も上がるでしょ？<br/>上がんなかったら…ポテトヤケ食いするか…|text_cn=这下总该给我涨工资了吧！没有的话我就……就……唉，就整点薯条把自己哄好算了……|trans_en=With this many improved skills, they've got to raise my pay.<br/>If they don't... I'll stress-eat fries...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_158_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいじゃん！クリスマスプレゼントを開けるときに流したら、盛り上がりそうだね！|text_cn=不错嘛，雪愿节礼物送达时就该播这个！|trans_en=Nice! Playing it while opening Snowish Festival presents would be a ton of fun!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_158_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いいね、これ。今度聴きながら釣りしよーっと|text_cn=不赖嘛，下次钓鱼就放这首吧。|trans_en=This is nice. I'll listen to it while I fish.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_158_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=プレゼントが空から降ってくるとかさ、これ以上のサプライズなんてなくない？|text_cn=礼物从天而降，这还不算惊喜吗？|trans_en=Could there be any better surprise than presents falling from the sky?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_158_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれ……あたし、いつの間に寝ちゃったんだろ？|text_cn=唔……我怎么睡着了？|trans_en=Hm? When did I fall asleep?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_158_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おっ、ちょうどいいところに！いま企画書まとめてるんだけどさ<br/>『大砲を用いたプレゼント配送計画』ってタイトルでどう？<br/>もしこれが実用化されれば、来年のクリスマスは、プレゼントが街中を飛び交うことになるよ|text_cn=你来得正好，我有个大项目要跟你聊聊，请看——论用大炮发射礼物的可行性方案！<br/>怎么样？只要我们能把这玩意儿做出来，明年的雪愿节礼物就会像炮弹一样从天而降，是不是很厉害~|trans_en=Oh, perfect timing! I'm putting a proposal together right now.<br/>What do you think of the title "Operation: Gift Delivery By Cannon"?<br/>If we can make this happen, there'll be presents flying all over town next year!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_158_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=前に話した、大砲を使ったプレゼントの配送方法だけど、早速試作品ができたらしいんだ<br/>衝撃吸収カプセルにプレゼントを入れて、それを大砲にセット。あとは魔力を注げば…<br/>あっ、ヤッバ…！爆発しそう！魔王っち、逃げて！早く！|text_cn=上次我跟你说过的那个礼物大炮，还记得吗？我找人帮我做了出来。<br/>你看，只要像这样把礼物塞进去，然后注入一点魔法……<br/>呃，不对，它要爆炸了！快跑啊！！！|trans_en=Remember that idea I had to deliver gifts by cannon? Looks like the prototype is ready!<br/>You put the present in a shock-resistant capsule and load it into the cannon, then just add a little bit of magic...<br/>Ah! Oh, no! It's gonna explode! Run, Tyrant! Run!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_158_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=見て見て。改良版の大砲が完成したんだー♪<br/>記念すべき一発目は、魔王っちに送りたいから…ってなんで逃げてんの？<br/>ダイジョブだって。今度は爆発したりしないから。そんじゃいくよー？<br/>3、2、1…発射ぁ！！ってあれ？爆発どころか今度は撃てない？|text_cn=快来，我的改良版无敌礼物大炮做出来了……我想把它发射出来的第一份礼物送给你！<br/>你跑什么？放心啦，我已经测试过好几次了，这次绝对不会有意外的——<br/>三、二、一，发射——<br/>奇怪，怎么哑火了？|trans_en=Hey, look! The redesigned cannon is ready! ♪<br/>I wanna send you a gift with our inaugural shot... Huh? Why are you running away?<br/>You worry too much! It's not gonna explode this time! Okay, ready?<br/>3, 2, 1... FIRE! What? This time it won't even shoot...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_158_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=例の大砲だけど、なんていうか…やっぱプレゼントって、手渡しが一番じゃねって思ったんだよね<br/>それに魔王っちと一緒なら、プレゼント配りはちっとも退屈しないっていうか…<br/>もちろん付き合ってくれるよね？付き合ってくれるでしょ？<br/>てなわけで、次のクリスマスも頼りにしてるからよろしくねー♪|text_cn=礼物大炮的开发进度……啊哈哈哈，你不觉得礼物这种东西，亲手送到对方手里才更有意义吗？<br/>反正明年你也会跟我一起对吧，就算没有那种东西，只要有你帮忙就轻轻松松啦~<br/>嗯？你会来的对吧……说好了哦！|trans_en=So, uh, about the cannon... I just realized that presents really should be delivered by hand.<br/>Besides, it won't be boring as long as I get to do it with you...<br/>Of course, you're up for it, right? You ARE up for it, right?<br/>So! I'm counting on you next Snowish Festival, too. Okay?♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_158_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=へ～なかなか実用的でいいじゃん。ありがとねー|text_cn=嗯？这个还挺实用的，谢谢啦~|trans_en=Oh, this looks pretty useful. Thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_158_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わ～お！サンキュー、魔王っち！<br/>これ、ずっとほしいと思ってたやつじゃん！よく知ってたね？|text_cn=哇，你也太了解我了吧！你怎么知道我最近想买这个？！|trans_en=Wow! Thank you, Tyrant!<br/>I always wanted one of these! How did you know?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_158_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いえ～い、いっただきー！もうこれ、あたしがもらったかんね？<br/>あとで返してって言われても返さないかんね？|text_cn=这、这个真的是给我的？真的真的吗？！之后要是后悔了我也不会还给你哦！！|trans_en=Yeah! I-I'll take it! This is all mine, right?<br/>No takesie-backsies later, cause I'm not giving it back!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_158_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=オッケー|text_cn=好咧~|trans_en=Okay!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_158_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=やだ|text_cn=算了吧……|trans_en=No.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_158_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=うん？|text_cn=嗯？|trans_en=Hm?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_158_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=これって…|text_cn=这是……？|trans_en=This is...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_158_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=なんであたしがぁ～…|text_cn=我也不想……|trans_en=Why me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_158_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=おおっ！|text_cn=哦！|trans_en=Whoa!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_158_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=腹立つな|text_cn=气死我了！|trans_en=That makes me mad!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_158_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=悪くないね|text_cn=很不错嘛！|trans_en=Not bad!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_158_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_158_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=寒い日に食べるフライドポテトは格別だよね～|text_cn=天气冷了，更应该来根热乎的薯条~|trans_en=Fried potatoes on a cold day are just on another level.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_158_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしにとって、サボりってのはある種のライフワークなのさ|text_cn=上班摸鱼是一种人生信仰，你迟早会懂的。|trans_en=I consider slacking off well a kind of life achievement.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_158_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=雪が止んだら釣りに行くぞ～～！|text_cn=等雪停了就去钓鱼吧！|trans_en=Once this snow stops, I'm going fishing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_158_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=クリスマスツリーに願い事をすると、精霊がプレゼントを運んできてくれるらしいよ|text_cn=据说向雪愿树精灵许愿，就能得到想要的礼物哦~|trans_en=I heard if you wish upon a Snowish tree, the Spirit will bring you a gift.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_158_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_158_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラールさんを信じなって。<br/>クリスマスツリーの精霊が、幸せを運んできてくれるのは本当だからさ|text_cn=雪愿树精灵会给你好运的，我保证。|trans_en=You can trust Lady Laru!<br/>It's a fact that the Snowish Tree Spirit brings happiness.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_158_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラール様からのプレゼントだよ！受け取りな！|text_cn=就让你欣赏菈露大人的，特别射击！|trans_en=It's a present from Queen Laru! Take it!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_158_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=クリスマスの使者からプレゼント！バーン！|text_cn=雪愿节使者给你送大礼了！邦！|trans_en=A present from the Snowish Festival Messenger! Boom!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_158_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなはずじゃ……|text_cn=不该是这样啊……|trans_en=This can't be...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_158_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラール、早退しまーす…|text_cn=提前……下班了……|trans_en=Laru's cutting out early...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_158_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力があれば、大砲でプレゼントを発射できちゃうかも！|text_cn=这力量，下次能用大炮发射礼物了吧！|trans_en=With this power, I might even be able to shoot presents from a cannon!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_158_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=おお！暖炉の火みたいに燃えてきたー！|text_cn=哦！像壁炉的火一样躁动！|trans_en=Woo! I'm getting fired up like a bonfire!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_158_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=有能になると責任が……まあ、今日は張り切りますか|text_cn=能力越大，责任……好吧，今天我会努力干活的。|trans_en=With abilities comes responsibility... Well, I'll see what I can do today.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_158_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=子供の幸せのためなら、喜んで手伝うよ～|text_cn=只要能给孩子们带去快乐，我还是很乐于帮忙的~|trans_en=I'll do anything to make the kids happy~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_158_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=プレゼント、届けにきたよ！|text_cn=喔！人人有份的礼物！|trans_en=Your present has arrived!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_158_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=は、ハクション！寒…この塔どっかに穴開いてんじゃないの？|text_cn=阿、阿嚏——！好冷……这座塔是不是哪里漏风了啊……|trans_en=A-Achoo! It's so cold. There must be a crack somewhere in this Monolith.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_158_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=パパっと終わらせて、クリスマスのステラキネマ見よ～っと|text_cn=早点完成，晚上还能去看雪愿节的特别节目~|trans_en=I'm gonna knock this work out and go see a Snowish Festival Stella Drama~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_158_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと聞いてよ！昨日釣りしてたらさ、見たことない大物がかかったんだけど…<br/>あとちょっとってところで、糸が切れて、逃げられちゃったんだよねー<br/>あーあ、もし釣り上げてたら、魔王っちにも証拠の写真送ったのになー？<br/>いやホントだから！|text_cn=我跟你说，你知道我昨天没钓上来的那条鱼有多大吗？要不是我线断了，我早就拍照群发给所有人了！|trans_en=Hey, listen to this! Yesterday I had a fish bigger than I've ever seen on the hook...<br/>I ALMOST had it reeled in, but then my line broke and it got away.<br/>Ah—I wish I could've caught it so I could send you a pic! I'm not joking!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_158_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=帰ったらさ、ご褒美にプレゼントちょうだい？|text_cn=等回去之后，你可要给我一份礼物犒劳我~|trans_en=When we get back, can I have a present as a reward?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_158_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=禁ポテトしてから、もう3時間なんだけど～…ヤバ、体の震えが止まらないんですけど…|text_cn=我已经戒薯条三小时了，再不来一根可就没法工作了。|trans_en=It's been three hours since I quit fries... Oh no... My whole body's shaking like crazy...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_158_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この程度の塔であたしの力を試そうなんて…あまいあまい|text_cn=想验证我的实力？天真，这种程度可难不倒我！|trans_en=Trying to test my power with a mediocre Monolith like this... How naive.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_158_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=しゃーない。いっちょやったりますかー|text_cn=又来？好啦好啦，我这就打起精神……|trans_en=Okay, fine. Let's get this over with.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_158_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=は？このコンビニ、クリスマスセールないの！？マジ！？|text_cn=这里竟然没有雪愿节大促销……难以置信！|trans_en=What? This shop doesn't even have a Snowish Festival sale? Seriously?!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_158_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=一旦フライドポテトで一服しますか～|text_cn=来根薯条，放松一下~|trans_en=Time for a little fried potato break~}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_158_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=面倒な仕事はイヤだからね？|text_cn=不会有什么麻烦事吧？|trans_en=I don't like tedious work, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_158_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい楽勝～日報書くより余裕だね|text_cn=轻轻松松~比写日报简单多了。|trans_en=Easy peasy. A lot easier than writing a daily report.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_158_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=クリスマスの使者、参上！ってね♪|text_cn=雪愿节使者来帮忙了。|trans_en=The Snowish Festival Messenger has arrived ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_158_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラール様に任せれば、オールオッケー間違いなし♪|text_cn=交给菈露大人，自然是万无一失~|trans_en=Leave it all to Queen Laru, and all will be fine! ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_158_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やっぱラール様、天才っしょ！|text_cn=看来菈露大人还是一如既往的优秀~|trans_en=Told ya Queen Laru was a genius!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_158_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=よーっし、定時で退勤だー！|text_cn=收工！下班！|trans_en=Good! Clocking out right on time!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_158_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こんなの、聞いてないんだけど…|text_cn=欸……？这不对吧？|trans_en=No one told me anything about this...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_158_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヤッバ…減給だけは勘弁して…|text_cn=完、完蛋了，要扣工资了……|trans_en=Yikes... I hope they don't dock my pay...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_158_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたし？他に人いないの？|text_cn=我吗？没其他人选了吗？|trans_en=Me? Can't someone else do it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_158_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが終わったら退勤していい？|text_cn=这是今天最后的工作了吧？|trans_en=Can I clock out after this?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_158_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=プレゼント持ってきたぞー|text_cn=礼物来咯！|trans_en=I brought you a present!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_158_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=絶・対、残業しないからね！|text_cn=说好了，绝不加班！|trans_en=I'll die before I do overtime, got it?}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_158_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よーすたー|text_cn=YO——STAR——|trans_en=YO——STAR——}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_158_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔王っちはチョコジャムつけるなら魚のフライ派？それとも焼き魚派？<br/>あ、いちおう質問はしたけど、どっちも食べてもらうから、あとで感想聞かせてねー|text_cn=提问！你是想要炸鱼蘸巧克力，还是想要烤鱼蘸巧克力？<br/>嗯？鱼可是我今天亲自钓的，无论如何你今天都要跟我一起吃上~|trans_en=Tyrant, do you like chocolate jam with fried fish? Or grilled fish?<br/>I thought I'd at least ask, but I'll have you try both anyway, so let me know what you think!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_158_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あたしに願掛けしてみない？クリスマスの奇跡が起こって、願いが叶うかもしれないよ？|text_cn=要不要试着对我许愿？只要对着雪愿树精灵许愿，愿望就会实现哦？|trans_en=Why don't you make a wish to me? A Snowish miracle might happen, and your wish just might come true!}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_158_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あっけおめ～！<br/>とっておきの釣り場に案内するからさ、新年くらい、ふたりでのんびりしようよ？|text_cn=新年快乐！来，我带你去个秘密钓点一起欢度新年~|trans_en=Happy New Year!<br/>I'll take you to my secret fishing spot. At least for the New Year, let's just relax together, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_158_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日は誕生日だし、自分へのご褒美ってことで、仕事休んで釣りに行っちゃおっかな～♪|text_cn=既然今天是我生日，那就奖励自己今天放假一天~走，我们去钓鱼~|trans_en=It's my birthday today, so as a little treat for myself, I think I'll take the day off work and go fishing~♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_158_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_158_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昨夜、クリスマスツリーの精霊があたしんところにきて――「届けてほしいものがある」<br/>そう言って、これを置いてったんだ。てなわけで、誕生日おめでとー！|text_cn=昨晚有精灵说，有份礼物今天一定要送到某个人手里，所以~<br/>锵锵！生日快乐~|trans_en=Last night, the Snowish Tree Spirit came to me—"There's something I want delivered." <br/>It said that and left this behind. So, here ya go! Happy birthday!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas 2025|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day01_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day01_cn.ogg|text_jp=この時期に食べたいものと言えばもちろん！<br/>お刺身だよね～！とくにサーモンなんか、色合い的にもぴったりでさいこ～！<br/>てことで！おいしいお魚をゲットするためにも！一緒に釣りに行こうぜ、魔王っち！|text_cn=说到跟雪愿节相称的食物——那当然就是生鱼片啦！<br/>尤其是红纹鱼刺身，不管是色泽还是口味都和这个节日十分相配！<br/>鱼，果然还是得现钓现吃啊。走，我们去钓鱼吧！|trans_en=When it comes to what I want to eat at this time of year, of course it's...! Fish sashimi!<br/>Salmon, especially, has the perfect color and is the best!<br/>So! To get some delicious fish, let's go fishing together, Tyrant!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas 2025|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day02_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day02_cn.ogg|text_jp=お、魔王っちじゃ～ん！たのしんでるぅ～？<br/>あたしは…見ればわかるっしょ！<br/>うまいことおサボりして、いい感じにクリスマスシーズンを満喫させてもらっちゃってま～す♪|text_cn=你来了啊！玩的开心吗？<br/>我？那还用说！我正在猛猛摸鱼，悠闲自在地享受着雪愿节呢！|trans_en=Oh, if it isn't Tyrant!Having fun?<br/>As for me... you can tell by looking, right? I finessed some slacking off and I'm really enjoying the Snowish Festival season!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas 2025|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day03_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day03_cn.ogg|text_jp=お゙ぉ～…さむさむ…あ、魔王っち！ちょうどいいとこに！<br/>ちょっと手、貸して！…はぁ～、あったか♪<br/>いま海釣りから帰ってきたとこでね、手も足も全身冷えっ冷えで…人肌であったまりたくて…ふふ♪|text_cn=嘶、嘶……好冷好冷啊……啊！你来的正好！<br/>来，把手借我暖暖！……啊~活过来了~！<br/>我刚钓鱼回来，现在手脚冰凉浑身发抖……真想有人来温暖一下我这楚楚可怜的美少女~|trans_en=Brrr... It's so cold...Oh, Tyrant! Perfect timing!<br/>Give me your hand!...Ah, it's so warm ♪<br/>I just got back from fishing, and my hands, feet, and whole body are freezing...I want to warm up with someone's body warmth... Hehe ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas 2025|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day04_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day04_cn.ogg|text_jp=へ、へ…！へくちゅ…！ゔぅ～…さすがにこの格好、ずっとしてると冷えてくるなぁ…<br/>って、うぉ…っ！？魔王っち！？いつからそこに！？<br/>もしかして、さっきのくしゃみ、聞いてた？あはは…なんか恥ずかしいな…|text_cn=啊、啊……阿嚏……呜……这衣服也太薄了……冷死我了……<br/>诶？哇啊！你在那儿待多久了？<br/>你不会听到我刚刚那个喷嚏了吧！啊哈哈……能就当没听到吗！|trans_en=Ah, ah... Ah-choo!Brr... This outfit does get cold after wearing it for a while...<br/>Uh, huh...? Tyrant?!Since when have you been there?!<br/>Did you ... hear the sneeze just now? Hahaha... That's kind of embarrassing...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas 2025|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day05_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc158_Xmas25_day05_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん？どしたの魔王っち？仕事納めは大丈夫なのかって？<br/>あはは、あたしがそのへん抜かるわけないじゃん！完ぺきに終わらせといたよ！<br/>…………え？上司から怒りの言伝を預かってきた？マ？|text_cn=嗯？怎么啦？你问我年底收尾工作有没有问题？<br/>啊哈哈，说什么呢？我当然是一丝不苟、严丝合缝、毫无破绽、完美无缺地做完啦！<br/>诶？领导要你跟我说她要发飙了？真的假的？|trans_en=Hm? What's wrong, Tyrant?You want to know if I finished up work for the year?<br/>Hahaha, there's no way I would mess that up! I got everything done perfectly!<br/>...Huh?You got an angry message from my boss? Serious?}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_159_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=顔色がいいね。やっぱり適度な休みが必要だということかな|text_cn=你的气色不错，看来，人果然还是需要假期。|trans_en=You look well. I guess it shows proper rest really is necessary.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_159_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=疲れているなら薬膳茶を淹れてあげよう<br/>滋養強壮に効く即効性のあるやつを…ね|text_cn=感到疲倦吗？这是我做的“药膳”，想必能让你打起精神。|trans_en=If you're tired, I'll make you some medicinal tea.<br/>A fast-acting and invigorating one...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_159_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=爆竹の音で起こされた？フフ、奇遇だね。私もなんだよ|text_cn=被窗外的爆竹声吵醒了？呵呵，我也是。|trans_en=Were you awakened by the firecracker noise? Hehe, what a coincidence. Me too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_159_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=蒼梧城は面白い街だね<br/>珍しいものも多いし、昼のマーケットなんて人の活気があふれていて楽しいよ|text_cn=苍梧城真是座有趣的城邦……从午市的喧闹里，能感受到别样的生活气息。|trans_en=Cangwu is an interesting city.<br/>There are a lot of rare things, and the daytime market is bustling with energy and fun.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_159_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=月は煌々と澄みわたり、風は颯々と吹きわたる……蒼梧の夜は実に趣があるね|text_cn=月白风清，苍梧的夜晚别有一番风味。|trans_en=The moon shines bright and clear, the wind blows crisp and brisk... The night in Cangwu is truly charming.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_159_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この子はね、蒼梧城で見つけた「最高の収穫」なんだ<br/>ここまで綺麗にするためにずいぶん手間暇かけたものさ|text_cn=这孩子是我来苍梧后遇到的最大的惊喜，为了把它处理得像现在这么漂亮，我可是花了不少心思。|trans_en=This little one is the best pick I found in Cangwu.<br/>I put a lot of time and effort into making it this beautiful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_159_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=蒼梧城で新年の挨拶を教わったよえーっと…新年快薬新年も良い薬に巡り合えるように<br/>…って、あれ？何か間違えたかな？いい挨拶だと思ったんだけど|text_cn=我在苍梧学了几句据说适合这个时候的问候语，咳咳……<br/>祝您新年新气象，事事顺心万事如意，福如东海寿比南山……<br/>嗯？怎么露出这种表情？我有哪里说的不对吗？|trans_en=I learned a New Year's greeting in Cangwu. Umm... New year, good medicine. May you find good medicine in the new year.<br/>...Hm? Did I make a mistake? I thought it was a good greeting.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_159_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=疲れたのかい？それなら…おいで<br/>キミは大事な被検体だからね…体のすみずみまで丁寧に癒してあげるよ|text_cn=累了吗？过来，我们一起休息会儿吧。作为我珍贵的实验体，我会疼爱你身体的每一处哦。|trans_en=Are you tired? If so... Come here.<br/>You're an important test subject, so... I'll take care of every single part of your body.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_159_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミ、また腕を上げた？毎回こんなに気持ちよくさせられたら…<br/>フフ…もしかして私をキミなしじゃいられない体にしたいのかな？…なんてね|text_cn=你的技术又进步了，竟然能让我这么舒服……嗯~是想要让我变得离不开你吗？|trans_en=Your skill's improved, hasn't it? If you make me feel this good every time...<br/>Heh... Could it be you want to make it ... so I can't live without you ... or what?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_159_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=祭りで街がいつもより賑やかだ。浮ついて目が冴えてしまうときは私の新作の薬を試してみるといい<br/>赤ん坊のようにぐっすり眠れるよ…フフ|text_cn=节日里比平时热闹得多，偶尔也会让人觉得不习惯吧？<br/>如果适应不了的话，可以试试我最近新研制出来的药剂，想必会让你获得如婴儿般的睡眠……呵呵。|trans_en=The city is livelier than usual because of the festival. If you're restless and can't sleep, you should try my new medicine.<br/>You'll sleep soundly like a baby... Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_159_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この注射器、小籠包という龍族料理にも向いているらしい<br/>こうやって具を皮に注入して…はい、できた。食べたら元気がわいてくるはずだよ|text_cn=我的注射器，似乎很适合用来制作一种叫做“灌汤包”的龙裔美食。<br/>像这样，把药剂注射进包子里……给，这是我亲手制作的灌汤包，吃下去就能精力充沛哦。|trans_en=It seems this syringe is also suitable for the Loong dish called xiao long bao.<br/>Just inject the filling into the dough like this... Yes, it's ready. Eating it should give you a boost of energy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_159_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=この衣装、なかなかいいだろう？龍族のデザインをベースに私好みにアレンジしてみたんだ<br/>スリットが入って動きやすいし、暴れる「患者」を相手するのにちょうどいいんだよね…フフ|text_cn=这身衣服还不错吧。虽然是龙裔的款式，但结合我的喜好做了不少改良，穿着舒适，活动方便……<br/>还不会妨碍我制服那些不听话的“病人”，呵呵。|trans_en=This outfit is pretty nice, huh? I arranged it to my liking based on a Loong design.<br/>The slit makes it easy to move, and it's just right for dealing with unruly "patients"... Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_159_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=蒼梧城のマーケットで、珍しい標本を集めるのに苦労するとは思わなかったね<br/>屋台の店主が強者揃いで、値切り交渉で思いのほか頭を悩ませてしまったよ|text_cn=在苍梧城，稀有的样本没想象中那么容易获得。有时候，甚至要去地摊上，和那些识货的行家斗智斗勇。|trans_en=I never imagined it would be so hard to collect rare specimens at Cangwu's market.<br/>All the stall owners were tough negotiators, and haggling over prices gave me more headaches than I expected.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_159_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=今月は…もう予算オーバーか。でも今は休暇中、懐事情よりも楽しむことの方が優先、だろう？|text_cn=这个月的预算似乎已经超支了。但我正在休假中，这种时候就不要考虑收入和开支的问题了，尽情享受节日吧。|trans_en=This month... Already over budget, huh? But it's the middle of vacation, so having fun takes priority over the financial situation, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_159_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=白沢管理局が専門家を招いて健康講座を開くらしいね<br/>興味があるんだけど…よかったら、キミも一緒にどう？|text_cn=听说白泽公署邀请玄师们，在城北举办了新春健康讲座。我对此有点兴趣，你要不要陪我一起去看看？|trans_en=It seems the Baize Bureau is inviting experts to hold a health seminar.<br/>I am interested. If you like, will you join me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_159_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=うーん…どうして子どもたちは私を見たら逃げたり泣いたりするんだろうね？<br/>…え、注射器を隠せばいい？なるほど。どの街でも子どもの怖がるものは同じということかな|text_cn=孩子们只要一看到我，就会四散而逃，或者哇哇大哭……<br/>诶？只要把注射器收起来，一切都会变好？<br/>这样啊……看来无论在哪里，小家伙们害怕的东西都是一样的啊。|trans_en=Umm... Why do the kids run and cry when they see me?<br/>...Hm? I should hide the syringe? I see. Kids are afraid of the same things in every town.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_159_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=注射器の中身が知りたいのかい？「医者の愛情」…とでも言おうか薬の名前よりわかりやすいしね<br/>フフ、ひとつ試してみる？それとも…もっと強くて刺激的な「愛」がお望みかい…？|text_cn=注射器里的是什么？比起那些拗口的专业名词，我更喜欢“医者的爱意”这个说法。你想要体验一下吗？我可以为你扎上一针。<br/>还是说……你想要感受更加强烈刺激的“爱意”？|trans_en=Want to know what's in the syringe? "Doctor's Love"... should I call it? It's easier to understand than a medicine name.<br/>Hehe, wanna try one? Or... Do you desire something stronger and more stimulating? "Love"... Is that what you want...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_159_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の衣装をよく見たい？かまわないけど、その間のキミの生体反応は記録させてもらうよ<br/>当然だろう？持ちつ持たれつ…というやつさ|text_cn=想研究研究我的服饰？当然可以。不过这个过程中，我也要记录你的生理指标变化，呵呵……礼尚往来嘛。|trans_en=You want to take a good look at my outfit? I don't mind, but allow me to record your bio-signs while you do.<br/>It's natural, isn't it? Give-and-take ... is what it's called.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_159_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今の賑やかさも嫌いじゃないけど…たまに診療所の匂いや標本が恋しくなるんだよね<br/>これが郷愁…って感情なのかな私にもそんな気持ちがあったなんてね|text_cn=我不讨厌现在这种热闹，不过偶尔……我也会想念诊所里消毒水的味道，以及那些与我共枕而眠的标本。<br/>原来如此，这就是“思乡之情”吗……|trans_en=I don't dislike the bustle of today, but ... sometimes I miss the smell and specimens in the clinic.<br/>Is this what they call nostalgia?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_159_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=夜空に咲き誇る大輪の花火…何度見てもキレイだよね今夜は…ふたりで見に行こうか|text_cn=烟花在夜空中绽开的景象，无论看多少次依旧觉得美丽。今晚一起去放烟花吧，就我们两个人。|trans_en=The large fireworks blooming in the night sky... They're always so beautiful. Tonight... Shall we go see them together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_159_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ジンリンの母親に頼まれてあの子の宿題を見ることになったんだ<br/>休暇中でも勉強とは、若い子は大変だね|text_cn=璟麟的母亲拜托我帮忙监督璟麟做作业……哪怕放假了，也依旧要做作业，现在的孩子还真是辛苦啊。|trans_en=At Jinglin's mother's request, I am going to look at that kid's homework.<br/>Studying even during vacations, young kids have it hard.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_159_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=チーシアから錬丹術を教えてもらおうと思ったんだけど、あの子は得意じゃないみたいだね<br/>代わりに腕の立つ姉弟子に頼んでくれるらしいから、楽しみにしているんだ|text_cn=我原本想找赤霞了解一下玄师们的“炼丹”技术，可惜她好像不太擅长这方面。<br/>不过，她答应帮我询问精通此道的师姐，真是令人期待啊。|trans_en=I was thinking of having Chixia teach me about Xuan Shi's alchemy, but it seems that girl is not good at it.<br/>But she will ask a skilled senior apprentice instead, so I am looking forward to it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_159_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=シーミャオ？賢くて探求心もあっていい子だと思うよ<br/>ただ…いつも忙しそうで、ゆっくり話せなかったのが残念だったね|text_cn=师渺？她很聪明，也很有钻研精神，是我喜欢的类型。<br/>但她一直忙于工作，我没能找到机会和她深入交流一番……可惜。|trans_en=Shimiao? She's smart and inquisitive—I think she's a good kid.<br/>But... It's a pity we couldn't speak at length because she always seems busy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_159_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=コゼットって言ったっけ？あの子はワケありなんだろう<br/>フフ…彼女の同類には心当たりがあってね。あの程度の変装じゃ、私の目はごまかせないよ|text_cn=那个叫珂赛特的孩子，似乎有什么隐情……呵呵，我和她的同类打过交道，那种程度的伪装骗不过我。|trans_en=The name is Cosette, right? I'm sure that girl has a reason.<br/>Hehe... I happen to know someone like her. A disguise like that won't fool my eyes.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_159_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=宿で不思議な雰囲気の女性を見かけたんだタンインって名前だったかな<br/>宿の女将らしいけど、ただ者じゃないと思うよ秘密を抱えた目をしていたからね|text_cn=那天在客栈里，见到了一位气质迷人的女子。听说她是那家客栈的老板，名叫丹韵。<br/>那人真的只是一个普通的客栈老板吗？她身上有秘密的味道。|trans_en=I saw a lady with a mysterious aura at the inn. Her name was Danyun, I think.<br/>She seems to be the innkeeper, but I think she's not an ordinary person. Her eyes held secrets.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_159_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=はいはい、そんなに焦らないで|text_cn=好了好了，不要心急。|trans_en=Yes yes, don't be so flustered.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_159_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=早く治療されたい？フフ…積極的ないい子は嫌いじゃないよ|text_cn=就这么迫不及待地想要打针？呵呵……我喜欢你这种主动。|trans_en=Want to be treated quickly? Hehe... I don't mind proactive kids when they behave.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_159_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=街が浮かれていても、キミはマイペースだね。そういうとこが好きなんだけどさ|text_cn=外面这么热闹，你倒是比平时更沉得住气。虽然我也挺喜欢你这种地方的。|trans_en=Even when the city is all hyped up, you just stay at your own pace. That's what I like about you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_159_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=暇つぶしに街歩きに行こうか。昨日見つけた新型の医療器具も、今のうちに買っておきたいしね|text_cn=闲来无事，要不要去街上逛逛呢，正好把昨天看中的那套医疗工具买下来……|trans_en=Shall we walk around the town to kill time? I also want to buy the medical device I found yesterday while I can.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_159_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よく眠っているね。私の調合した薬の効き目も上々ってところかな|text_cn=睡得真香，看来我新调配的药剂效果不错。|trans_en=You're sleeping well. I guess the medicine I mixed is working nicely.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_159_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=旅行先で出会うなんて、面白い偶然もあったものだね。<br/>ところで…この龍族風の衣装、キミはどう思う？|text_cn=没想到会在这里相遇，看来我们缘分不浅。为了顺应节日氛围，我特意挑了这身装束，你觉得怎么样？|trans_en=What an interesting coincidence to run into you while traveling.<br/>By the way... What do you think about this Loong-style outfit?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_159_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=また会ったね。フフ…私の治療が忘れられなかったのかな？|text_cn=又见面了，看来你对我的针剂还是念念不忘。|trans_en=We meet again. Hehe... You couldn't forget my treatment?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_159_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=外見だけでなく、中身も成長しないとね|text_cn=看来我这次得到的改变，不仅仅停留在装扮上。|trans_en=Not just appearance, we need to grow on the inside too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_159_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍族秘伝の鍛錬術はなかなか有効みたいだね|text_cn=龙裔们修养心神的技巧，确实能带给人惊喜。|trans_en=Loong's secret training techniques seem to be quite effective.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_159_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=過去の記憶にはどんな情報が眠っているんだろうね？|text_cn=从过往的记忆里，也能挖掘出有价值的信息吧。|trans_en=I wonder what kind of information is hidden in past memories?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_159_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いい音楽は治療の助けになるんだよ|text_cn=恰当的音乐，能缓解病人的紧张情绪。|trans_en=Good music can help with treatment.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_159_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…キミの気持ち、もっと高ぶらせてみせよう|text_cn=你那颗躁动不安的心，就让我来让它鼓动得更加激烈吧。|trans_en=Hehe... I'll make your feelings soar even higher.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_159_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=今度はキミが私を癒す番…フフ、手を止めたらダメだよ|text_cn=这次换你来诊疗我，感觉怎么样？呵呵，手别停啊……|trans_en=Now it's your turn to heal me... Heh, don't stop your hands.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_159_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっと付き合ってくれない？せっかくの休暇だし、キミと過ごしたいと思ってね<br/>街歩きもいいし、珍しい標本を探しに行くのも悪くない…え？計画ならもう立てている？<br/>龍族の文化体験か…フフ、楽しそうだね期待しておくよ|text_cn=难得的假期，陪我出去逛逛吧，随便走走，或者去找点珍贵的样本……<br/>诶？你已经做好计划了，要让我好好体验龙裔的风土人情？呵呵，那我开始期待了。|trans_en=Would you mind spending some time with me? Since it's a rare vacation, I'd like to spend it with you.<br/>A walk around town would be nice, or looking for rare specimens wouldn't be bad... Hm? You already have plans?<br/>A Loong cultural experience, huh... Hehe, that sounds fun. I look forward to it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_159_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちょっとした息抜きのつもりだったけど、キミのおかげで思った以上に満喫できたよ|text_cn=我本以为，这段假期对我而言只是短暂的放松。没想到你的存在，让我愈发地沉浸在假日里的美妙时光了……|trans_en=I just wanted a little break, but thanks to you, I enjoyed it more than I thought.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_159_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍族の「春節」は家族と一緒に新年を祝う行事なんだよね？<br/>…ということは、キミと春節を過ごせば、キミと私は家族と言えるんじゃないかな？|text_cn=龙裔的“春节”，是与家人一起庆祝新春到来的节日。呵呵，家人么……我们一起度过春节，是不是意味着，你会成我的“家人”？|trans_en=The Loong's Springseek Festival is the time when you celebrate the new year with family, right?<br/>... So, if I spend the Springseek Festival with you, doesn't that mean we can say we're family as well?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_159_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=蒼梧城には興味深いものがたくさんあって困るね…<br/>キミさえよければ、もう少しだけ一緒に残ってくれない？<br/>蒼梧城を隅から隅まで堪能しつくしたいんだキミの体を解き明かすように…ね|text_cn=我在这里还有很多有趣的事物尚未体验……<br/>如果你愿意，要不要和我再多留一段时间？我们一起探索更多的奥秘，就像……我探索你那样。|trans_en=There are almost too many fascinating things in Cangwu...<br/>If it's okay with you, can you stay with me a little longer?<br/>I want to enjoy every inch of Cangwu, just like how I want to explore your body...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_159_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミらしいチョイスだね|text_cn=嗯，独到的选择。|trans_en=That choice is so you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_159_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の好みを把握しているなんて…さすがだね|text_cn=很懂我的喜好呢……真不愧是你。|trans_en=You really understand my tastes... I knew you would.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_159_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=キミの想いはたしかに受け取ったよ<br/>であれば…私もとびきりの愛の証を返さないとね|text_cn=我感受到了你的心意，作为回礼，就送你一份甜蜜的“爱意”吧。|trans_en=Your feelings have definitely reached me.<br/>In that case... I must return a token of my love that is equally extraordinary.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_159_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=問題ないよ|text_cn=没问题。|trans_en=No problem.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_159_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありえない|text_cn=这不现实。|trans_en=Impossible.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_159_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにかな？|text_cn=什么？|trans_en=What is it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_159_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=えっ…|text_cn=为什么？|trans_en=Eh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_159_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=残念だ…|text_cn=可惜……|trans_en=What a pity...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_159_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=おぉっ！|text_cn=啊！|trans_en=Wow!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_159_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=覚悟はいい？|text_cn=做好觉悟吧！|trans_en=Are you ready?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_159_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…|text_cn=呵呵~|trans_en=Hehe...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_159_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=这样啊……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_159_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=今は休暇中なんだ|text_cn=我正在休假。|trans_en=I'm on vacation now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_159_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…賑やかだね|text_cn=呵呵，真热闹。|trans_en=Hehe... How lively.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_159_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=あれは…少し調べてみようか|text_cn=那是什么？值得好好研究一番。|trans_en=That... I'll look into it a little.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_159_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=特別な治療がお望みかい？|text_cn=想要我的特别关照吗？|trans_en=Do you desire special treatment?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_159_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_159_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは特製の薬だよ|text_cn=这是我特别调配的“药剂”。|trans_en=This is a special medicine.}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_159_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ…投薬の時間だよ|text_cn=接下来——请务必配合哦。|trans_en=Now... Time to take your medicine.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_159_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の「愛情」…一滴残さず飲み干して|text_cn=一滴不剩地接受我的“爱意”吧。|trans_en=My "love"... Drink it, every last drop.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_159_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=祭りもおしまい、か…|text_cn=节日的余兴……褪去了……|trans_en=The festival is over...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_159_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=羽目を外しすぎたね…|text_cn=好像悠哉过头了……|trans_en=Seems I went a bit too far...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_159_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=龍族の秘薬…実に興味深いね|text_cn=龙裔的秘药，很有启发性。|trans_en=Loong's secret medicine ... is truly fascinating.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_159_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この配合なら…フフ、実験が面白くなりそうだ|text_cn=新的配方，看来又能玩些新花样了。|trans_en=With this combination... Hehe, this experiment might be interesting.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_159_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=処方の幅が広がったね|text_cn=药的疗效，更胜以往。|trans_en=The range of treatments has expanded.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_159_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=安心して私にすべてを委ねて……|text_cn=安心享受我的“特别关照”吧。|trans_en=Relax and leave everything to me...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_159_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=力を抜いて。痛くしないから……|text_cn=放轻松，我打针绝对不痛。|trans_en=Just relax. I won't hurt you...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_159_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=…いいサンプルが見つかるかもね|text_cn=或许能采集到一些有意思的样本。|trans_en=... We might find a good sample.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_159_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=おもしろいデータを持ち帰りたいね|text_cn=带些有趣的数据回去吧……|trans_en=I'd love to take some interesting data back.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_159_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…龍族風の衣装に見惚れたかい？|text_cn=呵呵……看我穿龙裔的服装看得入迷了？|trans_en=Hehe... Are you captivated by this Loong-style outfit?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_159_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=今回の「患者」は…少し悪い子かもね|text_cn=这次的“病人”，或许没那么听话呢。|trans_en=This "patient" might be ... a bit of a troublemaker.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_159_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=研究の手がかりが見つかるなら、ここまで来た甲斐があるってものさ|text_cn=如果能带走点新技术，这趟出行就更有价值了。|trans_en=If I can find ideas for my research, then coming all this way will be worth it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_159_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=嫌な空気だね…不発弾を抱えている気分だ|text_cn=这压抑的氛围，就像爆竹哑火一样令人不安呢。|trans_en=The atmosphere is bad... Like we're holding an unexploded bomb.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_159_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こういうところで実験するのは初めてだ…フフ、少し興奮してきたよ|text_cn=我还是第一次在这种地方进行研究，有点兴奋起来了。|trans_en=This is my first time conducting an experiment in a place like this... Hehe, now I'm a little excited.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_159_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=祭りの支度をすませないとね|text_cn=置办点年货吧。|trans_en=I've got to get ready for the festival.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_159_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=祭りのために英気を養わないと|text_cn=节日的气氛真让人放松……|trans_en=I need to recharge my energy for the festival.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_159_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あの子たち、いつ休んでいるんだろう？|text_cn=看来她们没有假期。|trans_en=When do those kids ever rest?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_159_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…私の「愛情」、感じてもらえたかな|text_cn=相信它们已经感受到了我的“爱意”。|trans_en=Hehe... Did you feel my "love"?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_159_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=祭りは賑やかなのが一番だと思わないかい？|text_cn=节日还是热闹一点更好，你认为呢？|trans_en=Don't you think festivals are best when they're lively?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_159_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=昔ながらのやり方が効く病もあるものさ|text_cn=季节病害，还是得靠传统手段来解决。|trans_en=Some illnesses are best treated by the old ways.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_159_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さ、楽しい祭りに戻ろうか|text_cn=庆典本就该和平收场。|trans_en=Well, shall we return to the fun festival?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_159_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=衣装が汚れなくてよかった|text_cn=还好衣服没有弄脏。|trans_en=I'm glad my outfit didn't get dirty.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_159_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=長い休みは人をダメにするね…|text_cn=看来假期令人怠惰了……|trans_en=Long breaks really mess people up...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_159_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=医者の勘が鈍ったか…？|text_cn=我的手法……变生疏了？|trans_en=Has my intuition gone dull...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_159_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=体をほぐす時間だよ|text_cn=也该舒展筋骨了。|trans_en=It's time to stretch out.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_159_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=薬の在庫はたっぷりあるよ|text_cn=放心，药剂的储备很充足。|trans_en=We've got plenty of medicine in stock.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_159_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=さて、患者はどこかな？|text_cn=有人需要诊疗吗？|trans_en=Now, where are the patients?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_159_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=さあ、お祭りに繰り出そうか|text_cn=嗯，出发吧。|trans_en=Well, shall we head to the celebration?}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_159_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_159_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=フフ…今日は特別な日だし、そんな日くらい、いつもよりも素直になっていいんじゃない？<br/>さあ、力を抜いて…私の愛を、一滴残らずキミに注がせて…ね？|text_cn=在这个特别的日子里，我想你应该不会再拒绝我的心意了吧……<br/>来，放轻松，让我把满满的“爱意”，一点一滴地注射进你的身体里，好吗？|trans_en=Today is a special day, and on days like that, isn't it okay to be more honest than usual?<br/>Now, relax... Let me pour every last drop of my love into you... Okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_159_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=雪が強いね…体が冷えたなら温かい薬膳茶があるよ<br/>苦いのが駄目なら…別の方法で温めてもいいけど。フフ、どちらがいいかな？|text_cn=雪下大了呢……我这里有驱寒的汤剂。<br/>如果你不喜欢喝太苦的药，我也可以用别的方式让你身体热起来，你想要哪种呢？|trans_en=The snow is heavy... If you're cold, there's warm medicinal tea.<br/>If you don't like bitter flavors... We could warm you up another way. Heh, which would you prefer?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_159_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい年が始まったね必要ならこの一年、キミの健康管理を引き受けようか|text_cn=新的一年开始了，如果有需要，我可以负责你一整年份的健康管理。|trans_en=A new year has begun. If necessary, I can take charge of your health management this year.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_159_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の誕生日を祝いたい？別にケーキも贈り物もいらないよ<br/>代わりに…キミの体をちょっと観察させてくれない？それが一番嬉しいお祝いだからさ|text_cn=想要为我庆祝生日？其实不用准备蛋糕或者礼物。<br/>只要你在病床上安安静静地躺一会，让我收集到足够的数据，就是最棒的庆祝方式了。|trans_en=You want to celebrate my birthday? I don't need cake or a present.<br/>Instead... Could you let me observe your body a little? That would be the best celebration for me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_159_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_159_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日、おめでとう<br/>今日という日に、貴重な特殊体質を持ってこの世に生を受けた…<br/>そんな奇跡の偶然を考えると、人が誕生日を大切にする理由も理解できる気がするよ|text_cn=多年前的今天，我最为珍贵的实验体降生在了这个世界上……<br/>这样一想，我似乎能明白人们为什么会重视生日了。|trans_en=Happy birthday.<br/>On this day, you were born into this life with a precious and unique body...<br/>Thinking about such a miraculous coincidence, I feel I can understand why people value their birthdays.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Chinese New Year 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc159_ChineseNewYear26_day07_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc159_ChineseNewYear26_day07_cn.ogg|text_jp=せっかくの休みだし、一緒に春節で賑わう街を見て回らない？<br/>研究に役立つ、希少価値の高いものが見つかるかもしれないしね|text_cn=难得的假期，不如陪我去趟春节市集，顺便入乡随俗地买些年货。<br/>说不定还能淘到些有助于我研究的珍稀小玩意儿~|trans_en=We are on break, so why don't we look around the city celebrating the Springseek Festival?<br/>For research, we might even find some useful, rare, and valuable items.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_160_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=暑い日差し、白い砂浜、澄み渡る真っ青な海…！<br/>ビーチで過ごす、最高の休日ですね|text_cn=阳光，海浪，沙滩，这不就是完美的海边假日吗？|trans_en=Hot sunshine, a white sandy beach, and a clear, deep blue sea...!<br/>Spending time at the beach like this makes a perfect holiday.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_160_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ちゃーんと準備運動をしてから水に入ること。いいですね？|text_cn=要去游泳吗？下水前记得先热身哦。|trans_en=Do your warm-up exercises properly before going into the water. Got it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_160_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはようございます。せっかく海に来たんですから、いつまでも寝ていたらもったいないですよ|text_cn=早安。呵呵，我刚刚还在想，要不要给你多留一点赖床的时间呢。|trans_en=Good morning. Since we've come all the way to the sea, it would be a waste to just sleep the day away.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_160_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=近くにおいしいお店があるみたいなので、一緒にランチはいかがですか？|text_cn=午餐想吃什么？我听说附近有几家不错的特色餐厅，要一起去试试吗？|trans_en=Looks like there's a delicious store nearby. How about having lunch together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_160_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=昼と違って、夜の海は静かで落ち着きますね|text_cn=和白天不同，晚上的海边反而让人感到放松呢。|trans_en=Unlike the day, the sea at night is quiet and calms me down.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_160_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私としては、みんなと一緒に過ごすこの幸せな時間を、いつまでも大切にしたいんです|text_cn=像这样安静又舒适的时光，让人不知不觉就想要好好守护它。其实，只要能和大家一起待在这，我就已经很满足了。|trans_en=For me, this happy time spent together with everyone is what I want to cherish forever.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_160_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この拡声器、普通のシャボン玉も作れるんですよ♪見たいですか？|text_cn=这个喇叭也能制造普通泡泡哦，要我演示一下吗？|trans_en=This megaphone can even make regular soap bubbles ♪ Would you like to see?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_160_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうですか？コツさえ掴めば、泳ぐのは難しくないでしょう？|text_cn=怎么样？只要掌握了窍门，游泳也没有那么难学吧？|trans_en=What do you think? Once you get the hang of it, swimming isn't hard, right?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_160_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほらほら、がんばってください。その調子です、浮き輪に触っちゃダメですよ|text_cn=来，再加把劲。就是这样，不能依赖游泳圈哦！|trans_en=Come on, do your best. Just like that, and don't touch the floaty.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_160_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=海は本当に恐ろしい場所ですね。うっかり気を抜くと、ついダラダラしてしまって…<br/>ふふ。どうやら私も、海での休暇を満喫しているようです♪|text_cn=海边真是个危险的地方，让人一不小心就放松过头了。<br/>呵呵，看来我也开始享受假期了。|trans_en=The ocean really is scary. If I let my guard down for a second, I end up just lazing around...<br/>Hehe. Looks like I'm enjoying my vacation by the sea, too ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_160_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=子どもが沖のほうまで泳いでいってしまったようなので、注意してきますね<br/>すぐに戻るので、ここで待っていてください|text_cn=那边的孩子们又游远了，我去提醒她们一下。你在这边等等，我很快就回来。|trans_en=Those children have swum out to the open sea. I need to go check on them.<br/>I will be back soon, so please wait here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_160_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=風が心地良いからといって、体を冷やさないようにしてくださいね？<br/>タオルケットを渡しておくので、肌寒く感じたら羽織ってください|text_cn=海风是很舒服，但是吹久了也容易着凉，我给你拿了一张毯子，要是冷了记得披上哦。|trans_en=The breeze feels nice, but be sure not to catch a cold.<br/>I'll lend you this towel blanket. If you feel a chill, just wrap it around yourself.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_160_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=柔らかい砂地を歩くのは、体力がいりますからね<br/>無意味に歩き回らず、ジッとしているのも海を楽しむ手段ですよ|text_cn=别看沙地软绵绵的，走久了其实很耗体力。嗯，像你这样坐着不动也是一种明智的选择哦~|trans_en=Walking on soft sand does take a lot of energy.<br/>Instead of wandering around aimlessly, just staying still is another way to enjoy the ocean.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_160_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=え？怒ったときの私は怖い？<br/>ふふふ…私、怒ったことなんて一度もありませんよ？|text_cn=觉得我生气的样子很恐怖？怎么可能啦，我有生过气吗？|trans_en=Oh? I'm scary when I'm angry?<br/>Hehehe... I've never been angry even once, you know?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_160_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは左腕を失くして得た教訓なんですが…<br/>人間って、『部品』が1つ欠けたくらいじゃ意外と壊れないものなんですよねぇ<br/>なーんて、冗談ですよ、冗談。そんなに怯えた目をしなくても大丈夫ですから♪|text_cn=我在失去左手之后悟出来一个道理，人就算缺一块“零件”也能正常运作……<br/>开玩笑的，你表情别这么凝重啦~|trans_en=This is a lesson I learned from losing my left arm...<br/>Humans, surprisingly, don't break just because they are missing one "part."<br/>Yeah, right. It's a joke. You don't have to look so scared ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_160_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=巡遊者を引退してから、実はまだ1年ちょっとしか経っていないんですよね<br/>でも不思議なことに、思い返すともうずっと前のことのように感じてしまうんです|text_cn=算下来，不做旅人也才一年多而已。可现在回想那些冒险的日子，却感觉已经过了很久，真不可思议。|trans_en=It's been just over a year since I retired as a Trekker.<br/>But strangely enough, when I look back on it, it feels like it was a long time ago.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_160_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=地理協会…地理センの仕事を大変だと感じたことは、いまのところありませんね<br/>むしろ毎日が充実していてたのしいくらいです<br/>どちらかと言うと、雑務よりも人と話すほうがよっぽど気疲れするというか…|text_cn=我倒没觉得地理协会的工作累，相反，我其实还挺喜欢那种充实的感觉。比起工作本身，还是跟人打交道更耗费心力。|trans_en=Trekker Association... As of now, I have not felt that Trekkers' House work is difficult.<br/>On the contrary, every day is fulfilling and fun.<br/>If anything, talking to people is much more tiring than routine tasks...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_160_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よければ今度、ふたりでセルスティに行きませんか？<br/>あちらには、お気に入りの素敵な海岸がいくつもあって、いい気分転換になると思います<br/>なので、ぜひご一緒できると…うれしいです|text_cn=有机会的话，能请你陪我一起去塞尔斯泰吗？那边有几处我很喜欢的海岸，想带你去看看。<br/>嗯，就当是陪我散散心怎么样？|trans_en=If you'd like, how about we go to Sailstead together?<br/>There are several lovely beaches there that I'd like to visit, and I think it will be a nice change of pace.<br/>So, if you could join me... I would be really happy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_160_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=空白旅団のみんなって、危なっかしいところもあるから、つい世話を焼きたくなるんです<br/>でもいまはあなたが一緒にいてくれるおかげで、以前ほど心配することはなくなりました|text_cn=我之前一直很担心空白旅团的大家，不过现在有你在，相信她们一定不会有问题的。<br/>呵呵，有你在身边，确实是件让人安心的事。|trans_en=Everyone in the New Star Guild can be a bit reckless at times, so I can't help but want to look out for them.<br/>But now that you're here with me, I don't worry as much as I used to.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_160_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=海風に当たっていたら、いつの間にか日が傾いていて…<br/>不思議ですね。あなたと一緒にいると、あっという間に時間が過ぎていく気がするんです|text_cn=我原本只是想来吹吹风，结果一抬眼，发现太阳已经偏西了。<br/>……奇怪，明明没做什么特别的事，怎么和你待在一起的时候，时间过得特别快？|trans_en=Standing in the sea breeze... Before I knew it, the sun was setting...<br/>It's strange, isn't it? When I'm with you, I feel like time passes in the blink of an eye.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_160_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=海のことが知りたいなら、カナタに聞いてみるといいですよ<br/>船の完成まではまだ時間がかかりそうですが、ちょうど船員を募集しているようですし|text_cn=你要是对大海感兴趣的话，可以去找彼岸聊聊，她最近正忙着物色船员。至于船嘛……嗯，可能还需要点时间。|trans_en=If you want to learn about the sea, you should ask Horizon.<br/>It will still take some time until her ship is finished, but looks like they're recruiting crew members now.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_160_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=私がセイナとチームを組んでいた頃の話ですか？話すと長くなりますけど…<br/>あれは、そう…ヤドカリがようやく歩き始めた時代までさかのぼります<br/>って、あれ？もう聞かなくていいんですか？|text_cn=想听我和尘沙之前的故事？这个可说来话长，很久很久以前，世界上还没有旅人……寄居蟹也刚刚学会走路……<br/>嗯？又不想听了？|trans_en=About the time when I was teamed up with Noya? It will take a long time to talk about...<br/>That was... Well... It goes back to the time when hermit crabs had just started walking.<br/>Uh, what? You don't want to hear the rest?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_160_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=ラールって、サボりの常習犯ってイメージが強いですけど、本当はとても気が利くんですよ<br/>他ならぬ私も、これまで何度も助けられましたし|text_cn=菈露这个人啊，你别看她平时吊儿郎当的，实际上是个很细心的人，我也受到过她很多照顾。|trans_en=I know Laru has a reputation for being a chronic slacker, but she's actually very thoughtful.<br/>Not the least of which, she has saved me more times than I can count.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_160_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨロズ配達のトーナさんは、どんなときでも元気に振る舞っていますが…<br/>だからこそ、無理をしすぎないか心配ですね|text_cn=多娜那孩子虽然看上去很有活力，但总这样超负荷运转还是让人有些担心呢。|trans_en=Donna from Post Haste is always full of energy, but...<br/>That's exactly why I'm worried she might be pushing herself too hard.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_160_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこに行くときもいつも一緒で、カリンさんは本当にシアさんのことが大好きなんですね<br/>え？大きな声で言わないほうがいい？むしろカリンさんは、よろこぶと思いますけど|text_cn=花铃还是那么喜欢粘着希娅，每次见到都是两个人在一起……<br/>嗯？你要我小声点？但是我觉得，花铃听到这话一定会很开心的。|trans_en=They're always together everywhere they go. Karin really loves Shia, doesn't she?<br/>Hm? Should I not say that out loud? But I think Karin would be happy about it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_160_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにかあれば、遠慮なく言ってくださいね<br/>あまりにも無茶なお願いは受けられませんけど|text_cn=有什么事就直说吧，不过太离谱的事情我可不会帮你的。|trans_en=If there's anything, please don't hesitate to let me know.<br/>I can't accept requests that are too unreasonable, though.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_160_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=義手が見たいんですか？よければ外してお貸しすることもできますよ♪|text_cn=想看我的义肢？需要我拆下来给你吗？|trans_en=Want to see my prosthetic arm? If you'd like, I can take it off for you ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_160_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら？魔王さんからサーフィンのお誘いを受けたんですが…<br/>肝心の魔王さんは、どこに行ってしまったんでしょう？|text_cn=不是说要一起去晒日光浴吗？人呢？|trans_en=Huh? I received a surfing invitation from Boss, but...<br/>Where is she?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_160_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=やることがないなら、一緒にお昼寝でもどうですか？ふあぁ……|text_cn=没事干的话，要不去睡一会好了……|trans_en=If you don't have anything to do, how about we take a nap together? Yawn...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_160_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ひとりで静かに過ごすのって、こんな感じなんですね…ふふ。なんだか新鮮です|text_cn=原来一个人待着无人打扰是这种感觉，还真是稀奇。|trans_en=So, this is what it's like to spend some quiet time alone... Hehe. It feels kind of refreshing.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_160_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなと一緒に海に来られてよかったです<br/>ただ、はしゃぐのはけっこうですが、危ないことをしたらダメですよ？|text_cn=能和你们一起来海边真的很难得，希望大家能度过一个开心的假日。也请各位不要做危险的事。|trans_en=I'm glad I could come to the sea with everyone.<br/>But, while it's fine to have fun, don't do anything dangerous, okay?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_160_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ビーチの平和を守るため、私はまだまだ必要とされているようですね<br/>というわけで、もう少しみんなとご一緒させていただきます|text_cn=看样子，这片海暂时还离不开我。我就再陪大家一阵子吧~|trans_en=It seems I'm still needed to keep the peace at the beach.<br/>So, I'll be sticking around with everyone a little longer.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_160_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=成長が必要なのは、巡遊者に限った話ではありません|text_cn=无论是作为旅人，还是身处职场，能力提升都很重要。|trans_en=The need for growth is not limited to Trekkers.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_160_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ。私にもまだ伸び代があったんですね|text_cn=哎呀，这次可不只是小有提升呢。|trans_en=Hehe. I guess I still had room to grow.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_160_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あ…巡遊者だった頃のことを思い出しました|text_cn=嗯？突然想起了以前当旅人的日子……|trans_en=Ah... This reminds me of when I was a Trekker.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_160_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=このメロディ、休日に聴くのにぴったりですね|text_cn=这旋律……很适合度假的时候听。|trans_en=This melody is perfect to listen to on a day off.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_160_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いくら注意しても聞かない人は、力づくで言う事を聞いてもらいますからね？|text_cn=口头警告无效的话，就别怪我不客气了。|trans_en=For those who won't listen no matter how many times I warn them, I'll have to force them to listen.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_160_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなが心配するから、そろそろ帰らないといけない時間なんですけど…<br/>もう少しだけ、ふたりきりの時間を楽しみませんか？|text_cn=已经到了该回去的时间了，不过……夕阳真美啊，我们再多待一会儿吧。|trans_en=They'll get worried, so it's about time we go back, but...<br/>Can we enjoy just a little more time alone together?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_160_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなはビーチバレーをするようですが、私はダイビングに行ってみようかと<br/>ご一緒にいかがですか？このあたりにはキレイなサンゴ礁が広がっているみたいですよ|text_cn=大家去打排球了，但我想去潜水，你要跟我一起吗？我听当地人说，这里的水下有很漂亮的珊瑚丛。|trans_en=It seems everyone else is going to play beach volleyball, but I was thinking of going diving.<br/>Would you like to come with me? There are beautiful coral reefs spread out around here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_160_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ。あなたもこっそり抜け出してきたんですか？<br/>今日はいい波がきていて、絶好のサーフィン日和だそうですよ<br/>…といっても、私もサーフィンははじめてなんですけどね。とはいえ、何事も挑戦！ですよ|text_cn=好巧啊，你也偷偷溜出来了吗？今天的浪很适合下水，我想去试试冲浪。事先声明，我其实不会冲浪，但人生重在体验不是吗？|trans_en=Hehe. Did you sneak out too?<br/>I hear that good waves are coming today, and it's perfect weather for surfing.<br/>... To be honest, this is my first time surfing. Still, you've got to give everything a try!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_160_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あっ、ちょうどいいところに！あなたを探しに行こうと思っていたんです<br/>実は今夜、浅瀬に光るイカが現れるらしくてですね<br/>とはいえひとりで見るのは味気ないので、ぜひご一緒にいかがですか？|text_cn=你来得正好，我正准备去找你呢。听说今晚浅海会出现发光的鱿鱼……<br/>这样的景色，一个人去看也太可惜了~你会陪我一起去的，对吧？|trans_en=Ah, right at the perfect time! I was just thinking about looking for you.<br/>I heard that glowing squid will appear in the shallows tonight.<br/>But it's no fun watching them alone. Would you like to join me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_160_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたたちと一緒に過ごしたこの貴重な休暇の思い出が、私にとっての宝物なんです<br/>だから…もう少しだけ、この幸せな時間が続いてほしい。ついそんなふうに思ってしまって<br/>なんて、こんなこと言うのは私らしくないですよね|text_cn=海风、沙滩，还有这难得的假期……就是你们为我准备的最好的礼物。真希望这段时光能再长一点……呵呵，这可不像我啊……|trans_en=The memories of this precious vacation I spent with you all are a treasure to me.<br/>And... I wish this happy time could last a little longer. I just can't help but feel that way.<br/>Well, but it's not like me to say things like this, isn't it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_160_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これを私に？ありがとうございます|text_cn=是送给我的吗？谢谢你。|trans_en=This is for me? Thank you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_160_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁ…！私の欲しかったもの、どうしてわかったんですか？|text_cn=嗯？你怎么知道我最近想买这个？|trans_en=Wah...! How did you know this was exactly what I wanted?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_160_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まさかこれをいただけるなんて…ありがとうございます。大切にしますね|text_cn=真是让人意外……谢谢你，我会好好珍惜的。|trans_en=I never thought I would receive this... Thank you. I'll treasure it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_160_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい|text_cn=好啊。|trans_en=Yeah.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_160_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=ダメです|text_cn=这样不行。|trans_en=Nope.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_160_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=はい？|text_cn=这是什么？|trans_en=What?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_160_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしてですか？|text_cn=奇怪了？|trans_en=How come?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_160_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=そんな…|text_cn=嗯……|trans_en=No way…}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_160_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=わぁ♪|text_cn=太好了！|trans_en=Yay♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_160_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=もうっ！|text_cn=我没有在开玩笑。|trans_en=No kidding!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_160_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふっ|text_cn=呵呵。|trans_en=Heh.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_160_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_160_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=遊泳禁止エリアには、入らないようにしてください|text_cn=要在安全区域内游泳哦。|trans_en=Please do not enter the No Swimming area.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_160_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=この左腕、なかなか使い勝手がいいんですよ|text_cn=我的这只左手可是很厉害的哦？|trans_en=This left arm of mine is pretty useful.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_160_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにかお手伝いできることはありますか？|text_cn=有什么我能帮上忙的吗？|trans_en=Is there anything I can help you with?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_160_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=危険行為は控えてください|text_cn=不要做危险的事哦。|trans_en=Please refrain from dangerous behavior.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_160_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_160_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=潮風が心地良いですね|text_cn=海风真舒服啊~|trans_en=The sea breeze feels nice, doesn't it?}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_160_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ほらそこ！ルールを守ってください！|text_cn=都说了，要注意安全警示！|trans_en=Hey, over there! Please follow the rules!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_160_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=こらー！違反者には罰です！|text_cn=我生气了！嘿——|trans_en=Hey! Rule violators will be punished!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_160_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうして、こんなことに…|text_cn=怎么会这样……|trans_en=How did it end up like this...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_160_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=もう、限界です…|text_cn=我只能帮你们到这了……|trans_en=I'm ... at my limit...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_160_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうですか？現役を退いたって、まだまだ成長できるんですよ？|text_cn=怎么样？我的说服力是不是更强了？|trans_en=What do you think? Even though I've retired from active Trekker duty, I can keep on growing!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_160_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=ライフガードにも、適切な装備が必要なんです|text_cn=救生员也需要游泳装备。|trans_en=Lifeguards also need appropriate equipment.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_160_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=時には厳しい『警告』も必要なんですよ？|text_cn=有时候也需要给它们来点实质性的“警告”。|trans_en=Sometimes a strict warning is also necessary.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_160_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=後方支援でしたら、ぜひお任せください|text_cn=后勤支援？交给我就好了。|trans_en=If it's rear support,please leave it to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_160_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=みんなのことは、私がちゃんと見ておきますね|text_cn=我会帮你看住大家的。|trans_en=I'll be sure to keep a close eye on everyone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_160_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あら？いまの私は休暇中のはずなんですが…ふふ、おかしいですねー？|text_cn=哎，不是说好了让我来休假的吗？|trans_en=Huh? I'm supposed to be on vacation right now... Hehe, how strange.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_160_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=無事に帰るまでが探索ですよ|text_cn=好了，今天也要平安回去哦。|trans_en=The expedition isn't over until we return safely.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_160_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=たまには体を動かすのも、悪くないですね|text_cn=久违地活动下筋骨吧。|trans_en=Moving my body every once in a while. Not bad at all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_160_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔なんていつぶりだろう？案内をお願いしますね|text_cn=我已经很久没有来过星塔了，领路的事情就交给你吧。|trans_en=How long has it been since my last visit to a Monolith? Please show me around.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_160_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=お気遣いなく。腕を失くした代わりに、力を手に入れましたから♪|text_cn=别担心，虽然我少了一条胳膊，但现在打人更痛了哦~|trans_en=Please pay no mind. In exchange for losing an arm, I gained power ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_160_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この穏やかではない気配…懐かしいですね|text_cn=这种危险的气息真令人怀念。|trans_en=This uneasy atmosphere... It brings back memories.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_160_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=やるべきことは、他にもまだありますよ。気を引き締め直してください|text_cn=工作是永远做不完的，打起精神来吧。|trans_en=There are still other things you need to do. Please stay focused.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_160_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=そろそろ物資を補充したほうがよさそうですね|text_cn=该补充物资了。|trans_en=Looks like it's about time we restock our supplies.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_160_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=少し休みませんか？とっておきの小話をお聞かせしますよ？|text_cn=休息一下吧，要我给你讲个笑话吗？|trans_en=Why don't you rest a little? I'll tell you a special little story.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_160_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=新しい依頼…でしょうか？|text_cn=说不定会有新的委托。|trans_en=A new commission... Is it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_160_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=慣れればちょちょいのちょいです|text_cn=熟能生巧~|trans_en=Once you get used to it, it's super-duper easy.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_160_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=準備運動に最適ですね|text_cn=这种程度的任务，只能说刚好够热身。|trans_en=It's perfect for warm-up exercises.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_160_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=これが私の実力ですよ♪|text_cn=怎么，对我刮目相看了？|trans_en=This is my true power ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_160_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の腕は衰えませんよだって義手ですから♪|text_cn=也算是一种，宝刀未老？|trans_en=My arm never gets old and weak. After all, it's a prosthetic one ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_160_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=思ったより簡単でしたね|text_cn=比想象中轻松呢。|trans_en=That was easier than I thought.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_160_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これがブランクなのかしら…|text_cn=果然还是生疏了……|trans_en=Is this what they call rust...?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_160_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ義手が馴染んでいないのかも…|text_cn=这副义肢，磨合得还不太好啊……|trans_en=Maybe I haven't gotten used to my arm yet...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_160_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ。またここに戻ってくるとは思いませんでした|text_cn=没想到我还有重回一线的时候。|trans_en=Hehe. I didn't think I would come back here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_160_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=後方支援を甘く見ないでくださいね♪|text_cn=不要小看后勤人员哦。|trans_en=Please don't underestimate rear support ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_160_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=私にとって、義手はハンデになりませんよ♪|text_cn=缺胳膊少腿也不会影响我的战斗力哦？|trans_en=To me, this arm is no handicap ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_160_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=休暇をいただけるという話では？なんちゃって♪|text_cn=不是说让我来休假吗？|trans_en=I heard I can get some time off? Just saying ♪}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_160_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=Yostar}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_160_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=地理センの責任者という立場上、本来なら特定の個人とだけ親しくするわけにもいきませんが…<br/>今日はバレンタイン、特別な誰かを思うことが許される日ですから<br/>はい、こちらをどうぞ。あなたのためにチョコレートを用意してみました|text_cn=要是平时，很多事都要顾着场合和分寸，但可今天不一样。情人节可是少数能理直气壮地偏爱某个人的节日。<br/>收下吧，这是我为你准备的巧克力。|trans_en=Given my position as the head of Trekkers' House, I really shouldn't be getting too close to any one in person, but...<br/>Today is Valentine's Day, a day when it's okay to think of someone special.<br/>Here, please have this. I've prepared some chocolate for you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_160_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この時期になると、無邪気にはしゃぐ子どもたちを羨ましく思うことがあるんです<br/>でも…やっぱり大人だって、クリスマスくらい思い切り楽しみたいじゃないですか？<br/>ふふ…というわけで、これは私からのプレゼントです。メリークリスマス。|text_cn=有时候也会羡慕小孩子，毕竟大人的话，每到这个节日都会忙得不可开交。<br/>不过嘛，也正因为是大人，才更应该有仪式感一点。<br/>喏，给你的礼物，雪愿节快乐。|trans_en=At this time of year, I sometimes feel envious of children who play innocently.<br/>But ... after all, even adults want to fully enjoy Snowish Festival, right?<br/>Hehe... So, this is a present from me. Merry Snowish Festival.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_160_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとうございます<br/>冬の海は風が冷たくてこごえてしまいますが、ここから見る初日の出は壮観ですね<br/>私も全力でサポートしますから素敵な1年にしていきましょう|text_cn=新年快乐，要不要一起去放烟花？烟花映照在海面上的样子，想必不会让人失望的~|trans_en=Happy New Year.<br/>The winter sea is freezing with cold winds but the first sunrise seen from here is amazing.<br/>I will do my best to support you, so let's make it a lovely year.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_160_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の誕生日のお祝い？<br/>ありがとうございます。もうそんな時期になっていたんですね。<br/>え？プレゼントに…ケーキまで用意してくださったんですか？も、もう…ズルい人ですね|text_cn=我的生日？原来又到了啊……谢谢你还记得，礼物什么的就不用……<br/>什么，连蛋糕都准备好了？你这个人啊……|trans_en=My birthday celebration?<br/>Thank you.I didn't realize it was that time of year already.<br/>Hm? A present... And you even prepared a cake? Th-that's not fair...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_160_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_160_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=お誕生日おめでとうございます。こちらをどうぞ<br/>セルスティでは、誕生日に貝殻のアクセサリーをもらうと、その1年幸せに恵まれるそうですよ|text_cn=生日快乐，按照塞尔斯泰的习俗，生日当天收到贝壳制品，就能一整年都有好运，所以这份礼物送给你。|trans_en=Happy birthday.Please have this.<br/>In Sailstead, it is said that if you receive a shell accessory on your birthday, you will be blessed with happiness for the entire year.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Summer 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day01_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day01_cn.ogg|text_jp=今日の私は、地理センの受付けに立っている、チャーミングなお姉さんではありませんよ？<br/>みなさんが楽しく安全に過ごせるよう、ビーチの安全を守るライフセーバーのウィローです♪<br/>あ、いまのは、えっと…チャ、チャーミングというのは冗談ですから…！<br/>も、もぉ～！そんな目で見ないでください！|text_cn=今天的我，可不是地理协会接待处的那位……魅力十足的姐姐哦？<br/>而是为了让大家都能开心平安地度过每一天，负责守护海滩安全的救生员——薇洛哦~<br/>那个……呃……刚才那个……“魅力十足”……是我在开玩笑啦。<br/>你、你那是什么反应！别用那种眼神看着我啦！|trans_en=Today, I'm not that charming receptionist at Trekkers' House anymore.<br/>I'm Willow, the lifeguard protecting the beach so everyone can have a fun and safe time ♪<br/>Oh, um... The whole thing about being charming... I was just joking!<br/>H-Hey! Don't look at me like that!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Summer 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day02_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day02_cn.ogg|text_jp=浅瀬だからといって油断はせず、海に入る前には、きちんと準備運動をしてくださいね？<br/>もし海で溺れたら…海水をたくさん飲んで、お腹がタプタプになってしまいますよ？<br/>そんなタプタプ魔王さんなんて…<br/>ふふ。それはそれで、想像するとちょっとかわいいかも？|text_cn=别因为是浅水区就掉以轻心哦。下水之前，一定要做好热身运动。<br/>万一在海里呛了水，可是会一口气喝下好多海水，肚子都会变得圆滚滚的。<br/>要是你变成那样……呵呵，怎么说呢…… 我稍微想象了一下，好像还挺可爱的？|trans_en=Just because the water is shallow doesn't mean you don't need to be careful. Make sure to warm up before you hit the water.<br/>If you drown, you'll gulp down so much that your tummy will puff up like a balloon!<br/>Boss, all puffed up...<br/>Heh, that might be kind of cute?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Summer 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day03_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day03_cn.ogg|text_jp=ピピー！魔王さん、集合ー！はい、それでは準備運動を始めますよ<br/>海の中で脚が攣ったら大変ですからね。腰から足回りを重点的にほぐしていきましょう<br/>ではまず、開脚から。ゆっくり背中を押していきますからね。フーッと息を吐いて…<br/>ん？あ、あれ？魔王さん？うそ…セイナに聞いてましたけどこんなにカチカチだったなんて…|text_cn=哔哔！全员集合！好，现在要开始做准备运动了哦！<br/>为了避免各位在海里游泳时腿抽筋，我们来重点把腰和腿活动开吧。<br/>那么，先从腿部拉伸开始。慢慢来，把背挺直……吸气，呼气——<br/>嗯？咦？不、不会吧……我虽然听尘沙提过，可没想到，你身体能僵硬到这种程度……|trans_en=(Whistles) Boss, everyone, gather up! Okay, let's start with some warm-up exercises!<br/>The last thing you want is a leg cramp while you're out in the water, so let's stretch your hips and legs first.<br/>Let's start with a straddle stretch. I'll gently press on your back, so just relax and breathe out...<br/>Hm? Boss? Wow... Noya told me you weren't very flexible, but I didn't expect you to be this stiff...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Summer 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day04_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day04_cn.ogg|text_jp=いくら対策をしていても、万が一のことがありますからね今日はその練習をしてみましょう<br/>いいですか？もし溺れてしまっても、慌てないことが大切です<br/>はい、では私の目を見て…焦らず、冷静に…落ち着いて…<br/>あれ？なんだか逆に体が固くなってきてますけど…ふふ。リラックス、ですよ？|text_cn=就算做了充分的事前准备，也难免会有万一。所以今天，就来练习下遇到突发情况时该怎么应对吧。<br/>听好了——要是真不小心溺水了，也千万不要惊慌。<br/>来，看着我的眼睛……别着急，保持冷静，然后慢慢放松……<br/>咦？怎么感觉你身体变得更僵硬了……呵呵，是放松，放松哦？|trans_en=No matter how careful you are, accidents can still happen. That's why we're going to practice what to do if they do.<br/>Are you with me? If you ever find yourself in trouble in the water, the most important thing is to stay calm.<br/>That's it... Keep eye contact with me. Don't panic... Relax...<br/>Hm? Looks like you're tensing up instead... Hehe. Come on, just relax.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Summer 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day05_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day05_cn.ogg|text_jp=みなさんの安全を守るのが、ライフセーバーのお仕事ですからね<br/>おいたをする悪い子には…ふふ。たとえ魔王さんにだって、お・仕・置・きしちゃいますよ？<br/>え？どんなお仕置きか？それはそのときまで秘密です<br/>だからといって、わざと私を怒らせようとしたら、本気で怒っちゃいますからね？|text_cn=守护大家的安全，本来就是救生员的职责。<br/>至于那些不听话，又喜欢惹麻烦的坏孩子……呵呵，就算是你，我也会好好惩罚哦？<br/>嗯？想知道是什么样的惩罚？这个嘛……暂时保密。<br/>所以，要是有人故意惹怒我的话，我可是会真的生气哦？|trans_en=Keeping everyone safe is a lifeguard's job.<br/>As for those who misbehave... Hehe. Even you wouldn't get away without punishment, Boss.<br/>Hm? What kind of punishment? That's a secret... You'll find out if the time ever comes.<br/>But don't start teasing me on purpose just to see what happens, or I might actually get mad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Summer 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day06_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day06_cn.ogg|text_jp=普段はデスクワークばかりしているのに、ビーチを駆け回る体力があるのか？<br/>ふふ。甘く見てもらっては困ります。こう見えても、私は元巡遊者ですからね<br/>実際、引退してからそれほど経っていませんし…<br/>自分で言うのもなんですけど、引き締まった体は、まだまだ現役巡遊者には負けていませんよ♪|text_cn=明明平时总是坐在办公室里工作，有在海滩上跑来跑去的体力吗？<br/>呵呵，你可别小看我。再怎么说，我以前也是旅人啊。<br/>而且，离开一线也还没过多久呢……<br/>虽然这种话由我自己来说有点奇怪，不过——这副锻炼得还不错的身体，可不比现役旅人差哦~|trans_en=I usually just do desk work these days, so do I still have the stamina to patrol the beach, you ask?<br/>Hehe. Don't underestimate me. I may not look it, but I used to be a Trekker.<br/>It really wasn't that long ago that I retired...<br/>Not to brag, but I can still keep up with the active Trekkers ♪}}
{{AudioRow|title=Summer 2026|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day07_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc160_SummerEvent26_day07_cn.ogg|text_jp=潮風が涼しくて、気持ちいい…魔王さん、よかったら隣に座りませんか？<br/>あら？なんだかまぶたが重たそうですけど…もしかして、はしゃぎすぎて疲れちゃいました？<br/>ふふ。では、肩を貸してあげますから、遠慮しないで寄りかかっていいですよ<br/>あっ、それとも…膝枕のほうがいいですか？|text_cn=海风凉凉的，真舒服啊……我说，你要不要坐到我旁边来？<br/>嗯？怎么眼睛都要睁不开了……是今天玩得太尽兴，觉得累了吗？<br/>呵呵。那……我的肩膀借你吧，别客气，靠过来也可以哦。<br/>还是说……你更想要膝枕？|trans_en=The sea breeze feels so nice... Boss, would you like to come sit with me for a while?<br/>Hm? You look sleepy... Did you wear yourself out having too much fun?<br/>Hehe. Here, you can lean on my shoulder if you'd like.<br/>Or ... would you rather have a lap pillow?}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}

{{TrekkerAudioTop}}

==Daily Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 1|file_jp=vo_162_ui_greet_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_greet_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もしフィラニスを見て回るつもりなら、私が案内します。遠慮せず言ってください|text_cn=你还没有好好逛过菲兰尼斯吧？如果有空，要不要和我一起去城里走走？|trans_en=If you're planning to look around Filanis, I'd be happy to show you around. Just let me know.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 2|file_jp=vo_162_ui_greet_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_greet_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=やはり平穏な毎日が一番ですね|text_cn=和平安宁的日常，真是再好不过了。|trans_en=In the end, peaceful daily life is the best.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 3|file_jp=vo_162_ui_greetmorn_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_greetmorn_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=おはよう。ちょうど巡回が終わったところなんですが、なにか仕事はありますか？|text_cn=早上好，我刚结束巡逻，接下来有什么安排？|trans_en=Good morning. I just finished my patrol. Is there any work for me?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 4|file_jp=vo_162_ui_greetnoon_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_greetnoon_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまは昼休みだから、急ぎの仕事はありませんが…どうしたんですか？<br/>えっ？私と一緒に昼ごはんを食べたい？<br/>わかりました。すぐに支度してくるので、少しだけ待っていてください|text_cn=现在是午休时间，暂时没有紧急事务。嗯？你想和我一起吃午饭？<br/>……请稍等，我这就去准备。|trans_en=It's lunch break right now, so there's nothing urgent to take care of... What is it?<br/>Huh? You want to have lunch with me?<br/>Alright. I'll go get ready, so please wait just a moment.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Greetings 5|file_jp=vo_162_ui_greetnight_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_greetnight_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私は夜の巡回に行ってきます。あなたは部屋でゆっくりしていてください|text_cn=夜间巡逻是我的职责。你如果没有其他安排，就在房间里好好休息吧。|trans_en=I'm heading out for my night patrol. You can just relax in your room.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 1|file_jp=vo_162_ui_standee_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_standee_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=よりよい未来を創造するためにも、ここで立ち止まるわけにはいきません|text_cn=想让未来变得更好，就不能停下脚步。|trans_en=If we want to create a better future, we cannot waste our time here.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 2|file_jp=vo_162_ui_standee_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_standee_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=永遠に変わらないものなどありません。だからこそ、私たちはいまを大切にすべきなんです|text_cn=万物都会改变。正因如此，我们才更该珍惜眼前的一切。|trans_en=Nothing stays the same forever. That's why we must cherish the present.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 3|file_jp=vo_162_ui_fullscreen_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_fullscreen_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=さっきからジッとこちらを見て…なにかご用ですか？|text_cn=怎么一直看着我……是有什么事吗？|trans_en=You've been staring at me for a while now... Is there something you need?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 4|file_jp=vo_162_ui_fullscreen_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_fullscreen_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=背中の傷？闘技でケガをするのはめずらしいことではありません。どうぞお気になさらず|text_cn=伤口？啊，不必在意，在战斗中受伤是常有的事。|trans_en=The scar on my back? Injuries from battle are not uncommon. Don't worry about it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 5|file_jp=vo_162_ui_posterchat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_posterchat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=争いをおさめ、暴動を鎮める。それが閃銀騎士団の役目です<br/>決して楽な仕事とは言えないし、他人から感謝される仕事だとも言えませんが…<br/>少なくとも、都市の治安を守る重要な役割であることは間違いありません|text_cn=平息纷争、制止暴乱，是守夜人的职责。这工作既不轻松，也谈不上伟大。<br/>但至少……它应该是……维系城邦的基石……对吧？|trans_en=Our duty in the Night Watch is to settle conflicts and put down riots.<br/>It's not an easy job, and it's not the kind of work people are always grateful for...<br/>But there's no doubt that it plays a vital role in keeping the city safe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 6|file_jp=vo_162_ui_posterchat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_posterchat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=以前いたアモールという都市は、数え切れないほどの犠牲の上に栄華を極めていました<br/>だからフィラニスに来たばかりの頃、ここでなら平和に暮らせると思ってたんですが…|text_cn=埃摩的繁华建立在无数人的性命之上。来到菲兰尼斯后，我曾以为……这里不会再发生那样的悲剧。|trans_en=The city I used to live in, Emor, achieved its prosperity on top of countless sacrifices. So when I first came to Filanis, I thought maybe I'd finally be able to live here in peace…}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 7|file_jp=vo_162_ui_posterchat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_posterchat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=湖の島には、おいしいパンを作る店があるんです。まあ、その分値も張りますが…<br/>いつか…安くておいしくて、欲を言えば長持ちするパンができたらいいですね|text_cn=岛上有家店的面包做得很好吃，只是价格总让人有些望而却步。<br/>要是将来能有一种既便宜又美味，还能保存很久的面包就好了。|trans_en=There's a bakery on the island in the lake that makes delicious bread. Of course, it's pretty expensive...<br/>Still, maybe someday they'll make bread that's cheap, tasty, and—if I'm asking too much—lasts a long time, too.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 8|file_jp=vo_162_ui_posterchat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_posterchat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔法と違って、練習すれば誰でも上手に料理できるようになる？<br/>戦いと違って、料理は根性だけではどうにもならない？<br/>うーん…私のこと、からかっていませんか？|text_cn=比起学习魔法，烹饪这种事，只要肯下功夫，总能学会——<br/>什么？烹饪并非战斗，不能只靠毅力？<br/>……你不会是在骗我吧？|trans_en=So unlike magic, anyone can become a good cook if they practice?<br/>And unlike fighting, cooking takes more than just grit?<br/>Hmm... You're not making fun of me, are you?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 9|file_jp=vo_162_ui_posterchat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_posterchat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=この剣は、私がアモールで剣闘士をしていた頃のもので…<br/>ともに戦っていた仲間たちが、お金を出し合って買ってくれたものなんです|text_cn=这把剑，是我在埃摩城做角斗士时，与我并肩作战的伙伴们凑钱买给我的。<br/>对我而言，它不只是武器，也是我的半身，更是他们曾存在过的证明。|trans_en=This sword is from my days as a gladiator in Emor.<br/>The comrades I fought alongside all pitched in to buy it for me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 10|file_jp=vo_162_ui_posterchat_006_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_posterchat_006_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたの故郷では、誰もが平等に扱われるというのは本当ですか？<br/>身分が低いというだけで、生き方を選ぶ権利を奪われることもないと？<br/>ん？それでも残業はある？毎日夜遅くまで働いて、最悪帰れないことも…<br/>な、なんですかそれは！？いつか体を壊すんじゃ…なぜ誰もおかしいと思わないんですか！？|text_cn=在你的故乡，人们能够平等地对待彼此吗？不会有人因为身份低微，就被剥夺选择生活的权利吧？<br/>……加班？每天工作到深夜，甚至凌晨才能回去？这、这样不会把身体拖垮吗？难道没有人阻止这种事吗？|trans_en=Is it true that in your homeland, everyone is treated equally?<br/>That people aren't denied the right to choose how they live just because of their low status?<br/>Hm? But people still have to work overtime? Staying late every day, and sometimes not even getting to go home...<br/>Wh-What kind of place is that!? Won't that ruin their health eventually? Why doesn't anyone think that's wrong!?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 10|file_jp=vo_162_ui_affchat1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_affchat1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=乗馬の訓練では、筋が良いと褒められたこともありますよ<br/>いつか自分の馬を持てたら、一緒に遠乗りに出かけましょう|text_cn=骑马……我在训练时也试过几次，似乎还算有些天赋。<br/>要是以后有机会拥有一匹自己的马，我就带你一起去兜风。|trans_en=I've actually been told I have a knack for riding.<br/>If I ever get a horse of my own, let's go for a long ride together sometime.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 15|file_jp=vo_162_ui_affchat2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_affchat2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたはときどき、自分の命すら軽んじているように見えることがありますけど…<br/>そうおいそれと、自らを犠牲にしようとすべきではありません<br/>そうですね…もし迷っているならまずは声をかけてください。一緒に解決策を考えますから|text_cn=你太不把性命当回事了。今后遇到危险，别再擅自拿命去冒险。<br/>我知道你有自己的判断，但至少行动之前，先告诉我一声……我们一起想办法。|trans_en=Sometimes, it feels like you don't even value your own life...<br/>But you shouldn't be so quick to throw yourself away.<br/>If you're ever unsure, talk to me first. We can figure out a solution together.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 20|file_jp=vo_162_ui_affchat3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_affchat3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたの冒険の話、よければ聞かせてくれませんか？<br/>え？なんでって…だって、イリスさんには聞かせたんですよね？<br/>なら、私だって仲間なんだし…あなたのこと、もっといろいろ知りたいといいますか…|text_cn=你以前的冒险故事，也能讲给我听吗？你和天冬讲过，对吧？既然都是伙伴了……我也想多了解你一些。|trans_en=Would you tell me about your adventures, if you don't mind?<br/>Hm? Why? Well... You told Elis about them, didn't you?<br/>And I'm your companion too, so... I'd like to get to know you better.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 25|file_jp=vo_162_ui_affchat4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_affchat4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=疲れが溜まっているなら、一緒に浴場へ行きませんか？<br/>魔力を含んだお湯じゃなくても、浸かるだけで疲れが取れるはずです<br/>あ、でも…どうせ行くなら早い時間にしましょう<br/>その時間なら人が少ないから、ゆっくりできますよ|text_cn=你最近似乎有些疲惫。要不要去浴场放松一下？和蕴含魔力的热水不同，普通的热水也能很好地缓解疲劳。<br/>我带你一起去。嗯……时间就定在早上，浴场里的人会少一些。|trans_en=If you're feeling worn out, would you like to go to the baths with me?<br/>Even if the water isn't infused with magic, just soaking in it should help with your fatigue.<br/>Ah, but... If we're going, let's make it early.<br/>There won't be as many people then, so we can relax.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Affinity 30|file_jp=vo_162_ui_affchat5_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_affchat5_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんな物語にも終わりがあるように、あなたはフィラニスから旅立っていくんでしょうね<br/>でも…それまでは、あなたの剣として、騎士として…そばにいさせてください<br/>この命が尽きるそのときまで、あなたを守り抜くと約束します|text_cn=故事终会迎来结尾，而你也必将再次启程。<br/>但在那之前，请让我陪在你身边，作为你的剑，你的骑士……守护你直到生命的最后一刻。|trans_en=Just as every story must come to an end, I know you'll leave Filanis someday.<br/>But until that day comes, please let me stay by your side as your sword, and as your knight.<br/>I swear I'll protect you for as long as I live.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 11|file_jp=vo_162_ui_discuss_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_discuss_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この制服が気になる？閃銀騎士団の制服は、動きやすさが重視されているんです<br/>とはいえ内側にはちょっとした意匠が入っていて…<br/>これは私が閃銀騎士団に入るときオリンピアが直々に選んだものでもあるんです|text_cn=你是在问这身制服的设计吗？守夜人的制服一向以简洁、方便行动为主。不过你看，我这件的内饰还是有特别设计的……<br/>说起来，这套制服还是奥林匹娅大人当初特意替我挑选的……|trans_en=You're curious about this uniform? The Night Watch's uniforms are designed with mobility in mind.<br/>That said, there are a few decorative touches on the inside...<br/>This is actually the one Olympia personally chose for me when I joined.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 12|file_jp=vo_162_ui_discuss_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_discuss_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=イリスはいつも自分のことだけを考えているように見えますが…<br/>いざというときは、逃げ出したくなる気持ちを抑えて、私たちに手を貸してくれるんです<br/>だから私も彼女を信頼しているし、頼りになる仲間だと思っています|text_cn=天冬虽然嘴上会说她只在乎自己，可到了真正危险的时刻，她还是会选择留下来，与我们一起面对。<br/>对我而言，她毫无疑问是位值得信赖的伙伴。|trans_en=Elis always acts as if she only cares about herself...<br/>But when it really matters, she pushes past the urge to run away and helps us.<br/>That's why I trust her, and why I consider her a dependable companion.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 13|file_jp=vo_162_ui_discuss_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_discuss_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=前にあなたが話してくれた、私とよく似ている女の子ですが…<br/>顔はそっくりなのに、性格は私と正反対だなんて…ふふ、なんだか不思議な感覚です|text_cn=你之前提过的那位……跟我样貌相似的女孩子，听你的描述，我总觉得她非常活泼开朗。<br/>明明有着相似的脸，却拥有完全不同的性格……真不可思议。|trans_en=About that girl you told me about before, the one who looks so much like me...<br/>It's strange to think we have the same face, and yet our personalities are complete opposites. Hehe, it feels a little surreal.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 14|file_jp=vo_162_ui_discuss_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_discuss_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=情報収集なら、ルルの右に出る者はいません。どんな些細な情報も聞き漏らしませんから<br/>でも彼女のすごいところはそれだけじゃなくて。どうやら魔法の才能もあるみたいなんです<br/>きちんとした訓練を積めば、将来はきっと立派な魔法使いにだってなれるに違いありません|text_cn=露露那孩子很擅长收集情报，大街小巷的消息几乎都瞒不过她。<br/>除此之外，她拥有相当出色的魔法天赋。若能认真钻研，未来一定会成为优秀的魔法师。|trans_en=When it comes to gathering information, no one can match Lulu.<br/>She never misses even the smallest detail. But that's not the only remarkable thing about her. It seems she has a real talent for magic too.<br/>With proper training, I'm sure she could grow into a fine mage someday.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction 15|file_jp=vo_162_ui_discuss_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_discuss_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=かつて、闘技場の仲間たちと約束したんです。いつか必ず、みんなをここから連れ出すと…<br/>でも…結局自由を得られたのは、私だけでした。とはいえ、あの日の約束を忘れたことはありません<br/>支え合いながらともに戦った日々は…私にとって大切な思い出ですから|text_cn=我曾经答应过决斗场的同伴们，会想办法把大家都带出去。可是最后，只有我一个人站在了这里。<br/>我从没忘记过他们，那段互相扶持共同战斗的日子……至今仍是我珍视的回忆。|trans_en=A long time ago, I made a promise to my comrades in the arena. I swore that one day, I'd get all of us out of there.<br/>But in the end... I was the only one who ever gained freedom. Even so, I've never forgotten the promise I made that day.<br/>The days we spent fighting together and supporting one another... Those memories mean a great deal to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 1|file_jp=vo_162_ui_hfc_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_hfc_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=これは…よくわかりませんが、私もやらないとダメですか？|text_cn=这是某种礼仪？我、我也要做吗？|trans_en=I'm ... not really sure what this is, but do I have to do it too?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Repeated Input 2|file_jp=vo_162_ui_hfc_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_hfc_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=クッ…ま、待ってください…！あぅ…これは…くすぐったっ…！|text_cn=请，请停下……有点痒……|trans_en=W-Wait... Please...!Ah... That tickles...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 1|file_jp=vo_162_ui_hang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_hang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=こうしてのんびり過ごすのも、悪くありませんね|text_cn=这样悠闲的时光，实在难得。|trans_en=Spending time like this, nice and slow ... isn't so bad.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Idle 2|file_jp=vo_162_ui_hang_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_hang_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=あなたの顔を見ていると、不思議と落ち着きます|text_cn=看着你的脸，真让人感到安心……|trans_en=When I look at your face, I feel strangely at ease.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Home Screen Interaction: Inactive|file_jp=vo_162_ui_exhang_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_exhang_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=静かになったと思ったら…寝てしまったんですね<br/>私が見守っていますから、ゆっくり休んでください|text_cn=睡着了吗？安心休息吧，我会守在这里。|trans_en=So that's why you got quiet... You fell asleep, right?<br/>I'll keep watch over you, so get some rest.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Meeting|file_jp=vo_162_ui_gachaNew_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_gachaNew_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=閃銀騎士団団長のエリナ。要請を受けて参上しました<br/>魔法は得意じゃないけど…剣の腕なら誰にも負けません<br/>あなたと最後まで戦い抜き、あなたの大切なものを守り抜くとここに誓いましょう|text_cn=菲兰尼斯守夜人队长，应召而来。虽然我不擅长魔法，但剑术还算可靠。我会与你并肩作战，用这把剑，守护你珍视的一切。|trans_en=I am Alina, captain of the Night Watch.<br/>I have answered your call. I may not be skilled in magic, but when it comes to the sword, I won't lose to anyone.<br/>I swear here and now that I will fight by your side to the very end and protect all that you hold dear.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Meeting Again|file_jp=vo_162_ui_gacha_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_gacha_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=『一度目の出会いは縁、二度目の出会いは運命』と言いますが…<br/>それが本当なら、この再会は運命なのかもしれませんね。|text_cn=“相逢即是有缘，再遇便是命运”……我们能再次相遇，或许真的是命运吧？|trans_en=They say the first meeting is chance, and the second is destiny...<br/>If that's true, then perhaps this reunion was meant to be.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker Development|file_jp=vo_162_ui_charup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_charup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=もっと力をつけないと…|text_cn=我必须更加严格地磨炼自己。|trans_en=I have to get even stronger...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Significant Trekker Growth|file_jp=vo_162_ui_excharup_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_excharup_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力をものにして、人々を守る剣に変えてみせる。|text_cn=这份力量会成为守护他人的剑。|trans_en=I will master this power and wield it in a way that protects people.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Unique Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_162_ui_uniMusic_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_uniMusic_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星々よ、どうか見届けてくれ…これからも私は、前へと進み続ける|text_cn=愿星辰见证——从今往后，我也会继续前行。|trans_en=O Stars, please watch over me... From here on out, I shall keep going forward.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Listen to a Common Runic Disc|file_jp=vo_162_ui_music_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_music_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=人の心が紡ぎ出す旋律…不思議なものですね|text_cn=由人心谱写的旋律……确实不可思议。|trans_en=Melodies woven by the human heart... Fascinating to behold, don't you think?}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Stance Unlocked|file_jp=vo_162_ui_unlockLook_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_unlockLook_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=運命があなたをどこへ導こうとも、行く手をふさぐものは、私が剣となり斬り払います|text_cn=无论命运将你带向何方，我都会守在你身边，为你扫清前路的阻碍。|trans_en=No matter where fate may lead you, if anything stands in your way, I will become your sword and cut it down.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Memory Snapshot Unlocked|file_jp=vo_162_ui_unlockCG_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_unlockCG_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どうしたんですか？早く洗わないと、体が冷えてしまいますよ？|text_cn=怎么了？不快点去清洗身体的话，会着凉的。|trans_en=What's wrong? Hurry and wash up, or you'll get cold.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 10|file_jp=vo_162_ui_afflv1_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_afflv1_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔法を使えるようになりたいと思っているんですが、いくら訓練しても一向に上達しなくて…<br/>あなたがいたところでは、どうやって訓練していたのか、よければ教えてくれませんか？|text_cn=虽然我一直想要掌握魔法，但不管怎么努力，进展都不尽人意……<br/>对了！你不是来自遥远的地方吗？那里有没有一些特别的技巧，能让我快速学会魔法？|trans_en=I really want to be able to use magic, but no matter how much I train, I don't get any better...<br/>If you don't mind, would you tell me how you practiced it where you came from?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 15|file_jp=vo_162_ui_afflv2_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_afflv2_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ともに過ごした時間は長くありませんが、あなたはいつも私と誠実に向き合ってくれる<br/>私を仲間として見てくれて、ともに悩み、ともに答えを考えてくれる<br/>だから私も、そんなあなたの信頼にはできる限り応えたい<br/>もし困ったことがあれば、そのときは遠慮なく私を頼ってください|text_cn=虽然我们相处的时间不长，但你愿意认真听取我的意见。<br/>你把我当作伙伴，和我一起做决定。这份信任，我会牢记在心。今后若有需要，请尽管依靠我。|trans_en=I know we don't spend a lot of time together, but you're always honest with me.<br/>You view me as a friend and trust me enough to share your worries and thoughts.<br/>That's why I want to repay your kindness as best as I can.<br/>If you're ever in trouble, don't hesitate to reach out to me.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 25|file_jp=vo_162_ui_afflv3_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_afflv3_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私に心配かけないように…なんて気にする必要ありません。ケガをしたときはすぐに言ってください<br/>あなたに非がないことも、犠牲を出さずに勝利する難しさも理解しています。それでも…<br/>目的を果たすためとはいえ、あなただけにすべてを背負わせたくはないんです|text_cn=今后如果受了伤，请立刻告诉我。不要说什么没事不用担心……<br/>我知道这不是你的错，也知道战斗不可能毫无代价……可我不想看到你为了达成目的，自己承担所有代价。|trans_en=You don't need to go out of your way to hide things from me... If you ever get injured, tell me at once.<br/>I understand that it's not your fault and how difficult it is to win without any casualties. But...<br/>Even if it's for the sake of the mission, you shouldn't bear everything on your own.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Reach Affinity Lv. 30|file_jp=vo_162_ui_afflv4_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_afflv4_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誰かを特別に思う気持ちがどんな感覚なのか、少し前まではちっとも理解できませんでした<br/>でも…あなたと出会ったことで、なんとなくわかってきたような気がして…<br/>だから…これからは私を、あなただけの騎士にしてもらえるとうれしいです|text_cn=以前我不明白，牵挂一个人究竟是什么感觉。现在……我似乎明白了。<br/>你有属于自己的道路，我会尊重你的选择。但请你记住，无论你走向哪里，只要你需要我，我就会站在你身边，为你挡下所有危险。|trans_en=Until recently, I couldn't understand at all what it felt like to think of someone as special.<br/>But... Since I met you, I feel like I've started to understand it.<br/>So... I'd be happy if you'd let me be your knight, and yours alone.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 1|file_jp=vo_162_ui_thankSmall_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_thankSmall_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ありがとう、感謝します|text_cn=谢谢，我会妥善保管。|trans_en=Thank you. I appreciate it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 2|file_jp=vo_162_ui_thank_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_thank_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=細かいところまで、よく見ていますね。ありがとう、感謝します|text_cn=你总是考虑得如此周到。多谢。|trans_en=You have a keen eye for the smallest details. Thank you. I appreciate it.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Appreciating the Gift 3|file_jp=vo_162_ui_thankEx_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_thankEx_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私にここまで優しくしてくれるのは、世界中探してもあなたくらいです<br/>ありがとうございます。心からの感謝を、あなたに|text_cn=你就是这个世界上对我最好的人……|trans_en=If I searched the whole world for the person who's been the kindest to me, it would still be you.<br/>Thank you so much. You have my deepest gratitude.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Affirmative|file_jp=vo_story_162_001_confirm_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_001_confirm_cn.ogg|text_jp=ああ。|text_cn=嗯！|trans_en=Sure.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Disagreeing|file_jp=vo_story_162_002_deny_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_002_deny_cn.ogg|text_jp=断る。|text_cn=不！|trans_en=No thanks.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Questioning|file_jp=vo_story_162_003_question_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_003_question_cn.ogg|text_jp=ん？|text_cn=……嗯？|trans_en=Hm?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Confused|file_jp=vo_story_162_004_confuse_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_004_confuse_cn.ogg|text_jp=うーん…|text_cn=唔……|trans_en=Um...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sad|file_jp=vo_story_162_005_sad_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_005_sad_cn.ogg|text_jp=うぅ…|text_cn=呜……|trans_en=Ugh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Excited|file_jp=vo_story_162_006_excit_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_006_excit_cn.ogg|text_jp=おおっ。|text_cn=做得不错！|trans_en=Whoa.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Angry|file_jp=vo_story_162_007_angry_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_007_angry_cn.ogg|text_jp=このっ！|text_cn=无礼！|trans_en=You...!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Happy|file_jp=vo_story_162_008_happy_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_008_happy_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふふ。|text_cn=太好了！|trans_en=Hehe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Sigh|file_jp=vo_story_162_009_sigh_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_009_sigh_cn.ogg|text_jp=はぁ…|text_cn=唉……|trans_en=Sigh...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 1|file_jp=vo_story_162_010_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_010_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の助けが必要なときは、いつでも呼んでください|text_cn=需要我的时候，随时呼唤我。|trans_en=Please let me know whenever you need my help.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 2|file_jp=vo_story_162_011_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_011_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=私は自ら閃銀騎士団に志願しました。その選択を後悔したことはありません|text_cn=我自愿成为守夜人，也从未后悔过这个选择。|trans_en=It was my own wish to join the Night Watcher. And I never once regretted that decision.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 3|file_jp=vo_story_162_012_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_012_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=魔法というのは、本当に難しいな…|text_cn=学习魔法真是件困难的事……|trans_en=Magic is really difficult to learn...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 4|file_jp=vo_story_162_013_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_013_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=人の命は、権力者どものおもちゃじゃない！|text_cn=人的性命，不是供权贵玩乐的道具。|trans_en=People are not toys for those in power!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Motto 5|file_jp=vo_story_162_014_catchphrase_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_story_162_014_catchphrase_cn.ogg|text_jp=誰もが安心して暮らせる未来のために…|text_cn=为了所有人都能安然入眠的未来……|trans_en=For a future where everyone can live peacefully...}}

==Combat Voice Chat==
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 1|file_jp=vo_162_combat_ultskill_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_ultskill_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=弱き者に寄り添い、正義を実現します！|text_cn=为弱者挥剑，为正义而战！|trans_en=I stand with the weak, and uphold justice!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Ultimate Battle Cry 2|file_jp=vo_162_combat_ultskill_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_ultskill_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この剣で、未来を切り拓く！|text_cn=就用此剑，开辟未来！|trans_en=With this sword, I'll carve out the future!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 1|file_jp=vo_162_combat_dead_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_dead_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=まだ、倒れるわけには…|text_cn=我不能……在这停下……|trans_en=I mustn't fall yet...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Character Down 2|file_jp=vo_162_combat_dead_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_dead_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=期待に、応えられなかった…|text_cn=辜负……你的期待了……|trans_en=I failed you...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 1|file_jp=vo_162_combat_perk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_perk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=星ノ塔の力、使いこなしてみせる。|text_cn=星塔的力量……我会妥善使用的。|trans_en=I'll make full use of the power of the Monolith.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 2|file_jp=vo_162_combat_perk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_perk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=湧き上がるこの力の源は…星ノ塔なのか？|text_cn=这源源不绝的力量……是来自星塔吗？|trans_en=The source of this surging power ... is the Monolith?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 3|file_jp=vo_162_combat_perk_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_perk_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=闘志を奮い立たせろ！|text_cn=嗯，就这样继续前进吧！|trans_en=Let's steel ourselves for battle!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 4|file_jp=vo_162_combat_subPerk_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_subPerk_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この力で、期待に応えてみせる！|text_cn=我会用这份力量，回应你的期待。|trans_en=With this power, I won't disappoint you!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Potential Acquired 5|file_jp=vo_162_combat_subPerk_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_subPerk_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=この剣は、弱き者を守るための力だ！|text_cn=这柄剑，是为了守护他人而存在的。|trans_en=This sword is for protecting the weak!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 1|file_jp=vo_162_combat_chat_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_chat_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=命のやり取りに言葉はいらない。|text_cn=不必多言，拔剑吧。|trans_en=Words aren't needed when lives are on the line.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 2|file_jp=vo_162_combat_chat_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_chat_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=どこからでもかかってくるといい。本気で相手をしよう。|text_cn=我会全力应战。|trans_en=Come at me from wherever you like. I'll give it my all.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 3|file_jp=vo_162_combat_chat_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_chat_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=最小限の犠牲で終わらせよう。|text_cn=以最小的代价结束战斗。|trans_en=Let's finish this with as few casualties as possible.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 4|file_jp=vo_162_combat_chat_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_chat_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の目の届く範囲から離れないように。|text_cn=跟紧我，不要离开我的视线。|trans_en=Make sure not to stray far from my sight.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins 5|file_jp=vo_162_combat_chat_005_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_chat_005_cn.ogg|text_jp=敵の気配だ。迎撃の準備を。|text_cn=我感觉到了敌人的气息。准备迎击。|trans_en=Enemies in sight. Prepare for a counter-attack.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Difficulty)|file_jp=vo_162_combat_chatLvUp_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_chatLvUp_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=この程度の試練、いくらでも乗り越えてみせる！|text_cn=这种程度的阻碍，还不足以让我停下脚步。|trans_en=I'll overcome trials like this, no matter how many there are!}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Ascension Begins (New Type)|file_jp=vo_162_combat_chatNext_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_chatNext_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=どんな困難が待ち受けていようと、全力で挑むまでです|text_cn=无论前方有什么危险，我都会全力以赴。|trans_en=No matter what challenges may lie ahead, I'll tackle them with everything I've got.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith Shop|file_jp=vo_162_combat_shopRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_shopRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=コンビニ？これは…なかなか便利そうな場所ですね|text_cn=“便利店”……？听起来是个很方便的地方。|trans_en=A convenience store? That is quite a convenient place, isn't it?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Safe Room|file_jp=vo_162_combat_restRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_restRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ここは安全なようだ。ゆっくり休んでください|text_cn=这里很安全。好好休息吧。|trans_en=It seems safe here. Please take it easy and rest.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Event|file_jp=vo_162_combat_eventRoom_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_eventRoom_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=交渉ですか、それなら私に任せてください<br/>え？ただのおしゃべり？|text_cn=要开始谈判了吗？我已经准备好了。诶？只是普通聊天？|trans_en=Negotiations? Leave it to me.<br/>Huh? It's only a chat?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 1|file_jp=vo_162_combat_battleClear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_battleClear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ふう…敵は退けた。みんな、無事か？|text_cn=暂时安全了，大家都没事吧？|trans_en=Phew... We drove the enemy back. Is everyone safe and sound?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 2|file_jp=vo_162_combat_battleClear_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_battleClear_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=さて、次はどこへ向かいましょう？|text_cn=嗯。接下来往哪走？|trans_en=Well then, where should we go next?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Monolith: Battle Ended 3|file_jp=vo_162_combat_battleClear_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_combat_battleClear_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=少し休んでから、先へ進みましょう。|text_cn=先喘口气，然后继续前进吧。|trans_en=Let's rest up a little and then forge ahead.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 1|file_jp=vo_162_ui_win_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_win_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=勝利とは、戦い抜いた者が得る最大の栄誉だ。|text_cn=胜利来之不易，享受当下吧。|trans_en=Victory is the greatest honor bestowed upon those who fight to the end.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Victory 2|file_jp=vo_162_ui_win_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_win_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=未来への道を切り拓いたなら、あとは突き進むだけだ。|text_cn=既已开辟未来，便当继续前行。|trans_en=Once you have carved your path forward, all you have to do is charge ahead.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 1|file_jp=vo_162_ui_lose_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_lose_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=すまない、私のせいだ…|text_cn=是我没能履行职责。|trans_en=I'm sorry. It's my fault...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Defeated 2|file_jp=vo_162_ui_lose_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_lose_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=なにが悪かったのか、あらためて考えてみよう。|text_cn=我会重新审视这场战斗……|trans_en=Let's reflect and learn from this defeat...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 1|file_jp=vo_162_ui_swap_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_swap_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=出発しよう。まずはなにをすればいい？|text_cn=出发吧，我们的首要目标是什么？|trans_en=Let's head out. What should we do first?}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 2|file_jp=vo_162_ui_swap_002_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_swap_002_cn.ogg|text_jp=最後までともに戦うと、この剣に誓おう。|text_cn=以此剑为誓，我将与诸位并肩作战。|trans_en=I swear upon this sword I'll fight with you until the bitter end.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 3|file_jp=vo_162_ui_swap_003_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_swap_003_cn.ogg|text_jp=必ず勝利して、みんなで無事に帰ろう。|text_cn=各位，务必彼此照应，平安归来。|trans_en=We're going to win, and we're all making it home safe.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Entering Combat 4|file_jp=vo_162_ui_swap_004_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_swap_004_cn.ogg|text_jp=準備完了。いつでも出られます。|text_cn=整备已全部完成，哼……随时可以出击。|trans_en=All set. Ready to go anytime.}}

==Special Voice Lines==
{{AudioRow|title=Title screen|file_jp=vo_162_ui_logo_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_logo_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=ヨースター|text_cn=YOSTAR|trans_en=YOSTAR}}
{{AudioRow|title=Valentine's day|file_jp=vo_162_ui_valentine_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_valentine_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=チョコレート…というものを作ってみたんです<br/>ただ、手順も分量もきちんと説明どおりにしたはずなのに…<br/>完成したものは、本に書いてあったものと全然違っていて…<br/>い、いえ、やはりこれは個性的に仕上がっただけで、失敗ではない…はず！|text_cn=我试着做了巧克力。火候、分量和步骤都是严格按照食谱一步一步完成的。<br/>但是，不管形状还是口味都跟书上描述的不一样……不，这一定不是失败，只是成品比较独特。|trans_en=I tried making something you call ... chocolate.<br/>But even though I followed the recipe to the letter...<br/>What I created ... was nothing like the book described...<br/>B-But... I'd say my creation was just unique... It was not a failure! I think...}}
{{AudioRow|title=Christmas|file_jp=vo_162_ui_xmas_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_xmas_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=雪が強い…このまま降り積もったら、人の移動や物資の輸送にも影響が出るかもしれないし…<br/>私は様子を見てきますから、あなたは待っていてください。危ないから、外には出ないように|text_cn=这场雪下得太大了……如果继续这么下下去，城里的道路和物资可能都会受到影响。<br/>我得马上去确认情况。你就待在屋里，不要出门。|trans_en=It's snowing pretty hard... If this keeps up, travel and transportation will be heavily affected...<br/>I'm going to check on the situation, please wait here. It's dangerous out there, so stay put.}}
{{AudioRow|title=New Year|file_jp=vo_162_ui_newyear_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_newyear_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=あけましておめでとう。今年も当たり前のように新しい年が始まりますが…<br/>誰かが動かない限り、世界が勝手に良くなることはありません<br/>だから明るい未来を作るため、私たちひとりひとりが助け合っていかなければならないんです|text_cn=不知不觉又是新的一年，虽然世界并不会因为年份的交替就变得更加美好。<br/>但只要我们不把希望寄托在虚无的愿望上，而是愿意一同迈出脚步，就一定能让未来变得更加美好。|trans_en=Happy New Year. It's the start of another year...<br/>But the world doesn't just become better on its own.<br/>That's why we must work together if we want to create a brighter future.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Trekker birthday|file_jp=vo_162_ui_birth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_birth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=私の誕生日…？わざわざ祝うようなことではないと思いますが…あ、ありがとうございます|text_cn=我的生日吗……？我不觉得有什么值得庆祝的，但是……谢谢。|trans_en=My birthday...? I didn't think it was something worth going out of your way to celebrate, but... Th-thank you.}}
{{AudioRow|title=Player birthday|file_jp=vo_162_ui_yourbirth_001_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_162_ui_yourbirth_001_cn.ogg|text_jp=誕生日おめでとうございます。よければ私が彫って作った、この木馬を受け取ってください<br/>本物の馬を贈ることができればいいんですが、恥ずかしながらそんな余裕はありませんので…<br/>とにかくこの木馬が、これからのあなたの旅路を守ってくれるよう願っています|text_cn=生日快乐。这个木马是我用木头刻出来的，送给你。<br/>如今的我还买不起真正的马，但我还是想为你准备一件礼物。<br/>请收下它，愿它能陪你走过接下来的旅途。|trans_en=Happy birthday. If it's okay with you, please take this rocking horse that I carved myself.<br/>As much as I wanted to give you a real horse, I'm sorry to say that I didn't have the means to make that happen...<br/>Anyway, I hope this rocking horse will protect you on your journeys ahead.}}
{{AudioRow|title=First Anniversary|file_jp=vo_LoginNpc162_FirstAnniversary_day07_jp.ogg|file_cn=vo_LoginNpc162_FirstAnniversary_day07_cn.ogg|text_jp=いまはまだ、剣を振るう以外なんの取り柄もない私ですが…<br/>これからは剣技だけでなく、料理や魔法の腕も磨いていくつもりです<br/>あとは…もう少し愛想よくできるよう、笑顔と冗談も少しずつ練習していこうかと<br/>次にお会いするときには、必ずやあなたを驚かせてみせますから…どうぞ楽しみにしていてください|text_cn=现在的我，除了挥剑之外，似乎没什么值得称道的地方。<br/>不过，我已经决定了——今后不只要继续磨炼剑术，也要认真学习料理和魔法。<br/>还有……我也想让自己变得更容易亲近一些。所以，我会试着练习如何微笑，以及学习怎样和人开些玩笑。<br/>下次见面时，我一定会让你刮目相看。到时候，还请你好好见证我的成长。|trans_en=Right now, swinging a sword is still the only thing I’m any good at...<br/>But from now on, I plan to hone not only my swordsmanship but also my skills in cooking and magic.<br/>And... I'm thinking I'll practice smiling and joking a little more, so I can be a bit friendlier.<br/>The next time we meet, I'll definitely surprise you... So please look forward to it.}}
{{TrekkerAudioBottom}}
